śrīrastu |

{atha śrītattvanidhiḥ} |

{tatrādimo mahāśakti devatānāṃ lakṣaṇanidhiḥ} |

śubhamastu ||

nirvighnamastu ||

śrīgaṇādhipataye namaḥ ||
 
śrīmaccaṃḍikāyai namaḥ ||

śuklāṃbaradharaṃ viṣṇuṃ śaśivarṇaṃ caturbhujam ||
prasannavadanaṃ dhyāyet sarvavighnopaśāṃtaye || 1 ||

lakṣmīpradānasamaye navavidrumābhāṃ vidyāpradānasamaye śaradiṃduśubhrām ||
vidveṣivargavijaye harinīlavarṇāmaṃbāṃ trilokajananīmajaniṃ prapadme || 2 ||

jayatvaṃ devicāmuṇḍe jayabhūtārtihāriṇi ||
jaya sarvagate devi bhadrakāli namostute || 3 ||

śrīmaccāmuṇḍikā devī kaṭākṣaśubhavīkṣaṇāt || 
nigamāgamataṃtrāṇāṃ purāṇavacasāmapi || 1 ||

dharmaśāstreti hāsānāmupataṃtragirāmapi ||
maṃtrajyotiṣaśilpānāṃ sāraṃ saṃgṛhya tattvataḥ || 2 || ||

cāmuṃḍā pramukhānāṃ ca devatānāṃ pṛthak pṛthak ||
svarūpāyudhavarṇānāṃ bhūṣāvāhanalakṣmaṇām || 3 ||

puṣpābhidheya vastrāṇāṃ prabhedāśca tataḥ param ||
viṣṇvīśa brahmaśakrādi devānāṃ lakṣaṇāni ca || 4 ||

yugādikālabhedāśca kālajātaguṇāguṇāḥ |
etat prasaṃgādanyeṣāṃ vaktavyānāṃ kramā api || 5 ||

mahīśūra purādhīśakṛṣṇarājamahībhujā ||
graṃthe śrītattvanidhyākhye navanidhyātmake śubhe || 6 ||

prapaṃcasyopakārāya prakāśyaṃte yathā mati ||
vakṣyāmāṇeṣu vidhiṣu jñātavyoyaṃ tvanukramaḥ || 7 || ||

cāmuṃḍādi mahāśaktilakṣaṇaṃ prathame nidhau ||
viṣṇumūrtiprabhedānāṃ lakṣmaproktaṃ dvitīyake || 8 ||

<p. 2>

tṛtīye śivaśaivādi mūrtīnāṃ lakṣaṇaṃ matam ||
turīye brahmaśakrādidevarūpanirūpaṇam || 9 ||

paṃcame grahanakṣatrakālādīnāṃ ca lakṣaṇam ||
ṣaṣṭhe proktaṃ harikṣetraśāligrāmādilakṣaṇam || 10 ||

saptame tu śivakṣetraśivaliṃgādilakṣaṇam ||
nigamāgamataṃtrādilakṣaṇaṃ proktamaṣṭame || 11 ||

proktaṃ ca navame saṃkhyālipipramukhakautukam ||
etannavanidhi jñānātsulabhānidhayonava || 12 ||

(1) atha śrīcāmuṃḍeśvarīdhyānam (nṛsiṃhaprāsāde)

nigadyatetrayā caṃḍī hemābhāsusvarūpiṇī ||
triṇotrāyauvanasthā ca kruddhā cordhva sthitāmatā || 1 ||

kṛśamadhyā viśālākṣīcārupīnapayodharā ||
ekavaktrā tu sugrīvā bāhuviṃśati saṃyutā || 2 ||

śūlāsi śakticakrāṇibāṇaśaṃkha pavīnapi ||
abhayaṃ ḍamaruṃ caivacchurikāṃ dakṣiṇaiḥ karaiḥ || 3 ||

ūrdhvādikramayogena bibhratī sā sadā śubhā ||
nāgaṃpāśaṃ tathā kheṭaṃ kuṭhārāṃkuśa kārmukān || 4 ||

ghaṃṭā dhvajagadādarśān bibhrāṇā kāmarūpiṇī ||
tadadhomahiṣaśchinnamūrdhā patitamastakaḥ || 5 ||

trastodyatakaraḥ kruddhastadgrīvāsaṃbhavaḥ pumān ||
śūlabhinnovamadraktorakta bhrūśmaśrulocanaḥ || 6 ||

siṃhena khādyamānastu pāśabaddhogalebhṛśam ||
vāmāṃghryākrāṃta siṃhā ca savyāṃghryālīḍhagāsurā || 7 ||

caṃḍīcodyata śastreyamaśeṣaripunāśinī || svarṇavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(2) atha rājarājeśvarīdhyānam (ṣoḍaśīkalpe) 

koṭikaṃ darpalāvaṇyaśivavāmāṃkavāsinīm || 
ekakāloditāneka caṃdrakoṭyarkakoṭibhām || 1 ||

prabhā pāṭalitānekakoṭibrahmāṃḍamaṃḍalām ||
japākusumasaṃkāśāma japāma japātmikām || 2 ||

kuṃkumodara saṃkāśāṃ dāḍimī kusumāruṇām ||
bālārkakoṭibhāṃ tryakṣāṃ bāleṃdumakuṭojjvalām || 3 ||

pāśāṃkuśe kṣukodaṃḍa paṃcabāṇalasatkarām ||
acaṃcalataṭitkoṭiprabhā piṃgalavāsasam || 4 ||

samavṛttasuvṛttorujaghanastanamaṃḍalām ||
koṭarikoṭī ghaṭitasudhākara sudhāplutām || 5 ||

<p. 3>

phālabhūtilakī bhūtalocanāṃ kāmalocanām |
kaṭākṣasaraṇī niryatkaruṇā pūrṇalocanām || 6 ||

sūryeṃdumaṃḍalākāramaṇitāṭaṃkamaṃḍitām ||
śukratārāsamākāranāsābharaṇaśobhinīm || 7 ||

dāḍimībījasaṃdohasaṃdehadaśanāvalim ||
vīṇāravaghṛṇādāyinijavāṇīguṇodayām || 8 ||

karpūravīṭikāgaṃdhasugaṃdhitadigaṃtarām ||
maṇidarpaṇadarpaghnakapolaphalakaprabhām || 9 ||

prasannavadanāṃbhojāṃ samaṃdahasitekṣaṇām ||
maṇimaṃgalasūtreṇa vilasatkaṃbukaṃdharām || 10 ||

śritakalpalatībhūtabhujavallī catuṣṭayām ||
ratnāṃgulīya nivahairlasadaṃguli pallavām || 11 ||

tārahārajharairbhāsvat stanahāṭakabhūdharām ||
kucabhāra namanmadhyatrivalī lalitodarām || 12 ||

anargha ratnaghaṭitaraśanājaghanasthalām ||
suvṛttajaṃghorukāṃḍāṃgūḍhagulphāṃ guḍālakām || 13 ||

śiṃjā na maṇimaṃjīra maṃjupādābjamaṃjulām ||
ratnagraiveya valayamakuṭāṃgadakaṃkaṇām || 14 ||

kaṃbukaṃṭhīṃsunāsāḍhyāṃbiṃboṣṭhīmuḍupānanām ||
sarvaśṛṃgāra veṣāḍhyāṃ sarvābharaṇabhūṣitām || 15 ||

caṃdanāguru karpūramṛganābhi sugaṃdhinīm ||
kāraṇe śaśiroratnanighṛṣṭa caraṇāṃbujām || 16 ||

paṃcapretāsanāsīnāṃ paṃcapraṇavarūpiṇīm || siṃdūravarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(3) atha mahākālīdhyānam (caṃḍīkalpe)

khaḍgaṃ cakragadeṣu cāpaparighāñchūlaṃ bhuśuṃḍīṃśiraḥ śaṃkhaṃ saṃdadhatīṃkaraistriṇayanāṃ sarvāṃgabhūṣāvṛtām ||
nīlāśmadyutimāsya pādadaśakāṃseve mahākālikāṃ yāmastautsvapiteharaukamalajohaṃtuṃ madhuṃkaiṭabham || 1 || nīlavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(4) atha mahālakṣmīdhyānam  (caṃḍīkalpe)

akṣasrakparaśuṃgadeṣu kuliśaṃpadmaṃ dhanuḥ kuṃḍikāṃ daṃḍaṃ śaktimasiṃca carmajalajaṃ ghaṃṭāṃsurābhājanam ||
śūlaṃpāśasudarśane ca dadhatīṃ hastaiḥ pravālaprabhāṃ sevesairibhamardinīmiha mahālakṣmīṃ sarojasthitām || 1 || pravālavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 4>

(5) atha mahāsarasvatīdhyānam (caṃḍīkalpe)

ghaṃṭāśūlahalāni śaṃkhamusalau cakraṃdhanussāyakaṃ hastābjairdadhatīṃ ghanāṃtavilasacchītāṃśu tulyaprabhām ||  
gaurīdeha samudbhavāṃ trijagatāmādhārabhūtāṃ mahā pūrvāmatrasarasvatīmanubhaje śuṃbhādidaityārdinīm || 1 || śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

atha lalitopākhyātarītyā śrīcakrasthadevatā prārabhyate |

(6) aṇimādi siddhidevatādhyānam 

aṇimāmahimā caiva garimālaghimā tathā | 
prāptiḥ prākāmyāmīśatvaṃ va śitvaṃcāṣṭabhūtayaḥ || 1 ||

muktisiddhissarvasiddhirdaśasiddhaya īritāḥ |
etādevyaścaturvāhāḥ japākusumasaṃnibhāḥ || 2 ||

ciṃtāmaṇi kapālaṃ ca triśūlaṃ siddhakajjalam ||
dadhānādayayā pūrṇāyogibhiśca niṣevitāḥ || 3 || raktavarṇaḥ || 10 ||

(7) atha mahālakṣmī sahitāṣṭamātṛkādhyānam 

brāhmīmāheśvarī caiva kaumārī vaiṣṇavī tathā ||
vārāhī caiva māheṃdrīcāmuṃḍā caiva saptamī || 1 ||

mahālakṣmīraṣṭamī ca dvibhujāśśoṇavigrahāḥ ||
kapālamutpalaṃ caiva bibhrāṇāraktavāsasaḥ || 2 ||

atha vānyaprakāreṇa keciddhyānaṃ pracakṣate ||
brahmādisadṛśākārā brahmādisadṛśāyudhāḥ || 3 ||

brahmādīnāṃ paraṃ cihnaṃdhārayaṃtyaḥprakīrtitāḥ || raktavarṇaḥ || 8 ||

(8) atha sarvasaṃkṣobhiṇyādidaśamudrādevatādhyānam 

mudrāviracanāyuktairhastaiḥ kamalakāṃtibhiḥ ||
dāḍimī puṣpasaṃkāśāḥ pītāṃbaramanoharāḥ || 1 ||

caturbhujābhujadvaṃdvadhṛta carmakṛpāṇikāḥ ||
madaraktabilolākṣyastāsāṃ nāmāmisaṃ śṛṇu || 2 ||

sarvasaṃkṣobhiṇī caiva sarvavidrāviṇī tathā ||
sarvākarṣiṇimudrā ca tathā sarvavaśaṃkarī || 3 ||

sarvonmādini mudrā ca ṣaṣṭhī sarvamahāṃkuśā ||

<p. 5>

sarvakhecari mudrā ca sarvabījā tathā parā || 4 ||

sarvayoniśca navamī tathā sarvatrikhaṃḍikā ||
ityetāḥ kathitā vipradaśamudrādhidevatāḥ || 5 || raktavarṇaḥ || 10 ||

(9) atha guptayoginīdhyānam 

kāmākarṣiṇikā caiva buddhyā karṣiṇikākalā ||
ahaṃkārā karṣiṇī ca sarvākarṣiṇikākalā || 1 ||

sparśākarṣiṇikā nityārūpā karṣiṇikākalā ||
rasākarṣiṇikā caiva gaṃdhākarṣiṇikākalā || 2 ||

cittākarṣiṇikā nityādhairyā kārṣiṇikākalā ||
smṛtyākarṣiṇikā nityānāmā karṣiṇikākalā || 3 ||

bījākarṣiṇikā nityācātmā karṣiṇikākalā ||
amṛtākarṣiṇī nityāśarīrākarṣiṇī parā || 4 ||

etāḥ ṣoḍaśanityāssyuḥ kalārūpāśca śaktayaḥ ||
vidrumadruma saṃkāśāmaṃda prahasitānanāḥ || 5 ||

caturbhujāstriṇetrāśca caṃdrārdhamakuṭojjvalāḥ ||
cāpabāṇau carmakhaḍgaudadhānādivyakāṃtayaḥ || 6 || raktavarṇaḥ || 16 ||

(10) atha guptatarayoginīdhyānam 

anaṃgakusumānaṅgamekhalā ca dvitīyakā ||
anaṃgamadanānaṃgamadanāturayā saha || 1 ||

anaṃgararekhācānaṃgavegānaṃgāṃkuśāpi ca ||
anaṃgamālinya parācaitā devyojapātviṣaḥ || 2 ||

iṣucāpaṃ puṣpaśarān puṣpakaṃ tu kamutpalam ||
bibhratyodabhravikrāṃti śālinyolalitājñayā || 3 || raktavarṇaḥ || 8 ||

(11) atha saṃpradāyayoginīdhyānam 

sarvasaṃkṣobhiṇī mukhyāssaṃpradāyākhyayā yutāḥ ||
veṇī kṛtakacasmotāḥ siṃdūratilakojjvalāḥ || 1 ||

atitīvra svabhāvāśca kālānalasamatviṣaḥ ||
vahnicāpaṃ vahnibāṇaṃ vahnirūpamasiṃ tathā || 2 ||

vahnicakrākhya phalakaṃdadhānādīpta vigrahāḥ ||
asureṃdraṃ pratikruddhāḥ kāmabhasma samudbhavam || 3 ||

<p. 6>

ājñāśaktaya evaitālalitāyā mahaujasaḥ ||
sarvasaṃkṣobhiṇī caiva sarvavidrāviṇī tathā || 4 ||

sarvākarṣaṇikā śaktiḥ sārvāhladinikā tathā || 
sarvasaṃmohinī śaktissarvastaṃbhinikā tathā || 5 ||

sarvajṛṃbhiṇikā śaktiḥ tathā sarvavaśaṃkarī ||
sarvaraṃjinikā śaktiḥ sarvonmādinikā tathā || 6 ||

sarvārtha sādhikā śaktissarvasaṃpatprapūriṇī ||
sarvamaṃtramayī śaktissarvadvaṃdvakṣayaṃkarī || 7 ||

ityevaṃ saṃpradāyānāṃ nāmāni kathitāni vai || raktavarṇaḥ || 14 ||

(12) atha kulottīrṇayoginīdhyānam 

tāśca sphaṭikasaṃkāśāḥ paraśuṃ pāśameva ca ||
gadāṃghaṃṭāmaṇiṃ caiva dadhānādīpta vigrahāḥ || 1 ||

devadviṣamabhikruddhāḥ bhrukuṭīkuṭilānanāḥ ||
etāsāmapi nāmāni samākarṇayakuṃbhaja || 2 ||

sarvasiddhipradādevī sarvasaṃpatpradā tathā ||
sarvapriyaṃkarīdevī sarvamaṃgalakāriṇī || 3 ||

sarvakāmapradādevī sarvaduḥkhavināśinī ||
sarvamṛtyupraśamanī sarvavighnanivāriṇī || 4 ||

sarvāṃgasuṃdarīdevī sarvasaubhāgyadāyinī ||
daśaitāḥ kathitādevyodayayā pūritāśayāḥ || 5 || śvetavarṇaḥ || 10 ||

(13) atha nigarbhayoginīdhyānam |

nigarbhayoginīnāmnā prathitādaśa kīrtitāḥ ||
sarvajñā sarvaśaktiśca sarvaiśvaryapradāyinī || 1 ||

sarvajñānamayīdevī sarvavyādhivināśinī ||
sarvādhāra svarūpā ca sarvapāpaharā tathā || 2 ||

sarvānaṃdamayīdevī sarvarakṣāsvarūpiṇī ||
sarvepsita pradādevīmuktā gaurasamatviṣaḥ || 3 ||

etāścaturbhujā jñeyāḥ vajraṃ śaktiṃ ca tomaram ||
cakraṃ caiva ca bibhrāṇā bhaṃḍāsuravadhodyatāḥ || 4 || śvetavarṇaḥ || 10 ||

(14) atha rahasyayoginīdhyānam 

rahasya()yoginīnāmnā vāgīśvaryo hi suśrutāḥ ||
raktāśokaprasūnābhā bāṇakārmukapāṇayaḥ || 1 ||

kavacacchanna sarvāṃgyovīṇāpustakaśobhitāḥ ||

<p. 7>

vaśinī caiva kāmeśīmodinīvimalā tathā || 2 ||

aruṇā caiva jayini sarveśī kaulinī tathā ||
aṣṭāvetāssmṛtā devyodaityasaṃhārahetavaḥ || 3 || raktavarṇaḥ || 8 ||

(15) atha atirahasyayoginīdhyānam 

tisrastripīṭhanilayā aṣṭabāhusamanvitāḥ ||
cāpabāṇaupānapātraṃ mātuliṃgaṃ kṛpāṇakam || 1 ||

phalakaṃ nāgapāśaṃ ca ghaṃṭāṃ caiva mahādhvanim ||
bibhrāṇāmahironmattā atipūrvarahasyakāḥ || 2 ||

kāmeśī caiva kameśībhagamālinyathā parā ||
tisra etāssmṛtā daityebhaṃḍekopasamanvitāḥ || 3 ||

lalitā samamāhātmyā lalitāsamatejasaḥ ||
etāstu nityaṃ śrīdevyā aṃtaraṃgā prakīrtitāḥ || 4 || siṃdūravarṇaḥ || 3 ||

(16) atha nityaklinnādevatānāṃdhyānam 

lalitopākhyānarītyā cakreśvaryā tripurasuṃdaryāsākaṃ ṣoḍaśānāmapi || 

devīsamanijākārā devīsamanijāyudhāḥ ||
jagatāmupakārāya varttamānā yuge yuge || 1 ||

āsāmevaśarabha taṃtroktarītyādhyānaṃ prārabhyate |

(bheruṃḍāyāstu śarabhataṃtre anuktatvepi jñānārṇave caṃdrajñāna vidyāmukterlikhitam)

(17) atha kāmeśīdhyānam 

pāśekṣu cāpaumadhupūrṇapātraṃ mahāṃkuśaṃ puṣpaśaraṃvaraṃ ca || 
karairdadhānāmaruṇāṃ triṇetrāṃ kāmeśvarīṃ nityamahaṃbhajāmi || 1 || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(18) atha bhagamālādhyānam 

kahlārapaṃkajasapāśasṛṇīkṣu cāpaṃpuṣpāyudhaṃ ca dadhatīṃ nijabāhuṣaṭkaiḥ ||
baṃdhūkapuṣparucirāmati suṃdarāṃgīmaṃbāṃbhajāmi hṛdaye bhagamālinīṃ tām || 1 || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(19) atha nityaklinnādhyānam 

udyatsūryāruṇakiraṇanibhāṃ trīkṣaṇāmiṃdu khaṃḍāpīḍāṃkāṃcīvara maṇi vilasadbhūṣaṇālaṃkṛtāṃgīm ||

<p. 8>

dorbhiḥpāśaṃ sṛṇivaramabhayaṃ pānapātraṃ dadhānāṃ nityaklinnāmahamanudivasaṃmānase bhāvayāmi || 1 || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(20) atha bheruṃḍādhyānam (jñānārṇave caṃdrajñānavidyāyām)

muktā kuṃdeṃdugaurāṃmaṇimayamakuṭāṃratnatāṭaṃka yuktāmakṣa srakpuṣpahastāmabhaya varakarāṃ caṃdracūḍāṃ triṇetrām ||
guṃjāmālā virājatkucabharanamanonmadhyamāmabjasaṃsthāṃ nānā laṃkāra yuktāṃsuramakuṭamaṇidyotita svarṇapīṭhām || 1 ||

bhaktābhīṣṭādhidevīṃ paramasukhakarīṃ svākṛtiṃ sundarāsyāṃ bheruṃḍāṃ muktakeśīṃ tribhuvanajananīṃ cetasā ciṃtayāmi || śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(21) atha vahnivāsinīdhyānam 

padmaṃ śaṃkhekṣucāpaṃhimakiraṇamatho vāmahastairdadhānāṃ kahlāraṃ hemaśṛṃgaṃ kusumamayaśaraṃmātuliṃgaṃ ca dakṣaiḥ || 
taptodyat kāṃcanābhāṃ maṇimayamakuṭāmaṣṭahastāṃ triṇetrāṃ nityāṃ cittāraviṃde pratidivasamahaṃ vahnivāsībhajāmi || 1 || kanakavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(22) atha mahāvajreśvarīdhyānam 

raktāṃbhodhisthapote navamaṇivilasatpadmapīṭhe niṣaṇṇāṃ pāśaṃkodaṃḍamikṣūdbhavamapi ca sṛṇiṃ dāḍimījaṃ phalaṃ ca ||
bibhrāṇāṃ raktavarṇāṃ tribhirapinayanaiḥ sādaraṃ vīkṣatīṃ tāṃ vajreśīṃ bhāvayehaṃ suragaṇamunibhiḥ stūyamānāṃ bhavā(**) || 1 || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(23) atha śivadūtīdhyānam 

vāmādho ratnapātraṃ tadupari ca gadāṃ kheṭapāśaudadhānāṃ dakṣaiḥpadmaṃ kuṭhāraṃ tadupari ca mahākhaḍgamapyaṃkuśaṃ ca ||
madhyāhnārka prabhābhāṃ navamaṇivilasadbhūṣaṇāmaṣṭahastāṃ dūtīṃ nityāṃ triṇetrāṃ suragaṇamunibhiḥ stūyamānāṃbhajeham || 1 || pāṭalavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 9>

(24) atha tvaritādhyānam 

nāgaiḥ kalpitabhūṣaṇāṃ triṇayanāṃ guṃjāguṇālaṃ kṛtāṃśvāmāṃ pāśavarāṃkuśā bhayavarāṃ dorbhiryutāṃ bālikām ||
pītāṃpallavavāsinīṃ śikhiśikhā cūḍāvataṃsojjvalāṃ dhyāyāmyanvahamṛkṣasiṃhanivahaiḥ pīṭhasthi tāṃ sundarīm || 1 || pītavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(25) atha kulasuṃdarīdhyānam 

bālādityanibhāruṇāṃtriṇayanāṃ bāleṃdu cūḍānvitāṃ hālāgaṃdhi sukomalādhara yutāṃ līlāvatīṃ susmitām || 
mālāṃpustakamapyabhīṣṭamabhayaṃ saṃbibhratīṃ bāhubhirbālāṃ tāmakhilāṃgabhūṣaṇadharāṃ dhyāyāmi saṃsiddhidām || 1 || aruṇavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(26) atha nityādhyānam 

udyadbhānusamaprabhāṃ rasamukhāṃ pāśākṣasūtraṃdhanuḥ kheṭaṃśūlamabhīṣṭadaṃ ca dadhatīṃ vāmaiścaṣaḍbhiḥkaraiḥ ||
dakṣairaṃkuśapustakeṣu kusumaṃ khaḍgaṃ kapālābhayaṃ māṇikyābhara  ṇojjvalāṃ triṇayanāṃ nityāṃbhavānīṃbhaje || 1 || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(27) atha nīlapatākādhyānam 

nīlābhāmaruṇāṃśukāṃ triṇayanāṃ paṃcānanāṃsusmitāṃ vāme pāśapatākapadmavilasaccāpaṃvaraṃ bibhratīm ||
dakṣecāṃkuśa khaḍgaśaktisu mahābāṇābhayānbāhubhiḥ padmasthāṃ maṇimauktikā vṛtakucāṃnīladhvajāmāśraye || 1 || nīlavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(28) atha vijayādhyānam 

śaṃkhaṃ cakraṃ ca pāśaṃ sṛṇimapisumahākheṭakhaḍgausu cāpaṃbāṇaṃ kahlārapuṣpaṃtadanukaragataṃ mātulaṃgaṃdadhānām ||
udyadbālārkavarṇāṃ tribhuvanavijayāṃ paṃcavaktraṃ trinetrāṃ devīṃ pītāṃbarāḍhyāṃku ca bharanamitāṃ saṃtataṃ bhāvayāmi || 1 || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 10> 

(29) atha sarvamaṅgalādhyānam 

hemābhāṃkaruṇābhi pūrṇanayanāṃmāṇikyabhūṣojjvalāṃ dvātriṃśaddalaṣoḍaśāṣṭadalayukpadmasthitāṃsu smitām ||
bhaktānāṃ dhanadāṃvaraṃ ca radhatīṃvāmenahastena taddakṣeṇābhayamātulaṃgasuphalaṃ śrīmaṃgalāṃ bhāvaye || 1 || kanakavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(30) atha jvālāmālinīdhyānam 

kalpāntāgni samaprabhāṃsmitamukhaiḥ ṣaḍbhirbhujairdvādaśairyuktāṃ pāśakakheṭakaṃjasuśaraṃ śūlaṃvaraṃvāmataḥ ||
dakṣetvaṃkuśakhaḍgaśaktisuśarāñcāpābhaye bibhratīṃ jvalāmālinisaṃjñitāṃ maṇimayībhūṣānvitāmāśraye || 1 || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(31) atha mitrādhyānam 

bālārkakāṃtiśaśilāṃchitavaktraśobhāṃ pāśāṃkuśau ca varamapyabhayaṃdadhānām ||
citrāṃśukāṃ ca navaratnavibhūṣitāṃgīṃ citrāṃbikāṃtriṇayanāṃ hṛdibhāvayāmi || 1 || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(32) atha tripurasuṃdarīdhyānam 

rājarājeśvarīvatpāśāṃkuśekṣucāpapuṣpabāṇahastā siṃdūravarṇākāryā || 1 ||

(33) atha ṣaḍaṃgadevīdhyānam 

hṛddevī ca śirodevī śikhādevī tathaivaca || 
varmadevī dṛṣṭidevī hyastradevīṣaḍīratāḥ || 1 ||

navalāvaṇya pūrṇāṃgyassāvadhānadhṛtāyudhāḥ || 
paritobindupīṭhaṃ ca bhrāmyaṃtyodīptamūrtayaḥ || 2 || raktavarṇaḥ || 6 ||

(34) atha yoganidrādevīdhyānam (pāṃcarātrepādmasaṃhitāyām)

nidrā tu śayanārūḍhāsu saumyākamalekṣaṇā ||
pāśapātradharāceyaṃ dvibhujāśyāmalā smṛtā || 1 || śyāmavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(35) atha aṣṭādaśabhujābhadrakālīdhyānam (nṛsiṃhaprāsāde)

aṣṭādaśabhujākāryā bhadrakālīmanoharā || 
ālīḍhasthāna saṃsthānācatussiṃharathe sthitā || 1 ||

<p. 11>

akṣamālāṃtriśūlaṃ ca khaḍgaṃ carma ca sarvadā ||
bāṇacāpau ca kartavye śaṃkhapadme tathaiva ca || 2 ||

sruksruvau ca tathā kāryau tathā divyaṃkamaṃḍalum ||
daṃḍaśaktī ca kartavye kṛṣṇājinahutāśanau || 3 ||

hastānāṃbhadrakālyāstu bhavecchāṃtikarovaraḥ ||
ekatraiva mahābhāgāratnapātradharā bhavet || 4 || nīlavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

atha mūlādhārādisaptapīṭheśvarīṇāṃdhyānam (ṣoḍhākalpe) 

(36) atha tatra mūlādhārapīṭhastha śākinīdhyānam 

mūlādhārasthapadmeśrutidalasahite paṃcavaktrāṃ triṇetrāṃsvarṇābhāma sthi saṃsthāṃ sṛṇimapikamalaṃpustakaṃ jñānamudrām ||
bibhrāṇāṃ bāhudaṃḍaissulalitavaradādyābhivītāṃmanojñāṃ mudgānnāsaktacittāṃ madhumadamuditāṃ śākinīṃbhāvayet tām || 1 || svarṇavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(37) atha svādhiṣṭhānapīṭhasthakākinīdhyānam 

svādhiṣṭhānākhya padmerasadalalasite vedavaktrāṃtriṇetrāṃ pītābhāṃdhārayaṃtīṃ triśikhaguṇakapālābhayāññāṃtavargām ||
medodhātu pratiṣṭhāmalimadamuditāṃbaṃdhinīṃpūgaśaktyāvītāṃdadhya nnasaktāmabhimataphaladāṃkinīṃ bhāvayet tām || 1 || pītavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(38) atha maṇipūrakapīṭhasthalākinīdhyānam 

nābhaudikpatrapadme trivadanavilasattrīkṣaṇāṃ kṛṣṇavarṇāṃśaktiṃ daṃbholidaṃḍābhayamapi ca bhujairdhārayaṃtīṃ mahogrām ||
ḍāmaryādyaiḥparītāṃ paśujanabhayadāṃmāṃsadhātvāsanasthāṃgauḍā nne saktacittāṃsakalasukhakarīṃsaṃsmarellākinīṃ tām || 1 || kṛṣṇavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(39) atha anāhatapīṭhastharākinīdhyānam 

hṛtpadmebhānupatre dvivadanavilasaddaṃṣṭriṇīṃ śyāmavarṇāṃ ṭaṃkaṃ śūlaṃkapālaṃḍamarumapi bhujairdhārayaṃtīṃtriṇetrām ||

<p. 12>

raktasthāṃ kālarātriprabhṛtiparivṛtāṃ śuddharaktepravṛttāṃ śrīmadvīreṃdravaṃdyāmabhimataphaladāṃ rākinīṃ bhāvayet tām || 1 || śyāmavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(40) atha viśuddhapīṭhasthaḍākinīdhyānam 

grīvākūpeviśuddhe svaradalakamale raktavarṇāṃtriṇetrāṃ śrīkhaṭvāṃgaṃ kapālaṃtriśikhamapi mahācarmasaṃdhārayaṃtīm ||
vaktreṇaikenayuktāṃ paśujanabhayadāṃpāyasānna prasaktāṃtvaksthāṃ vaṃdemṛtoghaiḥ parivṛtavapuṣaṃḍākinīṃ vīracaṃḍām || 1 || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(41) atha ājñāpīṭhasthahākinīdhyānam 

bhrūmadhye biṃdupadmedvidalavilasite śubhravarṇāṃkarābjairbibhrāṇāṃ jñānamudrāṃḍamarukamamalaṃ cākṣamālāṃkapālam ||
ṣaḍvaktrāmabjasaṃsthāṃ trinayanalalitāṃhaṃsagatyādiyuktāṃhāridrānne prasaktāṃ sakalasuranutāṃhākinīṃ bhāvayet tām || 1 || śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(42) atha jālaṃdharapīṭhasthayākinīdhyānam 

muṃḍavyomastha padme sakaladalayute yākinīṃbhairavīṃ tāṃ yakṣiṇyādyāṃ samastāyudhalasitakarāṃ sarvavarṇāṃsamaṣṭim ||
rādīnāṃ sarvavaktrāṃ sakalasukhakarīṃ sarvadhātu svarūpāṃ sarvānnesaktacittāṃparaśivarasikāṃ bhāvayed yākinīṃ tām || 1 || citravarṇaḥ || 1 ||

atha saptamātṛkādevatānāṃ dhyānam (nṛsiṃhaprāsāde)

(43) tatra brāhmīdhyānam 

tatra brāhmīcaturvaktrāṣaḍbhujāhaṃsa saṃsthitā || 
piṃgābhābhūṣaṇopetāmṛgacarmottarīyakā || 1 ||

varaṃsūtraṃ sruvaṃdhatte dakṣabāhutraye kramāt || 
vāme tu pustakaṃkuṃḍīṃbibhratīcābhayaṃkaram || 2 || pītavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(44) atha māheśvarīdhyānam 

māheśvarī vṛṣārūḍhā paṃcavaktrātrilocanā || 
śvetavarṇā daśabhujācaṃdrarekhā vibhūṣitā || 1 ||

<p. 13>

khaḍgaṃvajraṃ triśūlaṃ ca paraśuṃcābhayaṃvaram || 
pāśaṃghaṃṭāṃ tathā nāgamaṃkuśaṃ bibhratīkaraiḥ || 2 || śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(45) atha kaumārīdhyānam 

ṣaḍānanā tu kaumārīpāṭalābhāsuśīlakā ||
ravibāhurmayūrasthāvaradā śaktidhariṇī || 1 ||

patākāṃ bibhratīdaṃḍaṃpātraṃbāṇaṃ ca dakṣiṇe ||
vāme cāpamathoghaṃṭāṃkamalaṃ kukkuṭaṃ tathā ||
paraśuṃ bibhratī caiva tadadhastvabhayānvitā || 2 || pāṭalavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(46) atha vaiṣṇavīdhyānam 

vaiṣṇavītārkṣyagāśyāmā ṣaḍbhujāvanamālinī ||
varadāgadinīdakṣe bibhratī ca kareṃbujam ||
śaṃkhacakrābhayānvāme sā ceyaṃvilasadbhujā || 1 || nīlavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(47) atha vārāhīdhyānam 

kṛṣṇavarṇā tu vārāhīmahiṣasthā mahodarī ||
varadādaṃḍinī khaḍgaṃbibhratī dakṣiṇekare || 1 ||
kheṭapātrābhayānvāme sūkarāsyālasadbhujā || kṛṣṇavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(48) atha aiṃdrīdhyānam 

aiṃdrīsahasradṛk saumyā hemābhāgajasaṃsthitā || 
varadāsūtriṇī vajraṃ bibhratyūrdhvaṃ tu dakṣiṇe || 1 || 
vāme tu kamalaṃpātraṃ hyabhayaṃtadadhaḥkare || kanakavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(49) atha cāmuṃḍādhyānam 

cāmuṃḍāpretagā kṛṣṇāvikṛtācā hi bhūṣaṇā ||
daṃṣṭrālākṣīṇadehā ca gartākṣīkāmarūpiṇī || 1 ||

digbāhuḥkṣāmakukṣiśca musalaṃcakracāmare ||
aṃkuśaṃ bibhratīkhaḍgaṃdakṣiṇe cāthavāmake || 2 ||
kheṭaṃpāśaṃdhanurdaṃḍaṃ kuṭhāraṃcāpibibhratī || kṛṣṇavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 14>

(50) atha caṃḍikādhyānam (nṛsiṃhaprāsāde)

caṃḍikāśvetavarṇā sā śivarūpā ca siṃhagā ||
jaṭilāvartulā tryakṣāvaradā śūladhāriṇī || 1 ||
kartrikāṃ bibhratīdakṣe pāśapātrābhayānvitā || śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

atha navadurgāṇāṃdhyānam (śaivāgame) (sarvāsāṃśyāmavarṇaḥ)

(51) tatra śailaputrīdurgādhyānam 

vaṃ devāṃchitalābhāya caṃdrārdhakṛtaśekharām ||
vṛṣārūḍhāṃ śūladharāṃ śailaputrīṃyaśasvinīm || 1 || 1 ||

(52) atha brahmacāriṇīdurgādhyānam 

dadhānākarapadmābhyāmakṣamālākamaṃḍalū ||
devīprasīda tu mayibrahmacāriṇyanuttamā || 1 || 1 ||

(53) atha caṃḍakhaṃḍadurgādhyānam 

aṃḍajapravarārūḍhācaṃḍakopārbhaṭīyutā ||
prasādaṃ tanutāṃmahyaṃ caṃḍakhaṃḍeti viśrutā || 1 || 1 ||

(54) atha skaṃdadurgādhyānam 

siṃhāsanagatānityaṃ padmāṃcitakaradvayā || 
śubhadāstu sadā devīskaṃdamātāyaśasvinī || 1 || 1 ||

(55) atha kūṣmāṃḍadurgādhyānam 

surāsaṃpūrṇakalaśaṃ rudhirāplutameva ca || 
dadhānāhastapadmābhyāṃ kūṣmāṃḍāśubhadāstume || 1 || 1 ||

(56) atha kātyāyanīdurgādhyānam 

caṃdrahāsojjvalakarāśārdūlavaravāhanā ||
kātyāyanīśubhaṃ dadyād devīdānavaghātinī || 1 || 1 ||

<p. 15>

(57) atha kālarātridurgādhyānam 

karālarūpā kālābjasamānākṛtivigrahā ||
kālarātriḥśubhaṃ dadyād devīcaṃḍāṭṭahāsinī || 1 || 1 ||

(58) atha mahāgaurīdurgādhyānam 

śvetahastisamārūḍhā śvetāmbaradharāśuciḥ ||
mahāgaurīśubhaṃ dadyānmahādeva pramodadā || 1 || 1 ||

(59) atha siddhidāyinīdurgādhyānam 

siddhagaṃdharva yakṣādyairasurairamarairapi ||
sevyamānā sadābhūyāt siddhidāsiddhidāyinī || 1 || 9 ||

(60) atha navadurgāṇāṃdhyānam (skaṃdayāmaloktarītyākāraṇāgame) 

tatra padmānvite sthāne pūjyādurgāstumūrtitaḥ | aṣṭādaśabhujācaikāpīnavakṣobhujorukā || 1 ||

sarvālaṃkārasaṃyuktā sarvasiddhipradāyinī ||
mūrdhajaṃ kheṭakaṃghaṃṭāmādarśaṃtarjanīṃ dhanuḥ || 2 ||

dhvajaṃḍamarukaṃ pāśaṃbibhratī vāmapāṇibhiḥ ||
śaktimudgaraśūlānivajraṃ śaṃkhamathāṃbujam || 3 ||

śalākāṃmārgaṇaṃ cakraṃdadhānā dakṣiṇaiḥkaraiḥ ||
śeṣāṣṣoḍaśahastāssyuśśaraṃḍamarukaṃvinā || 4 ||

jayamicchadbhiretāstu pūjanīyāmanīṣibhiḥ || etāsāṃnāmāni ||
rudrācaṃḍāśacīśaivācaṃḍīkrūrānucaṃḍikā ||
navamīcogra caṃḍā ca navadurgāḥprakīrtitāḥ || 1 || tāsāṃvarṇā ||

pāvakābhāṃjanā kṛṣṇānīlā śuklā ca dhūmikā ||
pītā ca pāṃḍarā jñeyāhyālīḍhāstāharidvṛtāḥ || 1 || 9 ||

(61) atha ṣoḍaśabhujādurgādhyānam  (durgākalpe)

trinayanapannagayuktāṃ śūlavyagrāṃbhujaiśca ṣoḍaśabhiḥ ||
pannagavalayavibhūṣāṃ nīlagrīvāṃdigaṃbarāṃ vaṃde || 1 || śyāmavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 16>

(62) atha rudrāṃśadurgādhyānam (kāraṇāgame)

raktāṃbarāṃ śyāmalinīṃdvinetrāṃ kirīṭaratnāṃkitahemabhūṣām || 
saśūlakhaḍgāṃdhṛtaśaṃkhacakrāṃ mṛgeṃdrayānāṃ ravicaṃdrabhūṣām || 1 ||

iṣṭārthadātrīṃsuravaṃdyapādāṃ rudrāṃśadurgāṃ manasāsmarāmi || śyāmavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(63) atha aṣṭabhujākālīdhyānam (kāraṇāgame) 

aṣṭabāhurmahākāyā kālameghasamaprabhā ||
śaṃkhacakragadākuṃbhamusalāṃkuśapāśayuk ||
vajraṃkare bibhratī sā mahākālīmudestunaḥ || 1 || meghaśyāmavarṇaḥ ||

(**)durgādhyānam (āmnāye) 

ariśaṃkhakṛpāṇakheṭabāṇān sadhanuśśūlakatarjanīṃdadhānā ||
mama sā mahiṣottamāṃgasaṃsthā navadūrvāsadṛśīśriyestudurgā || 1 || hemavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(65) atha pratyaṃgirādhyānam (pratyaṃgirākalpe) 

śyāmābhāṃ ca triṇetrāṃ tāṃ siṃhavaktrāṃ caturbhujām || ūrdhvakeśīṃ ca siṃhasthāṃcaṃ(*)kitaśiroruhām || 1 ||

kapālaśūlaḍamarunāgapāśadharāṃśubhām || 
pratyaṅgirā()nityaṃ sarvaśatruvināśinīm || 2 || śyāmavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(66) atha śūlinīdhyānam (tatkalpe)

bibhrāṇāśūlabāṇāsyarisadaragadāpāśacāpānkarāgrairmeghaśyāmā kirīṭollasitajaladharābhīṣaṇā bhūṣaṇāḍhyā || 
siṃhaskaṃdhādhirūḍhā catasṛbhirasikheṭānvitābhiḥ parītākanyābhirbhinna daityābhavatu bhavabhayadhvaṃsinīśūlinīnaḥ || 1 || meghaśyāmavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(67) atha dhūmrāvatīdhyānam (tatkalpe)

raktāṃgīṃ raktavastrāṃkarikaravilasatkuṃḍalāṃ caḍadaṃṣṭrāṃkaṃṭhodya druṃḍamālāṃ parisaravilasacchobhipaiśāca vṛṃdām || 
ghorāṃghorāṭṭahāsāṃkarakalitakapālāsiraudrāṃ triṇetrāṃ śatrūṇāṃ prāṇahaṃtrīṃ śaśiśiśumakuṭāṃ bhāvayeddhūmrakālām || 1 || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 17>

(68) atha vaśyamukhīdhyānam (mahālakṣmīratnakośe)

saṃdhāyasumanobāṇaṃ karṣaṃtīmaikṣavaṃ dhanuḥ ||
jagajjaitrīṃ japāraktāṃdevīṃvaśyamukhīṃbhaje || 1 || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(69) atha ugratārādhyānam (āmnāye)

pratyālīḍhapadārpitāṃghriśavabhṛdghorāṭṭahāsāparākhaṅge dīvaraśūlakharparadharā huṃkārabījodbhavā || 
kharvānīlaviśālapiṃgalajaṭājūṭogranāgairvṛtā jāḍyaṃ nyasyakapālake trijagatāṃhaṃtyugratārāsvayam || 1 || siṃdūravarṇaḥ || 1 || 

(70) atha kurukullādhyānam (lalitopākhyāne)

tatra naukeśvarīdevī kurukulletiviśrutā ||
tamālaśyāmalākārāśyāmakaṃcukadhāriṇī || 1 ||

ratnāritrakarānityamullasanmadamāṃsalā ||
paritobhrāmyati munemaṇinaukādhirohiṇī || 2 || nīlavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(71) atha vāruṇīdhyānam (lalitopākhyāne)

sākṣācca vāruṇīdevī tatra naukādhināyikā || 
yāṃsuvāmālinīmāhuryāmāhuramṛteśvarīm || 1 ||

sā tatra maṇinaukāsthā śaktisenāsamāvṛtā ||
īṣadālokamātreṇa trailokyamadadāyinī || 2 ||

taruṇādityasaṃkāśāmadaraktakapolabhūḥ ||
pārijātaprasūnāsṛk parivītakacoccayā || 3 ||

vahaṃtīmadirāpūrṇaṃ caṣakaṃloladutpalam ||
pakvaṃpiśitakhaṃḍaṃ ca maṇipātre tathānyake ||
vāruṇītaraṇī śreṇīnāyikā tatra rājate || 4 || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(72) atha aparājitādhyānam (nāradasaṃhitāyām)

nīlotpalanibhāṃdevīṃ nidrāmudritalocanām || 
nīlakuṃcita keśāgrāṃnimnanābhīvalitrayām || 1 ||

varābhayakarāṃbhojāṃ praṇatārtivināśinīm ||
pītāṃbaravaropetāṃ bhūṣaṇasragvibhūṣitām || 2 ||

varaśaktyākṛtiṃ saumyāṃparasainya prabhaṃjinīm ||

<p. 18>

śaṃkhacakragadābhīti ramyahastāṃtrilocanām || 3 ||
sarvakāmapradāṃdevīṃ dhyāyet tāmaparājitām || nīlavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(73) atha śatruvidhvaṃsinīdhyānam (sudarśanasaṃhitāyām)

śatruvidhvaṃsinī raudrātriśirāraktalocanā ||
agnijvālāraudramukhī ghoradaṃṣṭrātrilocanā || 1 ||

digaṃbarāraktakeśīraktapāṇirmahodarī ||
etai raviṣkṛtairghoraiśśīghramuccāṭayed dviṣaḥ || 2 || nīla() || 1 ||

(74) atha svasthāveśinīdhyānam (ahirbudhnyasaṃhitāyām)

raktāṃgīṃśavavāsinīṃtriśirasaṃraudrīṃ mahābhairavīṃ dhūmrākṣīṃbhayahāriṇīṃ ghanaśikhānīlālakālaṃkṛtām ||
ḍhakkāśūladharāṃ mahābalaripudhvaṃsāṃ kṛśāṃgīṃmahīṃ bhīmāṃgīṃ trijaṭāṃdavānalamayīṃ dhyāyetpinākistutām || 1 || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(75) atha daṃḍanāthāvārāhīdhyānam (lalitopākhyāne)

daṃḍanāthā tatra devīśatastaṃbhāḍhyamaṃḍape || 
kārtasvaramayāṃbhoja karṇikāmadhyasaṃsthitam || 1 ||

biṃdutrikoṇavṛttāḍhyaṃ ṣaḍdalaṃvṛttayugmakam ||
cakraṃvirājate tatra taptakāṃcanasannibhā || 2 ||

saṃdhyāruṇalasaccelā sarvābharaṇamaṃḍitā ||
śaṃkhacakrābhayavarān halaṃ ca musalaṃ tathā || 3 ||

pāśāṃkuśau ca dadhatī caṃdrarekhāvataṃsinī ||
vārāhavaktrasaṃyuktādaṃḍinī tatra vartate || 4 || kanakavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(76) atha svapnavārāhīdhyānam (tatkalpe)

meghaśyāmaruciṃ manoharakucāṃ netratrayodbhāsitāṃ kolāsyāṃśaśi śekharāmabhilasaddaṃṣṭrā prabhāśobhinīm ||
bibhrāṇāṃ svakarāṃbujairasilatāṃ carmāpipāśaṃsṛṇiṃ vārāhīmanu ciṃtayeddhayavarārūḍhāṃśubhālaṃkṛtim || 1 || meghaśyāmavarṇaḥ || 1 || 

(77) atha śuddhavārāhīdhyānam (vārāhīkalpe)

daṃṣṭrojjvaladvarāhāsyāṃ raktavastrottarīyakām || 
śūlaṃkapālaṃmusalaṃnāgaṃ hastaistubibhratīm || 1 || 
iṃdurekhālasanmauliṃ vārāhīṃtāmahaṃbhaje || nīlavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 19>

(78) atha laghuśyāmalādhyānam (śyāmalākalpe)

smaretprathamapuṣpiṇoṃrudhirabindu śoṇāṃbarāṃ gṛhītamadhupātrikāṃ madavidhūrṇanetrāṃcalām ||
karasphuritavallakīṃ vimalaśaṃkhatāṭaṃkinīṃgha()nastanabharālasāṃgalita cūlikāṃśyāmalām || 1 || śyāmavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(79) atha rājamātaṃgīdhyānam (tatkalpe)

ratnāsanāṃ śyāmagātrīṃśṛṇvatīṃśukajalpitam || 
abjanyastaikacaraṇāṃ cārucaṃdrāvataṃsakām || 1 ||

vīṇāmālāpayaṃtīṃ ca tilakodbhāsiphālakām ||
saugaṃdhikasrakkalikācūlikāṃ raktavāsasam || 2 ||
vibhūṣaṇairbhūṣitāṃ ca mātaṃgīṃ praṇamāmyaham || śyāmavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(80) atha bālādhyānam (tripurasuṃdarīkalpe)

japākusumasaṃkāśāphullā padmāsanāsthitā || 
akṣasrakpustakābhītivarastātubālikā || 1 || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(81) atha bhuvaneśvarīdhyānam (mahālakṣmīratnakośe)

udyadbhāsvatsamābhāṃvijitanavajapāmiṃdu khaṇḍāvanaddhāṃ jyotirmālāṃtriṇeṣāṃ vividhamaṇilasatkuṃḍalāṃ padmasaṃsthām  ||
hāragraiveyakāṃcīgaṇigaṇavalayainsaṃyutāmaṃbarāḍhyāmādyāṃ pāśāṃkuśābhyāmabhayavarakarāṃ bhāvayedbhauvaneśīm ||  || 1 || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(82) atha mṛtasaṃjīvinīdhyānam (rudrayāmale kuhūkalpe)

mṛtasaṃjīvinīṃdevīṃ śāṃtarūpāṃ ca bibhratīm ||
pāśāhīṃdrāṃkuśagadākhaḍgaśūlavarābhayān || 1 ||

raktāmaṣṭabhujāṃvaṃde phullapadmāsanāṃśubhām || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(83) atha bagalādevatādhyānam  (tatkalpe)

caturbhujāṃtrinayanāṃkamalāsana saṃsthitām ||
triśūlaṃpānapātraṃ ca gadāṃ jihvāṃ ca vibhratīm || 1 ||

biṃboṣṭhīṃkaṃbukaṃṭhīṃ ca samapīnapayodharām ||
pītāṃbarāṃmadāghūrṇāṃ dhyāyedbrahmāstradevatām || 2 || pītavarṇaḥ || 1 || 

<p. 20>

(84) atha prāṇaśaktidevatādhyānam (śāradātilake)

raktāṃbhodhisthapotollasadaruṇasarojādhirūḍhākarābjaiḥ pāśaṃkodaṃḍa mikṣūdbhavamaṇiguṇamapyaṃkuśaṃ paṃcabāṇān ||
bibhrāṇāsṛkkapālaṃ trinayanalasitāpīnavakṣoruhāḍhyā devībālārkavarṇā bhavatu sukhakarīprāṇaśaktiḥ parānaḥ || 1 || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(85) atha śuddhavidyādevīdhyānam (somanāthavallīmaṃtraśāstre)

akṣamālāṃpustakaṃ ca dadhānā śvetavigrahā ||
cinmudrā'bhīti hastā ca śuddhavidyā sadāvatu || 1 || śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(86) atha śrīvidyādevīdhyānam (mahālakṣmīratnakośe)

ādhāre taruṇārkabiṃbavadanehyatyugra daṃṣṭrāṃkure vīṇāvāda anaṃtabhoganilaye vīṇādigāna priye ||
nānāvarṇamayenarāsthilulitesu vyaktamālādhare śrīvidyetvarite mahārtha mahite śrīśāṃkaritvāṃbhaje || 1 || citravarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(87) atha kāmakaleśvarīdhyānam (mahālakṣmīratnakośe)

paṃkajapāśekṣu dhanuḥ kiṃśukaśālyagra paṃcabāṇadharām ||
satatābhayavarahastāṃkalaye kāmapi kalādharāmaṃbām || 1 || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(88) atha vanaśaṃkarīdhyānam (padmapurāṇe)

kalpāṃtānalakāyakāṃtisu bhagāṃśūlaṃkapālaṃśaraṃ cāpaṃcāpi varābhayau ca parighaṃśaṃkhaṃ ca cakraṃgadām ||
bibhrāṇāṃśaśikhaṃḍaśobhimakuṭāṃ ratnāṃbarālaṃkṛtāṃvaṃdetāṃ vanaśaṃkarīṃtrinayanāṃ vāgīśaviṣṇustutām || 1 || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(89) atha śākaṃbharīdhyānam (padmapurāṇe)

śūlaṃpāśakapālacāpakuliśaṃ bāṇānsṛṇiṃkheṭakaṃ śaṃkhaṃ cakragadā hi khaḍgamabhayaṃ khaṭvāṃgadaṃḍaṃdharām ||
varṣābhāvavaśāddhatānmunigaṇāñśākena yā rakṣatātrailokyā jananīṃ maheśadayitāṃtāṃstaumiśākaṃbharīm || 1 || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(90) atha surādevīdhyānam (tatkalpe)

surāsurairmathyamāne kṣīrodesāgarottame || 
tatrotpannāṃsurāṃ devīṃ kanyakārūpadhāriṇīm || 1 ||

<p. 21>

aṣṭādaśabhujairyuktāṃ raktāntāyatalocanām ||
śaṃkhaṃ khaḍgaṃdhanuścaiva kapālaṃmusalaṃ tathā || 2 ||

śaktiṃgadāṃvaraṃ ghaṃṭāṃdadhānāṃ vāmapāṇibhiḥ ||
cakraṃmuṣṭiṃśaraṃ śūlaṃlohaṃ kheṭaṃ ca tomaram || 3 ||

abhayaṃbhiṃḍibālaṃ ca dadhānāṃ dakṣiṇairbhujaiḥ ||
triṇetrāṃdīrghatanvaṃgīṃ kālāgnisadṛśīṃ bhajet || 4 ||

maṃdaraṃveṣṭayitvā tu phenilāvartabhīṣaṇām ||
gomūtrakṣīravarṇābhāṃ kṛṣṇarūpāṃparāṃsurām || 5 ||

(trāsayaṃtyasurān sarvāndevānāmabhayaṃkarī ||
yā surāsāhyumādevī yomohassamaheśvaraḥ || 1 ||) citravarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(91) atha catuṣṣaṣṭikalādevīdhyānam (śābarataṃtre)

hastaiḥ padmaṃrathāṃgaṃguṇamathahariṇaṃ pustakaṃvarṇamālāṃṭaṃkaṃ śubhraṃkapālaṃvaramamṛtalasaddhemakuṃbhaṃdadhānām ||
muktāvidyutpayodasphaṭikanavajapābaṃdhuraiḥ paṃcavaktrairūpakṣairvakṣojana mrāṃsakalaśaśinibhāṃ śāradāṃtāṃ namāmi || 1 || śubhravarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(92) atha sarvavarṇeśvarīdhyānam (siddhaśābarataṃtre)

akṣasrajaṃhariṇapotamudagraṭaṃkaṃ vidyāṃkarairavirataṃdadhatīṃ triṇetrām || 
ardhendumaulimaruṇāmaraviṃdavāsāṃ varṇeśvarīṃ praṇamatastanabhāra namrām || 1 || aruṇavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(93) atha dvādaśārddhadevīdhyānam (mahālakṣmīratnakośe)

paṃcavaktrāṃ triṇetrāṃ ca śavasthāṃraktavarṇakām ||
raktakaṃjaśiromālāṃ caṃdrarekhāvataṃsakām || 1 ||

akṣamālāṃkuśavara triśūlakusumāśugān ||
pāśekṣucāpamabhayaṃ kapālaṃpustakaṃ tathā || 2 ||

dhārayaṃtīṃ dvādaśārddhadevīṃ tāṃ praṇamāmyaham || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(94) atha tiraskariṇīdevīdhyānam (mahālakṣmīratnakośe)

nīlavājisamārūḍhā nīlāṃgīkhaḍgadhāriṇī ||
nidrānimīladbhuvanātiraskariṇikāvatu || 1 || nīlavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(95) atha aśvārūḍhādevīdhyānam (mahālakṣmīratnakośe) 

aśvārūḍhākarāgre navakanakamayīṃ vetrayaṣṭiṃdadhānādakṣe vāmepi caivaṃ khalinatanulatā pāśabaddhāsu sādhyā ||
devī nityaṃprasannāśaśadharavilasatkeśapāśātriṇetrā dadyādadyānavadyā sakalasukhakulaprāpti hṛdyāṃśriyaṃnaḥ || 1 || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(96) atha iṃdrākṣīdevīdhyānam (iṃdrākṣīkalpe)

iṃdrākṣīṃdvibhujāṃ devīṃ pītavastradvayānvitām ||
vāmahaste vajradharāṃ dakṣiṇenavarapradām || 1 ||

iṃdrākṣīṃsahayuvatīṃ nānālaṃkārabhūṣitām ||
prasannavadanāṃbhojāmapsarogaṇasevitām || 2 || pītavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(97) atha tulajābhavānīdhyānam (bhavānīkalpe)

raktābhāmaruṇāṃ śubhāṃbaradharāmānaṃdapūrṇānanāṃ muktāhāra(-) vibhūṣaṇāṃkucabharā krāṃtāṃsukāṃcīguṇām ||
devīṃ divyarasānnapūrṇakalaśāmaṃbhojadarvīkarāṃ dhyāyecchaṃkaravallabhāṃ trinayanāmabhrālakāṃsundarīm || 1 || aruṇavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(98) atha caṃdrāparameśvarīdhyānam (tatkalpe)

karalasadaraviṃdācārunetrāraviṃdānivasatu hṛdicaṃdrāsmeravaktrāraviṃdā || 
nikhilavibudhavṛṃdāvaṃdyapādāraviṃdāhyati śayitamaraṃdāmodamādyanmi lindā || 1 ||

karadhṛtakaravālākāladṛṣṭyā karālāgativijitamarālāpakṣmapaṅtyāpyarālā ||
vikacakamalamālā yogisaṃgītaśīlāvasaturuciralīlācaṃdrikānaṃdabālā || 2 ||

svarṇavarṇāṃmahādevīṃ divyasiṃhāsane sthitām ||
dhyāyecca varadāṃdevīṃ caṃdirāṃparameśvarīm || 3 || svarṇavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(99) atha tulasīdevīdhyānam (tulasīmāhātmye)

dhyāyecca tulasīṃdevīṃ śyāmāṃkamalalocanām ||
prasannāṃ padmakalhāravarābhayacaturbhujām || 1 ||

kirīṭahārakeyūrakuṃḍalādivibhūṣitām ||
dhvalāṃśukasaṃyuktāṃ padmāsananiṣeduṣīm || 2 || śyāmavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(100) atha gāyatrīdhyānam (mārkaṃḍeyapurāṇe)

devīṃ parvāhṇasaṃdhyāyāṃ gāyatrīṃ vahnirūpiṇīm ||
kumārīṃraktavastrāṃgīṃ raktasraganulepanām || 1 ||

caturbhujāṃcaturvaktrāṃvaradāṃcāṣṭalocanām ||

<p. 23> 

padmākṣamālāvalayaṃ vibhratīṃdakṣiṇekare || 2 ||

vāme kamaṃḍaluṃpāṇausruvaṃsavyetarekare ||
abhayaṃvāmamaste ca padmapīṭhe pratiṣṭitām || 3 ||

ṛgvedarūpiṇīṃ prātassavanāṃhaṃsavāhanām ||
rasāyanāṃ ca bṛhatīṃgārhapatye pratiṣṭhitām || 4 || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(101) atha sāvitrīdhyānam (mārkaṇḍeyapurāṇe)

devīṃmadhyāhnasaṃdhyāyāṃ sāvitrīṃrudrarūpiṇīm ||
yuvatīṃśvetavastrāḍhyāṃ śuklasraganulepanām || 1 ||

caturbhujāṃ caturvaktrāṃvaradāṃ dvādaśekṣaṇām ||
rudrākṣamālāvalayaṃ bibhratīṃdakṣiṇekare || 2 ||

vāmekare ca khaṭvāṃgaṃtriśūlaṃ dakṣiṇekare ||
vāmekare'bhayaṃ devīṃ tathaivārdhendudhāriṇīm || 3 ||

svarṇapīṭhe sthitāṃ saumyeyajurveda svarūpiṇīm ||
mādhyaṃdinākhyasavanesatīṃgovṛṣavāhanām || 4 ||

dakṣiṇāgni svarūpāṃtāṃ dhyāyennityaṃviśuddhadhīḥ || 2 || śuklavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(102) atha sarasvatīdhyānam (mārkaṃḍeyapurāṇe)

sarasvatīṃ tu sāyāhne saṃdhyāyāṃ viṣṇurūpiṇīm || 
sthavirendīvaraśyāmāṃ nīlakuṃcitamūrdhajām || 1 ||

caturbhujāṃ caikavaktrāṃ padmapatrāyatekṣaṇām ||
śaṃkhaṃcakraṃgadāṃ caiva tathaivābhayadaṃpunaḥ || 2 ||

pītābaraṃdadhānāṃ ca divyasraganulepanām ||
tṛtīyasavanākhyāṃ ca dhyāyedvai viṣṇurūpiṇīm || 3 ||

nīlapīṭhesthitāṃ saumye sāmavedasvarūpiṇīm ||
varadāṃgaruḍārūḍhāmāhavanīye vyavasthitām || 4 || śyāmavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(103) atha dvibhujānnapūrṇādhyānam (kāraṇāgame)

vāme māṇikyapātraṃ madhurasabharitaṃbibhratīṃ pāṇipadme divyairannaiḥ prapūrṇāṃdhṛtamaṇivalaye dakṣiṇeratnadarvīm ||
raktāgīṃpīnatuṃgastanabharavilasattārahārāṃtriṇetrāṃ vaṃde pūrṇendubibapratinidhivadanāmaṃbikāmannapūrṇām || 1 || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(104) atha caturbhujānnapūrṇādhyānam (kāraṇāgame)

sindūrābhāṃtriṇetrāmamṛta śaśikalāṃkhecarīṃ raktavastrāṃpīnottuṃgasta nāḍhyāmabhinavavilasadyauvanāraṃbharamyām ||

<p. 24>

nānālaṃkārayuktāṃsarasijanayanāmiṃdusaṃkrāṃtamūrtiṃdevīṃ pāśāṃkuśāḍhyāmabhayavarakarāmannapūrṇāṃ namāmi || 1 || sindūravarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(105) atha agnidurgādhyānam (śāradātilake)

vidyuddāmasamaprabhāṃ mṛgapatiskaṃdhasthitāṃ bhīṣaṇāṃkanyābhiḥ karavālakheṭavilasaddhastābhirā sevitām ||
hastaiścakravarāsikheṭaviśiravāṃścāpāṃkuśau tarjanīṃbibhrāṇāmana lātmikāṃ śaśidharāṃdurgāṃtriṇetrāṃbhaje || 1 || kanakavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(106) atha śītalādevīdhyānam (rudrayāmaleśītalākalpe)

dhyāyecca śītalāṃdevīṃ rāsabhasthāṃdigaṃbarām || 
mārjanīkalaśopetāṃśūrpālaṃkṛtamastakām || 1 || kṛṣṇavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(107) atha lopāmudrādevatādhyānam (āmnāye)

pāśāṃkuśauśaraṃcāpaṃdhārayaṃtīṃ trilocanām | sūryābhāṃ caṃdracūḍāṃcalopāmudrāṃbhajeśivām || 1 || siṃdūravarṇaḥ || 1 ||

atha aṣṭamahālakṣmīsvarūpāṇi |

(108) tatra dvibhujālakṣmīdhyānam (nṛsiṃhaprāsāde)

haressamīpe kartavyālakṣmīstu dvibhujānṛpa || 
divyarūpāṃbujakarāsarvābharaṇabhūṣitā || 1 || hemavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(109) atha gajalakṣmīdhyānam (pāṃcarātre)

lakṣmīḥ śuklāṃbarādevīrūpeṇā pratimābhuvi ||
pṛthakcaturbhujākāryā devīsiṃhāsaneśubhā || 1 ||

siṃhāsanesyāḥkartavyaṃ kamalaṃcārukarṇikam ||
aṣṭapatraṃ mahābhāgākarṇikāyāṃsu saṃsthitā || 2 ||

vināyakavadāsīnā devīkāryācaturbhujā ||
bṛhannālaṃkarekāryaṃtasyāścakamalaṃ śubham || 3 ||

dakṣiṇe yādavaśreṣṭhakeyūraprāṃtasaṃsthitam ||
vāme'mṛtaghaṭaḥkāryastathā rājanmanoharaḥ || 4 ||

tasyā anyaukarau kāryau bilvaśaṃkhadharaudvija ||
āvarjitakaraṃkāryaṃ tatpṛṣṭe kuṃjaradvayam || 5 ||

<p. 25>

devyāśca mastake kāryaṃpadmaṃcāpimanoharam || svarṇavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(110) atha mahālakṣmīdhyānam (nṛsiṃhaprāsāde viśvakarmaṇā)

kollāpuraṃ vinānyatra mahālakṣmīryadocyate ||
lakṣmīvatsā tadā kāryā sarvābharaṇabhūṣitā || 1 ||

dakṣiṇādhaḥkarepātramūrdhve kaumodakīṃ tataḥ ||
vāmordhve kheṭakaṃ caiva śrīphalaṃtadadhaḥkare || 2 ||

vibhratīmastakeliṃgaṃpūjanīyā vibhūtaye || svarṇavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(111) atha śrīdevīdhyānam (mayūrave)

pāśākṣamālikāṃbhojasṛṇibhiryāmya saumyayoḥ || 
padmāsanasthāṃ kurvīta śriyaṃtrailokyamātaram || 1 || hemavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(112) atha vīralakṣmīdhyānam (pāṃcarātre)

vīralakṣmīritiravyātāvaradā'bhaya hastinī ||
ūrdhvapadmadvayauhastau tathā padmāsane sthitā || 1 || svarṇavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(113) atha dvibhujāvīralakṣmīdhyānam (pāṃcarātre)

dakṣiṇetvabhayaṃ bityuttare varadaṃ tathā || ūrūpadmadalākārauvīra śrīmurtilakṣaṇam || 1 || hemavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(114) atha aṣṭabhujāvīralakṣmīdhyānam (pāṃcarātre)

pāśāṃkuśākṣasūtravarābhayagadāpadmapātrahastākāryā || 1 || hemavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(115) atha prasannalakṣmīdhyānam (atharvaṇarahasye)

vaṃde lakṣmīṃ paraśivamayīṃśuddhajāṃbūnadābhāṃ tejorūpāṃ kanakavasanāṃ sarvabhūṣojjvalāṃgīm ||
bījāpūraṃ kanakakalaśaṃ hemapadmaṃdadhānāmādyāṃ śaktiṃ sakalajananīṃ viṣṇuvāmāṃkasaṃsthām || 1 || svarṇavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(116) atha viṣṇuparivāraśaktīnāṃdhyānam (padmapurāṇe)

suvarṇanibhaśobhā śrīssyātsā bhūrarjunacchaviḥ ||
sarasvatīsitāraktā prītiḥ śyāmanibhākṛtiḥ || 1 ||

kīrtīraktābhavecchāṃtissphaṭikābhāsamīritā ||

<p. 26>

tuṣṭiḥ pītābhavetpuṣṭiśśyāmā devyastutāḥsmṛtāḥ || 2 ||

padmadvayakarāścaiva varābhayakarāstutāḥ || 1 ||

(117) atha saubhāgyabhuvaneśvarīdhyānam (śāradātilake)

siṃdūrāruṇavigrahāṃ trinayanāṃmāṇikyamauli sphurattārānāyaka śekharāṃsmitamukhīmāpīnavakṣoruhām ||
pāṇibhyāmaṇipūrṇaratnacaṣakaṃ raktotpalaṃbibhratīṃ saumyāṃratnanidhistha savyacaraṇāṃdhyāyet parāmaṃbikām || 1 || sindūravarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(118) atha māyābhuvaneśvarīdhyānam (śāradātilake)

śyāmāṃgīṃ śaśiśekharāṃnijakarairdānaṃ ca raktotpalaṃ ratnāḍhyaṃ caṣakaṃ paraṃbhayaharaṃ saṃvibhratīṃśāśvatīm ||
muktāhāralasatpayodharanatāṃ netratrayollāsinīṃ vaṃdehaṃsurapūjitāṃharavadhūṃ raktāraviṃdasthitām || 1 || nīlavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(119) atha vajraprastāriṇīdhyānam (śāradātilake)

raktābdhauraktapotevidalita kamalābhyaṃtare saṃniṣaṇṇāṃraktāṃgīṃraktamaulisphurita śaśikalāṃsmeravaktrāṃtriṇetrām || 
bījāpūreṣupāśāṃkuśamusaladhanussrakkapālānihastairbibhrāṇāmāna(-) tāṃgīṃ stanabharanamitāmaṃbikāmānamāmi || 1 || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(120) atha trikaṃṭakīdevīdhyānam (śāradātilake)

nīlānābheradhastādaruṇarucidharā kaṃṭhadeśātsitā sā vaktrairdaṃṣṭrākarālairudaraparigatairbhīṣaṇāṃgīcaturbhiḥ ||
dīpaukaṃbuṃrathāṃgaṃkarasarasiruhairdhārayaṃtī jaṭāṃtassphūrjacchītāṃśukhaṃḍābhavatu bhayaharādevatā ca triṇetrā || 1 || citravarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(121) atha mohinīnityādevīdhyānam (śāradātilake)

arddheṃdumaulimaruṇāmamarābhivaṃdyāmaṃbhojapāśasṛṇipūrṇaka pālahastām ||
raktāṃgarāgavasanābharaṇāṃtriṇetrāṃ dhyāyecchivasya vanitāṃmada vihvalāṃgīm || 1 || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(122) atha jayadurgādhyānam (śāradātilake)

kālāṃsphārāṃ kaṭākṣairarikulabhayadāṃ maulibaddheṃdu rekhāṃ śaṃkhaṃcakraṃ kṛpāṇaṃtriśikhamapi karairudvahaṃtīṃtriṇetrām ||

<p. 27>

siṃhaskaṃdhādhirūḍhāṃ tribhuvanamakhilaṃ tejasāpūrayaṃtīṃ dhyāyeddurgāṃ jayākhyāṃtridaśaparivṛtāṃsevitāṃ siddhikāmaiḥ || 1 || kṛṣṇavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(123) atha viṃdhyavāsinīdurgādhyānam (śāradātilake)

sauvarṇāṃbujamadhyagāṃtrinayanāṃsaudāminī saṃnibhāṃśaṃkhaṃcakra varābhayānidadhatīmiṃdoḥ kalāṃbibhratīm || 
graiveyāṃgadahārakuṇḍaladharāmākhaṃḍalādyaistutāṃ dhyāyedviṃdhya nivāsinīṃ śaśimukhīṃpārśvastha paṃcānanām || 1 || kanakavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(124) atha ripumāriṇīdurgādhyānam (śāradātilake)

tarjanīṃtriśikhaṃdorbhyāṃdhārayaṃtīṃ bhayaṃkarīm || raktāṃdhyātvāravairbiṃbe prajapedayutaṃ manum || 1 ||
mārayedacirādevaripūnbaṃdhusamanvitān || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(125) atha tripurabhairavīdhyānam (śāradātilake)

udyadbhānusahasrakāṃtimaruṇakṣaumāṃśiromālinīṃ raktāliptapayodharāṃ japavaṭīṃvidyāmabhītiṃvaram ||
hastābjairdadhatīṃtriṇetravilasadvaktrāraviṃdaśriyaṃ devīṃ baddhahimāṃśuratnamakuṭāṃvaṃderaviṃdasthatām || 1 || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(126) atha saṃvittripurādhyānam (śāradātilake)

caṃdrāvataṃsakalitāṃśaradiṃdu śubhrāṃpaṃcāśadakṣaramayīṃ hṛdibhāvayet tām ||
śrīpustakaṃ japavaṭīmamṛtāḍhyakuṃbhaṃ vyākhyāṃ ca hastakamalair(-) dadhatīṃtriṇetrām || 1 || śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(127) atha bālātripurasuṃdarīdhyānam (śāradātilake)

sadyassamudyata sahasradivākarābhāṃ vidyākṣasūtravaradābhayahastacihnām ||
netrotpalaistribhiralaṃkṛtapadmavaktrāṃtvāṃhārabhārarucirāṃ tripurebhajaṃti || 1 || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(128) atha nityādevīdhyānam (śāradātilake)

nityāṃbhajebālaśaśāṃkacūḍāṃ pāśāṃkuśau kalpalatāṃkapālam || 
hastairvahaṃtīmaruṇāṃtriṇetrāmāsphālayaṃtīṃkaravallakīṃtām || 1 || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 28>

(129) atha tvaritādevīdhyānam (śāradātilake)

śmāmāṃbarhikalāpaśekharayutāmābaddhaparṇāṃśukāṃguṃjāhāra lasatpayodharayutāmaṣṭāhipānbibhratīm ||
tāṭaṃkāṃgadamekhalāṃguṇaraṇanmaṃjīrabhābhūṣitāṃkairātīṃ varadābhayodyatakarāṃdevīṃtriṇetrāṃbhaje || 1 || śyāmavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(130) atha kālarātridhyānam (nṛsiṃhaprāsāde)

ekaveṇījapākarṇapūrānagnākharāsthitā ||
laṃboṣṭhīkarṇikākarṇītailābhyaktaśarīriṇī || 1 ||
vāmapādollasallohalatākaṃṭakabhūṣaṇā ||
vardhanmūrdhadhvajā kṛṣṇākālarātrirbhayaṃkarī || 2 || kṛṣṇavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(131) atha vāgīśvarīdhyānam (pāṃcarātrekriyāpāde)

śvetapadmāsanārūḍhā śuklavarṇācaturbhujā ||
jaṭāmakuṭa saṃyuktāratnakuṃḍalamaṃḍitā || 1 ||

yajñopavītinīhāramuktābharaṇabhūṣitā ||
dukūlavasanādevī netratrayasamanvitā || 2 ||

sudaṃḍaṃdakṣiṇehaste vāmahaste tu pustakam ||
dakṣiṇecākṣamālāṃ ca kuṃḍikāṃ vāmahastake || 3 ||
vāgīśyākṛtirākhyatā || śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(132) atha dhenuvāgīśvarīdhyānam (āśvalāyanakalpe)

śuddhasphaṭikasaṃkāśāṃ śuklamālyāṃbarāvṛtām ||
aṃkuśenākṣasūtreṇa pāśapustakadhāriṇīm || 1 ||

muktāhāraissamāyuktāṃ devīṃ divyacaturbhujām ||
sitenadarpaṇābhe navastreṇaparibhūṣitām || 2 ||

sustanīṃ vedimadhyāṃtāṃ caṃdrārdhakṛtaśekharām ||
jaṭākalāpasaṃyuktāṃpūrṇacaṃdranibhānanām || 3 ||

trilocanīṃ mahādevīṃ svarṇanūpuradhāriṇīm ||
kaṭakaissvarṇaratnāḍhyairmahāvalayabhūṣitām || 4 ||

keyūrairmekhalādyaiścadyotayaṃtīṃ jagattrayam ||
śabdabrahmamayīṃdhyā yeddhenuvāgīśvarīṃ parām || 5 || śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(133) atha saubhāgyavāgīśvarīdhyānam (śāradātilake)

taruṇaśakalamiṃdorbibhratīṃ śubhrakāṃtiṃkucabharanamitāṃgīṃ sanniṣaṇṇāṃsitābje ||

<p. 29>

nijakarakamalodyallekhinīpustaka śrīssakalavibhavasaṃghaiḥpātuvāgdevatānaḥ || 1 || śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(134) atha padmānāmakalakṣmīdhyānam (pāṃcarātrekriyāpade)

padmāpadmāsanāsīnāpadmābhāpadmavāsinī || 
hemaratnojjvalannakrakuṃḍalaṃ karṇamaṃḍanam || 1 ||

caṃdrabimbāmalamukhīkarṇapūrāyutekṣaṇā ||
sayauvanāsuramyāṃgīkuṃcitabhrūsuvibhramā || 2 ||

raktoṣṭhīpīnagaṃḍācakaṃcukācchāditastanī ||
śirasomaṃḍanaṃ śaṃkhacakrasīmaṃtapadmakam || 3 ||

nāgahastasamaubāhūkeyūrakaṭakojjvalau ||
paṃkajaṃ śrīphalaṃ vāmedakṣiṇebibhratīparā || 4 ||

śobhanāṃbarasaṃpannāvipulaśroṇikā tathā ||
mekhalākaṭisūtrāṃkā lakṣmīlakṣmīvivarddhinī || 5 || padmavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(135) atha catuṣṣaṣṭiyoginīdhyānam (nāmāni ca rudrayāmale)

aṣṭāṣṭakaṃ pravakṣyāmi yoginīnāṃ samāsataḥ ||
ādyaṣṭakaṃsuvarṇābhaṃ triśūlaṃḍamaruṃ tathā || 1 ||

pāśaṃcāsiṃdadhānaṃ taddhyāyet sarvāṃgasuṃdaram ||
atha dvitīyakaṃ dhyāyedakṣamālāmathāṃkuśam || 2 ||

dadhānaṃ pustakaṃvīṇāṃsu śvetaṃmaṇibhūṣaṇam ||
jvālāṃśaktiṃgadāṃkuṃtaṃ dadhānaṃnīlavarṇakam || 3 ||

dhyāyet tṛtīyaṃ śubhadamaṣṭakaṃśubhalakṣaṇam ||
khaḍgaṃkheṭaṃ paṭṭiśaṃ ca dadhānaṃ paraśuṃ tathā || 4 ||

dhūmravarṇaṃ caturthaṃ taddhyāyedaṣṭakamādarāt ||
kuṃtaṃkheṭaṃ ca parighaṃbhiṃḍivālaṃ tathaiva ca || 5 ||

paṃcamāṣṭakametaddhiśvetaṃ syātsumanoharam || 5 ||

pītaṃṣaṣṭhamṛṣīraktamaṣṭamaṃ ca taṭitprabham || 6 ||

kuṃtādikaṃ samaṃproktaṃ ṣaḍārabhyāṣṭamāṃtakam || ||
divyayogāmahāyogā siddhayogāmaheśvarī || 7 ||

piśācinī ḍākinī ca kālarātrīniśācarī ||
kaṃkālī raudravetālīhuṃkārībhuvaneśvarī || 8 ||

ūrdhvakeśīvirūpākṣī śuṣkāṃgīnarabhojinī ||
phaṭkārīvīrabhadrā ca dhūmrākṣīkalahapriyā || 9 ||

raktākṣīrākṣasīghorā viśvarūpābhayaṃkarī ||
kāmākṣīcogracāmuṃḍābhīṣaṇātripurāṃtakā || 10 ||

vīrakaumārikā caṃḍīvārāhīmuṃḍadhāriṇī ||
bhairavīhastinī krodhadurmukhīpretavāhinī || 11 ||

<p. 30>

khaṭvāṃgadīrghalaṃboṣṭhīmālatī maṃtrayoginī ||
asthinīcakriṇīgrāhākaṃkālībhuvaneśvarī || 12 ||

kaṃṭakīkāṭakī śubhrākriyādūtīkarālinī ||
śaṃkhinīpadminīkṣīrāhyasaṃdhā ca prahāriṇī || 13 ||

lakṣmīśca kāmukīlolākākadṛṣṭiradhomukhī ||
dhūrjaṭīmālinīghorākapālīviṣabhojinī || 14 ||

catuṣṣaṣṭissamākhyātā yoginyovarasiddhidāḥ || 64 ||

(136) atha śarīrasthaṣaṭcakradevatādhyānam (vedāṃtayogaśāstrarītyā) 

ādhāre liṃganābhau hṛdayasarasijetālumūle lalāṭe dvepatreṣoḍaśāre dvidaśada śadale dvādaśārdhe catuṣke ||
nāsāṃte phālamadhye ḍaphakaṭhasahite kaṃṭhamadhye svarāṇāṃ haṃkṣaṃ tattvārthayuktaṃ sakaladalagataṃ varṇarūpaṃnamāmi || 1 ||

atha varṇadhyānāni (siddhaśābarataṃtre)

(137) atha akāradhyānam 

ajāmukhīraktavarṇāhaṃsagā dhavalāṃśukā ||
śarāsanaṃ varaṃdakṣedhatte vāmeśarābhayau || 1 || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(138) atha ākāradhyānam

ākārākhyātharvaṇī tu śyāmāśuklāṃbarāṃśugā ||
dhatte khaṭvāṃ ca kheṭaṃ ca krameṇaivavarābhayau || 1 || śyāvarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(139) atha ikāradhyānam

ikārākhyātvilā devī śvetāmattebhagāśubhā ||
caṃdrahāsavarau dakṣe vāmedhattegadābhayau || 1 || śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(140) atha īkāradhyānam

īśvarīsvarṇavarṇābhā vṛṣārūḍhāsitāṃśukā ||
śārikāṃ ca varaṃdakṣe vāmedhatteṃkuśābhayau || 1 || svarṇavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(141) atha ukāradhyānam

ugrādevī hyukārākhyāṣaḍbhujā siṃhagāsitā ||
dakṣeśūlāṃkuśavarānvāme pāśagadābhayān || 1 || śubhravarṇaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 31>

(142) atha ūkāradhyānam

ūkārorjasvalādevīśārdūlavaravāhanā ||
raktācaturbhujā dhattekhaḍgakheṭavarābhayān || 1 || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(143) atha ṛkāradhyānam

ṛtudhāmā(-)ṛkārākhyā raktavarṇāvṛṣasthitā ||
dakṣepāśavaraudhatte tathā vāmeṃkuśābhayau || 1 || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(144) atha ṝkāradhyānam

ṝkārākhyāreṇukeyaṃ ṣaḍāsyāṣaḍbhujāsitā ||
śūlaṃpāśaṃvaraṃ dakṣevāme khaḍgagadābhayān || 1 ||
dadhānāraktasiṃhasthākrūrālokabhayaṃkarī || śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(145) atha ḷkāradhyānam

ḷtaṃbharāḷkārākhyā śyāmāvyāghravarasthitā ||
caturmukhāṣṭahasteyaṃ dhattestrāṇikaraiḥparaiḥ || 1 ||

triśūlapāśaḍamaruvarānvāmakaraistathā ||
khaḍgaṃ kapālamusalābhayānpītāṃbarāśubhā || 2 || śyāmavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(146) atha ḹkāradhyānam

ḹkārā(-)ḹṃjikākhyaiṣā puṣpadaṃtagajasthitā ||
raktādaśabhujārdhena dakṣādikramaśaḥkaraiḥ || 1 ||

triśūlapāśamusalacaṃdrahāsavarāñchubhān ||
vāmaiḥkaraiḥkhaḍgakheṭagadāśaktyabhayāṃstathā || 2 || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(147) atha ekāradhyānam

ekārākhyā revatī syāddaśāsyāruṇḍamālinī ||
raktāviṃśadbhujā siṃhavāhanāphālalocanā || 1 ||

karairdhattecakraśūlapāśakhaḍgakamaṃḍalūn ||
akṣasūtraṃ ca cinmudrāṃbhuśuḍīṃmudgaraṃ varam || 2 ||

vāmedhattekaraiśśaṃkhaṃbhiṃḍīṃdumṛgakheṭakān ||
kapālaṃdahanaṃśoṣaṃdaṃḍaṃ caiva gadābhayau || 3 || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(148) atha aikāradhyānam

aikārākhyāśuṣkapūrvārevatī triśirāhitā || 
mayūragāṣaḍbhujeyaṃ raktakeśaiśca saṃvṛtā || 1 ||

<p. 32>

arddhairdhatte karaiścakraṃ triśūlaṃ ca varaṃtathā ||
vāmaiḥśaṃkhaṃgadāṃgurvīṃkarairdhatte'bhayaṃ tathā || 2 || śubhravarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(149) atha okāradhyānam

okārātvaśvinī devīraktavarṇāṣaḍānanā ||
mayūragārkabāhussyāddhattedakṣeṃkuśaṃśaram || 1 ||

khaḍgaṃpāśaṃ ca cinmudrāṃdaraṃcākekarekṣaṇā ||
vāmeśūlaṃ kārmukaṃ ca kheṭaṃmusalameva ca || 2 ||

pustakaṃcābhayaṃ caiva sarvaśatrubhayaṃkarī || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(150) atha aukāradhyānam

aukārākhyāhyaghoreyaṃ karālīdīrghajihvikā ||
ekavaktrāvakranetrābhrukuṭīkuṭilekṣaṇā || 1 ||

nīlameghanibhāraudrībheruṃḍavaravāhanā ||
ṣaḍbhujārkakarairdhatte śūlaṃkhaḍgaṃvaraṃ tathā || 2 ||

gadākheṭābhayānvāmedadhānā ca mahodarī || śyāmavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(151) atha aṃkāradhyānam

aṃjanābhāṃjanā devī paṃcāsyājaṭilākṛśā ||
mahodarīmahāvyāghravaravāhanamāsthitā || 1 ||

caturbhujāśūlapāśavarābhayakarāmatā || kṛṣṇavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(152) atha aḥkāradhyānam

a(-)ittyākhyātvajādevī triśirāśca trilocanā ||
raktāpītāmbarākrūratarakṣuvaravāhanā || 1 ||

ṣaḍbhujāśūlapaṭṭāsivaradānakarāṃcitā || 
vāmeṃkuśa mahākheṭābhayāndhattekaraiḥkramāt || 2 || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(153) atha kakāradhyānam

bhūtavinyāsinīśubhrāgajārūḍhācaturbhujā ||
triśūlaṃ ca varaṃdakṣe vāmeṃkuśamathābhayam || 1 || śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(154) atha khakāradhyānam

khaṃjarīṭasthitā pītātriśirāśca triśūlinī ||
khākhyākhadyotinīkhaḍgavarābhayakarāmatā || 1 || pītavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 33>

(155) atha gakāradhyānam

gākhyādhūmrācaturvaktrāsiṃhasthāṣṭabhujāśubhā ||
dhūmrābhādakṣiṇe dhatteśūlaṃ cākṣaṃsruvaṃvaram || 1 ||
vāme tu pustakaṃkuṃḍīṃkapālamabhayaṃkramāt || dhūmravarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(156) atha ghakāradhyānam 

kṛṣṇavarṇāgharūpā ca sūkarāsyākṛśodarī ||
ṣaḍbhujāśūlakhaṭvāṃgavarān dakṣabhujaiḥ kramāt || 1 ||
vāme khaḍgaṃ tathā kheṭamabhayaṃśatrubhaṃjanī || kṛṣṇavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(157) atha ṅakāradhyānam

anaṃtaśaktirdeveśīraktābarhiṇavāhanā ||
ṣaḍānaneṣu cāpāsikheṭadānābhayānvitā || 1 || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(158) atha cakāradhyānam

suṣumā caikavaktraiṣā hayārūḍhācaturbhujā ||
khaḍgakheṭadharācākhyāvarābhayakarāśubhā || 1 || svarṇavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(159) atha chakāradhyānam

chonirjharāruṃdhatīyaṃ pītāmarkaṭavāhanā ||
triśūlaṃ kṣurikāṃpāśaṃkheṭaṃ ca dadhatīśubhā || 1 || pītavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(160) atha jakāradhyānam

jobhogadāhiraktāsyā triṇetrāsiṃhavāhanā ||
caturbhujākhaḍgakheṭavarābhayakarānvitā || 1 || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(161) atha jhakāradhyānam

jhonirjharanadīdevī śaranmeghanibhāṃbujā ||
pāśaṃvarābhayau dhattenakrasthāśubhadānṛṇām || 1 || śubhravarṇaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 34>

(162) atha ñakāradhyānam

ñākhyāprabodhinī śubhrāsiṃhasthā citsvarūpiṇī ||
triśūlāṃbujacinmudrābhayānvitakarāśubhā || 1 || śubhravarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(163) atha ṭakāradhyānam

ṭākhyā ca dhāraṇī devīśūlaṭaṃkavarābhayān ||
dhattemattamataṃgasthā pāṭalābhāsitāṃśukā || 1 || pāṭalavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(164) atha ṭhakāradhyānam

kriyā sarasvatīṭhākhyāṭaṃkāṃkuśavarābhayān ||
dhatte siṃhavarārūḍhā caika vaktrāruṇāmatā || 1 || aruṇavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(165) atha ḍakāradhyānam

ḍakāriṇī paṃcavaktrāsitāṭaṃkagadādharā ||
caturbāhuḥkukkuṭasthāvarābhayakarā ca sā || 1 || śubhravarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(166) atha ḍhakāradhyānam

ḍharūpiṇī śrīghanākhyā paṃcavaktrāmayūragā ||
taṭidgaurīkarairdhatte śūlaṭaṃkavarābhayān || 1 || hemavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(167) atha ṇakāradhyānam

ṇonaṃtaśaktirdeveśī raktābarhiṇavāhanā || 
ekavaktrāśūlaśaktivarābhayakarāśubhā || 1 || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(168) atha takāradhyānam

tākhyā sarasvatīśubhrāsita padmāsanāṃśukā ||
ekavaktrākarairdhatte vīṇātaṃ trīvarābhayān || 1 || śubhravarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(169) atha thakāradhyānam

paṃcavaktrāsitā thākhyānīlakaṃṭhā sarasvatī ||
śārikāṃḍamaruṃdhatte vṛṣārūḍhāvarābhayau || 1 || śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 35>

(170) atha dakāradhyānam

ekavaktrāruṇādākhyāṣṭabhujā bhogadāyinī ||
dhattebjaṃ śārikāvīṇāṃḍamarveṇa varābhayān || 1 || aruṇavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(171) atha dhakāradhyānam

śyāmalācāmalādhākhyā hyekavaktrā caturbhujā ||
vṛṣasthā śārikāmabjaṃkarairdhatte varābhayau || 1 || śyāmavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(172) atha nakāradhyānam

nonaṃtaśaktirdeveśīmattamātaṃgasaṃsthitā || 
ekavaktrātaṭidgairīdhatte padmavarābhayān || 1 || hemavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(173) atha pakāradhyānam

pākhyecchā śaktirūpeyaṃ śūlaśaktivarābhayān ||
dhattekaraiḥ paṃcavaktrāphullapadmāsanāruṇā || 1 || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(174) atha phakāradhyānam

paṃcavaktrograsiṃhasthā pāṭalātapakomalā ||
phākhyāśukaiṇāsikheṭavarābhayadharāśarān || 1 ||

pāśaṃcaḍamṛgaṃdhatte krameṇadaśabhiḥkaraiḥ || pāṭalavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(175) atha bakāradhyānam

cicchayāmalābabhruvarṇā siṃhārūḍhābarūpiṇī ||
dhattekrameṇadaśabhiḥkaraiḥ pūrvavadāyudhān || 1 || babhruvarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(176) atha bhakāradhyānam

bhākhyā tu śyāmalā caika vaktrābhadrāsane sthitā ||
udyadravinibhādhatteśaracāpavarābhayān || 1 || siṃdūravarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(177) atha makāradhyānam

movidyāśyāmalādevī hayāsyāsphaṭikaprabhā ||
vīṇāvādana tattvajñāvarābhayakarāśubhā || 1 || śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 36>

(178) atha yakāradhyānam

yākhyeyaṃ dīpinī devī siṃhasthāṣṭabhujāsitā ||
śūlacāpeṣu pāśāsikheṭadānābhayānvitā || 1 || śubhravarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(179) atha rephadhyānam 

rephākhyārecikā śyāmāsiṃhasthā lohitāṃśukā ||
paṃcāsyāṣṭakarairdhatte dakṣavāmakrameṇa sā || 1 || khaḍgakheṭāṃkuśagadāpāśaśūlavarābhayān || śyāmavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(180) atha lakāradhyānam

lātmikā mohinīdevī svarṇābhāgajasaṃsthitā ||
ṣaḍbhujāṃkuśaśūlāsikheṭadānābhayānvitā || 1 || svarṇavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(181) atha vakāradhyānam 

vākhyāpārāyaṇīdevī sphaṭikābhāruṇāṃśukā ||
sphuṭapadmāsanādhatte padmadvayavarābhayān || 1 || śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(182) atha śakāradhyānam 

śākhyāmaṃgalagaurī tu taptajāṃbūnadaprabhā ||
sahasrapadmapīṭhasthā divyābharaṇabhūṣitā || 1 ||
caturbhujākarairdhatte padmadvayavarābhayān || kanakavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(183) atha ṣakāradhyānam 

raktāṣānukriyādevī rājahaṃsavarasthitā ||
pītāṃbarākarairdhatte padmadvayavarābhayān || 1 || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(184) atha sakāradhyānam

siddhakriyāsakārākhyāsitāṃbuja nivāsinī ||
pāṭalābhākarairdhatte cidaṃbujavarābhayān || 1 || pāṭalavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(185) atha hakāradhyānam

ādhyāyinīhakārākhyāmattamātaṃgavāhanā ||
pāṭalābhākarairdhatte cidaṃbujavarābhayān || 1 || pāṭalavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 37>

(186) atha lakāradhyānam

lobaṃdhamocinīdevī svarṇābhāgajasaṃsthitā ||
ṣaḍbhujāṃkuśaśūlāsikheṭadānābhayānvitā || 1 || svarṇavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(187) atha kṣakāradhyānam 

kṣomāyāmālinīdevī paṃcānanavarāsthitā ||
paṃcāsyā pāṭalādhatte khaḍgaśūlavarābhayān || 1 || pāṭalavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

atha praṇavādivarṇadevatādhyānam (pāṃcarātrāgame)

(atra sarvāsāṃ devatānāṃ prādakṣiṇya krameṇāyudhavinyāsaḥ kartavyaḥ)

(188) tatra oṃkārasya 

śrīnārāyaṇodevatā (śeṣasaṃhitāyām) nārāyaṇonīlotpaladalaprabhaḥ paṃkajāṃtaḥ sthitaḥ pītāṃbaraḥ sarvābharaṇabhūṣitaḥ śrībhūbhyāṃsahitaḥ śaṃkhacakragadāpadmadharaḥ || 1 ||

(189) atha akārasya

viṣṇurdevatā (pādmasaṃhitāyām) padmakiṃjalkavarṇaḥ pītāṃbaraḥ sarvābharaṇabhūṣitaḥ gadāpaṃkajaśaṃkhāridharaḥ || 1 ||

(190) atha ākārasya

madhusūdanodevatā (pādmasaṃhitāyām) aruṇapaṃkajavarṇaḥ pītāṃbaraḥ cakraśaṃkhābjagadādharaḥ sarvābharaṇabhūṣitaḥ sthitaḥ || 1 ||

(191) atha ikārasya

trivikramodevatā (pādmasaṃhitāyām) kālānalavarṇaḥ pītavāsāḥ padmadaṃḍāriśaṃkhadharaḥ sarvābharaṇayuktaḥ sthitaḥ || 1 ||

(192) atha īkārasya

vāmanodevatā (pādmasaṃhitāyām) bālārkavarṇaḥ pītavastraḥ śaṃkhacakragadāpadmadharaḥ ābharaṇabhūṣitaḥ sthitaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 38>

(193) atha ukārasya

śrīdharodevatā pītavarṇaḥ pītavastraḥ padmacakragadāśaṃkhadharaḥ bhūṣāyuktaḥ sthitaḥ || 1 ||

(194) atha ūkārasya

hṛṣīkeśodevatā taḍidvarṇaḥ pītavastraḥ gadāripadmaśaṃkhadharaḥ bhūṣāyuktaḥ sthitaḥ || 1 ||

(195) atha ṛkārasya

padmanābhodevatā nīlotpalavarṇaḥ pītavastraḥ śaṃkhacakrapadmagadādharaḥ bhūṣāyuktaḥ sthitaḥ || 1 ||

(196) atha ṝkārasya

dāmodarodevatā japāpuṣpavarṇaḥ padmaśaṃkhagadācakradharaḥ pītavastrābharaṇādiyuktaḥ sthitaḥ || 1 ||

(197) atha ḷkārasya

śaṃbhurdevatā triṇetraḥ aruṇavarṇaḥ jaṭāmakuṭadhārī abhayaparaśumṛgavarahastaḥ vyāghracarmadhārī || 1 ||

(198) atha ḷkārasya

nārāyaṇodevatā asitadyutiḥ śaṃkhapadmagadācakradharaḥ vanamālābharaṇādibhūṣitaḥ pītāṃbaraḥ sthitaḥ || 1 ||  

(199) atha ekārasya

mādhavodevatā dhavalavarṇaḥ pītavastraḥ gadācakraśaṃkhāṃbujadharaḥ bhūṣitaḥ sthitaḥ || 1 ||

(200) atha aikārasya

goviṃdodevatā pāṭalābhaḥ pītavāsāḥ cakradaṃḍābjaśaṃkhadharaḥ sarvābharaṇabhūṣitaḥ sthitaḥ || 1 ||

(201) atha okārasya

vāsudevodevatā ghanaśyāmaḥ pītavastraḥ padmacakraśaṃkhagadādharaḥ bhūṣaṇa bhūṣitaḥ sthitaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 39>

(202) atha aukārasya

saṃkarṣaṇodevatā raktavarṇaḥ pītavastraḥ gadāśaṃkhābjacakradharaḥ bhūṣaṇa bhūṣitaḥ sthitaḥ || 1 ||

(203) atha aṃkārasya

pradyumnodevatā kanatkanakavarṇaḥ cakraśaṃkhagadāpadmadharaḥ bhūṣitaḥ sthitaḥ || 1 ||

(204) atha aḥkārasya 

aniruddhodevatā dūrvādalaśyāmaḥ pītavāsāḥ cakragadāśaṃkhapadmadharaḥ bhūṣaṇa bhūṣitaḥ sthitaḥ || 1 ||

(205) atha kakārasya

vidhirdevatā caturmukhaḥ hemavarṇaḥ varābhayakuṃḍikākṣasūtrakaraḥ mukhyahastayorvarābhayadharaḥ anyayoḥkuṃḍikākṣasūtradharaḥ jaṭāmaṃḍaladharaḥ sukhāsīnaḥ || 1 ||

(206) atha khakārasya

sudarśanodevatā agnijvālāvarṇaḥ ṣaṭkoṇasaṃsthaḥ śaṃkhacakracāpaparaśvasīṣuśūlapāśāṃkuśābja vajrakheṭahalamusalagadā kuṃtāyudhadharaḥ sarvābharaṇabhūṣitaḥ jvālākeśaḥ sthitaḥ || 1 ||

(207) atha gakārasya

vāṇīdevatā sphaṭikavarṇā akṣamālāpadmaśukapustakadharā prādakṣiṇyena sarvālaṃkārabhūṣitā || 1 ||

(208) atha ghakārasya

śārṅgadhārīdevatā hemanibhaḥ narākṛtiḥ dakṣiṇahaste tarjanīmudrānvitaḥ vāmahastenakaṭimavalaṃbya sthitaḥ svacihnāṃkitamastakaḥ sthitaḥ || 1 ||

(209) atha ṅakārasya

naṃdakodevatā dūrvādalaśyāmaḥ narākṛtiḥ dakṣiṇahaste tarjanīmudrānvitaḥ kaṭivinyastavāmahastaḥ svacihnāṃkitamastakaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 40>

(210) atha cakārasya

naṃdakodevatā śeṣaṃ pūrvavat || 1 ||

(211) atha chakārasya

yamodevatā kālavarṇaḥ abhayadaṃḍapāśavarahastaḥ mahiṣārūḍhaḥ karālavadanaḥ || 1 ||

(212) atha jakārasya 

musalīdevatā sasyaśyāmaḥ narākṛtiḥ dakṣiṇahaste tarjanīmudrānvitaḥ kaṭivinyastavāmahastaḥ mastake svahnāṃkitaḥ sarvābharaṇabhūṣitaḥ || 1 ||

(213) atha jhakārasya

aṃkuśadhārīdevatā hemavarṇaḥ narākṛtiḥ dakṣiṇahaste tarjanīmudrānvitaḥ kaṭivinyastavāmahastaḥ svacihnāṃkitamastakaḥ sarvābharaṇabhūṣitaḥ || 1 ||

(214) atha ñakārasya

bhṛgurdevatā dūrvādalaśyāmaḥ dakṣiṇahaste vijñānamudrāṃ vāme pustakaṃ ca dadhānaḥ upavītajaṭādibhiryuktaḥ || 1 ||

(215) atha ṭakārasya

kūrmodevatā kāṃcanasannibhaḥ abhayacakraśaṃkhavaradahastaḥ pītāṃbaradharaḥ sarvālaṃkārabhūṣitaḥ || 1 ||

(216) atha ṭhakārasya

paṭṭābhirāmodevatā śyāmavarṇaḥ pīṭhe madhyesukhāsīnaḥ tadvāme hemavarṇāsītāpurataḥ kanakavarṇo hanumān paścime hemavarṇolakṣmaṇaḥ pārśvayoḥ śyāmavarṇo bharataḥ raktavarṇaḥ śatrughnaśca vāyavye hemapiṅgalaḥ sugrīvaḥ kālavarṇovibhīṣaṇaḥ raktavarṇoṃgadaḥ kanakavarṇo jāṃbabān etaiḥ parivṛtaḥ sarvālaṃkārabhūṣitaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 41>

(217) atha ḍakārasya

garuḍodevatā kāṃcanaprabhaḥ kuṃcitadakṣiṇapādaḥ pṛṣṭhenikṣipta vāmapādaḥ prasāritobhayapakṣaḥ hṛdibaddhāṃjalipuṭaḥ nānābharaṇabhuṣitaḥ || 1 ||

(218) atha ḍhakārasya

saptamātṛkādevatāḥ tatra brāhmīhemavarṇā abhayaśūlākṣamālāvarahastā jaṭāmakuṭadhāriṇī haṃsadhvajavāhanā sarvālaṃkārabhūṣitā || 1 ||

māheśvarī raktābhā abhayaśūlākṣamālāvarahastā jaṭāmakuṭadhāriṇā vṛṣabhadhvajavāhanā || 2 ||

kaumārī aruṇaprabhā abhayaśaktikukkuṭavarahastā mayūradhvajavāhanā sarvālaṃkārabhūṣitā || 3 ||

vaiṣṇavī śyāmā abhayaśaṃkhacakravarahastāgaruḍadhvajavāhanā sarvālaṃkārabhūṣitā || 4 ||

vārāhī śyāmavarṇā varāhamukhī aṣṭabhujā dakṣiṇāditaḥ abhayamusalakhaḍgacakraśaṃkhakheṭahalavaradharā siṃhārūḍhā sarvālaṃkārabhūṣitā || 5 ||

māheṃdrī raktavarṇā caturbhujā abhayaśaktivajravarahastā gajadhvajavāhanā sarvālaṃkārabhūṣitā || 6 ||

cāmuṃḍā raktavarṇā caturbhujā abhayakapālaśūlavarahastā vyāghracarmāṃbaradharā sarvālaṃkārabhūṣitā || 7 ||

(219) atha ṇakārasya

viṣṇurdevatā padmakiṃjalkanibhaḥ caturbhujaḥ padmagadācakraśaṃkhadharaḥ pītāṃbaraḥ sarvālaṃkārabhūṣitaḥ sthitaḥ || 1 ||

(220) atha takārasya

acyutodevatā pītavarṇaḥ caturbhujaḥ śaṃkhapadmacakragadādharaḥ śrībhūsahitaḥ sarvālaṃkārabhūṣitaḥ || 1 ||

(221) atha thakārasya

puruṣottamodevatā cakrapadmaśaṃkhagadādharaḥ caturbhujaḥ sphaṭikavarṇaḥ sarvālaṃkārabhūṣitaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 42>

(222) atha dakārasya

atrirdevatā aruṇaprabhaḥ jaṭāvān āsīnaḥ dakṣiṇe jñānamudrāṃ vāme pustakaṃ ca dadhānaḥ sarvālaṃkārabhūṣitaḥ || 1 ||

(223) atha dhakārasya

kuberodevatā sitaprabhaḥ dvibhujaḥ padmakhalīnahastaḥ turaṃgārūḍhaḥ sarvābharaṇabhūṣitaḥ || 1 ||

(224) atha nakārasya

laṃbodarodevatā aruṇaprabhaḥ caturbhujaḥ bhagnadaṃtapāśāṃkuśamahāphalahastaḥ gajavaktraḥ sarvābharaṇabhūṣitaḥ || 37 ||

(225) atha pakārasya 

yoganṛsiṃhodevatā hemanibhaḥ jānūpariprasāritamukhyabāhudvayaḥ itarābhyāṃ cakraśaṃkhadharaḥ sarvālaṃkārabhūṣitaḥ || 1 ||

(226) atha phakārasya

bhīmanṛharirdevatā taptakāṃcanasannibhaḥ caturbhirbāhubhiścatuścakrāṇi dadhānaḥ jvālākeśadharaḥ daṃṣṭrākarālavadanaḥ sarvālaṃkārabhūṣitaḥ || 1 ||

(227) atha bakārasya

balarāmodevatā sitaprabhaḥ dvibhujaḥ dakṣiṇehaladharaḥ pralaṃbavāmahastaḥ nīlāṃbaradharaḥ sarvālaṃkārabhūṣitaḥ || 1 ||

(228) atha bhakārasya

pūrvoktayoganṛsiṃhodevatā anyatsarvaṃ pakāravat || 1 ||

(229) atha makārasya

nārāyaṇodevatā śyāmavarṇaḥ padmāsanasthaḥ caturbhujaḥ śaṃkhacakragadāpadmadharaḥ śrībhūbhyāṃsahitaḥ sarvābharaṇabhūṣitaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 43>

(230) atha yakārasya 

vāyurdevatā dhūmravarṇaḥ dvibhujaḥ aṃkuśadhvajahastaḥ hariṇārūḍhaḥ sarvābharaṇabhūṣitaḥ || 1 ||

(231) atha rephasya

dhūmadhvajodevatā aruṇavarṇaḥ dakṣiṇe caturhastaḥ vāmetrihastaḥ prādakṣiṇyena sruksruvākṣamālāśaktitomaravyajanaghṛtapātradharaḥ tripād dviśīrṣaḥ sarvālaṃkārabhūṣitaḥ || 1 ||

(232) atha lakārasya

iṃdrodevatā meghaśyāmaḥ caturbhujaḥ abhayavajraśaṃkhavarahastaḥ gajārūḍhaḥ sarvālaṃkārabhūṣitaḥ || 1 ||

(233) atha vakārasya

varuṇodevatā śyāmalaḥ dvibhujaḥ makaravāhanārūḍhaḥ dakṣiṇe pāśahastaḥ vāme'bhayapradaḥ sarvālaṃkārabhūṣitaḥ || 1 ||

(234) atha śakārasya

umādevatā śyāmavarṇā dvibhujā dakṣiṇe padmadharā pralaṃbavāmahastā caṃdrakalāvataṃ sā sarvālaṃkārabhūṣitā || 1 ||

(235) atha ṣakārasya

lakṣmīrdevatā kāṃcanaprabhā padmāsanāsīnā caturbhujā abhayapadmadvayavarahastā gajadvayasamuddhṛtakuṃbhāmṛtābhiṣiktā sarvābharaṇabhūṣitā || 1 ||

(236) atha sakārasya

candrodevatā sphaṭikasannibhaḥ siṃhāsanesamāsīnaḥ dvibhujaḥ kumudadvayadhārī śyāmayā dhṛtakumudayā rohiṇyā sahitaḥ sarvālaṃkārabhūṣitaḥ || 1 ||

(237) atha hakārasya

sūryodevatā raktavarṇaḥ prabhāmaṃḍalamadhye'ṣṭadalapadma āsīnaḥ dvibhujaḥ padmadvayadharaḥ sarvālaṃkārabhūṣitaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 44>

(238) atha lakārasya 

sūryodevatā anyatsarvaṃ pūrvavat || 1 ||

(239) atha kṣakārasya

pūrvoktabhīma nṛsiṃhodevatā anyatsarvaṃ pūrvavat || 1 ||

[itiśrīmatsamastabhūmaṃḍalamaṃḍanāyamānanikhiladeśāvataṃ sakarṇāṭaka janapadasaṃpadadhiṣṭhānabhūta śrīmanmahīśūramahāsaṃsthānamadhya dedīpyamānāvikala kalānidhikulakramāgatarājakṣitipālapramukhanikhilanija rājādhirājamahārājacakravartimaṃḍalānubhūtadivyaratnasiṃhāsanārūḍha
śrīmadrājādhirājarājaparameśvaraprauḍhapratāpā pratimavīranarapatibiru deṃteṃbaragaṃḍalokaikavīrayadukulapayaḥ pārāvārakalānidhiśaṃkha cakrāṃkuśakuṭhāramakaramatsyaśarabhasālvagaṃḍabheruṃḍadharaṇīvarāha hanumadgaruḍakaṃṭhīravādyaneka birudāṃkitamahīśūrapuravarādhīśa kṛṣṇarājamahārājaviracite śrītattvanidhyākhyagraṃthe cāmuṃḍādi śaktisvarūpanirūpaṇaṃnāmaprathamonidhiḥ saṃpūrṇaḥ] || 1 ||

śrīcāmuṃḍācaraṇāraviṃdārpaṇamastu ||

|| śubhamastu ||

[iti śrītattvanidhigranthāntarvartī prathamaḥ śaktinidhiḥ sampūrṇaḥ] |

śrīḥ |

atha

[śrītattvanidhau

dvitīyoviṣṇunidhiḥ] |

(1) atha virāṭpuruṣadhyānam (bhāgavate 2 skandhe 1 adhyāye)

pātālametasya hi pādamūlaṃpaṭhaṃti pārṣṇiprapaderasātalam || 
mahātalaṃviśvasṛjassugulphau talātalaṃ vai puruṣasyajaṃghe || 1 ||

dvejānunīsutalaṃ viśvamūrterūrudvayaṃvitalaṃcātalaṃ ca ||
mahītalaṃtajjaghanaṃ mahīpatenabhasthalaṃnābhisarogṛṇaṃti || 2 ||

urasthalaṃ jyotiranīkamasyagrīvāmaharvadanaṃ vaijanosya ||
tapolalāṭaṃvidurādipuṃsassatyaṃ ca śīrṣāṇisahasraśīrṣṇaḥ || 3 ||

iṃdrādayobāhava(-)āhurusrāḥ karṇaudiśaḥ śrotramamuṣyaśabdaḥ ||
nāsatyadasrauparamasyanāse ghrāṇaṃ ca gaṃdhomukhamagniriddhaḥ || 4 ||

dyurakṣiṇī cakṣurabhūtpataṃgaḥ pakṣmāṇiviṣṇorahanī(-)ubhe ca ||
tadbhrūvijṛṃbhaḥ parameṣṭhidhiṣṇyamāposyatālūrasa eva jihvā || 5 ||

chaṃdāṃsyanaṃ tasyavacogṛṇaṃtidaṃṣṭrāryameṃdūḍugaṇādvijāni ||
hāsojanonmādakarī ca māyā duraṃtasargoyadapāṃgamokṣaḥ || 6 ||

vrīḍottaroṣṭhodhara eva lobhodharmastanodharmapathaśca pṛṣṭhaḥ ||
kastasya meḍhraṃ vṛṣaṇau ca mitraḥkukṣissamudrāgirayosthi saṃghāḥ || 7 ||

nadyosya nāḍyothatanūruhāṇi mahīruhāviśvatanornṛpeṃdra ||
annaṃ ca vīryaṃśvasitaṃ mātariśvāgatirvayaḥ karmaguṇapravāhaḥ || 8 ||

īśasya keśānviduraṃbuvāhānvāsastu saṃdhye kuruvaryabhūmnaḥ ||
avyaktamāhurhṛdayaṃ manaśca sa caṃdramāssarvavikārakośaḥ || 9 ||

vijñānaśaktiṃ matimāmanaṃti sarvātmanoṃtaḥ karaṇaṃgiritraḥ ||
aśvāśvataryuṣṭragajānakhāni sarve mṛgāḥ paśavaḥśroṇideśaḥ || 10 ||

vacāṃsitadvyākaraṇaṃ vicitraṃ manurmanīṣāmunayonivāsaḥ ||
gaṃdharvavidyādharacāraṇāpsarassvarāḥ smṛtirhyasurānīkavaryaḥ || 11 ||

<p. 46>

brahmānanaṃkṣatrabhujomahātmāviḍūruraṃghriśritakṛṣṇavarṇaḥ ||
svāhāsvadhāvīryaguṇopapannohavyātmakaḥ karmavitānayogaḥ || 12 ||

iyānasāvīśvaravigrahasya yassanniveśaḥ kathitomayāte ||
saṃdhāryatesmin vapuṣisthaviṣṭhe manassvabuddhyānayato stikiṃcit || 13 || 1 ||

(2) atha mahāvaikuṃṭhamūrtidhyānam (pādmottarakhaṃḍe)

tasminmaṇimayastaṃbhasahasresūryavarcasi ||
vimāneśu śubhedivye saṃsthito bhagavānhariḥ || 1 ||

tatra cādhāraśaktyādidhṛte pīṭhehiraṇmaye ||
nānāratnamaye divye nānāratnasamanvite || 2 ||

tanmadhyeṣṭadale padmemaṃtrākṣaramayeśubhe ||
karṇikāyāṃsuramyāyāṃ lakṣmībīje śubhākṣare || 3 ||

tasminbālārka sāhasrakoṭitulyaprabhānvitaḥ ||
divyonārāyaṇaḥ śrīmānāsīnaḥ paṃkajāsane || 4 ||

tasya dakṣiṇataḥ pārśve jaganmātāhiraṇmayī ||
sarvalakṣaṇasaṃpannādivyābharaṇabhūṣitā || 5 ||

vasupātraṃmātuluṃgaṃ svarṇapadme vahākaraiḥ ||
vāmataḥpṛthivīdevīnīlotpaladalaprabhā || 6 ||

nānālaṃkārasaṃyuktā vicitrāṃbarabhūṣitā ||
vahāsāhyūrdhvabāhubhyāṃ ramyaṃraktotpaladvayam || 7 ||

uttarābhyāṃ tathā devī dhānyapātraṃśukaṃ tathā ||
gṛhītacāmarā divyāśaktayovimalādayaḥ || 8 ||

dalāgreṣu samāsīnāssarvalakṣaṇaśobhitāḥ ||
tāsāṃ madhye samāsīnobhagavānacyutohariḥ || 9 ||

śaṃkhacakragadāpadmapāṇibhirdivyabhūṣaṇaiḥ ||
keyūrāṃgadahārādyairbhūṣaṇairupaśobhitaḥ || 10 ||

prātarudyatsahasrāṃśukuṃḍalābhyāṃ virājitaḥ ||
pūrvoktaistridaśairnityaṃ sevitaḥpuruṣottamaḥ || 11 ||

āste vai kuṃṭhanagare nityamuktaikabhogavān ||
śrīmadaṣṭākṣarairmaṃtraiḥ siddhānāṃ vai manīṣiṇām || 12 ||

gamanaṃ vaiṣṇave lokenetareṣāṃ kathaṃcana || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(3) atha viṣṇudhyānam (pādmapurāṇe)

devadevastu kartavyaḥ śeṣasuptodvibāhukaḥ || ekapādosyakartavyolakṣmyutsaṃgagataḥprabhoḥ || 1 ||

tathā paraśca kartavyaśśeṣabhogāṃkasaṃsthitaḥ ||
ekaḥ karosyakartavyaḥ savyajānauprasāritaḥ || 2 ||

kartavyomūrdhadeśasthastathā tasyāparaḥkaraḥ ||

<p. 47>

nābhīsaṃbhūtakamale sukhāsīnaḥ pitāmahaḥ || 3 ||

nālelagnau tu kartavyaupadmasyamadhukaiṭabhau ||
śaṃkhacakragadādīnimūrtāniparito nyaset || 4 || meghavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(4) atha lakṣmīdhyānam (ratnakośe)

aruṇakamalasaṃsthātadrajaḥ puṃjavarṇākarakamaladhṛteṣṭābhīti yugmāṃbujā ca ||
maṇimukuṭavicitrālaṃkṛtā kalpajātairbhavatu bhuvanamātāsaṃtataṃśrīśśriyainaḥ || 1 || kanakavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(5) atha bhūdevīdhyānam (pāṃcarātre)

svarṇavarṇādvihastā ca dakṣiṇenābhayapradā ||
dāḍimīphalasaṃyuktā vāmekalpataroradhaḥ || 1 ||

vāmapādena saṃspṛṣṭanidhikuṃbhādharāmatā ||
sarvālaṃkārabhūṣāḍhyā dhyeyāsarvaphalapradā || 2 || svarṇavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(6) atha nīlādevīdhyānam (pāṃcarātre)

nīlotpaladalaśyāmānīlavastravibhūṣitā || 
caturbhujāsukhāsīnāvarābhayakarānvitā || 1 ||

itarābhyāṃ tu hastābhyāṃ kumudadvayadhāriṇī ||
sarvābharaṇasaṃyuktā nīlādevīsamīritā || 2 || śyāmavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(7) atha vai kuṃṭhanārāyaṇadhyānam (aṣṭākṣarīkalpe)

savyaṃpādaṃprasārya śritaduritaharaṃ dakṣiṇaṃkuṃcayitvā jānunyādhāya savyetaramitarabhujaṃnāgabhoge nidhāya ||
paścādbāhudvayena pratibhaṭaśamane dhārayañchaṃkha cakredevī bhūṣādijuṣṭo janayati jagatāṃśarmavaikuṃṭhanāthaḥ || 1 || meghavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(8) atha tārakarāmadhyānam (śrīrāmakalpe)

vai dehī sahitaṃ suradrumatalehaime mahāmaṃḍape madhyepuṣpakamāsane maṇimayevīrāsane saṃsthitam ||
agre vācayati prabhaṃjanasute tattvaṃ munibhyaḥ paraṃvyākhyāṃ taṃ bharatādibhiḥ parivṛtaṃ rāmaṃbhajeśyāmalam || 1 || śyāmavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(9) atha śiṃśumāramūrtidhyānam (mayūkhedānakhaṃḍe)

śiṃśumārassphurattārānibha kāṃtiścaturbhujaḥ ||
śaṃkhacakravarābhītilasat pāṇistrayīmayaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 48>

jyotiścakrādhāra pucchaśritadevagaṇojjvalaḥ ||
kālarūpī sadādhyeyobhaktābhīṣṭapradohariḥ || 2 || śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(10) atha trivikramadhyānam (pāṃcarātre maṃtrasārebhāgavate)

trivikramoraktavarṇaśśaṃkhacakragadābjabhṛt ||
kirīṭahārakeyūrakuṃḍalaiśca virājate || 1 ||

sphuratkirīṭāṃgadamīnakuṃḍalaśrīvatsaratnottamamekhalāṃbaraiḥ ||
madhuvratasragvanamālayāvṛtorarājarājanbhagavānurukramaḥ || 2 ||

kṣitiṃ padaikena balervicakramenabhaśśarīreṇadiśaśca bāhubhiḥ ||
padaṃdvitīyātkramatastriviṣṭapaṃnavai tṛtīyasyatadīyamaṇvapi || 3 ||

urukramasyāṃghriruparyadhodivomaharjanābhyāṃtapasaḥ paraṃgataḥ || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(11) atha hayagrīvadhyānam (pāṃcarātre)

vaṃde tu raṃgavadanaṃśaśibiṃbasaṃsthaṃ caṃdrāvadātamamṛtātma karaissamaṃtāt ||
aṃḍāṃtaraṃbahirapi pratibhāsayaṃtaṃ śaṃkhākṣapustakasubodhayutābjabāhum || 1 ||

śvetavarṇaḥ || prakārāntareṇa (vedāṃtācāryakṛtahayagrīvastutau) vyākhyāmudrāṃkarasarasijaiḥ pustakaṃśaṃkhacakre bibhradbhinnasphaṭikarucire puṃḍarīkeniṣaṇṇaḥ | 
amlānaśrīramṛtaviśadairaṃśubhiḥ plāvayanmāmāvirbhūyādanaghamahi māmānasevāgadhīśaḥ || 1 || śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(12) atha bhūvarāhamūrtidhyānam (pāṃcarātre)

śyāmassudarśanadarābhayasadvareto bhūmyāyutokhilanijoktaparigrahaiśca ||
dhyeyonijaiśca tanubhissakalairupetaḥ koloharissakalavāṃchitasiddhayenaḥ || 1 || śyāmavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(13) atha dharaṇīvarāhamūrtidhyānam (hemādraudānakāṃḍe)

varāharūpaḥ kāryastu śeṣoparigataḥ prabhuḥ ||
śeṣaścaturbhujaḥ kāryaścāruratnaphaṇānvitaḥ || 1 ||

kartavyausīramusalaukarayostasyayādava ||
sarparūpaśca kartavyastathaiva racitāṃjaliḥ || 2 ||

ālīḍhasthāna saṃsthānastatpṛṣṭhe bhagavānbhavet ||
vāmāratnigatā tasya yoṣidrūpāvasuṃdharā || 3 ||

namaskāraparā tasya kartavyādvibhujāśubhā ||
yasminbhujedharādevī tatra śaṃkhaḥkarebhavet || 4 ||

<p. 49>

anye tasya karāḥ kāryāḥ padmacakragadādharāḥ ||
padmāsanasthāṃ kurvītaśriyantrailokyamātaram || 5 ||

gauravarṇāṃsurūpāṃ ca sarvālaṃkārabhūṣitām ||
raukmapadmakaravyagrāṃvaradāṃ dakṣiṇena tu || 6 ||

varāhaḥ śyāmavarṇaḥ || bhūmiśśuklavarṇā || śrīssuvarṇavarṇā || śeṣaśśubhravarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(14) śrīkaramūrtidhyānam (pāṃcarātre)

ādityacaṃdrāvapi śaṃkhacakre śaṃkhaprasūnākhyanidhīdadhānaḥ || 
ciṃtyaḥkarābhyāṃ vasutarpayansasvāṃkastha lakṣmīrgaruḍāṃsasaṃsthaḥ || 1 || kāṃcanavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(15) atha haṃsamūrtidhyānam (pāṃcarātre maṃtrasāre)

dhyāyedravīṃdukaramiṃdu sahasralakṣakāṃtiṃ priyāsahitamāsthitamiṃdubiṃbe ||
śaṃkhāridordvayamudarkamaheṃdubiṃbātsaṃsicyamānamamṛtenaramādhinātham || 1 || śuklavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(16) atha dadhivāmanamūrtidhyānam (pāṃcarātre)

dhyāyetsuśuklamaraviṃdadalāyatākṣaṃsauvarṇapātradadhibhojyamathāmṛtaṃ ca ||
dorbhyāṃdadhānamakhilaiśca suraissametaṃ śītāṃśumaṃḍalagataṃ ramayāsametam || 1 || śuklavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(17) atha aśvatthanārāyaṇadhyānam (brahmāṃḍapurāṇe aśvatthakalpe)

śvetavarṇaṃsalakṣmīkaṃbhujāṣṭakavibhūṣitam ||
śaṃkhacakradharaṃdevaṃ pītavāsasamacyutam || 1 ||

abhayaṃvaradaṃśāṃtaṃ khaḍgakheṭakadhāriṇam ||
dhanurbāṇasamāyuktaṃ ciṃtayet puruṣottamam || 2 || śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(18) atha lakṣmīnṛsiṃhadhyānam (tanmantradhyāne)

śaraccaṃdranibhaṃdevaṃ śaṃkhacakravarābhayān ||
bibhrāṇaṃpuṃḍarīkākṣaṃlakṣmyāliṃgitavigraham || 1 ||

siṃhavaktraṃmahākāyaṃ nṛsiṃhaṃhṛdibhāvayet || śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 50>

atha keśavādicaturviṃśatimūrtīnāṃlakṣaṇāni (pāṃcarātrekriyāpāde)

(19) tatra keśavadhyānam 

keśavastusuvarṇābhaśśaṃkhacakragadābjabhṛt ||
śuklāṃbaradharassaumyomuktābharaṇabhūṣitaḥ || 1 ||

dakṣiṇordhvakareśaṃkhaḥ vāmoccakarecakraṃ vāmādhaḥ karegadā dakṣādhaḥkarepadmaṃ śuklāṃbaraḥ muktābharaṇaḥ kāryaḥ || svarṇavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(20) atha nārāyaṇadhyānam 

nārāyaṇoghanaśyāmaḥ padmaśaṃkhagadāribhṛt ||
pītavāsāmaṇimayairbhūṣaṇairuttamairvṛtaḥ || 1 ||

dakṣiṇādhaḥkareśaṃkhaḥ dakṣordhvakarepadmaṃ vāmoccakare gadā vāmādhaḥkarecakram || meghaśyāmavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(21) atha mādhavadhyānam

mādhavastūtpalaprakhyaścakraśaṃkhagadābjabhṛt ||
citramālyāṃbaradharaḥ puṃḍarīkanibhekṣaṇaḥ || 1 ||

vāmordhvakareśaṃkhaḥ vāmādhaḥkarepadmaṃ dakṣordhvakarecakraṃ dakṣādhaḥkaregadā || kṛṣṇavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(22) atha goviṃdadhyānam

goviṃdaśśaśivarṇaḥ syātpadmaśaṃkhagadāribhṛt ||
raktāraviṃdanayanastaptakāṃcanabhūṣaṇaḥ || 1 ||

vāmādhaḥkareśaṃkhaḥ dakṣādhaḥkarecakraṃ dakṣordhvakare gadā vāmoccakarepadmam || śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(23) atha viṣṇudhyānam

dhautavarṇobhavedviṣṇuścakraśaṃkhagadābjabhṛt ||
hemāṃbaradharassragvīkeyūrāṃgadabhūṣitaḥ || 1 ||

vāmordhvakareśaṃkhaḥ vāmādhaḥkarecakraṃ dakṣādhaḥkaregadā dakṣordhvakarepadmam || śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(24) atha madhusūdanadhyānam

araviṃdanibhaśśrīmānmadhujitkamalāśrayaḥ ||
śaṃkhaṃcakraṃgadāṃpadmaṃdorbhirnityaṃbibhartyasau || 1 ||

dakṣordhvakareśaṃkhaḥ vāmoccakarepadmaṃ vāmādhaḥ karegadā dakṣādhaḥkarecakram || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 51>

(25) atha trivikramadhyānam

trivikramoraktavarṇaḥ śaṃkhacakragadābjabhṛt ||
kirīṭahārakeyūrakuṃḍalaiśca virājate || 1 ||
vāmādhaḥkareśaṃkhaḥ dakṣādhaḥkare padmaṃ dakṣodhrvakare gadā vāmordhvakare cakram || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(26) atha vāmanadhyānam

vāmanaḥ kuṃdavarṇassyāt puṃḍarīkāyate kṣaṇaḥ ||
dorbhiśśaṃkhaṃgadāṃ cakraṃ padmaṃ caiva bibhartyasau || 1 || 
dakṣādhaḥkare śaṃkhaḥ dakṣoccakare cakraṃ vamoccakare gadā  vāmādhaḥkare padmam || śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(27) atha śrīdharadhyānam 

śrīdharaḥ puṃḍarīkābhaḥcakraśaṃkhagadābjabhṛt | raktāraviṃdanayanomuktādāmavibhūṣitaḥ || 1 ||
vāmādhaḥkareśaṃkhaḥ dakṣādhaḥkarepadmaṃ dakṣodhrvakarecakraṃ vāmoccakaregadā || śvetavarṇaḥ ||

(28) atha hṛṣīkeśadhyānam

vidyudvarṇohṛṣīkeśaścakraśaṃkhagadābjabṛt || raktamālyāṃbaradharaḥpuṃḍarīkāvataṃsakaḥ || 1 || 
vāmādhaḥkareśaṃkhaḥ dakṣādhaḥkaregadā dakṣodhrvakarecakraṃ vāmordhvakarepadmam || kanakavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(29) atha padmanābhadhyānam

iṃdranīlanibhaścakraśaṃkhapadmagadādharaḥ || pdmanābhaḥpītavāsāścitramālyānulepanaḥ || 1 || 
dakṣādhaḥkareśaṃkhaḥ dakṣodhrvakarepadmaṃ vāmordhvakarecakraṃ vāmādhaḥkaregadā || nīlavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(30) atha dāmodaradhyānam

dāmodaraśśādvalābhogadāpadmāriśaṃkhabhṛt || pītavāsāviśālākṣonānāratnavibhūṣitaḥ || 1 ||
dakṣodhrvakareśaṃkhaḥ vāmordhvakaregadā vāmādhaḥ karecakraṃ dakṣādhaḥkarepadmam || dūrvāśyāmavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(31) atha saṃkarṣaṇadhyānam

saṃkarṣaṇassitodhatte śaṃkhapadmārisadgadāḥ || dakṣodhrvakareśaṃkhaḥ vāmoccakarepadmaṃ vāmādhaḥkarecakraṃ dakṣādhaḥkaregadhā || śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 52>

(32) atha vāsudevadhyānam

vāsudevaśśaṃkhacakragadāpadmadharassitaḥ ||
dakṣodhrvakareśaṃkhaḥ vāmordhvakarecakraṃ vāmādhaḥkarepadmaṃ dakṣādhaḥkaregadā || śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(33) atha pradyumnadhyānam

pradyumnaḥkanakābhassyācchaṃkhābajārigadādharaḥ ||
dakṣodhrvakareśaṃkhaḥ vāmordhvakaregadā vāmādhaḥkarepadmaṃ dakṣādhaḥkarecakram || kanakavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(34) atha aniruddhadhyānam

aniruddhonīlavarṇaḥ śaṃkhapadmagadāribhṛt || vāmordhvakareśaṃkhaḥ vāmādhaḥkarepadmaṃ dakṣādhaḥkarecakraṃ dakṣocca karegadā || nīlavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(35) atha puruṣottamadhyānam

padmaśaṃkhagadācakrabhṛcchvetaḥ puruṣottamaḥ ||
vāmordhvakareśaṃkhaḥ vāmādhaḥkaregadā dakṣādhaḥcakraṃ dakṣoccakarepadmam || śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(36) atha adhokṣajadhyānam

dhattecādhokṣajonīlaṃgadā cakradarābjakam ||
vāmordhvakare śaṃkhaḥ vāmādhaḥkarecakraṃ dakṣādhaḥkarepadmaṃ dakṣodhrvakaregadā || nīlavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(37) atha nārasiṃhadhyānam

nārasiṃhaśśvetavarṇaḥgadā śaṃkhāripadmabhṛt ||
vāmādhaḥkare śaṃkhaḥ dakṣādhaḥkarecakraṃ dakṣordhvakarepadmaṃ vāmordhvakaregadā || śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(38) atha acyutadhyānam

dhattecyutaḥ svarṇavarṇaḥ gadāśaṃkhārisārasān ||
vāmādhaḥkare śaṃkhaḥ dakṣādhaḥkaregadā dakṣordhvakarepadmaṃ vāmoccakare cakram || kanakavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(39) atha janārdanadhyānam

janārdanoraktavarṇaścakra śaṃkhagadābjabhṛt ||
vāmordhvakareśaṃkhaḥ vāmādhaḥkaregadā dakṣādhaḥkarepadmaṃ dakṣodhrvakarecakram || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 53>

(40) atha upeṃdradhyānam

upeṃdronīlavarṇastu gadācakrābjaśaṃkhabhṛt ||
dakṣādhaḥkareśaṃkhaḥ dakṣodhrvakaregadā vāmoccakarecakraṃ vāmādhaḥkarepadmam || nīlavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(41) atha haridhyānam

hariḥkanakavarṇassyāccakra śaṃkhagadābjabhṛt ||
dakṣādhaḥkareśaṃkhaḥ dakṣordhvakarecakraṃ vāmoccakarepadmaṃ vāmādhaḥkaregadā || kanakavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(42) atha kṛṣṇadhyānam

kṛṣṇastu kṛṣṇavarṇassyādgadābjadaracakrabhṛt ||
dakṣādhaḥkareśaṃkhaḥ dakṣordhvakaregadā vāmoccakarepadmaṃ vāmādhaḥkarecakram || kṛṣṇavarṇaḥ || 1 || 24)

keśavādīnāṃvarṇāḥ (padmapurāṇe)

keśavaḥ kanakaprakhyaḥ syādarjunasamācchaviḥ ||
nārāyaṇaśśyāmavarṇomādhavaḥ sphaṭikaprabhaḥ || 1 || 

goviṃdaḥ padmakiṃjalkanibhoviṣṇurudāhṛtaḥ ||
aruṇāṃbujasaṃkāśomadhusūdana ucyate || 2 ||

trivikramaśśikhinibho vāmanobālasūryavat ||
śrīdharaḥpītavarṇābho hṛṣīkeśastaṭitprabhaḥ || 3 || 

padmanābhaśśyāmavarṇo baṃdhūkakusumacchaviḥ || 
dāmodarodvādaśaite kathitāḥ keśavādayaḥ || 4 || 

vāsudevādimūrtīnāṃ yovarṇaḥ parikīrtitaḥ ||
sa eva vāsudevādicaturṇāṃ tadbhuvāmapi || 5 || 

śuddhasphaṭikaśaṃkāśovijñeyaḥ puruṣottamaḥ || adhokṣajaśśyāmavarṇonṛsiṃhohemasannibhaḥ || 6 || 

pītavarṇocyutotīvaraktavarṇo janārdanaḥ ||
upeṃdraśśyāmalaḥ proktohariḥ pītanibhaḥ smṛtaḥ || 7 || 

kṛṣṇaḥ kṛṣnāṃbudaprakhyaścaturviṃśatimūrtayaḥ ||

atha vyūhacatuṣṭayamūrtidhyānam (bhaṭṭabhāskarīye)

(43) tatra saṃkarṣaṇadhyānam

vāsudeva svarūpeṇa kāryassaṃkarṣanaḥ prabhuḥ ||
satuśuklavapuḥ kāryonīlavāsāyadūttamaḥ || 1 ||

gadāsthāne ca musalaṃcakrasthāne calāṃgalam || śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 54>

(44) atha vāsudevadhyānam

vāsudevassitaśśāṃtassitābjasthaścaturbhujaḥ ||
yogamūrdhordhrva śaṃkhaśca dakṣeśārṅgadharassmṛtaḥ || 1 || 
dhārayeduttare cakra dakṣiṇe ca gadāmiti || śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(45) atha pradyumnadhyānam

dakṣiṇordhvakare padmaṃdadyācchaṃkhagadhaḥkare ||
cakramūrdhve tathā vāme gadāṃdadyādadhaḥkare || 1 || pītavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(46) athāniruddhadhyānam

kṛṣṇaṃ caturbhujaṃdakṣeśaraṃ  khaḍgaṃ tathottare ||
dhanuḥ kheṭadharaṃ vīramaniruddhaṃ pracakṣate || 1 || kṛṣṇavarṇaḥ || 1 || 4 ||

atha matsyādidaśāvatāra mūrtīnāṃdhyānam (pāṃcarātre) (varṇastupādme)

(47) tatra matsyadhyānam

vāme śaṃkhaṃgadāṃdakṣe dvibhujomatsyarūpadhṛk ||
narāṃghrirmatsyarūpo vā matsyarūpījanārdanaḥ || 1 || śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(48) atha kūrmadhyānam

kūrmastu kacchapākāromatsyarūpoktarūpavān || svarṇavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(49) atha varāhadhyānam

madhupiṃgalavarṇaṃ ca caturbāhvāyudhairvṛtam ||
narāṃgaṃsūkarāsyaṃ ca manākpīnaṃsubhīṣaṇam || 1 || 

śrīrvāmakūrparasthācadharānaṃtaupadānugau ||
etadrūpadharaṃ vaṃdevarāhaṃ bhuktimuktidam || 2 || śyāmavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(50) atha nṛsiṃhadhyānam

jvaladagni samākāraṃ siṃhavaktraṃnarāṃgakam ||
daṃṣṭrākarālavadanaṃ lolajihvāsubhīṣaṇam || 1 ||

vṛttāsyaṃjaṭilaṃ kruddhamālīḍhaṃpīnavakṣasam ||
abhedyatīkṣṇanakharamātmoru kṛtadānavam || 2 ||

tadvakṣodārayaṃtaṃ ca karābhyāṃnakharairbhṛśam ||
gadācakradharaṃ dvābhyāṃnṛsiṃhaṃ praṇametprabhum || 3 || śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 55>

(51) atha vāmanadhyānam

kuṃḍīcchatradharodvābhyāṃ vāmanaḥ parikīrtitaḥ || 1 || śyāmavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(52) atha paraśurāmadhyānam

kṣatrāṃtakāraṇaṃ ghoramudvahan paraśuṃkare ||
jāmadagnyaśva kartavyorāmaśśatruniṣūdanaḥ || 1 || svarṇavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(53) atha śrīrāmadhyānam

yuvāprasannavadanassiṃha skaṃdhoruṇekṣaṇaḥ || 
ājānubāhuḥkartavyorāmo bāṇadhanurdharaḥ || 1 || śyāmavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(54) atha balarāmadhyānam

madyapātraṃ ca sīraṃ ca vāmadakṣiṇayoḥ kramāt || 
gadāmusalavajraṃ ca halīrāmaḥ  dadhatsitaḥ || 1 ||
musalarūpaṃvajramityarthaḥ || kṣīravarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(55) atha buddhadhyānam

kāṣāyavastrasaṃvītaḥ  skaṃdhasaṃsaktacīvaraḥ ||
padmāsanasthodvibhujodhyeyo buddhaḥ prakīrtitaḥ || 1 || 
pāṭalavarṇaḥ prasiddhaḥ || 1 ||

(56) atha kalkidhyānam

khaḍgodyatakaraḥ kruddhohayārūḍhomahābalaḥ || 
mlecchacchedakaraḥ kalkīdvibhujaḥ parikīrtitaḥ || 1 || śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(graṃthātare daśāvatāramūrtīnāṃ madhye budhdhasthāne kṛṣṇa iti dṛśyate)

(57) atha kṛṣṇadhyānam (pādme)

śaṃkhacakradharaḥ śyāmodvibhujaḥ kṛṣṇasaṃjñakaḥ || śyāmavarṇaḥ || 11 || 0 ||

matsyādidaśāvatāramūrtīnāṃvarṇāḥ (pādme)

matsyaḥ sphaṭikasaṃkāśaḥ kūrmaḥkāṃcana saprabhaḥ || 
varāhaśśyāmalanibhodhvalākṛtireva vā || 1 ||

nṛsihaścaṃdravarṇābhaḥ prahlādaḥ kāṃcanaprabhḥ ||
vāmanaśśyāmalanibhokālavarṇo mahābalaḥ || 2 ||

jāmadagnyassuvarṇābhorāghavaśśyāmalākratiḥ ||
bharataśśyāmalaḥ proktaḥ lakṣmaṇaḥ kanakaprabhaḥ || 3 || 

śatrughnoraktavarṇābho sītāhemanibhākṛtiḥ ||
<p. 56> māṃḍavīraktavarṇābhācormilāśyāmalākṛtiḥ || 4 || 

śrutakīrtissitāṃgī syāddhanūmānkanakaprabhaḥ || aṃgadoraktavarṇābhassugrīvohemapiṃgalaḥ || 5 ||

nīlotpalanibhaḥproktojāṃbavānkanakaprabhaḥ || 
guhastuti lavarṇābhaḥ kālavarṇovibhīṣaṇaḥ || 6 || 

balaḥkṣīranibhaśvaiva raktavarṇā ca revatī ||
meghaśyāmobhavet kṛṣṇorukmiṇī kanakaprabhā || 7 || 

kalkīśveta nibhaśvaiva varṇā eṣāṃ prakīrtitāḥ ||

(58) atha lakṣmīnārāyaṇadhyānam (bhaṭṭabhāskarīye)

nārāyaṇaścaturbāhuśśaṃkha cakrī tathottare ||
dakṣiṇe tu gadāpadmī nīlajīmūtasannibhaḥ || 1 ||
vāme śrīrvallakī hastāpuṣṭāpadmakarāpare || śyāmavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(59) atha sūryanārāyaṇadhyānam (tryṛcākalpe)

dhyeyassadā savitṛmaṃḍalamadhyavartī nārāyaṇassarasijāsanasanniviṣṭaḥ || keyūravānmakarakuṃḍalavānkirīṭīhārī hiraṇmayavapuḥ dhṛtaśaṃkhacakraḥ || 1 || svarṇavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(60) athāṣṭamukhagaṃḍabheruṃḍa nṛsiṃhadhyānam (atharvaṇarahasye maṃtrasāre)

vaṃdehaṃ krūraghoraprabalataramahāgaṃḍabheruṃḍa siṃhavyāghrāścakroḍaśākhāmṛgavarakhagarāṅbhallukādyaṣṭavaktram | dvātriṃśatkotibāhuṃhalamusalagadā śaṃkhacakrādihetīrvibhrāṇaṃ bhīmadaṣṭraṃśarabhakhagagajānbhakṣayaṃtaṃ nṛsiṃham || 1 || 
śarīre raktavarṇaḥ mukheṣu tattadvarṇāḥ || 1 ||

athavā prakārāntareṇadhyānam (maṃtrasāre)

kalpāṃtāśaniviṣphuliṃgahutabhuṅnīkāśanetratrayaṃkolaṃ
vajrasamānatuṃḍanakharaṃdaṃṣṭridvijihvānanam || 1 || 

ṛkṣaṃmārutasaptimārtiharaṇaṃ cāṣṭānanaṃbhīṣaṇaṃdhyāyedrudramadāṃtakaṃ śarabhahṛdbheruṃḍasiṃhaṃsadā || 2 || aṣṭāsyo vahnidṛṣṭirbhiduravaranakhovidyudujjvālasiṃhohīrābhaudvau ca pakṣau

hṛdayajaṭharagāhyaṣṭakālyaṣṭadurgā || ūrūdvaurudrakālaukhagamṛganṛharirgaṃḍabherūpaḥpāyādasmān sa cakroharirihaśarabhādyugraśatrūnpravidhyan || 3 || 

hastāṃjalyāhṛtātmadviṣadasuravarorojabahvasrapānavyāttāsyaṃdoryugāṃ cannakhadalita mahāśārabhāṃgaṃsubhūṣam ||
bāhudvaṃdvoparuddhāsuraka ca caraṇaṃdoryugodyannakhāgrapracchannārāti dehaṃraviśaśidahanatrīkṣaṇaṃvajrapakṣam || 4 || 

<p. 57>

aṃbhojaṃvītihotraṃkuśaviśikha mahāpāśakuṃtāsi śaktīrāṃtraṃ cakraṃkuṭhoroddhatabhujayugaladveṣidoḥkhaḍgaśaṃkhān || 
hairaṇyāṃtraṃtriśūlaṃ phalakamapi mahāpāśaśīrṣaṃpinākaṃ vajraṃkaumodakīṃ cāpyatibalamasalaṃsaṃdadhānaṃ karāgraiḥ || 5 || 

śarīreraktavarṇaḥ mukheṣu tattadvarṇāḥ || 1 ||


(61) atha paṃcavaktranārasiṃhadhyānam (maṃtrasāre)

paṃcavaktraṃ mahābhīmaṃkālānalasamaprabham ||
muṃḍamālādharaṃraudraṃkaṃṭhahāreṇaśobhitam || 1 || 

nāgayajñopavītāḍhyaṃ paṃcānanasuśobhitam ||
caṃdramauliṃnilakṃṭhaṃ prativaktraṃtrilocanam || 2 || 

bhujaiḥparighasaṃkāśairdaśabhiścopaśobhitam ||
akṣasūtraṃgadāṃpadmaṃśaṃkhaṃgokṣīrasannibham || 3 ||

dhanuścamusalaṃ caiva tathā cakraṃmahatprabham ||
khaḍgaṃ ca śūlapāśau ca nṛsiṃhaṃrudrarūpiṇam || 4 || 

iṃdragopakanīlābhaṃ caṃdrābhaṃ svarṇasannibham || pūrvādimottarāṃtāsyamūdhrvāsyaṃ sarvavarṇakam || 5 || 

bibhrāṇaṃ sarvajagatāmādhāraṃ girikanyake || śarīreraktavarṇaḥ || mukheṣuvarṇānāṃ paṃcakam || 1 ||

(62) atha pratāparāmadhyānam (maṃtrasāre)

dorbhiḥkhaḍgaṃ triśūlaṃḍamarumasidhanurdaṃḍabāṇaṃ kuṭhāraṃśaṃkhaṃcakraṃ kṛpāṇaṃhalamusalagadābhiṃḍivālaṃ ca pāśam || udyadbāhuṃ ca muṣṭiṃhyabhayavarakaraṃbibhrataṃ śuklavarṇaṃ vaṃderāmaṃtriṇetraṃtvamararipu kulaṃmardayaṃtaṃpratāpaiḥ || 1 || śuklavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(63) atha saparivārapaṭṭābhirāmadhyānam (rāmāṣṭottare)

vāme bhūmisutāpurastu hanumānpaścāt sumitrāsutaśśatrughnobharataśca pārśvadalayorvāyvādikoṇeṣu ca ||
sugrīvaśca vibhīṣaṇaśca yuvaraṭtārāsutojāṃbavānmadye nīlasarojakomalarucaṃrāmaṃbhajeśyāmalam || 1 || nīlavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(64) atha anaṃtamūrtidhyānam (bhaviṣyottarenaṃtakalpe)

navāmrapallavābhāsaṃpiṃgabhrūśmaśrulocanam || dakṣiṇodhrvakarepadmaṃśaṃkhaṃ tasyāpyadhaḥkare || 1 || 

cakramūdhrvakare vāme gadāṃ tasyāpyadhaḥkare || 
bhibhrataṃ puṃḍarikākṣaṃ phaṇāsaptānvitaṃbhaje || 2 || gomūtravarṇaḥ || 1 ||

<p.(58>

(65) atha gopālakṛṣṇadhyānam (bhāgavate)

naumīḍyate bhavapuṣe taṭidaṃbarāyaguṃjāvataṃsa śikhipiñchalasanmukhāya || 
vanya srajekabalavetraviṣāṇaveṇu lakṣmaśriye mṛdupadepaśupāṃgajāya || 1 || nīlvarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(66) atha saṃtānagopāladhyānam (pāṃcarātre)

pibaṃtaṃ ca stanaṃmāturmukhaṃsaṃvīkṣyasusmitam ||
aṃgulyagraistanaṃcānyaṃ spṛśaṃ taṃ ca muhurmuhuḥ || 1 ||
yaśodāṃkasthitaṃ gopaṃdhyāyet putrapradaṃsadā || 1 ||
nīlavarṇaḥ ||

(67) atha madanagopāladhyānam (pāṃcarātre)

raktavarṇodaśabhujaḥ sarvālaṃkārabhūṣitaḥ ||
śaṃkhacakragadā padmapāśāṃkuśasumāśugān || 1 || 

ikṣukodaṃḍamanyābhyāṃ vādayanveṇuprādarāt ||
ṣoḍaśacchadapadmastha ṣaṭkoṇoparisaṃsithataḥ || 2 ||

gopālomadanākhyoyaṃmaṃdasmitamukhāṃbujaḥ ||
svarapatrastha gopībhirādarādīkṣitovatāt || 3 || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(68) atha sudarśanadhyānam (pāṃcarātre)

śaṃkhaṃcakraṃ ca pāśaṃparaśumasimiṣuṃ śūlacāpāṃkuśāgniṃ bibhrattaṃ vajrakheṭaṃ halamusalagadākuṃtamatyugradaṃṣṭram ||
jvālākeśaṃ triṇetraṃ jvaladanalanibhaṃhārakeyūrabhūṣaṃ dhyāyet ṣaṭkoṇasaṃsthaṃ sakalaripujanaḥprāṇasaṃhāracakram || 1 || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(69) atha cakradhyānam (pāṃcarātre)

tiryagjvālāgnirūpaṃ jvalitaśikhiśikhottuṃgakeyūra bāhuṃpiṃgākṣaṃdīpta jihvāṃdaśaśatavilasattīkṣṇadhārātiraudram || śārṅgacakrābjaśaṃkhānśaramusaladharaṃ sarvaśatrūndahaṃtaṃ ṣaṭkoṇābhyaṃtarasthaṃ raviniyutanibhaṃ cakrarājaṃprasannam || 1 || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(70) atha viṣvaksenadhyānam (pāṃcarātrepādmasaṃhitāyām)

śyāmavarṇaḥ caturbhirbhujaistarjanī śaṃkhacakragadādadhānaḥ pīṭhādhastātprasāritadakṣiṇapādaḥ ākuṃcitavāmapādaḥ kirīṭādi sarvālaṃkārabhūṣito viṣvaksenaḥ || śyāmavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 59>

(71) atha hanumatsvarūpam (tanmaṃtradhyāne)

sphaṭikābhaṃsvarṇakāṃtiṃ dvibhūjaṃ ca kṛtāṃjalim || kuṃḍaladvayasaṃśobhimukhāṃbujamahaṃbhaje || 1 || svarṇavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(72) atha paṃcamukhāṃjaneyadhyānam (sudarśanasaṃhitāyām)

paṃcavaktraṃ mahābhīmaṃ tripaṃcanayanairyutam ||
koṭisūryapratīkāśaṃ kapivaktraṃsu tejasam || 1 ||

daṃṣṭrākarālavadanaṃbhrukuṭilekṣaṇam ||
asyaikaṃdakṣiṇaṃ vaktraṃ nārasiṃhaṃ mahādbhutam || 2 || 

atyugra tejovapupaṃbhīṣaṇaṃ bhayanāśanam ||
paścime gāruḍaṃvaktraṃ vakratuṃḍaṃmahādyuti || 3 || 

pātālasiddhidaṃghoraṃ viṣabhūtādikṛṃtanam ||
uttaraṃsaukaraṃ vaktraṃ kṛṣṇaṃdīptaṃ śikhojjvalam || 4 || 

sarvabhūtapraśamanaṃtāpa jvaranivāraṇam ||
ūrddhvaṃhayānanaṃ ghoraṃdānavāṃtakaraṃ param || 5 || 

khaḍgatriśūlakhaṭvāṅga pāśamaṃkuśaparvatau ||
drumagomudrikāmuṃḍaṃdadhānaṃsuravaṃditam || 6 || svarṇavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(73) atha garuḍadhyānam (bhaṭṭabhāskarīye)

upeṃdrasyāgrataḥ pakṣīguḍākeśaḥkṛtāṃjaliḥ ||
savyajānugatobhūmaumūrdhnā ca phaṇimaṃḍitaḥ || 1 ||

sthūlajaṃghonaragrīvastuṃganāsonarāṃgakaḥ ||
dvibāhuḥ pakṣayuktaśca kartavyovinatāsutaḥ || 2 || suvarṇavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(74) atha śrīkārtavīryadhyānam (ḍāmarataṃtre)

avyātsarvabhayāt prabhākaranibhaḥpradyotanadyotita svarṇasrakparivītakaṃdharadharoraktāṃśukoṣṇīṣavān ||
nānākalpavibhūṣaṇaḥkara sahasrārdhāttabāṇāsanobāṇāttārdhasahastrabāhuraniśaṃbhūvallabhonaḥ prabhuḥ || 1 || raktavarṇaḥ ||

athavā prakārāṃteṇa dhyānam (kārtavīryārjunakalpe)

sahasrabāhuṃsaśaraṃsacāpaṃ raktāṃbaraṃ ratnakirīṭakuṃḍalam || corādiduṣṭāmayanāśamiśṭaṃ dhyāyen mahāṃtaṃbhuvikārtavīryam || 1 || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

<p.(60>

(75) atha manmathadhyānam (bhaṭṭabhāskarīye)

kāmadevastu kartavyorūpeṇā pratimobhuvi ||
aṣṭabāhuḥ prakartavyośaṃkhapadmavibhūṣitaḥ || 1 || 

cāpabāṇakaraścaiva madodaṃcitalocanaḥ ||
ratiḥprītistathā śaktirbhedaśaktistathojjvalā || 2 || 

catasrastasya kartavyāḥ patnyorūpamanoharāḥ ||
catvāraścakarāstasya kāryābhāryāstanopagāḥ || 3 || 

ketau tu makaraḥkāryaḥ paṃcabāṇarathomahān || ||
kāmaṃkāṃcana saṃnibhamiti saivāgame || svarṇavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(76) atha dattātreyadhyānam (tatkalpe)

maṃdāramūle maṇimaṃṭapasthitaṃ suvarṇadānaikanibaddhadīkṣam || dhyāyetparītaṃnavanāthasiddhairdāridryadā vānalakālameghaiḥ || 1 ||
 vyākhyāmudrāṃkarasarasijedakṣiṇe saṃdadhānojānunyastāvarakarasarojātavāmonnatāṃsaḥ || dhyānādhārātsukhaparavaśādardhamāmīlitākṣodattātreyobhasita dhavalaḥ pātunaḥ kṛttivāsāḥ || 1 || śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

[itiśrīmatsamastabhūmaṃḍalamaṃḍanāyamānanikhiladeśāvataṃsa karnāṭakajanapadasaṃpadadhiṣṭhānabhūta śrīmanmahīśūramahāsaṃsthānamadhyadedīpyamānāvikala kalānidhi kulakramāgatarājakṣitipāla pramukhanikhilanijarājādhirāja mahārājacakravartimaṃḍalānubhūtadivyaratnasiṃhāsanārūḍha śrīmadrājādhirājarājaparameśvarapauḍha pratāpāpratimavīranarapatibirudeṃteṃbaragaṃḍalokaika vīrayadukulapayaḥ pārāvāra kalānidhiśaṃkhacakrāṃkuśa kuṭhāramakaramatsyaśarabhasālvagaṃḍa bheruṃḍadharaṇīvarāhahanumadgaruḍakaṃṭhīravādyaneka birudāṃkitamahīśūra puravarādhīśa śrīkṛṣṇarājamahārājaviracite śrītattvanidhyākhyagraṃthe virāḍrūpādiviṣṇu svarūpanirūpaṇaṃ nāmadvitīyoviṣṇunidhissaṃpūrṇaḥ] ||

[iti śrītattvanidhigranthāntarvartī dvitīyoviṣṇunidhiḥ sampūrnaḥ] ||


śrīḥ 

atha

[śrītattvanidhau

tṛtīyaśśivanidhiḥ] |

(1) atha maheśvaradhyānam (śivapaṃcākṣarīmaṃtre)

śāṃtaṃ padmāsanasthaṃ śaśadharamukuṭaṃ paṃcavaktraṃ triṇetraṃ śūlaṃ vajraṃ ca khaḍgaṃ paraśumabhayadaṃ dakṣabhāge vahaṃtam || 
nāgaṃ pāśaṃ ca ghaṃṭāṃ pralayahutavahaṃ sāṃkuśaṃ vāmabhāge nānālaṃkārayuktaṃsphaṭikamaṇinibhaṃ pārvatīśaṃ namāmi || 1 || śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(2) atha gaurīdhyānam (nṛsiṃhaprāsāde)

gaurīśuklāṃbarā devī rūpeṇā pratimābhuvi || 
pṛthak caturbhujākāryā devī siṃhāsane śubhā || 1 || 

siṃhāsanesyāḥ kartavyaṃ kamalaṃcārukarṇikam ||
aṣṭapatraṃ mahābhāgākarṇikāyāṃsu saṃsthitā || 2 || 

vināyakavadāsīnā devī kāyā mahābhujā ||
bṛhannālaṃkare kāryaṃ tasyāśca kamalaṃśubham || 3 || 

dakṣiṇe yādavaśreṣṭhakeyūraprāṃtasannibhaṃ ||
vāmemṛtaghaṭaḥ kāryastathā rājanmanoharaḥ || 4 || 

tasyā anyaukaraukāryaubilvaśaṃkhadharāviti || marakatavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(3) atha mahākailāsamūrtidhyānam (skāṃdeśaṃkarasaṃhitāyāmupadeśakāṃḍe)

śṛṇutabrāhmaṇāḥ sarve guhyādguhyataraṃparam ||
astimerorudagbhāge mahānkailāsaparvataḥ || 1 ||

sāṃbasyasaguṇasyāyaṃ sabhaktasyeṃdumaulinaḥ ||
saṃvāsoyojanānāṃ ca viṃśatkoṭibhirāyataḥ || 2 ||

aunnatyametaddviguṇamasya jñeyaṃ dvijottamāḥ ||
navaratnamayaṃ tasyamadhye śikharamuttamam || 3 || 

tatrālayaṃ maheśasya nānāratnavicitritratam ||
prākāragopurāṭṭālavalabhībhirvirājitam ||  (4 || 

tathā siṃhāsane tatra mahāñchaṃbhuḥ sadāśivaḥ ||
praphullakamalollāsa paṃcaviṃśanmukhojjvalaḥ || 5 ||

dhṛta nānāyudhodbhāsipaṃcāśatkaramaṃḍitaḥ ||
phullaraktāṃbujātta śrīnābhyaṃghriyugalojjvalaḥ || 6 || 

vicitraratnakhacitabhūṣaṇairapibhūṣitaḥ ||
anekakoṭisūryābhaḥ paramānaṃdavigrahaḥ || 7)  || 

aprākṛtatanuśśrīmāllaṁkṣyalakṣaṇavarjitaḥ ||
yatovāconivartaṃte aprāpyamanasāsaha || 8 || 

gaṃgāśrayajaṭājuṭaścaṃdrarekhāvibhūṣitaḥ ||
bhasmoddhūlita sarvāṃgovyālajñopavītavān || 9 || 

kapālamālādhāri ca vyāghracarmāṃbarāvṛtaḥ ||
prativaktraṃ trinayanobhakta sarvarthasiddhidaḥ || 10 || 

prasāryadakṣiṇaṃ pādaṃkuṃcayitvetaraṃ padam ||
abhayaṃ cakraśūle caṭaṃkabāṇaugadāṃbhuje || 11 ||

khaḍgatomaraśaktīśca paraśuprāsapannagān ||
halāṃkuśākṣamālāśca cchurikāṃdhvajadaṃḍakau || 12 || 

vajrakuṃtāsthi daṃṣṭrāścakrakacaṃbhiṃḍīvālakaṃ || paṃcaviṃśatibhirhastairdadhānodakṣiṇaiśśubhaiḥ || 13 || 

varacāpaumṛgaṃśaṃkhaṃ kheṭapāśaparaśvadhān ||
mudgaraṃḍamaruṃ ghaṃkṭāṃ rudravīṇāṃ ca pustakam || 14 || 

kapālamuṃḍakhaṭvāṃgabhuśuṃḍīparighānapi ||
phalakaṃpaṭta saṃvetraṃkamaṃḍaluhutāśanau || 15 || 

kartarīṃmusalaṃ piṃchaṃbibhradvāmaistathākaraiḥ ||
mahān sadāśivassoyaṃrājate tatra parvate || 16 || śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(4) atha dvātriṃśadbhujā'ghoramūrtidhyānam (śivatattvaratnākre)

ekavaktraṃ sadānaṃdaṃ dvātriṃśadbhujasaṃyutam ||
jaṭāmakuṭasaṃyuktaṃ triṇetraṃ caṃdraśekharam || 1 ||

abhayaṃ khaḍgaśūlaṃ ca cakraṃḍamarugaṃ tathā ||
dadhānamasthibāṇau ca gadāṃpadmaṃ kapālakam || 2 ||

jñānamudrāṃkuṃtahastamaṃkuśaṃ cākṣamālikām ||
khaṭvāṃgaṃparaśuṃ caiva dadhānaṃ dakṣiṇaiḥ karaiḥ || 3 ||

varaṃ ca phalakaṃ caiva ṭaṃkaṃpāśaṃ ca mudgaram ||
nāgamagniṃ mṛgaṃ ghaṃṭāṃdhanuśca kaṭihastakam  || 4 ||

ratnaṃ ca kumudaṃkuṃbhaṃmusalaṃ pustakaṃ tathā ||
etadāyudhasaṃyuktaṃ ruṃḍamālāvibhūṣitam || 5 || 

kālamuṃḍasya śirasisthitaṃ sarvābhayapradam ||
nīlavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 63>

(5) atha daśabhujā'ghoramūrtidhyānam (pāṃcarātre)

paraśuṃḍamaruṃkhaḍgakheṭaubāṇaśarāsane ||
śūlaṃkapālamabhayavaraudadhatamiṣṭadam || 1 ||

trilocanaṃ bhīṣaṇāsyaṃ nīlāṃgaṃraktavāsasam ||
ahibhūṣita sarvāṃgaṃtamaghoramupāsmahe || 2 || nīlavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(6) atha mahākālīsameta mahākāladhyānam (lalitopākhyāne)

mahākāloghanaśyāmaḥ kālyāliṃgitavigrahaḥ ||
śyāmakaṃcukadhārī ca madāruṇavilocanaḥ || 1 ||

braṃhmāṃḍacaṣake pūrṇaṃ pibanviśvarasāsavam ||
mahākālīṃ ghanaśyāmāmanaṃgārdrāmapāṃgayan || 2 ||

siṃhāsane samāsīnaḥ kalyāṇa kalanātmke ||
kālamṛtyumukhairyuktassarvalokaika bhakṣakaḥ || 3 ||

lalitā dhyānasaṃpannolalitā pūjanotsukaḥ ||
vitanvaṁllalitābhakteṣvāyuṣo dīrghadīrghatām || 4 || nīlavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(7)  atha amṛta mṛtyuṃjayadhyānam (kāraṇāgame)

caṃdropariṣṭāt saṃbaddhapadmāsanavirājitam ||
caṃdravarṇaṃsravaddivyāmṛta caṃdrakalādharam || 1 ||

yogamudraikasaṃbaddhādhara hastadvayānvitam ||
amṛtāpūrṇakanakakalaśāptakaradvayaṃ || 2 ||

somasūryāgni netraṃ ca baddhapiṃgajaṭādharam ||
nānābharaṇasaṃbhūṣaṃ nāgayajñopavītinam || 3 ||

vyāghracarmāṃbaradharaṃ devaṃ bhāktānukaṃpinam ||
bhasmānulepinaṃ rudraṃ mṛtyuṃjayamimaṃ smaret || 4 || śubhravarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(8) atha nīlakaṃṭhadhynam (pāṃcarātre)

jaṭābaddhakalānāthaṃbhogi bhūṣaṇabhūṣitam || 
akṣamalāṃ ca śūlaṃ ca kapālaṃ dadhataṃkaraiḥ || 1 ||

khaṭvāṃgamapi paṃcāsayaṃvasānaṃ vyāghracarma ca ||
triṇetramabjanilyaṃbālārka sadṛśaprabham || sādhakābhīṣṭadātāraṃ nīlakaṃṭhamahaṃbhaje || 2 || aruṇavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(9) atha rudramūrtidhyanm (paṃcarātre)

kailāsābhaṃ paṃcavaktraṃ devyāyuktaṃ trilocanam || 
nīlakaṃṭhaṃsarpabhūṣaṃ vyāghracarmāṃbarāvṛtam || 1 ||

akṣamālāvarābhīti kamaṃḍalulasatkaram ||
caṃdragaṃgājaṭājūṭaṃrūdraṃtaṃ praṇamāmyaham || 2 || śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 64>

(10) atha saparivāromāmaheśvaradhyānam (kāraṇāgame)
	
vāme śailasutāpurastu vṛṣabhaḥpaścātsureṃdrādayodaityāriśca vidhiśca pārśvadalayorvāyvadikoṇeṣu ca ||
bhṛṃgīnāradabāṇabhairava gajāsyaskaṃda vīreśvarāmadhyeśubhra sarojakomalarucaṃ śaṃbhuṃbhajepāṃḍuram || 1 ||  śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(11) atha sabhāpatidhyānam   (kāraṇāgame)

kailāsaśailaśikhare trijagajjanitrīṃgaurīṃ niveśyakanakāṃcitaratnapīṭhe ||
nṛtyaṃtamādipuruṣaṃ śaśiśekharaṃtaṃ devāḥ pradoṣasamayenubhajaṃti sarve || 1 ||

brahmātāladharoharissapaṭahovīṇākarābhāratīvaṃśadvaṃdvayutau subhāsvarakaraumārtaṃḍasomauśubhau ||
gākautuṃburunāradausamurajaunaṃdī kumārastathā rudronṛttakarassvabhāvajanitaṃnāṭyaṃ sadāpātunaḥ || 1 || gauravarṇaḥ || 1 ||

atha sadyojātādipaṃcamūrtidhyānam (śaivekāraṇagame)

(12) tatrādo sadyojātadhyānam 

kuṃdeṃduśaṃkhasphaṭikāvabhāsovedākṣamālāvaradābhayāṃkaḥ ||
tryakṣaścaturvaktra(-)uruprabhāvassadyodhijātovatumāṃ pratīcyām || 1 || śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(13) atha vāmadevadhyānam

varākṣamālābhayaṭaṃkahastassarojakiṃjalkasamānavarṇaḥ ||
trīlocanaścārucaturmukhomāṃ pāyādudīcyāṃdiśivāmadevaḥ || 1 || kanakavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(14) atha aghoradhyānam

kuṭhāravedāṃkuśapāśaśūlakapālaḍhakkākṣaguṇāndadhānaḥ ||
caturmukhonīlarucistriṇetraḥ pāyādaghorodiśidakṣiṇasyām || 1 || nīlavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(15) atha tatpuruṣadhyanam

pradīptavidyutkanakāvabhāso vidyāvarābhītikuṭhārapāṇiḥ ||
caturmukhastatpuruṣastriṇetraḥ prācyāṃ sthitorakṣatu māmajasram || 1 || kanakavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 65>

(16) atha īśānadhyānam

vedābhayeṣṭāṃkuśapāśaṭaṃkakapālaḍhakkākṣakaśūlapāṇiḥ ||
sitadyutiḥ paṃcamukhovatānmāmīśāna(-)urdhvaṃparamaprakāśaḥ || 1 || śvetavrṇaḥ || 1 || 5 ||

atha saptatāṃḍavamūrtisvarūpaṇi (śaivekāraṇāgame)

(17) tatrādau ānaṃdatāṃḍavadhyānam 

caturbhujaṃ triṇetraṃ ca prasāritajaṭānvitam ||
gauravarṇasamāyuktaṃ barhipiṃchasamanvitam || 1 ||

maulaudakṣiṇadhuttūramardhacaṃdrasamanvitam || 
dakṣiṇe svajaṭāgre tu jāhnavyāparimaṃḍitam || 2 ||

vāmakarṇe patrabhṛtaṃ dakṣiṇenakrakuṃḍalam ||
sarvābharaṇasaṃyuktamupavīta samanvitam || 3 ||

vyāghrājināṃbaropetaṃ pādakiṃkiṇikāyutam ||
prasāritabhujaṃ vāmedakṣiṇe'bhayahastakam || 4 ||

ḍamaruṃ savyahaste tu vahniṃ vai vāmakedadham ||
vakraṃ tu dakṣiṇaṃpādamapasmāroparisthitam || 5 ||

ūdhrvagaṃ vāmapādaṃ tu pādāgraṃdakṣiṇānugam ||
ānaṃdatāṃḍavaṃ proktam || gauravarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(18) atha saṃdhyātāṃḍavadhyānam

caturbhujaṃ triṇetraṃ ca jaṭāmukuṭinaṃ dadham ||
abhayaṃ ḍamaruṃsavye vāme piṃchaṃsavismayam || 1 ||

apasmāraṃ vināpīṭhe vāmāṃghryā kuṃcitaṃ sthitam ||
ūdhrve tu dakṣiṇaṃpādamapasavyānugaṃdadham || 2 ||

tatpādaṃ kuṃciṃtaṃ vāthasarṣakaṃkaṇabhūṣītam ||
saṃdhyātāṃḍavamevaṃ syād || varṇādikaṃ pūrvavat || 1 ||

(19) athomātāṃḍavadhyānam

ekavaktraṃ trinayanaṃ jaṭāmaṃḍalabhūṣitam ||
gaurāṃgaṃṣaḍbhujopetamabhayaṃ damaruṃ tathā || 1 ||

śūlaṃdakṣiṇapārśve tu kapālaṃvismayaṃ tathā ||
gajahastopamaṃ hastaṃsavyapārśvānugaṃdadham || 2 ||

tameva vāmapādaṃ ca hyapasmāroparisthitam ||
uddhṛtaṃ dakṣiṇaṃpādaṃ vāmapādānugaṃ tathā || 3 ||
vāmapārśve hyumādevī sahitaṃ jāhnavīyutam ||
sarvābharaṇasaṃyuktaṃ vyāghracarmottarīyakam || 4 ||

umātāṃḍavamatrom || śiṣṭaṃpūrvavat || 1 ||

<p. 66>

(20) atha gaurītāṃḍavadhyānam

śāṃtaṃ caturbhujopetaṃ raktavarṇaṃsmitānanam ||
karoṭiṃbakapuṣpaṃ ca dhuttūraṃ cārkapuṣpakam || 1 ||

bālacaṃdrajaṭājūṭaṃ suvikīrṇajāṭānvitam ||
sarpakaṃkaṇasaṃyuktamapasmāroparisthitam || 2 ||

dakṣiṇaṃ kuṃcitaṃ pādaṃvāmapādaṃ tadūrdhvagam ||
savyedadhānamabhayamanyasmin ḍamaruṃkare || 3 ||

anyasmin pūrvatovyālamapare vahnipātrakam ||
vāmegaurī samāyuktamavāme naṃdikeśinam || 4 ||

suvikīrṇajaṭābhāraṃ jaṭāmakuṭasaṃyutam ||
vāme maulisamāyuktaṃśeṣaṃ prathamanṛttavat || 5 ||

gaurītāṃḍavamityuktam || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(21) atha kālikātāṃḍavadhyānam

ekavaktraṃ dvinayanaṃ jaṭāsaṃkīrṇamastakam ||
bhujāṣṭakasamāyuktaṃ savyapādaṃ samuddhṛtam || 1 ||

savakraṃ vāmapādaṃtamapasmāroparisthitam ||
abhayaṃ śūlapāśaṃ ca ḍamaruṃdakaṣiṇekare || 2 ||

kapālaṃcāgnipātraṃ ca ghaṃṭāṃ vāmakarevaram ||
gajahastopamaṃhastaṃ prasṛtaṃdakṣiṇānugam || 3 ||

dadhaṃlakṣaṇasaṃyuktaṃ śeṣaṃ prathamanṛttavat ||
kālikātaṃḍavaṃ proktam || gauravarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(22) atha tripuratāṃḍavadhyānam

derbhiḥ ṣoḍaśabhiryuktaṃ vāmegairīsamāśritam ||
skaṃdaṃdakṣiṇapārśve tu savyahaste dhṛtāṃjalim || 1 ||

abhayaṃ ḍamaruṃ caiva vajraṃśūlaṃ ca bibhratam ||
pāśaṃṭaṃkaṃ tathā daṃḍaṃnāgaṃ vai dakṣiṇekare || 2 ||

savyānugaṃkaraṃ caiva vāmepūrvakaraṃ tathā ||
analaṃ pustakaṃ caiva varadaṃ ketukheṭakam || 3 ||

ghaṭāṃ caiva kapālaṃ ca vāmapārśveṣṭabhiḥkaraiḥ ||
sarvalakṣaṇasaṃyuktaṃ śeṣaṃprathamanṛttavat || 4 ||

traipuraṃtāṃḍavaṃ proktam || gauravarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(23) atha saṃhāratāṃḍavadhyānam

triṇetraṃ cāṣṭahastaṃ ca suvikīrṇajaṭānvitam ||
kuṃcitaṃ vāmapādaṃtamapasmāroparisthitam || 1 ||

uddhṛtaṃ dakṣiṇaṃpādaṃ vyāghracarmottarīyakam ||
abhayaṃśūlapāśau ca ḍamaruṃdakṣiṇekare || 2 ||

kapālaṃcāgnipātraṃ ca dadhaṃvismayahastakam ||

<p. 67>

gajahastopamaṃ vāme caturdorbhissamanvitam || 3 ||

gajahastopamaṃ savyamapasavyānugaṃ tathā ||
naṃdīśaṃ savyabhāge tu vāmegaurīsamanvitam || 4 ||

saptamaṃ nṛttamākhyātaṃ jagadvṛddhikaraṃbhavet ||
śiṣṭaṃ prathamanṛttavat || gauravarṇaḥ || 1 || 7 ||

atha eteṣāṃ saptatāṃḍavānāṃ nāmāni (śaivekāraṇāgame)

ānaṃdatāṃḍavaṃ pūrvaṃsaṃdhyātāṃḍavamuttaram ||
umātāṃḍavamevaṃ syādgaurītāṃḍavamapyatho || 1 ||

kālikā tāṃḍavaṃ caiva ṣaṣṭhaṃ tripuratāṃḍavam ||
saṃhāratāṃḍavaṃ saptamamitthaṃ saptatāṃḍavāḥ || 2 || 7 ||

(24) atha bhavādyaṣṭamūrtidhyānam (śaivāgameśekhare)

bhavaḥśarvastatheśānaḥ paśupatyugrakau tathā ||
rudrobhīmo mahādevaḥ kīrtitāstvaṣṭamūrtayaḥ || 1 ||   ||

caturbhujāstriṇetrāśca jaṭāmakuṭadhāriṇaḥ ||
varābhayakarāścaivaṭaṃka kṛṣṇadharāstathā || 1 ||

sarvābharaṇasaṃyuktāraktakṣaumadharā(-)ime ||
eteṣāṃvarṇāḥ ||

śuklaśyāmaśca raktaśca kṛṣṇogokṣīrasaṃnibhaḥ ||
kesarovidrumonīlobhavādināṃ ca varṇakaḥ || 1 || 8 ||

athaikādaśarudrāṇāṃ nāmādi (śaivāgame)

śaṃbhuḥpinākīgiriśaḥsthāṇurbhargassadāśivaḥ ||
śivoharastathā śarvaḥ kapālībhava eva ca || 1 ||

ekādaśaite kathitāḥ rudrālokahiteratāḥ || 11 ||

(25) tatrādauśaṃbhudhyānam

brahmaviṣṇumaheśānadevadānavarākṣasāḥ ||
yasmāt prajajñiredevāstaṃ śaṃbhuṃpraṇamāmyaham || 1 || śoṇavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(26) atha pinākidhyānam

kṣamāratha samārūḍhaṃ brahmasūtrasamanvitam ||
caturvedaiśca sahitaṃ pinākinamahaṃbhaje || 1 ||
haridvarṇaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 68>

(27) atha giriśadhyānam

kailāsaśikharaprodyanmaṇimaṃṭapamadhyagaḥ ||
giriśogirijāprāṇavallabhostu sadāmude || 1 || nīlavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(28) atha sthāṇudhyānam

vāmāṃgakṛtasaṃveśagirikanyā sukhāvaham ||
sthāṇuṃnamāmi śirasā sarvadeva namaskṛtam || 1 ||
śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(29) atha bhargadhyānam

caṃdrāvataṃso jaṭilastriṇetrobhasmapāṃḍaraḥ ||
hṛdayasthaḥ sadābhūyādbhargobhayavināśanaḥ || 1 ||
śyāmavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(30) atha sadāśivadhyānam

brahmābhūtvā sṛjallokaṃ viṣṇurbhūtvātha pālayan ||
rudrobhūtvāharannaṃte gatirmestu sadāśivaḥ || 1 ||
śyāmalavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(31) atha śivadhyānam

gāyatrī pratipādyāyāpyoṃkāra kṛtasadmane ||
kalyāṇaguṇadhāmnestu śivāyavihitānatiḥ ||  (1 ||
pītavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(32) atha haradhyānam

āśīviṣāhārakṛte devaugha praṇatāṃghraye ||
pinākāṃkitahastāyaharāyāstu namaskṛtiḥ || 1 ||
kṛṣṇavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(33) atha śarvadhyānam

tisṛṇāṃ ca purāṃhaṃtā kṛtāṃtamadabhaṃjanaḥ ||
khaḍgapāṇistīkṣṇadaṃṣṭraśśarvākhyostumude mama || 1 ||
babhruvarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(34) atha kapālidhyānam

dakṣādhvaradhvaṃsakaraḥ kopayuktamukhāṃbujaḥ ||
śūlapāṇissukhāyāstu kapālīmehyaharniśam || 1 ||
pāṭalavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 69>

(35) atha bhavadhyānam

yogīṃdranutapādābjaṃ dvaṃdvātītaṃ janāśrayam ||
vedāṃtakṛtasaṃcāraṃ bhavaṃtaṃ śaraṇaṃbhaje || 1 ||
śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

athavā eteṣāṃsvarūpāṇi (padmapurāṇe)

triṇetrārudrasadṛśā jaṭāmakuṭadhāriṇaḥ ||
rudraṃtriṇetramaruṇaṃ jaṭāmaṃḍaladhāriṇam || 1 ||

caturbhujaṃ nīlakaṃṭhamiṃdurekhāvibhūṣitam ||
vaiyyāghracarmavasanaṃ sarvābharaṇabhūṣitam || 2 ||

karābhyāmapi mukhyābhyāṃ varadābhayadaṃsthiram ||
aparābhyāṃ ca hastābhyāṃ bibhrāṇaṃparaśuṃmṛgam || 3 ||

eteṣāṃ varṇāḥ || śoṇaśca haritonīlaḥśvetaḥ śyāmalamecakau ||
pītaḥkālastathā babhruvarṇakaḥpāṭalassitaḥ || 1 ||

ekādaśānāṃ rudrāṇāṃ varṇoyaṃsamudāhṛtaḥ || 11 ||

atha paṃcaviṃśatilīlāmūrtīnāṃdhyānam (śaivekāraṇāgame)

(36) tatrādau caṃdraśekharadhyānam

abhayavaradahastaṃ saumyaśṛṃgārabhāvaṃ vipulavadananetraṃ caṃdrabiṃbāṃśamaulim ||
ṛjutanusamapādasthānakaṃ vidrumābhaṃhariṇaparaśupāṇiṃpadmapīṭhopariṣṭham || 1 ||

pravālavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(37) athaitatpārśvasthagaurīdhyānam

śyāmāṃ triṇetrāṃdvibhujāṃ tribhaṃgīṃ savyāpasavyasthitakuṃcitāṃghrim ||
savye tu nīlotpalacāruhastāṃ devasya vāmasthitapadmapīṭhām || 1 ||
śyāmavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(38) atha umāmaheśvaradhyānam

dhavalābjasukhāsanasannihitaṃ mṛgaḍimbhakaṭaṃkavarābhayinam ||
sumukhaṃ paramutpaladṛgvaradaṃ hyumayāsahanaumisarūpamidam || 1 ||
śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(39) atha vṛṣabhārūḍhadhyānam

savye syādvakratuṃḍānvitakaṭakakaraṃgopateḥ pṛṣṭasaṃsthaṃ vāmasyārdhaṃ sadakṣaṃvarakarayugaleṭaṃka kṛṣṇaṃdadhānam ||
phālasthākṣaṃ prasannaṃtrinayanalasitaṃ baddhaveṇīkirīṭaṃ vāme gauryāsametaṃ namataśubhakaraṃ taṃ vṛṣārūḍhamīśam || 1 || śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 70>

(40) atha nāṭyamūrtidhyānam

śayyāpasmārakordhvasthita padavilasanvāmamuddhṛtya pādaṃjvālāmālāsumadhye naṭaphaṇiśirasi sthūlamāsedivānyaḥ ||
bhasmoddhulitamaṃgavidrumanibhaṃ hastāgrapādāgrayoragniṃ dolavarābhayaṃ ḍamarukaṃ dhṛtvānaṭeśaṃbhaje || raktavaṛṇaḥ ||
śivakāmavallī caṃdraśekharasamīpasthāṃbāvatkāryā || 1 ||

(41) atha vaivāhikamūrtidhyānam athavā kalyāṇasundaramūrtidhyānam

siṃdūrābhaṃtriṇetraṃ yugabhujasahitaṃ hārakeyūrabhūṣaṃ divyairvastrairvṛtāṃgaṃvarakaṭakalasaddhemakalhārabhūṣam || ||
śaṃbhuṃdakṣiṇapārvatīkaratalaṃ savyena saṃgṛhṇataṃṭaṃkaṃ kṛṣṇamṛgaṃdharaṃ varakaraṃcūḍeṃdubaddhādaram || 1 ||

jaṭāmakuṭasuṃyuktaṃ caṃdrārdhakṛtabhūṣaṇam ||
tryakṣaṃ caturbhujaṃnaṃsye navayauvanagarvitam || 2 ||
samabhaṃgayutaṃ devasthānakaṃ saṃprakīrtitam ||
kuṃcitaṃ savyapādena sthitasavyetarāṃghrikam || 1 || siṃdūravarṇaḥ || 1 ||

atha vaivāhikeśāṃgamūrtayaḥ

(42) tatrādau girijādhyanam

pīnoruṃpīnagaṃḍāṃ ca pīnahastasamanvitām ||
dvibāhukāṃdvinetrāṃ ca sarvābharaṇabhūṣitām || 1 ||

dukūlavasanāṃ devīṃ kuryāddevasyavāmake || śyāmavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(43) atha brahmadhyānam

caturmukhaṃ caturbāhuṃkamaṃḍalvakṣadhāriṇam ||
yajñasūtrottarīyaṃ ca jaṭāmakuṭasaṃyutam || 1 ||

savyahastekṣamālāṃ ca vāmahaste kamaṃḍalum ||
sruvaṃdakṣiṇahaste tu pustakaṃ vāmakedadham || 2 ||

aṃbujāsana(-)āsīnaṃ brahmāṇaṃhasanonmukhaṃ ||
kuṃḍaṃ tu caturaśraṃ vai mekhalātrayasaṃyutam || 3 ||

nābhiyonisamāyuktamuktalakṣaṇalakṣitam ||
kuryānmadhye havyavāhaṃ jvālāpaṃcakasaṃvṛtam || 4 ||

brahmaṇaḥ puratobhāgenyastāgniṃ samyagarcayet || pāṭalavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 71>

(44) atha menakādhyānam

devyāstu dakṣiṇepārśve menakāsusmitānanām || 1 ||
sarvābharaṇasaṃyuktāṃ sarvālaṃkāraśobhitām || kāñcanavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(45) atha himavaddhyānam

hastadvaye hemakuṃbhajalaṃdharakṛtiṃ bhajet || 6 ||
padmapīṭhasthitāṃ caiva tatpārśve himavān sthitaḥ ||

tanmadhye vṛṣabhesthityājalayānākṛtistadā ||
devasyavāmapārśve tu sanakaśca sanaṃdanaḥ || 7 ||

sthitau kṛtāṃjalipuṭau jaṭābaddhau sadāpriyau ||
viṣṇvādyamaramukhyāśca vivāhe sevayāyutāḥ || 8 ||
kalyāṇasuṃdaraṃproktam || himavān śvetavarṇaḥ ||
sanakasanandanau pāṭalavarṇau || viṣṇvādīnāṃ tattadvarṇāḥ || 5 ||

(46) atha bhikṣāṭanamūrtidhyānam

caturbhujaṃtriṇetraṃ ca nagnaṃ caiva smitānanam ||
bhasmadigdhaṃ vidrumābhaṃ kaṭyāṃpannagasaṃvṛtam || 1 ||

āvṛttālaṃkṛtaṃ bhṛṃgīpādaṃ pādukasaṃyutam ||
dakṣiṇaṃ tatkarāgraṃ tu hariṇāsyānugaṃ bhavet || 2 ||

dakṣiṇe parahaste tu ḍamaruṃ caiva kārayet ||
vāme tvaparahaste tu triśūlaṃpiṃchadhāriṇam || 3 ||

kuṃcitaṃ dakṣiṇaṃpādaṃ vāmapādaṃ tu susthitam ||
samabhaṃgasthānakaṃ ca gamanonmukharūpakam || 4 ||

kapālopetahastaṃ ca vṛṣanābhisamaṃbhavet ||
evaṃ bhikṣāṭanaṃ proktam || guṃḍodaramathośṛṇu || 5 ||

devasya vāmapārśve tu guṃḍodaramadhasthitam ||
hastadvayasamāyuktaṃ kapālaṃśirasi nyaset || 6 ||

bhūtākārasamāyuktaṃ kuṃḍale karṇayornyaset ||
daṃṣṭrākarālavaktraṃ ca pūrvoktaṃ lakṣaṇānvitam || 7 ||
devovidrumavarṇaḥ || guṃḍodaraḥśyāmavarṇaḥ || 2 ||

(47) atha kāmadahanamūrtidhyānam

ugrarūpaṃ tu kāmāriṃ caturbhujasamanvitam ||
kṛṣṇaṭaṃkasamāyuktamabhayaṃvaradānvitam || 1 ||

kāmanigraharūpaṃ tu padmapīṭhoparisthitam ||
dakṣiṇelaṃbitaṃpādaṃ vāmapādaṃ tu śāyitam || 2 ||

kāryaḥkāmaripustvevaṃ vakṣyehaṃkālanāśanam || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 72>

(48) atha kālaharamūrtidhyānam

baṃdhūkābhamamuṃtriṇetrabhujinaṃ śūlābjahastojjvalaṃṭaṃkaṃ sūtravaraṃsupāśasahitaṃdaṃṣṭrākarālāsyakam ||
vāme kuṃcitapādamuddhṛtatalaṃkālasya vakṣasthalechinnābhinna jaṭādharaṃgirijayāyuktaṃ jagaddaivatam || 1 ||

uddhṛtaṃ vāmapādaṃ tu kālavakṣasthale sthitam ||
savyapādaṃliṃgamūrdhni sthitaṃ raudramukhaṃ bhajet || 2 || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

athāṃgamūrtayaḥ

(49) atha mārkaṇḍeyadhyānam

mārkaḍeya sthitodakṣeliṃgamūlaṃ tu saṃspṛśan ||
dvibhujaśca dvinetraśca bhasmarudrākṣasaṃyutaḥ || 3 ||
śivārcanaparaśśāṃtaḥ śivadhyānaparo bhavet || śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(50) atha mṛtyudhyānam

devasya vāmapāśve tu kālaṃ mṛtyusvarūpakam || 4 ||

kirīṭakuṃḍalopetaṃ sudaṃṣtraṃghorarūpakam ||
hastadvaye daṃḍapāśakarṣaṇākṛtirūpakam || 5 ||

tanmadhye mahiṣasthityākālarupamihocyate || śyāmavarṇaḥ ||  (1 ||

(51) atha tripurārimūrtidhyānam

caturbhujaṃ triṇetraṃ ca mṛgaṃparaśudhāriṇam ||
dhanurbāṇasamāyuktamumayāsahitaṃ tathā || 1 ||

sarvābharaṇasaṃyuktaṃ dvivyāṃbarasamāvṛtam || 
patraṃdadhaṃvāmakarṇe dakṣiṇe kuṃḍalānvitam || 2 ||

upavītasamāyuktaṃ samabhaṃgayutaṃśivam ||
jaṭāmakuṭasaṃyuktaṃvilasadvidrumāṃgakam || 3 || evaṃ tripurasaṃhāram || vidrumavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(52) atha jalaṃdharaharamūrtidhyānam

raktābhamugranayanaṃ dvibhujaṃ ca triṇetrakam ||
upavītasamāyuktaṃ sarvālaṃkāraśobhitam || 1 ||

<p. 73>

pādayoḥpādukāyuktaṃ kiṃcid vai gamanonmukham ||
dakṣahaste sthitaṃchatraṃ vāmepūrṇakamaṃḍalum || 2 ||

suvikīrṇajaṭābhāraṃ gaṃgācaṃdrasamanvitam ||
karṇakuṃḍalasaṃyuktaṃ hāranūpurasaṃyutam || 3 ||

dvibhujaṃ ca dvinetraṃ ca kirīṭakaṭakānvitam ||
sarvālaṃkārasaṃyuktaṃ kakṣekhaḍgasamanvitam || 1 ||

kṛtāṃjalipuṭopetaṃ hastecakraṃdadhaṃparam ||
jalaṃdharamathaproktam || devoraktavarṇaḥ || jalaṃdharaḥ pītavarṇaḥ || 2 ||

<p. 73>

(53) atha brahmaśiraśche tṛmūrtidhyānam

gauravarṇaṃ triṇetraṃ ca jaṭāmaulivirājiam ||
tāṭaṃkaṃkuṃḍalaṃ savyavāmaśrutyośca bibhratam || 1 ||

vyāghracarmāṃbaradharaṃ caturbhujasamanvitam ||
vajraṃparaśupūrvāṃsaṃ vāme brahmakaroṭikam || 2 ||

apare śūlahastaṃ ca śeṣaṃ purvoktavatkuru || gauravarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(54) atha gajāsurasaṃhāramūrtidhyānam

sthitvā hastiśirasyadakṣacaraṇaṃ vāmāṃgadakṣoddhṛtaṃ pucchordhvāvṛtacārmamuddhṛtakare śūlāsiśṛṃgojjvalam ||
ṭaṃkaṃ kṛṣṇamṛgaṃdharaṃparakare bhīṣmānaneṃdu prabhaṃvāmo mātibhayonmukhīsutayutaṃ sūcyāḍhyahastaṃharam || 1 || śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(55) atha vīrabhadramūrtidhyānam

caturbhujaṃ triṇetraṃ ca jaṭāmakuṭasaṃyutam ||
dakṣiṇe khaḍgabāṇau ca vāme cāpaṃ gadāṃdharam || 1 ||

daṃṣṭrākarālavadanaṃ bhīmaṃ bhairavagarjitam ||
ruṃḍamālāsamāyuktaṃ pādukoparisusthitam || 2 ||

bhadrakālīsamāyukaṃ karālaṃ hṛdivinyaset || nīlavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

dakṣabrahmasvarūpam || vīrasyadakṣabhāge tu dakṣabrahmāṇamāsthitam ||
ajavaktraṃ dvinayanaṃśṛṃgadvayavibhūṣitam || 1 ||
namaskārāṃ jaliṃvipraṃ śivadhyānaparāyaṇam || śyāmavarṇaḥ || 1 || 2 ||

(56) atha hariharadhyānam

saṃvyāṃge vidrumābhaṃśaśadharamakuṭaṃ bhasmarudrākṣabhūṣaṃ vāmāṃge śyāmalābhaṃ maṇimakuṭayutaṃ pītavastrātiśobham ||
savyeṭaṃkābhayaṃ syāditarakarayuge śaṃkhakaumodaki syāt kiṃcillālāṭanetraṃ vilasatupurataḥ śrīharerardhadeham || 1 ||

savyeṭaṃkaṃ parasmin kaṭakasujalajaṃ siṃdhuveṇīsunaddhaṃ vāmārdhesatkirīṭaṃ rudhirajalanibhaṃ vyāghracarmāṃbarāḍhyam ||

<p. 74>

phālārdhe locanārdhākalitasamapadaṃ śubhayajñopavītaṃ haryardhaṃnaumi śaṃbhuṃsakalaśubhakaraṃ sarvasaṃpatkarāḍhyam || 2 ||

raktavarṇa īśkarabhāgaḥ || viṣṇubhāgaḥśyāmavarṇaḥ || 1 ||



(57) atha ardhanārīśvaramūrtidhyānam

caturbhujaṃ triṇetraṃ ca śivāṃśaṃdakṣapārśvake ||
vāmārdhaṃ vāmabhāge tu sīmaṃtatilakālakam || 1 ||

netrārdhaṃ tu lalāṭe tu saṃyuktaṃ dakṣiṇāṃśake ||
dakṣiṇe kuṃḍalaṃkarṇedadhaṃ vāme tu patrakam || 2 ||

kaṭyāṃvākalitaṃ vāme'bhayaṭaṃkau ca dakṣiṇe ||
varadotpalake vāmekeyūrakaṭakānvitam || 3 ||

umāṃśe tu stanaṃkuryāt svāhākārayutaṃ tu vā ||
śroṇyardhaṃ dakṣiṇe śaṃbhorvyāghracarmakṛtāṃbaram || 4 ||

umārdhaṃ kaṭisūtraṃ tu citravastraparicchadam ||
nūpurālaṃkṛtaṃ vāme savyapādaṃ tu kuṃcitam || 5 ||

svayaṃ pravālavarṇaḥ syātsukṛṣṇaṃ vāmabhāgakam ||
ardhanārīśvaraṃ proktam || īśvarabhāgoraktavarṇaḥ ||
devībhāgaśśyāmavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(58) atha kirātārjunamūrtidhyānam

caturbhujaṃ triṇetraṃ ca jaṭāmakuṭasaṃyutam ||
sarvābharaṇasaṃyuktaṃ divyāṃbarasamāvṛtam || 1 ||

dhanurbāṇayutaṃ raktaṃkṛṣṇāparaśusaṃyutam ||
upavītasamāyuktaṃ samabhaṃgatanuṃkuru || 2 ||

vāme gaurīsamāyuktaṃ dakṣiṇetvarjunaṃ sthitam ||
arjunasvarūpam || ekavaktraṃ dvinayanaṃ jaṭāmakuṭasaṃyutam ||

<p. 75>

sarvābharaṇasaṃyuktaṃ kṛtāṃjalipuṭaṃ sthitam || 1 ||
evaṃ kirātamākhyātam || devoraktavarṇaḥ || arjunaḥśyāmavarṇaḥ || 2 ||

(59) atha kaṃkālamūrtidhyānam

bhasmālepatripuṃdraṃ ruciramaṇilasatpiṃchakaṃkāladakṣaṃṭaṃkaṃ vāmekārābje dadhatamabhilasatsāṃdrasiṃdūraśobham ||
śūlaṃkṛṣṇamṛgāsya laṃbitakaraṃ baddheṃdu cūḍaṃharaṃ vaṃdedeva(-)ṛṣīśvaraiḥ parivṛtaṃvaiyyāghracarmāṃbaram || 1 ||

caturbhujaṃ triṇetraṃ ca jaṭāmakuṭasaṃyutam ||
pādayoḥ pādukāyuktaṃ kiṃcidvaigamanonmukham || 2 ||

sarvābharaṇasaṃyuktaṃ yajñasūtrottarīyakam ||
śaṃkhaṃ tu vāmakarṇe tu pakṣiṇenakrakuṃḍalam || 3 ||

kiṃcitprahasitāsyaṃ ca nānālīlāsamāvṛtam ||
churikāṃ dakṣakaṭyāṃ tu dadhānaṃ bhūtasaṃyutam || 4 ||

bhikṣānnamocanāyātamṛgapakṣyādisaṃyutam ||
devasya vāmapārśve tu mahābhūtaṃprakalpayet || 5 ||

dvibhujaṃ ca dvinetraṃ ca karālavadanānvitam ||
kapālaṃśirasi nyasya devavāme tu saṃsthitam || 6 ||

evaṃ kaṃkālamākhyātam || devoraktavarṇaḥ || bhūtaḥkṛṣṇavarṇaḥ || 2 ||


(60) atha caṃḍeśānugrahamūrtidhyānam

caṃḍeśaṃ pītavarṇaṃ yugakarasahitaṃ dakṣahaste ca ṭaṃkaṃ vāme kṛṣṇaṃdadhānaṃvarakarasahitaṃ pārvatīvāmabhāgam ||
caṃḍeśasyottamāṃge pratinihitakaraṃ dakṣabhāgetriṇetraṃ sarvālaṃkārayuktaṃ śaśiśakaladharaṃgaṃgayāyuktamīḍe || 1 ||

devasya dakṣabhāge tu caṃḍeśaṃ tuprakalpayet ||
devasya bāhumātreṇacaṃḍeśāyāma(-)ucyate || 2 ||

nyastavyomatprasādena caṃḍeśobhaktisaṃyutaḥ ||
caṃḍeśvaraṃ svarṇavarṇaṃbālabhūṣaṇabhūṣitam || 3 ||

devaṃ śirasicaṃḍasya līlayāpariśobhitam ||
caṃḍeśānugrahaṃproktam || 4 ||

devaḥ caṃḍeśaśca pītavarṇaḥ || 2 ||

(61) atha viṣāpaharamūrtidhyānam

ekavaktraṃ trinayanaṃ jaṭāmakuṭasaṃyutam ||
caturbāhuṃsuraktaṃ samṛgaṃparaśudhāriṇam || 1 ||

dakṣahaste garaṃdhṛtvāpānonmukhamadekṣaṇam ||
varadaṃ vāmahaste tu sarvālaṃkārasaṃyutam || 2 ||

devasya vāmapārśve tu devīṃ caiva tu kārayet ||
śyāmāṃdvinetrāṃdvibhujāṃtribhaṃgīṃ savyāpasavyasthitakuṃcitāṃghrim ||
kaṃṭhenipīḍya sthita savyalaṃbāṃciṃtākulāmīśvaratuṣṭidātrīm || 1 ||

pītavastrāṃdvinayanāṃvāṃchitārtha phalapradām ||
devoraktavarṇaḥ || devīśyāmavarṇā || 2 ||

(62) atha cakradānamūrtidhyānam

viṣṇusatvīśapurasthitoṃjalikarodevasya pādābjayossaṃsthāpyākṣilasatsumālyamaniśaṃ pītāṃbaraṃkaustubham ||
yastasmaidayayā paraṃ paśupatiṃpadmākṣa ityākhyayāṭaṃkaṃ kṛṣṇamṛgaṃvaraṃ ca dadhataṃcakrapradaṃtaṃbhaje || 1 ||

ekavaktraṃ triṇetraṃ ca jaṭāmakuṭasaṃyutam ||

<p. 76>

dadhameṇaṃ ca paraśuṃvaraṃ ca caiva vāmake || 2 ||

dakṣiṇe cakrasaṃyuktaṃ dātṛrūpamihocyate ||
devasya vāmabhāge tu śyāmarūpaṃ susaṃsthitam || 3 ||

sarvābharaṇasaṃyuktaṃ pītavastrottarīyakam ||
śaṃkhacakrasamāyuktamuttare cāṃjaliṃ nyaset || 4 ||

evaṃ lakṣaṇasaṃyuktaṃ viṣṇurūpamihocyate ||
devaḥśvetavarṇaḥ || viṣṇuḥśyāmavarṇaḥ || 2 ||

(63) atha vighneśvaravaraprasannamūrtidhyānam

caturbhujaṃ triṇetraṃ ca jaṭāmakuṭasaṃyutam ||
abhayaṃ śirasinyasyavaradaṃ vāmahastake || 1 ||

kṛṣṇāparaśusaṃyuktaṃ vighneśodakṣiṇe sthitaḥ ||
śayānaṃ dakṣiṇaṃpādaṃdadhaṃvāmaṃ tu laṃbitam || 2 ||

sarvābharaṇasaṃyuktaṃ śyāmavarṇaṃsuśobhitam ||
devasya vāmapārśve tu devīṃprahasitānanām || 3 ||

sarvālaṃkārasaṃyuktāṃ savyetūtpaladhāriṇīm ||
vāme varadasaṃyuktāṃ dvibhujāṃ ca triṇetrakām || 4 ||

dakṣiṇeśayitaṃ pādaṃdadhaṃ vāme tu laṃbitam ||
ekapīṭhasthitāṃ devīmumāṃskaṃdoktivatkuru || 5 ||

vighneśaṃ raktavarṇaṃ ca kirīṭamakuṭānvitam ||
namaskārāṃjalikaraṃ paśāṃkuśasamanvitam ||  (6 ||

sarvalakṣaṇasaṃyuktaṃ sarvābhīṣṭaphalapradam ||
vighnaprasādamityuktam || devodevī ca śyāmavarṇau || vighneśoraktavarṇaḥ || 3 ||

(64) atha somāskandamūrtidhyānam

udyadbhanunibhaṃcatuṣkarayutaṃ keyūrahārādibhirdivyaṃvastradharaṃ jaṭāmakuṭinaṃsaṃśobhi netratrayam ||
vāmegauriyutaṃ sukhāsamubhayormadhye kumārasthitiṃsomāskaṃdavibhuṃmṛgābhayavarān ṭaṃkaṃdadhānaṃbhaje || 1 ||

somāskaṃdeśvaraṃ proktaṃbhogaśaktisamanvitam ||
caturbhujaṃ triṇetraṃ ca jaṭāmukuṭamaṇḍitam || 2 ||

sarvābharaṇasaṃyuktaṃ varadābhayahastakam ||
kṛṣṇaṭaṃkaṃ dadhānaṃ ca dakṣiṇe vāmakepi ca || 3 ||

patraṃ tu vāmakarṇe tu dakṣiṇenakrakuḍalam ||
upavītadharaṃ caiva śayānaṃ vāmapādakam || 4 ||

laṃbitaṃ dakṣiṇaṃpādaṃ vāmegaurīsamanvitam ||
tayormadhyagataṃ skaṃdaṃ sarvalakṣaṇasaṃyutam || 5 ||

somāskaṃdamiti proktaṃ gaṃgācaṃdrasamanvitam ||
somāskaṃdasya pārśve tu bhogaśaktiśca vāmake || 6 ||

<p. 77>

vīraṃ tu dakṣiṇepārśvecāsīnaṃ vā sthitaṃ tu vā ||
paṃcaviṃśatimūrtīnāṃ somāskaṃdomahānmataḥ || 7 ||

utsavāraṃbhakāle tu somāskaṃdoviśeṣataḥ ||
dharāṃ tu kumudaṃ devīṃ vāmevaradasaṃyutām || 8 ||

śayānaṃdakṣiṇaṃpādaṃ vāmapādaṃ tu laṃbitam ||
skaṃdadhyānam || 

bālarūpaṃ sthitaṃ skaṃdaṃdvinetraṃ dvibhujānvitam ||
saralābjadharaṃhaste sarvābharaṇabhūṣitam || 1 ||

somāskaṃdamiti proktam || devoraktavarṇaḥ || devīśyāmavarṇā || skaṃdonīlavarṇaḥ || 3 ||

(65) atha ekapādamūrtidhyānam

dhyāyetkoṭiraviprabhaṃ trinayanaṃśītāṃśu gaṃgādharaṃ hasteṭaṃkamṛgaṃvarābhayakaraṃ pādaikayuktaṃvibhum || 
śaṃbhordakṣiṇavāmakakṣabhujayorbrahmācyutābhayāṃ sthitaṃ tattallakṣaṇamāyudhaiḥ parivṛtaṃ hastadvayāḍhyāṃjalim || 1 ||

brahmāṃḍapralayesusaṃsthitapadaṃ brahmāṃḍamadhyasthitaṃ hyevaṃ lakṣaṇasaṃyutaṃ puraharaṃpādaikamūrtīkṛtam ||
ekapādamitikhyātaṃ sukhāsinam || raktavarṇaḥ || pakṣāṃtare śvetavarnopi prasiddhaḥ || 1 ||

(66) atha sukhāsīnamūrtidhyānam

aruṇābhasubhasmavilepanadhṛddharaṇīvaraṭaṃkavarābhayadam ||
aruṇāṃbaraśobhilasachubhadaṃguṇanetrasukhāsanarūpamidam || 1 ||

caturbhujaṃ triṇetraṃ ca jaṭāmakuṭasaṃyutam ||
abhayaṃ dakṣiṇehastevaradaṃ vāmahastake || 2 ||

kṛṣṇāparaśusaṃyuktaṃ vāmadakṣiṇahastayoḥ ||
śayānaṃdakṣiṇaṃpādaṃ dadhaṃvāmaṃ tu kuṃcitam || 3 ||

umāsahitavatsarvaṃ skaṃdagaurīvivarjitam ||
sukhāsīnamiti proktam || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(67) atha dakṣiṇāmūrtidhyānam athavā vyākhyānamūrtidhyānam

bhūtivyāpāṃḍurāṃgaśśaśiśakaladharo jñānamudrākṣamālāvīṇāpustairvirājatkaratalakamaloyogapaṭṭābhirāmaḥ ||
vyākhyāpīṭheniṣaṇṇassakalamunivaraissevitaḥ suprasannassavyālaḥ kṛttivāsāssatatamavatunodakṣiṇāmūrtirīśaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 78>

nāradojamadagniśca vasiṣṭhabhṛgudakṣiṇe ||
bharadvājaśśaunakaścāpyagastyobhārgavastathā || 2 ||

vāmabhāge vidhātavyāḥ kinnarādyaissusevite ||
kailāsaparvate tasmin vaṭavṛkṣasyamūlake || 3 ||

āsīnaṃ sakaleśaṃ tu śāṃtarūpaṃ maheśvaram ||
dakṣiṇāmūrtimityuktam || adho'pasmāraṃśāyayet ||
śubhravarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(68) atha liṃgodbhavamūrtidhyānam

liṃgākārasyamadhye tu caṃdraśekharavatsthitam ||
nālakādhasthitaṃ pādaṃliṃgodbhavasamanvitam || 1 ||

viriṃcirhaṃsarūpeṇacodhrvagovāmapārśvake ||
dakṣevarāharūpasya rūpeṇādhogatohariḥ || 2 ||

vāmadakṣiṇamārśvasthau kṛtāṃjalisamanvitau ||
svarūpeṇadvipādasthāvajaviṣṇūvibhoḥpare || 3 ||

evaṃ liṃgāvatāraṃ tu sarvaśāṃtikaraṃ sadā ||
tuṃgāṃgavistṛtinatāṃsakalaṃbamānaissaṃpanna cihnabhujabhūṣaṇavarṇabhedaiḥ ||
śobhānvitaṃ śubhakaraṃsakalaprajānāmaiśvarya saṃghaparivṛddhikaraṃvidadhyāt || 1 ||
pakṣāṃtare śubhravarṇopi prasiddhaḥ || 1 ||

(69) atha śarabhamūrtidhyānam

mahāmerusamākāramaṣṭapādaṃ raviprabham ||
dvātriṃśadbāhusaṃyuktaṃ sūryasomāgnilocanam || 1 ||

durgākāladvipakṣaṃ ca sutīkṣṇaghanagarjitam ||
ūdhrvakeśaṃ mahābāhuṃ nānālaṃkārabhūṣitam || 2 ||

vajramuṣṭyabhayaṃcakraṃ śaktiṃdaṃḍāṃkusau tathā ||
khaḍgakhaṭvāṃgaparaśūnakṣamālāsthi śūlakam || 3 ||

dhanuśca musalaṃcāgniṃ dadhānaṃdakṣiṇaiḥkaraiḥ ||
varadaṃpāśahastaṃ ca gadāṃbāṇadhvajau tathā || 4 ||

krakacaṃkroḍaśaṃkhau ca khetaṃnāgaṃ ca paṃkajam ||
kapālaṃ pustakaṃkuṃtaṃ durgāśliṣṭakarāṃbujam || 5 ||

halaṃvāme dadhānaṃ ca bhīṣaṇaṃkarapaṃkajaiḥ ||
daṃṣṭrollāsaṃ mahāsiṃhacchaṭācchaṭanipīḍitam || 6 ||

raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

atha dvātriṃśadgaṇapatināmāni (mudgalapurāṇe)

bālastaruṇabhaktau ca vīraśśaktirdvijastathā ||
siddha(-)ucchiṣṭavighneśaukṣiproheraṃbanāmakaḥ || 1 ||

lakṣmīgaṇapatiścaiva mahāvighneśvarastathā ||
vijayaḥkalpanṛttaścāpyūrdhva vighneśa(-)ucyate || 2 ||

ekākṣarovaraścaiva tryakṣaraḥkṣipradāyakaḥ ||

<p. 79>

haridrākhyaścaikadaṃtassṛṣṭiruddaṃḍanāmakaḥ || 3 ||

ṛṇamocanakoḍhuṃḍirdvimukhastrimukhastathā ||
siṃhoyogaśca durgā ca devassaṃkaṭahārakaḥ || 4 ||

dvātriṃśadvighnarājākhyāsteṣāṃ dhyānamathocyate ||

<p. 79>

(70) tatrādau bālagaṇapatidhyānam

karasthakadalīcūtapanasekṣukamodakam ||
bālasūryamimaṃvaṃde devaṃbālagaṇādhipam || 1 || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(71) atha taruṇagaṇapatidhyānam

pāśāṃkuśāpūpakapittha jaṃbūsvadaṃtaśālīkṣumapi svahastaiḥ ||
dhatte sadāyastaruṇāruṇābhaḥ pāyātsayuṣmāṃstaruṇogaṇeśaḥ || 1 || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(72) atha bhaktagaṇapatidhyānam

nālikerāmrakadalīguḍapāyasadhāriṇam ||
śaraccandrābhavapuṣaṃbhaje bhaktagaṇādhipam || 1 || śvetavarṇaḥ ||(1 ||

(73) atha vīragaṇapatidhyānam

betālaśaktiśarakārmukacakrakhaḍgakhaṭvāṃgamudgaragadāṃkuśanāgapāśān ||
śūlaṃ ca kuṃtaparaśudhvajamudvahaṃtaṃ vīraṃgaṇeśamaruṇaṃ satataṃsmarāmi || 1 || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(74) atha śaktigaṇapatidhyānam

āliṃgyadevīṃharitāṃgayaṣṭiṃ parasparaśliṣṭakaṭipradeśam ||
saṃdhyāruṇaṃ pāśasṛṇīvahaṃtaṃ bhayāpahaṃ śaktigaṇeśamīḍe || 1 || siṃdūravarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(75) atha dvijagaṇapatidhyānam

yaṃ pustakākṣaguṇadaṃḍakamaṃḍalu śrīvidyotamānakarabhūṣaṇamiṃduvarṇam ||
staṃberamānanacatuṣṭayaśomamānaṃtvāṃyaḥ smareddijagaṇādhipatesadhanyaḥ || 1 || śubhravarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(76) atha siddhagaṇapatidhyānam

pakvacūtaphalapuṣpamaṃjarīrikṣudaṃḍatilamodakaissaha ||
udvahanparaśumastu tenamaśrīsamṛddhiyuta hemapiṃgala || 1 || piṃgalavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 80>

(77) atha ucchiṣṭagaṇapatidhyānam

nīlābjadāḍimī vīṇāśāliguṃjākṣasūtrakam ||
dadhaducchiṣṭanāmāyaṃ gaṇeśaḥ pātumecakaḥ || 1 ||

prakārāṃtareṇa nārīyonirasāsvādalolupaṃ kāmamohitam || nīlavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(78) atha vighnagaṇapatidhyānam

śaṃkhekṣucāpakusumeṣukuṭhārapāśacakrasvadaṃtasṛṇimaṃjarikā śarādyaiḥ ||
pāṇiśritaiḥ parisamīhitabhūṣaṇaśrīrvighneśvarovijayateta panīyagauraḥ || 1 || svarṇavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(79) atha kṣipragaṇapatidhyānam

daṃtakalpalatāpāśaratnakuṃbhāṃkuśojjvalam ||
baṃdhūkakamanīyābhaṃ dhyāyet kṣipragaṇādhipam || 1 || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(80) atha heraṃbagaṇapatidhyānam

abhayavaradahastaḥ pāśadaṃtākṣamālāsṛṇiparaśudadhānomudgaraṃmodakaṃ ca ||
phalamadhigatasiṃhaḥ paṃcamātaṃgavaktrogaṇapatiratigauraḥ pātuheraṃbanāmā || 1 || gauravarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(81) atha lakṣmigaṇapatidhyānam

bibhrāṇaśśukabījapūrakamilanmāṇikya kuṃbhāṃkuśān pāśaṃkalpalatāṃ ca khaḍgavilasajjyotissudhānirjharaḥ ||
śyāmenāttasaroruheṇasahitaṃ devīdvayaṃcāṃtike gorāṃgauvaradānahastasahitolakṣmī gaṇeśovatāt || gauravarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(82) atha mahāgaṇapatidhyānam

hastīṃdrānanamiṃdu cūḍamaruṇacchāyaṃ triṇetraṃrasādāśliṣṭaṃ priyayāsapadmakarayāsvāṃkasthayā saṃtatam ||
bījāpūragadekṣukārmukalasaccakrābjapāśotpalavrīhyagrasvaviṣāṇaratnakalaśān(-)hastairvahaṃtaṃbhaje || 1 || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(83) atha vijayagaṇapatidhyānam

pāśāṃkuśasvadaṃtāmraphalavānākhuvāhanaḥ ||
vighnaṃnihaṃtunassarvaṃ raktavarṇo vināyakaḥ || 1 || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 81>

(84) atha nṛttagaṇapatidhyānam

pāśāṃkuśāpūpakūṭhāradaṃtacaṃcatkarākḷpta varāṃgulīkam ||
pītaprabhaṃkalpataroradhasthaṃbhajāmi nṛttopapadaṃgaṇeśam || 1 || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(85) atha ūdhrvagaṇapatidhyānam

kahlāraśālikamalekṣukacāpabāṇadaṃtaprarohakagadikanakojjvalāṃgaḥ ||
āliṃganodyatakaroharitāṃga yaṣṭyādevyākarotu śubhamūrdhvagaṇādhipome || 1 || kanakavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(86) atha ekākṣaragaṇapatidhyānam

raktoraktāṃgarāgāṃśukakusumayutastuṃdilaścaṃdramaulirnetrairyuktastribhirvāmanakaracaraṇobījapūraṃdadhānaḥ ||
hastāgrākḷpta pāśāṃkuśaradavaradonāgavaktro hi bhūṣodevaḥ padmāsanasthobhavatu sukhakarobhūtaye vighnarājaḥ || 1 || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(87) atha varagaṇapatidhyānam

siṃdūrābhamibhānanaṃ trinayanaṃ haste ca pāśāṃkuśaubibhrāṇaṃ madhumatkapālamaniśaṃsādhviṃdumauliṃbhaje ||
puṣṭyāśliṣṭatanuṃ dhvajāgrakarayāpadmollasaddhastayā tadyonyā hitapāṇimāttavasumatpātrollasatpuṣkaram || 1 || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(88) atha tryakṣaragaṇapatidhyānam

gajeṃdravadanaṃ sākṣāccalatkarṇasucāmaram ||
hemavarṇaṃ caturbāhuṃpāśāṃkuśadharaṃvaram || 1 ||

svadaṃtaṃ dakṣiṇehaste savyetvāmraphalaṃ tathā ||
puṣkarairmodakaṃ caiva dhārayaṃtamanusmaret || 2 || svarṇavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(89) atha kṣipraprasādagaṇapatidhyānam

dhṛtapāśāṃkuśakalpalatā svaradaśca bījapūrayutaḥ ||
śaśiśakalakalitamaulistrilocanoruṇaśca gajavadanaḥ || 1 ||

bhāsurabhūṣaṇadīptobṛhadudaraḥ padmaviṣṭarollasitaḥ ||
vighnapayodhrapavanaḥkaradhṛtakamalassadāstume bhūtyai || 2 || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 82>

(90) atha haridrāgaṇapatidhyānam

haridrābhaṃ caturbāhuṃ haridrāvadanaṃprabhum ||
pāśāṃkuśaudharaṃ devaṃ modakaṃdaṃtameva ca || 1 ||

bhaktābhayapradātāraṃvaṃde vighnavināśanam || haridrāvarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(91) atha ekadaṃtagaṇapatidhyānam

laṃbodaraṃ śyāmatanuṃ gaṇeśaṃ kuṭhāramakṣasrajamūrdhvagātram ||
salaḍḍukaṃdaṃtamadhaḥ karābhyāṃ vāmetarābhyāṃ ca dadhānamīḍe || 1 || śyāmavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(92) atha sṛṣṭigaṇapatidhyānam

pāśāṃkuśasvadaṃtāmraphalavānākhuvāhanaḥ ||
vighnaṃnihaṃtu naśśoṇaḥ sṛṣṭidakṣovināyakaḥ || 1 || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(93) atha uddaṃḍagaṇapatidhyānam

kalhārāṃbujabījapūrakagadādaṃtekṣucāpaṃsumaṃbibhrāṇomaṇikuṃbhaśālikala(-)śaupāśaṃ sṛṇiṃcābjakam ||
gaurāṃgyārucirāraviṃdakarayā devyā samāliṃgitaśśoṇāṃgaśśubhamātano tu bhajatāmuddaṃḍavighneśvaraḥ || 1 || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(94) atha ṛṇamocakagaṇapatidhyānam

pāśāṃkuśaudaṃta jaṃbudadhānassphaṭikaprabhaḥ ||
raktāṃśukogaṇapatirmude syādṛṇamocakaḥ || 1 || śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(95) atha ḍhuṃḍigaṇapatidhyānam

akṣamālāṃkuṭhāraṃ ca ratnapātraṃsvadaṃtakam ||
dhattekarairvighnarājoḍhuṃḍināmāmudestunaḥ || 1 || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(96) atha dvimukhagaṇapatidhyānam

svadaṃtapāśāṃkuśaratnapātraṃ karairdadhānoharinīlagātraḥ ||
raktāṃśukoratnakirīṭamālībhūtyai sadāmedvimukhogaṇeśaḥ || 1 || haridvarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(97) atha trimukhagaṇapatidhyānam

śrīmattīkṣṇaśikhāṃkuśākṣavaradāndakṣedadhānaḥ karaiḥ pāśaṃcāmṛta pūrṇakuṃbhamabhayaṃ vāmedadhānomudā ||

<p. 83>

pīṭhe svarṇamayāraviṃdavilasatsatkarṇikābhāsure svāsīnastrimukhaḥ palāśarucironāgānanaḥ pātunaḥ || 1 || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(98) atha siṃhagaṇapatidhyānam

vīṇāṃkalpalatāmariṃ ca varadaṃdakṣevidhattekarairvāmetāmarasaṃcaratnakalaśaṃ sanmaṃjarīṃcābhayam ||
śuṃḍādaḍalasanmṛgeṃdravadanaḥ śaṃkheṃdugauraḥśubhodīvyadratnanibhāṃśukogaṇapatiḥ pāyādapāyātsanaḥ || 1 || śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(99) atha yogagaṇapatidhyānam

yogārūḍhoyogapaṭṭābhirāmovālārkābhaśceṃdranīlāṃśukāḍhyaḥ ||
pāśekṣvakṣānyogadaṃḍaṃdadhānopāyānnityaṃ yogavighneśvaronaḥ || 1 || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(100) atha durgāgaṇapatidhyānam

taptakāṃcanasaṃkāśaścāṣṭahastomahattanuḥ || dīptāṃkuśaṃśaraṃcākṣaṃdaṃtaṃ dakṣevahankaraiḥ || 1 ||

vāme pāśaṃkārmukaṃ calatāṃjaṃbudadhatkaraiḥ ||
raktāṃśukassadābhūyāddurgāgaṇapatirmude || 2 || kanakavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(101) atha saṃkaṣṭaharagaṇapatidhyānam

bālārkāruṇakāṃtirvāme bālāṃvahannaṃke ||
lasadiṃdīvarahastāṃgaurāṃgīṃ ratnaśobhāḍhyām || 1 ||

dakṣeṃkuśavaradānaṃ vāme pāśaṃ ca pāyasaṃpātram ||
nīlāṃśukalasamānaḥ pīṭhepadmāruṇe tiṣṭhan || 2 ||
saṃkaṭaharaṇaḥpāyātsaṃkaṭapūgādgajānanonityam || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

atha saptadaśasubrahmaṇyānāṃdhyānam (śaivāgameśekhare)

(102) tatrādau jñānaśaktisu brahmaṇyadhyānam

ekavaktraṃ dvinetraṃ ca jaṭāmakuṭasaṃyutam ||
śvetārkapuṣpamālaṃ ca hemaratnakirīṭinam || 1 ||

caturbhujairvajraśaktikukkuṭābhayadhāriṇam ||
divyagaṃdhānuliptāṃgaṃ śuklayajñopavītinam || 2 ||

śivaśaktijñānayogaṃ jñānaśaktisvarūpakam || śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 84>

(103) atha skaṃdasubrahmaṇyadhyānam

caturbhujaṃ dvinetraṃ ca śvetapadmāsanasthitam ||
kukkuṭābhayavajrāṇi dadhataṃ varadaṃ kare || 1 ||

kiṃcit keśaśikhābaddhapuṣpamālābhirāvṛtam ||
mekhalāṃbarasaṃvītaṃ ratnabhūṣaṇabhūṣitam || 2 ||

dhūmravarṇaprabhaṃ skaṃdaṃprabhāmaṇḍalamaṃḍitam || skaṃdarūpamidaṃproktam || dhūmravarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(104) atha agnijātasubrahmaṇyadhyānam

dvimukhaṃcāṣṭabāhuṃ ca śvetaṃbāśyāmakaṃdadham ||
sruvākṣamālāṃkhaḍgaṃ ca svastikaṃdakṣiṇekare || 1 ||

kukkuṭaṃ kheṭakaṃvajramājyapātraṃ tu vāmake ||
agnihotravidhiṃ devamagnijātasvarūpakam || 2 ||
nīlavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(105) atha saurabheyasubrahmaṇyadhyānam

caturvaktrāṣṭanayanaṃ bhujāṣṭakamalāsanam ||
kuṃcitaṃ vāmapādaṃ ca susthitaṃ dakṣiṇaṃ padam || 1 ||

śaktyutpale puṣpabāṇamabhayaṃ dakṣiṇe kare ||
vajraṃ cekṣudhanuśśūlaṃ varadaṃ vāmake dadham || 2 ||

padmapuṣpanibhaṃ caiva saurabheyasvarūpakam || pāṭalavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(106) atha gāṃgeyasubrahmaṇyadhyānam

ekavaktraṃ trinayanaṃdāḍimīkusumaprabham ||
karaṃḍamukuṭopetaṃ kukkuṭadhvajadhāriṇam || 1 ||

nīlotpaladharaṃvande makarārūḍhamavyayam ||
paraśuṃpūrṇakuṃbhaṃ ca savyahaste tu dhāriṇam || 2 ||

araṇiṃkukkuṭaṃ vāmegāṃgeyasamarūpakam || pāṭalavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(107) atha śaravaṇodbhavasubrahmaṇyadhyānam

ṣaḍbhujaṃ caikavadanaṃ bālasūryasamaprabham ||
sarvābharaṇasaṃyuktaṃ siṃhasthaṃ dadhataṃbhaje || 1 ||

triṇetraṃbhasitoddhūlaṃ puṣpabāṇekṣukārmukam ||
khaḍgaṃkhetaṃ ca vajraṃ ca kukkuṭadhvajadhāriṇam || 2 ||

śarajanmasamākhyātam || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(108) atha kārtikeyasubrahmaṇyadhyānam

triṇetraṃdaśahastaṃ ca mastakebilvadhāriṇam ||
śaktiṃśūlaṃ tathā ca kramaṃkuśābhayamanyake || 1 ||

<p. 85>

varadaṃtomaraṃpāśaṃ śaṃkhaṃvajra ca vāmake ||
mayuravāhanārūḍhaṃ sarvābharaṇabhūṣitam || 2 ||

bālasūryapratīkāśaṃ kārtikeyaṃ śivātmajam || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(109) atha kumārasubrahmaṇyadhyānam

caturbhujaṃcaikavaktraṃkaraṃḍamukuṭānvitam ||
śaktiṃcābhayadadaṃkṣe savyevaradavajrake || 1 ||

padmapuṣpaṃdharaṃ kaṃṭhedevaṃbālasvarupakam || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(110) atha paṇmukhasubrahmaṇyadhyānam

śaktiṃśaraṃ ca khaḍgaṃ ca cakraṃpāśābhayau tathā ||
kukkuṭaṃ ca dhanuḥkheṭaṃśaṃkhaṃdhattehalaṃvaram || 1 ||

mayūravāhanopetaṃ sarvalakṣaṇasaṃyutam ||
jayā ca vijayā caiva vāmadakṣiṇapārśvayoḥ || 2 ||

sarvālaṃkārasaṃyuktaṃ sarvābharaṇabhūṣitam ||
ṣaṇmukhaṃ cetivikhyātam || raktavarṇaḥ ||

(111) atha tārakādisubrahmaṇyadhyānam

ekavaktraṃ trinayanaṃ gajapṛṣṭhoparisthitam ||
ṣaṇmukhaṃcābhayaṃ khaḍgaṃ śaktiṃ vāmetaredadham || 1 ||

kheṭakaṃcākṣamālāṃ ca kukkuṭaṃ vāmahastake ||
tārakāriṃbhajekhyātam || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(112) atha senānīsubrahmaṇyadhyānam

ekavaktraṃ dvinayanaṃśaṃkhacakravarābhayān ||
sarvāvaraṇasaṃyuktaṃ divyagaṃdhānulepanam || 1 ||

śyāmavarṇaṃ prabhuṃ caivaśuklayajñopavītinam ||
susmitaṃcāruvadanaṃ devasenāpatiṃbhaje || 2 || śyāmavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(113) atha guhasutrabrahmaṇyadhyānam

caturbhujaṃtriṇetraṃ ca hemaratnakirīṭanan ||
śūlaṃ vajraṃdharaṃ savyevarābhayakamanyake || 1 ||

śvetavastradharaṃ devaṃ sarveṣāṃrakṣaṇonmukham ||
jāyayā vāmapārśve tu kalyāṇotsavavigraham || 2 ||

pādāṃbujaṃ hṛdidhyāttvāguharūpaṃsamāśraye || śyāmavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(114) atha brahmacārisubrahmaṇyadhyānam

dvinetraṃ dvibhujaṃ caiva bālasūryadharaṃprabhum ||
dakṣabhāge daṃḍahastaṃ vajravāmoruhastakam || 1 ||

<p. 83>

savyāpasavyapādaṃ tu sthitaṃ vā kuṃcitaṃ tu vā ||
śikhāyajñopavītāḍhyaṃmauṃjīkaupīnasaṃyutam || 2 ||

mekhaloparivaḍyāṇaṃraktapadmoparisthitam ||
divyarūpadharaṃ devaṃ brahmacāriṇamāśraye || 3 || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(115) atha deśikasubrahmaṇyadhyānam

ṣaḍbhujaṃcaikavadanaṃ karaṃḍamakuṭānvitam ||
śaktihastadvayaṃ caiva japamālādharaṃśubham || 1 ||

mayūravāhanārūḍhaṃ varābhayakarāṃbujam ||
ityevaṃ vidhivaddhyāyecchiva devasyadeśikam || 2 || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(116)  atha krauṃcabhedanasubrahmaṇyadhyānam

caturbhujaṃtriṇetraṃ ca sthitaṃ siṃhāsanopari ||
varadābhayasaṃyuṃktapuṣpabāṇekṣukārmukam || 1 ||

mayūravāhanārūḍhaṃ namasyerakṣaṇonmukham ||
krauṃcabhedakara dvaṃdvaṃkrauṃca bhedisvarūpakam || 2 || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(117) atha śikhivāhanasubrahmaṇyadhyānam

caturbhujaṃcaikavaktraṃ triṇetramabhayaṃvaram ||
pāśāṃkuśaṃdadhaṃ caiva jvalākeśaśikhaṃḍakam || 1 ||

indranīlarathārūḍhaṃ raktottpalasamaprabham ||
caturdaśādibhavanaṃ śikhivāhanamācaret || 2 || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(118) atha velāyudhasubrahmaṇyadhyānam

kalpadrumaṃ praṇamatāṃkamalāruṇābhaṃ skaṃdaṃ bhujadvikamanāmayamekavaktram ||
kātyāyanīsutamahaṃ kaṭibaddhavāmahastaṃ ca daṃḍadharadakṣiṇahastamīḍe || 1 || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(119) atha vīrabhadradhyānam  (pāṃcarātre)

nīlavarṇaṃ triṇetraṃ ca khaḍgabāṇadhanurgadāḥ ||
dadhataṃ ruṃḍamālāṃ ca pādukādvayasaṃyutam || 1 ||

dakṣiṇaṃpītavasanaṃ vīrabhadramupāsmahe || nīlavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(120) atha svarṇākarṣaṇabhairavadhyānam (tatkalpe)

pītavarṇaṃ caturbāhuṃ triṇetraṃpītavāsasam ||
akṣayasvarṇamāṇikyagaṇapūritapātrakam || 1 ||

<p. 87>

aṃsāhitamahāśūla cāmaraṃtomarodvaham ||
satataṃ ciṃtayed bhaktyābhairavaṃ sarvasiddhidam || 2 ||

nānābharaṇaśobhāḍhyamānaṃdasukharūpiṇam ||
madonmattaṃ sadānaṃdaṃ sarvadevanamaskṛtam || 3 ||

evaṃ dhyāyecca maṃtrajñaḥ svarṇākarṣaṇabhairavam || pītavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(121) atha vaṭukabhairavadhyānam (tatkalpe)

vikīrṇalohitajaṭaṃ triṇetraṃ raktavigraham ||
śūlaṃ kapālaṃpāśaṃ ca ḍamuruṃdadhataṃkaraiḥ || 1 ||

nānārūpaiḥ piśācaiśca nānārūpagaṇairvṛtam ||
śvānārūḍhaṃ ca nirvāṇaṃ vadukaṃ bhairavaṃbhaje || 2 || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(122) atha mallāriśivadhyānam (mallārimāhātmye)

mukuṭamaṇimayūkhaprojjhitā śeṣaratnaṃ vimalaśaśikalāṃkaṃ suṃdareṃdīvarākṣam ||
anukṛtaśaśitejaḥ kuṃḍalaṃ cāruhāsaṃ prakaṭadaśanaśobhānirjitāneka hīram || 1 ||

abhinavamaṇimuktāhāra cāṃpeyamālāvividha kusumagucchaiḥ śobhivakṣasthalāḍhyam ||
saphaṇapavanabhugdordaṃḍabhūṣābhirāmaṃkara ḍamaruninādaiḥ pūritadyokhagarbham || 2 ||

tribhuvanabhavaneśaṃ pītakauśeyavāsaṃdanujadahanadakṣaṃ prasphuratkhaḍgahastam ||
bhujagaphaṇasuguptairbhūṣaṇairnyastabhūṣaṃpraṇata surakirīṭavyāptapā dāraviṃdam || 3 ||

sitahayavarapatraṃ hārasaṃbhūṣitāṃgaṃ parivṛtamatighoraiḥ saptabhiḥsārameyaiḥ ||
kanakagirisamābhaṃnaiśacūrṇābhirāmaṃ sakalanigamaguhyaṃ naumimallāridevam || 4 || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(123) atha caṃḍeśadhyānam    (kāraṇāgame)

kṛṣṇaṃsubhadracaturānana miṃducūḍaṃ śārdūlacarmavasanaṃ jaṭilaṃtriṇetram ||
ṭaṃkaṃca śūlamabhayaṃjapamālikāṃ ca bibrāṇamekamanasāsatataṃ smarāmi || 1 || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(124) atha pāśupatāstradhyānam (śaivāgame)

caturvatkraṃ caturbāhuṃ sūryakoṭisamaprabham ||
saṃhārābhaṃsumūrdhānaṃ prativatkraṃ trilocanam || 1 ||

dīptadaṃtāgrakeśabhruśmaśrubhīmaṃmahābalam ||
śaktimudgaraśaṃkhāsīn dadhānaṃ somasūtriṇam || 2 ||

sāṃgaṃpāśupataṃ śastraṃbhaje padmāsane sthitam || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 88>

(125) atha khaḍgarāvaṇadhyānam (pāṃcarātre)

lohitāṃgaṃ caṃdramauliṃ paṃcavaktraṃ trilocanam ||
ghaṃṭāṃkapālaṃ ca sṛṇiṃmuḍaṃ cāpikṛpāṇakam || 1 ||

kheṭakhaṭvāṃgaśūlāni ḍamuraṃ ca tathābhayam ||
dadhānaṃ raktavasanaṃbhajehaṃ khaḍgarāvaṇam || 2 || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

atha bairavāṣṭāṣṭakadhyānam (rudrayāmale)

itaḥparaṃ pravakṣyāmi śṛṇurājannaśeṣataḥ ||
aṣṭāṣṭakamidaṃ puṇyaṃ bhairavāṇāmabhīṣṭadam || 1 ||

pūrvavadvarṇatodhyāne dhyeyaṃ sarvaiḥ pṛthak pṛthak || 64 ||

(126) tatrādau prathamāṣṭakadhyānam

adyāṣṭakaṃ suvarṇābhaṃ triśūlaṃḍamaruṃ tathā ||
pāśaṃ cāsiṃdadhānaṃ ca dhyāyetsarvāṅgasuṃdaram || 1 || kanakavarṇam || 8 ||

(127) atha dvitīyāṣṭakadhyānam

atha dvitīyakaṃ dhyāyedakṣamālāmathāṃkuśam ||
dadhānaṃpustakaṃ vīṇāṃsuśvetamaṇibhūṣaṇam || 1 || śvetavarṇam || 8 ||

(128) atha tṛtīyāṣṭakadhyānam

jvālāṃśaktiṃ gadāṃkuṃtaṃdadhānaṃ nīlavarṇakam ||
dhyāyettṛtīyaṃ śubhadamaṣṭakaṃśubhalakṣaṇam || 1 || nīlavarṇam || 1 ||

(129) atha caturthāṣṭakadhyānam

khaḍgaṃkheṭaṃ padṛsaṃ ca dadhānaṃparaśuṃ tathā ||
dhūmravarṇamabhipretaṃ dhyāyedaṣṭakamādarāt || 1 ||

kuṃtaṃ kheṭaṃ ca parighaṃbhiṃḍivālaṃ tathaiva ca || dhūmravarṇam || 8 ||

(130) atha paṃcamāṣṭakadhyānam

paṃcamāṣṭakametadviśvetaṃ syātsumanoharam || śvetavarṇam || 1 || 8 ||

(131) atha ṣaṣṭhasaptamāṣṭamāṣṭakānāṃdhyānam

pītaṣṣaṣṭhamṛṣariktamaṣṭamaṃ ca taṭitprabham ||
paṃcamāṣṭakametaddhiśvetaṃ syātsumanoharam || 1 ||

kuntādikaṃ samaṃproktaṃ ṣaḍārabhyāṣṭamāṃtakam ||
krameṇapītaraktataṭidvarṇāḥ || 24 ||

<p. 89>

atha catuṣṣaṣṭibhairavāṇāṃ nāmāni

asitāṃgoviśālākṣomārtāṃḍomodaka priyaḥ ||
svacchaṃdovighnasaṃtuṣṭaḥ khecaraḥ sacarācaraḥ || 1 ||

ruruścakroḍadaṃṣṭraśca tathaiva ca jaṭādharaḥ ||
viśvarūpovirūpākṣo nānārūpadharaḥparaḥ || 2 ||

vajrahastomahākāyo caṃḍaśca pralayāṃtakaḥ ||
bhūmikaṃponīlakaṃṭho viṣṇuśca kulapālakaḥ || 3 ||

muṃḍapālaḥ kāmapālaḥ krodho vai piṃgalekṣaṇaḥ ||
abhrarūpodharāpālaḥ kuṭilomaṃtranāyakaḥ || 4 ||

rudraḥ pitāmahākhyaścāpyunmattovaṭunāyakaḥ ||
śaṃkarobhūtavetālotriṇetrastripurāṃtakaḥ || 5 ||

varadaḥ parvatāvāsaḥ kapālaḥ śaśibhūṣaṇaḥ ||
hasticarmāṃbaradharoyogīśo brahmarākṣasaḥ || 6 ||

sarvajñaḥ sarvadeveśaḥ sarvabhūta hṛdisthitaḥ ||
bhīṣaṇākhyobhayaharassarvajñākhyastathaiva ca || 7 ||

kālāgniśca mahāraudro dakṣiṇomukharo'sthiraḥ ||
saṃhāraścātiriktāṃgokālāgniśca priyaṃkaraḥ || 8 ||

ghoranādoviśālākṣoyogīśodakṣasaṃsthitaḥ || 64 ||

[iti śrīmatsamastabhūmaṃḍalamaṃḍanāyamānanikhiladeśāvataṃ sakarnāṭakajanapadasaṃpadadhiṣṭhānabhūta śrīmanmahīśūramahāsaṃsthāna madhyadedīpyamānāvikalakalānidhikulakramāgata rājakṣitipālapramukhanikhilarājādhirājamahārājacakravartimaṃḍalānubhūtadivya(-)ratnasiṃhāsanārūḍha śrīmadrājādhirājarājaparameśvara prauḍhapratāpā pratimavīranarapatibirudeteṃbaragaṃḍalokaika vīrayadukulapayaḥ pārāvārakalānidhiśaṃkhacakrāṃkuśakuṭhāramakaramatsya śarabhasālvagaṃḍabheruṃḍadharaṇīvarāhahanumadgaruḍakaṃṭhīravādyaneka virudāṃkitamahīśūrapuravarādhīśa śrīkṛṣṇarājamahārājaviracite śrītattvanidhyākhyagraṃthe mahākailāsamūrtyādiśivamūrtisvarūpanirūpaṇaṃnāmatṛtīyaśśivanidhissaṃ(-)pūrṇaḥ] || 3 ||

[iti śrītattvanidhyākhyagranthe mahākailāsamūrtyādi svarūpanirūpaṇaṃ nāmaśivanidhissampūrṇaḥ] ||

<p. 90>

iti

[śrī tattvanidhyākhyagranthe mahākailāsamūrtyādisvarūpanirūpaṇaṃ nāmaśivanidhissaṃpūrṇaḥ] ||


śrīḥ |

atha

[śrītattvanidhau

caturthobrahmanidhiḥ] |

(1) atha caturmukhadhyānam (śaivāgame)

caturmukhaṃ caturbāhuṃkamaṃḍalvakṣadhāriṇam ||
yajñasūtrottarīyaṃ ca jaṭāmakuṭasaṃyutam || 1 ||

savyahaste kṣamālāṃ ca vāmahaste kamaṃḍalum ||
sruvaṃ dakṣiṇahaste ca pustakaṃ vāmahastake || 2 ||

aṃbujāsanamāsīnaṃ dhyānasaṃmīlite kṣaṇam ||
padmapatradalāgrābhaṃ dhyāyedevaṃ caturmukham || 3 || pāṭalavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(2) atha sarasvatīdhyānam (nṛsiṃhaprāsāde)

devī sarasvatīkāryā sarvābharaṇabhūṣitā ||
caturbhujā sā kartavyā tathaiva ca samasthitā || 1 ||

pustakaṃ cākṣamālāṃ ca tasyādakṣiṇahastayoḥ ||
vāmayośca tathā kārye vaiṇavī ca kamaṃḍaluḥ || 2 ||

samapādāpratiṣṭhāpyākāryā saumyamukhīsitā || śvetavarṇā || 1 ||

atha paṃcabrahmaṇāṃdhyānam (nṛsiṃhaprāsāde)

(3) tatrādau ādyabrahmadhyānam

brahmāṇaṃ kārayedvidvāndevaṃ saumyaṃ caturmukham ||
baddhapadmāsanaṃ tuṣṭaṃ tathā kṛṣṇājināṃbaram || 1 ||

jaṭādharaṃ caturbāhuṃ saptahaṃsarathasthitam ||
vāmanyaste tarakaraṃ tasyaikaṃdoryugaṃ bhavet || 2 ||

ekasmin dakṣiṇe pāṇāvakṣamālāṃ tu bibhratam ||
kamaṃḍaluṃ dvitīye ca sarvābharaṇadhāriṇam || 3 ||

sarvalakṣaṇasaṃyuktaṃśāṃtarūpaṃ ca pārthiva ||
padmapatradalāgrābhaṃ dhyānasaṃmīlite kṣaṇam || 4 ||

ācāryaḥ kārayedevaṃ citre vā vāstukarmaṇi || pāṭalavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 90>

(4) atha lokapālabrahmadhyānam

padmapatrāsanasthaśca brahmākāryaścaturmukhaḥ ||
ādityavarṇodharmajñassākṣasūtradharastathā || 1 ||

rūpaṃ pūrvoditaṃkāryaṃ sarvamanyajjagatpateḥ || pāṭalavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(5) atha prajāpatibrahmadhyānam

haṃsayānena kartavyo na ca kāryaścaturmukhaḥ ||
sāvitrī tasya kartavyāvāmotsaṃgagatā śubhā || 1 ||

brahmoktaṃ paramaṃrūpaṃ sarvaṃ kāryaṃ prajāpateḥ || pāṭalavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(6) atha vidhibrahmadhyānam

viśvakarmā tu kartavyassūryarūpadharaḥ prabhuḥ ||
dvibhujodaśapāṇiśca tejomūrtidharomahān || 1 || pāṭalavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(7) atha viśvakarmabrahmadhyānam

caturvaktraścatuṣpādaścaturbāhuḥ sitāṃbaraḥ ||
sarvābharaṇavāñchāṃtodharmakārya vidavyayaḥ || 1 ||

dakṣiṇe cākṣamālāṃdadhānaṃ vāme tu pustakam ||
mūrtimān vyavasāyastu kāryodakṣiṇabhāgataḥ || 2 ||

vāmabhāgagataṃ kāryaṃmukhaṃ paramarūpavat ||
kāryau padmakaraumūrdhni vinyastau ca tathātayoḥ || 3 || pāṭalavarṇaḥ || 2 || 5 ||

atha navaprajeśvarāṇāṃ nāmāni (skāṃde lakṣmīnārāyaṇasaṃhitāyām)

marīcistvaṃgirāścātriḥ pulastyaḥ pulahaḥkratuḥ ||
kardamaḥ kaśyapodakṣonavaite brahmasūnavaḥ || 1 || 9 ||

(8) tatrādau marīcidhyānam

ādyaṃ prajeśvaraṃnaumi brahmamānasasaṃbhavam ||
akṣasrakkuṃḍikāpāṇiṃ jaṭāvalkalabhūṣitam || 1 ||

kanakācalasaṃkāśaṃ japaṃtaṃ praṇavaṃ param || kanakavarṇaḥ ||

(9) atha aṃgirodhyānam

ṛṣimāṃgirasaṃvaṃde tripuṃḍrāṃkitamastakam ||
akṣasrakkuṃḍikāhastaṃ prajeśaṃkanakaprabham || 1 || kanakavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 93>

(10) atha atridhyānam

atriṃmarīcitanayaṃsākṣasūtrakamaṃḍalum ||
jaṭilaṃśmaśrulaṃ śāṃtaṃśyāmalāṃgaṃbhaje'niśam || 1 || śyāmavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(11) atha pulastyadhyānam

pulastyaṃ śirasānaumi brahmaṇomānasaṃsutam ||
śāṃtaṃjitāriṣaḍvargamakṣasragdaṃḍahastakam || 1 ||

kṛṣṇājinottarīyaṃ ca jaṭilaṃpiṃgalaprabham || piṃgalavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(12) atha pulahadhyānam

taponidhimahaṃśāṃtaṃ pulahaṃnaumisaṃtatam ||
akṣamālāṃkuṃḍikāṃ ca dadhataṃghanamecakam || 1 || nīlavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(13) atha kratudhyānam

ṛtuṃkratuvarodyuktaṃ brahmarṣigaṇasaṃstutam ||
jaṭilaṃśmaśrulaṃdaṃḍakamaṃlukarojjvalam || 1 ||

saptārcirivabhāsvaṃtaṃ dhyāyehaṃtapasāṃnidhim || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(14) atha kardamadhyānam

kardamaṃnaumiśirasā pāpakardamaśoṣaṇam ||
jaṭāmakuṭaśobhāḍhyaṃ saṃdhyābhrāruṇavigraham || 1 ||

akṣasrakkuṃḍikāhastaṃcīrakṛṣṇājināṃbaram || siṃdūravarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(15) atha kaśyapadhyānam

kaśyapaṃnaumiśirasāmarīcitanayaṃśucim ||
praṇavabrahmasaṃsaktacittaṃ satkāṃcanaprabham || 1 ||

cīravalkalasaṃvītaṃ jaṭāmaṃḍalabhāsuram ||
prajāsaṃsarjanodyuktamakṣasrakkuṃḍikādharam || 2 || kāṃcanavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(16) atha dakṣadhyānam

ajavaktraṃ dvinayanaṃ śṛṃgadvayavibhūṣitam ||
namaskārāṃjaliṃvaṃde śivadhyānaparāyaṇam || 1 || svāyaṃbhuvaṃ ghanaśyāmaṃ dakṣamadhvaradīkṣitam || śyāmavarṇaḥ || 1 || 9 ||

(17) atha saptaṛṣīṇāṃdhyānam (nṛsiṃhaprāsāde)

udāsīnāssopavītāḥ kamaṃḍalvakṣasūtriṇaḥ ||
jaṭilāśśmaśrulāśśāṃtā(-)āsīnā dhyānatatparāḥ || 1 ||

<p. 94> saptarṣayovasiṣṭhastu kāryobhāryāsamanvitaḥ ||
teṣāṃ nāmāni || gautamaśca bharadvājoviśvāmitrothakāśyapaḥ ||
jamadagnirvasiṣṭho trisapta vaivasvateṃtare || 1 || 7 ||

(18) tatrādau gautamadhyānam

rahūgaṇātmajaṃśāṃtaṃ tripuṃḍrāṃkitamastakam ||
akṣasrakkuṃḍikādaṃḍāndadhānaṃ gautamaṃbhaje || 1 || kanakavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(19) atha bharadvājadhyānam

bharadvājaṃmahāśāṃtaṃsuśīlāpatimūrjitam ||
akṣasragdaṃḍahastaṃ ca munimāṃgirasaṃbhaje || 1 || śyāmavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(20) atha viśvāmitradhyānam

hiraṇyagarbhasadṛśaṃ jaṭāmakuṭadhāriṇam ||
kumudvatīpatiṃśāṃtaṃ viśvāmitraṃbhajāmyaham || 1 || pītavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(21) atha kāśyapadhyānam

dhyāyenmarīcitanayaṃ jaṭāvalkaladhāriṇam ||
japākṣasragdharaṃ patnīsahitaṃ munipuṃgavam || 1 || kṛṣṇavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(22) atha jamadagnidhyānam

śāṃtaṃjitāriṣaḍvargabhṛguputraṃ mahādyutim ||
daṃḍākṣasūtrapāṇiṃ ca jamadagniṃ namāmyaham || 1 || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(23) atha vasiṣṭhadhyānam

taponidhiṃ dayāsiṃdhuṃmitrāvaruṇasaṃbhavam ||
sragdaṃḍapāṇiṃvaradaṃ vasiṣṭhaṃ praṇamāmyaham || 1 || sitavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(24) atha atridhyānam

viriṃcitanayaṃ devaṃ sākṣasūtrakamaṃḍalum ||
anasūyāpatiṃśāṃtamatriṃniṣkalmaṣaṃbhaje || 1 || asitavarṇaḥ || 1 || 7 ||

<p. 95>

(25) atha dharmādicatuṣṭayadhyānam (nṛsiṃhaprāsāde)

dharmojñānaṃ ca vairāgyamaiśvaryaṃ ca tathaiva hi ||
sitāruṇaṃ pītakṛṣṇaṃsiṃharūpāḥ prakīrtitāḥ || 1 || 4 ||

(26) atha dharmādicatuṣṭayābhimāni devatācatuṣṭayadhyānam (pāṃcarātre)

yamavāyuśiveṃdrāśca jñeyādharmādidevatāḥ || eteṣāṃ lakṣaṇānidikpāleṣu draṣṭavyā  (4) nidhau || 4 ||

(27) atha adharmādicatuṣṭayadhyānam (pāṃcarātre pādmasaṃhitāyām)

āśāsutāvatīṣveva puruṣākṛtayasthitāḥ ||
caturbhujāssiṃhavaktrāssita pūrvāruṇāḥpare || 1 ||

hastābhyāmābhimukhyābhyāṃ racitāṃjalisaṃpuṭāḥ ||
aparābhyāṃ ca vibhrāṇāḥ karābhyāṃ yogapīṭhakau || 2 ||

mukheśvetavarṇāḥ || śarīreruṇavarṇāḥ || 4 ||

(28) atha adharmādicatuṣṭayābhimāni devatācatuṣṭayadhyānam (pāṃcarātre pādmasaṃhitāyām)

adharmādhipatirnir(-)ṛtiḥ || ajñānāghipatirdurgā || avairāgyādhipatiḥ kāmaḥ || anaiśvaryādhipatiḥ rudraḥ || apūjitā(-)adharmādyādātāraste tathā vidhāḥ ||
nir(-)ṛtiścaiva durgā ca kāmorudrastathaiva ca || 1 || eteṣāṃ svarūpāṇiṃ tattanmūrtilakṣaṇe pūrvamuktānivakṣyaṃte ca krameṇa (4 - 5 - 2 - 5) nidhau || rudraḥ(-)ārdrānakṣatradevatāvat durgāraudrivatsaradevatāvat || 4 ||

(29) atha puṇyapuruṣalakṣaṇam (kāraṇāgame)

siṃhāsane samāsīnaṃ svarṇavarṇaṃkirīṭinam ||
gīrvāṇamutapādābjaṃpuṇyaṃ hṛdivibhāvaye || 1 || svarṇavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(30) atha pāpapuruṣadhyānam (pāṃcarātre)

brahmahatyāśiraskaṃ ca svarṇasteyabhujadvayam ||
surāpānahṛdāyuktaṃ gurutalpakaṭidvayam || 1 ||

tatsaṃyogipadadvadvamaṃgapratyaṃgapātakam ||
upapātakaromāṇaṃpiṃgabhrūśmaśrulocanam || 2 ||

khaḍgacarmadharaṃkṛṣṇaṃkukṣaupāpaṃ viciṃtayet || kṛṣṇavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 96>

(31) atha brahmāstradhyānam (tatkalpe)

savyenārinpīḍayaṃtaṃgadayācottareṇa tu ||
dīrghajihvaṃ pītavastraṃ smarāmibagalāmukham || 1 || pītavarṇaḥ prasiddhaḥ || 1 ||

atha vedacatuṣṭayasvarūpam (nṛsiṃhaprāsāde)

(32) tatrādau ṛgvedasvarūpam

ṛgvedaśśvetavarṇassyāddvibhujorāsabhānanaḥ ||
akṣamālādharaḥ saumyaḥ prītovyākhyāpanodyataḥ || 1 || śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(33) atha yajurvedasvarūpam

ajāsyaḥpītavarṇassyādyajurvedokṣasūtradṛt ||
vāme kuliśapāṇistu bhūtidomaṃgalapradaḥ || 1 || pītavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(34) atha sāmavedasvarūpam

nīlotpaladalābhāsaḥ sāmavedohayānanaḥ || 
akṣamālānvitodakṣe vāmekuṃbhadharassmṛtaḥ || 1 || śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(35) atha atharvaṇavedasvarūpam

atharvaṇābhidhovedodhavalomarkaṭānanaḥ ||
akṣamālānvito vāmedakṣekuṃbhadharassmṛtaḥ || 1 || śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

atha ṛgādivedapatnīnāṃ svarūpāṇi (skāṃdelakṣmīnārāyaṇasaṃhitāyām)

(36) tatrādau ṛgvedapatnīsāmidhenī svarūpam

mayūrāsyāśubhravarṇākaṭakadvayabhūṣitā ||
hastābhyāṃdadhatīpadmaṃ pītavastramanūpamam || 1 ||

sāmidhenīsamākhyātā || śubhravarṇā || 1 ||

(37) atha yajurvedapatnīsṛgāsvarūpam

sṛgāyālakṣaṇaṃ śṛṇu || raktavarṇāviśālākṣī padmahastākṛśodarī || 1 || raktavarṇā || 1 ||

(38) atha sāmavedapatnīkuhūsvarūpam

pūrṇeṃduvadanāśubhrābhujadvayavibhūṣitā ||
savyeśukaṃ tathā dakṣedhānyamaṃjarikāṃ tathā || 1 ||

dadhānāsākahūrdevī || śvetavarṇā || 1 ||

<p. 97> atha atharvaṇavedapatnīsamitsvarūpam (-)

samillakṣaṇamucyate || 

sūkarāsyā cakorākṣī caṃpakā bhāsitāṃśukā || 1 ||

bhujaiścaturbhissaṃdhatte sruksruvaukamalaṃghaṭam || 

kanakavarṇāḥ || 1 ||

(40) atha caturvedābhimānināṃ gotrādhidaivatānāṃ svarūpāṇi (hemādraudānakāṇḍe) (-)

ṛgvedasyā treyaṃ gotraṃ somaṃdaivaṃ vidurbudhāḥ ||
kāśyapaṃcayajurvedaṃ rudradaivaṃ tu taṃ viduḥ || 1 ||

sāmavedopi gotreṇa bharadvājaḥpuraṃdaraḥ ||
adhidaivaṃ vijāniyādvaitānaṃ syādatharvaṇe || 2 ||

brahmadaivaṃ vijānīyādrūpāṇyasya śṛṇuṣvabho || 

(ṛgvedābhimānī somaḥ navagrahastha caṃdravat (5) ni(0) || yajurvedābhimānīrudraḥ sūryapratyadhi devatāvat (5) ni(0) || sāmavedābhimānīṃdraḥ bṛhaspatyadhidevatāvat (5) ni(0) ||
(atharvaṇavedābhimānībrahmā bṛhaspatipratyadhidevatāvat (4) ni(0) || 1 ||

(41) atha āyurvedasvarūpam (nṛsiṃhaprāsāde) (-)

āyurvedoharidrābho vānarāsyo viśāladṛk ||
akṣasūtraṃ sudhākuṃbhaṃ bibhadārogyado bhṛśam || 1 || 

pītavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(42) atha āyurvedābhimānidhanvaṃtaridhyānam (bhāgavate) (-)

athodadhermathyamānāt kāśyapairamṛtārthibhiḥ ||
udatiṣṭhanmahārājapuruṣaḥ paramādbhutaḥ || 1 ||

dīrghapīvaradordaṃḍaḥ kaṃbugrīvoruṇekṣaṇaḥ ||
śyāmalastaruṇaḥ sragvī sarvābharaṇabhūṣitaḥ || 2 ||

pītavāsāmahoraskāssumṛṣṭamaṇikuṃḍalaḥ ||
nīlakuṃcitakeśāṃta subhagassiṃhavikramaḥ || 3 ||

amṛtā'pūrṇakalaśaṃ bibhradvalayasaṃyutaḥ ||
savaibhagavatassākṣādviṣṇoraṃśāṃśa saṃbhavaḥ || 4 ||

dhanvaṃtarissyādvikhyāta āyurvedadṛgijyayā || śyāmavarṇaḥ ||
prakārāṃtaram (āyurvedataṃtre ||

arijalajajalūkāratnapīyūṣakuṃbhaprakaṭitakarakāṃtakāṃtapītāṃbarāḍhyaḥ ||
sitavasanavirājanmaulirārogyadāyīśatamakhamaṇivarṇaḥ pātudhanvaṃtarirnaḥ || 1 || 

nīlavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

prakārāntaram (mantrāgame) śaṃkhaṃ cakraṃjalūkāṃdadhadamṛtaghaṭaṃ cāpidorbhiścaturbhissūkṣmaṃ svacchaṃdahṛdyaṃkuśaparivilasanmaulimaṃbhojanetram ||

kālāṃbhodojjvalāṃgaṃ kaṭitaṭavilasaccārupītāṃbarāḍhyaṃ vaṃde dhanvaṃtariṃ taṃ nikhilagadavanavrātadāvāgnilīlam || 1 ||

<p. 98> prakārānteṇadhyānam (vaidyaśāstre ||

śaṃkhaṃcakramuparyadhasthakarayordivyauṣadhiṃdakṣiṇe vāmenānyakareṇa nirmalasudhākuṃḍaṃ jalūkāvalim ||

bibhrāṇaḥ karuṇākaraśśubhakarassarvāmayadhvaṃsakassarvaṃ te duritaṃ chinattu bhagavāndhanvaṃtarissaṃtatam || 1 || 

nīlavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(43) atha dhanurvedasvarūpam (nṛsiṃhaprāsāde) (-)

pītavarṇodhanurvedaḥ pikavaktromahattanuḥ ||
dhanurbāṇadharoraudro mastake kapilā jaṭāḥ || 1 || 

pītavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(44) atha dhanurvedābhimānīṃdra devatādhyānam (nṛsiṃhaprāsāde mayūkhe ca) (-)

śvetahastisamārūḍhaṃ vajrāṃkuśalasatkaram |
sahasranetraṃ pītābhamiṃdraṃ hṛdi vibhāvaye || 1 || 

pītavarṇaḥ || śukrapratyadhi devatāvat (5) ni(0) || 1 ||

atha vedaṣaḍaṃgasvarūpābhimāni devatā svarūpāṇi (nṛsiṃhaprāsāde)

(45) tatra śikṣāsvarūpam (-)

śikṣāśubhrā'bhayakarājñānamudrāsamanvitā ||
tryakṣasūtrā sa kuṇḍā ca ṣaḍbhujādaṃḍapaṃkajā || 1 || 

śubhravarṇā || 1 ||

(46) atha śikṣābhimānidevatāprajāpatidhyānam (-)

haṃsayānenakartavyo na ca kāryaścaturmukhaḥ ||
sāvitrī tasya kartavyā vāmotsaṃgagatāśubhā || 1 ||

brahmoktaṃ paramaṃ rūpaṃ sarvaṃ kāryaṃ prajāpateḥ || 

pāṭalavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(paṃcabrahmasuprajāpatibrahmavat (4) ni(0) || 1 ||

(47) atha kalpasvarūpam (-)

kalpastu kumudābhassyādvāyasāsyo mahodaraḥ ||
kuṭhāradaṃḍābjahasto mekhalākuṇḍalānvitaḥ || 1 || 

kumudavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(48) atha kalpābhimānibrahmadhyāna (śaivāgame) (-)

caturmukhaṃ caturbāhuṃ kamaṃḍalvakṣadhārīṇam ||
yajñasūtrottarīyaṃ ca jaṭāmakuṭasaṃyutam || 1 ||

savyahastekṣamālāṃ ca dadhaṃvāmekamaṃḍalum ||
sruvaṃ dakṣiṇahaste ca pustakaṃ vāmahastake || 2 ||

<p. 99>

aṃbujāsana āsīnaṃ brāhmāṇaṃ hasanonmukham || 

pāṭalavarṇaḥ || trimūrtyaṃtargatabrahmavat (4) ni(0) || 1 ||

(49) atha vyākaraṇasvarūpam (-)

sitaṃ vyākaraṇaṃ jñeyaṃ mayūrābhasaṭodaram ||
vīṇākarānvitaṃ divyaṃ divyavastravibhūṣitam || 1 || 

śubhravarṇam || 1 ||

(50) atha vyākaraṇābhimānisarasvatīdhyānam (hemādrau) (-)

dorbhiryuktā caturbhissphaṭikamaṇimayīmakṣamālāṃ dadhānāhastenaikena padmaṃsitamapi ca śukaṃpustakaṃ cāpareṇa ||
bhāsākuṃdeṃdu śaṃkhasphaṭikamaṇinibhābhāsamānā samānāsāmevāgdevateyaṃ nivasatu vadane sarvadāsu prasannā || 1 || śvetavarṇā || 1 ||

(51) atha niruktasvarūpam (-)

iṃduvannirmalaṃ śāṃtaṃ bakavaktraṃ kṛśodaram ||
pāśapaṃkajasaṃyuktaṃ sākṣasūtraṃ sa pustakam || 1 || 

niruktamitinirṇītam || śubhravarṇam || 1 ||

(52) atha niruktādhidevatāvaruṇasvarūpam (mayūkhe) (-)

nāgapāśadharoratna bhūṣaṇaḥ padminī priyaḥ ||
varuṇoṃbupatissvarṇa varṇo makaravāhanaḥ || 1 || 

kanakavarṇaḥ || dikpālāntargatavaruṇavat (4) ni(0) || 1 ||

(53) atha chaṃdassvarūpam (-)

japākusumasaṃkāśaṃ chaṃdo jñeyaṃ vicakṣaṇaiḥ ||
cakorāsyaṃ japāpuṣpaṃ śaktiṃ bibhracchikhānvitam || 1 ||

lohakuṃḍalakopetaṃ pravālakṛtabhūṣaṇam || 

raktavarṇan || 1 ||

(54) atha cchaṃdobhimānyaditidevatāsvarūpam (śaivāgame) (-)

aditiḥ pītavarṇā ca sruksruvākṣakamaṃḍalūn ||
dadhānāśubhadāmesyād devamātā yaśasvinī || 1 || 

pītavarṇā || punarvasvadhidevatāvat (5) ni(0) || 1 ||

(55) atha jyotiṣasvarūpam (-)

jyotiṣaṃ ca biḍālāsyamiṃdragopanibhaṃ śubham ||
akṣasūtraṃ japāṃbibhraddhastayordakṣavāmayoḥ || 1 || 

raktavarṇam || 1 ||

<p. 100>

(56) atha jyotiṣābhimāniharisvarūpam (pāṃcarātre) (-)

hariḥ kanakavarṇaḥsyācchaṃkhacakragadābjabhṛt || 

kanakavarṇaḥ || caturviṃśatimūrtirathaharivat (2) ni(0) || 1 ||

(57) atha mīmāṃsāśāstrasvarūpam (nṛsiṃhaprāsāde) (-)

somakīrtisamābhāsaṃ mīmāṃsāśāstramuttamam ||
akṣasūtraṃ dadhaddakṣe sūdhāpūrṇaṃ ghaṭaṃpare || 1 || 

śvetavarṇam || 1 ||

(58) atha mīmāṃsādhidevatāsomasvarūpam (śaivāgame) (-)

śvetaḥśvetāṃbaradharodaśāśvaḥśvetabhūṣaṇaḥ ||
gadāpāṇirdvibāhuśca kartavyo varadaḥ śaśī || 1 || 

śvetavarṇaḥ || navagrahasthacaṃdravat (5) ni(0) || 1 ||

(59) atha nyāyaśāstrasvarūpam (nṛsiṃhaprāsāde) (-)

atasīpuṣpasaṃkāśo nyāyo jñeyo vipaścitā ||
siṃhāsyo dakṣiṇe sūtraṃ dhvajaṃvāmakare dadhat || 1 || 

nīlavarṇam || 1 ||

(60) atha nyāyaśāstrābhimānivāyusvarūpam (śaivāgame) (-)

dhāvaddhariṇamārūḍhaṃ dvibhujaṃ dhvajadhāriṇam ||
varadānakaraṃdhūmravarṇaṃ vāyu mahaṃbhaje || 1 || 

dhūmravarṇaḥ || paṃcabhūtasthavāyuvat (4) ni(0) || 1 ||

(61) atha dharmāśāstrasvarūpam (nṛsiṃhaprāsāde) (-)

dharmaśāstraṃ sitaṃśāṃtaṃ cāruvaktraṃ kuśāsanam ||
muktājapākṣa dhṛk dakṣe tulā hastaṃ tu vāmataḥ || 1 || 

śvetavarṇam || 1 ||

(62) atha dharmaśāstrābhimānidharmapuruṣasvarūpam (hemādraudānakāṃḍe) (-)

catuvaktraścaturbāhuścatuṣpāccasitāṃbaraḥ ||
sarvābharaṇavānśveto dharmaḥ kāryo vijānatā || 1 ||

dakṣiṇe cākṣamālā syāt tasya vāme tu pustakam ||
varābhaya yutaḥ kāryaḥ || 

śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(63) atha purāṇasvarūpam (nṛsiṃhaprāsāde) (-)

purāṇaṃ caṃpakābhāsaṃ śukavaktraṃ catuṃdilam ||
akṣasūtrā bhayaṃjñeyaṃ nānābharaṇabhūṣitam || 1 || 

caṃpakavarṇam || 1 ||

<p. 101>

(64) atha purāṇādhidevatāsvāyaṃbhuvamanusvarūpam (śaivāgamesiddhā0 -)

ādyaḥ svāyaṃbhuvo brahmaputro manuriti smṛtaḥ ||

śvetavarṇaḥ || anyat sarvaṃ (14) manuṣudraṣṭavyam (4) ni(0) || 1 ||

(65) atha itihāsasvarūpam (nṛsiṃhaprāsāde) (-)

itihāsaḥ kuśābhāsaḥ sūkarāsyo mahodaraḥ ||
akṣasūtraṃ ghaṭaṃvibhrat paṃkajā varaṇānvitaḥ || 1 || 

dūrvāśyāmavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(66) atha itihāsādhidevatāprajāpatisvarūpam (nṛsiṃhaprāsāde) (-)

haṃsayānenakartavyo na ca kāryaścaturmukhaḥ ||
sāvitrī tasya kartavyā vāmotsaṃgagatā śubhā || 1 ||

brahmoktaṃ paramaṃ rūpaṃ sarvaṃ kāryaṃ prajāpateḥ || 

pāṭalavarṇaḥ || paṃcabrahmasthaprajāpatibrahmavat (4) ni(0) || 1 ||

(67) atha bharataśāstrasvarūpam (nṛsiṃhaprāsāde) (-)

nṛttaśāstramidaṃ ramyaṃ mṛgavaktraṃ jaṭādharam ||
akṣasūtraṃ triśūlaṃ ca bibhrāṇaṃ ca trilocanam || 1 || 

śvetavarṇam || 1 ||

(68) atha bharataśāstrābhimānyumāmaheśvarasvarūpam (kāraṇāgame) (-)

dhavalābhasukhāsanadevi yutaṃ mṛgaśiśuṭaṃkavarābhayahastam ||
sumukhīkṛtamutpala dṛgvaradamumayā sahadeva sa rūpamidam || 1 || 

śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(69) atha pāṃcarātraśāstrasvarūpam (nṛsiṃhaprāsāde) (-)

pāṃcarātrābhidhaṃ śāstraṃ lāvaṇyavṛṣavāhanam ||
akṣasūtraṃ halaṃbibhradvanamālāvibhūṣitam || 1 || 

śvetavarṇam || 1 ||

(70) atha pāṃcarātraśāstrābhimānisaṃkarṣaṇasvarūpam (bhaṭṭabhāskarīye) (-)

vāsudeva svarūpeṇa kāryaḥ saṃkarṣaṇaḥ prabhuḥ ||
sa tu śuklavapuḥ kāryo nīlavāsāyadūttamaḥ || 1 ||

gadāsthāne ca musalaṃ cakrasthane calāṃgalam ||
dakṣordhvakareśaṃkhaḥ dakṣādhaḥ kare musalaṃ vāmādhaḥ kareśārṅgaṃ vāmordhva kare lāṃgalam || 1 || 

śvetavarṇaḥ || vyūhamūrtivat (2) ni(0) || 1 ||

<p. 102>

(71) atha pāśupataśāstrasvarūpam (nṛsiṃhaprāsāde) (-)

śāstraṃpāśupataṃ śubhraṃ vyālavaktraṃ kṛśodaram ||
sūtrapātradharaṃbhīmaṃ vyāghracarmāṃbarā vṛtam || 1 || 

śvetavarṇam || 1 ||

(72) atha pāśupataśāstrābhimānirudrasvarūpam (mayukhe) (-)

paṃcavaktro vṛṣārūḍhaḥ prativaktraṃ trilocanaḥ ||
varadābhayaśūlākṣa sūtradhṛk parameśvaraḥ || 1 || 

śvetavarṇaḥ || sūryapratyadhidevatāvat (5) ni(0) || 1 ||

(73) atha pātaṃjalaśāstrasvarūpam (nṛsiṃhaprāsāde) (-)

pātaṃjalābhidhaṃraktaṃ sarpavaktraṃ sutejasam ||
akṣasūtraṃ pātākāṃ ca dadhataṃ kuṃḍalānvitam || 1 || 

raktavarṇam || 1 ||

(74) atha pātaṃjalādhidevatā'naṃtasvarūpam (anaṃtavratakalpe) (-)

navāmrapallavābhāsaṃ piṃgabhrūśmaśrulocanam ||
dakṣiṇordhvakare padmaṃ śaṃkhaṃ tasyāpyadhaḥ kare || 1 ||

cakramūrdhvakare vāme gadāṃ tasyāpyadhaḥkare ||
bibhrataṃ puṃḍarīkākṣaṃ phaṇāsaptānvitaṃ bhaje || 2 || 

gomūtravarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(75) atha sāṃkhyaśāstrasvarūpam (nṛsiṃhaprāsāde) (-)

sāṃkhyaṃ tatkāpilaṃbabhru vaktramujjvalakuṃḍalam ||
jāpyadaṃḍadharaṃdīrghaṃ na khalomajaṭādharam || 1 || 

kapilavarṇam || 1 ||

(76) atha sāṃkhyaśāstrābhimānikapilasvarūpam (pāṃcarātremaṃtrādhyāye) (-)

prodyaddivākarasamānatanuṃ sahasrasūryorudidhitibhirāpta samastalokam ||
jñānābhayāṃkita karaṃkapilaṃ ca dattaṃ dhyāyedajādi samitiṃ pratibodhayaṃ tam || 1 || 

raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(77) atha catuṣṣaṣṭikalānāṃnāmāni (śivatattvaratnākare) (-)

vedāssarve sa vedāṃgā itihāsastathāgamaḥ ||
nyāyaśāstraṃ tathākāvya malaṃkāraśca nāṭakam || 1 ||

kavitvaṃ kāmaśāstraṃ ca dyūtanaipuṇyamityapi ||
deśabhāṣāparijñānaṃ lipijñānaṃ lipikriyā || 2 ||

tathāsamastā vadhānaṃ svaraśāstraṃ ca vācakam ||
sāmudrikaṃ ca śakunaṃ parīkṣāratnasaṃtateḥ || 3 ||

<p. 103>

tathāsvarṇaparīkṣā ca tathāturagalakṣaṇam ||
gajaśāstraṃ mallavidyā pākakarma tataḥ param || 4 ||

daśadohalavidyāśca vādogaṃdhakasaṃbhavaḥ ||
dhātuvādaḥ khanīvādo rasavādastataḥ paraḥ || 5 ||

agnistaṃbho jalastaṃbho pyasistaṃbhanameva ca ||
vāyustaṃbhastathā vaśyaṃ mohanākarṣaṇe tathā || 6 ||

uccāṭanaṃ ca vidveṣo māraṇaṃ kālavaṃcanam ||
vāṇijyaṃ pāśupālyaṃ ca kṛṣirā savakarma ca || 7 ||

lāvukāyodhanaprauḍhirmeṣayuddheṣu kauśalam ||
ratikauśalamākheṭo pyadṛśyakaraṇī tathā || 8 ||

citralohāśmamṛddāruveṇucarmāṃbara kriyāḥ ||
tathaiva dyūtakaraṇī corakarmājanaṃ tathā || 9 ||

maṃtrauṣadhyostathāsiddhissvaradṛṣṭyostu vaṃcane ||
jalaplavanavāksiddhi ghuṭikā siddhayastathā || 10 ||

tathaiva pādukāsiddhiriṃdrajālaṃ tataḥ param ||
vidyāmaheṃdrajālena catuṣṣaṣṭirmatā imāḥ || 11 ||

(śrīviṣṇubhāgavate (10) ska(0) pūrvā(0) (45) dhyā(0) (36) ślo(0) vyā(0) śrīdharīye śukranītau (4) dhyāye ca prakārāntareṇāpidṛśyante)

atha paṃcabhūtasvarūpāṇi (śaivāgame)

(78) tatrādaupṛthvīdevatāsvarūpam (-)

dhyāyenmahīṃ śuklavarṇāṃ divyābharaṇabhūṣitām || 
caturbhūjāṃ saumyatanuṃ caṃḍāṃśu sadṛśāṃbarām || 1 ||

adhaścordhvaṃ ratnapātraṃ karābhyāṃ sasyabhājanam ||
dakṣiṇābhyāṃ tathāvāma karābhyāṃ sarasīruham || 2 ||

oṣadhī pūritaṃ pātraṃ dadhānāṃ sumukhāṃbujām ||
diṅnāgānāṃ caturṇāṃ ca pṛṣṭhārūḍhāṃ caturbhujām || 3 ||

sarvasasyālayāṃ śubhrāṃbhū devīṃ śaraṇaṃbhaje || 

śubhravarṇā || 1 ||

(79) atha abdevatāsvarūpam (-)

ādarśatalasaṃkāśā lokasaṃjīvinīśśubhāḥ ||
mādhuryaguṇasaṃyuktāḥ sarvālaṃkāraśobhitāḥ || 1 ||

strīrūpadhāriṇīḥ śubhrāḥ bhujadvayavirājitāḥ ||
dadhānāḥ pāśakalaśau sadāmakaravāhanāḥ || 2 ||

muktābhūṣitasarvāṃgirapaḥ saṃciṃtayenmudā || 

śubhravarṇāḥ || 1 ||

<p. 104>

(80) atha tejodevatāsvarūpam (-)

agniṃsuvarṇavarṇāṃgaṃ saptārciṣa manāmayam ||
meṣārūḍaṃ saptahastaṃ svāhādevī samanvitam || 1 ||

śaktyādyāyudhasaṃpanna hastaṃ dhyāyedvibhāvasūm || 

kanakavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(81) atha vāyudevatāsvarūpam (-)

dhāvaddhariṇaṃmārūḍhaṃ dvibhujaṃ dhvajadhāriṇam ||
varadānakaraṃdhūmravarṇaṃvāyumahaṃbhaje || 1 || 

dhūmravarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(82) atha ākāśadevatāsvarūpam (-)

dhyāyāmigaganaṃnīlaṃ nīlāṃbaradharaṃ vibhum ||
caṃdrārkahastaṃ dvibhujaṃ sarvābharaṇabhūṣitam || 1 || 

nīlavarṇam || 1 ||

atha daśadiksvarūpam (nṛsiṃhaprāsāde)

(83) tatrādaupūrvadiksvarūpam (-)

pūrvāgajagatābālā raktavarṇā hi digbhavet || 

raktavarṇā || 1 ||

(84) atha āgneyadiksvarūpam (-)

kāraṃḍagā bṛhatkāyā padmābhā pūrvadakṣiṇā || 

padmavarṇā || 1 ||

(85) atha dakṣiṇadiksvarūpam (-)

gṛdhrasthā dakṣiṇāpītā gṛdhrāsyā prāptayauvanā || 

pītavarṇā || 1 ||

(86) atha nir(-)ṛtidiksvarūpam (-)

uṣṭragā kṛṣṇapītā ca taruṇī yāmya paścimā | 

haridvarṇā || 1 ||

(87) atha paścimadiksvarūpam (-)

yuvatiḥ dvibhujā kṛṣṇā paścimā turagasthitā || 

kṛṣṇavarṇā || 1 ||

(88) atha vāyavyadiksvarūpam (-)

āsannapatikānīlā dhanurvādanatatparā || 

nīlavarṇā || 1 ||

(89) atha uttaradiksvarūpam (-)

śvetānanā tathāraktā kruddhā bhavati cottarā || 

raktavarṇā || 1 ||

<p. 105>

(90) atha īśānadiksvarūpam (-)

ativṛddhā vṛṣasthā ca śuklāpūrvottarā bhavet || 

śvetavarṇā || 1 ||

(91) atha ūrdhvadiksvarūpam (-)

ūrdhvāgaganasannimā || nīlavarṇā || 1 ||

(92) atha adhodiksvarūpam (-)

adhasthāpṛthivītulyā || śvetavarṇā || 1 ||

(93) atha aṣṭanāgasvarūpāṇi (nṛsiṃhaprāsāde)

anaṃto vāsukiścaiva takṣakarkoṭapadmakāḥ ||
mahāpadmaśca śaṃkhaśca kulikoṣṭau kulānihi || 1 ||

ataṃtakulikau viprau śvetavarṇāvudāhṛtau ||
pratyekaṃ tu sahasrāṣṭa phaṇaistau samalaṃkṛtau || 2 ||

vāsukiśśaṃkhapālaśca kṣatriyau raktavarṇakau ||
pratyekaṃ tu phaṇā śaptaśatasaṃkhyā virājitau || 3 ||

takṣakaśca mahāpadmo vaiśyajātāvudāhṛtau ||
pītavarṇau phaṇaiḥ paṃcaśatatuṃgottamāṃgakau || 4 ||

padmakarkoṭakauśūdrau nīlavarṇāvudhāhṛau ||
phaṇātriśatakau jñeyau vikhyātā vititattvataḥ || 5 || 8 ||

(94) atha aṣṭadiggajasvarūpāṇi (-) (mayūkhe āgneyapurāṇe ca)

śubhrābhaśca caturdaṃtaḥ śrīmānairāvato gajaḥ ||
puṣpadaṃto bṛhacchyāmo ṣaḍdaṃtaḥ puṣpadaṃtavān || 1 ||

sāmānyagajarūpeṇa śeṣādikkariṇaḥ smṛtāḥ || (-) ||

(āgneyapūraṇenāmāni || airāvataḥ puṃḍarīko vāmanaḥ kumudoṃjanaḥ ||
puṣpadaṃtassārvabhaumassupratīkoṣṭadiggajāḥ || 1 || 8 ||

(95) atha aṣṭadiggajapatnīnāṃ nāmāni (-) (āgneyapūrāṇe)

kariṇyobhramuḥ kapilāpiṃgalānupamākramāt ||
tāmraparṇīsudaṃtī syādaṃ janācāṃjanāvatī || 1 || 8 ||

atha aṣṭadikpālānāṃdhyānam

(96) tatrādau iṃdradhyānam (-) (bhaṭṭabhāskarīye) 

iṃdraṃsahasra netraṃ ca pītavarṇaṃ caturbhujam ||
abhayaṃ dakṣiṇe haste varadaṃvāmahastake || 1 ||

kuliśaṃ dakṣiṇe haste hyaṃkuśaṃ tu tathetare ||
ratnakaustubhamaṇikya divyābharaṇabhūṣitam || 2 ||

<p. 106>

kuṃḍalaṃ yajñasūtraṃ ca dadhānaṃ divya tejasam ||
airāvatagajārūḍhaṃ śacīkāṃtaṃ namāmyaham || 3 || 

hemavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(97) atha agnidhyānam (siṃgābhaṭṭīyepūrvaprayoge)

saptahastaścatuśśṛṃgassaptajihvo dviśīrṣakaḥ ||
tripātprasannavadanassukhāsīnaśśuci smitaḥ || 1 ||

svāhāṃ tu dakṣiṇe pārśve devīṃ vāme svadhāṃ tathā ||
vibhraddakṣiṇahaste tu śaktimannaṃ srucaṃ sruvam || 2 ||

tomaraṃ vyajanaṃ vāme ghṛtapātraṃ ca dhārayan ||
meṣārūḍhaṃ jaṭābaddhaṃ ghoravarṇaṃ mahodaram || 3 ||

dhūmadhvajaṃrohitākṣaṃ saptārciṣamanāmayam ||
ātmābhimukhamāsīnamevaṃ dhyāyeddhutāśanam || 4 ||

raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(98) atha yamadhyānam (-) (śaivāgamenṛsiṃhaprāsāde ca)

karālamahiṣārūḍhaṃ kāladaṃḍadharaṃ punaḥ ||
śyāmavarṇaṃ pāśahastaṃ kṛtāṃtaṃ praṇamāmyaham || 1 ||

ilāpriyo daṃḍadharo yamo mahiṣavāhanaḥ ||
raktavarṇo hi lokānāṃ svasvakarmaphalapradaḥ || 2 || 

śyāmavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(99) atha nir(-)ṛtidhyānam (-) (mayūkhedānakhaṃḍe)

khaḍgacarmadharonīlo nir(-)ṛtirnaravāhanaḥ ||
ūrdhvakeśo virūpākṣaḥ karālaḥ kālikā priyaḥ || 1 || 

nīlavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(100) atha varuṇadhyānam (-) (mayūkhebhaṭṭabhāskarīye)

nāgapāśadharoraktabhūṣaṇaḥ padminī priyaḥ ||
varuṇoṃbu patiḥsvarṇa varṇomakaravāhanaḥ || 1 || 

svarṇavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(101) atha vāyudhyānam (-) (mayūkhebhaṭṭabhāskarīye)

prāṇabaṃdhurhi jagato vāyuḥ kṛṣṇamṛgāsanaḥ ||
hemadaṃḍadhvajaḥ śyāmo varṇato mohinī priyaḥ || 1 || 

śyāmavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(102) atha kuberadhyānam (-) (mayūkhebhaṭṭabhāskarīye)

aśvārūḍhaḥ kuṃtapāṇiḥ kuberaścitriṇī priyaḥ ||
nidhīśvaraḥ svarṇavarṇo dhanadorūpavānprabhuḥ || 1 || 

svarṇavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 107>

(103) atha īśānadhyānam (-) (mayūkhedānakhaṃḍe)

śuddhasphaṭikasaṃkāśo gaurīśo vṛṣavāhanaḥ ||
varadābhayaśūlākṣa sūtradhṛtparameśvaraḥ || 1 || 

śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

atha aṣṭavasūnāṃdhyānam (-) (śaivāgame)
(varṇastukāraṇāgame)

(104) tatrādau dhruvavasusvarūpam (-)

akṣamālādharaṃbrahma sūtrojjvalabhujāṃtaram ||
dhruvaṃdhruvāya yaśase ciṃtayāmi sadāmudā || 1 || 

pītavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(105) atha adhvaravasusvarūpam (-)

sruksruvāṃcatkaraṃ vyāghracarmāṃbaradharaṃ śucim ||
agniśuśrūṣaṇaratamadhvaraṃ praṇamenvaham || 1 || 

śyāmavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(106) atha somavasusvarūpam (-)

jagadānaṃdajanakamamṛtasrāvicakṣuṣam ||
ratnasiṃhāsanagataṃ somaṃ hṛdivibhāvaye || 1 || 

sitavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(107) atha abvasusvarūpam (-)

sarvapāpavināśinyaḥ sāmudrāhemapūritāḥ ||
āpaḥśubhapradāssaṃtu matsyavāhanasaṃgatāḥ || 1 || 

śvetavarṇāḥ || 1 ||

(108) atha anilavasusvarūpam (-)

śubhāyame sadābhūdādanilolokapāvanaḥ ||
samastadevanivahavaṃdyamānapadāṃbujaḥ || 1 || 

haridvarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(109) atha analavasusvarūpam (-)

ajādhirūḍhaṃśubhadaṃ svāhā devī samanvitam ||
kirīṭojjvalamūrdhānamanalaṃ bhāvayāmyaham || 1 || 

lohitavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(110) atha pratyūṣavasusvarūpam (-)

śvetavastradharaṃśveta caṃdanāliptadehakam ||
pratyūṣaṃ ciṃtaye bhūyaḥ pratyūhonmūlakāraṇam || 1 || 

śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 108>

(111) atha prabhāsavasusvarūpam (-)

prabhāsaṃpūrṇavapuṣaṃ prabhāsaṃbhāvayāmyaham ||
akṣasūtrojjvalakaraṃ vyāghrājinanivāsinam || 1 || 

śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

atha aṣṭavasūnāṃvarṇalakṣaṇāni (-) (kāraṇāgame)

dhruvaḥpītodhvaraḥ śyāmaḥ sitaḥ somoniloharit ||
āpaḥsitā itiproktā hyanalolohitaḥ smṛtaḥ || 1 ||

pratyūṣaḥ śvetabhāstadvatprabhāsaḥ śvetavarṇakaḥ ||
prasannavadanāḥ saumyā varadāḥ śaktipāṇayaḥ || 2 || 

padmāsanasthā dvibhujāḥ kartavyāvasavassadā || 8 ||

atha saptamarutāṃsvarūpāṇi (-) (śaivāgame)

(varṇastupādmekāraṇāgame ca)

(112) tatrādau āvahamarutsvarūpam (-)

āvahomarutāṃśreṣṭho sukhāyāstu sadāmama ||
āsamaṃtātsaṃcariṣṇuḥ sutīvragaruḍasthitaḥ || 1 || 

dhūmravarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(113) atha vivaharutsvarūpam (-)

jagatāṃ bhaṃjanaṃ kurvanviparītapradhāvanaiḥ ||
nabhomadhyagatovāyuḥ vivahobhūtidostume || 1 || 

raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(114) atha udvahamarutsvarūpam (-)

udvelayanpayorāśīngirīnunmūlayaṃstarūn ||
jagatīṃ kṣobhayannityamudvahaḥ sevyate mayā || 1 || 

pītavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(115) atha saṃvahamarutsvarūpam (-)

jagadānaṃdajanako gaṃdhahārī śanaiśśanaiḥ ||
śītāṃbukaṇasaṃvāhaḥ saṃvahaḥ sukhadostume || 1 || 

śyāmavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(116) atha nivahamarutsvarūpam (-)

pracaṃḍagatibhirdhutaprapalāyitaparvatam ||
nivahaṃ pavanaśreṣṭhaṃ śirasāpraṇamāmyaham || 1 || 

śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 109>

(117) atha anuvahamarutsvarūpam (-)

prātikūlyena dhāvaṃtaṃ bhrāmayaṃ taṃ jagattrayam ||
marutāṃ pravahaṃ nityamāśrayenuvahābhidham || 1 || 

asitavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(118) atha vyavahamarutsvarūpam (-)

prāṇāpānādi rūpeṇa jagatīṃ vyāpyajīvayan ||
sevyatāṃ prāṇinivahaiḥ marudvyavahasaṃjñakaḥ || 1 || 

aruṇavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(119) atha sapta marutāṃnāmāni (-) (śaivāgame)

āvāho vivahaścaivā pyudvahassaṃvahastathā ||
nivahonuvahaścaiva vyavahaśceti nāmabhiḥ || 1 ||

saptaite marutaḥ proktāḥ saptasaptaprabhedinaḥ || (-) ||
eteṣāṃ varṇāḥ (pādmekāraṇāgame ca) 
dhūmroraktastathāpītaśśyāmaḥ śvetositoruṇaḥ ||
varṇoyaṃ marutāmuktassaptānāmānu pūrvyaśaḥ || 1 || 7 ||

(120) atha ekonapaṃcāśanmarunnāmāni (-) (kāraṇāgame)

prāṇaḥ (1) | apānaḥ (2) | vyānaḥ (3) | udānaḥ (4) | samānaḥ (5) | nāgaḥ (6) | kṛkaraḥ (7) | kūrmaḥ (8) | devadattaḥ (9) | dhanaṃjayaḥ (10) | pravahaḥ (11) | vivahaḥ (12) | śaṃbhuḥ (13) | saṃvahaḥ (14) | parivahaḥ (15) | udvahaḥ (16) | āvahaḥ (17) | śaṃkuḥ (18) | kālaḥ (19) | prāvahaḥ (20) | śāsaḥ (21) | anilaḥ (22) | analaḥ (23) | pratibhaḥ (24) | kumudaḥ (25) | kāṃtaḥ (26) | śibiḥ (27) | śvetaḥ (28) | raktaḥ (29) | kṛṣṇaḥ (30) | jitaḥ (31) | ajitaḥ (32) | jaṃjhādyotaḥ (33) | kratuḥ (34) | siddhaḥ (35) | piṃgaḥ (36) | śuciḥ (37) | saumyaḥ (38) | kāmyaḥ (39) | mārutaḥ (40) | hanuḥ (41) | kaṃpanaḥ (42) | maṃḍūkaḥ (43) | bhīmaḥ (44) | kapiḥ (45) | saṃvartakaḥ (46) | jaḍaḥ (47) | atijaḍaḥ (48) | saṃtataḥ (49) || 49 ||

atha eteṣāṃsvarūpāṇi (-) (mayūkhe)

bhrātaraḥ puruhūtasya marutaḥ sūryavarcasaḥ ||
kirīṭahārakeyūra kaṭakādi vibhūṣitāḥ || 1 ||

khaḍgacarmadhārānityaṃ śakrasyānu carāssadā ||
eteṣāṃ varṇarūrūpāṇi mukhyānāṃ marutāṃ yathā || 2 || 49 ||

(121) atha daśānāṃviśveṣāṃdevānāṃsvarūpam (bhaṭṭabhāskarīye)

viśvedevāśca sarvepi dakṣiṇe bāṇapāṇayaḥ ||
kartavyāvāmapāṇau tu śarāsanadharāssitāḥ || 1 || (-) ||

<p. 110>

eteṣāṃnāmāni ||

kraturdakṣovasussatyo kālakāmau dhurilocanau ||
purūravārdravau ceti viśvedevā daśasmṛtāḥ || 1 || 

śvetavarṇāḥ || 10 ||

atha saptasamudrasvarūpāṇi (-) (nṛsiṃhaprāsāde)

(122) tatra lavaṇasamudrasvarūpam (-)

lavaṇodaḥprakartavyo dvibhujoratnabhūṣaṇaḥ ||
dakṣekṣamālikāṃvāme pātraṃ ca bahuratnabhṛt || 1 ||

sottarīyo pavitī ca pāṭalābhaḥ sukhāsanaḥ || 

pāṭalavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(123) atha ikṣusamudrasvarūpam (-)

samudramikṣukāṃḍaṃ ca gomūtrasadṛśacchavim ||
ghaṭaṃ daṃḍaṃ ca bibhrāṇaṃ devaṃ hṛdivibhāvaye || 1 || 

gomūtravarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(124) atha surāsamudrasvarūpam (-)

surodaṃ gaṃḍakārusthaṃ gomeda sadṛśacchavim ||
mudgaraṃ kuṃḍikāṃ caiva bibhrāṇaṃ hṛdibhāvaye || 1 || 

gomedavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(125) atha sarpissamudrasvarūpam (-)

ghṛtodaḥ kapilojñeyaḥ kulīrastho jaṭādharaḥ ||
kaśerupūritaṃ pātraṃ ghaṭaṃ bibhradvidūrathaḥ || 1 || 

kapilavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(126) atha dadhisamudrasvarūpam (-)

dadhimaṃḍoda āste vai śubhroyaṃ vāridāsanaḥ ||
daṃḍaṃ śaktiṃ ca bibhrāṇo dvibujosau jaṭāyutaḥ || 1 || 

śubhravarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(127) atha kṣīrasamudrasvarūpam (-)

kṣīrodaśśvetavarṇaśca dvibhujoratnakuṃḍalaḥ ||
makarasthoṃbujaṃdakṣe vāme kalaśamādadhat || 1 || 

śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(128) atha śuddhodakasamudrasvarūpam (-)

svādūdomauktikābhāso dvibhujo raktakuṃḍalaḥ ||
makarasthoṃbujaṃdakṣe vāme kalaśamādadhat || 1 || 

mauktikavarṇaḥ || 1 || 7 ||

<p. 111>

(129) atha aṣṭanadīsvarūpāṇi (-) (śaivāgame)

dakṣiṇe tu karekuṃbhaṃ vāme varuṇapāśakam ||
dadhānā dvibhujāḥ pūjyā nadyo makaravāhanāḥ || 1 || 8 ||

(130) tatrādaugaṃgānadīsvarūpam (-)

trivikramapadodbhūtāṃ bhagīrathapathānugām ||
bhāgīrathīṃ namasyāmi gaṃgāṃtripathagāṃ nadīm || 1 || 

śubhravarṇā || 1 || (-) ||

prakārāntaram (dharmābdhisārepaśapāpaharākalpe ||
sitamakaraniṣaṇṇāṃ śubhravarṇāṃ triṇetrāṃ karadhṛtakalaśodyatsotpalāmatyabhīṣṭām ||
vidhiharihararūpāṃ seṃdukoṭīrajuṣṭāṃ kalitasitadukūlāṃ jāhnavīṃ tāṃ namāmi || 1 || śvetavarṇā || 1 || (-) ||

prakārāṃtaram (kāśīkhaṃḍepūrvārdhesaptaviṃśādhyāye ||
caturbhujāṃ triṇetrāṃ ca nadīnadaniṣevitām ||
lāvaṇyāmṛtaniṣyaṃda saṃśliṣadnātrayaṣṭikām || 1 ||

pūrṇakuṃbhasitāṃbhoja varadābhayasatkarām ||
evaṃ dhyāyet susaumyāṃ ca caṃdrāyuta samaprabhām || 2 ||

cāmarairvījyamānāṃ ca śvetacchatropaśobhitām ||
sudhāplāvitabhūpṛṣṭhāṃ divyagaṃdhānulepanām || 3 ||

trailokyapūjitapadāṃdevarṣibhirabhiṣṭutām || 

śvetavarṇā || 1 ||

(131) atha yamunānadīsvarūpam (-)

kāliṃdīṃśirasānaumi nīlāṃrāmahalāśritām ||
kṛṣṇapādarajaḥpūtāṃ yamunāṃ hṛdi bhāvayet || 1 || 

kṛṣṇavarṇā || 1||

(132) atha godāvarīnadīsvarūpam (-)

godāṃmahānadīṃvaṃde pāṭalāmṛṣisevitām ||
pāvanīṃ sarvalokasya svargadvārasya kuṃcikām || 1 || 

pāṭalavarṇā || 1 ||

(133) atha kṛṣṇānadīsvarūpam (-)

kṛṣṇaveṇinamastubhyaṃ kṛṣṇavarṇe sulakṣaṇe ||
kṛṣṇāṃgarajasādhūta kalmaṣe te namonamaḥ || 1 || 

kṛṣṇavarṇā || 1 ||

<p. 112) 

(134) atha revānadīsvarūpam

viṃdhayaparvatasaṃbhutāṃ revāṃraivata sevitām ||
kalyāṇajananīṃ loke namāmi kanakaprabhām || 1 || 

kanakavarṇā || 1 ||

(135) atha tāpīnadīsvarūpam (-)

tāpīṃtapasvisaṃsevyāṃ raktāṃpāpaugha tāpinīm ||
aṃtastāpapraśamanīṃ praṇamāmi mahānadīm || 1 || 

raktavarṇā ||(1 ||

(136) atha veṇīnadīsvarūpam (-) 

bhavasaṃtāpasaṃdoha śāṃtikṛcchītalodakām ||
veṇīṃ pravālasaṃkāśāmupāse sukhasiddhaye || 1 || 

raktavarṇā || 1 ||

(137) atha sarasvatīnadīsvarūpam (-) 

praveṇīṃ salilāvartāṃ muktābhāṃ gūḍhavāhinīm ||
namāmi maṃgalānaṃda saṃdhātrīṃ bahudhāmudā || 1 || 

mauktikavarṇā || 1 ||

(138) atha parjanyasvarūpam (-) (śaivāgame)

parjanyanāmāvijñeyo gajavaktratrayānvitaḥ ||
yo dhatte sarvajīvānāṃ varaṃ jīvaṃ ca śoṣakam || 1 ||

kuṭhāraṃ capayojaṃ ca ciṃtāratnaṃ mahāśuci ||
pāśaṃ cakraṃ kisalayaṃ kuṃḍikāṃ daśabhiḥ karaiḥ || 2 || 

śvetavarṇā || 1 ||

(139) atha aśvinīdevatayoḥsvarūpam (-) (śaivāgame)

ubhau ca sopavītautau cūḍāmakuṭadhāriṇau ||
phullaraktotpalākṣau ca pītasragvastravarṇakau || 1 ||

nāsatyadasranāmānāvaśvinau bhiṣajau smṛtau || 

śvetavarṇau || 2 || (-) ||

prakārāntaram (-) (vaidyaśāstre āyurvedataṃtre ||

aśvinorākṛtīvakṣye sarvalakṣaṇamaṃḍite ||
pādādi kaṃṭhaparyaṃtamaśvarūpaṃ prakalpayet || 1 ||

vaktrenarākṛtīprākte dvinetre makuṭānvite ||
śrotradvayau sthūlakaṃṭhau caturbāhusamanvitau || 2 ||

aśvapādadvayopetau savyecābhayamoṣadhim ||
karaṃḍaṃ cāmṛtaghaṭaṃvāma haste ca bibhrataḥ || 3 ||

navatāle na kartavyā vaśvinau bhiṣajau smṛtau ||
devānāṃdasranāsatyau nāmnoktau śvetarūpiṇau || 4 || 

śvetavarṇau || 2 ||

<p. 113>

(140) atha kāmadhenusvarūpam (-) (nṛsiṃhaprāsāde)

surabhirgomukhīgaurī strīrupā sarvabhūṣaṇā ||
ghāsamuṣṭiṃ tathākuṃḍīṃ bibhrāṇābhūtapuṣṭidā || 1 || 

gauravarṇā || 1 || (-) || 

prakārāntaram (mahābhārate ādiparvaṇi (176) adhyāye ||
ṣaḍunnatāṃ supārśvoruṃ tripṛthuṃ paṃcasaṃvṛtām ||
maṇḍūkanetrāṃ sannāsāṃ kāmadhenupraninditām || 1 ||

suvāladhiṃ śaṅkukarṇāṃ cāruśṛṅgāṃ manoramām |
atyāyata śirogrīvāṃ vismitā syābhivīkṣitām || 2 || 

gauravarṇā || 1 ||

(141) atha dvādaśāyudhānāṃsvarūpam (-) (śaivāgame)

vajraṃśaktiśca daṃḍaśca khaḍgaṃpāśastathāṃkuśam ||
gadātriśūlacakre ca padmaṃ ceti daśāyudham || 1 ||

dvibhujāśca dvinetrāśca sarvābharaṇabhūṣitāḥ ||
kṛtāṃjali puṭopetāḥ karaṃḍamukuṭānvitāḥ || 2 ||

tattadvaktrapramāṇena tvastramūrtisamanvitāḥ ||
nānāvarṇamahāvidyun nīlajīmūtavarṇakam || 3 ||

pāvakaṃpadmarāgaṃ ca tuṣāraṃ ceṃdranīlakam ||
śāraṃ dābhraṃ ca raktaṃ ca vajrādīnāṃ ca varṇakam || 4 ||

striyaṃ śaktiṃ gadāṃ viṃdyāt pāśapadmena puṃsake ||
śesāḥ puṃstvena vikhyātāḥ kīrtitāstvastramūrtayaḥ || 5 || (-) ||

(nṛsiṃhaprāsāde) tu (-) śaraḥ syāt puruṣo divyo raktāṃgo divya locanaḥ ||
dhanuḥ strīraktapadmābhā mūrdhnibhūṣita cāpabhṛt || 1 ||

evamastrāṇi mūrtāni jānīyāt parameśvari ||
uktānāṃ caiva sarveṣāṃ mūrdhnisvāyudhalāṃchanam || 2 ||

bhujau dvau tu prakartavyau skaṃdhalagna tadā yudhau || 2 ||

atha śaktitrayasvarūpāṇi (-) (kāraṇāgame)

(142) tatrādauprabhuśaktisvarūpam (-)

prabhuśaktiḥ prabhāvākhyā devīkṣātraguṇānugā ||
strīrūpiṇī pāṭalābhā svetāśva varavāhanā || 1 ||

karaṃḍa makuṭe cakra śaktikhaḍgavarāṃkuśān ||
dakṣe vāme śamkhaghaṃṭā kheṭābhaya gadāstathā || 2 ||

daśabhirbibhratī hastaiśśatruvidhvaṃsakāriṇī ||
kausuṃbhavastrasaṃvītā pujitā ceṣṭadā nṛṇām || 3 || 

pāṭalavarṇā || 1 ||

<p. 114>

(143) atha maṃtraśaktisvarupam (-)

maṃtraśaktissvarṇamukhī kuṃkumābhā kirīṭinī ||
khaḍgacāpau bhṛśuṃḍīṃ ca śūlaṃ śaktiṃ varaṃ halam || 1 ||

āvāpabāṇadaṃḍāsi putrīpāśā bhayāṃkuśān ||
caturdaśabhujairddhatte dakṣevāme pṛthakpṛhak || 2 ||

mattebha vāhanāhīrakavacā maṇi mekhalā || 

raktavarṇā || 1 ||

(144) atha utsāhaśaktisvarūpam (-)

śaktirutsāharūpā tu siṃdūravadanā śubhā ||
jāṃbūnadarucirnṛtyan mayūravaravāhanā || 1 ||

ṣaḍbhirbhujaiśśakti cāpavarapāśaśarābhayān ||
dadhānākramaśaścitra vasanāmakuṭojjvalā || 2 || 

upāyairvaśaye cchatrūn devī ceyaṃ śuci smitā || 

raktavarṇā || 1 ||

atha upāyacatuṣṭayadevatāsvarūpam (-) (kāraṇāgama)

(145) tatrādausāmopāyadevatālakṣaṇam (-)

gajārūḍhā smitamukhī kanakābhāsitāṃśukā ||
ṣaḍbhirbhujaiścakraśaṃkha varābhayadhanuśśarān || 1 ||

dadhatī sārcitā nityaṃ vaśaye cchatrumaṃḍalam || 

kanakavarṇā || 1 ||

(146) atha dānopāyasvarūpam (-)

dānopāyākhya devastu śibikāvaravāhanaḥ ||
saṃdhyāruṇoṣṭabhirhastaiścakraṃ padmaṃnidhiṃvaram || 1 ||

dhanurdakṣetareśaṃkhaṃ dakṣekuṃdaśarābhayau ||
dadhānaḥ pītavasanaḥ kirīṭāṃgadaśobhitaḥ || 2 ||

pūjitaśca śubhaṃ dadyād vaśayed ripumaṃdalam || 

raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(147) atha bhedopāyasvarūpam (-)

bhedopāyākhya devastu tarakṣuvaravāhanaḥ ||
meghavarṇaḥ karālāsyaḥ krūradaṃṣṭraśca digbhujaiḥ || 1 ||

cakraśūladhanuḥpāśa varāndakṣethavāmake ||
śaṃkhaṃdaḍaṃśaraṃkhaṭvā bhayaubibhradarīnvaśe || 2 ||

kalayenmardayedvāpi kirīṭakavacojjvalaḥ || 

meghavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 115>

(148) atha daṃḍopāyasvarūpam

daṃḍopāyoraktavarṇaḥ siṃhāsyaśśavavāhanaḥ ||
cakraśūlagadādaṃḍa khaḍgaghaṃṭāvaraṃdhanuḥ || 1 ||

kaśāṃkuśauśaraṃvahniṃ kheṭapāśābhayaṃdaram ||
dadhāno dvyaṣṭabhirhastairnīlaśuklacitāṃśukaḥ || 2 ||

pūjitomardage cchatrūnraṇeraṇavimardakaḥ || 

raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

atha caturdaśamanūnāṃsvarūpāṇi (-) (śaivāgame siddhāṃtaśekhare)

(149) tatrādausvāyaṃbhavamanudhyānam (-)

ādyassvāyaṃbhavobrahma pūtromanuriti smṛtaḥ ||
śatarūpā tasya bhāryā kṣatradharmamanuvrataḥ || 1 ||

priyavratottāna pādau tasya kanyā trayaṃ tathā ||
ākūtiḥrdevahūtiśca prasūtiḥ śvetavarṇavān || 2 ||

kṣātrayogyāstradhārī tu sarveṣāṃ jagatāṃpatiḥ ||
yatradharmāśca vividhāḥ caturvarṇya śritāśśubhāḥ || 3 || 

śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(150) atha svārociṣamanudhyānam (-)

svārociṣo dvitīyastu manuragnessuto bhavat ||
dyumatsuṣeṇarociṣmat pramukhāstasya cātmajāḥ || 1 ||

ūrjā tu tasya bhāryāsīdbrāhmaṃdharmamanuvrataḥ ||
taptakārtasvarābhāsassarveṣāṃ jagatāṃ patiḥ || 2 || 

hemavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(151) atha uttamamanudhyānam (-)

tṛtīya uttamonāma priyavratasutomanuḥ ||
bhāryoṣāsṛṃjayajayahotrādyāstasya cātmajāḥ || 1 ||

raktavarṇostradhāī tu kṣātraṃdharmamanuvrataḥ ||
caturṇāmekasaptatyā yugānāṃ patirīśvaraḥ || 2 || 

raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(152) atha tāmasamanudhyānam (-)

caturtha uttamabhrātā manurnāmnā ca tāmasaḥ ||
khyātiḥ patnīketumaṃta ityādyāstatsutāmatāḥ || 1 ||

priyavratasutastveṣa kṣātraṃdharmamanuvrataḥ ||
haridvarṇostradhārī tu sarveṣāṃ jagatāṃ prabhuḥ || 2 || 

haridvarṇaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 116>

(153) atha raivatamanudhyānam (-)

paṃcamo raivatonāma pūrvayoranujassmṛtaḥ ||
patnīviṃdhyāvaliḥ putrādattakārjunapūrvakāḥ || 1 ||

kṣatrapriyavratasutovarṇaṃ syāmaṃsamāśritaḥ ||
sadākhaḍgādyastradhārī sarveṣāṃ jagatāṃ prabhuḥ || 2 || 

śyāmavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(154) atha cākṣuṣamanudhyānam (-)

ṣaṣṭhastu cakṣuṣaḥ putraśvākṣuṣonāma viśrutaḥ ||
ādityapautrastatpatnī kāṃtistasyātmajāñchṛṇu || 1 ||

tathāpuruśca sudyumna pramukhāstāmravarṇavān ||
brāhmavratadharodevaḥ sarveṣāṃ jagatāṃ prabhuḥ || 2 || 

raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(155) atha vaivasvatamanudhyānam (-)

vaivasvatomanurnāma putrassūryasya saptamaḥ ||
ikṣvāku pramukhāḥ putrāḥ patnīriṣṭiritīritā || 1 ||

kṣātraṃbrāhmaṃśritodharmaṃ smṛti kartā bhuvaḥpatiḥ ||
sauvarṇavarṇaḥ padmākṣo jagatāṃ prabhurīritaḥ || 2 || 

svarṇavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(156) atha sūryasāvarṇimanudhyānam (-)

aṣṭamaḥsūryaputrastu sāvarṇirbhavitā manuḥ ||
nirmohavirājaskādyāḥ pūtrāḥ patnī tu devikā || 1 ||

kṣatriyolokavikhyāto varṇaṃ śyāmaṃ samāśritaḥ ||
caturṇāmekasaptatyā yugānāṃ prabhurīritaḥ || 2 || 

śyāmavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(157) atha dakṣasāvarṇimanudhyānam (-)

navamodakṣasāvarṇirmanurvaruṇasaṃbhavaḥ ||
patnīparādhṛṣṭaketurityādyāstatsutāssmṛtāḥ || 1 ||

kṣatriyo lokavikhyāto varṇaṃ śyāmaṃ sāmāśritaḥ ||
caturnāmekasaptatyā yugānāṃ prabhurīritaḥ || 2 || 

raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(158) atha brahmasāvarṇimanudhyānam (-)

daśamoṃbrāhmasāvarṇi rupaślokamunessutaḥ ||
tatsutābhūriṣeṇādyāstatpatnī bṛhatī matā || 1 ||

brāhmaṇolokavikhyāto varṇaṃ śvetaṃ samāśritaḥ ||
sarveṣāṃ jagatāṃ bhartā pūrvoktā manavo yathā || 2 || 

śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 117>

(159) atha dharmasāvarṇimanudhyānam (-)

manurvaidharmasāvarṇirekādaśa itīritaḥ ||
dharmaputrastatsutāstu satyadharmādayomatāḥ || 1 ||

dīkṣāpatnī raktavarṇaḥ kṣātraṃdharmamanuvrataḥ ||
caturṇāmekasaptatyā yugānāṃ prabhurīritaḥ || 2 || 

raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(160) atha rudrasāvarṇimanudhyānam (-)

bhavitārudrasāvarṇī raudro dvādaśakastathā ||
devānudevāstatputrāḥ patnītvāryā nṛbhiḥ smṛtāḥ || 1 ||

samāśritaḥ kṣatradharmaṃ śyāmavarṇaḥ pratāpavān ||
caṃḍapraśāsanastvāsīt sarveṣāṃ jagatāṃ prabhuḥ || 2 || 

śyāmavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(161) atha vedasāvarṇimanudhyānam (-)

manustrayodaśobhāvyo vedasāvarṇirātmavān ||
āsīdvedaśirāḥ putrobrāhmaṃdharmamanuvrataḥ || 1 ||

citrasenādayaḥ putrāstrayīpatnī susaṃmatā ||
caturṇāmekasaptatyā yugānāṃ patirīśvaraḥ || 2 || 

śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(162) atha iṃdrasāvarṇimanudhyānam (-)

manussyādiṃdrasāvarṇiścaturdaśa itīritaḥ ||
iṃdraputrastatsutāścāpyurugaṃbhīrakādayaḥ || 1 ||

nīlavarṇo dhanurdhārī kṣātraṃdharma manuvrataḥ ||
abhūtpatnīmatistasya sarveṣāṃ jagatāṃ prabhuḥ || 2 || 

nīlavarṇaḥ || 1 || 14 ||

atha navaciraṃjīvināṃsvarūpāṇi (śaivāgame varṇastupādme)

(163) tatrādau aśvatthāmadhyānam

brahmasūtrojjvalabhujorājat kṛṣṇājināṃbaraḥ ||
aśvatthāmā ciraṃjīvī dīrghamāyurdadātume || 1 || 

śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(164) atha balidhyānam (-)

baliḥpātalanilayo dhanurbāṇadharo nṛpaḥ ||
viṣṇupādāṃkitaśirāściraṃ jīvīprasīdatu || 1 || 

kṛṣṇavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 118>

(165) atha vyāsadhyānam (-)

vyāsassamastadharmāṇāṃ vaktāmunivareḍitaḥ ||
ciraṃjīvī dīrghamāyurdadātu jaṭilo mama || 1)  || 

kṛṣṇavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(166) atha hanūmaddhyānam (-)

hanūmānrāmapādābja saṃgīvarṇivaraḥ śuciḥ ||
saṃjīvanāpahartā me dīrghamāyurdadātviha || 1 || 

sphaṭikavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(167) atha bibhiṣaṇadhyānam (-)

bibhīṣaṇodharmaparorāmārcana parāyaṇaḥ ||
dadātu cirajīvitvaṃ ciraṃjīvī jiteṃdriyaḥ || 1 || 

kṛṣṇavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(168) atha kṛpadhyānam (-)

kṛpaḥkṛpāpayorāśistapasvī cīravastra dhṛk ||
vitanotu prasannātmā yāvajjīvamarogatām || 1 || 

śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(169) atha paraśurāmadhyānam (-)

paruśūjjvalahastābjo jaṭāmaṃḍalamaṃḍitaḥ ||
dadātu cirajīvitvaṃ prasannātmā bhṛgūdvahaḥ || 1 || 

svarṇavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(170) atha prahlādadhyānam (-)

viṣṇubhaktaṃ mahāprājñaṃ dvibhujaṃ rākṣasottamam ||
dhyāyāmyahaṃ mahāsaumyaṃ prahlādaṃ cirajīvinam || 1 || 

svarṇavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(171) atha mārkaṃḍeyadhyānam (-)

śrīmaṃtaṃ śāṃtamanasaṃ śivapūjā parāyaṇam ||
vedaśāstrārtha tattvajñaṃ mārkaṃḍeya mahaṃbhaje || 1 || 

śubhravarṇaḥ || 1 || 9 ||

eteṣāṃciraṃjīvināṃvarṇāḥ (-) (pādme)

aśvatthāmā śvetavarṇaḥ kālavarṇo mahābaliḥ ||
vyāsaḥ kṛṣṇo mārutistu sphaṭikābhaḥ prakīrtitaḥ || 1 ||

bibhīṣaṇaḥ kṛṣṇavarṇo kṛpastu dhavalassmṛtaḥ ||
jāmadagnyassuvarṇābho mārkaṃḍeyassitassmṛtaḥ || 2 || 

<p. 119>

prahlādaśca suvarṇābho varṇā eṣāṃ prakīrtitāḥ || 10 ||

(172) atha marīcyādidaśa ṛṣīṇāṃsvarūpāṇi (-) (nṛsiṃhaprāsāde)

marīciratryaṃgirasaupulastyaḥ pulahaḥ kratuḥ ||
sa vedāśca vasiṣṭhaśca bhṛgurnārada eva ca || 1 ||

jaṭilāḥ śmaśrulāśśāṃtāḥ kṛśādharmaratāssadā ||
sukuṃbhākṣadharāḥkāryā munayo dvibhujā daśa || 2 ||

nārado devagaṃdharvassākṣasūtrakamaṃḍaluḥ ||
sakhyeva vīṇayāvāma bhujamūlopagūḍhayā || 3 ||

munayastu prakartavyāśśuklarūpeṇapārthiva || 

śvetavarṇāḥ || 10 ||

atha bhṛgvaṃgirogaṇaḥ (-) (nṛsiṃhaprāsāde)

(173) tatrādaubhṛgugaṇauḥ (-)

kartavyāśśuklarūpeṇa bhṛgavo vāmadevakaḥ ||
bhṛvaṇo bhāvanaścaiva sujanyassujanastathā || 1 ||

kratussarvasvasurnāma tathā ca vyaśrutastathā ||
pravāsaścāvyayaścaiva dakṣodvādaśakastathā || 2 ||

bhṛgavonāmanirdiṣṭā devādvādaśa yājñikāḥ || 

śvetavarṇāḥ || 12 ||

(174) atha aṃgirogaṇaḥ (-)

jīvarūpeṇakartavyā devā aṃgirasastathā ||
ātmā āyurmanodakṣaḥ pādaprāpastathaiva ca || 1 ||

haviṣyaśca gaviṣṭhaśca ṛtassatyaśca devalaḥ || 

pītavarṇāḥ || 9 ||

atha śāstrābhimānināṃdevatānāṃnāmāni (-) (nṛsiṃhaprāsāde)

śikṣāprajāpatirjñeyaḥ kalpo brahmāprakīrtitaḥ ||
sārasvataṃ vyākaraṇaṃ niruktaṃ varuṇaḥ prabhuḥ || 1 ||

chaṃdoditistathaivāgnirjyotiṣaṃ bhagavānhariḥ ||
mīmāṃsā bhagavānsomo nyāyamārgassamīraṇaḥ || 2 ||

dharmaśca dharmaśāstrāṇāṃ purāṇasya tathāmanuḥ ||
itihāsaḥ prajādhyakṣo dhanurvedaśśatakratuḥ || 3 ||

āyurvedastathāsākṣād devodhanvaṃtariḥ prabhuḥ ||
phalavedo mahādevo nṛttaśāstraṃ maheśvaraḥ || 4 ||

<p. 120>

saṃkarṣaṇaḥ pāṃcarātraṃ rudraḥpāśupataṃ tathā ||
pātaṃjalamanaṃtaśca sāṃkhyaṃ ca kapilo muniḥ || 5 ||

arthaśāstrāṇi sarvāṇi dhanādhyakṣaḥ prakīrtitaḥ ||
kalāśāstrāṇi sarvāṇi kāmadevo jagadguruḥ || 6 ||

anyāniyāniśāstrāṇi yatkṛtāni pracakṣate ||
sa eva devatā tasya śāstraṃ kāvyaṃ ca vedavat || 7 ||

(175) atha yakṣasvarūpam (-)

yakṣāssarve guṇādhyakṣāḥ khaḍgakheṭadharāśśubhaḥ ||
khecarā ye devacarāstānnamasye sukhāptaye || 1 || 1 ||

(176) atha viśvakarmasvarūpam (-) (hemādraudānakhaṃḍe)

viśvakartā tu kartavyaśśmaśruloraśanādharaḥ ||
saṃdaṃśapāṇirdvibhujastejo mūrtidharo mahān || 1 || 

kanakavarṇaḥ || 1 || 1 ||

[iti śrīmatsamastabhūmaṃḍalamaṃḍanāyamānanikhiladeśāvataṃsakarnāṭakajanapada(-)saṃpadadhiṣṭhānabhūtaśrīmanmahīśūramahāsaṃsthānamadhyadedīpyamānā(-)vikalakalānidhikulakramāgatarājakṣitipālapramukhanikhilanijarājādhirājamahārāja(-)cakravartimaṃḍalānubhūtadivyaratnasiṃhāsanārūḍhaśrīmadrājādhirājarāja(-)parameśvaraprauḍhapratāpāpratimavīranarapatibirudeṃteṃbaragaṃḍalokaikavīrayadu(-)kulapayaḥ parāvārakalānidhiśaṃkhacakrāṃkuśakuṭhāramakaramatsyaśarabha(-)sālvagaṃḍabheruṃḍadharaṇīvarāhahanumadgaruḍakaṃṭhīravādyanekabirudāṃkita(-)mahīśūrapuravarādhīśaśrīkṛṣṇarājamahārājaviracite śrītattvanidhyākhyagrandhe caturmukhapaṃcabrahmadikpālādisvarūpanirūpaṇaṃnāmacaturthonidhissaṃpūrṇaḥ] ||

[iti śrītattvanidhyākhyagranthe caturmukhapaṃcabrahmādi nirūpaṇaṃ nāmacaturtho brahmanidhiḥ sampūrṇaḥ] ||


|| śrīḥ ||

atha

[śrītattvanidhau

paṃcamograhanidhiḥ] |

athādhidevatāpratyadhidevatāsahitanavagrahasvarūpāṇi (prayogaratnenārāyaṇabhaṭṭīyevākyaiḥ (-) ślokaistu mayūkhe)

(1) tatrādau sūryadhyānam (-)

bhagavannādityagrahādhipate kāśyapagotra kaliṃgadeśeśvara saptamyāṃviśākhānakṣatrajāta japāpuṣpopamāṃgadyute dvibhuja padmābhayahasta siṃdūravarṇāṃbaramālyānulepana jvalanmāṇikyakhacitasarvāṃgābharaṇa bhāsvaratejonidhe trilokīprakāśakadevatātrayīmūrte namaste sannaddhābharaṇapatākopaśobhitena saptāśvarathavāhanaikacakreṇa rathena meruṃ pradakṣiṇīkurvannāgaccha agnirudrābhyāṃ saha padmakarṇikāyāṃ tāmrapratimāṃ prāṅmukhavartulapīṭhamadhitiṣṭheti sāṅgaṃsāyudhaṃsaśaktiṃsapatnīkaṃdhyāyet || (-) || 

padmāsanaḥpadmakaraḥ padmagarbhasamadyutiḥ || 
saptāśvarathasaṃyukto dvibhujassyāt sadāraviḥ || 1 || 

pāṭalavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(2)  atha caturvaktrasūryadhyānam (-) (śāradātilake)

hemāṃbhojapravālapratimanijaruciṃcārukhaṭvāṃgapadme
cakraṃśaktiṃ ca pāśaṃ(-)sṛṇimatiruciraṃ cākṣamālāṃ kapālam ||
hastāṃbhojairdadhānaṃ trinayanavilasadvedavaktrābhirāmaṃ mārtāṃḍaṃvallabhāḍhyaṃ maṇimayamakuṭaṃ hīradīptaṃ bhajāmaḥ || 1 || 

vidrumavarṇā || 1 || (-) ||

<p. 122> 

prakārāṃtareṇadhyānam (-) (śāradātilake) 

raktāṃbujāsanamaśeṣa guṇaikasiṃdhuṃbhānuṃ samastajagatāmadhipaṃ bhajāmi ||
padmadvayābhayavarāndadhataṃ karābjairmāṇikyamaulimaruṇāṃgaruciṃ triṇetram || 1 || 

raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(3) atha sūryādhidevatāgnidhyānam (-)

piṃgabhrūśmaśrukeśaśca piṃgākṣi tritayoruṇaḥ ||
chāgasthaḥ sākṣasūtraśca varadaḥ śaktidhārakaḥ || 1 || 

aruṇavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(4) atha sūryapratyadhidevatārudradhyānam (-)

paṃcavaktrovṛṣārūḍhaḥ prativaktraṃ trilocanaḥ ||
kapālaśūlakhaṭvāṃgapinākīṃduśirāḥ śivaḥ || 1 || 

śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(5) atha caṃdradhyānam (-)

bhagavaṃtsomadvijādhipate sudhāmayaśarīrātrigotra yāmunadeśeśvara gokṣīradhavalāṃgadyute dvibhuja gadāvaradāṃkitakara śuklābaramālyānulepana mauktikābharaṇaramaṇīya samastalokāpyāyakadevatāsvādyamūrte namaste sannaddhadhavaladhvajopaśobhitena daśāśvarathavāhanena tricakrarathena meruṃ pradakṣiṇīkurvannāgaccha adbhirumayā saha padmāgneyadalamadhye sphaṭikapratimāṃ prāṅmukhīṃ caturasrapīṭhamadhitiṣṭheti sapatnīputraṃ sāyudhaṃ sāṃgaṃ caṃdraṃ bhāvayet || (-) ||

śvetaḥśvetāṃbaradharo daśāśvaśśvetabhūṣaṇaḥ ||
gadāpāṇirdvibāhuśca kartavyo varadaśśaśī || 1 || 

śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 || (-) ||

prakārāṃtareṇa caṃdradhyānam (-) (śāradātilake) 

karpūrasphaṭikāvadātamaniśaṃ pūrneṃdubiṃbānanaṃ 
muktādāmabibhūṣitena vapuṣānirmūlayaṃ taṃ tamaḥ ||
hastābhyāṃ kumudaṃvaraṃ ca dadhataṃ nīlālakodbhāsitaṃ 
svasyāṃkasthamṛgoditā śrayaguṇaṃ somaṃ sudhābdhiṃ bhaje || 1 || 

śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(6) atha caṃdrādhidevatānāmapāṃdhyānam (-)

āpastrīrūpadhāriṇyaḥ śvetāmakaravāhanāḥ ||
dadhānāḥ pāśakalaśau muktābharaṇabhūṣitāḥ || 1 || 

śvetavarṇāḥ || 1 ||

<p. 123>

(7) atha pratyadhidevatomādhyānam (-)

akṣasūtraṃ ca kamalaṃ darpaṇaṃ ca kamaṃḍalum ||
umābibharti hasteṣu pūjitā tridaśairapi || 1 || 

svarṇavarṇā || 1 ||

(8) atha aṃgārakadhyānam (-)

bhagavannaṃgāraka agnyākṛte bharadvājagotra avaṃtīdeśeśvara aṣṭamyāṃ śravaṇanakṣatrotpanna jvālāpuṃjopamāṃgadyute caturbhujaśaktiśūlagadākhaṭvāṃgadhārin raktāṃbaramālyānulepana pravālābharaṇabhūṣitasarvāṃgadyute ālokadīpte namaste sannaddharaktadhvajopaśobhitena raktameṣāṣṭarathavāhanena meruṃ pradakṣiṇīkurvannāgaccha bhūmiskaṃdābhyāṃ saha padmadakṣiṇadalamadhye raktacaṃdanapratimāṃ dakṣiṇābhimukhīṃ trikoṇapīṭhamadhitiṣṭhetisāṅgaṃsāyudhaṃsapatnīkaṃ bhāvayet || (-) ||

raktamālyāṃbaradharaḥ śaktiśūlagadādharaḥ ||
caturbhujomeṣagamovaradassyāddharāsutaḥ || 1 || 

raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(9) atha aṃgārakādhidevatābhūmidhyānam (-)

śuklavarṇāmahīkāryā divyābharaṇabhūṣitā ||
caturbhujā saumyavapuścaṃḍāṃśu sadṛśāṃbarā || 1 ||

ratnapātraṃ sasyapātraṃ pātramoṣadhisaṃyutam ||
padmaṃkare ca kartavyaṃ bhuvoyādavanaṃdana || 2 ||

diggajānāṃ caturṇāṃ sā kāryā pṛṣṭhagatā tathā || 

śvetavarṇā || 1 ||

(10) atha aṃgārakapratyadhidevatāskaṃdadhyānam (-)

kumāraṣṣaṇmukhaḥkāryaśśikhikhaṃḍavibhūṣaṇaḥ ||
raktāṃbaradharodevo mayūravaravāhanaḥ || 1 ||

kukkuṭaśca tathāghaṃṭā tasya dakṣiṇahastayoḥ ||
patākāvaijayaṃtī syācchaktiḥ kāryā ca vāmayoḥ || 2 || 

pāṭalavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(11) atha budhadhyānam (-)

bhagavan saumyadyute sarvajñānamaya atrigotra dvādaśyāṃdhaniṣthānakṣatrotpanna magadhadeśeśvara kuṃkumavarṇāṃgadyute caturbhuja khaḍgakheṭagadāvaradānāṃkitakara pītamālyānulepana marakatābharaṇālaṃkṛtasarvāṃgadyute vibudhamate namaste sannaddhaharitadhvajopaśobhitena catussiṃharathavāhanena meruṃ pradakṣiṇīkurvannāgaccha viṣṇupuruṣābhyāṃ saha padmeśānadalamadhye suvarṇapratimāmudaṅmukhīṃbāṇākārapīṭhamadhitiṣṭheti sāṃgaṃ sāyudhaṃsapatnīkaṃ saparivāraṃ saśaktiṃ bhāvayet || (-) ||

<p. 124>

pītamālyāṃbaradharaḥkarṇikārasamadyutiḥ ||
khaḍgacarmagadāpāṇissiṃhasthovarado budhaḥ || 1 || 

kanakavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(12) atha budhādhidevatāviṣṇudhyānam (-)

viṣṇuḥkaumodakīpadmaśaṃkhacakraṃdharaḥ kramāt ||
pradakṣiṇaṃ dakṣiṇādhaḥ karādārabhya nityaśaḥ || 1 || 

śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(13) atha budhapratyadhidevatāpuruṣadhyānam (-)

puruṣamūrtissvarṇavarṇaḥ caturbhujaḥ śaṃkhacakragadāpadmadharaḥ kāryaḥ || 

svarṇavarṇaḥ || 1 || 1 ||

(14) atha bṛhaspatidhyānam (-)

bhagavan bṛhaspate samastadevatācārya āṃgirasagotra siṃdhudeśeśvara dīptasuvarṇasadṛśāṃgadīpte caturbhuja daṃḍakamaṃḍalvakṣasūtravaradāṃkitakara pītāṃbaramālyānulepana puṣyarāgābharaṇaramaṇīya samastavidyādhipate namaste sannaddhapītadhvajopaśobhitena aṣṭāśvarathavāhanena meruṃ pradakṣiṇīkurvannāgaccha iṃdrabrahmabhyāṃ saha padmottaradalamadhye suvarṇapratimāmudaṅmukhīṃdīrghacaturasrapīṭhamadhitiṣṭhetisāṃgaṃsāyudhaṃ saparivāraṃ sapatnīkaṃ saśaktiṃ bhāvayet || (-) ||

aṣṭabhiḥ pāṃḍarairyuktovājibhiḥ kāṃcane rathe ||
tiṣṭhantarati vai varṣaṃ rāśaurāśau bṛhaspatiḥ || 1 ||

devadaityagurūśuddhau pītaśvetau caturbhujau ||
daṃḍinau varadau kāryau sākṣasūtrakamaṇḍalū || 2 || 

kanakavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(15) atha gurvadhidevatendradhyānam (-)

caturdaṃtagajārūḍho vajrāṃkuśalasatkaraḥ ||
prācīpatiḥ prakartavyo nānābharaṇabhūṣitaḥ || 1 || 

svarṇavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 125>

(16) atha gurupratyadhidevatābrahmadhyānam (-)

padmāsanasthaṃ jaṭilaṃ caturmukhamakṣamālā sruvapustakakamaṃḍaludharaṃ kṛṣṇājinavāsasaṃpārśvasthita haṃsaṃbrahmāṇaṃ bhāvayet || 

pāṭalavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(17) atha śukradhyānam (-)

bhagavan bhārgava samastadaityaguro bhārgavagotra bhojakaṭadeśeśvara rajatojjvalāṃgakāṃte caturbhuja daṃḍakamaṃḍalvakṣasūtravaradānāṃkitakara śuklāṃbaramālyānulepana vajrābharaṇabhūṣitasarvāṃga samastanītiśāstranipuṇamate namaste śukladhvajopaśobhitena śuklāṣṭāśvarathavāhanena meruṃ pradakṣiṇīkurvannāgaccha iṃdrāṇīṃdrābhyāṃ saha padmapūrvadalamadhye rajatapratimāṃprāṅmukhīṃ paṃcakoṇapīṭhamadhitiṣṭheti sāṅgaṃ sāyudhaṃ saparivāraṃ sapatnīkaṃ saśaktiṃ bhāvayet || (-) ||

savarūthassānukarṣo yukto bhūsaṃbhavairhayaiḥ ||
sopāsaṃgapatākastu śuklassyāttu rathomahān || 1 ||

devadaityagurūśuddhau pītaśvetau caturbhujau ||
daṃḍinau varadau kāryau sākṣasūtrakamaṃḍalū || 2 || 

śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(18) atha śukrādhidevateṃdrāṇīdhyānam (-)

vāmeśacyāḥ karekāryā saumyāsaṃtānamaṃjarī ||
abhayā''maṃḍitākāryādvibhujā ca tathā śacī || 1 || 

kanakavarṇā || 1 ||

(19) atha śukrapratyadhidevateṃdradhyānam (-)

śvetahastisamārūḍhaṃ vajrāṃkuśalasatkaram ||
sahasranetraṃ pītābhamiṃdraṃ hṛdivibhāvaye || 1 || 

kanakavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(20) atha śanaiścaradhyānam (-)

bhagavan śanaiścara bhāskaratanaya kāśyapagotra saurāṣṭradeśeśvara kajjalasamāṃgadyute caturbhuja cāpabāṇakṛpāṇābhayāṃkitakara nīlāṃbaramālyānulepana nīlaratnabhūṣaṇālaṃkṛtasarvāṃga samastabhuvanabhīṣaṇāmarṣamūrte namaste sannaddhanīladhvajopaśobhitena nīlagṛdhrāṣṭarathavāhanena meruṃ pradakṣiṇīkurvannāgaccha prajāpatiyamābhyāṃ saha padmapaścimadalamadhye kālāyasapratimāṃ pratyaṅmukhīṃ cāpākārapīṭhamadhitiṣṭheti sāṅgaṃ sāyudhaṃ saparivāraṃ sapatnīkaṃ saśaktiṃ bhāvayet || (-) ||

<p. 126>

iṃdranīladyutiḥkhaḍgīvaradogṛdhravāhanaḥ ||
bāṇacāpadharovīraḥ kartavyorkasutassadā || 1 || 

kṛṣaṇavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(21) atha śanyadhidevatāprajāpatidhyānam (-)

haṃsayānenakartavyo na ca kāryaścaturmukhaḥ ||
sāvitrī tasya kartavyā vāmotsaṃgagatā śubhā || 1 ||

brahmoktaṃ paramaṃ kāryaṃ rūpaṃ sarvaṃ prajāpateḥ ||
yajñopavītī haṃsastha ekavaktraścaturbhujaḥ || 2 || 

akṣasrajaṃ sruvaṃ bibhratkuṃḍikāṃ pustakaṃ tathā || 

padmavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(22) atha śanipratyadhidevatāyamadhyānam (-)

raktadṛkpāśahastaśca yamomahiṣavāhanaḥ ||
kālaḥkarālavadanaḥ nīlāṃgaścāti bhīṣaṇaḥ || 1 || 

nīlavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(23) atha rāhudhyānam (-)

bhagavan rāho ravisomavimardana siṃhikānaṃdana paiṭhīnasigotra barbaradeśeśvara kālameghadyute vyāghravadana caturbhuja khaḍgacarmaśūlavaradānāṃkitakara kṛṣṇāṃbaramālyānulepana gomedhikābharaṇabhūṣitasarvāṃga sauryanidhe namaste sannaddhakṛṣṇadhvajopaśobhitenakṛṣṇasiṃharathavāhanena merumapradakṣiṇīkurvannāgaccha sarpakālābhyāṃ saha padmanair(-)ṛtyadalamadhye sīsakapratimāṃ dakṣimābhimukhīṃ śūrpākārapīṭhamadhitiṣṭheti sāṃgaṃ sāyudhaṃ saparivāraṃ sapatnīkaṃ saśaktiṃ bhāvayet || (-) ||

karālavadanaḥ khaḍgacarmaśūlīvarapradaḥ ||
nīlasiṃhāsanasthaśca rāhurmesyācchubha pradaḥ || 1 || 

nīlameghavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(24) atha rāhvadhidevatāsarpadhyānam (-)

akṣasūtradharāssarpāḥ kuṃḍikāpucchabhūṣaṇāḥ ||
ekabhogāstribhogā vā sarvekāryāśca bhīṣaṇāḥ || 1 || 

raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(25) atha rāhupratyadhidevatākāladhyānam (-)

kālaḥkarālavadano nīlāṃgaścāti bhīṣaṇaḥ ||
pāśadaṃḍadharaḥ kāryassarpavṛścikaromavān || 1 || 

kṛṣṇavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 127>

(26) atha ketudhyānam (-)

bhagavanketo dhūmarūpa jaiminigotra madhyadeśeśvara dhūmravarṇadhvajākṛte dvibhuja gadāvaradānāṃkitakara citramālyānulepana vaiḍūryavarābharaṇabhūṣitasarvāṃga vicitraśakte namaste sannaddhacitradhvajopaśobhitena citrakapotarathavāhanena merumapradakṣiṇīkurvannāgaccha brahmacitraguptābhyāṃ saha padmavāyavyadalamadhye kāṃsyapratimāṃ dakṣiṇābhimukhīṃ dhvajākārapīṭhamadhitiṣṭheti sāṃgaṃ sāyudhaṃ saparivāraṃ sapatnīkaṃ saśaktiṃ bhāvayet || (-) ||

dhūmrāssukhāvahāssarve gadinovikṛtā nanāḥ ||
kapotavāhanā nityaṃ ketavassyūrvarapradāḥ || 1 ||

sarvekirīṭinaḥ kāryā grahā lokahitāvahāḥ ||
(ketūnāṃbahutvepi ekasyaiva prādhānyam ) dhūmravarṇāḥ || 1 ||

(27) atha ketvadhidevatābrahmadhyānam (-) (śaivāgame)

viriṃciṃvākpatiṃśveta paṃkajasthaṃ mahāprabham ||
akṣasrakkuṃḍikābhīti dānahastaṃ viciṃtaye || 1 || 

padmavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(28) atha ketupratyadhidevatācitraguptadhyānam (-) (bhaṭṭabhāskarīye)

apīcyaveṣaṃ svākāraṃ dvibhujaṃ saumyadarśanam ||
dakṣiṇe lekhinīṃ caiva dadhaṃvāme ca patrakam || 1 ||

piṃgalaśma śrukeśākṣaṃ citraguptaṃ vibhāvayet || 

kanakavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

atha karmasādguṇyadevatānāṃdhyānam (-)

(29) tatrādaudurgādhyānam (-) (śaivāgame)

durgāṃvipattidhutaye bhujāṣṭakavibhūṣitām ||
dhyāyāmi daityahaṃtrīṃ tāṃraktā svādana tatparām || 1 || 

nīlavarṇā || 1 ||

(30) atha gaṇapatidhyānam (-) (śaivāgame)

ekadaṃtaṃgajamukhaṃ śuṃḍālaṃ modakapriyam ||
śūrpakarṇaṃ namasyāmi śirasākhuvarasthitam || 1 || 

raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 128>

(31) atha kṣetrapāladhyānam (-) (kāraṇāgame)

kṣetrapālaṃ śyāmavarṇaṃ bhrukuṭīkuṭilānanam ||
trilocanaṃ cordhvakeśamatikruddhaṃ sudaṃṣṭrakam || 1 ||

nūpurālaṃ kṛtāṃghriṃ ca sarpaśṛṃkhalabhūṣitam ||
kṣudraghaṃṭā baddhagulphaṃ kapālasragvibhūṣaṇam || 2 ||

nāgayajñopavītaṃ ca caṃdramauliṃ digaṃbaram ||
dakṣiṇeśūlavetāla khaḍgaduṃdubhidhāriṇam || 3 ||

vāmekapālaghaṃṭocca carmacāpāṃśca bibhratam ||
kṣetrapālamahaṃvande sarvāriṣṭopa śāṃtaye || 4 || 

śyāmavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(32) atha abhayaṃkaradhyānam (-) (śaivāgame)

ānamrajanasaṃdoha bhītivrātavināśanam ||
abhayaṃkaramīḍehaṃ satataṃ saukhyadāyinam || 1 ||

kanakavarṇaḥ || anyatsarvamiṃdravat (4) ni(0) || 1 ||

(33) atha vāstupuruṣadhyānam (-) (śaivāgame)

mānadaṃḍaṃkarābjena vahaṃtaṃ bhūmiśodhakam ||
vaṃdehaṃ vāstupuruṣaṃ śayānaṃ śayane śubhe || 1 || 

nīlavarṇaḥ || dvibhujaḥ || 1 ||

(34) atha mṛtyuṃjayadhyānam (-) (śaivāgame)

dalatsarojamadhyasthaṃ caṃdrasūryāgnilocanam ||
maulibaddheṃdu vigaladamṛtādraṃsitadyutim || 1 ||

mudrāṃ pāśaṃ pustakaṃ ca bibhrāṇaṃ cākṣasūtrakam ||
bhaktārtiharamīśānaṃ mṛtyuṃjayamupāsmahe || 2 || 

śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(35) atha caturyugasvarūpāṇi (-) (padmapurāṇe)

evaṃ vṛṣeṃdravadanā yugārājankṛtādayaḥ ||
supakvāmrātasīpuṣpanīlābjaśukasannibhāḥ || 1 ||

sarvesadvastrasatpuṣpa sa dalaṃkaraṇojjvalāḥ ||
śaṃkhapadmadharāssarve varābhayakarāstu vai || 2 || 4 ||

(36) tatrakalipuruṣasvarūpam (-) (śrīviṣṇubhāgavate)

nṛpaliṃgadharaṃśūdraṃ ghnaṃtaṃ gomithunaṃ padā || (1) skaṃ(0) (16) adhyā(0) || (-) ||
prakārāntaram ||

daṃḍahastaṃ ca vṛṣalaṃ dadṛśe nṛpalāṃchanam || (1) skaṃ(0) 17 adhyā(0) kṛṣṇavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 129>

(37) atha caturyugābhimānidevatādhyānam (-) (padmapurāṇe)

kṛtevalakṣastretāyāmaruṇo dvāpare tathā ||
pītaḥkalaughanaśyāmo vāsudevaḥ puraḥpumān || 1 ||

śaṃkhaṃśārṅgaṃgadāṃcakraṃ dadhānābāhubhiḥ kramāt ||
sukhāsīnāścāruhastā yugānāmadhi devatāḥ || 2 || 4 ||

atha prabhavādiṣaṣṭisaṃvatsarāṇāṃsvarūpāṇi (-) (kāraṇāgamemadanaratne horāyām)

(38) tatrādauprabhavasaṃvatsarasvarūpam (-)

akṣadhṛgbhūtipuṃḍrastu dvipādaḥ kṛṣṇavarṇakaḥ ||
raktākṣasthūladehaśca prabhavobrāhmaṇaḥ pumān || 1 || 

kṛṣṇavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(39) atha vibhavasaṃvatsarasvarūpam (-)

ratnamuktā mayīṃ mālāṃ dadhānaṃ kaṃṭhadeśake ||
divyāṃgadaṃrathārūḍhaṃ dhyāyedvibhavamīdṛśam || 1 || 

meghavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(40) atha śuklasaṃvatsarasvarūpam (-)

divyāṃgarāgasaṃchannaṃ śvetavastropaśobhitam ||
lipikalpadrumasyādho dhyāyechruklākhya vatsaram || 1 || 

śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(41) atha pramodūtasaṃvatsarasvarūpam (-)

paṃcāsyo tyugra mūrtiśca lolākṣaśśyāmarūpadhṛt ||
pramodūtassavijñeyaḥ kāṃtāliṃgitavigrahaḥ || 1 || 

śyāmavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(42) atha prajāpatisaṃvatsarasvarūpam (-)

jvalatkālānalaprakhyo varadābhayapāṇimān ||
mahodaro lohitākṣo vatsarastu prajāvatiḥ || 1 || 

raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(43) atha āṃgirasasaṃvatsarasvarūpaṃ (-)

phālenayanayormadhye cakrākāraṃ sitadyuti ||
padmahastadvayaṃ devaṃ dhyāyedāṃgira sābhidham || 1 || 

śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 130>

(44) atha śrīmukhasaṃvatsarasvarūpam (-)

anekaratnasaṃchannaṃ kṣvelapīnagalaṃparam ||
puṣkarākṣaṃ haridrābhaṃ dhyāyecchrīmukhavatsaram || 1 || 

kanakavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(45) atha bhāvasaṃvatsarasvarūpam (-)

jaḍabhāvayutaścaiva karalagnamṛgastathā ||
ūrdhvabāhuyutaścaiva dvibhujaḥ kṣatriyassmṛtaḥ || 1 || 

raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(46) atha yuvasaṃvatsarasvarūpam (-)

gārutmatasamākḷpta kaṭākṣahasitotpalam ||
dvibhujaṃ śvetavarṇaṃ ca padmākṣaṃyuvavatsaram || 1 || 

śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(47) atha dhātusaṃvatsarasvarūpam (-)

padmahastadharaṃ devaṃ kailāsācalasannibham ||
triṇetraṃ padmavarṇaṃ ca nirbhayaṃ dhātusaṃjñakam || 1 || 

padmavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(48) atha īśvarasaṃvatsarasvarūpam (-)

udyadbhānasahasrābhaṃ dvibāhuṃcordhvadiṅmukham ||
citrāṃbaradharaṃdevaṃ dhyāyedīśvarasaṃjñakam || 1 || 

aruṇavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(49) atha bahudhānyasaṃvatsarasvarūpam (-)

amṛtakalaśahastaḥkāṃtisaṃpūrṇadehaḥ sakalavibudhavaṃdyovedaśāstraikaciṃtaḥ ||
vitatalalitatejādīrghavakṣādvipādaḥ kamalanayanayuktaściṃtitodvādaśobdaḥ || 1 || 

nīlavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(50) atha pramāthisaṃvatsarasvarūpam (-)

dharmiṣṭhogauravarṇaśca dīrghavakṣassamanivtaḥ ||
graiveyakṛtamāṇikyaḥ pramāthī vatsaraḥpumān || 1 || 

kanakavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(51) atha vikramasaṃvatsarasvarūpam (-)

śyāmanetraṃ ca śilpajñaṃ godhūmābhaṃ hitoktikam ||
madhyamoccaṃ dīrghabāhuṃ dvipādaṃ vikramaṃ viduḥ || 1 || 

godhūmavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 131>

(52)  atha viṣusaṃvatsarasvarūpam (-)

viṣusaṃvatsaronāmnā nīlāṃgo nyāsatatparaḥ ||
ākhubhuksadṛśokṣibhyāṃ mukhevraṇayutaścalaḥ || 1 || 

nīlavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(53) atha citrabhānusaṃvatsarasvarūpam (-)

dvibāhuḥkubjakaḥśyāva ūrdhvakeśasamanvitaḥ ||
devālaye japansthāne nānālaṃkārabhūḍitaḥ || 1 || 

kapilavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(54) atha svabhānusaṃvatsarasvarūpam (-)

kapilaḥ krūraceṣṭaśca raktāṃbara vibhūṣitaḥ ||
tṛṣārtomeṣavadanassvabhānurdvibhujo vibhuḥ || 1 || 

kapilavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(55) atha tāraṇasaṃvatsarasvarūpam (-)

suṃdarodīrghadehaśca nṛtyavādyakalākṛtī ||
nīrajākṣo vyāghrapātsyād gajāsyastāraṇābhidhaḥ || 1 || 

raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(56) atha pārthivasaṃvatsarasvarūpam (-)

tapasvīgauravarṇaśca dīrghakaṃṭho vṛkodaraḥ ||
taskarodaṃḍayuktaśca sthūloṣaṭhaḥ pārthivaḥ smṛtaḥ || 1 || 

gauravarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(57) atha vyayasaṃvatsarasvarūpam (-)

dīrghāsyaḥ śyāvatejāśca raktalocanakeśavān ||
nipuṇaḥ satyavākcaiva vyayovyayakaraḥpumān || 1 || 

kapilavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(58) atha sarvajitsaṃvatsarasvarūpam (-)

dīrghanāsāmukhaḥśūraḥ sūkṣmoṣṭho gauravarṇakaḥ ||
saddhastaḥ kūpakhanakaḥ sarvajitsarvasādhakaḥ || 1 || 

gauravarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(59) atha sarvadhārisaṃvatsarasvarūpam (-)

abhūrigrāmavāsī ca sūkṣmanetraḥ kṛṣībalaḥ ||
sūkṣmoṣṭho dīrghadehaśca sarvadhārī ca sarvadā || 1 || 

raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 132>

(60) atha virodhisaṃvatsarasvarūpam (-)

taskarohiṃsakaścaiva hyāmlabhuṅmaṃdalocanaḥ ||
sūkṣmagrīvasthūladehasthūlamadhyo virodhikaḥ || 1 || 

raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(61) atha vikṛtisaṃvatsarasvarūpam (-)

suṃdarodīrghadehaśca tapasvīgauravarṇakaḥ ||
śuṣkodarodīrghakaṃtho raktākṣo vikṛtiḥ pumān || 1 || 

gauravarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(62) atha kharasaṃvatsarasvarūpam (-)

devālaye nadītīre caturbāhusthitaḥ kharaḥ ||
varadhābhayapāṇiśca gadāpadmadharaḥ paraḥ || 1 || 

raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(63) atha naṃdanasaṃvatsarasvarūpam (-)

raktākṣodīrghabāhuśca dīrghaghrāṇasamanvitaḥ ||
bhasmarudrākṣasaṃyukto varado naṃdanaḥ pumān || 1 || 

raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(64) atha vijayasaṃvatsarasvarūpam (-)

dvibāhuḥpadmasaṃkāśaśśaracāpayutaḥ pumān ||
vāmatassarvato dṛṣṭirvijayorjunamūlagaḥ || 1 || 

padmavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(65) atha jayasaṃvatsarasvarūpam (-)

dvibāhuḥsthulakaṭimānraktalocanasaṃyutaḥ ||
varadābhayapāṇiśca sitaḥ śyāmayutojayaḥ || 1 || 

dhūmravarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(66) atha manmathasaṃvatsarasvarūpam (-)

padmākṣovṛttabāhuśca śaracāpayutaḥ pumān ||
baḍabāpaṃcakārūḍho manmatho manmathā kṛtiḥ || 1 || 

kāṃcanavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(67) atha durmukhisaṃvatsarasvarūpam (-)

daṃṣṭrākarālavadana udyadiṃdunibhadyutiḥ ||
dvibāhuḥśārṅgapāṇiśca durmukhī durmukholasaḥ || 1 || 

śvetavarṇaḥ ||

<p. 133>

(68) atha hemalaṃbivi(ma)laṃbisaṃvatsarasvarūpe (-)

hemalaṃbīvi(ma)laṃ bicaraktākṣau krūravihvalau ||
raktavarṇau tu tau vṛddhau sadāmātṛsamīpagau || 1 || 

raktavarṇau || 2 ||

(69) atha vikāriśārvarisaṃvatsarasvarūpe (-)

vikārīśārvarī caiva bhṛśuṃḍī musalā yudhau ||
śiṃśupākhyatarormūle cāsīnau girisannibhau || 1 || 

raktavarṇau || 2 ||

(70) atha plavasaṃvatsarasvarūpam (-)

naukāsamudratīrastho dvīpāṃtaragatissadā ||
turaṃgaguptiyuktaśca capalaḥ plavavatsaraḥ || 1 || 

raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(71) atha śubhakṛcchobhakṛtsaṃvatsarayoḥsvarūpe (-)

śubhakṛcchobhakṛccaiva vane vṛddhasvarūpiṇau ||
dhāriṇau puṃḍrarudrākṣaṃ malayadrumasannibhau || 1 || 

raktavarṇau || 2 ||

(72) atha krodhisaṃvatsarasvarūpam (-)

sarvato vyāghrasaṃvīto bhayaśīlaḥ kṣudhārditaḥ ||
śivanārāyaṇau dhyāyankrodhyabdo hrasvakaḥsitaḥ || 1 || 

śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(73) atha viśvāvasusaṃvatsarasvarūpam (-)

araṇye nirjale bhūmau sthito viśvā vasuḥ pumān ||
vāpīsopānamāśritya dhyāyanvai viśvato mukham || 1 || 

raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(74) atha parābhavaplavaṃgasaṃvatsarasvarūpe (-)

parābhavaḥplavaṃgaśca śvetaupuṣkarasannidhau ||
tiṣṭhatyekaḥ plavatyekaḥ yuvānāvati darpitau || 1 || 

śvetavarṇau || 2 ||

(75) atha kīlakasaumyasaṃvatsarasvarūpe (-)

dhṛtvāśirasibhāṃdaṃ ca yuvānau nīlalohitau ||
kīlakaścaiva saumyaśca tapasyaṃtau girestaṭe || 1 || 

nīlaraktavarṇau || 2 ||

<p. 134>

(76) atha sādhāraṇasaṃvatsarasvarūpam (-)

sādhāraṇassarasvatyāstīre vipraughasaṃvṛtaḥ ||
purastāddevamīśānamarcayanvasati dvijaḥ || 1 || 

kanakavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(77) atha virodhikṛtsaṃvatsarasvarūpaṃ (-)

virodhikṛtkrūrakarmā dhanurbāṇayuto niśam ||
raktākṣaḥ sthūladehaśca mṛgānhiṃsaṃścaratyayam || 1 || 

nīlavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(78) atha paridhāvisaṃvatsarasvarūpam (-)

mṛgacarmaśirastrāṇo dhanvīkutiladṛkśaṭhaḥ ||
upānadbhyāṃ mṛgānnighnanparidhāvī vane caraḥ || 

śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(79) atha pramādī ca saṃvatsarasvarūpam (-)

ūrdhvabāhurvanenadyāstīrebhasma vilepanaḥ ||
dhyāyanraviṃkṛśonīlaḥ pramādīcodvijaḥ smṛtaḥ || 1 || 

nīlavarṇaḥ ||

(80) atha ānaṃdasaṃvatsarasvarūpam (-)

kṛtordhvapuṃdro nibhṛto nivasanvijane vane ||
ānaṃdo lohito dhyāyannakṣamālāvabhūṣitaḥ || 1 || 

raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(81) atha rākṣasasaṃvatsarasvarūpam (-)

skaṃdhe gṛhṇansthūladaṃḍaṃ dṛṣaddhasto vanecaraḥ ||
pathikānbādhamānastu rākṣasaḥ śvānagositaḥ || 1 || 

nīlavarṇaḥ ||

(82) atha nalasaṃvatsarasvarūpam (-)

tapasvījalamadhyastho cīrakṛṣṇājināṃbaraḥ ||
jaṭābhṛcchmamu()laśśāṃtaḥ kṛṣṇobhūti vibhuṣaṇaḥ || 1 || 

kṛṣṇavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(83) atha piṃgalakālayuktisaṃvatsarasvarūpe (-)

piṃgalaḥkālayuktiśca raktāsyau raktalocanau ||
japataḥ śvetanīlāṃgāṃ varaṇye niṃbasannidhau || 1 || 1 || 

śvetavarṇaḥ || 2 || nīlavarṇaḥ || 2 ||

<p. 135>

(84) atha siddhārthisaṃvatsarasvarūpam (-)

samudratīre saṃdhyāyāṃ snātvā sūryamuṅmukhaḥ ||
tiṣṭhandhyāyanjapanvarṇī śvetassidhārthivatsaraḥ || 1 || 

śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(85) atha rodrisaṃvatsarasvarūpam (-)

raudrisaṃvatsarorājā sihāsanagataḥ śaṭhaḥ ||
raktākṣaḥ sthūladehaśca śyāmo()kṣakriḍane rataḥ || 1 || 

kṛṣṇavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(86) atha durmatisaṃvatsarasvarūpam (-)

durmatiḥ kṣatriyaśśuraḥ sthulasturagavāhanaḥ ||
khaḍgacarmadharoraktaḥ śatrucchedanalālasaḥ || 1 || 

raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(87) atha duṃdubhisaṃvatsarasvarūpam (-)

puṣkaradvīpamāsādya duṃdubhiḥ plakṣasannidhau ||
dhyāyanvasati niśśaṃkaṃ viṣṇuṃ vai viśvarūpiṇam || 1 || 

nīlavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(88) atha rudhirodgārisaṃvatsarasvarūpam (-)

rudhirodgārināmāsau puṣkarasya taṭe vasan ||
arcayandroṇapuṣpaistu rudramekādaśātmakam || 1 || 

kanakavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(89) atha raktākṣisaṃvatsarasvarūpam (-)

svarṇaprāsādamāśritya maṃṭape siṃdhusannidhau ||
strībhiḥkrīḍanbhūṣitāṃgo raktākṣī tu yuvāvibhuḥ || 1 || 

śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(90) atha krodhanasaṃvatsarasvarūpam (-)

krodhanaḥkuṭilākāro raktāṃgo drumasannidhau ||
śvabhiḥ kriḍanvilolākṣo krodhano vikṛtānanaḥ || 1 || 

raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(91) atha akṣayasaṃvatsarasvarūpam (-)

śālmalidvīpamāsādya vasandṛṣadi viṣṭare ||
krūraḥ kṛṣṇo dīrgharomā'kṣayo dīrghākṛtiḥ pumān || 1 || 

kṛṣṇavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 136>

atha idvasarādināmāni (-) (kālamādhavīye)

idvatsaraḥ iḍāvatsaraḥ saṃvatsaraḥ parivatsaraḥ anuvatsaraḥ iti saṃjñāstu prabhavādiṣu ṣaṣṭisaṃvatsareṣu āditaḥ paṃcānāṃ paṃcānāmekaikaśaḥ krameṇa jñeyāḥ || 5 ||

(92) atha prabhavādiṣaṣṭisaṃvatsareṣujātaguṇāḥ (-) (jātakābharaṇe)

(tatrādau prabhave) (-) 

sarvavastuparisaṃgraherataḥ putrasaṃtatiratīvasanmatiḥ ||
sarvabhogayutadīrghajīvito jāyate prabhavasaṃbhavaḥ pumān || 1 ||

(vibhave) (-) 

utpannabhoktāpriyadarśanaśca balādiśālī caturaḥ kalājñaḥ ||
rājābhavedātmakule suśīlovidvānmanuṣyo vibhavābdajanmā || 1 ||

(śukle) (-) 

sadāsaharṣotitarāmudārosatputradāro vibhavaissametaḥ ||
sadbhāgyavidyāvinayopapannonūnaṃ pumāñchuklasamudbhavaḥ syāt || 1 ||

(pramodūte) (-) 

dātāsadānaṃdayutoti kāṃtassatyena nityaṃ sahito guṇī syāt ||
dakṣaśca dhūrtaḥ parakāryakartā pramodajanmāmanujobhimānī || 1 ||

(prajotpatyām) (-)

dānābhimānassutarāṃ dayāluḥ kulānuvṛttaḥ kilacāruśīlaḥ |
devadvirjārcābhirato vinītomartyaḥ prajādhīśasamadbhavassyāt || 1 ||

(āṅgīrase) (-) 

kāṃtassukhībhogayutaśca mānīpriyapravaktā bahuputrayuktaḥ ||
saguptabuddhiḥ khaludīrghajīvī naroṃgirogirovatsarasaṃbhavassyāt || 1 ||

(śrīmukhe) (-) 

śrīmānpratāpī bahuśāstravettā suhṛtpriyaścārumatirbalīyān ||
satkīrtiyuktotitarāmudāro bhavennaraḥ śrīmukhasaṃbhavaśca || 1 ||

(bhāve) (-) 

praśasta cetāssutarāṃ yaśasvīguṇānvito dhairyayuto vinītaḥ ||
sadāsaharṣo vimato bahūnāṃ bhāvābhidhānodbhavamānavassyāt || 1 ||

(yūni) (-) 

prasannamūrtirguṇavānvitītaḥ śāṃtaśca dānābhiratonitāṃtam ||
sudhīścirāyurdṛḍhadehaśālī jātoyuvābde puruṣassatoṣaḥ || 1 ||

(dhātau) (-) 

sarvalokaguṇagauravayuktassuṃdropyatitarāṃ gurubhaktaḥ ||
śilpaśāstrakuśalaśca suśīlodhātuvatsara bhavohinarassyāt || 1 ||

<p. 137>

(īśvare) (-) 

tatkālasaṃjātamahāprakopo harṣādvihīno guṇavānpratāpī ||
dakṣaḥkalākauśalaśīlaśālī martyobhavedīśvara jātajanmā || 1 ||

(bahudhānye) (-) 

vyāpāradakṣaḥ kṣitipālamānī dānābhimānī nanu śāstravettā ||
bahuprakārairbahudhānyavittaḥ syānmānavo vai bahudhānyajanmā || 1 ||

(pramāthini ) (-) 

rathadhvajacchatraturaṃgamādyairyutaśca śāstrābhiratorihaṃtā ||
maṃtrī nareṃdrasyanaraḥ kṛtajñaḥ pramāthisaṃvatsarasaṃbhavassyāt || 1 ||

(vikrame) (-) 

atyugrakarmābhirato nitāṃtamarāti cakrākramaṇeti dakṣaḥ ||
śūraśca vīrotitarāmudāraḥ parākramīvikramavarṣajātaḥ || 1 ||

(ṛṣe) (-) 

kāryaḥpratāpī kilaniṃdyaśīlaḥ khalānuyātaḥ parakarmakarttā ||
bartā bahūnāṃgalinolasaśca jāto vṛṣābdemanujoti lubdhaḥ || 1 ||

(citrabhānau) (-) 

citravastrakusumaikamānaso mānasodbhava ca yānvitassadā ||
cāruśīlavilasatkalācitaścitrabhānujanito hi pūruṣaḥ || 1 ||

(svabhānau) (-) 

arālakeśaḥ saralassukāṃtirjitāripakṣo matimānvinītaḥ ||
prasannamūrtissamasiddhihūtissvabhānusaṃvatsarajo narassyāt || 1 ||

(tāraṇe) (-) 

dhūrtaśca śūraścapalaḥ kalājñassuniṣṭhurogarhitakarmakartā ||
utpannabhoktādraviṇena muktassyāt tāraṇābdodbhavamānavo yaḥ || 1 ||

(pārthive) (-) 

svadharmakarmābhiratonitāṃtaṃ sukṣātrapāraṃgamatāmupetaḥ ||
kalākalāpekuśalo vilāsīyaḥ pārthivābde kulapārthivassyāt || 1 ||

(vyaye) (-) 

saukhyātirikto vyasanābhibhūto bhīto na kiṃcidgrahaṇādṛṇasya ||
jātaḥ pumānasthiracittavṛttirvyayābhidhāne vyayakarmaśīlaḥ || 1 || 20 ||

(sarvajiti ) (-) 

rājagauravamahotsavaḥ śucirmānavaḥ pṛthutanurmahādyutiḥ ||
vairivargavijayodyatassadāsarvajiccharadisaṃbhavaḥ pumān || 1 ||

(sarvadhāriṇi) (-) 

bhūtibhṛtyabahubhogasaṃyutassuṃdaraśca madhurānnabhuksadā ||
dhīratadguṇayutoti dāruṇassarvadhāriṇi ca yasya saṃbhavaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 138>

(virodhini) (-) 

raktovideśāṭanatāṃ prapannaḥ kuṭuṃbasaukhyāpacayoti dhūrtaḥ ||
janenasākaṃ gatacittavṛttirvirodhivarṣaprabhavo narassyāt || 1 ||

(vikṛtau) (-) 

nirdhanaḥ kilakarālatāṃgatodīrghaparvabahugarvasaṃyutaḥ ||
cārubuddhirahitopyamitrakomānavo vikṛtivarṣasaṃbhavaḥ || 1 ||

(khare) (-) 

kāmāturodhūsarakāyakāṃtiḥ kaṭhoradīrghasvaraphalguvākyaḥ ||
kleśī ca lajjāvidhivarjitassyānnaraḥ kharābdaprabhavoti dīrghaḥ || 1 ||

(nandane) (-) 

taṭākavāpī gṛhakūpakarttā sadānnadānābhirataśśucissyāt ||
vilāsinīnaṃdanajātaharṣo narobhayennaṃdanavarṣajanmā || 1 ||

(vijaye) (-) 

saṃgrāmadhīraḥ sutarāṃsuśīlo bhūpālamānyo vadatāṃvareṇyaḥ ||
dātādayāluḥ kilavairihaṃtā yasya prasūtirvijayābhidhāne || 1 ||

(jaye) (-) 

śāstraprasaṃge viduṣāṃviṣādī mānyovadānyo ripugarvahaṃtā ||
jayābhilāpī viṣayānurakto jātojayābde manujo mahaujāḥ || 1 ||

(manmathe) (-) 

bhūṣāvibhūṣā sahitaśca yoṣā vilāsaśīlo'mṛtavākkalājñaḥ ||
sadgītanṛtyābhirataśca bhoktā yo manmathābde jananaṃ prapannaḥ || 1 ||

(durmukhini) (-) 

krūroddhato niṃdyamatiśca lubdho vakrāsya bāhvaṃghriraruśaṃ() priyaḥ syāt || viruddhabāṣī bahuduṣṭaceṣṭo yo hāyane durmukhināmnijātaḥ || 1 ||

(hemalambini) (-) 

turaṃgahemāṃbaradhānyaratnairyutonitāṃtaṃ sutadārayuktaḥ ||
samastavastugrahaṇaikabuddhiryo hemalaṃbi prabhavaḥ pumāntsyāt || 1 ||

(vi(ma)lambini) (-) 

dhūrtotilubdho lasatāṃ prapannaḥ śleṣmāndhikaḥ sattvavivarjitaśca ||
prārabdhakāryetitarāṃ pralāpī vimalaṃbisaṃvatsarassaṃbhavassyāt || 1 ||

(vikāriṇi) (-) 

durāgrahīsarvakalāpravīṇassuvaṃcakaścaṃcaladhīśca dhurtaḥ ||
analpajalpassvasuhṛdvikalpo vikārisaṃvatsarajonarassyāt || 1 ||

(śārvaryām) (-) 

vaṇikkalāyāṃ kuśalo vilāsī naivānukūlastu suhṛjanānām ||
anekavidyābhyasanānuraktaḥ saṃvatsare śārvarināmnijātaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 139>

(plave) (-) 

kāmīprakāmaṃdhanavāṃśca śaśvatsevādarodārahṛdarthatṛptaḥ ||
suguptabuddhiścapalasvabhāvaḥ plavābhidhānābdabhavonarassyāt || 1 ||

(śubhakṛti) (-) 

saubhāgyavidyāvinayaissametaḥ puṇyairagaṇyairapi dīrghajīvī ||
syānmānavassūnudhanorusaṃpadyasya prasūtiḥ śubhakṛtsamāsu || 1 ||

(śobhakṛti)  (-) 

sarvonnataścāruguṇodayāluḥ satkarmakarttāvijayī viśeṣāt ||
kāṃtovinītaḥ śubhakṛtpravīṇoyaḥ śobhakṛdvatsarasaṃbhavaḥ syāt || 1 ||

(kraudhini) (-) 

krūrekṣaṇaḥ krūratarasvabhāvaḥ strīvallabhaḥ parvatatulyagarvaḥ ||
syādaṃtarāyaḥ parakāryakālekrodhībhavet krodhiśaratprabhūtaḥ ||

(viśvāvasau) (-) 

satputradāraḥ sutarāmudāraḥ varassadācāraparotidhīraḥ ||
iṣṭānnabhuksarvaguṇābhirāmo viśvāvasau yasya bhavet prasūtiḥ ||

(parābhave) (-) 

dhanasyadhānyasya ca naiva kiṃcit susaṃgrahotyaṃtakaṭhoravākyaḥ ||
ācāratolpatvaśaṭhatvayuktaḥ parābhave yasya bhavet prasūtiḥ || 1 ||

(plavaṃge) (-) 

bhavitsadācaṃcalacittavṛttiḥ na syāt pravṛttiḥ khalusādhukārye ||
dhūrtassadācāravicārahīnaḥ plavaṃgajovaimanujaḥ kṛśāṃgaḥ || 1 ||

(kīlake) (-) 

rūpeṇamathyaḥ priyavāgdayālurjalābhilāṣītvanuvelameva ||
sthūlāṃghrisanmauliralaṃbalīyāñjātorikīlaḥ kilakīlakābde || 1 ||

(saumye) (-) 

paṃḍito hi dhanavānbahubhogī devatātithiruciśca śucissyāt ||
sāttvikaḥ kṛśakalebarayaṣṭiḥ saumyavatsarabhavomanujastu || 1 ||

(sādhāraṇe) (-) 

itastatassaṃcalitonurukto lipikriyāyāṃ kuśalo vivekī ||
krodhīśucirbhoganivṛttacetāḥ prāṇī hi sādhāraṇajaḥ pragītaḥ || 1 ||

(virodhikṛti) (-) 

maheśvarārādhanatatparaḥ syāt krodhīvirodhī satataṃ bahūnām ||
parāṅmukhastātavacasyatīvavirodhikṛnnāmni hi janma yasya || 1 ||

(paridhāvini) (-) 

vidvānsuśīlaśca kalā pravīṇaḥ sudhīśca mānyo vasudhādhipānām ||
vyāpārasaṃprāptamahatpratiṣṭhaḥ pumānbhavedvai paridhāvināmni || 1 ||

(pramādini) (-) 

duṣṭābhimānī kalahānurakto lubdhaḥ kuṭuṃbābhirataśca dīnaḥ ||
syādalpadhīrgarhitakarmakarttā pramādi janmā manujaḥ pramādī || 1 ||

<p. 140>

(ānande) (-) 

syādbhūridānaścaturotidakṣaḥ śaśvatsutānaṃdabharaprapūraḥ ||
prājñaḥ kṛtajñaḥ sutarāṃvinītopyānaṃdajāto manujovadānyaḥ || 1 ||

(rakṣase) (-) 

syātkrūrakarmākalahānuraktassaṃtyaktasatkarma vicārasāraḥ ||
dayāvihīnaśca sasāhasopi bhavennaro rākṣasavarṣajanmā || 1 ||

(nale) (-) 

sabuddhiśālījalasasyasaṃpadvaiśyānuvṛttau kuśalaḥ suśīlaḥ ||
syādalpavitto bahupālakaśca jātonalābde capalomanuṣyaḥ || 1 ||

(piṃgale) (-) 

piṃgekṣaṇogarhitakarmakartā syādutthitaścaṃcalavaibhavādyaḥ ||
tyāgīśaṭhotyaṃtakaṭhoravākyo jātonaraḥ piṃgalanāmadheye || 1 ||

(kālayuktau) (-) 

analpajalpaḥ priyatāmupetassasādhubuddhirvidhināviyuktaḥ ||
kaviprasaṃgaḥ kilakālarūpoyaḥ kālayuktiḥ prabhavaḥ kṛśāṃgaḥ ||

(siddhārthini) (-) 

udāracetāvilasatprasādoraṇāṃgaṇaprāptayaśāḥ sukhī syāt ||
nareṃdramaṃtrī bahupūjitārthaḥ siddhārthijāto manujaḥ samarthaḥ || 1 ||

(raudrau)  (-) 

bhayaṃkaraḥ pālayitāpaśūnāṃ śaśvatprāsādaśca palotidhūrtaḥ ||
jātāpakīrtiḥ khalacittavṛttirnarotiraudraḥ khaluraudrijanmā || 1 ||

(durmatau) (-) 

svavākyanirvāhamahābhimānī prasaṃgatohīnataro narassyāt ||
kāmīprakāmaṃ duritepravṛtto yo durmatirdurmati varṣajātaḥ || 1 ||

(duṃdubhau) (-) nityaṃnareṃdrādaragauravaḥ syādgajāśva bhūhemasamanvitaśca ||
tauryatrikaprītiratīvajātaścenmānavo duṃdubhināmavarṣe || 1 ||

(rudhirodgāriṇi) (-) āraktākṣaḥ kvacidapi mahākāmadaḥ kāminīnāṃ prādurbhāvādati kṛśatanurjāyate tyaṃtaroṣaḥ ||
pādadvaṃdve bhavati kunakhīhastayuṇmethavāsyācchastrāddukhaṃ vrajatirudhirodgārijanmāmanuṣyaḥ || 1 ||

(raktākṣiṇi) (-) 

ācāradharmābhirato nitāṃtaṃ manobhavāccārutaronaraḥ syāt ||
anyādhikattvaṃ sahatenakiṃcidraktākṣijātokṣirujānvitaśca || 1 ||

(krodhane) (-) 

syādaṃtarāyo hi parasyakāyatamoguṇādhikyabhayaṃkaraśca ||
parasyabuddhiṃ praharetprakāmaṃ yohāyane krodhananāmnijātaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 141>

(akṣaye) (-) 

upārjitārthavyayakṛnnitāṃtaṃ sevārate niṣṭhuracittavṛttiḥ ||
satkāryaketyalpamanaḥ pravṛtiḥ kṣayābhidhāne jananaṃ hi yasya || 1 || 60 ||

atha prabhavādiṣaṣṭisaṃvatsaranāmāni (-) (daivajñavilāse)

prabhavo vibhavaḥ śuklaḥ pramodothaprajāpatiḥ ||
āṃgīrasaḥ śrīmukhaśca bhāvothayuvavatsaraḥ || 1 ||

dhātvīśvaraubahudhānyaḥ pramāthī vikramo vṛṣaḥ ||
citrabhānuḥ svabhānuśca tāraṇaḥ pārthivo vyayaḥ || 2 ||

sarvajitsarvadhārī ca virodhī vikṛtiḥ kharaḥ ||
naṃdanovijayaścaiva jayomanmathadurmukhau || 3 ||

hemalaṃbīvi(ma)laṃbīcavikārīśārvarīplavaḥ ||
śubhakṛcchobhakṛtkrodhī viśvāvasuparābhavau || 4 ||

plavaṃgaḥ kīlakaḥ saumyaḥ sādhāraṇavirodhikṛt ||
paridhāvīpramādīsyādānaṃdo rākṣasonalaḥ || 5 ||

piṃgalaḥ kālayuktiśca siddhārthīraudridurmatī ||
duṃdubhīrudhirodgāriraktākṣī krodhanākṣayau || 6 ||

ṣaṣṭistu vatsarājñeyāḥ prabhavādyā ime budhaiḥ ||


atha prabhavādiṣaṣṭisaṃvatsarābhimānidevatānāṃnāmāni (-) (śaivāgame)

brahmaviṣṇumaheśāsnā gaṇeśogaṇapastathā ||
ṣaḍānanaśca vallī ca gaurībrahmīmaheśvarī || 1 ||

kaumārīvaiṣaṇavī caiva vārāhyaiṃdrī tathaiva ca ||
cāmuṃḍikāpyarogaśca bhrājaḥpaṭara eva ca || 2 ||

pataṃgaḥ svarṇarojyotiṣmānvibhāsaśca kaśyapaḥ ||
raviḥsūryaśca bhānuśca khagaḥ pūṣā tathaiva ca || 3 ||

hiraṇyagarbhothamarīcyādityau savitā tathā ||
arkastatobhāskarāgni jātavedassahaujasaḥ || 4 ||

tato jarāprabhurvaiśvānaranaryāpasāvapi ||
paṅtirāthavisarpiśca matsyakūrmavarāhakāḥ || 5 ||

nārasiṃhovāmanaśca śrīrāmobhārgavohalī ||
kṛṣṇaḥ kalkībuddhadurgeyā tu dhānaśca bhairavaḥ || 6 ||

hanūmāñchāradādākṣāyaṇīlakṣmīriti smṛtāḥ ||
abhimāninya eteṣāmabdānāṃ devatāḥ kramāt || 7 || 60 ||

atha prabhavādiṣaṣṭisaṃvatsarābhimānidevatāsvarūpāṇi (-) (śaivāgame)

(93) tatrādau prabhavābhimānibrahmadhyānam (-)

akṣādyaṃkitapāṇipadmamabhayaṃ cinmudrikāṃhastayorbibhrāṇaṃ caturānanaṃ pravikasatpadmāsanāṃtasthitam ||

<p. 142>

vakṣobhāgavirājamānaviśadaśrībrahmasūtrojjvalaṃ vaṃdehaṃ prabhavābhidhaṃ kamalajaṃ śreyobhivṛddhipradam || 1 || 

padmavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(94) atha vibhavābhimāniviṣṇudevatādhyānam (-)

bhāsvatkirīṭaṃdaracakraśārṅgagadābhirāmaṃ sahitaṃ caturbhiḥ ||
karairanaṃtāsanasanniviṣṭaṃ dhyāyedrameśaṃvibhavādhinātham || 1 || 

meghaśyāmavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(95) atha śuklābhimānimaheśvaradhyānam (-)

jaṭilamuragabhūṣābhūṣitāṃgaṃ triṇetraṃ śaśadharamakuṭāṃtaṃ vyāghracarmottarīyam ||
vṛṣavarakṛtavāhaṃ śuklasaṃjñaṃ girīśaṃnamadamaramunīṃdraṃ śūlapāṇiṃ namāmi || 1 || 

śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(96) atha pramodūtābhimānigaṇeśadhyānam (-)

karīṃdravaktraṃ śubhamekadaṃtojjvalaṃ pramodūtakṛtābhidhānam ||
pratyūhaśāṃtipradamākhusaṃsthaṃ dhyāyeddhṛdabje satataṃ gaṇeśam || 1 || 

raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(97) atha prajāpativatsarābhimāniśaktigaṇapatidhyānam (-)

daṃtīṃdravaktrākalitāṃsuśaktiṃ caturbhujāṃcaṃdrakalāvataṃsām ||
bhakteṣṭapātho nidhipūrṇacaṃdrāṃ vaṃdeprajotpatti kṛtābhidhānām || 1 || 

raktavarṇā || 1 ||

(98) atha āṃgīrasābhimāniṣaṇmukhadhyānam (-)

śaktyujjvalaikabāhuṃ śaśadharamakuṭaṃ mayūramārūḍham ||
āṃgirasanāmadheyaṃ ṣaṇmukhamīḍemareṃdrasenānyam || 1 || 

raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(99) atha śrīmukhābhimānivallīdevatādhyānam (-)

caṃdramukhīṃcārudṛśaṃkukkuṭavāhāṃguhādṛtāmaniśam ||
śrīmukhasaṃjñāṃ vallīṃ śreyovṛddhipradāmahaṃkalaye || 1 || 

pāṭalavarṇā || 1 ||

(100) atha bhāvābhimānigaurīdevatādhyānam (-)

gaurīṃgirīṃdratanayāṃ vṛṣavarasaṃsthāṃ kalādharāṃ śaśinaḥ ||
bhāvākhyā mahamīḍe bhavakutukāṃbhodhi pūrṇacaṃdrāṃtām || 1 || 

marakatavarṇā || 1 ||

<p. 143>

(101) atha yuvābhimānibrāhmīdevatādhyānam (-)

yuvasaṃjñāmahamīḍebrāhmīṃbrahmādi vaṃditāṃghriṃtām ||
haṃsapravarārūḍhāṃ śaṃbhumanohārirūpasaubhāgyām || 1 || 

kanakavarṇā || 1 ||

(102) atha dhātvabhimānimāheśvarīdhyānam (-)

māheśvarīhṛdabje vilasatu satataṃ ca dhātusaṃjñā sā ||
caṃdrāvataṃsasahitā śreyovṛddhipradāsadāśaṃbhoḥ || 1 || 

śubhravarṇā || 1 ||

(103) atha īśvarābhīmānikaumārīdhyānam (-)

kaumārīmahamīḍesaṃpaddātrīṃsadāśukārūḍhām ||
tāmīśvarābhidhānāṃśaṃ karatoṣapradāṃ svarūpeṇa || 1 || 

pāṭalavarṇā || 1 ||

(104) atha bahudhānyābhimānivaiṣṇavīdhyānam (-)

bahudhānyanāmadheyāṃ satataṃ hṛdayena vaiṣṇavīṃ kalaye ||
śaṃkaravāmāṃkasthāṃ namatāmiṣṭārthadāyikāmaniśam || 1 || 

meghaśyāmavarṇā || 1 ||

(105) atha pramāthyabhimānivārāhīdhyānam (-)

vārāhīṃpraṇamāmodhūrjaṭiharṣābdhipūrṇacaṃdrāṃtām ||
śreyobhivṛddhidātrīṃ kṛtanijanāmnīṃ pramāthīti ||(1 || 

śyāmavarṇā || 1 ||

(106) atha vikramābhimānīṃdrāṇīdhyānam (-)

māheṃdrīṃkalayāmovikramasaṃjñāṃ vṛṣāsanārūḍhām ||
bhāsuracaṃdrakirīṭāṃ bhaktābhīṣṭapradāṃbhiyāṃśāṃtyai || 1 || 

kanakavarṇā || 1 ||

(107) atha vi(vṛ)ṣuvatsarābhimānicāmuṃḍādhyānam (-)

cāmuṃḍāṃcārvaṃgīmahamihavaṃde vṛṣāsanārūḍhām ||
vi(vṛ)ṣunāmnīṃ suravaṃdyāṃ daityakuladhvaṃsakāriṇīmaniśam || 1 || 

kṛṣṇavarṇā || 1 ||

(108) atha citrabhānuvatsarābhimānyarogadevatādhyānam (-)

arogāhvayamīḍehaṃ citrabhānuṃ sadāmude ||
turaṃgamavarārūḍhaṃ makuṭojjvalamastakam || 1 || 

raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 144>

(109) atha svabhānuvatsarābhimānibhrājadevatādhyānam (-)

ārogyasiddhidaṃnṝṇāṃ svabhānuṃbhrājasaṃjñakam ||
gajārūḍhaṃlasatkhaḍgakheṭahastaṃ namāmyaham || 1 || 

raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(110) atha tāraṇābhimānipaṭaradevatādhyānam (-)

aṃtarhṛdabje satataṃ kalaye paṭarāhvayam ||
tāraṇaṃ sūryagamanaṃ śūlodbhāsikarāṃbujam || 1 || 

raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(111) atha pārthivavatsarābhimānipataṃgadevatādhyānam (-)

pataṃgaṃ vṛṣabhārūḍhaṃ pārthivāhvayamāśraye ||
śaṃkhacakradharaṃdivya pītāṃbaramahaṃbhaje || 1 || 

raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(112) atha vyayābhimānisvarṇaradevatādhyānam (-)

svarṇaraṃkokilārūḍhaṃ vyayasaṃjñakamāśraye ||
caṃdrāvataṃsaṃ jaṭilaṃ triṇetraṃśūlabhāsuram || 1 || 

raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(113) atha sarvajidvatsarābhimānijyotiṣmaddevatādhyānam (-)

sarvajitsaṃjñakaṃvaṃde jyotiṣmaṃtamabhiṣṭadam ||
bhṛśuṃḍīpāśahastābjaṃ vyāghrārūḍhaṃ trilocanam || 1 || 

raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(114) atha sarvadhāryabhimānivibhāsadevatādhyānam (-)

vibhāsanāmakaṃ bhānuṃ sarvadhārikṛtāhvayam ||
iṣṭaprāptyaisadāvaṃde saptāśvarathamāsthitam || 1 || 

raktavarṇaḥ || śiṣṭaṃsūryavat ni(0) (5) || 1 ||

(115) atha virodhisaṃvatsarābhimānikaśyapadevatādhyānam (-)

meruśṛṃgāsanasthaṃ taṃ virodhīti kṛtāhvayam ||
kaśyapaṃ paṃcavadanaṃ daśahastaṃ namāmyaham || 1 || 

raktavarṇaḥ || śiṣṭaṃsūryavat ni(0) (5) || 1 ||

(116) atha vikṛtyabhimāniravidevatādhyānam (-)

raviṃvikṛtināmānaṃ triśīrṣaṃ ṣaḍbhujaṃbhaje ||
pannageśvaramārūḍhaṃ cārupītāṃbarā vṛtam || 1 || 

raktavarṇaḥ || śiṣṭaṃsūryavat ni(0) (5) || 1 ||

<p. 145>

(117) atha kharābhimānisūryadevatādhyānam (-)

khagavaryasamārūḍhaṃ nīlāṃbarasamāvṛtam ||
sūryābhidhaṃ kharaṃvaṃde caturvaktāṣṭa hastakam || 1 || 

raktavarṇaḥ || śiṣṭaṃsūryavat ni(0) (5) || 1 ||

(118) atha naṃdanābhimānibhānudevatādhyānam (-)

bhānuṃ naṃdananāmānaṃ bhāsācārupariṣkṛtam ||
mṛgeṃdravāhanaṃpaṃcavaktraṃ daśabhujaṃ bhaje || 1 || 

raktavarṇaḥ || śiṣṭaṃsūryavat ni(0) (5) || 1 ||

(119) atha vijayābhimānikhagadevatādhyānam (-)

ṣaṇmukhaṃ dvādaśabhujaṃ vyāghravāhanamāsthitam ||
vyāghracarmāṃbaradharaṃvaṃde vijayasaṃjñakam || 1 || 

raktavarṇaḥ || śiṣṭaṃsūryavat ni(0) (5) || 1 ||

(120) atha jayābhimānipūṣadevatādhyānam (-)

pūṣaṇaṃ jayanāmānaṃ varadaṃbhaktasaṃtateḥ ||
śaṃkhacakrāṃkitakaradvaṃdvaṃ hṛdisamāśraye || 1 || 

raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(121) atha manmathābhimānihiraṇyagarbhadevatādhyānam (-)

haṃsavaryādhirūḍhaṃtaṃ vīṇāmaṃḍitahastakam ||
hiraṇyagarbhaṃvaṃdehaṃ manmathākhyaṃ mameṣṭadam || 1 || 

raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(122) atha durmukhyabhimānimarīcidevatādhyānam (-)

marīciṃdurmukhākhyānaṃ manyumarkaṭamāsthitam ||
vivṛttāsyaṃ jagadbhīti dāyakaṃ saṃśraye mudā || 1 || 

raktavarṇaḥ || śaṣṭaṃsūryavat ni(0) (5) || 1 ||

(123) atha hemalaṃbyabhimānyādityadevatādhyānam (-)

ādityaṃtejasa sthānaṃ hemalaṃ bikṛtāhvayam ||
saptasaptisamārūḍhaṃ jagatāṃ netramāśraye || 1 || 

raktavarṇaḥ || śiṣṭaṃsūryavat ni(0) (5) || 1 ||

(124) atha vi(ma)laṃbyabhimānisavitṛdevatādhyānam (-)

vi(ma)laṃbisaṃjñaṃmanasāsavitāraṃsmarāmyaham  ||
cāpabāṇadharaṃdorbhyāṃ turaṃgavaravāhanam || 1 || 

raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 146>

(125) atha vikāryabhimānyarkkadevatādhyānam (-)

arkaṃvikārināmānaṃ karkaśaṃkrakacāyudham ||
kraravyāghrasamārūḍhamekanetraṃ namāmyaham || 1 || 

raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(126) atha śārvaryabhimānibhāskaradevatādhyānam (-)

bhāskaraṃśārvarīsaṃjñaṃ bhāsāpūritadiṅmukham ||
cakrojjvalakaraṃvaṃde bhāsvadrathasamāśritam || 1 || 

raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(127) atha plavābhimānyagnidevatādhyānam (-)

agniṃnamāmivitatajvālāmālaṃtamopaham ||
ajārūḍhaṃ caturhastaṃ dviśīrṣaṃ plavasaṃjñakam || 1 || 

raktavarṇaḥ || śiṣṭamagnivat ni(0) (4) || 1 ||

(128) atha śubhakṛdabhimānijātavedodevatādhyānam (-)

jātavedasamīḍehaṃ śubhakṛnnāmakaṃ sadā ||
āṃdolikāsamārūḍhaṃ khaḍgakheṭadharaṃ śubham || 1 || 

raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(129) atha śobhakṛdabhimānisahaujodevatādhyānam (-)

sahaujasaṃśobhakṛtaṃ nṛṇāmiṣṭadamāśraye ||
śibikāvāhanārūḍhaṃ cāmaradvayapāṇikam || 1 || 

raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(130) atha krodhyabhimānyajarāprabhudevatādhyānam (-)

ajarāprabhumīḍehaṃ krodhīti kṛtanāmakam ||
gorathārūḍhamaniśaṃ kuṃtojjvalakarāṃbujam || 1 || 

raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(131) atha viśvāvasusaṃvatsarābhimānivaiśvānaradevatādhyānam (-)

vaiśvānaraṃbhaje nityaṃ viśvāvasu kṛtāhvayam ||
naravāhanamārūḍhaṃ khaḍgakheṭadharaṃśubham || 1 || 

raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(132) atha parābhavābhimāninaryāpasadevatādhyānam (-)

parābhavāhvayaṃ vaṃde naryāpasamudarciṣam ||
uttuṃgaturagārūḍhaṃ paraśūjjvalapāṇikam || 1 || 

raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 147>

(133) atha plavaṃgābhimānipaṅtirādhodevatādhyānam (-)

paṅtirādhasamīḍegniṃ plavaṃgeti suviśrutam ||
śvetāśvavaramārūḍhaṃ śārṅgavāṇadharaṃ sadā || 1 || 

raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(134) atha kīlakābhimānivisarpidevatādhyānam (-)

visarpiṇaṃhutavahaṃ kīlakāhvayamāśraye ||
uttuṃgagajamārūḍhaṃ śūlojjvalakarāṃbujam || 1 || 

raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(135) atha saumyābhimānimatsyadevatādhyānam (-)

matsyamūrtiṃ hariṃvaṃde śirasāsaumyasaṃjñakam ||
śaṃkhacakrojjvalakaraṃbhaktābhīṣṭapradāyakam || 1 || 

śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(136) atha sādhāraṇābhimānikūrmadevatādhyānam (-)

kūrmākṛtimahaṃvaṃde maṃdarācaladhāriṇam ||
kaumodakīśārṅgahastaṃ sādhāraṇakṛtā hvayam || 

kāṃcanavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(137) atha virodhikṛdvatsarābhimānivarāhadevatādhyānam (-)

daṃṣṭārūḍhamahībhāgaṃ kroḍarūpadharaṃharim ||
varadābhayadaṃ vaṃde virodhikṛditi śrutam || 1 || 

śyāmavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(138) atha parīdhāvyabhimāninṛsiṃhadevatādhyānam (-)

nṛkesaritanuṃvaṃde hariṃstaṃbhavidāriṇaṃ ||
prahlādaharṣadātāraṃ parīdhāvikṛtā hvayam || 1 || 

śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(139) atha pramādīcābhimānivāmanadevatādhyānam (-)

chatrojjvalakaraṃvaṃde hariṃvāmanarūpiṇam ||
balipratāpanakaraṃpramādī ca kṛtāhvayam || 1 || 

śyāmavarṇaḥ dūrvādalavat || 1 ||

(140)  atha ānaṃdābhimāniśrīrāmadevatādhyānam (-)

jagadānaṃdajanakaṃ sītāvallabhamāśraye ||
rāmamānaṃdanāmānaṃ dhṛtakodaṃḍamārgaṇam || 1 || 

śyāmavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 148>

(141) atha rākṣasābhimāniśrīparaśurāmadevatādhyānam (-)

kuṭhāraprojjvalakaraṃjaṭāmaṃḍalamaṃḍitam ||
bhārgavaṃrāmamāśāse rākṣasābhidhamaṃjasā || 1 || 

kāṃcanavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(142) atha nalābhimānibalarāmadevatādhyānam (-)

sīrodbhāsikarāṃbhojaṃ nīlāṃbarasamāvṛtam ||
balarāmamahaṃvaṃde nalāhvayamaharniśam || 1 || 

śubhravarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(143) atha piṃgalābhimānikṛṣṇadevatādhyānam (-)

kṛṣṇaṃ piṃgalanāmānaṃ barhibarhojjvalākṛtim ||
navanītojjvalakaraṃnṛtyaṃ taṃ hṛdisaṃśraye || 1 || 

śyāmavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(144) atha kālayuktyabhimānikalkidevatādhyānam (-)

mlecchāvalikṛtadveṣaṃ kālayuktikṛtāhvayam ||
āśrayekalkimārūḍhaṃ dhanurbāṇakaraṃ sadā || 1 || 

śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(145) atha siddhārthyabhimānibuddhadevatādhyānam (-)

siddhārthikṛtanāmānaṃ buddhākṛtimahaṃbhaje ||
nagnaṃvirūpavapuṣaṃ stripradharṣaṇakāraṇam || 1 || 

pāṭalavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(146) atha raudrivatsarābhimānidurgādevatādhyānam (-)

durgāṃ vipattidhutaye raudrītikṛtasaṃjñikām ||
dhyāyāmidaityahaṃtrīṃtāṃ raktāsvādanatatparām || 1 || 

nīlavarṇā || 1 ||

(147) atha durmatyabhimāniyātudhānadevatādhyānam (-)

yātudhānaṃvakramukhaṃ caikākṣaṃ dāruṇākṛtim ||
dhyāyāmyaniṣṭaśāṃtyarthaṃ durmatītikṛtāhvayam || 1 || 

nīlavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(148) atha duṃdubhyabhimānibhairavadevatādhyānam (-)

duṃdubhītikṛtāhvānaṃ samastaripubhairavam ||
bhairavaṃśca varārūḍhaṃ digaṃbaramupāśraye || 1 || 

śyāmavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 149>

(149) atha rudhirodbhāryabhimānihanūmaddevatādhyānam (-)

hanūmaṃtaṃ vāyusutaṃ rudhirodgārisaṃjñakam ||
samudralaṃghanodyuktaṃ dīrghalāṃgūlamāśraye || 1 || 

kanakavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(150) atha raktākṣyabhimānisarasvatīdevatādhyānam (-)

sarasvatīṃ bhāsamānāṃ vīṇojjvalakarāṃbujām ||
raktāṃkṣasaṃjñikāṃ devīṃ prapadyevāgvibhūtidām || 1 || 

śvetavarṇā || 1 ||

(151) atha krodhanābhimānidākṣāyaṇīdevatādhyānam (-)

dākṣāyaṇīṃkrodhanākhyāṃdakṣakratuvibhañjanīm ||
śukārūḍhāṃśūladharāṃbhajebhīṣṭārthasiddhaye || 1 || 

kanakavarṇā || 1 ||

(152) atha akṣayābhimānilakṣmīdevatādhyānam (-)

prapadye'kṣayasaṃjñāṃtāṃlakṣmīṃkṣīrābdhikanyakām ||
haṃsārūḍhāmiṃdumukhīṃpāṇidvayakṛtāṃbujām || 1 || 

svarṇavarṇā || 1 || 60 ||

(153) atha dakṣiṇāyanasvarūpam (-) (śaivāgame)

dakṣiṇāyanasaṃjño vai śyāmosaumaṃdalocanaḥ ||
pītavastrovahankuṃḍaṃ karṇikāradalākṛtiḥ || 1 ||

bījāṃkuraśarāvārkamaniśaṃ narahastakaḥ ||
pūjitaḥ siddhaye nityaṃ dhanadhānyasamṛddhaye || 2 || 

śyāmavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(154) atha utarāyaṇasvarūpam (-) (śaivāgame)

uttarāyaṇasaṃjñosau śubhravarṇo viśāladṛk ||
māṃjiṣṭhavasanopetaḥ svarṇamuktāvibhūṣaṇaḥ || 1 ||

pustukaṃdakṣiṇehaste vāmecaravibiṃbakam ||
dadhanmuktyaimude ca syāt pūjanīyastu kīrtaye || 2 || 

śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 || 2 ||

(155) atha ayanalakṣaṇam (-) (bhaṭṭabhāskarīyeratnamālāyām)

śiśirapūrvamṛtutrayamuttaraṃ hyayanamāhurahaśca tadāmaram ||
bhavati dakṣiṇamanyadṛtutrayaṃ nigaditārajanī marutāṃ ca sā || 1 || 2 ||

atha ayanayorupayogamāhasatyavrataḥ (-) (mādhavīye)

devatārāmavāpyādi pratiṣṭho daṅmukheravau ||
dakṣiṇāśā mukhe kurvan na tatphalamavāpnuyāt || 1 || (-) ||

<p. 150>

(vaikhānasasaṃhitāyām) 

mātṛbhairavavārāha narasiṃha trivikramāḥ ||
mahiṣāsurahaṃtrī ca sthāpyā vai dakṣiṇāyane || 1 || (-) ||

(madanaratnejyotiśśāstre) 

gṛhapraveśastridaśapratiṣṭhā vivāhacaulavratabaṃdhapūrvam ||
saumyāyane karmaśubhaṃ pradiṣṭaṃ yadgarhitaṃ tatkhalu dakṣiṇe syāt || 1 ||

atha ayanayoḥkartavyadānakarmaviśeṣāḥ (-) (dānaciṃtāmaṇau)

tatra uttarāyaṇedānāni (-)

(skāṃde) (-) 

dhenuṃtilamayīṃ rājan dadyādyaścottarāyaṇe ||
sarvānkāmānavāpnoti viṃdate paramaṃ sukham || 1 || (-) ||

(viṣṇudharmottare) (-) 

uttaretvayane viprāvastradānaṃ mahāphalam ||
tilapūrṇamanaḍvāhaṃ dattvārogaiḥ pramucyate || 1 ||

atha dakṣiṇāyanedānakarmāṇi (-) (bhaviṣyottare)

satilaistaṃḍulairdevaṃ pūjayed dakṣiṇāyane ||
ghṛtābhiṣekaṃ vā kuryān mahāpuṇyaphalecchayā || 1 ||

ghṛtapūrṇena bhāṃḍena sa cchidreṇa tvaharniśam ||
gavyenājyena vā śaṃbhoḥ pradadyādghṛtakaṃbalam || 2 ||

sarpiṣārūpakaṃramyaṃkṛtvāśreyobhivṛddhaye ||

atha ayanayorjātaguṇāḥ (-) (jātakābharaṇe)

śaśvatprasannonanusūnukāṃtā saṃtoṣayuktotitarāṃcirāyuḥ ||
narassadātrāṇaparopyudārobhīruśca saumyāyanajātajanmā || 1 ||

akarmagauraḥ kṛṣikarma karttācatuṣpadāṃyo'tikaṭhoracittaḥ ||
śaṭhopyasahyonanumānavānāṃ yāmyāyane yojananaṃ prapannaḥ || 2 ||

(156) atha dakṣiṇāyanābhimānisūryadevatāsvarūpam (-) (śaivāgame)

śreyase bhūyase nityaṃ dakṣiṇāyanamāśraye ||
bhāsvadrathagataṃsūryaṃ caṃdranakṣatrasaṃvṛtam || 1 || 

raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(157) atha uttarāyaṇābhimānisomadevatāsvarūpam (-) (śaivāgame)

kleśāpanuttayenityamuttarāyaṇamāśraye ||
divyasyaṃdanamārūḍhaṃ sūryādigrahasaṃyutam || 1 || 

śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 151>

atha ṛtūnāṃsvarūpāṇi (-) (śaivāgame nṛsiṃhaprāsādeca)

(158) tatrādau vasaṃtartusvarūpam (-)

ādyaṃvasaṃtamīḍehamāsīnaṃ vyāghracarmaṇi ||
akṣamālodyatakaraṃ paṃcākṣaraparāyaṇam || 1 ||

puṣpacchatrāvṛtaśśrīmān vasaṃtobhīṣṭadāyakaḥ ||
baddhapadmāsanāsīnaḥ prāṅkhohasitānanaḥ || 2 ||

śvetāṃgolohitākṣastu pītāṃbarasamanvitaḥ ||
bhasmoddhūlitasarvāṃgo vasaṃtostumudemama || 1 || 

śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(159) atha grīṣmartusvarūpam (-)

grīṣmābhidhodvitīyastu dhūsarorūkṣagātrakaḥ ||
akṣasūtrārka hastastu caṃdraśubhrātapatrayuk || 1 ||

rogasaṃtāpanāśāya pūjanīyo vipaścitā ||
grīṣmaṃprāṅmukhamāsīnaṃ viṣṭare munipūjite || 1 ||

kamaṃḍalūjjvalakaraṃ namāmi śirasānvaham || 1 || 

dhūmravarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(160) atha varṣartusvarūpam (-)

tṛtīyastoyadartustu haridvarṇoruṇekṣaṇaḥ ||
tāmravarṇaśukopetaḥ nīlavidrumakuṃḍalaḥ || 1 ||

mīnamaṃkedadhānoyaṃ toyapūrṇaṃ ghaṭaṃparre ||
meghamālāvṛtaścaiva vidyutvānathadīptimān || 2 ||

haritāladalaiḥpūjyo puṣṭisaṃtuṣṭi vṛddhaye ||
śirasāpraṇamāmyadyavarṣāharṣābhidhāyikāḥ || 1 ||

brusīniviṣṭāssatataṃ dakṣiṇāmukhamāsthitāḥ || 

haridvarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(161) atha śaradṛtusvarūpam (-)

śāradartuścaturthastu caṃdragaurassulocanaḥ ||
kaṃṭhemauktikamālastu karṇeceṃdrāśmakuṃḍalaḥ || 1 ||

caṃdrabiṃbaṃ karedakṣe vāmekuṃbhaṃ sudhāyutam ||
dadhānaḥ pūjanīyoyamāyurvṛddhyaisukhāya ca || 2 ||

śāradobhavitāhyasmat prārthitārthapradāyakaḥ ||
ṛtuḥ pratyaṅmukhāsīnaḥ sphāṭikaṃ valayaṃ vahan || 1 || 

caṃdragauravarṇaḥ || 4 ||

(162) atha hemaṃtartusvarūpam (-)

hemaṃtaḥ paṃcamojñeyaḥ kapilaśśṛṃgakuṃḍalī ||
pītavastrasamāvītastrijaṭaḥ kṛṣṇagodhikaḥ || 1 ||

dhānyamaṃjarikādakṣe vāmepātraṃ sa dhānyakam ||
pūjanīyo vibhūtyarthaṃ dhānyasaṃpadvivṛddhaye || 2 ||

<p. 152>

hemaṃta(-)ṛturasmākamudaṅmukhamupāśritaḥ ||
śuciryajñopavītī ca prasīdatu śubhapradaḥ || 1 || 

kapilavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(163) atha śiśirartusvarūpam (-)

śiśirākhyothaṣaṣṭhastu haritprāṃtāruṇekṣaṇaḥ ||
pītakuṃḍalakarṇastu kaṃṭhevidrumamālakaḥ || 1 ||

madhūkasuprasūnāṃkaḥ pātramarkaṃkarāṃbuje ||
vāmedhānyaśarāvaṃ ca dhārayanniṣṭavṛddhaye || 2 ||

śiśiraṃśirasānaumi ṛtumūrdhvamavasthitam ||
sūryabiṃbādṛtakaraṃ paṃcākṣarajapodyatam || 1 || 

haridvarṇaḥ || 1 || 6 ||

(atraṣaḍṛtunirūpaṇetattatsvarūpatirūpakāṃtimaślokaḥ (-) (śaivāgameśāntiprakaraṇe || (-) ||

tattadaṃtimaślokānyaślokoktatattatpratimālakṣaṇāni ca ||

(nṛsiṃhaprāsāde) 

evaṃ ca matabhedena pratimāyāḥ svarūpebheda itiyatra yasyābhirucistadanusāreṇapratimākalpyetyāśayena ubhayorullekhaḥ ||)

atha vasaṃtādi(-)ṛtuṣukarttavyadānāni (-) (dānaciṃtāmaṇauviṣṇudharmottare)

snānānulepanādīnāṃ vasaṃte dānamiṣyate ||
yānakānāṃ tathāgrīṣme chatrāṇāṃ tadanaṃtaram || 1 || (-) ||

(devīpurāṇe) (-) 

yaḥ punarvidhināvatsa devīmuddiśyaprāvṛṣi ||
vipreṣuviprakanyāsu tilādīntsaṃprayacchati || 1 ||

tasyasātuṣṭimāpnoti śīghrameva tu vidyayā ||(-) ||

(viṣṇudharmottare) (-) 

śaradyannasyadharmajña vastrāṇāmapi haimane ||
vahnerdānaṃ naraḥ kṛtvā sūryamuddiśya codaye || 1 ||

śiśiraṃ satataṃ vahniṃ tarpayitvā tathātilaiḥ ||
kulmāṣaṃ sughṛtaṃdattvā yathāśaktyā dvijātiṣu || 2 ||

kāyāgnidīptiprākaṭyaṃ śatrunāśaṃ ca viṃdati ||

atha vasaṃtādi(-)ṛtuṣujātaguṇāḥ (-) (jātakābharaṇe)

tatrādau (vasaṃte) (-) 

kaṃdarparūpomatimānpratāpī saṃgītaśāstre gaṇite pravīṇaḥ ||
śastrāstra śīlāmala cittavṛttiḥ vasaṃtajāto manujaḥ prasannaḥ || 1 ||

(grīṣme) (-) 

aiśvaryavidyādhanadhānyayukto vaktāpralaṃbāmalakeśapāśaḥ ||
bhogībhavennāti vicāraśīlo yo grīṣmakāle jananaṃ prapannaḥ || 1 ||

(varṣāsu) (-) 

saṃgrāmadhīromatimānpratāpīturaṃgamapremakarasurūpaḥ ||
kaphānilātmālalanāvilāsī varṣovyo()vaipuruṣaḥ saharṣaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 153>

(śaradi) (-) 

apūrṇaroṣaḥ puruṣonilātmā mānīdhanīdharmaruciḥ śuciḥ syāt ||
raṇapriyo vāhanasaṃyutaśca ṛatau śarannāmni ca janma yasya || 1 ||

(hemante) (-) 

nareṃdramaṃtrī caturotyudāro naro bhaveccāruguṇopapannaḥ ||
satkarmadharmānurato manasvī hemaṃtajātaḥ satataṃ vinītaḥ || 1 ||

(śiśire) (-) 

mṛṣṭānnapānānuratovinīto gurupriyaḥ putrakalatrasaumyaḥ ||
satkarmaveṣaḥ puruṣaḥ saroṣobalādiśālīśiśirartujanmā || 1 || 6 ||

atha ṣaḍṛtvabhimānidevatānāṃnāmāni (-) (śaivāgame)

kāmognirvaruṇogaurīsarpa īśvara eva ca ||
etāḥ prakīrtitāḥ ṣaṇṇāmṛtūnāmadhi devatāḥ || 1 ||

atha ṣaḍṛtūnāmabhimānidevatānāṃsvarūpāṇi (-) (śaivāgame)

(164) tatrādau vasaṃtartvabhimānikāmadevatāsvarūpam (-)

vasaṃtakālanetāraṃ kāmaṃkāmyapradāyakam ||
puṣpabāṇavinirbhinna jagattrayamahaṃbhaje || 1 || 

kāṃcanavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(165) atha grīṣmartvabhimānyagnidevatāsvarūpam (-)

śuciṃgrīṣmasya netāraṃvahniṃ meṣagataṃ vibhūm ||
śaktisruksruvahastāḍhyaṃ devaṃ bhaktajana priyam || 1 || 

lohitavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(166) atha varṣartvabhimānivaruṇadevatāsvarūpam (-)

pracetasamahaṃvaṃde varṣartoradhidaivatam ||
nakrārūḍhaṃ pāśapāṇiṃ lokānāṃ jīvanapradam || 1 || 

kanakavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(167) atha śaradṛtvabhimānigirijādevatāsvarūpam (-)

girijāṃśaṃkarārdhāṃgīṃ śaratkālādhidevatām ||
vaṃdelokaikajananīṃ sarvābhīṣṭapradāyinīm || 1 || 

haridvarṇā || 1 ||

(168) atha hemaṃtartvabhimānisarpadevatāsvarūpam (-)

ahiṃsarpakulādhīśaṃ hemaṃtasyādhi daivatam ||
kādraveyaṃ mahāsattvaṃ bhajemāṃpātu sarvadā || 1 || 

śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 154>

(169) atha śiśirartvabhimānīśvaradevatāsvarūpam (-)

śiśirasyeśvaraṃ devaṃ maheśaṃ vṛṣabhadhvajam ||
vaṃdetripurahaṃtāraṃ samebhīṣṭaṃ prayacchatu || 1 || 

śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 || 6 ||

atha cāṃdramānarītyācaitrādimāsasvarūpāṇi (-) (śaivāgame)

(170) tatrādau caitramāsasvarūam (-)

śaṃkhacakrojjvalakaraṃkirīṭodbhāsimastakam ||
jagadānaṃdajanakaṃ madhumāsamupāsmahe || 1 || 

raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(171) atha vaiśākhamāsasvarūpam (-)

kaumodakīśārṅgadharaṃ māsaṃ mādhavasaṃjñakam ||
garutmadvāhanārūḍhaṃ vaṃdebhīṣṭasya siddhaye || 1 || 

śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(172) atha jyeṣṭhamāsasvarūpam (-)

triṇetraṃ ṣaḍbhujaṃbrahma sūtrojjvalabhujāṃtaram ||
vaiyyāghravāhanārūḍhaṃ śuklamāsamupāsmahe || 1 || 

śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(173) atha āṣāḍhamāsasvarūpam (-)

dviśīrṣakaṃ caturbāhuṃ pannageśvara vāhanam ||
upāsmaheśuciṃmāsaṃ bhaktābhīṣṭapradāyakam || 1 || 

aruṇavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(174) atha śrāvaṇamāsasvarūpam (-)

nabhomāsaṃnamāmyadyakleśānāmapanuttaye ||
paṃcavaktraṃ daśabhujaṃ sāraṃgapravarasthitam || 1 || 

haridvarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(175) atha bhādrapadamāsasvarūpam (-)

namāmyahaṃ nabhasyākhyaṃ māsamiṣṭasya siddhaye ||
caturmukhaṃ cāṣṭabhujaṃ haṃsapravarasaṃsthitam || 1 || 

śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(176) atha āśvayujamāsasvarūpam (-)

ṣaṇmukhaṃdvādaśabhujaṃ bhallūkavarasaṃsthitam ||
bhaktābhīṣṭapradaṃnityamiṣamāsamupāsmahe || 1 || 

aruṇavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 155>

(177) atha kārtikamāsasvarūpam (-)

triṇetraṃcārujaṭilaṃ cārucaṃdrārdha śekharam ||
kailāsasikharārūḍhamūrjamāsamupāsmahe || 1 || 

śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(178) atha mārgaśīrṣamāsasvarūpam (-)

vṛṣārūḍhaṃ śūlapāṇiṃ pramadāparisevitam ||
namāmi śirasādevaṃ sahākhyaṃmāsamanvaham || 1 || 

śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(179) atha puṣyamāsasvarūpam (-)

śārikāvāhanārūḍhaṃ khaḍgakheṭakasatkaram ||
dhyāyehaṃmanasānityaṃ sahasyaṃ māsamanvaham || 1 || 

haridvarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(180) atha māghamāsasvarūpam (-)

caṃdrahāsojjvalakaraṃ śukapravaravāhanam ||
dhyāyāmiṣṭakṛtenityaṃ tapomāsamananyadhīḥ || 1 || 

haridvarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(181) atha phālgunamāsasvarūpam (-)

tapasyaṃmāsamīḍehaṃ kokilapravarasthitam ||
brahmasūtrojjvalāṃsaṃca kirīṭāṃkitamastakam || 1 || 

pāṭalavarṇaḥ || 1 || 12 ||

atha caitrādimāsānāṃvarṇāḥ (-) (viṣṇudharmottarekāraṇāgame ca)

caitromadhurlohitaśca vaiśākho mādhavaḥsitaḥ ||
jyeṣṭhaḥ śuklaḥ śvetavarṇaḥ śucirāṣāḍhakoruṇaḥ || 1 ||

śrāvaṇastu haridvarṇo devatā tu nabhaḥ smṛtaḥ ||
bhādronabhasyaḥ śvetaḥ syādāśvayugro hitoruṇaḥ || 2 ||

ūrjo vai kārttikaśśveto mārgaśīrṣaḥ sahāssitaḥ ||
puṣyaḥ sahasyo haritaḥ māghopi haritaḥ smṛtaḥ || 3 ||

phālgunopi tasyākhyo varṇataḥ pāṭalaḥ smṛtaḥ ||
uktāmāsādhi devāśca varṇaiste pṛthivīpate || 4 ||

atha caitrādidvādaśamāseṣutattanmāsakartavyasnānadānapūjopāyanādīni (-) (bhaṭṭabhāskarīyepādmavāmanapurāṇamahābhārateṣu)

tatrādau (caitrai) (-) 

caitraimāsivicitrāṇi nnā()yanānyāsanāni ca ||
viṣṇoḥprītyarthametāni deyānibrāhmaṇoṣviti || 1 ||

<p. 156>

(vaiśākhe) (-) 

vaiśākhe vidhinā snāna devanadyādike bahiḥ ||
haviṣyaṃbrahmacaryaṃ ca bhūśayyāni yama sthitiḥ || 1 || 

vrataṃdānaṃdamodevi madhusūdanapūjanam ||
apijanmasahasrotthaṃ pāpaṃdahati dāruṇam || 2 ||

(jyeṣṭhe) (-) 

udakuṃbhāṃbudhenūśca tālavṛṃtaṃ ca caṃdanam ||
trivikramasya prītyarthaṃ dātavyaṃ jyeṣṭhamāsi ca || 1 ||

(āṣāḍhe) (-) 

upānadyugalaṃchatraṃ lavaṇāmalakāni ca ||
āṣāḍhe vāmanaprītyai dātavyānīhabhaktitaḥ || 1 ||

(śrāvaṇe) (-) 

ghṛtaṃ ca kṣīrakuṃbhāṃśca ghṛtapakvaṃphalāni ca ||
śrāvaṇeśrīdharaprītyai dātavyāni dinedine || 1 ||

(bhādrapade) (-) 

māsibhādrapade dadyāt pāyasaṃ madhusarpiṣī ||
hṛṣīkeśaprīṇanārthaṃ darpaṇaṃ sa guḍodanam || 1 ||

(āśvayuje) (-) 

samyaksthirāṃgaṃ vṛṣabhaṃdadhicāmlarasādikam ||
prītyarthaṃ padmanābhasya deyamāśvayuje naraiḥ || 1 ||

(kārtike) (-) 

rajataṃkanakaṃdīpān maṇimuktāphalādikam ||
dāmodarasya prītyarthaṃ pradadyāt kārtike naraḥ || 1 ||

(mārgaśīṣe) (-) 

kharoṣṭrāśvanarāgāvaḥ śakaṭānyapyajāvikam ||
dātavyā viṣṇusaṃprītyai mārgaśīrṣe narottamaiḥ || 1 ||

(pauṣe) (-) 

pauṣamāsaṃ tu kauṃteya caikabhuktena yaḥ kṣipet ||
subhagodarśanīyaśca yaśobhāgī ca jāyate || 1 ||

(māghe) (-) 

māghamāsi ca yaḥ srāyānnairaṃtaryeṇa bhārata ||
pauṃḍarīka phalaṃ tasya divase divase bhavet || 1 ||

(phālgune) (-) 

phālgunebrīhayogāvovastraṃ kṛṣṇājinānvitam ||
goviṃdaprīṇanārthāya dātavyaṃ puruṣarṣabha || 1 || 12 ||

atha māghādidvādaśamāseṣudānāni (-) (dānaciṃtāmaṇauviṣṇudharmottare)

tatrādau (māghe) (-) 

tilapradānānmāghe tu yāmyaṃ lokaṃ na gacchati ||

<p. 157>

(phālgune) (-) 

priyaṃguṃphālgune dattvā priyo bhavati bhūtale ||

(caitre) (-) 

caitrecitrāṇivastrāṇi dattvāsaubhāgyamaśnute ||

(vaiśākhe) (-) 

apūpānāṃ pradānena vaiśākhe svargamaśnute ||

(jyeṣṭhe) (-) 

chatradānāttathājyeṣṭhe sarvānkāmāntsamaśnute ||

(āṣāḍhe) (-) 

āṣāḍhe caṃdanaṃ deyaṃ sa karpūraṃ mahāphalam ||

(śrāvaṇe) (-) 

śrāvaṇe vastradānena kīrtitaṃ sumahatphalam ||

(bhādrapade) (-) 

prauṣṭhapadye tathāmāsi pradānaṃ phāṇi tasya ca ||

(āśvine) (-) 

āśvine ghṛtadānena rūpavānabhijāyate ||

(kārtike) (-) 

kārtikedīpadānena sarvamaujjvalyamāpnuyāt ||

(mārgaśīrṣe) (-) 

lavaṇaṃmārgaśīrṣe tu dattvāsaubhāgyamaśnute ||

(pauṣe) (-) 

pauṣekanakadānena parāṃ puṣṭiṃ tathaiva ca || 11 ||

atha caitrādimāseṣu jātānāṃguṇāḥ (-) (jātakābharaṇe)

tatrādau (caitre) (-) 

satkarmavidyāvinayopapannobhogī naraḥ syānmadhurānnabhoktā ||
satpātradānānu rataśca maṃtrī caitrodbhavaścāpi vicitramaṃtraḥ || 1 ||

(vaiśākhe) (-) 

suteṣaṇaḥ puṣṭiguṇādhiśālī pumānbalīyān dvijadevabhaktaḥ ||
kāmīcirāyurjalayānaśīlassyānmādhave bāṃdhavasaukhyayuktaḥ || 1 ||

(jyeṣṭhe) (-) 

kṣamānvitaścaṃcalacittavṛttirvideśavāsābhiruciśca tīvraḥ ||
vicitrabuddhiḥ khaludīrghasūtro jyeṣṭhodbhavaśśreṣṭhataronarassyāt || 1 ||

(āṣāḍhe) (-) 

bahuvyayonalpavacovilāsaḥ pramādaśīloguruvatsalaśca ||
sadāgnimāṃdyaśśubhakarmakṛtsyādāṣāḍhajogāḍhatarābhimānaḥ || 1 ||

(śrāvaṇe) (-) 

putraiśca pautraiśca kalatramitraissukhī ca tātasya nideśakarttā ||
lokaprasiddhaḥ kaphavānvadānyoyaśśrāvaṇe puṇyaguṇaiḥ sapūrṇaḥ || 1 ||

(bhādrapade) (-) 

śrīmānbhavetkṣīṇa kalebaraśca dātā ca kāṃtāsutasaukhyayuktaḥ ||
sukhaiśca duḥkhairvikṛto hi martyo dhūrto bhavedbhādrapadesujanmā || 1 ||

(āśvayuje) (-) 

vidvāndhanīrājakulapriyaśca satkāryakartā bahubhṛtyayuktaḥ ||
dātāguṇajño bahuputrasaṃtatissyādāśvine'śvādi samṛddhibhājī || 1 ||

<p. 158>

(kārtike) (-) 

satkarmakarttā bahuvāgvilāsodhanīlasatpaṃgucitālakaśca ||
kāmaṃ sa kāmaḥ krayavikrayārtha satkāryakṛtkārtikajātajanmā || 1 ||

(mārgaśīrse) (-) 

sutīrthayātrānirataḥ suśīlaḥ kalākalāpe kuśalo vilāsī ||
paropakarttā dhṛtasādhumārgo mārgodbhavo vai vibhavaissametaḥ || 1 ||

(puṣye) (-) 

paropakārī pitṛvittahīnaḥ kaṣṭārjitārtha vyayakṛdvidhijñaḥ ||
suguptamaṃtraḥ kṛtaśāstrayuktaḥ pauṣeviśeṣī puruṣaḥ kalāvān || 1 ||

(māghe) (-) 

sanmaṃtravidvaidikasādhuyogo yogoktavidyābhyasanānu yuktaḥ ||
buddherviśeṣādvijitārisaṃgho māghodbhavassyādanagho manuṣyaḥ || 1 ||

(phālgune) (-) 

paropakārī kuśalīdayālurbalānvitaḥ komalakāyaśālī ||
vilāsinīkelividhānaśīloyaḥ phālgunephalguvaco vilāsaḥ || 1 || 12 ||

(182) atha caitrādimāsābhimānidevatānāṃdhyānam (-) (śāradātilake)

āmārgaśīrṣamūrjātaṃkeśavādyā hi devatāḥ ||
pūjāḥkrameṇamāseṣusarvasaṃpatsamṛddhaye || 1 ||

(eṣāṃlakṣaṇānikeśavādi caturviśatimūrtivat ni(0) (2) || 12 ||

atha meṣādimīnaparyataṃdvādaśasaṃkrāṃtīnāṃsvarūpāṇi (-) (jyotiṣārṇave)

(183) tatrādau meṣasaṃkrāṃtisvarūpam (-)

jaṭilāvahni rūpā ca tryakṣāśārdūla vāhanā ||
kapālābhayahastāsyādekavaktrākarālikā || 1 ||

asmanmudesadābhūyānmeṣasaṃkrāṃtirādimā || 

raktavarṇā || 1 ||

(184) atha vṛṣabhasaṃkrāṃtisvarūpam (-)

ekavaktrādvihastā ca triṇetrā siṃhavāhanā ||
śvetavarṇā mahāghorā kapālābhayasaṃyutā || 1 ||

dvitīyāvṛṣasaṃkrāṃtissadābhūyānmudemama || 

śvetavarṇā || 1 ||

(185) atha mithunasaṃktāṃtisvarūpam (-)

virūpākṣīharidvarṇā triṇetrāsūkarasthitā ||
abhayaṃ ca kapālaṃ ca dadhānaikamukhīśubhā || 1 ||

<p. 159>

muthunākhyā tu saṃktāṃtiriṣṭasidhyaisadāstuvaḥ || 

haridvarṇā || 1) |

(186) atha karkāṭakasaṃkrāṃtisvarūpam (-)

mahodarīcaikavaktrākaṭakākhyāśunisthitā ||
pāṭalāṃgī dvihastā ca kapālābhayadhāriṇī || 1 || 

pāṭalavarṇā || 1 ||

(187) atha sihmasaṃkrāṃtisvarūpam (-)

kapālacāmarakarāraktā gardabhasaṃsthitā ||
jihmikāsiṃhasaṃkrāṃtirekavaktrā prasīdatu || 1 || 

raktavarṇā || 1 ||

(188) atha kanyāsaṃkrāṃtisvarūpam (-)

kṛṣṇānanāraktadehā triṇetrāgajasaṃsthitā ||
siṃhikānāmavijñeyā kapālābhayaśobhitā || 1 ||

kanyāsaṃkrāṃtirityuktā pitṛprītikarāśubhā ||

mukhekṛṣṇavarṇā || deheraktavarṇā || 1 ||

(189) atha tulāsaṃkrāṃtisvarūpam (-)

eḍānanānīlavarṇā kukkuṭasthā tulābhidhā ||
maṃdātriṇetrasahitā kapālābhayadhāriṇī || 1 || 

nīlavarṇā || 1 ||

(190) atha vṛścikasaṃkrāṃtisvarūpam (-)

ajārūḍhānīlavarṇā triṇetrāhlādinīmatā ||
kapālaśaktihastā ca saṃkrāṃtirvṛścikābhidhā || 1 || 

nīlavarṇā || 1 ||

(191) atha dhanussaṃkrāṃtisvarūpam (-)

mahiṣasthā triṇetrā ca citravarṇojjvalābhidhā ||
kapālābhayahastā ca dhanussakrāṃtirucyate || 1 || 

citravarṇā || 1 ||

(192) atha makarasaṃkrāṃtisvarūpam (-)

japākusumavarṇā ca triṇetrā daṃṣṭrikānanā ||
kapālavajrahastā ca rākṣasī coṣṭravāhanā || 1 ||

bhūyānmakarasaṃkrāṃtirabhiṣṭhaphaladāyinī || 

raktavarṇā || 1 ||

<p. 160>

(193) atha kuṃbhasaṃkrāṃtisvarūpam (-)

bhaṃjikāturagārūḍhā nilavarṇāmahodarī ||
kapālābhayahastā ca kuṃbhasaṃkrāṃtirīritā || 1 || 

nīlavarṇā || 1 ||

(194) atha mīnasaṃkrāṃtisvarūpam (-)

bhallukavaramārūḍhāvakrānāmnī trilocanā ||
mīnākhyāruṇavarṇāsyāt kapālābhayasaṃyutā || 1 || 

aruṇavarṇā || 1 || 12 ||

atha dvādaśasaṃkrāṃtināmāni (-) (jyotiṣārṇave)

karālī ca mahāghorā virūpākṣī mahodarī ||
jiṃhikāsihmikāmaṃdāhlādinī cojjvalāmatā || 1 ||

rākṣasībhaṃjikāvakrā ceti saṃkrāṃtayaḥ kramāt || 12 ||

atha dvādaśasaṃkrāṃtivāhanāni (-) (jyotiṣārṇave)

vyāghrasiṃhavarāhāśca śunakogardabhogajaḥ ||
kukkuṭājau ca mahisaścoṣṭrośvo ṛkṣa eva ca || 1 ||

etānivāhanānisyuḥ saṃkrāṃtī nāmajāditaḥ || 12 ||

atha saṃkrāṃtiṣudānānyāhaviśvāmitraḥ (-) (bhaṭṭabhāskarīye)

meṣasaṃkramaṇebhānormeṣadānaṃ mahāphalam ||
vṛṣasaṃkramaṇedānaṃ gavāṃproktaṃ tathaiva ca || 1 ||

vastrānnapānayānāni mithune vihitāni tu ||
ghṛtadhenupradānaṃ tu karkaṭe pariśasyate || 2 ||

sasuvarṇaṃ pātradānaṃ siṃhe ca vihitaṃ sadā ||
kanyāpraveśe vastrāṇāṃ surabhīṇāṃ tathaiva ca || 3 ||

tulāpraveśe dhānyānāṃ bījānāmeva cottamam ||
kīṭapraveśe vastrāṇāṃ veśmanāṃdānameva ca || 4 ||

dhanuḥpraveśe vastrāṇāṃ yānānāṃ ca mahāphalam ||
mṛgapraveśedārūṇāṃ dānamagnestathaiva ca || 5 ||

kuṃbhapraveśe dānaṃ tu gobhyastṛṇajalasya ca ||
mīnapraveśe hyamlānamālyānāmapi cottamam || 6 ||

atha dvādaśamāsābhimānidvādaśādityānāṃnāmāni (-) (śaivāgame)

dhātāryamācamitraścāpyaruṇaścaṃdra eva ca ||
vivasvattvaṣṭṛviṣṇvaṃśubhagapūṣaṇa eva ca || 1 ||

parjanyaśca dvādaśaite saṃkrāṃtīnāṃ hi devatāḥ || 12 ||

<p. 161>

atha dvādaśamāsābhimānidvādaśādityadevatādhyānam (-) (śaivāgame (-) ślokaiḥ)

(vākyaiḥśrīviṣṇubhāgavate (-) raśmayastu kūrmapūrāṇe)

(194) tatrādau dhātṛsūryadhyānam (-)

dhātākṛtasthalīhetirvāsukīrathakṛnmune ||
pulastyastuṃbururītimadhumāsaṃnayaṃtyamī || 1 ||

dhātāśubhasya me dātā bhūyobhūyopi bhūyasaḥ ||
raśmijālasamāślaṣṭastamastomavināśanaḥ || 2 ||

meṣemāsidhātāsūryaḥ || 

apsarāḥkṛtasthalī || gaṃdharvastuṃbaruḥ || pulastya(-)ṛṣiḥ || pāśasthānīyo vāsukiḥ || rathakṛdākhyovardhakiḥ || hetirnāmārākṣasaḥ || raśmayoṣṭasahasrāṇi || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(195) atha ayamasūryadhyānam (-)

aryamāpulahothorjaḥ prahetiḥ puṃjikasthalī ||
nāradaḥ kacchanīraśca nayaṃtyetesmamādhavam || 1 ||

meruśṛṃgāṃtaracaraḥ kamalākarabāṃdhavaḥ ||
aryamāstu sadābhūtyai bhūyasyai praṇatasya me || 2 ||

vṛṣabhemāsi aryamāsūryaḥ || pulaha(-)ṛṣiḥ || apsarāḥ puṃjikasthalī || nāradākhyogaṃdharvaḥ | kacchanīrākhyonāgaḥ || ūrjākhyovardhakiḥ || prahetīrākṣasaḥ || raśmayodaśasahasrāṇi || pītavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(196) atha mitrasūryadhyānam (-)

mitrotriḥpauruṣeyothatakṣakomenakāhahā ||
rathasvana itihyete śuklamāsaṃnayaṃtyamī || 1 ||

niśānivāraṇapaṭurudayādrikṛtāśrayaḥ ||
mitrostu mama modāyatamastomavināśanaḥ || 2 ||

mithunamāsimitrassūryaḥ || atrir(-)ṛṣiḥ || menakāpsarāḥ || hāhāgaṃdharvaḥ || takṣakonāgaḥ || rathasvanākhyovardhakiḥ || pauruṣeyorākṣasaḥ || raśmayassaptasahasrāṇi || aruṇavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(197) atha aruṇasūryadhyānam (-)

vasiṣṭhohyaruṇoraṃbhāsahajanyastathāhuhūḥ ||
śukaścitrasvanaścaiva śucimāsaṃnayaṃtyamī || 1 ||

sūryassyaṃdanamārūḍha arcirmālīpratāpavān ||
kālabhūtaḥ kāmarūpo hyaruṇassevyate mayā || 2 ||

<p. 162>

karkakemāsi aruṇassūryaḥ || vasiṣṭha(-)ṛṣiḥ || raṃbhā'psarāḥ || hūhūrgaṃdharvaḥ || śukākhyonāgaḥ || citrasvanovardhakiḥ || sahajanyorākṣasaḥ || raśmayaḥpaṃcasahasrāṇi || śyāmavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(198) atha iṃdrasūryadhyānam (-)

iṃdroviśvāvasuśśrotā celāputrastathāṃgirāḥ ||
pramlocārākṣasaśśaryo nabhomāsaṃnayaṃtyamī || 1 ||

sahasraraśmisaṃvītamiṃdraṃvaradamāśraye ||
śirasāpraṇamāmyadyaśreyovṛddhipradāyakam || 2 ||

siṃhemāsi iṃdrassūryaḥ || aṃgirā ṛṣiḥ || viśvāvasūrgaṃdharvaḥ || pramlocā'psarāḥ || ilāputronāgaḥ || śrotrākhyovardhakiḥ || śaryākhyorākṣasaḥ || raśmayassaptasahasrāṇi || śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(199) atha vivasvatsūryadhyānam (-)

vivasvānugrasenaśca vyāghra āsāraṇobhṛguḥ ||
anumlocāśśaṃkhapālonabhasyākhyaṃnayaṃtyamī || 1 ||

jagannirmāṇakarttāraṃ sarvadigvyāptatejasam ||
nabhograhamahādīpaṃ vivasvaṃtaṃ namāmyaham || 2 ||

kanyāmāsivivasvānsūryaḥ || bhṛgur(-)ṛṣiḥ || anumlocāpsarāḥ || ugrasenogaṃdharvaḥ || śaṃkhapālonāgaḥ || āsāraṇovardhakiḥ || vyāghrorākṣasaḥ || raśmayodaśasahasrāṇi || babhruvarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(200) atha tvaṣṭṛsūryadhyānam (-)

tvaṣṭā(-)ṛcīkorakṣaśca kaṃbalākhyastilottamā ||
brahmarātothaśatajiddhṛtarāṣṭra iṣaṃbharā || 1 ||

tvaṣṭāśubhāyamebhūyācchiṣṭābali niṣevitaḥ ||
nānāśilpakaronānā dhāturūpaḥ prabhākaraḥ || 2 ||

tulāmāsitvaṣṭāsūryaḥ || brahmarāta(-)ṛṣiḥ || tilottamā'psarāḥ || dhṛtarāṣṭrogaṃdharvaḥ || kaṃbalākhyonāgaḥ || śatajinnāmāvardhakiḥ || ṛcīkākhyorākṣasaḥ || raśmayoṣṭasahasrāṇi || citravarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(201) atha viṣṇusūryadhyānam (-)

viṣṇuraśvataroraṃbhāsūryavarcāśca satyajit ||
viśvāmitro mahāpreta ūrjamāsaṃnayaṃtyamī || 1 ||

bhānumaṃḍalamadhyasthaṃ vedatrayaniṣevitam ||
gāyatripratipādyaṃtaṃ viṣṇuṃbhaktyā namāmyaham || 2 ||

<p. 163>

vṛścikemāsiviṣṇussūryaḥ || viśvāmitra ṛṣiḥ || raṃbhā'psarāḥ || sūryavarcāgaṃdharvaḥ || satyajinnāmāvardhakiḥ || aśvataronāgaḥ || mahāpretorākṣasaḥ || raśmayaḥ ṣaṭsahasrāṇi || aruṇavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(202) atha aṃśusūryadhyānam (-)

athāṃśulkāśyapastārkṣya(-)ṛtasenastathorvaśī ||
vidyuchatrurmahāśaṃkhassahomāsaṃnayaṃtyamī || 1 ||

sadāvidrāvaṇaratojaganmaṃgaladīpakaḥ ||
munīṃdranivahastutyobhūtidoṃśurbhavenmama || 2 ||

dhanurmāsi aṃśussūryaḥ || kāśyapa ṛṣiḥ || urvaśyapsarāḥ || ṛtasenogaṃdharvaḥ || mahāśaṃkhonāgaḥ || tārkṣyovardhakiḥ || vidyucchatrūrākṣasaḥ || raśmayonavasahasrāṇi || haridvarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(203) atha bhagasūryadhyānam (-)

bhagassphūrjoriṣṭanemirūrṇa āyuśca paṃcamaḥ ||
karkoṭakaḥ pūrvacittiḥ pauṣamāsaṃnayaṃtyamī || 1 ||

tithimāsa(-)ṛtūnāṃ ca vatsarāyanayorapi ||
ghaṭikānāṃ ca yaḥ kartābhagobhāgyapradostume || 2 ||

makaremāsibhagassūryaḥ || ariṣṭanemir(-)ṛṣiḥ || pūrvacittirapsarāḥ || ūrṇogaṃdharvaḥ || karkoṭakonāgaḥ || āyurvardhakiḥ || sphūrjorākṣasaḥ || raśmaya ekādaśasahasrāṇi || raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(204) atha pūṣasūryadhyānam (-)

pūṣādhanaṃjayodhātāsuṣeṇassurucistathā ||
ghṛtācīgautamaśceti tapomāsaṃnayaṃtyamī || 1 ||

pūṣātoṣāyamebhūyātsarvapāpāpanodanāt ||
sahasrakarasaṃvītassamastā śāṃtarāṃtaraḥ || 2 ||

kuṃbhemāsipuṣāsūryaḥ || gautama ṛṣiḥ || ghṛtācyapsarāḥ || surucirgaṃdharvaḥ || dhanaṃjayonāgaḥ || suṣeṇovardhakiḥ || dhātārākṣasaḥ || raśmayaṣṣaṭsahasrāṇi || alaktakavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(205) atha parjanyasūryadhyānam (-)

kraturvarcābharadvājaḥ parjanyassenajittathā ||
viśvaścairāvataścaiva tapasyākhyaṃnayaṃtyamī || 1 ||

prapaṃcaṃpratapanbhūyo vṛṣṭibhirmādayanpunaḥ ||
jagadānaṃdajanakaḥ parjanyaḥ pūjyate mayā || 2 ||

<p. 164>

mīnemāsiparjanyassūryaḥ || bharadvāja ṛṣiḥ || varcāgaṃdharvaḥ || airāvatonāgaḥ || senajidvardhakiḥ || viśvorākṣasaḥ || raśmayonavasahasrāṇi || aruṇavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

atha eteṣāṃ dvādaśādityānāṃ rathāśvāḥ (-) (viṣṇupurāṇe)

haridvarṇāḥ || chaṃdonāmānaḥ || saptasaṃkhyākāḥ || teṣāṃpurogaṃtā saptināmā pradhānaḥ ekaḥ aśvaśca vartate ||

atradvādaśādityānāṃnāmānidvādaśamāsapravartakatvaṃ ca (-) (viṣṇupurāṇe)

(anyatravyatyāsenoktistukalpabhedaparetijñeyam)

(206) atha eteṣāṃdvādaśādityānāṃlakṣaṇāni (-) (padmapurāṇe)

mārtaṃḍaṃ dvibhujaṃ raktaṃ raktāṃbaradharaṃ sthitam ||
pṛṣṭhabhāgeśiraścakraṃ sthānevimalamaṃḍalam || 1 ||

bibhrāṇaṃ kamaladvaṃdvaṃ hastābhyāṃ ca kirīṭinam ||
uraḥpradeśe vimalaṃsyamaṃtakamahāmaṇim || 2 ||

samāśvamekacakraṃ ca bhāvayerathamāsthitam || 1 ||

atha eteṣāṃvarṇāḥ (-) (padmapūrāṇe)

raktaḥpitoruṇaḥśyāmaḥ śvetobabhruśca karburaḥ ||
aruṇoharitaścaiva śoṇaḥkāṃtanibhoruṇaḥ || 1 ||

ādityānāmimevarṇā dvādaśānāṃ kramāt smṛtāḥ ||

(207) atha adhimāsakṣayamāsayorlakṣaṇe (-) (śiromaṇau)

asaṃkrāṃtimāsodhimāsaḥ sphuṭaṃsyāddvisaṃkrāṃtimāsaḥ kṣayākhyaḥ kadācit ||
kṣayaḥ kārtikādi trayenānyathā syāt tadāvarṣamadhyedhimāsadvayaṃ ca || 1 ||

(adhimāsasyāpinijamāsadevataiva devatā ) (tatsvarūpamapinijamāsasvarūpavat (6) ni(0) ||

athādhikamāsekartavyadānāni (-) (brahmavaivarte)

adhimāse tu saṃprāpte trayastriṃśadapūpakam ||
saguḍājyaphalaṃdadyāt kāṃsyapātrapratiṣṭhitam || 1 ||

janārdanasya prītyarthaṃ tanmūrtiṃ ca hiraṇmayīm ||

<p. 165>

(208) atha makarasaṃkrāṃtisvarūpam (-) (jyotiṣaratnākare)

dvimukhaṃ kṛṣṇavarṇaṃ ca caturbāhuṃ trilocanam ||
saptahastaṃ tripādaṃ ca dviśīrṣaṃ cordhvadṛṣṭikam || 1 ||

saptāyudhadharaṃdakṣe musalaṃ cāsibāṇakau ||
gadāṃvāme ca bibhrāṇaṃ kheṭaṃpātraṃ śarāsanam || 2 ||

prakhyātaṃ krūrarūpaṃtan makarakrāṃti lakṣaṇam || 

kṛṣṇavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

atha vārabhedenasaptavidhamakarasaṃkrāntīnāṃsvarūpāṇi (-) (jyotiṣārṇave) (sarvāḥkṛṣṇavarṇāḥ)

(209) tatrādau bhānuvāreghorānāmnīsaṃkrānteḥsvarūapm (-)

makarakrāṃtirarke tu ghorānāmnī tu siṃhagā ||
vīṇāsijīrṇaśūrpāṇi sitapadmaṃ śarāsanam || 1 ||

tulādaṃḍamahīṃdraṃ ca dadhānā saptabhiḥ karaiḥ || 1 ||

(210) atha somavāredhvāṃkṣīsaṃkrānteḥsvarūpam (-)

iṃduvāre tu saṃkrāṃtirdhvāṃkṣī śārdūla vāhanā ||
asiṃśurpaṃsitāṃbhojaṃ tulādaṃḍaṃśarāsanam || 1 ||

sarpaṃcakrakacaṃ caiva bibhrāṇā varadāstume || 1 ||

(211) atha maṃgalavāremahodarīsaṃkrānteḥsvarūpam (-)

kujavāretathākrāṃtirvarāhavaravāhanā ||
mahodarīti vikhyātā jīrṇaśūrpaṃ sitāṃbujam || 1 ||

tulādaṃḍaṃ cāpasarpau krakacaṃkṣurikāṃ tathā ||
bibhrāṇā varadābhūyāt sarvadāriṣṭaśāṃtaye || 2 || 1 ||

(212) atha budhavāremaṃdākinīsaṃkrānteḥsvarūpam (-)

maṃdākinīsaumyavāre kharapravarasaṃsthitā ||
sitapadmaśarāse ca tulādaṃḍaṃphaṇīṃdrakam || 1 ||

krakacakṣurikābāṇān bibhrāṇā śubhadā sadā || 1 ||

(213) atha guruvāremaṃdāsaṃkrānteḥsvarūpam (-)

surejyavāre maṃdākhyā gajapravaragā śubhā ||
śarāsanatulādaṃḍau nāgeṃdraṃ krakacaṃ śarān || 1 ||

kṣurikāṃbhiṃḍivālaṃ ca dadhānābāhubhirmudā || 1 ||

<p. 166>

(214) atha śukravāremiśrikāsaṃkrānteḥsvarūpam (-)

asureṃdragurorvāre miśrikāmahiṣāsanā ||
tulādaṃḍamahīṃdraṃ ca krakacaṃ kṣurikāṃ tathā || 1 ||

viśikhaṃbhiṃḍivālaṃ ca kuṃtaṃcāpi bibhartyasau || 1 ||

(215) atha śanivārerākṣasīsaṃkrānteḥsvarūpam (-)

bhānuputrasyavāre tu rākṣasīturagasthitā ||
jihmagakrakacau cāpi kṣurikāṃ bāṇameva ca || 1 ||

bhiṃḍivālaṃ ca kuṃtaṃ ca bhuśuṃḍīṃ bibhratī karaiḥ || 1 ||

(216) atha saṃkrāṃtisāmānyalakṣaṇam (-) (jyotiṣasaṃgrahe)

aṣṭabāhuścaturvaktrā hyaṣṭakarṇāṣṭa locanā ||
ṣaṣṭiyojanavistīrṇā śatayojanamunnatā || 2 ||

saptāyudhakarāpūjyā pralaṃboṣṭhī tripādikā ||
ūrdhvakeśī virūpākṣī saṃkrāṃtiḥ puruṣā kṛtiḥ || 1 || 

nīlavarṇā || 1 ||

atha karaṇapraveśabhedādviśeṣeṇāsāmekādaśasvarūpāṇi (-) (jyotiṣasaṃgrahe)

(217) tatrādau bavakaraṇepraviṣṭasaṃkrānteḥsvarūpam (-)

siṃhopaviṣṭaśca bhuśuṃḍi dhārīpunnāga śuklāṃbaravidrumāṇi ||
kastūrikāṃ caiva suhemapātramannaṃ ca bhuṅkte hi bavevivasvān || 1 || 

nīlavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(218) atha bālavakaraṇepraviṣṭasaṃkrānteḥsvarūpam (-)

vyāghropaviṣtoruṇavastrajātī prasūnamuktāphala caṃdanāni ||
kāṃsyaṃ ca pātraṃ sahabhiṃḍivālaṃdhatte raviḥ pāyasabhuk ca bālave || 1 || 

nīlavaraṇaḥ || 1 ||

(219) atha kaulavakaraṇapraviṣṭasaṃkrānteḥsvarūpam

sthitvāvarāhebakulānidhṛtvācitrāṃbaraḥ kuṃdumabhṛtsahāsiḥ ||
bhakṣyaudanorājitabhūṣaṇaścasatāmrapātraḥkhalukaulaverkaḥ || 1 || nīlavaraṇaḥ || 1 ||

(220) atha taitilapraviṣṭasaṃkrānteḥsvarūpam

jaṃbūṃkaredaṃḍadharaścamallikāprasūnagorocanapītavastraḥ ||
dhattedyayaḥpātrampūpabhojanomāṇisyabhuṣāmapitailerkaḥ || 1 || nīlavarṇaḥ || 

<p. 167>

(221) atha garepraviṣṭasaṃkrānteḥsvarūpam (-)

garjopaviṣṭassadhanussalākṣo gomedhikālaṃ karaṇaḥ payaḥ piban ||
nīlāni vastrāṇi ca sīsapātraṃ japāprasūnānigaredadhāti || 1 || 

nīlavarṇaḥ ||(1 ||

(222) atha vaṇikparviṣṭasaṃkānteḥsvarūpam (-)

vaṇiggatoyaṃ mahiṣopaviṣṭassakaṃbalastho'maracaṃdane ca ||
nīlotpalaṃnīlamaṇīṃ ca dhattedadhyannabhoktātrapupātradhārī || 1 || 

nīlavarṇaḥ ||(1 ||

(223) atha bhadrāpraviṣṭasaṃkrāṃteḥsvarūpam (-)

bhadrenikuṃtasturagopaviṣṭaścarmāṃbaromādhavikā prasūnam ||
dhatteharidrāvapikāṃsyapātraṃ citrānnabhuksvarṇavibhūṣaṇorkaḥ || 1 || 

nīlavarṇaḥ ||(1 ||

(224) atha śakunipraviṣṭasaṃkrāṃteḥsvarūpam (-)

śunisthitaḥpāśadharaśca kaṃthāsiṃdūratāmrāṃbaragaṃdhapātraḥ ||
sa caṃpakaḥ pīśi()diśiprayātoguḍāśanaḥ śākunikoravissyāt || 1 || 

nīlavarṇaḥ ||(1 ||

(225) atha catuṣpātpraviṣṭasaṃkrāṃteḥsvarūapam (-)

parṇāṃbaraḥpāṭaladāmadārupātraṃdadhānaḥ kuśabhūṣaṇāni ||
dhatte ca meṣenugataḥ sunidraścatuṣpade madhvaśanoravistu || 1 || 

nīlavarṇaḥ ||(1 ||

(226) atha nāgapraviṣṭasaṃkrāṃteḥsvarūpam (-)

vṛṣasthitovalkalavastradhārī mṛtpātraśastretrapubhūṣaṇāni ||
kuṃḍānivibhraccasapūti gaṃdhaṃ bhuṃkte dhṛtaṃ nāgavasaṃjñakerkaḥ || 1 || 

nīlavarṇaḥ ||(1 ||

(227) atha kiṃstughnapraviṣṭasaṃkrāṃteḥsvarūpam (-)

kukkuṭastha iṣabhṛccakaṃcukīketakīkusumaraktagaṃdhakaḥ ||
śarkarābhugathatāmrabhūṣaṇo veṇupātrabhṛdathāṃtyasaṃjñake || 1 || 

nīlavarṇaḥ ||(1 ||

(228) atha śuklapakṣasyasvarūpam (-) (nṛsiṃhaprāsāde)

śuklapakṣonaraḥśuklo jaṭāmakuṭasaṃyutaḥ ||
śoṇavastrojaṭālākṣo viśālatilakāṃcitaḥ || 1 ||

sūryaṃ dakṣedadhānoyaṃ vāmecaṃdrasya biṃbakam || 2 ||

pūjanīyo mahābhaktyā pratipakṣaṃsite'site || 2 || 

śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 168>

(229) atha kṛṣṇapakṣasyasvarūpam (-) (nṛsiṃhaprāsāde)

śyāmābhaḥkṛṣṇapakṣastu sitaśoṇāṃbaro balī ||
sūyabiṃbaṃ karebibhradvāme sārasamavyayam || 1 || 

pūjanīyobalāptyarthaṃ pratimāsaṃ tu bhedataḥ || 

kṛṣṇavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

atha śuklakṛṣṇapakṣayoḥkartavyadānāni (-) (dānaciṃtāmaṇau viṣṇudharmottare)

puṣpāṇāṃ ca sitepakṣe dānaṃlakṣmī karaṃ smṛtam ||
phalānāṃ ca tathādānaṃ kṛṣṇapakṣe mahāphalam || 1 ||

atha śuklakṛṣṇapakṣayoḥjātaguṇāḥ (-) (jātakābharaṇe)

caṃcaccirāyussutarāṃsu śīlaśśrīputravānkomalakāyakāṃtiḥ ||
sadāsadānaṃdavinītakālaścejjanmakālastu valakṣapakṣe || 1 ||

pralāpaśīlo vibalaśca lolaḥ kavipriyassvīyakuloddhataśca ||
manobhavādhikyayutonitāṃtaṃ sitetareyasya narasya janma || 2 ||

(230) atha śuklapakṣābhimānicaṃdrasyasvarūapam (-) (śaivāgame)

dinedine ca gīrvāṇairvahnīṃdrayamapūrvakaiḥ ||
āpūryamāṇapakṣāyanamaśśvetavapuṣmate || 1 || 

śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(231) atha kṛṣṇapakṣābhimānicaṃdrasyasvarūpam (-) (śaivāgame)

dinedinedevagaṇānpuṣṇate'mṛtadhārayā ||
asitāya namastestu pitṛprītikarāyavai || 1 || 

kṛṣṇavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

atha śuklapakṣakṛṣṇapakṣavibhedenatriṃśatsaṃkhyākatithīnāṃ svarūpāṇi (nṛsiṃhaprāsāde)

(232) tatrādau tithīnāṃnāmāni (-) (śaivāgame)

dinānivakṣyepratipaddvitīyāthatṛtīyakā ||
caturthīpaṃcamīṣaṣṭhīsaptamī cāṣṭamītathā || 1 ||

navamī ca daśamyekādaśīdvādaśikā tathā ||
trayodaśīcaturdaśyau pūrṇimāśśuklapakṣagāḥ || 2 ||

kṛṣṇecaturdaśatathādarśaḥ paṃcadaśomataḥ ||
ubhābhyāmapi pakṣābhyāṃ māsastriṃśaddinātmakaḥ || 3 ||

<p. 169>

(233) tatrādau śuklapratipatsvarūpam

tithayo hi pravakṣyaṃte pratipaddvibhujāruṇā ||
meṣagāśaktipātrāsā śvetapakṣādimāmatā || 1 || 

aruṇavarṇā || 1 ||

(234) atha śukladvitīyāsvarūpam (-)

dvitīyāhaṃsagāśubhrāśubhrapustakadhāriṇī || śubhravarṇā || 1 ||

(235) atha śuklatṛtīyāsvarūpam (-)

tṛtīyāvṛṣagāgaurāśūlapātrakarāmatā || gauravarṇā || 1 ||

(236) atha śuklacaturthīsvarūpam (-)

nīlotpaladalābhāsā caturthīkanakasthitā ||
paraśuṃbibhratīpātraṃ pitavastrābhisaṃyutā || 1 || 

nīlotpalavarṇā || 1 ||

(237) atha śuklapaṃcamīsvarūpam (-)

paṃkajasthāpravālābhā kaṃṭhamastakabhūṣaṇā ||
śaṃkhaṃmudrāṃ tathāpātraṃ bibhrāṇā paṃcamī matā || 1 || 

pravālavarṇā || 1 ||

(238) atha śuklaṣaṣṭhīsvarūpam (-)

mayūragāruṇāṣaṣṭhīpātrakukkuṭadhāriṇī || 

aruṇavarṇā || 1 ||

(239) atha śuklasaptamīsvarūpam (-)

meghavarṇābrahmapātrāsiṃhasthāsaptamīmatā || 

meghavarṇā || 1 ||

(240) atha śuklāṣṭamīsvarūpam (-)

ghaṃṭāpātradharāgoṣṭhā gokṣīradhavalāṣṭamī || 

kṣīravarṇā || 1 ||

(241) atha śuklanavamīsvarūpam (-)

navmīsiṃhagāśubhrāpāśapātradharāmatā || 

śvetavarṇā || 1 ||

(242) atha śukladaśamīsvarūpam (-)

kṛṣṇavarṇālulāyasthā daśamīdaṃḍadhāriṇī || 

kṛṣṇavarṇā || 1 ||

<p. 170>

(243) atha śuklakādaśīsvarūpam (-)

ekādaśīmṛgārūḍhā tulākartarisaṃyutā ||
sitānanāruṇākṣīsyadiṃdranīlasamadyutiḥ || 1 || 

citravarṇā || 1 ||

(244) atha śukladvādaśīsvarūpam (-)

dvādaśīgaruḍārūḍha meghavarṇāripātriṇī || 

meghavarṇā || 1 ||

(245) atha śuklatrayodaśīsvarūpam (-)

cāpabāṇadharāgaurā makarasthā trayodaśī || 

gauravarṇā || 1 ||

(246) atha śuklacaturdaśīsvarūpam (-)

abjasthāpāṭalābhāsā phalapātrakarāmatā ||
nīlakaṃṭhāceṃdragopanayanā ca caturdaśī || 1 || 

pāṭalavarṇā || 1 ||

(247) atha śuklapūrṇimāsvarūpam (-)

śaśagāpūrṇimāśubhrā mauktikābharaṇānvitā ||
sudhāpūr.ṇaṃ ghaṭaṃdhatte vāme dakṣepi dhānakam || 1 || 

śvetavarṇā || 1 || 15 ||

(248) tatrādau kṛṣṇapratipatsvarūpam (-)

dhūsarākṛṣṇapakṣadyā sārasasthā caturmukhā ||
astraṃpātraṃ sruvaṃcāpaṃ karairdhatte caturbhujā || 1 || 

dhūmravarṇā || 1 ||

(249) atha kṛṣṇadvitīyāsvarūpam (-)

dvitīyākumudābhāsā vṛṣasthā sākṣakuṃḍikā || 

śvetavarṇā || 1 ||

(250) atha kṛṣṇatṛtīyāsvarūpam (-)

tṛtīyātārkṣyagānīlā śaṃkhapātradharā smṛtā || 

nīlavarṇā || 1 ||

(251) atha kṛṣṇacaturthīsvarūpam (-)

caturthīkajjalābhāsā mahiṣasthā caturbhujā ||
dhattekṣamālikāṃdaṃḍaṃ pāśaṃpātraṃ ca dakṣiṇe || 1 || 

kṛṣṇavarṇā || 1 ||

(252) atha kṛṣṇapaṃcamīsvarūpam (-)

grāhasthācaṃdrikāgaurā paṃcamī sākṣakumḍikā || 

śvetavarṇā || 1 ||

<p. 171>

(253) atha kṛṣṇaṣaṣṭhīsvarūpam (-)

tryakṣāmayūragā raktāśaktikukkuṭadhāriṇī ||
ekāsyā dvibhujāṣaṣṭhī raktavastropaśobhitā || 1 ||

nīlakuṃḍalakāvaśyā jaṭākhaṃḍeṃdubhūṣitā || 

raktavarṇā || 1 ||

(254) atha kṛṣṇasaptamīsvarūpam (-)

ibhasthāsaptamīgaurā dvibhujāvajrayaṃtriṇī || 

gauravarṇā || 1 ||

(255) atha kṛṣṇāṣṭamīsvarūpam (-)

pretagācāṣṭamīraktā kṛṣṇagrīvāmatāśubhā ||
akṣaṃkhetaṃtathākhaḍgaṃ pātraṃdhatte caturbhujā || 1 || 

raktavarṇā || 1 ||

(256) atha kṛṣṇanavamīsvarūpam (-)

sarpagānavamītāla daṃṣṭriṇī śyāmalā matā || 

śyāmavarṇā || 1 ||

(257) atha kṛṣṇadaśamīsvarūapam (-)

siṃhāsanasthitāśubhrā daśamīpītakuṃḍalā ||
jñānamudrābhayāceyaṃ pītavastrābjamālinī || 1 || 

śubhravarṇā || 1 ||

(258) atha kṛṣṇaikādaśīsvarūpam (-)

ekādaśīvṛṣārūḍhā nīlavarṇā triśūlinī || 

nīlavarṇā || 1 ||

(259) atha kṛṣṇadvādaśīsvarūpam (-)

tāmravarṇārathāruḍhā pātrakheṭāsipaṃkajā ||
dvādaśīśubhravastreyaṃ nīlakuṃḍalabhūṣitā || 1 || 

raktavarṇā ||

(260) atha kṛṣṇatrayodaśīsvarūpam (-)

aśokakalikābāṇa cāpapātradharāmatā ||
dvibhujācoragārūḍhā kṛṣṇavarṇā trayodaśī || 1 || 

kṛṣṇavarṇā || 1 ||

(261) atha kṛṣṇacaturdaśīsvarūpam (-)

khaḍgasaṃsthāvarānīlā dvibhūjā ca caturdaśī || 

nīlavarṇā || 1 ||

<p. 172>

(262) atha kṛṣṇāmāvāsyāsvarūpam (-)

amāvāsyāvidhātavyā dvidormarakataprabhā ||
darbhāsanasthitā ceyaṃ darbhapiṃḍadharākṛśā || 1 || 

marakatavarṇā || 1 ||

atha śuklakṛṣṇapratipadāditithiṣukartavyakṛtyāni (-) (daivajñavilāse)

(pratipadi) (-) 

lohāśmavṛkṣaśayyādi kṛṣiścitra kriyāpi ca ||
raṇopakaraṇaṃtatra tithaupratipadīritam || 1 ||

(dvitīyāyām) (-) 

mauṃjīvivāhayātrādi pratiṣṭhābhūṣaṇādikam ||
pauṣṭivāstvādikaṃkarma dvitīyāyāṃ vidhīyate || 1 ||

(tṛtīyāyām) (-) 

saṃgītavādyākhilaśilpakarmasīmaṃtacaulānnagṛhapratiṣṭhāḥ ||
kāryaṃ dvitīye divase yaduktaṃ sadā tṛtīye divasepi tat syāt || 1 ||

(caturthyām) (-) 

riktāsukarturvadhabaṃdhaśāstraviṣāgnibhūtādi ca yāti siddhim ||
yanmaṃgalaṃ tāsukṛtaṃ ca māsairvināśamāyāti tathānumāsam || 1 ||

(paṃcamyām) (-) 

yātropanayanodvāhapratiṣṭhāśāṃtipauṣṭikam ||
ciraṃsthiraṃsarvakarmapaṃcamyāṃsamudīritam || 1 ||

(ṣaṣṭhyām) (-) 

sevābhūṣaṇagovāstu samarakrayavikrayam ||
bhūṣākarma ca bhaiṣajyaṃ sarvaṃ ṣaṣṭhyāṃ vidhīyate || 7 ||

(saptamyām) (-) 

vāstūpanayanodvāha pratiṣṭhādi carasthiram ||
kṛṣibhūṣaṇasaṃgrāmaṃ saptamyāṃsamudīritam || (-) ||

(prakārāntaram) (-) 

dvitīyāyāṃ tṛtīyāyāṃ paṃcamyāṃ kathitānyapi ||
tānisidhyaṃti kāryāṇi saptamyāmakhilānyapi || 1 ||

(aṣṭamyām) (-) 

saṃgrāmadhānyākhilavāstuśilpavṛttaprakopākhilalekhakāni ||
strīratnapaṇyākhilabhūṣaṇāni kāryāṇyakāryāṇi maheśatithyām || 1 ||

(navamyām) (-) 

vigrahaṃnigrahaṃ caiva śatrucchedanabhedanam ||
navamyāṃbhūtakarmāṇi bahūnyapi ca kārayet || 1 ||

<p. 173>

(daśamyām) (-) 

pauṣṭikaṃ maṃgalaṃ yātrā praveśaṃ jalakarma ca ||
darśanaṃ gṛhakāryāṇi daśamyāṃ kārayedbudhaḥ || 1 ||

(ekādaśyām) (-) 

vivāhakṛṣivāṇijyamupavāsādibhūṣaṇam ||
vāstukaṃśilpanṛttādyamekādaśyāṃ vidhīyate || 1 ||

(dvādaśyām) (-) 

vṛddhivyayāni kāryāṇi dharmavṛttikarāṇi ca ||
carasthirāṇi dvādaśyāmanyatraśravaṇaṃvinā || 1 ||

(trayodaśyām) (-) 

kṣemaṃdhruvaṃ ca saubhāgyaṃ maṃgalaṃ nāṭyabhūṣanam ||
aśvaśikṣātathālekhyaṃ trayodaśyāṃ tu kārayet || 1 ||

(caturdaśyām) (-) 

daṃtadhāvanatailaṃ ca māṃsayātropanāyanam ||
caturdaśyāṃ na kartavyamanyacca śubhakarma vā || 1 ||

(paurṇamāsyām) (-) 

yajñakriyāmaṃgalapauṣṭikāni saṃgrāmayogyākhilavāstukarma ||
udvāhaśilpākhilabhūṣaṇāḍhyaṃ kāryaṃ pratiṣṭhākhalupaurṇamāsyām || 1 ||

(amāvāsyāyām) (-) 

amāyāṃpitṛkarmaikaṃ kartavyamitarannatu ||

atha śuklakṛṣṇapratipadāditithiṣuviṣanāḍīpraveśakālaḥ (-) (sārāvalyām)

hayobhayolayonāgo varaṃnārīkharaṃvaram ||
kharaṃvaraṃ kaviṃviṣṇuṃ rālaṃsākaṃ viyatkramāt || 1 || (-) || 

prakārāntareṇa ||

(muhūrtagaṇapatau) (-) 

tithi bāṇāṣṭasaptāṃga paṃcavedāṣṭabhūdharāḥ ||
digvahnyarkamanukṣmābhṛdvasavo ghaṭikāḥ kramāt || 1 ||

(263) atha śuklapratipadāditithiṣukartavyadānāni (-) (dānaciṃtāmaṇau (-) viṣṇudharmottare)

pratipadyathapuṣpāṇāṃ dvitīyāyāṃ ghṛtasya ca ||
tṛtīyāyāṃ priyamgūṇāṃ caturthyāṃ rajatasya ca || 1 ||

paṃcamyāṃ tu phalānāṃ vai ṣaṣṭhyāṃ snānasya dānataḥ ||
saptamyāṃ vāsasāṃ caiva tvaṣṭamyāṃ vai guḍasya ca || 2 ||

kulmāṣasya navamyāṃ tu daśamyāṃ bhojanasya ca ||
ekādaśyāṃ suvarṇasya dvādaśyāṃ vasanasya ca || 3 || 

<p. 174>

trayodaśyāṃ ca gaṃdhānāṃ sitāyāstadanaṃtaram ||
dānaṃ ca paramānnasya paṃcadaśyāṃ mahāphalam || 4 ||

atha śuklakṛṣṇapratipadāditithiṣujātānāṃguṇāḥ (-) (kālaprakāśe)

(pratipadi) (-) 

pratipatsudhanāḍhyassyājjātaḥ puṇyarataḥ pumān ||

(dvitīyāyām)  (-) 

viśokastu kaviḥkāṃtaḥ kāmukaḥ kalahapriyaḥ ||
dvitīyāyāṃ tu saṃjāto godhānyādhipatirbhavet || 1 ||

(tṛtīyāyām) (-) 

jayaśīlodhanāḍhyaśca puṇyaśīlassurūpavān ||
medhāvī vākparovidvānjātaḥ śuddho jayātithau || 1 ||

(caturthyām ) (-) 

dīnaceṣṭaḥ kuśīlaśca kunakhīmaṃtrataṃtravit ||
caturthyāṃ ca tithaujātassamassāhasakarmavit ||

(paṃcamyām) (-) 

saumyaḥkāmīkalābhijñaḥ kṣamīcāśritavatsalaḥ ||
oṣadhīśatithaujātaḥ kāruṇya caritaḥ kaviḥ || 1 ||

(ṣaṣṭhyām) (-) 

ajayyassattvavānkhyātaḥ kṣiprakopī janādhipaḥ ||
mukhapṛṣṭhorutilakaḥ ṣaṣṭhyāṃ saṃjāyate naraḥ || 1 ||

(saptamyām) (-) 

medhāvī sattvavāñcchrīmāñchayāmalāṃgaḥ kalātmakaḥ ||
sṛṣṭisthityaṃtadakṣassyājjātaśceṃdratithauprabhuḥ || 1 ||

(aṣṭamyām) (-) 

hṛṣṭaḥkaṣṭaśśaṭhaśśrīmānnīcavṛttiḥkaphātmakaḥ ||
kāmīkalatravāṃstyāgī tvaṣṭamyāṃ jāyate naraḥ || 1 ||

(navamyām) (-) 

nāstikonirbhayaḥ khyāto dīrghavairī ca paṃḍitaḥ ||
śūraḥkuputravānvaśyo navamyāṃ jāyate naraḥ || 1 ||

(daśamyām) (-) 

dhārmikodhanavānāḍhyaḥ putramitrakalatravān ||
nītimānsatyavānvidvāndaśamyāṃ jāyate naraḥ || 1 ||

(ekādaśyām) (-) 

pitṛdevādibhaktiśca kāryodyogījayotsukaḥ ||
dhanavānprabhukāryaśca goviṃdatithijonaraḥ || 1 ||

(dvādaśyām) (-) 

kāmīkalāpī vikrāṃtaḥ kāṃtaḥ śāṃto dhanādhipaḥ ||
dhīrastyāgī sukhīvīro dvādaśyāṃ jāyate naraḥ || 1 ||

<p. 175>

(trayodaśyām) (-) 

saumyaḥkāmījayīvidvālluṁbddhassyāccapalātmajaḥ ||
dhanavānnṛttagobhoktā trayodaśyāṃ tu jātavān || 1 ||

(caturdaśyām) (-) 

kopīvaśyamanāmaṃdaḥ kṛtajñonāstikodhanī ||
paradārarataścaiva caturdaśyāṃ tu saṃbhavaḥ || 1 ||

(pañcadaśyām) (-) 

devadvijanṛpaiḥpūjyo bhogīgodhanadhānyavān ||
putramitrakalatrāḍhyo jātaḥpaṃcadaśī tithau || 1 || (-) || 

prakārāṃtareṇa || 

atha śuklakṛṣṇapakṣapratipadāditithiṣu jātaguṇāḥ (-) (jātakābharaṇe)

(partipadi) (-) 

bahujanaparivāraścāruvidyovivekīkanakamaṇivibhuṣāveṣaśālīsuśīlaḥ ||
atisulalitakāṃtirbhūmipālāttavittaḥpratipadiyadisūti jāyate yasya jaṃtoḥ || 1 ||

(dvitīyāyām) (-) 

dātādayālurguṇavānsusaṃpaccaṃcatsutācāravicāradhanyaḥ ||
prasannamūrtirbahugītakīrtirjātodvitīyātithisaṃbhavassyāt || 1 ||

(tṛtīyāyām) (-) 

kāmādhikassyādanavadyavidyobalānvitorājakulāttavittaḥ ||
pravāsaśīlaścaturovilāsī martyastṛtīyāprabhavobhimānī || 1 ||

(caturthyām) (-) 

ṛṇapravṛttirbahusāhasassyādraṇapravīṇaḥ kṛpaṇasvabhāvaḥ ||
dyūteratirlolamanāmanuṣyo vādīyadisyājjananeṃ caturthī || 1 ||

(paṃcamyām) (-) 

saṃpūrṇagātraśca kalaputramitrānvito bhūtadayānvitaśca ||
nareṃdramānyastu narovadānyaḥ prasūtikāle kilapaṃcamī syāt || 1 ||

(ṣaṣṭhyām) (-) 

satyapratijñodhanasūnusaṃpaddīrghorujānurmanujomahaujāḥ ||
prakṛṣṭakīrtiścaturovariṣṭhaṣṣaṣṭhyāṃ prajātovraṇakīrṇagātraḥ || 1 ||

(saptamyām) (-) 

jñānīguṇajño hi viśālanetraḥ satpātradevārcana cittavṛttiḥ ||
kanyāpanetāparavittahartā syātsaptamījomanujorihaṃtā || 1 ||

(aṣṭamyām) (-) 

nānāsaṃpatsūnusaukhyaḥ kṛpāluḥ pṛthvīpālaprāptavittapratiṣṭhaḥ ||
kāṃtāprītiścaṃcalasvāṃtavṛttiryasyāṣṭamyāṃ jāyate janmasasyāt || 1 ||

<p. 176>

(navamyām)  (-) 

parāṅmukhobaṃdhujanasya kāryekaṭhoravākyaśca sūdhīvirodhī ||
narassadācārakṛtādarassyādyasya prasūtaunavamītithissyāt || 1 ||

(daśamyām) (-) 

dharmaikabuddhirbahuvaibhavāḍhyaḥ pralaṃbakaṃṭho bahuśāstrapāṭhī ||
udāracitto nitarāṃvinīto ramyaśca kāmī daśamī bhavassyāt || 1 ||

(ekādaśyām) (-) 

devadvijārcāvratadānaśīlaḥ sunirmalāṃtaḥ karaṇaḥ pravīṇaḥ ||
puṇyaikacitto gurukarmakṛtsyādekādaśījotikṛśotiroṣaḥ || 1 ||

(dvādaśyām) (-) 

jalapriyo vai vyavahāraśīlo nīcālayāvāsavilāsaśīlaḥ ||
sadānnadātā kṣitipāptavittassyāddvādaśījomanujaḥ prajāvān || 1 ||

(trayodaśyām) (-) 

rūpānvitaḥsātvikatā vimuktaḥ pralaṃbakaṃṭhaścaraṇaprasūtiḥ ||
narotiśuraścaturaḥ prakāmaṃ trayodaśīnāmatithiprasūtaḥ || 1 ||

(caturdaśyām) (-) 

krūrotiśūraścaturassahāsaḥ kaṃdarpalīlākulacittavṛttiḥ ||
syāddussahotyaṃtaviruddhabhāṣī caturdaśījaḥ puruṣassaroṣaḥ || 1 ||

(pūrṇimāyām) (-) 

atisulalitakāyo nyāyasaṃprāptavitto bahuyuvatisameto nityasaṃjātaharṣaḥ ||
prabalabalavilāsotyaṃtakāruṇyapuṇyo guṇagaṇaparipūrṇaḥ pūrṇimājātajanmā || 1 ||

(amāvāsyāyām) (-) 

śāṃtomanasvī pitṛmātṛbhaktaḥ kleśāptavittaśca gamāgamecchuḥ ||
mānyojanānāṃhatakāṃti harṣodarśodbhavassyātpuruṣaḥ kṛśāṃgaḥ || 1 ||

atha śuklakṛṣṇapakṣatithyabhimānidevatānāṃnāmāni (-) (kālāmṛte)

vahnitvaṣṭṛhimādrijāgaṇapatiḥ sarpaḥ kumāroravigaurīśo vasunāgadharmaharayaḥ kāmaḥ kalīṃdupitā || ete sarvadinādhipāḥ syuḥ ||

(264) atha śuklakṛṣṇapakṣatithyabhimānidevatāsvarūpāṇi (-) 

tatrādauśuklakṛṣṇapakṣapratipadabhimānyagnerdhyānam (-)

ehisākṣādihāgnetvaṃ devānāṃ havyavāhakaḥ ||
śāṃtikarmaṇipūjārthametāṃ mūrtiṃsamāviśa || 1 || 

raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 177>

(265) atha śuklakṛṣṇadvitīyābhimānitvaṣṭṛdevatāyāḥdhyānam (-)

tvaṣṭarjagattrayīdhātaḥpunīhidayayāmahīm ||
pratimāyāmamuṣyāṃ tvaṃ sannidhatsvacaturmukha || 1 || 

raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(266) atha śuklakṛṣṇatṛtīyābhimānipārvatyāḥdhyānam (-)

pratimāyāṃhiraṇmayyāmehiparvatakanyake ||
namasyāmipadābjaṃtepumarthapratipattaye || 1 || 

pītavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(267) atha śuklakṛṣṇacaturthyabhimānigajānanasyadhyānam (-)

vighnāṃtakālabālārkapārvatī malasaṃbhava ||
gajānanārcāṃ gṛhṇīṣvapratimāmetyasādaram || 1 || 

raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(268) atha śuklakṛṣṇapaṃcamyabhimānisarpadevatāyāḥdhyānam (-)

sarpādhipamayāhūtaḥ pratimāyāṃniṣīdabho ||
pūjayāmi padābjaṃte sarvasaṃpadavāptaye || 1 || 

śubhravarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(269) atha śuklakṛṣṇaṣaṣṭhyabhimāniṣaḍānanadevatāyāḥdhyānam (-)

ṣaḍānananamasyāṃte karavāṇipadābjayoḥ ||
pratimāyāṃhiraṇmayyāmehivallī manaḥ priya || 1 || 

raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(270) atha śuklakṛṣṇasaptamyabhimānisūryasyadhyānam (-)

sahasrabhāno caṃḍāṃśo pratimāmehisādaram ||
trayītanonamasyāṃte bhūyobhūyaḥ karomyaham || 1 || 

raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(271) atha śuklakṛṣṇāṣṭamyabhimānisadyojātasyadhyānam (-)

sadyojātanamastestu gaurīnātha namostute ||
prasādaṃ kuru me śambho pratimāme hi sādaram || 1 || 

śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(272) atha śuklakṛṣṇanavamyabhimānidurgāyāḥdhyānam (-)

durgetriṇayane caṃdrakalāṃkita śiroruhe ||
ihāgatyaprasādaṃ me racayāśu sureśvari || 1 || 

śyāmavarṇā || 1 ||

<p. 178>

(273) atha śuklakṛṣṇadaśamyabhimāniśeṣadevatāyāḥdhyānam (-)

bhūbhārabhūgnagrīvāya viṣṇupādāṃkamaulaye ||
namonamostunāgāya pratimā me hi sādaram || 1 || 

śubhravarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(274) atha śuklakṛṣṇaikādaśyabhimānidharmadevatāyāḥdhyānam (-)

śrutivedyasvarūpāyayāgādikratumūrtaye ||
bhūriśreyassādhanāya dharmāyamahate namaḥ || 1 || 

nīlavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(275) atha śuklakṛṣṇadvādaśyabhimāniharidevatāyāḥdhyānam (-)

harejagattrayādhīśalakṣmīvallabhamādhava ||
pratimāmetyasahasā prasādaṃ kuru me vibho || 1 || 

kanakavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(276) atha śuklakṛṣṇatrayodaśyabhimānimanmathadevatāyāḥdhyānam (-)

rativallabhapuṣpāstranārāyaṇatanūdbhava ||
ehīmāṃpratimāṃtūrṇaṃ prasīdamayimanmatha || 1 || 

kāṃcanavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(277) atha śuklakṛṣṇacaturdaśyabhimānikalipuruṣasyadhyānam (-)

sarvādharmapravaktāraṃ sarvapāpapravartakam ||
vaṃcanā caturaṃvaṃde bhūtaye kalibhūpatim || 1 || 

kṛṣṇavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(278) atha pūrṇimābhimānicaṃdradevatāyāḥdhyānam (-)

sarvagīrvāṇasevyāyalakṣmīkāmuka cakṣuṣe ||
kṣīrābdhipriyapūtrāya namaścaṃdramasestute || 1 || 

śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(279) atha amāvāsyābhimānipitṛdevatānāṃdhyānam (-)

pitṛlokanivāsibhyaḥ pitṛbhyostu namonamaḥ ||
pratimāṃprāpyasauvarṇī prasīdaṃ tu sadāmayi || 1 || 

kṛṣṇavarṇāḥ || 1 || 30 ||

atha vārasvarūpāṇi (-) (mayūkhedānakhaṃḍe)

(280) tatrādau ravivārasvarūapm (-)

padmāsanaḥpadmakaraḥ padmagarbhasamadyutiḥ ||
saptāśvarathasaṃyukto dvibhujassyātsadāraviḥ || 1 || 

pāṭalavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 179>

(281) atha somavārasvarūpam (-)

śvetaśśvetāṃbaradharodaśāśvaḥ śvetabhūṣaṇaḥ ||
gadāpāṇirdvibāhuśca kartavyo varadaḥ śaśī || 1 || 

śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(282) atha maṃgalavārasvarūpam (-)

raktamālyāṃbaradharaḥśaktiśūlagadādharaḥ ||
caturbhujomeṣagamovaradaḥ syāddharāsutaḥ || 1 || 

raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(283) atha budhavārasvarūpam (-)

pītamālyāṃbaradharaḥkarṇikārasamadyutiḥ ||
khaḍgacarmagadāpāṇiḥ siṃhastho varado budhaḥ || 1 || 

pītavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(284) atha guruśukravārayoḥsvarūpe (-)

devadaityagurūśuddhau pītaśvetau caturbhujau ||
daṃḍinau varadau kāryau sākṣasūtrakamaṃḍalū || 1 || 

svarṇavarṇau || 2 ||

(285) atha sthiravārasvarūpam (-)

iṃdranīlākṛtiḥśūlī varadogṛdhravāhanaḥ || 1 ||
bāṇabāṇāsanadharaḥ kartavyorkasutaḥsadā || 1 || 

nīlavarṇaḥ || 1 || 7 ||

atha ravyādisaptavāreṣukartavyāni (-) (nāradīye)

tatrādau (ravau) (-) nṛpābhiṣekamāṃgalya sevāyānādi karmayat ||
auṣadhāhavadhānyādi nilayaṃ bhānuvāsare || 1 ||

(some) (-) 

śaṃkhamuktāṃburajatavṛkṣekṣustrīniṣevaṇam ||
puṣpagītakratukṣīrakṛṣikarmeduvāsare || 1 ||

(maṃgale) (-) 

viṣāgnibaṃdhanasteya saṃdhivigrahamāhavam ||
dhātvākarapravālāstrakarma bhūmijavāsare || 1 ||

(budhe) (-) 

nṛttaśilpakalāgītalipipustakavigraham ||
vivādadhātusaṃgrāmakarmasaumyasya vāsare || 1 ||

<p. 180>

(gurau) (-) 

yajñapauṣṭikamāṃgalya svarṇavastrādibhūṣaṇam ||
vṛkṣagulmalatāyānakarmadevejyavāsare || 1 ||

(śukre) (-) 

nṛtyagītādivāditra svarṇastrī vastrabhūṣaṇam ||
paṇyotsavādigodhānyakarma bhārgavavāsare || 1 ||

(śanau) (-) 

trapusīsāyasāstrāśma viṣapāpāsavānṛtam ||
sthirakarmākhilaṃvāstu saṃgrahaḥ saurivāsare || 1 || 7 ||

atha ravyādisaptavāreṣuviṣanāḍīpraveśakālāḥ (-) (muhūrtagaṇapatau)

sūryeviṃśatiriṃdaudve bhaumedvādaśa caṃdraje ||
daśajīve tu saptaiva bhṛguje paṃca sūryaje || 1 ||

paṃcaviṃśati ghaṭyūrdhvaṃ viṣanāḍyaḥ prakīrtitāḥ || (-) || 

(graṃthāṃtare)

ekaviṃśāguraucaivaddāviṃśā budhabhaumayoḥ ||
paṃcaviṃśāśukrabhānvormaṃdeṃdvoścāṣṭanāḍikāḥ || 1 || 7 ||

atha ravyādisaptavāreṣukartavyadānāni (-) (brahmāṃḍapurāṇe)

grahāntsvarṇamayānkṛtvā yo viprebhyaḥ prayacchati ||
tadratnaṃ caiva taddhānyaṃ tadvarṇaṃ vastrameva ca || 1 || 

taddineṣu yathāśaktyā sarvātkāmānavāpnuyāt || 7 ||

atha tattadvāsarekartavyadānānipṛthakprṭhak (-) (viṣṇudharmottare)

tatrādau (ravivāsare) (-) 

lavaṇājyaguḍopetamapūpaṃ sūryavāsare ||
sahiraṇyaṃ naro dattvā na rogairabhibhūyate || 1 ||

(somavāsare) (-) 

evaṃvidhaṃceṃdudine dattvāsaubhāgyamāpnuyāt ||

(bhaumavāsare) (-) 

kāṣṭhadānebhaumadine śatrornāśamavāpnuyāt ||

(budhavāsare) (-) 

budhekrīḍanakānāṃ ca dānaṃ bāleṣu śasyate ||

(guruvāsare) (-) 

jīvehnivastradānena parāṃ puṣṭiṃ samaśnute ||

(śukravāsare) (-) 

śvetaṃturaṃgamāpnoti śukredattvā ratiṃstriyaḥ ||

(śanivāsare) (-) 

abhyaṃgaṃsauridivase dattvājīvitamāpnuyāt || 7 ||

<p. 181>

atha ravyādisaptavāreṣujātānāṃguṇāḥ (-) (jātakābharaṇe anyatra ca)

tatrādau (ravau) (-) 

śūrolpakeśo vijayīraṇāgre śyāmāruṇaḥ pittacayaḥ prakopaḥ ||
dātāmahotsāha yutomahaujā dinedine śasya bhavenmanuṣyaḥ || 1 ||

(some) (-) 

prātaḥprajātaḥ priyavāgvidhijñaḥ śaśvannareṃdrā śrayavṛttimāṃśca ||
kukhe ca duḥkhepi samasvabhāvo vārenaraḥ śītakarasya jātaḥ || 1 ||

(maṃgale) (-) 

vakroktiratyaṃtaraṇapriyassyānnareṃdramaṃtrī ca ghanopajīvī ||
sattvānvitastīvratarasvabhāvo dinodbhavothāvaninaṃdanasya || 1 ||

(budhe) (-) 

surūpaśālī mṛduvāgvilāsaḥ śrīmānkalākauśalatā sametaḥ ||
vaṇikkriyāyāṃ hi bhavedabhijñaḥ prājñoguṇajñojñadinodbhavoyaḥ || 1 ||

(gurau) (-) 

vidvāndhanīsarvaguṇopapanno manoramaḥ kṣmāpatilabdhakāmaḥ ||
ācāryavaryaśca janapriyassyādvāreguroryasya narasyajanma || 1 ||

(śukre) (-) 

sunīlasaccaṃcalakeśapāśaḥ prassannaveṣo matimānviśeṣāt ||
śuklāṃbaraḥ prītidharo narassyātsumārgagobhārgavavārajātaḥ || 1 ||

(śanau) (-) 

akālasaṃprāptajarāpravṛttirbalojjhitodurbaladehayaṣṭiḥ ||
tamoguṇaḥ kraurya ca yā bhibhūtaḥ śanerdine jātajanirmanuṣyaḥ || 1 || 7 ||

prakārāṃtaram (-) (kālaprakāśikāyām)

(ravau) (-) 

piṃgadṛkpītakeśaśca śilpavicchīlavānprabhuḥ ||
pittavātātmakomānī ravivārodbhavo naraḥ || 1 ||

(some) (-) 

mṛdukāṃtavapussaumyaḥ kalālpodhanadhānyavān ||
śleṣmalaḥ paradārecchuścaṃdravārodbhavo naraḥ || 1 ||

(maṃgale) (-) 

dhīraḥkhalodvibhāṣī ca vīrassāhasakāryakṛt ||
kharvaḥkopī ca senāḍhyaḥ kujavārodbhavonaraḥ || 1 ||

(budhe) (-) 

gītavādyaviśeṣajño devabrāhmaṇapūjakaḥ ||
sadā tu dharmanirato budhavārodbhavonaraḥ || 1 ||

<p. 182>

(gurau) (-) 

jñānavāndhavavānkhyāto śīlavānnṛpavallabhaḥ ||
tyāgībhogībhaviṣyajjño guruvārodbhavonaraḥ || 1 ||

(śukre) (-) 

svabhāvaśleṣmaṇaḥ kāṃtaḥ kaviśca nayavidguruḥ ||
gaṃdhamālyopabhogī ca śukravārodbhvonaraḥ || 1 ||

(śanau) (-) 

piṃgadṛkpīnakarṇaśca dhanavānkṣudramārgagaḥ ||
kunakhīmaṃdakṛtyaśca śanivārodbhavonaraḥ || 1 || 7 ||

atha vārābhimānidevatā nāmāni svarūpāṇi ca (-) (śaivāgame)

rudrodurgāṣaṇmukhaśca viṣṇurbrahmāsvarāḍyamaḥ ||
divākarādivārāṇāmadhi devāḥ prakīrtitāḥ || 1 ||

(286) tatrādau ravivārābhimāniśivasyasvarūapam (-)

vṛṣārūḍhaṃśūlapāṇiṃ pramadāparisevitam ||
śirasāpraṇamāmyadyaravivārādhipaṃ śivam || 1 || 

śubhravarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(287) atha somavārābhimānidurgāyāḥsvarūpam (-)

durgāṃvipattidhutaye bhujāṣṭakavibhūṣitām ||
dhyāyāmidaityahaṃtriṃtāṃ raktāsvādanatatparām || 1 || 

meghavarṇā || 1 ||

(288) atha maṃgalavārābhimāniṣaṇmukhasyasvarūpam (-)

śaktyujjvalaikabāhuṃśaśadharamakuṭaṃ mayūramārūḍham ||
aṃgārakādhināthaṃ ṣaṇmukhamīḍemareṃdrasenānyam || 1 || 

raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(289) atha budhavārābhimāniviṣṇudevatāyāḥsvarūpam (-)

bhāsvatkirīṭaṃdaracakraśārṅgagadābhirāmaissahitaṃ caturbhiḥ ||
karairanaṃtāsanasanniviṣṭaṃ dhyāyedrameśaṃbudhavāranātham || 1 || 

nīlavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(290) atha guruvārābhimānicaturmukhasyasvarūpam (-)

caturmukhaścaturbāhuḥkamaṃḍalvakṣasūtradhṛt ||
varābhayakaraḥśuddho guruvārādhipomataḥ || 1 || 

padmavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 183>

(291) atha śukravārābhimānīṃdrasyasvarūpam (-)

iṃdraṃgajavarārūḍhaṃ vajrāṃkuśavarābhayān ||
karaiścaturbhirdadhataṃ śukrādhīśvaramāśraye || 1 || 

pītavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(292) atha sthiravārābhimāniyamasyasvarūpam (-)

pāśadaṃḍojjvalabhujadvayaṃ mahiṣāvāhanam ||
yamaṃnīlatanuṃbhīmaṃ śanivārābhidhaṃbhaje || 1 || 

nīlavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

atha nakṣatrābhimānidevatānāṃsvarūpāṇi (-) (śaivāgame)

tatranakṣatrāṇāṃtārāsaṃkhyāsvarūpapūjādayaḥ (-) (nakṣatracūḍāmaṇau)

tatranakṣatrādhipānāṃnāmāni (-) (jyotiṣaratnākare nāradīye)

nakṣatreśāḥ kramāddasrayamavahnipitāvahāḥ ||
caṃdreśāditijīvāhipitaraścāryāmābhagaḥ || 1 ||

savitṛtvaṣṭṛmaruta iṃdrāgnīmitravāsavau ||
yātudhānoṃbuviśve ca viṣṇuśca vasutoyapau || 2 ||

ajaikapādahirbudhnyapūṣaṇaścetikīrtitāḥ || 27 ||

(293) atha aśvinīnakṣatrasya (-)

aśvinaudevateśvetavarṇautau dvibhujaustumaḥ ||
sudhāsaṃpūrṇakalaśakarābjāvaśvavāhanau || 1 || 

śvetavarṇau || aśvinaudevate || (-) || nakṣatracūḍāmaṇau)  

hastyaśvabaṃdharathayānapurapratiṣṭhābhaiṣajyamaṃtragṛhaharmyasurapratiṣṭhāḥ ||
yātrābhiṣekamakhadīkṣaṇacaulamauṃjīḥkurvaṃtiśāṃtikavidhānamathāśvinīṣu || 1 ||

turagamukhā'śvinī trīṇī (-) cūcecolā aśvinī (-) kṛṣṇavarṇaḥ | tritārā | aśvamukhākṛtiḥ | paṭṭaṇaṃsthānam | pumān | devagaṇaḥ | tiryaṅmukham | maṃdalocanam | kṣipraṃbāhyam | viṣamuṣṭivṛkṣaḥ || bheruṃḍapakṣī | vaiśyajātiḥ | catuṣpāt | aśvayoniḥ | aśvinaudevate | akārākṣarassvaraḥ | asminnaśvatthāmājātaḥ | paṃcāśadghaṭikābhyaḥ paraṃviṣanāḍyaścatasraḥ | māṣapiṣṭaṃbhakṣayitvāpūrvottaraprayāṇeśubham | jvarenavadinānyariṣṭāni || (-) || tacchāṃtyai aśvinīdevatāpūjāvidhānam | śvetavastram | malayajagaṃdhaḥ |

<p. 184>

utpalapuṣpam | gugguladhūpaḥ | kṣīrānnanaivedyam | devasyatvetimaṃtreṇaṣoḍaśopacāraissaṃpūjyakṣīrasamidājyairgāyatryā aṣṭottaraśataṃjuhuyāt || gaṃdhapuṣpamāṣānnaṃ guḍasahitamuttarasyāṃ diśibaliṃ haret | navāhātsūkhībhavati || (-) || asminnakṣatreprathamarajasvalāputravatībhavatī || (-) || asminnakṣatrebījāvāpanāśvagrahaṇavastrālaṃkaraṇakarṇavedhacaulopanayana(-)bhaiṣajyayuddhādīnipraśastāni || (-) || asminnakṣatrejātaguṇāḥ dīrghāyuḥ | sthulaśarīraḥ || sukṣmanakhaḥ | viśālākṣaḥ | subhagaḥ | surūpaḥ | rājapūjyaḥ | dīrghāsyaḥ | sutīkṣṇamānasaḥ | bhuṣaṇapriyaḥ | durjanasakhaḥ | sāhasī | capalaḥ | lubdhaḥ | bhogyāṃśaḥ | sthirāraṃbhaḥ | kaṭipradeśematsyāṃkitaḥ | alasaguṇaḥ | ṣaḍaśītivarṣāṇiparamāyurityādikaṃ sarvametadgraṃthedraṣṭavyam || 1 || atra pra(0) yathāpustakaṃlikhitā viṣayāḥ )

(294) atha bharaṇīnakṣatrasya (-)

pāśadaṃḍojjvalabhujadvayaṃmahiṣavāhanam ||
yamaṃnīlaṃbhajebhīmaṃsuvarṇapratimāgatam || 1 ||

nīlavarṇaḥ || yamadevatā || (-) || nakṣatracūḍāmaṇau) 

yuddhabhighātavadhabaṃdhaviṣāgniśastrabhedāvṛtādibhayasāhasacauryakarma ||
dyutābhicāravidhimaṃtrabilapraveśakanyājanāni yamabhe kilayāṃtisiddhim || 1 ||

yonirbharaṇī trīṇi | līlūlelobharaṇī | śvetavarṇaḥ | tritārā | trikoṇākṛtiḥ | vaiśyajātiḥ | strī | manuṣyagaṇaḥ | adhomukhī | maṃdalocanam || sthānaṃgrāmaḥ | ugraḥ | catuṣpāt | agnimaṃḍalam | āmalakavṛkṣaḥ | pakṣīkākaḥ | gajayoniḥ | yamodevatā | yakāra ukārokṣarassvaraḥ | asminduryodhanojātaḥ | caturviṃśatighaṭikābhyaḥ paraṃviṣanāḍyaścatasraḥ | yātrāvarjyā | athavāsaptaghaṭikābhyaḥ paraṃtilataṃḍulabhakṣaṇaṃ kṛtvāpūrvottaraprayāṇeśubham || jvareprāṇabhayam | aṃtyapādemṛtyuḥ | tṛtīyapādedinadvayam | athavā ekādaśadinānyariṣṭāni || (-) || tacchāṃtyaiyamadevatāpūjāvidhānam || nīlavastram | raktakaravīrapuṣpam | kṛṣṇāgarugaṃdhaḥ | mahiṣākṣīdhūpaḥ | guḍānnanaivedyam | yamāyasomamitimaṃtreṇaṣoḍaśopacāraiḥsaṃpūjyatilājyena gāyatryā aṣṭottaraśataṃjuhuyāt |

<p. 185>

gaṃdhamālyairguḍatilamiśrānnaṃyāmyadiśibaliṃhareduttarevā |
ekādaśāhātsukhībhavatī || (-) || asminnakṣatreprathamarajasvalāvidhavābhavati || (-) || asminnakṣatre ugrakāryāṇipraśastāni || (-) || asminnakṣatrejātaguṇāḥ (-) capalaḥ | bahusutaḥ | śāstrajñaḥ | sumukhaḥ | sukhī | dīrghāyuḥ | satyavādī | subhojanaḥ | strīpriyaḥ | tīvranidraḥ | raktākṣaḥ | raktakeśaḥ | bhogaśarīravān | nābhipradeśetilamatsyāṃkitaḥ | ṣaḍaśītivarṣāṇiparamāyurityādikaṃsarvametadgraṃthedraṣṭavyam || 1 ||

(295) atha kṛttikānakṣatrasya (-)

kṛtīkādevatāmagniṃ meṣavāhanasaṃsthitam ||
sruksruvābhītivaradhṛkcaturhastaṃ namāmyaham || 1 || 

raktavarṇaḥ | agnirdevatā || (-) || nakṣatracūḍānaṇau) 

ādhānahomamakhadīkṣaṇavahnipūjādāyānidhātu vihitābharaṇādikarma ||
maṃtrauṣadhīrasarasāyanasādhakāni sidhyaṃtivahni vihitāni hutāśanarkṣe || 1 ||

kṣuraṃkṛttikā ṣaṭ | ā ī ū e kṛttikā || raktavarṇam || ṣaṭtārāḥ | kṣurākṛtiḥ | strī | rākṣasagaṇaḥ | ajayoniḥ | brāhmaṇajātiḥ | tripāt | agnirdevatā | adhomuhī | sulocanam | sādhāraṇam | samatārā | aṃtam | sthānaṃ  śūnyam | agnimaṃḍalam | auduṃbaravṛkṣaḥ | pakṣīmayūraḥ | ikāra ukārokṣarassvaraḥ | triṃśadghaṭikābhyaḥ paraṃviṣanāḍyaścatasraḥ | yātrāvarjyā | ekonaviṃśatighaṭikānaṃtaraṃ dadhibhuktvāpūrvottaraprayāṇe śubham | jvareprāṇabhayam | athavānavadinānyariṣṭāni || (-) || tacchāntyai agnidevatāpūjāvidhānam | raktavastram | raktagaṃdhaḥ | raktakaravīrapuṣpam | dhṛtagugguladhūpaḥ | ghṛtaudananaivedyam | agnināgnissamidhyate | agnayesamidhamahārṣaṃ itimaṃtreṇaṣoḍaśopacāraissaṃpūjyaghṛtamadhunāgāyatryā aṣṭottaraśataṃjuhuyāt || (-) || asminkrūrakāryāṇipraśastāni | navāhātsukhī bhavati || (-) || asminnakṣatreprathamarajasvalādaridrābhavati || (-) || asminnakṣatrejātaguṇāḥ | tejasvī matimān | vikhyātaḥ | bahvaśanaḥ | pramadāpriyaḥ | pratāpi | bhujārjitadhanaḥ | duḥkhabhājī |

<p. 186>

sitakeśaḥ | gaṃbhīraśarīraḥ | vāmabhāgematsyāṃkitaḥ | aśītivarṣāṇiparamāyurityādikaṃ sarvametadgraṃthe draṣṭavyam || 1 ||

(296) atha rohiṇīnakṣatrasya (-)

prajāpatiścaturbāhuḥ kamaṃḍalvakṣasūtradhṛt || 
varābhayakaraḥ śuddhorohiṇīdevatāstume || 1 || 

pāṭalavarṇaḥ | brahmādevatā || (-) || nakṣatracūḍāmaṇau) 

rājābhiṣekagṛhaharmyapurapraveśahomādiśāṃtikavivāhavidhiṃ ca kuryāt ||
śālīkṣuvṛkṣavratabaṃdhanavāhanāninavyāṃbarābharāṇabhūṣaṇamabjajarkṣe || 1 ||

rohiṇīśakaṭākāraṃ paṃca | ū vā vī vū rohiṇī | kṛṣṇavarṇam | paṃcatārāḥ | śakaṭākṛtiḥ | pumān | manuṣyagaṇaḥ | bhujaṃgayoniḥ | brahmādevatā | śūdrajātiḥ | catuṣpāt | ūrdhvamukham | aṃdhalocanam | sthiram | madhyatārā | pattanasthānam | iṃdramaṃḍalam | jaṃbūvṛkṣaḥ | kukkuṭapakṣī | ukāra ṛkārāvakṣarau | asmin kṛṣṇabhīmau jātau | catvāriṃśadghaṭikābhyaḥ paraṃviṣanāḍyaścatasraḥ | ghṛtamiśraparamānnaṃbhuktvāpūrvottaraprayāṇe śubham | jvaresaptadinānyariṣṭāni || (-) || tacchāṃtyaibrahmadevatāpūjāvidhānam || kṛṣṇavastram | kastūrīgaṃdhaḥ || kahlārapuṣpam | gugguladhūpaḥ | kṣīrānnanaivedyam | namobrahmaṇe itimantreṇaṣoḍaśopacāraissaṃpūjyasarpirmiśrasaptadhānyairgāyatryā aṣṭottaraśataṃjuhuyāt | gaṃdhamālyaiḥ kṣīrodanaṃ prāgdiśibaliṃ haret || (-) || asminnakṣatreprathamarajasvalāpati priyāputravatī bhavati || (-) || asminnakṣatre ṛtusīmaṃtapuṃsavanacaulopanayanavedaśāstrābhyāsasamāvartanavivāha(-)tailābhyaṃgana vā bharaṇarājābhiṣekasiṃhāsanāṃ dolanārohaṇanavavāstu puragrāmasvīkaraṇapraveśagṛhapraveśadevatāpratisṭhākrayavikrayayajñādhyayana(-)homaśāṃtikapauṣṭikadhanadhānyataṭākādi śubhakāryāṇi praśastāti || (-) || asminnakṣatrejātaguṇāḥ (-) surūpaḥ || suratapriyaḥ | samarthaḥ | nipuṇaḥ | dhānyāḍhyaḥ | nānāvastrapriyaḥ | netrarogī kiṃciddīnaḥ | pīnasarogī | svalpapādapāṇiskaṃdhalalāṭaḥ | svamātulāriḥ | aṣṭāśītivarṣāṇiparamāyurityādikametadgraṃthe draṣṭavyam || 1 ||

<p. 187>

(297) atha mṛgaśīrṣanakṣatrasya (-)

śvetavarṇākṛtissomodvibhujovaradaṃḍabhṛt ||
daśāśvarathamārūḍho mṛgaśīrṣostumemude || 1 || 

śvetavarṇaḥ || somodevatā || (-) || nakṣatracūḍāmaṇau) 

māṃgalyavratahomadānatapasāṃ yajñasya vai sādhanaṃkṛṣyāraṃbhavaṇikpraveśagamanaṃ kṣauraṃpriyāsaṃgamam ||
śāṃtisnānanṛpābhiṣekaniyamāndevāgnipitrarcanaṃ kuryācchāṃtikapauṣṭikādi śubhadaṃ caṃdrarkṣabhe saṃyute || 1 || (-) || śiromṛgaśirāstrīṇi | ve vo kā kī mṛgaśirāḥ | śvetavarṇam | tritārā | mṛgaśīrṣākṛtiḥ || napuṃsakam | devagaṇaḥ | tiryaṅmukham | sarpiṇīyoniḥ | somodevatā | upajīvajātiḥ | dvipāt | maṃdalocanam | mṛduḥ | samatārā | sthānaṃpuram | vāyumaṃḍalam | khādiravṛkṣaḥ | kukkuṭapakṣī | ṛkārākṣarassvaraḥ | nirjīvajātiḥ || asminnakṣatre puruṣamṛgojātaḥ || caturdaśaghaṭikābhyaḥ paraṃ viṣanāḍyaścatasraḥ || mṛgamāṃsabhakṣaṇaṃkṛtvāpūrvottaraprayāṇe śubham | jvareprāṇabhayam | athavāmāsamariṣṭam || (-) || tacchāṃtyaisomadevatāpūjāvidhānam | śvetavastram | śvetacaṃdanam | kuṃdapuṣpam | gugguladhūpaḥ | paramānnanaivedyam | vavonava itimaṃtreṇaṣoḍaśopacāraissaṃpūjyakṣīramiśraghṛtenagāyatryā aṣṭottaraśataṃjuhuyāt | gaṃdhamālyaiḥ kṣīrodanaṃbaliṃharet | māsātsukhī bhavati || (-) || asminnakṣatre prathamarajasvalāputravatī bhavati || (-) || asminnakṣatrepuṃsavanajātakarmanāmakaraṇānnaprāśanacaulopanayanākṣaragrahaṇavedaśāstrābhyāsasamāvartanatailābhyaṃganavābharaṇāṃbaradhāraṇavāstūpa(-)kramagrāmapuragṛhādipraveśakṛṣibījāvāpanabhaiṣajya prabhṛtiśubhakāryāṇipraśastāni || (-) || asminnakṣatrejātaguṇāḥ (-) utsāhaśīlaḥ | pāpabhīruḥ | mātāpitṛbhaktaḥ | svataṃtraḥ | cirāyuḥ | vinayasapannaḥ | pīnavakṣāḥ | sumukhaḥ | mṛduvacanaḥ | medhāvī | adhikanaiṣṭhuryavān | vipulabhujaḥ | ekagrāhī | dharmarataḥ | caturaśītivarṣāṇiparamāyurityādikamasmingraṃthe draṣṭavyam || 1 ||

<p. 188>

(298) atha ārdrānakṣatrasya (-)

rudraśśvetovṛṣārūḍhaḥ śvetamālyaścaturbhujaḥ ||
śūlakhaḍgābhayavarānda dhānomeprasīdatu || 1 || 

śvetavarṇaḥ | rudrodevatā || (-) || nakṣatracūḍāmaṇau) 

śatrūṇāṃnidhanaṃdavāgnidahanaṃduṣṭāgryasaṃmardanaṃśastrāstragrahaṇaṃ ca cauryagamanaṃ dūtāgamoddhāṭanam ||
rakṣobhūtapiśācayakṣakagaṇādeśaṃ tathoccāṭanaṃ yaccānyadbaliraudrakarmakathitaṃ raudrārdrabhekārayet || 1 || (-) || 

ārdrāpravālamekam || kūghaṃṅaccha ārdrā | raktavarṇā | ekatārā | strī | manuṣyagaṇaḥ | śunīyoniḥ | catuṣpāt | ugram | ūrdhvamūkham | madhyalocanam | kṣatriyajātiḥ | sthānaṃ śūnyam | varuṇamaṃḍalam | rudrodevatā | raktakhadiravṛkṣaḥ | pakṣīkrauṃcaḥ | ekārākṣaraḥsvaraḥ | ekaviṃśatighaṭikābhyaḥ paraṃviṣanāḍyaścatasraḥ | yātrāvarjyā | athavā caturdaśaghaṭikānaṃtaraṃmṛgaraktaṃpītvāpūrvottaradiggamaneśubham | jvareprāṇabhayam | athavā māsamariṣṭam || (-) || tacchāṃtyairudrapūjāvidhānam | śvetavastram | śvetagaṃdhaḥ | dhuttūrapuṣpam | bilvapatram | mahiṣākṣīgugguladhūpaḥ agarudhūpovā | nānāvidhānnanaivedyam | namasterudra itimaṃtreṇanamaśśaṃbhava itimaṃtreṇa vā ṣoṣdśopacāraissaṃpūjyagāyatryātilairaṣṭottaraśataṃjuhuyāt | gaṃdhamālyaiḥkṣīrodanabaliṃharet | śvetadhenuṃdadyāt | māsātsukhībhavati || (-) || asminnakṣatreprathamarajasvalāduḥkhitābhavati || (-) || asminnakṣatreśastrapraharaṇāgniprayogākṣaragrahaṇaśastrābhyāsacauragamana(-)bhūtoccāṭanamaṃtrayaṃtraprayogaśaivadevatāpratiṣṭhābhūtāveśaśrāddhādi(-)krūrakāryāṇipraśastāni || (-) || asminnakṣatrejātagūṇāḥ ācāraparaḥ | krayavikrayanipuṇaḥ | śūraḥ | kaliḥ | hiṃsakaḥ | kṛtaghnaḥ | alpaśatruḥ | sthirāyuḥ | saptāśīti  varṣāṇiparamāyurityādikaṃsarvametadgraṃthedraṣṭavyam || 1 ||

(299) atha punarvasūnakṣatrasya (-)

aditiḥpītavarṇācasruksruvākṣakamaṃḍalūn ||
dadhānāśubhadāmesyātpunarvasukṛtāhvayā || 1 || 

pītavarṇaḥ | aditirdevatā || (-) || nakṣatracūḍāmaṇau || (-) ||

sīmaṃtapuṃsavanapauṣṭikacaulamauṃjīvedavratānivividhādhyayanaṃpraśastam |
āṃdolikādivaravāhanaśastraśayyālaṃkāramapyaditibhevidadhītanūnam || 1 ||

punarvasūtaṭākaṃpaṃca | ke ko hā hi punarvasū | kṛṣṇavarṇaḥ | paṃcatārāḥ | gṛhadaṃḍākṛtiḥ | pumān | devagaṇaḥ | mārjālīyoniḥ | aditirdevatā | vaiśyajātiḥ | tripāt | tiryaṅmukham | sulocanam | caraṃ sthānam | pattanam | vāyumaṃḍalam | veṇuvṛkṣaḥ | pakṣīhaṃsaḥ | ṅakārākṣarassvaraḥ || asminsurabhirjātā | viṃśatighaṭikābhyaḥparaṃviṣanāḍyaścatasraḥ | payaḥ pītvāpūrvottaraprayāṇeśubham || jvaresaptadinānyariṣṭāni || (-) || tacchāṃtyai aditipūjāvidhānam | pītavastram | kuṃkumagaṃdhaḥ | kumudapuṣpaṃ mallikāpuṣpaṃvā | malayajadhūpaḥ | guḍānnanaivedyam | aditirdyauritimaṃtreṇa ṣoḍaśopacāriassaṃpūjya ājyatilataṃḍulairgāyatryā aṣṭottaraśataṃ juhuyāt | gaṃdhamālyairguḍaudanabaliṃharet | saptāhātsukhībhavati || (-) || asminnakṣatre prathamarajasvalābahujanacittābhavati || (-) || asminnakṣatre ṛtupuṃsavanasīmaṃtanāmakaraṇānnaprāśanakarṇavedhacaulopanayanākṣara(-)grahaṇavedaśāstrābhyāsacitra vastrābharaṇadhāraṇarājābhiṣekasiṃhāsanāṃdolikārohaṇaśayyālaṃkāranavavā stūpakramapuragrāmaguhāpraveśayātrābhaiṣajyādiśubhakāryāṇipraśastāni || (-) || asminnakṣatrejātaguṇāḥ (-) dīrghāyuḥ | pramadāpriyaḥ | surūpaḥ | vibhavakāmaḥ | durmatiḥ | unnataḥ | hīnasvaraḥ | māṃsapriyaḥ | buddhimān | udarematsyāṃkitaḥ | ṣaṇṇavativarṣāṇiparamāyurityādikametadgraṃthedraṣṭavyam || 1 ||

(300) atha puṣyanakṣatrasya (-)

vaṃdebṛhaspatiṃpuṣyadevatāṃ mānuṣākṛtim ||
sarvābharaṇasaṃpannaṃ devamaṃtriṇamādarāt || 1 ||

pītavarṇaḥ | bṛhaspatirdevatā || (-) || nakṣatracūḍāmaṇau) 

vedābhyāsasuśāstrasaṃgrahavidhiśśastrāstraśikṣāpaṇaṃmaṃtrārādhana(-)devatārcanabhiṣakkāryaṃ nṛpālokanam | kuryācchāṃtikapauṣṭikāninṛpateryātrābhiṣekaṃtathāpuṣyarkṣevaracitravastra(-)nicayālaṃkārasaṃdhāraṇam || 1 || 

puṣyaṃ saralaṃtrīṇi |

<p. 190>

hū he ho ḍā puṣyam | śvetavarṇaḥ | tritārā | śarākṛtiḥ | pumān | devagaṇaḥ | ajāyoniḥ | bṛhaspatirdevatā | kṣatriyajātiḥ | catuṣpāt | ūdhvamukham | aṃdhalocanam | kṣipram | bāhyam | samatārā | sthānaṃgrāmaḥ | agnimaṃḍalam | aśvatthavṛkṣaḥ | pakṣījalakākaḥ | akārākṣarassvaraḥ || asminnṛkṣepaṃkajaśukraujātau || viṃśatighaṭikābhyaḥ paraṃviṣanāḍyaścatasraḥ | paramānnabhojanaṃkṛtvāsarvadikṣuprayāṇeśubham || jvaresaptadinānyariṣṭāni || (-) || tacchāṃtyaivṛhaspatipūjāvidhānam | pītavastram | kuṃkumagaṃdhaḥ | saroruhapuṣpam | agarudhūpaḥ || khaṃḍamaṃḍalānnanaivedyam | bṛhaspate atiyadaryo arhā itimaṃtreṇaṣoḍaśopacāraissaṃpūjyaparamānnenagāyatryā aṣṭottaraśataṃjuhuyāt | gaṃdhamālyaiḥkṣīrodanabaliṃharet | saptāhātsukhībhavatī || (-) || asminnakṣatreprathamarajasvalāpativratāputriṇībhavati || (-) || asminnakṣatre ṛtupuṃsavanasīmaṃtanāmakaraṇānnaprāśanakarṇavedhakṣauracaulopanayana(-)vedaśāstrābhyāsayaṃtramaṃtropadeśatailābhyaṃganavavastrābharaṇadhāraṇa(-)rājābhiṣekasiṃhāsanacaturaṃgabalāṃdolikāgajāśvaśikṣārohaṇavāstūpakrama(-)puragṛhagrāmādipraveśayajñaraṃgagurūpadeśamahotsavavādyanṛttābhyāsa(-)śāṃtikapauṣṭikabhṛtyaparigrahapaśukrayavikrayakṛṣiprayogabījāvāpanataṃtra(-)bhaiṣajyānipraśastāni || (-) || asminnakṣatrejātaguṇāḥ (-) sarvajñaḥ | dhīmān | kṣiprakrodhaḥ | jyautiṣajñānaśīlaḥ | pradhānaḥ | dhairyavān | baṃdhuvargopakārī | madhurabhāṣī | maṃtrajñaḥ | abhimānī | dīrghāyuḥ | sūkṣmavācakaḥ | ekāṃtapriyaḥ | hastapādayormatsyāṃkitaḥ | navativarṣāṇiparamāyurityādikaṃsarvametadgraṃthedraṣṭavyam || 1 ||

(301) atha āśleṣānakṣatrasya (-)

sarporaktastriṇetraśca phalakāsikaradvayaḥ ||
āśleṣādevatāpītāṃbaradhṛgvaradostume || 1 ||

raktavarṇaḥ | sarpodevatā || (-) || nakṣatracūḍāmaṇau) 

maṃtraprayogamabhicāramathāgnidāhavyāyāmavādaśarakarmavipākapākau |
kuṃtāsiśaktiśarakārmukasaṃgrahaṃ ca kuryādviṣapraharaṇaṃ khalusārpadhiṣṇye || 1 ||

<p. 191>

āśleṣāsarpākārāśaṭ || ḍī ḍū ḍe ḍo āśleṣā | raktavarṇaḥ | ṣaṭtārāḥ | sarpākṛtiḥ | strī | rākṣasagaṇaḥ | mārjārayoniḥ | sarpodevatā | caṃḍālajātiḥ | catuṣpāt | adhomukham | maṃdalocanam | dāruṇam | bāhyam | ardhatārā | sthānaṃśūnyam | varuṇamaṃḍalam | punnāgavṛkṣaḥ | ṭiṭṭibhapakṣī || asminnakṣatredharmarājojātaḥ | dvātriṃśadghaṭikābhyaḥ paraṃviṣanāḍyaścatasraḥ | yātrāvarjyā | athavā caturdaśaghaṭikānaṃtaraṃparamānnaṃbhuktvā pūrvottaraprayāṇe śubham | jvare prāṇabhayam | athavāmāsamariṣṭam || (-) || tacchāṃtyaisarpadevatāpūjāvidhānam | madhupiṃgalavastram | kuṃkumāgarugaṃdhaḥ | agastyapuṣpam | ghṛtagugguladhūpaḥ | pāyasānnanaivedyam | namostusarpebhya itimaṃtreṇaṣoḍaśopacāraissaṃpūjya paramānnamiśrājyenagāyatryā aṣṭottaraśataṃjuhuyāt || gaṃdhamālyaiḥkṣīrodanabaliṃharet | raktadhenuṃdadyāt | māsātsukhībhavatī || (-) || asminnakṣatreprathamarajasvalāvidhāvāduśśīlābhavati || (-) || asminnakṣatre abhighātaviṣāgniprayogavidyāvādakārmukādiśastrābhyāsamaṃtraprayogaparadāra(-)gamanavāpikupataṭākaghaṃṭāparighādīnipraśastāni || (-) || asminnakṣatrejātaguṇāḥ (-) rājapūjyaḥ | raudraḥ | kāmukaḥ | pravāsī | śarīretilamatsyāṃkitaḥ | vipularataḥ | maṃdagatiḥ | bhogi | ṣaḍaśīti  varṣāṇiparamāyurityādikaṃsarvametadgraṃthedraṣṭavyam || 1 ||

(302) atha maghānakṣatrasya (-)

pitaraḥ piṃḍahastāśca kṛśādhūmrāḥ pavitriṇaḥ ||
kuśalaṃdadyurasmākaṃ maghānakṣatra devatāḥ || 1 ||

dhūmravarṇaḥ | pitarodevatāḥ || (-) || nakṣatracūḍāmaṇau) 

agnyādhānaṃ sarvamaṃtra prayogaṃ kuryācchrāddhaṃ tarpaṇaṃ vai pitṝṇām ||
dyūtāraṃbhaṃ karmavādaṃ bilaṃ ca pitryemadyaṃsaṃyugaṃcāpakarma || 1 ||

maghā āṃdolikāpaṃca | mā mī mū me maghā | kṛṣṇavarṇaḥ | paṃcatārāḥ | āṃdolikādaṃḍākṛtiḥ | adhomukham | pumān | strī | rākṣasagaṇaḥ | mūṣakayoniḥ | pitarodevatāḥ | śūdrajātiḥ | catuṣpāt | madhyalocanam | ugram | aṃtaḥ | samatārā | sthānaṃpattanam | agnimaṃḍalam | vaṭavṛkṣaḥ | kukkuṭapakṣī | ghasa akṣaraḥ || asminnakṣatre yamojātaḥ |

<p. 192>

triṃśadghaṭikābhyaḥparaṃviṣanāḍyaścatasraḥ | yātrāvarjyā | athavā ekādaśaghaṭikābhyaḥ paraṃdvāviṃśatighaṭikāvadhitilabhakṣaṇaṃ kṛtvādakṣiṇapaścimaprayāṇe śubham | jvarebhānuvāraprayukte prāṇabhayam | athavāviṃśatidinānyariṣṭāni || (-) || tacchāṃtyai pitṛdevatā pūjāvidhānam | kṛṣṇavastram | kṛṣṇāgarugaṃdhaḥ | caṃpakapuṣpam | ghṛtāgarugugguladhūpaḥ | ghṛtānnāpupanaivedyam | udīratāmavara itimaṃtreṇaṣoḍaśopacāraiḥ saṃpūjyatilataṃḍulamiśrānnājyenagāyatryāṣṭottaraśataṃ juhuyāt | gaṃdhamālyaistilodanabaliṃ haret | kṛṣṇadhenuṃ dadyāt | viṃśatidinātsukhī bhavati || (-) || asminnakṣatreprathamarajasvalāduḥkhitā bhavati || (-) || asminnakṣatre samāvartanavivāhasarvamaṃtrataṃtraprayogabhūbhṛttvadāsī saṃgrahakrayavikrayalāṃgalāpakarṣaṇa bījā vā padyūtanikṣepāṃjanakanyādānavādayaṃtraprayogavāpī kupataṭākaśrāddhapitṛtarpaṇādīni praśastāni || (-) || asminnakṣatre jātaguṇāḥ vidvān | vinayarataḥ | pitṛmātṛbhaktaḥ | bahuguṇavān | dīrghajīvī | dhanāḍhyaḥ | kāryanipuṇaḥ | baṃdhuvargopakārī | spaṣṭabhāṣī | ripugaṇavaśīkaraḥ | alpabuddhiḥ | kṣiprarogī | svastrīpriyaḥ | raktalocanaḥ | udarematsyāṃkitaḥ | saptanavativarṣāṇiparamāyurityādikaṃ sarvametadgraṃthe draṣṭavyam || 1 ||

(303) atha pūrvaphālgunīnakṣatrasya (-)

saṃpūjayāmyaryamaṇaṃphalgunītāradevatām |
dhūmravarṇaṃ rathārūḍhaṃ suśaktikarasaṃyutam || 1 ||

aryamādevatā | dhūmravarṇaḥ || (-) || nakṣatracūḍāmaṇau) 

purapraveśaṃ nagarābhighātaṃ viṣaprayogaṃ bhayarogaduḥkham | maṃtrauṣadhaṃgāruḍakhanyavādaṃ bhāgyākhyabhetaṃ vihitaṃ vidadhyāt || 1 || pūrvaphalgunyuttaraphalgunyau dve dve khaṭvācaukam | mo ṭā ṭī ṭū pūrvaphalgunī | śvetavarṇaḥ | dvitārā | daṃḍākṛtiḥ | strī | manuṣyagaṇaḥ | mūṣakāyoniḥ | bhagodevatā | viprajātiḥ | catuṣpāt | adhomukham | sulocanam | ugram | aṃtaḥ | samatārā | sthānaṃgrāmaḥ | agnimaṃḍalam | gṛdhrapakṣī | pālāśavṛkṣaḥ | svarākṣaraḥ |

<p. 193>

viṃśatighaṭikābhyaḥ paraṃviṣanāḍyaścatasraḥ | yātrāvarjyā | athavā aṣṭādaśaghaṭikābhyaḥ paraṃprayāṇe śubham | jvareprāṇabhayam | athavāmāsamariṣṭaṃ navadinānivā māsadvayaṃvā || (-) || tacchāṃtyai aryamadevatāpūjāvidhānam | raktavastram | raktacaṃdanagaṃdhaḥ | aryamaṇamitimaṃtreṇaraktakaravīrapuṣpaiḥ bilvadhūpaiḥ kṛsarānnanavedyaiḥ ṣoḍaśopacārapūjāṃ kṛtvā māṣānnājyena gāyatryā aṣṭottaraśataṃjuhuyāt | gaṃdhamālyaiḥpriyaṃgvaudanabaliṃ haret | māsātsukhī bhavati || (-) || asminnakṣatreprathamarajasvalāpatisutahīnā bhavati || (-) || asminnakṣatre akṣarābhyāsaśāstrābhyāsaviṣāgniprayogādi kāryāṇi praśastāni || (-) || asminnakṣatre jātaguṇāḥ rūpavān | dāṃtaḥ | lokajanapriyaḥ | gītavādyapriyaḥ | ābharaṇābhiyutaḥ | adhyayanapriyaḥ | capalaḥ | mātṛhīnaḥ | navativarṣāṇi paramāyurityādikaṃ sarvamasmingraṃthe draṣṭavyam || 1 ||

(304) atha uttarāphalgunīnakṣatrasya (-)

bhagaṃrathavarārūḍhaṃ dvibhujaṃśaṃkha cakrakam ||
phalgunī devatāṃ dhyāye bhaktābhīṣṭavarapradam || 1 ||

raktavarṇaḥ | bhagodevatā || (-) || nakṣatracūḍāmaṇau) 

vāpīkūpataṭākadīrghikapuraprāsādadevālayāḥ śayyāratnavibhūṣaṇāṃgaracanāsiṃhāsanādhyāsanam || snānodvarttanamaṃgalaṃpariṇayaṃ rājābhiṣekaṃ tathākṛṣyāraṃbhapurapraveśamakhilaṃ kartavyamāryamṇabhe || 1 || 

pūrvaphalgunyuttaraphalgunyau dvedvekhaṭvācaukam || ṭeṭopāpī uttarāphalgunī || raktavarṇaṃ || dvitārā | daṃḍākṛtiḥ | strī | manuṣyagaṇaḥ | goyoniḥ | bhagodevatā | kṣatriyajātiḥ | tripāt | urdhvamukham | aṃdhalocanam | dhruvam | aṃtaḥ | atyardhatārā | sthānaṃ śūnyam | badarīvṛkṣaḥ | pakṣīkaṃkaḥ | jarāca akṣaraḥ || asminnakṣatre bṛhaspatirjātaḥ || aṣṭādaśaghaṭikābhyaḥ paraṃ viṣanāḍyaścatasraḥ | śākamāṃsabhojanaṃ kṛtvā dakṣiṇapaścimaprayāṇe śubham || jvare saptadinānyariṣṭāni || (-) || tacchāṃtyaibhagadevatāpūjāvidhānam |

<p. 194>

kuṃkumagaṃdhaḥ | nīlotpalapuṣpam | bilvadhūpaḥ | raktaśālyodananaivedyam | bhagapraṇeta itimaṃtreṇaṣoḍaśopacāraiḥ saṃpūjyaghṛtamiśrānnenagāyatryā aṣṭottaraśataṃhutvāgaṃdhamālyaiḥ ghṛtodanabaliṃ haret | māsātsukhī bhavati || (-) || asminnakṣatre prathamarajasvalādharmiṇīputravatī bhavati || (-) || asminnakṣatrekratupuṃsavanasīmaṃtanāmakaraṇānnaprāśanakarṇavedha(-)chaulopanayanavivāhasamāvartanavastrābharaṇapaṭṭabaṃdhanasiṃhāsanāṃdoli(-)kārohaṇapuragrāmagṛhādipraveśavedābhyāsayajñabījāvāpanatoraṇālaṃkārādi(-)sthirakāryāṇipraśastāni || (-) || asminnakṣatrejātaguṇāḥ kāvyaśīlaḥ | abhimānī | dharmajñaḥ | subhagaḥ | kuśalaḥ | śreṣṭhaḥ | strīlolaḥ | rogī | kṛṣṇadehaḥ | vinayapriyaḥ | alpasaukhyavān | paṃḍitaḥ | śarīrematsyāṃkitaḥ | caturaśītivarṣāṇiparamāyurityādikaṃsarvametadgraṃthe draṣṭavyam || 1 ||

(305) atha hastanakṣatrasya (-)

savitāramahaṃvaṃde saptāśvarathavāhanam ||
padmāsanasthaṃ chāyeśaṃ hastanakṣatra devatām || 1 ||

raktavarṇaḥ | savitādevatā || (-) || nakṣatracūḍāmaṇau) 

pāṇigrahādyabalimaṃgalakarmayātrārājābhiṣekagṛhaharmyasurapratiṣṭhāḥ ||
citrādivastra varavāhanabhūṣaṇāni kṛṣyudyamādyakhilakarmakarotu vidvān || 1 ||

hastaḥpāṇyākāraṃśarāḥ | pū ṣaṃ ṇā ḍhā hastaḥ | kṛṣṇavarṇaḥ | paṃcatārā | hastākṛtiḥ | pumān | devagaṇaḥ | mahiṣayoniḥ | sūryodevatā | vaiśyajātiḥ | catuṣpāt | tiryaṅmukham | laghuḥ | maṃdalocanam | kṣipram | aṃtaḥ | sthānam | pattanam | vāyumaṃḍalam | aṃbaṣṭhavṛkṣaḥ | pakṣīśukaḥ | lā akṣaraḥ | sūryodevatā || asminnakṣatrenakulasahadevaujātau | ekaviṃśatighaṭikābhyaḥ  paraṃviṣanāḍyaścatasraḥ | taṃḍulaṃbhakṣayitvāsarvadikṣuprayāṇeśubham | jvareprāṇabhayam | athavāpaṃcadaśadinānyariṣṭāni || (-) || tacchāṃtyaisavitṛdevatāpūjāvidhānam | raktavastram | raktagaṃdhaḥ | raktakaravīrapuṣpam | daśāṃgadhūpaḥ | apūpanaivedyam |

<p. 195>

udityamitimaṃtreṇaṣoḍaśopacāraiḥ saṃpūjya arkasamidājyena gāyatryā aṣṭottaraśataṃhutvāgaṃdhamālyairmāṣānnabaliṃharet | paṃcadaśāhātsukhī bhavati || (-) || asminnakṣatre prathamarajasvalāputriṇī bhavati || (-) || asminnakṣatrekratupuṃsavanānnaprāśanakarṇavedhacaulopanayanavedaśāstrā(-)bhyāsasamāvartanavivāhatailābhyaṃgavastrābharaṇaśāṃtikapauṣṭika(-)mahotsavāṃdolikarathā'śvārohaṇapaśukrayavikrayakṛṣiprāraṃbhabījāvāpana(-)dhānyasaṃgrahanavavastradhāraṇavararatnasaṃgrahamaṃtraśāstrayātrābhaiṣajyādīnipraśastāni || (-) || asminnakṣatrejātaguṇāḥ vikhyātaḥ | pragalbhavākyaḥ | bahuśāstravibhavaḥ | dakṣaḥ | dhanāḍhyaḥ | strīlolaḥ | svadārānuvartī | parakāryahitaḥ | dvijagurupūjakaḥ | kīrtimān | śatrughnaḥ | dāracoraḥ | śarīrematsyāṃkitaḥ | aṣṭāśītivarṣāṇiparamāyurityādikamasmingraṃthe | draṣṭavyam || 1 ||

(306) atha citrānakṣatrasya (-)

tvaṣṭāraṃrathamārūḍhaṃ citrānakṣatradevatām ||
śaṃkhacakrānvitakaraṃkirīṭinamahaṃbhaje || 1 ||

raktavarṇaḥ || tvaṣṭādevatā || (-) || nakṣatracūḍāmaṇau) 

citrāṃbarābharaṇabhūṣaṇacitrakarmamuktāmaṇiśravaṇavedhanavidrumaṃ ca ||
tvaṣṭṛvratopanayanakṣurakarmakāryaṃ saṃgītanṛtyavividhodyamavādyavidyāḥ || 1 ||

citrāmauktikamekam | pe po rā rī citrā | śvetavarṇaḥ | ekatārā | mauktikākāram | pumān | rākṣasagaṇaḥ | vyāghrayoniḥ | tvaṣṭādevatā | upajīvijātiḥ | dvipāt | tiryaṅmukham | madhyalocanam | mṛduḥ | bāhyam | samatārā | sthānaṃ pattanam | vāyumaṃḍalam | bilvavṛkṣaḥ | pakṣīkākaḥ | ṭavā akṣaraḥ | viṃśatighaṭikābhyaḥ paraṃviṣanāḍyaścatasraḥ | yātrāvarjyā | athavācaturdaśaghaṭikānaṃtaraṃcitrānnabhojanaṃ kṛtvādakṣiṇapaścimaprayāṇe śubham | jvare ekādaśadinānyariṣṭāni || (-) || tacchāṃtyaitvaṣṭṛdevatāpūjāvidhānam | citravastram | kuṃkumagaṃdhaḥ | citrapuṣpam | sarjarasadhūpaḥ | modakanaivedyam | citraṃdevānāmitimaṃtreṇaṣoḍaśopacāraiḥ saṃpūjyacitrānnājyenagāyatryāṣṭottaraśataṃ hutvāgaṃdhamālyaiścitrānna baliṃharet |

<p. 196>

ekādaśāhātsukhī bahvati || (-) || asminnakṣatre prathamarajasvalāsamarthā bhavati || (-) || asminnakṣatre strī bhoganāmakaraṇānnaprāśanakarṇavedhacaulopanayanākṣaragrahaṇavedaśāstrā(-)bhyāsatailābhyaṃgacitravastranānābharaṇadhāraṇagajāśvarakṣābaṃdhanaratha(-)śikṣādinṛtyadivyagopanastrīgopanacitralekhanādi nānāvidyāraṃbhanānāvanaspatyauṣadhaprāraṃbhabhaiṣajyādi śubhakāryāṇipraśastāni || (-) || asminnakṣatrejātaguṇāḥ dhanapriyaḥ | bhogavān | kāmī | caturaśītivarṣāṇiparamāyurityādikaṃsarvametadgraṃthe draṣṭavyam || 1 ||

(307) atha svātīnakṣatrasya (-)

vāyuṃvaramṛgārūḍhaṃ svātīnakṣatradevatām ||
khaḍgacarmojjvalakaraṃdhūmravarṇaṃ namāmyaham || 1 || 

dhūmravarṇaḥ || vāyurdevatā || (-) || nakṣatracūḍāmaṇau) 

sasyodyānapurāmarālayagṛhaprāsādasaṃsthāpanaṃ lolāṃdolasūkhāsanoṣṭraturagaskaṃdhesamārohaṇam ||
vidyāraṃbhavivāhapauṣṭikavaṇikkṛṣyādyanekāgamānnānāvastra(-)vibhūṣaṇāṃgaracanāṃprāhurbudhāmārute || 1 || 

svātīmāṇikyamekam || rū re ro tā svātī | raktavarṇaḥ | ekatārā | vidrumābham | devagaṇaḥ | mahiṣīyoniḥ | vāyurdevatā | śūdrajātiḥ | catuṣpāt | caram | tiryaṅmukham | sulocanam | sthānaṃ śūnyam | vāyumaṃḍalam | arjunavṛkṣaḥ | pakṣīśyenaḥ | vakārākṣaraḥ | caturdaśaghaṭikābhyaḥparaṃviṣanāḍyaścatasraḥ | yātrāvarjyā | athavācaturdaśaghaṭikānaṃtaramāmalakapiṣṭaṃbhakṣayitvādakṣiṇapaścimaprayāṇe śubham || asminnṛsiṃhojātaḥ | jvareprāṇabhayam | athavāmāsamariṣṭam || (-) || tacchāṃtyaivāyudevatāpūjāvidhānan | kṛṣṇāgarugaṃdhaḥ | mādhavīpuṣpam | kṛṣṇāgarudhūpaḥ | dadhyodananaivedyam | tavavāyavṛtaspata itimaṃtreṇaṣoḍaśopacāraiḥ saṃpūjyalājājyenagāyatryā aṣṭottaraśataṃjuhuyāt | gaṃdhamālyairdadhyodanabaliṃharet | māsātsukhībhavati || (-) || asminnakṣatreprathamarajasvalāsanmārgāsaubhāgyavatībhavati || (-) || 

<p. 197>

asminnakṣatrestrīsaṃbhoganāmakaraṇānnaprāśanacaulopanayanākṣaragrahaṇa(-)jyotiṣādiśāstrābhyāsasamāvartanavivāhatailābhyaṃganavavastradhāraṇa(-)mauktikābharaṇanṛttagītavādyāraṃbhagajāśvāṃdolikārohaṇaprāsādādikṛṣi(-)prāraṃbhaṇabījāvāpanādiśubhakāryāṇipraśastāni || (-) || asminnakṣatrejātaguṇāḥ (-) saubhāgyavān | dāṃtaḥ | dātā | dhairyaśālī | dīrghāṃgaḥ | ruciratanuḥ | viśālākṣaḥ | vicitracaritrahṛdayaḥ | vikhyātaḥ | roṣī | dvijagurudevatāpūjārataḥ | dhanavyayakaraḥ | baṃdhujanapriyaḥ | kāvyaśīlaḥ | caturataraḥ | hāsyapriyaḥ | svataṃtraḥ | navativarṣāṇi paramāyurityādikaṃ sarvametadgraṃthe draṣṭavyam || 1 ||

(308) atha viśākhānakṣatrasya (-)

iṃdrāgnīśubhadausyātāṃ viśākhādevate śubhe ||
namāmyekarathārūḍhau varābhayakarāṃbujau || 1 ||

raktavarṇa agniḥ | svarṇavarṇa iṃdraḥ || iṃdrāgnīdevate || (-) || nakṣatracūḍāmaṇau) maṇikanakavibhūṣāyajñahomopavāsavratahutavahakāryasnehapāśādikuryāt ||
jagatimunivareṇyādhātukarmadvidaivesuragurupitṛpūjā yojayedagnibheṣu || 1 ||

viśākhākulālacakraṃpaṃca | to tū te tī viśākhā | raktavarṇaḥ | paṃcatārā | pumān | rākṣasagaṇaḥ | adhomukham | aṃdhalocanam | vyāghrayoniḥ | sādhāraṇam | gaṇa akṣaraḥ | vikatavṛkṣaḥ | pakṣīkāraṃḍavaḥ | iṃdrāgnīdevate | kṣatriyajātiḥ | tripāt | samatārā | toraṇākṛtiḥ | sthānaṃśūnyam | vahnimaṃḍalam | caturdaśaghaṭikābhyaḥ paraṃviṣanāḍyaścatasraḥ | yātrāvarjyā | jvareprāṇabhayam | athavāpaṃcadaśadinānyariṣṭāni || (-) || tacchāṃtyai iṃdrāgnidevatāpūjāvidhānam | vaktavastram | aṣṭagaṃdhaḥ | śvetapuṣpam | kālāgarudhūpaḥ  | raktāṃgāraudananaivedyam | tryaṃbakamaṃtreṇaṣoḍaśopacāraiḥ saṃpūjyaghṛtamiśrānnairgāyatryā aṣṭośataṃjuhuyāt | raktānnaṃ surayāsahabaliṃharet | sukhībhavati | asminnakṣatreprathamarajasvalāsaubhāgyavatībhavati || (-) || granthapātaḥ) asminnakṣatrejātaguṇāḥ vidvatpriyaḥ | vinayarataḥ | dīrghajīvī | dhanāḍhyaḥ | kāryanipuṇaḥ | baṃdhuvargopakārī | bahuguṇayutaḥ |

<p. 198>

spaṣṭabhāṣī | ripugaṇavaśīkārīḥ | alpabuddhiḥ | kṣiprarogī | hṛdgrāhī | svastrīpriyaḥ | raktalocanaḥ | udarematsyāṃkitaḥ | navativarṣāṇiparamāyurityādikaṃsarvametadgraṃthe draṣṭavyam || 1 ||

(309) atha anūrādhānakṣatrasya (-)

mitraṃpadmāsanārūḍhanūrādheśvaraṃ bhaje ||
śūlāṃkuśalasadbāhuyugmaṃśoṇitavarṇakam || 1 ||

raktavarṇaḥ | mitrodevatā || (-) || nakṣatracūḍāmaṇau) 

citrakriyākanakaratnaparīkṣaṇaṃ ca saṃrohaṇaṃ turagagovṛṣakuṃjarāṇām ||
cūrṇaprayoganayanāṃjanabheṣajāniyātrāvivāhaśubhapauṣṭikakarmamaitre || 1 ||

anūrādhāpuṣpākārātrīṇi | nā nī nū ne anūrādhā | śvetavarṇaḥ | tritārā | pumān | devagaṇaḥ | puṣpākṛtiḥ | mitrodevatā | śūdrajātiḥ | hariṇīyoniḥ | tiryaṅmukham | maṃdalocanam | mṛduḥ | sthānaṃpattanam | iṃdramaṃḍalam | bakulavṛkṣaḥ | pakṣīghūkaḥ | tatha akṣaraḥ || asminnaṃdanavanaṃjātam | daśaghaṭikābhyaḥ paraṃviṣanāḍyaścatasraḥ | kulitthabhakṣaṇaṃ kṛtvā sarvadikṣu prayāṇe śubham | jvare prāṇabhayam | athavāmāsamariṣṭam || (-) || tacchāṃtyaimitradevatā pūjāvidhānam || raktavastram || kuṃkumaṃgadhaḥ | sugaṃdhipuṣpam | bilvapatram | bilvadhūpaḥ | kṛsarānnanaivedyam | devasyatvetimaṃtreṇaṣoḍaśopacāraiḥ saṃpūjyaśākamūlaphalājyenagāyatyā aṣṭottaraśataṃjuhuyāt | prāgdiśigaṃdhamālyairguḍodanabaliṃharet | māsātsukhībhavati || (-) || asminnakṣatre prathamarajasvalādhanasuputravatī bhavati || asminnakṣatre ṛtupuṃsavanasīmaṃtanāmakaraṇānnaprāśanakarṇavedhacaulopanayanavedaśāstrā(-)bhyāsasamāvartanavivāhatailābhyaṃganavavastradhāraṇanavaratnābharaṇa(-)rājābhiṣekarathāṃdolikārohaṇagṛhāraṃbhaśaṃkusthāpanapuragrāmādi(-)gṛhapraveśanṛttagītaveṇuvādyādiprāraṃbhaśilpaśāstrābhyāsanavaratnapaśu saṃgrahakrayavikrayakṛṣiprayogabījāvāpanaśrāddhabhaiṣajyādikāryāṇi praśastāni || (-) || asminnakṣatrejātaguṇāḥ (-) dayāparaḥ | prājñaḥ | kṣudhāturaḥ |

<p. 199>

śubhadaḥ | sanmārgavān | bhogī | nṛpajanavaradaḥ | prasādī | alpasūtaḥ śāṃtaḥ | annadātā | khyātimān | rājapūjyaḥ | yuvatijanavaśagaḥ | anyadeśasthaḥ | navativarṣāṇiparamāyurityādikaṃsarvametadgraṃthedraṣṭavyam ||

(310) atha jyeṣṭhānakṣatrasya (-)

śvetahastinamārūḍhaṃ vajrāṃkuśalasatkaram |
sahasranetraṃ pītābhamiṃdraṃhṛdivibhāvaye || 1 || 

pītavarṇaḥ || iṃdrodevatā || (-) ||

(nakṣatracūḍāmaṇau) (-)

arinagaravikhātaṃ bhedanaṃcohakāryaṃ dhanurasimusalādīnśilpakaṃ homakāryam ||
kapaṭakuṭilavidyācoradaṃḍābhicāradraviṇahariṇamaiṃdraproktamanyacca kāryam || 1 ||

jyeṣṭhākuṃḍalākāraṃ trīṇi | noyāyīyūjyeṣṭhā | śvetavarṇam | tritārā | kuṃḍalākṛtiḥ | strī | rākṣasagaṇaḥ | hariṇayoniḥ | iṃdrodevatā | upajīvijātiḥ | catuṣpāt | tiryaṅmukham | madhyalocanam | tīkṣṇam | sthānaṃśūnyam | iṃdramaṃḍalam | śālmalīvṛkṣaḥ | cātakapakṣī | ya tha akṣarau | caturdaśaghaṭikābhyaḥ paraṃviṣanāḍyaścatasraḥ | yātrāvarjyā | athavā dadhyodanatilabhakṣaṇaṃkṛtvādakṣiṇapaścimaprayāṇe śubham | jvare prāṇabhayam | athavāmāsamariṣṭam || (-) || tacchāṃtyai iṃdradevatāpūjāvidhānam | pītavastram | śrīgaṃdhaḥ | pāṭalapuṣpam | karpūrāgarudhūpaḥ | citrodananaivedyam | iṃdraṃvoviśvatasparītimaṃtreṇaṣoḍaśopacāraiḥ saṃpūjyacitrānnājyenagāyatryā aṣṭottaraśataṃ hutvāgaṃdhamālyaiścitrodanabaliṃ haret | māsātsukhībhavati || (-) || asminnakṣatreprathamarajasvalādaridrābhavati | bahuputriṇī ca bhūyāt || (-) || asminnakṣatre śauryakarmaviṣāgniprayogābhicārayaṃtramaṃtrārādhanayuddhadyutavyavahāra(-)cauryayātrāprayogamokṣastaṃbhanādiprayogaśāstrābhyāsabhūtapretoccāṭanavidyāvādastrīparadravyāpaharaṇapaśukrayavikrayādini praśastāni || (-) || asminnakṣatre jātaguṇāḥ (-) śyāmaḥ | dṛḍhakaragrahaḥ | vidyārataḥ | bahusutamitravān | saṃtuṣṭaḥ | satyavādī | strīlolaḥ | kliṣṭaḥ | ripugaṇavān | kṣiprakopaḥ |

<p. 200>

madhyajīvī | dhanavān | mṛdubhāṣī | rājapūjyaḥ | dvijagurupūjakaḥ | śarīretilamatsyāṃkitaḥ | svabhāryārataḥ | paṃcanavativarṣāṇiparamāyurityādikaṃ sarvametadgraṃthedraṣṭavyam || 1 ||

(311) atha mūlānakṣatrasya (-)

khaḍgakheṭadharaṃkṛṣṇaṃ yātudhānaṃ nṛvāhanam ||
ūrdhvakeśaṃ virūpākṣaṃ bhajemūlādhidevatām || 1 || 

kṛṣṇavarṇaḥ | yātudhānodevatā || (-) ||

(nakṣatracūḍāmaṇau) (-)

saṃropaṇaṃvividhagulmalatātarūṇāṃ mudgekṣumāṣatilasarṣapavāhanaṃ ca ||
maṃtrauṣadhāstranikhilāgamataṃtravidyāprāraṃbhaṇaṃ varavadhūvaraṇaṃ ca mūle || 1 ||

mūlāṃkuśaṃ ṣaṭ | ye yo bā bī (bhā bhī) mūlam | kṛṣṇavarṇaḥ | ṣaṭtārā | aṃkuśākṛtiḥ | siṃhātmavān | napuṃsakam | rākṣasagaṇaḥ | śukayoniḥ | nir(-)ṛtirdevatā | dāruṇam | adhomukham | sulocanam | aṃtaḥ | samam | sthānam | pattanam varuṇamaṃḍalam | sarjavṛkṣaḥ | pakṣīcakravākaḥ | paphau akṣarau || asminnakṣatrehanūmāñjātaḥ | viṃśatighaṭikābhyaḥ paraṃviṣanāḍyaścatasraḥ | kaṃdamūlaṃbhuktvāpaścimadakṣiṇaprayāṇe śubham | jvareprāṇabhayam | athavānavadivānyariṣṭāni || (-) || tacchāṃtyai yātudhāna devatāpūjāvidhānam | kṛṣṇavastram | kṛṣṇāgarugaṃdhaḥ | kṛṣṇasarojapuṣpam | meṣaśṛṃgadhūpaḥ | raktarasānnanaivedyam | moṣuṇaḥ parā itimaṃtreṇaṣoḍaśopacāraiḥ saṃpūjyakaṃdamūlaphalājyenagāyatryā aṣṭottaraśataṃjuhuyāt | gaṃdhamālyairguḍodanabaliṃharet | kṛṣṇadhenuṃdadyāt | navāhātsukhībhavati || (-) || asminnakṣatreprathamarajasvālāputravatībhavati || (-) || asminnakṣatre ṛtupuṃsavanajātakarmasīmaṃtanāmakaraṇānnaprāśanavidyāraṃbhasamāvartana(-)vivāhatailābhyaṃjanasuvarṇābharaṇayajñavṛkṣaprāraṃbhakṣaurakarma(-)bhaiṣajyakṛṣiprayogabījāvāpakramukanālikeranāgavallīsthāpana vāṇijyataṭākādibilapraveśabhūtoccāṭanamaṃtraprayogayaṃtroddhārādini(-)praśastāni || (-) || asminnakṣatrejātaguṇāḥ dharmajñaḥ | dhanāḍhyaḥ | taskaraḥ | mānyaḥ | baṃdhurataḥ | raktavaṇaḥ | kāmī |

<p. 201>

atirogī | caṃcalaḥ | śaṭhakāryaḥ | vinayaparaḥ | svataṃtraḥ | dvinavativarṣāṇiparamāyurityādikaṃ sarvametadgraṃthe draṣṭavyam || 1 ||

(312) atha pūrvāṣāḍhānakṣatrasya (-)

āṣāḍhadevatānityamāpaḥsaṃtuśubhāvahāḥ ||
samudragāstaraṃgiṇyo hlādinyaḥ sarvadehinām || 1 || 

śubhravarṇāḥ | āpodevatāḥ || (-) ||

(nakṣatracūḍāmaṇau) (-)

taṭākavāpīhradakūpadīrghikāpravālamuktāmaṇiratnasaṃgraham ||
grahārgalodghaṭṭanaśastrataikṣṇyaṃsamāhuraṃbhobhavaneniśākare || 1 ||

bu dha bha ḍha pūrvāṣāḍhā | śvetavaṛṇaḥ || catustārā | ardhacaṃdrākṛtiḥ || strī || vānarayoniḥ | āpodevatāḥ | viprajātiḥ | adhomukham | catuṣpāt | ugram | aṃtarikṣam | ardhatārā | vāyumaṃḍalam | sthānaṃśūnyam | jaṃbūvṛkṣaḥ | pakṣīśukaḥ | babha akṣarau | asminnakṣatrepuṣpadaṃtojātaḥ || caturviṃśatighaṭikābhyaḥparaṃviṣanāḍyaścatasraḥ | yātrāvarjyā | athavāṣoḍaśaghaṭikābhyaḥ paraṃjalaṃpītvā dakṣiṇapaścimaprayāṇe śubham | jvareprāṇabhayam | athavāmāsamariṣṭam || (-) || tacchāṃtyai abdevatāpūjāvidhānam | śvetavastram | śvetakaravīrapuṣpam | manaśśilādhūpaḥ | kṣīrānnanaivedyam | yatkiṃcadamitimaṃtreṇa imaṃmevaruṇetimaṃtreṇavāṣoḍaśopacāraissaṃpūjya raktaśālitaṃḍulājyenagāyatryā aṣṭottaraśataṃjuhuyāt | gaṃdhamālyaiḥ kṣīraudanaṃkṛsarānnaṃvābaliṃharet | māsātsukhībhavatī || (-) || asminnakṣatreprathamarajasvalāpatihīnāduścarītā bhavatī || (-) || asminnakṣatregaṇikāraṃbhasaṃgrahekṣusthāpanākṣaragrahaṇaśravaṇavedhaśatru(-)cchedanaśrāddhādikāryāṇipraśastāni || (-) || asminnakṣatrejātaguṇāḥ kiṃciddīrghadehaḥ | sūkṣmāṃguliḥ | vinayarataḥ | bhūpamānyaḥ | grāhī | khyātaḥ | nirjitadhanaḥ | āsaktaḥ | hāsyapriyaḥ | navativarṣāṇiparamāyurityādikaṃ sarvamasmingraṃthedraṣṭavyam || 1 ||

(313) atha uttarāṣāḍhānakṣatrasya (-)

viśvāndevānahaṃvaṃde'ṣāḍhānakṣatradevatām |
śrīpuṣṭikīrtidhīdātrīṃsarvapāpāpanuttaye || 1 || 

<p. 202)

śubhravarṇaḥ | viśvedevādevatāḥ || (-) || nakṣatracūḍāmaṇau) (-)

kuryādāyatanaṃśubhaṃ sthiragṛhaṃ gīrvāṇasaṃsthāpanaṃ devādyarcanaśāṃtikotsavavidhiṃbhūpābhiṣekaṃ tathā ||
staṃbhasthāpanabījavāpanalatāgulmādisaṃropaṇaṃsīmāsādhanavastrabhūṣaṇa(-)śubhodvāhādikaṃ viśvabhe || 1 ||

uttarāṣāḍhāgajaśiroṣṭakam || be bo jā jī uttarāṣāḍhā | raktavarṇaḥ | aṣṭatārā | gajaśira ākṛtiḥ | strī | manuṣyagaṇaḥ | goṣaṃḍayoniḥ | viśvedevādevatāḥ | tripāt | ūrdhvamukham | maṃdalocanam | panasavṛkṣaḥ | pakṣībhāradvājaḥ | sthiram | sthānaṃśūnyam | iṃdramaṃḍalam | makārākṣaraḥ || asminśalyojātaḥ | viṃśatighaṭikābhyaḥ paraṃviṣanāḍyaścatasraḥ | saktubhakṣaṇaṃkṛtvāpaścimadakṣiṇaprayāṇeśubham | jvareprāṇabhayam | athavāmāsamariṣṭam || (-) || tacchāṃtyaiviśvedevapūjāvidhānam | śvetavastram | śrīgaṃdhaḥ | paṃcavarṇapuṣpam | uśīradhūpaḥ | paṃcabhakṣyanaivedyam | viśvedevāsa āgata itimaṃtreṇaṣoḍaśopacāraissaṃpūjya mudgānnājyenagāyatryā aṣṭottaraśataṃjuhuyāt | gaṃdhamālyaiḥ kṣīrodanabaliṃharet | māsātsukhībhavati | śvetadhenuṃdadyāt || (-) || asminnakṣatreprathamarajasvalāpativratāputravatībhavati || (-) || asminnakṣatre ṛtupuṃsavanasīmaṃtanāmakaraṇānnaprāśanakarṇavedhacaulopanayanavedaśāstrā(-)bhyāsasamāvartanavivāhatailābhyaṃgarājyavastrālaṃkārarājābhiṣekapuragrāmādiśaṃkusthāpanapraveśagulmādibījāvāpanadhanadhānyasaṃgrahasurabhikrayabhūmi(-)parigrahataṭākādisthirakāryāṇipraśastāni || (-) || asminnakṣatrejātaguṇāḥ (-) sarvajñaḥ | sukhacittaḥ | suvṛttaḥ | pṛthulajaghanaḥ | viśālākṣaḥ | guṇādhikaḥ | hāsyaśīlaḥ | alpanidraḥ | kṛpāvān | vāgmī | dhārmikaḥ | śūraḥ | navativarṣāṇiparamāyurityādikaṃsarvametadgraṃthedraṣṭavyam || 1 ||

(314) atha abhijinnakṣatrasya (-)

nirguṇaṃbrahmabhūyānmejñānaiśvaryapradaṃsadā |
abhijittārakeśānaṃ vedāṃtakṛtasaṃśrayam || 1 || 

(atraitāvanmātralekhomātṛkāyām) (-)

<p. 203>

(315) atha śravaṇanakṣatrasya (-)

śāṃtākāraṃcaṃturhastaṃ śroṇānakṣatravallabham ||
viṣṇuṃkamalapatrākṣaṃ dhyāyedgaruḍavāhanam || 1 || 

nīlameghaśyāmaḥ | viṣṇurdevatā || (-) ||

(nakṣatracūḍāmaṇau) (-)

kuryāddhomaṃyajñadīkṣā vratānividyāraṃbhaṃ caulamoṃjīvidhānam ||
garbhādhānaṃkarṇavedhaṃ prayāṇaṃ viṣṇordhiṣṇye devatāsupratiṣṭhām || 1 ||

śroṇāhāratrayam || śī śu śe śo śravaṇam | kṛṣṇavarṇaḥ | dhanurākṛtiḥ | pumān | devagaṇaḥ | vānarayoniḥ | viṣṇurdevatā | brāhmaṇajātiḥ | catuṣpāt | ūrdhvamukham | sulocanam | caraḥ | aṃtarbāhyam | pattanam | sthānm | iṃdramaṃḍalam | ṭokṣaraḥ | samatārā | arkavṛkṣaḥ | pakṣīsārasaḥ || asminnakṣatre aṃgārakavibhīṣaṇau jātau | daśaghaṭikābhyaḥ paraṃviṣanāḍyaścatasraḥ | śālipiṣṭaṃbhakṣayitvādakṣiṇapaścimaprayāṇeśubham | jvare ekādaśadinānyariṣṭāni || (-) || tacchāṃtyaiviṣṇupūjāvidhānam | kṛṣṇavastram | caṃdanakastūrīkarpūrakuṃkumagaṃdhaḥ | tulasīpuṣpam | daśāṃgadhūpaḥ | śālyodananaivedyam | atodevā itimantreṇa idaṃviṣṇuritimaṃtreṇavāṣoḍaśopacāraissaṃpūjya aśvatthasamittaṃḍulājyenagāyatryā aṣṭottaraśataṃ juhuyāt | gaṃdhamālyaiḥ kṣīraudanabaliṃ haret | ekādaśāhātsukhī bhavati || (-) || asminnakṣatreprathamarajasvalābhāgyaputravatī bhavati || (-) || asminnakṣatre ṛtupuṃsavanasīmaṃtanāmakaraṇānnaprāśanakarṇavedhacaulopanayana(-)kṣaurābhyaṃjanākṣaragrahaṇavedaśāstrābhyāsanavavastrabhūṣaṇamauktikāraṃbharājābhiṣekapūrṇamāsādigrahapraveśavaiṣṇavadevatāsthāpanayajñopadeśa(-)śāṃtikapauṣṭikamahotsavamaṃtrābhyāsakṛṣiprāraṃbhabījāvāpanabhaiṣajyādīni(-)praśastāni || (-) || asminnakṣatre jātaguṇāḥ (-) kṛṣṇāṃgaḥ | puṣṭimān | citrāṃbaragaṃḥ | dhapriyaḥ | parasatīratipriyaḥ | udāraśīlaḥ | baṃdhujanarataḥ | bahuvyayakaraḥ | subhagaḥ | vācakaḥ | durmaṃtrī | gulmādirogī | videśavāsī | capalaḥ | maṃtravādī | prabhuḥ | guhyadeśematsyāṃkitaḥ || navativarṣāṇiparamāyurityādikaṃ sarvamasmingraṃthedraṣṭavyam || 1 ||

<p. 204>

(316) atha dhaniṣṭhānakṣatrasya (-)

śraviṣṭhādevatāṃvaṃdevasūnvaradharāśritān ||
śaṃkhacakrāṃkitakarānkirīṭāṃkitamastakān || 1 || 

śvetavarṇaḥ | vasavodevatāḥ || (-) || nakṣatracūḍāmaṇau) (-)

vidyāgamopanayanāṃjanabheṣajāniśvetātapatraśayanāsanabhojanāni ||
yajñābhiṣekaśubhaśāṃtikapauṣṭikānisidhyaṃtiharmyanagarāṇi ca vāsavarkṣe || 1 ||

dhaniṣṭhāmardalākāraṃcatasraḥ | gā gī gū ge dhaniṣṭhā | śvetavarṇaḥ | catustārā | mṛdaṃgākṛtiḥ | strī | rākṣasagaṇaḥ | siṃhīyoniḥ | vasavodevatāḥ | upajīvijātiḥ | ūrdhvamukham | aṃdhalocanam | aṃtarikṣam | sthānaṃgrāmaḥ | iṃdramaṃḍalam | śamīvṛkṣaḥ | pakṣībhramaraḥ | trya (ñira) kṣaraḥ || asminnakṣatreduṃdubhirjātaḥ | daśaghaṭikābhyaḥ paraṃviṣanāḍyaścatasraḥ | tilataṃḍulabhakṣaṇaṃ kṛtvā pūrvottaraprayāṇe śubham | jvaremāsamariṣṭam || (-) || tacchāṃtyaivasudevatāpūjāvidhānam | śvetavastram | caṃdanagaṃdhaḥ | śatapatrapuṣpam | gugguladhūpaḥ | pāyasanaivedyam | trātāramitimaṃtreṇaṣoḍaśopacārapūjāṃkṛtvā auduṃbarasamidājyenagāyatryā aṣṭottaraśataṃjuhuyāt | gaṃdhamālyaiḥkṣīraudanabaliṃharet | māsātsukhībhavati || (-) || asminnakṣatreprathamarajasvalāputravatībhavati || (-) || asminnakṣatrestrīsaṃbhoganāmakaraṇānnaprāśanakarṇavedhacaulopanayana(-)tailābhyaṃgavastrābharaṇadhāraṇacaturaṃgayānāṃdolikācchatracāmara(-)dhāraṇadevatāsevāprāraṃbhayātrāpraveśaśāṃtikapauṣṭikamahotsavanṛtta(-)gītavādyakṛṣiprāraṃbhabījāvāpanagajādiśikṣākrayavikrayādīnipraśastāni || (-) || asminnakṣatrejātaguṇāḥ (-) alpaśāstrajñaḥ | tejasvī | udyogavān | sthūlatanuḥ | nṛttagītāṃganāpriyaḥ | dīnaḥ | anṛtavādī | nṛpasevakaḥ | dhātuvādī | kṛpāhīnaḥ | duṣkṛtī | uṣṇadehī | piśunaḥ | paṃcasaptativarṣāṇiparamāyurityādikaṃ sarvametadgraṃthe draṣṭavyam || 1 ||

(317) atha śatabhiṣaṅnakṣatrasya (-)

varuṇaṃ saṃtataṃ vaṃde sudhākalaśadhāriṇam |
pāśahastaṃśatabhiṣagdevatāṃdevavaṃditam || 1 || 

svarṇavarṇaḥ | varuṇodevatā || (-) || nakṣatracūḍāmaṇau ||

jalāśayodyānakṛṣikriyāśca pravālamuktādikasaṃgrahaṃ ca ||
turaṃgaśāṃtiṃjapahomadānaṃ kuryācchatarkṣe nayanāṃjanāni || 1 ||

śatabhiṣakśatatārā | golākṛtiḥ | go sā sī sū śatabhiṣak | raktavarṇaḥ | śatatārā | puṣpavarṣākṛtiḥ | napuṃsakam | rākṣasagaṇaḥ | turagīyoniḥ | varuṇodevatā | kṣatriyajātiḥ | ūrdhvamukham | maṃdalocanam | caram | aṃtaḥ | samatārā | sthānaṃśūnyam | varuṇamaṃḍalam | kadaṃbavṛkṣaḥ | pakṣīkokilaḥ | ṣakārākṣaraḥ || asminvaruṇojātaḥ | aṣṭādaśaghaṭikābhyaḥ paraṃviṣanāḍyaścatasraḥ | taṃḍulaṃbhakṣayitvāpūrvottaraprayāṇe śubham | jvareprāṇabhayam | athavā ekādaśadinānyariṣṭāni || (-) || tacchāṃtyaivaruṇapūjāvidhānam | śvetavastram | śatapatrapuṣpam | malayajagaṃdhaḥ | karpūradhūpaḥ | ghṛtānnanaivedyam | avateheḍa itimaṃtreṇaṣoḍaśopacāraiḥ saṃpūjyajalajakusumairājyenagāyatryā aṣṭottaraśataṃjuhuyāt || gaṃdhamālyaiḥkṣīrodanabaliṃharet | ekādaśāhātsukhībhavati || (-) || asminnakṣatre prathamarajasvalāputravatī kiṃcitkopavatī ca bhavati || (-) || asminnakṣatre strīsaṃbhoganāmakaraṇānnaprāśanacaulopanayanākṣaragrahaṇavedaśāstrā(-)bhyāsatailābhyaṃgarājābhiṣekagajāśvādimauktikacakṣuraṃjanaprayoga devatāsthāpanasetubaṃdhanajalasūtraprāraṃbhaputraparigrahavāṇijyakrayavikraya(-)kṛṣiprayogabījāvāpanādi śubhakāryāṇi praśastāni || (-) || asminnakṣatre jātaguṇāḥ (-) vipulatanuḥ | lokamānyaḥ | bahuputraḥ | baṃdhuvargopakārī | ripuhaṃtā | sthirāyuḥ | vyavahārī | raktarogī | dhūrtaguṇaḥ | kiṃcijjñānavān | caṃcalaḥ | vācālaḥ | śyāmalaḥ | śūraḥ | dhairyacittaḥ | varasutajanakaḥ | nītivairī | alpavidyāvān | atigarvī | aśītivarṣāṇiparamāyurityādikametadgraṃthedraṣṭavyam || 1 ||

(318) atha pūrvābhādrapadānakṣatrasya (-)

śirasāhamajaṃvaṃde hyekapādaṃtamopaham |
mudeproṣṭhapadeśānaṃ sarvadevanamaskṛtam || 1 ||

<p. 206>

raktavarṇaḥ | ajaikapāddevatā || (-) || nakṣatracūḍāmaṇau) (-)

vidyāraṃbhaṃkuṃjaraṇāṃ ca baṃdhaṃ betālādyāveśanaṃ kalpavādam ||
dyūtāraṃbhaṃcordhvayātrāprayogaṃ śāstrābhyāsaṃ caikapādbhevidadhyāt || 1 ||

pūrvābhādrottarābhādrā ca dvedve caturasram | se so dā dī pūrvābhādrā | kṛṣṇavarṇaḥ | dvitārā | tripāt | khaṭvākṛtiḥ | pumān | manuṣyagaṇaḥ | siṃhayoniḥ | ajaikapāddevatā | brāhmaṇajātiḥ | adhomukham | madhyalocanam | ugram | aṃtaḥ | samatārā | sthānaṃpattanam | iṃdramaṃḍalam | cūtavṛkṣaḥ | pakṣīkapotaḥ | lakārākṣaraḥ || asminnakṣatrekinnarojātaḥ | ṣoḍaśaghaṭikābhyaḥ paraṃviṣanāḍyaścatasraḥ | yātrāvarjyā | athavāmadhupītvā pūrvottaraprayāṇe śubham | jvareprāṇabhayam | athavāmāsamariṣṭam || (-) || tacchāṃtyai ajaikapāddevatāpūjāvidhānam | raktavastram | kuṃkumagaṃdhaḥ | arkapuṣpam | daśauṣadhīdhūpaḥ | dadhyodananaivedyam | śamagniritimaṃtreṇaṣoḍaśopacāraiḥ saṃpūjya annājyenagāyatryā aṣṭottaraśataṃhutvā gaṃdhamālyaiḥkṣīrodanabaliṃ haret | māsātsukhī bhavati || (-) || asminnakṣatre prathamarajasvalāvidhavā bhavati || (-) || asminnakṣatre vidyāraṃbhagrāmasaṃgrahābhicāracauryakalahadyūtavyavahārabaṃdhanavāpī(-)kūpataṭākakhananamahābilapraveśaripubhedanabhūtapretapiśācamaṃtraprayogo(-)ccāṭanadhātuvādaprabhṛtikrūrakāryāṇipraśastāni || (-) || asminnakṣatre jātaguṇāḥ (-) kamalanetraḥ | vittavān | atyudāraḥ | strīpriyaḥ | dānaśīlaḥ | subhagaḥ | pariveśasamāhitaḥ | vikhyātaḥ | atikopī | dīrghajīvī | bahusukhavibhavaḥ | kaṃṭharogī | kṣuttṛṣṇākarmarahitaḥ | ṣaṇṇavativarṣāṇiparamāyurityādikaṃ sarvametadgraṃthe draṣṭavyam || 1 ||

(319) atha uttarābhādrapadānakṣatrasya (-)

ahirmebudhniyo bhūyānmudeproṣṭhapadeśvaraḥ ||
śaṃkhacakrāṃkitakaraḥkirīṭojjvalamaulimān || 1 || 

śvetavarṇaḥ | ahirbudhnyodevatā || (-) || nakṣatracūḍāmaṇau) (-)

sthirakriyāpauṣṭikamaṃgalānivivāhayajñādi parigrahāṇi ||
nṛpābhiṣekāṃbarabhūṣaṇāni sidhyaṃtyahirbudhnyagate śaśāṃke || 1 ||

pūrvābhādrottarābhādrā ca dvedve caturasram |

<p. 207>

duḥ śaṃ ḍā thā uttarābhādrā | śvetavarṇaḥ | dvitārā | khaḍgākṛtiḥ | pumān | manuṣyagaṇaḥ | goyoniḥ | ahirbudhnyodevatā | kṣatriyajātiḥ | ūrdhvamukham | sulocanam | catuṣpāt | samatārā | halau akṣarau | sthānam | grāmaḥ | vāyumaṃḍalam | picunadavṛkṣaḥ | pakṣīkokilaḥ || asmiñjaṭāyurjātaḥ | caturviṃśatighaṭikābhyaḥ paraṃviṣanāḍyaścatasraḥ | śālitaṃḍulabhabhaṇaṃ kṛtvāpūrvottaraprayāṇe śubham || jvare saptadinānyariṣṭāni || (-) || tacchāṃtyai ahirbudhnyadevatāpūjāvidhānam | śvetavastram | agarugaṃdhaḥ | śatapatrapuṣpam | ghṛtagugguladhūpaḥ | guḍodananaivedyam | viṣṇuryoni mitimaṃtreṇaṣoḍaśopacāraiḥ saṃpūjyakṣīramiśramāṣājyenagāyatryā aṣṭottaraśaṃtaṃ juhuyāt | gaṃdhamālyairguḍodanabaliṃharet | saptāhātsukhī bhavati || (-) || asminnakṣatre prathamarajasvalāsaubhāgyaputravatī bhavati || (-) || asminnakṣatre ṛtusī maṃtapuṃsavananāmakaraṇānnaprāśanakarṇavedhacaulopanayanasamāvarttana(-)bhūṣaṇālaṃkāra rājābhiṣekaśāṃtikapauṣṭikasiṃhāsanacaturaṃgānayanāṃdolikārohaṇaśayyā sthāpanapurapraveśakṛṣibījāvāpanadhanadhānyasaṃgrahaprabhṛtiśubhakāryāṇi(-)praśastāni || (-) || asminnakṣatrejātaguṇāḥ (-) karmajñaḥ | nṛttagītapriyaḥ | yuvatijanapriyaḥ | dhairyavān | parākramī | dīrghabuddhiḥ | janabhīṣaṇaḥ | dhanāḍhyaḥ | atibhogī | gaṃdhamālyapriyaḥ | maṃdagamanaḥ | kubjaḥ | svadāradveṣī | baṃdhuniṃdakaḥ | navativarṣāṇiparamāyurityādikaṃ sarvametadgraṃthe draṣṭavyam || 1 ||

(320) atha revatīnakṣatrasya

pūṣaṇaṃsatataṃvaṃderevatīśaṃsamṛddhaye ||
varābhayojjvalakaraṃratnasiṃhāsane sthitam || 1 || (-) || 

padmavarṇaḥ | pūṣādevatā || (-) || nakṣatracūḍāmaṇau) (-)

upanayanakṣurakarmavivāhaṃgṛhanagarādikavāstuniveśaḥ ||
karituragādyadhirohaṇamuktaṃtadapiśubhāni hi pauṣṇaśubharkṣe || 1 ||

revatīmatsyākāraṃ dvātriṃśat || de doo cā ci revatī | raktavarṇaḥ | dvātriṃśattārā | matsyākṛtiḥ |

<p. 208>

devagaṇaḥ | strī | gajīyoniḥ | pūṣādevatā | catuṣpāt | tiryaṅmukham | aṃdhalocanam | mṛduḥ | bāhyam | samatārā | sthānaṃśūnyam | varuṇamaṃḍalam | madhūkavṛkṣaḥ | mayūrapakṣī | kṣakārākṣaraḥ | asminnabhimanyurjātaḥ | triṃśadghaṭhikābhyaḥ paraṃviṣanāḍyaścatasraḥ | piṣṭaṃbhuktvāpūrvottaraprayāṇeśubham | jvaremāsamariṣaṭam || (-) || tacchāṃtyaipūṣadevatāpūjāvidhānam || padmarāgavastram | raktacaṃdanagaṃdhaḥ | maṃdārapuṣpam | gugguladhūpaḥ | tilodananaivedyam | haṁsaśśuciṣaditimaṃtreṇaṣoḍaśopacāraissaṃpūjyatilodanājyairgāyatryā aṣṭottaraśataṃjuhuyāt | gaṃdhamālyaistilodanabaliṃharet | māsātsukhībhavati || (-) || asminnakṣatreprathamarajasvalāputravatībhavati || (-) || asminnakṣatrekratupuṃsavananāmakaraṇānnaprāśanacaulopanayanavedaśāstrā(-)bhyāsākṣaraprāraṃbhatailābhyaṃgavastrābharaṇasamāvartanarājābhiṣekarāja(-)darśanasiṃhāsanāṃdolikāgajāśvārohaṇaśāṃtikapauṣṭikamahotsavamaṃtrā(-)bhyāsabhaiṣajyanṛttagītavādyaprayogabījāvāpanayātrādiśubhakāryāṇi praśastāni || (-) || asminnakṣatrejātaguṇāḥ (-) saubhāgyayutaḥ | tejasvī | sthūlakāyaḥ | saṃpūrṇāṃgaḥ | kopavān | bhogī | arthavyayakaraḥ | paṃḍitaḥ | dīrghajīvī | vicitraripugaṇaḥ | pittavān | annadātā | matsarī | krūrakāryaḥ | dhīraḥ | paradeśagaḥ | raktakeśaḥ | kiṃcittilamatsyāṃkitaḥ | caturaśītivarṣāṇiparamāyurityādikaṃ sarvametadgraṃthe draṣṭavyam || 1 || 27 ||

atha kṛttikādisaptaviṃśatinakṣatreṣukartavyakāryāṇi (-) (graṃthāṃtarenāradīye ca || (-) || dānāni ca (dānaciṃtāmaṇau mahābhārate)

(kṛttikāyām) (-) 

agnyādhānāstraśastrograsaṃdhivigrahadāruṇam ||
saṃgrāmauṣadhavāditrakriyāḥ śastāśca vahnibhe || 1 || (-) ||

(dānam) (-) 

kṛttikāsumahābhage pāyasenasusarpiṣā ||
saṃtarpyabrāhmaṇāṃtsādhūṁllokānāpnotyanuttamān || 1 ||

<p. 209>

(rohiṇyām) (-) 

sīmaṃtonnayanodvāha vastrabhūṣāsthirakriyāḥ ||
gajavāstvabhiṣekāśva pratiṣṭhābrahmabhe śubhāḥ || (-) ||

(dānam) (-) 

rohiṇyāṃpāṃḍavaśreṣṭhamāṣairannenasarpiṣā ||
payonupānaṃ dātavyamānṛṇyārthaṃ dvijātaye || 1 || 1 ||

(mṛgaśīrṣe) (-) 

pratiṣṭhābhūṣaṇodvāha sīmaṃtopanayakriyāḥ ||
kṣauravāstu gajoṣṭrāśva yātrāḥ śastāśca caṃdrabhe || 1 || (-) ||

(dānam) (-) 

dogdhrīṃsavatsāṃ tu naronakṣatre somadaivate ||
dattvā divyavimānasthaḥ svargaṃprāpnotyanuttamam || 1 ||

(ārdrāyām) (-) 

dhvajatoraṇasaṃgrāma prākārāstra kriyāḥ śubhāḥ ||
saṃdhivigrahavaitāna rasādyāḥ śārvabhe śubhāḥ || 1 || (-) ||

(dānam) (-) 

ārdrāyāṃkṛsaraṃ dattvā tailamiśraṃsamāhitaḥ ||
narastaratidūrgāṇi kṣuradhārāṃśca parvatān || 1 || 1 ||

(punarvasau) (-) 

pratiṣṭhāyānasīmaṃta vastravāstūpanāyanam ||
kṣaurāstrakarmāditibhe vidheyaṃ dhānyabhuṣaṇam || 1 || (-) ||

(dānam) (-) 

pūṣaṃpunarvasau dattvā ghṛtapūrṇaṃ tu pācitam ||
yaśasvīrūpasaṃpanno bahvanne jāyate kule || 1 || 1 ||

(puṣye) (-) 

yātrāpratiṣṭhāsīmaṃta vratabaṃdhapraveśanam ||
karagrahaṃvināsarva karmadevejyabhe śubham || 1 || (-) ||

(dānam) (-) 

puṣye tu kāṃcanaṃ dattvā kṛtaṃ cākṛtameva ca ||
anālokeṣulokeṣu somavatsavirājate || 1 || 1 ||

(āśleṣāyām) (-) 

amṛtavyasanadyūtadhātuvādauṣadhāhavāḥ ||
vivādarasavāṇijyakarmabhaujaṃgabhe śubham || 1 || (-) ||

(dānam) (-) 

āśleṣāsutathārauppamṛṣabhaṃ vā prayacchati ||
sasarvabhayanirmuktaḥ śāstravānabhijāyate || 1 || 1 ||

(maghāyām) (-) 

kṛṣivāṇijyagodhānyavraṇopakaraṇādikam ||
vivāhanṛttagītādyāṃ nikhilaṃ karmapaitṛbhe || 1 || (-) ||

(dānam) (-) 

maghāsutilapūrṇāni vardhamānāni mānavaḥ ||
pradāyapaśumāṃścaiva putravāṃśca prajāyate || 1 || 1 ||

(pūrvaphalgunyām) (-) 

vivādaviṣaśastrāgni dāruṇogrāhavādikam ||
pūrvatrayekhilaṃkarma kartavyaṃ māṃsavikrayaḥ || 1 || (-) ||

(dānam) (-) 

phalgunīpūrvasamaye brāhmaṇebhya upoṣitaḥ ||
bhakṣyāṃśca phāṇitairyuktāndattvā saubhāgyamaśnute || 1 || 1 ||

<p. 210>

(uttaraphalgunyām) (-) 

vastrābhiṣekasīmaṃta vivāhavratabaṃdhanam ||
praveśasthāpanāśvebha vāstukarmottarā traye || 1 || (-) ||

(dānam) (-) 

ghṛtakṣīrasamāyuktaṃ vidhivatpiṣṭakaudanam ||
uttarāviṣaye dattvā svargeloke mahīyate || 1 ||

yadvā pradīyate dānamuttarā viṣaye naraiḥ ||
sadāphalamanaṃtaṃ ca bhavatīhaviniścayaḥ || 2 || 1 ||

(haste) (-) 

pratiṣṭhodvāhasīmaṃtayānavastropanāyanam ||
kṣauravāstvabhiṣekāśca bhūṣaṇaṃkarmabhānubhe || 1 || (-) ||

(dānam) (-) 

haste caturhastirathaṃ dattvāyuktaṃ hyupoṣitaḥ ||
narastarati durgāṇi kṣuradhārāśca parvatān || 1 || 1 ||

(citrāyām) (-) 

praveśavastrasīmaṃta pratiṣṭhāvaratabaṃdhanam ||
tvāṣṭrabhevāstuvidyāssyuḥ kṣurabhūṣaṇakarmayat || 1 || (-) ||

(dānam) (-) 

citrāyāmṛṣabhaṃ dattvā puṇyāṃ gāṃ gāṃ ca bhārata ||
caratyapsarasāṃ loke ramate naṃdane vane || 1 || 1 ||

(svātyām) (-) 

pratiṣṭhopana yo dvāhavastrasīmaṃta bhūṣaṇam ||
paśvaṃbvaśvebhakṛṣyādi kṣaurakarmasamīrabhe || 1 || (-) ||

(dānam) (-) 

svātīṣvathadhanaṃdattvā yadiṣṭatamamātmanaḥ ||
prāpnoti lokāṃśca śubhāniha caiva mahadyaśaḥ || 1 || 1 ||

(viśākhāyām) (-) 

vastrabhūṣaṇavāṇijya vasudhānyādi saṃgraham ||
iṃdrāgnibhe nṛttagītaśilpalekhanakarma ca || (-) ||

(dānam) (-) 

viśākhāyāmanaḍvāhaṃ dhenuṃ dattvā ca dugdhadām ||
sagrāsaṃgaṃ ca śakaṭaṃ sadhānyaṃ vastrasaṃyutam || 1 ||

pitṝndevānprīṇayati pretyacānaṃtyamasnute ||
na ca durgāṇyavāpnoti svargalokaṃ ca gacchati || 2 ||

dattvā yathoktaṃ viprebhyo vṛtīmiṣṭāṃsaviṃdati ||
nārakīyāṃśca saṃkleśānna prāpnotīti niścayaḥ || 3 || 1 ||

(anūrādhāyām) (-) 

praveśasthāpanodvāha vratabaṃdhādi maṃgalam ||
vastrabhūṣaṇavāstvādya maitrabhe saṃdhivigraham || 1 || (-) ||

(dānam) (-) 

anūrādhāsuprāvāraṃ vastrottaramupoṣitaḥ ||
dattvāyugaśataṃvāpi naraḥ svarge mahīyate || 1 || 1 ||

(jyeṣṭhāyām) (-) 

kṣaurāstraśastravāṇijya go mahiṣyaṃbukarma ca ||
iṃdrabhenṛttavāditraśilpalohāśma locanam || 1 || (-) ||

(dānam) (-) 

kālaśākaṃ tu viprebhyo dattvāmartyaḥ sa mūlakam ||

<p. 211>

jyeṣṭhāyāṃ mṛtyumutsādya gatimiṣṭāṃ ca gacchati || 1 || 1 ||

(mūlāyām) (-) 

vivāhakṛṣivāṇijyadāruṇāhavabheṣajam ||
nir(-)ṛtaunṛttaśilpāstra saṃdhi vigraha lekhanam || 1 ||

(dānam) (-) 

mūlemūlaphalaṃdattvā brāhmaṇebhyaḥ samāhitaḥ ||
svapitṝnprīṇaye deva gatimiṣṭāṃ ca gacchati || 1 ||

(pūrvāṣāḍhāsu) (-) 

vivādaviṣaśastrāgnidāraṇogrāhavādikam ||
pūrvāṣāḍhāsu kartavyaṃ māṃsavikraya karma vai || 1 || (-) ||

(dānam) (-) 

athapūrvāsvaṣāḍhāsu dadhipātrāṇyupoṣitaḥ ||
kulavṛttopasaṃpanne brāhmaṇe vedapārage || 1 ||

pradāyajāyate śreṣṭhakule bahuguṇojjvale ||
putrapautraiḥ parivṛtaḥ paśumāndhanavāṃstathā || 2 || 1 ||

(uttarāṣāḍhāsu (-) abhijiti ca) (-) 

vastrābhiṣekasīmaṃta vivāhavratabaṃdhanam ||
praveśasthāpanāśvebha vāstukarmottarā traye || 1 || (-) ||

(dānam) (-) 

udamaṃthaṃsasarpiṣkaṃ prabhūtamadhuphāṇitam ||
dattvottarāsvaṣāḍhāsu sarvalokānavāpnuyāt || 1 || (-) ||

(dānam) (-) 

dugdhaṃtvabhijitā yoge dattvā madhughṛtāplutam ||
dharmaniṣṭhomanīṣibhyaḥ svarge loke mahīyate || 1 || 2 ||

(uttarāṣāḍhānakṣatracaturthapādaśravaṇabhasyādyaghaṭikācatuṣṭayayuktaḥ(-)kālo'bhijidyoga ityucyate || 1 ||

(śravaṇe) (-) 

pratiṣṭhākṣaurasīmaṃtayānopanayanauṣadham ||
purārāmagṛhāraṃbhaṃviṣṇubhe paṭṭabaṃdhanam || 1 || (-) ||

(dānam) (-) 

śravaṇekaṃbalaṃ dattvā vastrāṃtaritameva ca ||
śvetenayātvā yānena svargeloke mahīyate || 1 || 1 ||

(dhaniṣṭhāyām) (-) 

vastropanayanakṣaurapratiṣṭhāyānabheṣajam ||
vasubhevāstusīmaṃta praveśāśvebhabhūṣaṇam || 1 || (-) ||

(dānam) (-) 

goyuktaṃ ca dhaniṣṭhāsu yānaṃ dattvā samāhitaḥ ||
vastramasminnavaṃ dattvā pretyarājyaṃ prapadyate || 1 || 1 ||

(śatabhiṣaji) (-) 

praveśasthāpanakṣauramauṃjī baṃdhanabheṣajam ||
aśvābharaṇasīmaṃta vāstukarmajale śubhe || 1 || (-) ||

(dānam) (-) 

gaṃdhaṃśatabhiṣagyoge dattvā cāgarucaṃdanam ||
prāpnotyapsarasāṃlokaṃ dhattegaṃdhāṃśca śāśvatān || 1 || 1 ||

<p. 212>

(pūrvabhādrapadāyām) (-) 

vivādaviṣaśāstrāgni dāraṇogrāhavādikam ||
pūrvātrayekhilaṃkāryaṃ māṃsavikrayaṇādikam || 1 || (-) ||

(dānam) (-) 

pūrvabhādrapadāyoge rājamāṣānpradāya vai ||
sarvabhakṣyaphalopetaṃ sarvaiḥ pretyasukhī bhavet || 1 || 1 ||

(uttarabhādrapadāyām) (-) 

vastrābhiṣekasīmaṃtavivāhavratabaṃdhanam ||
praveśasthāpanāśvebha vāstukarmottarā traye || 1 || (-) ||

(dānam) (-) 

aurabhramuttarā yoge yastu māṃsaṃ prayacchati |
pitṛnprīṇāti sakalānpretyacānaṃtyamaśnute || 1 || 1 ||

(revatyām) (-) 

vivāhavratabaṃdhāśca pratiṣṭhāyānabhūṣaṇam ||
praveśavastrasīmaṃta kṣaurabheṣajamaṃtyabhe || 1 || (-) ||

(dānam) (-) 

kāṃsyopadohinīṃ dhenuṃ revatyāṃ yaḥ prayacchati ||
sapretyakāmānādāyadātāramupatiṣṭhate || 1 || 1 ||

(aśvinyām) (-) 

yātropanayanakṣaurasīmaṃtābharaṇakriyāḥ ||
sthāpanāśvebhayānāstra kṛṣividyādayośvibhe || 1 || (-) ||

(dānam) (-) 

rathamaśvasamāyuktaṃ dattvāśvinyāṃ narottamaḥ ||
hastyaśvarathasaṃpanne varcasvāñjāyate kule || 1 || 1 ||

(bharaṇyām) (-) 

vāpīkūpataṭākāgniviṣaśastrogradāruṇam ||
bilapraveśagaṇitanikṣepāyāmyabhe śubhāḥ || 1 || (-) ||

(dānam) (-) 

bharaṇīṣu dvijātibhyastiladhenuṃ pradāya vai ||
gā prabhṛtā athāpnoti naraḥpretyayaśastathā || 1 || 28 ||

(321) atha kṛttikādisaptaviṃśatinakṣatreṣuviṣanāḍīpraveśakālāḥ (-)

(jyotiṣevidyāmādhavīye)

triṃśaddviguṇitakṛtimanu samidhastriṃśatkṛtidvijāstriṃśat ||
kṛtidhṛtisamidhaḥ kṛtimanumanudiṅmanukṭijināḥkṛtiḥkakubhaḥ || 1 ||

daśadhṛtayo nṛpatijināstriṃśatpaṃcāśaṃtaujināstebhyaḥ ||
paratoghṭīcatuṣkaṃ viṣasaṃjñaṃ kṛttikādiṣu jñeyam || 2 || 27 ||

(322) atha kṛttikādisaptaviṃśatinakṣatreṣu amṛtanāḍīpraveśakālāḥ (-jyotiṣevidyāmādhavīye)

saṃkṛyākṛtināgavāsaraji nariṃdrotkṛtibhyāṃjinairmanvarkaistithināgaśakravasubhirvedāṣṭaśakraiḥ kramāt ||

<p. 213>

vidyeṃdrābdhiyugābdhidigdhṛtijinairarkaiḥpurāṇairyutānāḍīstriṃśadatītyabheṣu(-)puratonāḍyaścatasro'mṛtam || 1 || 27 ||

atha aśvinyādinakṣatreṣujātaguṇāḥpunarapi (-) (jātakābharaṇe)

tatrādau (aśvinyām) (-) 

savaisadaivābhyudito vinītaḥ satyānvitaḥ prāptasamastasaṃpat ||
yoṣidvibhūṣātmajabhūritoṣaḥ syādaśvinībhejananaṃ prapannaḥ || 1 ||

(bharaṇyām) (-) 

sadāpakīrtirhimadā (hā) pavādairnānāvinodaiśca vinītarāgaḥ ||
jalāttabhītiścapalaḥ khalassyātprāṇipraṇītobharaṇībhajātaḥ || 1 ||

(kṛttikāyām) (-) 

kṣudhādhikassattvadhanairvihīno vṛthāṭanotpannamatiḥ kṛtaghnaḥ ||
kaṭhoravāggarhitakarmakṛtsyāccetkṛttikājanmani yasya jaṃtoḥ || 1 ||

(rohiṇyām) (-) 

dharmakarmakuśalaḥ kṛṣīvalaḥ cāruśīlavilasat kalevaraḥ |
vāgvilāsakalitākhilāśayorohiṇībhavati yasya janmabham || 1 ||

(mṛgaśīrṣe) (-) 

śarāsanābhyāsaratovinītaḥ sadānurakto guṇināṃ gaṇeṣu ||
bhoktānṛpasnehabhareṇapūrṇaḥ sanmārgavettā mṛgajātajanmā || 1 ||

(ārdrāyām) (-) 

kṣudhādhikorūkṣaśarīrakāṃtirbahu (ndhu) priyaḥ kopayutaḥkṛtaghnaḥ ||
pasūtikāle ca bhavet kilārdrādayārdracetānabhavenmanuṣyaḥ || 1 ||

(punarvasvoḥ) (-) 

prabhūtayatnaḥ kṛtaśāstrayatnaḥ sadratnacāmīkarabhūṣaṇāḍhyaḥ ||
dātāpratāpīvasudhāvasuśca punarvasū yasya bhavet prasūtau || 1 ||

(puṣye) (-) 

prasannagātraḥ pitṛmrātṛbhaktaḥ svadharmayukto vinayāvimuktaḥ ||
bhavenmanuṣyaḥ khalupaṣyajanmā sanmānanānādhanavāhanāḍhyaḥ || 1 ||

(āśleṣāyām) (-) 

vṛthādanassyātpariduṣṭaceṣṭaḥ kaṣṭapradaścāpi vṛthājanānām ||
sārpesadarpohivṛthārpitārthaḥ kaṃdarpasaṃtaptamanāmanuṣyaḥ || 1 || 

(adhikaṃmūlānakṣatraphalevistareṇadraṣṭavyam)

(maghāyām) (-) 

kaṭhoracittaḥpitṛbhaktiyuktastīvrasvabhāvastvanavadyahṛdyaḥ ||
cejjavmabhaṃ yasya maghānaghassyānmatissadārāti vighātadakṣā || 1 ||

<p. 214>

(pūrvaphalgunyām) (-) 

bhūrityāgī sāhasībhūribhartākopāṭopīsyācchikhālotidakṣaḥ ||
dhūrtaḥkrotyantasaṃjātagarvaḥ pūrvāphalgunyasti cejjanmakāle || 1 ||

(uttaraphalgunyām) (-) 

dātādayālussutarāṃsuśīlo visālakīrtirnṛpatipradhānaḥ ||
dhīronarotyaṃtamṛdūttaraḥ syācceduttarāphalgunikāprasūtau || 1 ||

(haste) (-) 

dātāmanasvīsutarāṃ yaśasvī bhūdevadevārcana yajñakarttā ||
prasutikāle yadi yasya hasto hastodgatā tasya samastasaṃpat || 1 ||

(citrāyām) (-) 

pratāpasaṃtāpitaśatrupakṣonayetidakṣaśca vicitravāsāḥ ||
prasutikāle yadi yasya citrābuddhirvicitrākhalu tasya śāstre || 1 ||

(svātyām) (-) 

kaṃdarparūpaḥ prabhayāsametaḥ kāṃtāparaprītiratiprasannaḥ ||
svātīprasūtaumanujasya yasya bhavennṛpaḥ prāptavibhūti yuktaḥ || 1 ||

(viśākhāyām) (-) 

sadānuraktognisurakriyāyāṃ dhātukriyāyāmapi cograsaumyaḥ ||
yasya prasūtau ca bhavedviśākhāsakhānakasyāpi bhavenmanuṣyaḥ || 1 ||

(anūrādhāyām) (-) 

satkāṃtikīrtiśca sadotsavassyājjetāripūṇāṃ ca kalā pravīṇaḥ ||
syātsaṃbhave yasya kilānurādhāsaṃpadvibādhāvividhā ca tasya || 1 ||

(jyeṣṭhāyām) (-) 

satkirtikāṃtirvibhutāsameto vittānvitotyaṃtalasatpratāpaḥ ||
śreṣṭhapratiṣṭhovadatāṃ variṣṭho jyeṣṭhodbhavasssyātpuruṣo viśeṣāt || 1 ||

(mūle) (-) 

mūlaṃviruddhāvayavaṃsamūlaṃbalaṃharatyevavadaṃtisaṃtaḥ ||
cedanyathā tatkurute viśeṣātsaubhāgyamātu(yu)ścakulābhivṛddhim || 1 ||

(atha mūle viśeṣaḥ)

(323) tatra abhuktamūlākhyaviruddhāvayavamūlasyasvarūpam (-)

jyeṣṭhāṃtyeghaṭikaikā ca mūlasyādyaghaṭī dvayam ||
abhuktamūlamityuktam ||

(324) atha abhuktamūlotpannenajātadoṣasyavāraṇāyaśāntiḥ (-) (jātakābharaṇe)

tatrotpannaśiśormukham || aṣṭavarṣāṇinālokyaṃtā tena śubhamicchatā || 1 ||

taddoṣaparihārārthaṃ śāṃtisssaṃprocyatedhunā ||
ratnaiśśatauṣadhīmūlaiḥ saptamṛdbhiḥ prapūrayet || 2 ||

<p. 215>

śatacchidraṃghaṭaṃ tasmānnirgatena jalena hi ||
bālakāṃ'vāpitṛsnāne vipraissaṃpādite sati || 3 ||

japahomapradāne ca kṛtesanmaṃgalaṃ dhruvam ||
viruddhāvayave mūle vidhirevaṃ smṛto budhaiḥ || 4 ||

munīnāṃ vacanaṃ satyaṃ maṃtavyaṃ kṣemamīpsubhīḥ ||

atha mūlāśleṣayoḥcaraṇabhedenajanmaniphalabhedāḥ (-) (jātakābharaṇe)

mūlasyapādatritayekrameṇapiturjananyāśca sutasyariṣṭam ||
caturthapādaśśubhado nitāṃtaṃ sārpe vilomaṃ parikalpanīyam || 1 ||

atha mūlasyayogabhedenajanmaniphalabhedāḥ (-) (jatakābharaṇe)

kṛṣṇetṛtīyādaśamīvalakṣebhūtomahījārkibudhaissametaḥ ||
cejjanmakāle kilatatramūlamunmūlanaṃ tatkurute kulasya || 1 ||

divāsāyaṃ niśiprātaḥ pitussyānmātulasya ca ||
paśūnāṃmitravargasya kramānmūlamaniṣṭadam || 2 ||

(325) atha phalabhedasūcakayoḥpuruṣākṛtimūlāśleṣayoḥsvarūpe (-)

mūrdhnipaṃcamukhe paṃcaskaṃdhayorghaṭikāṣṭakam ||
gajāśca bhujayoryugme hastayorhṛdayeṣṭakam || 1 ||

yugmaṃ nābhau diśoguhye ṣaḍjānvoṣṣaṭca pādayoḥ ||
vinyasya puruṣākāre mūlasya phalamādiśet || 2 ||

chatralābhaśśirodeśe vadanepitṛghātanam ||
skaṃdhayordhūrvahatvaṃ ca bāhuyugmetva karmakṛt || 3 ||

hatyākaraḥ karadvaṃdverājyāptirhṛdaye bhavet ||
alpāyurnābhi deśe ca guhye ca sukhamadbhutam || 4 ||

jaṃghāyāṃ bhramaṇaprītiḥ pādayorjīvitālpatā ||
ghaṭīphalaṃ kilaproktaṃ mūlasya munipuṃgavaiḥ || 5 ||

vijñeyaṃ vibudhaissarvaṃ sārpetaccaviparyayāt ||

atha mūlāśleṣāmuhūrtanāyakānāṃnāmāni (-)

rākṣasoyātudhānaśca somaśukrauphaṇīśvaraḥ ||
pitāmātāyamaḥ kālo viśvedevāmaheśvaraḥ || 1 ||

sarpākhyaśca kuberaśca śakromegho divākaraḥ ||
gaṃdharvo yamadevaśca brahmāviṣṇuryamastathā || 2 ||

īśvaroviṣṇuriṃdraśca pavanomunayastathā ||
ṣaṇmukhobhṛṃgirīṭiśca gaurīnāmnāsarasvatī || 3 ||

prajāpatiśca mūlasyasyurmuhurtādhi nāyakāḥ ||
viparītāḥ punarjñeyā āśleṣājātabālake || 4 ||

<p. 216>

dvitīyeprathameṣaṣṭhe cāṣṭamedvādaśetathā ||
trayoviṃśe ca navame kulakṣayakaraḥ śiśuḥ || 5 ||

atha mūlavṛkṣasya phalam (-) (jātakābharaṇe)

vedāḥsaptagajāḥkāṣṭhāḥkheṭābāṇābhraṣaṭśivāḥ mūlaṃbhargastvajaḥ śākhā

mūlavṛkṣavibhāgeṣu maṃgalaṃ hi phale bhavet || 1 || 

maṃgalā || 

maṃgalaṃ (dale | amaṃgalaṃ phalaṃ) viṃdyāccheṣaṃbhāge niścitam ||
pādemūhūrte velāyāṃ vṛkṣe ca puruṣā kṛtau || 2 ||

ariṣṭamaśubhādhikye śūbhādhikye śubhaṃ phalam ||

atha tātajanmabhesutejātetātajanmabhemūlatvātideśadvārāphalaśāntyornirūpaṇam (-) 

tātasyajanmabhe yasya prasūtirjāyate yadi ||
tātaṃvābhrātaraṃ jyeṣṭhaṃriṣṭa sātkurute dhruvam || 1 ||

mūlavacchāṃtikaṃ tatra vidheyaṃ hi vicakṣaṇaiḥ ||
bhūmiratnānnahemādi deyaṃ vipreṣu bhaktitaḥ || 2 ||

(iti mūlarkṣe'dhikāṃśāvicāraḥ)

(mūle) (-) 

sukhenayuktodhanavāhanāḍhyo hiṃsro balāḍhyaḥ sthirakarmakarttā ||
pratāpitārātijanomanuṣyo mūlekṛtīsyājjananaṃprapannaḥ || 1 ||

(pūrvāṣāḍhāyām) (-) 

bhūyobhuyastoyapānānurakto bhoktācaṃcadvāgvilāsaḥ suśīlaḥ ||
nūnaṃsaṃpajjāyate tasya gāḍhāpūrvāṣāḍhājanmabhaṃ yasya puṃsaḥ || 1 ||

(uttarāṣāḍhāyām) (-) 

dātādayāvānvjayīvinītassatkarmacetāvibhunāsametaḥ ||
kāṃtāsutāvāptasukhonitāṃtaṃ lokesuveṣaḥ puruṣomanīṣī || 1 ||

(abhijiti) (-) 

atisulalitakāṃtissaṃmatassajjānānāmanubhavativinītaścārukīrtiḥsurūpaḥ ||
dvijavarasurabhaktirvyaktavāṅmānavassyādabhijitiyadisūtirbhūpatiḥ sa svaṃvaṃśe || 1 ||

(śravaṇe) (-) 

śāstrānuraktobahuputramitrassatpātrabhaktirvijitāripakṣaḥ ||
prāṇīpurāṇaśravaṇapravīṇaścejjanmakāle śravaṇaṃ hi yasya || 1 ||

<p. 217>

(dhaniṣṭhāyām) (-) 

ācārajātyādikacāruśīlo dhanādiśālībalavānkṛpāluḥ ||
yasya prasūtau ca bhaveddhaniṣṭhāmahānpratiṣṭhā sahito narassyāt || 1 ||

(śatabhiṣaji) (-) 

śītabhīruratisāhasīsadāniṣṭhuroti caturobhavetsadā ||
vairiṇāmativiśeṣadāruṇo vāruṇo yadi ca yasya saṃbhave || 1 ||

(pūrvabhādrapadāyām) (-) 

jiteṃdriyassarvakalāsudakṣojitāripakṣaḥ khalu tasya nityam ||
bhavenmanīṣāsutarāmapūrvāpurvāyadābhādrapadāprasūtau || 1 ||

(uttarabhādrapadāyām) (-) 

kulasyamadhyekilabhūṣaṇaṃ ca bhū(nā)tyuccadehaśśubhakarmakartā ||
yasyottarābhādrapadā ca janyāṃ dhanyāṃ labhen māṃ ca bhavedvādānyaḥ || 1 ||

(revatyām) (-) 

cāruśīlavibhavojiteṃdriyassaddhanānubhavanaikamānasaḥ ||
mānavonanubhavenmahāmatīrevatī bhavati yasya janmabham || 1 || 27 ||

(326) atha viṣkaṃbhādisaptaviṃśatiyogānāṃnāmāni (-) (jyotiṣārṇave)

viṣkaṃbhaṃprītirāyuṣmānsaubhāgyaṃśobhanastathā ||
atigaṃḍassukarmā ca dhṛtiśśūlastathaiva ca || 1 ||

gaṃḍovṛddhirdhruvaścaiva vyādhāto harṣaṇastathā ||
vajraṃsiddhirvyatīpātovarīyāt parivaśśivaḥ || 2 ||

siddhaḥ sādhyaḥ śubhaḥ śuklo brahmācaiṃdraśca vaidhṛtiḥ ||
ete yogāḥ prakathitāssaptaviṃśatisaṃkhyayā || 3 || 27 ||

tatrādau viṣkaṃbhādisaptaviṃśatiyogānāṃsvarūpāṇi (-) (śaivāgame)

eṣukartavyakṛtyāni (-) (daivajñavilāse) eṣukartavyadānāni (-) (dānaciṃtāmaṇau mahābhārate)

(327) tatrādauviṣkaṃbhayogasya svarūpam (-)

viṣkaṃbhaṃ śirasāvaṃde viṣṇugotrasamudbhavam ||
prāṅmukhaṃprāṃjalikaraṃtrikoṇoparisaṃsthitam || 1 || 

pāṭalavarṇaḥ || (-) ||

(kṛtyam) (-) 

asminyogeśubhakarmavarjyam |
athavā ghaṭītrayānaṃtaraṃśubhaṃkarmakuryāt ||
caulaṃ ca bījārohaṃ ca strīsaṃgaṃdaṃtakalpanam |
kāṣṭhakarmaripūccāṭaṃviṣkaṃbhetu prakārayet || 1 || (-) ||

(dānam) (-) 

viṣkaṃbhesarvadhānyānāṃ dānaṃ sarvāghanāśanam || 1 ||

<p. 218>

(328) atha prītiyogasya svarūpam (-)

prītimīḍehamaniśaṃbrahmagotrasamudbhavam ||
prāṅmukhaṃ puṃḍarīkākṣaṃ japamālādharaṃ śubham || 1 || 

pāṭalavarṇaḥ || (-) ||

(kṛtyam) (-) 

ayaṃyogassarvakarmasuśubhaḥ ||

mitratvaṃlepanaṃcaiva bhūṣaṇaṃ bhūtisaṃgraham ||
rājavaśyaṃ mahotsāhaṃ prītiyoge ca kārayet || 1 || (-) ||

(dānam) (-) 

prītautathānnasvarṇānām || 1 ||

(329) atha āyuṣmadyogasya svarūpam (-)

āyuṣmaṃtamahaṃvaṃde yogaṃyogibhirīḍitam ||
prāṅmukhaṃpaṃcakoṇasthaṃ kauṃḍinyānvayasaṃbhavam || 1 || 

pāṭalavarṇaḥ || (-) ||

(kṛtyam) (-) 

ayaṃyogassarvakarmasuśubhaḥ ||

bījāvāpaṃvastrabaṃdhaṃ yuddhamārogyakarma ca ||
vivādaṃpāṇipīḍāñca hyāyuṣmatyapi kārayet || 1 || (-) ||

(dānam) (-) āyuṣmatighṛtasya ca || 1 ||

(330) atha saubhāgyayogasya svarūpam (-)

saubhāgyaṃśirasānaumi catuṣkoṇamupāśritam ||
kauṃḍinyagotrajanitaṃ prāṅmukhaṃjapatāṃvaram || 1 || 

pāṭalavarṇaḥ || (-) ||

(kṛtyam) (-) ayaṃyogassarvakarmasuśubhaḥ ||

bhūṣaṇāṃbarasaubhāgya vilepanasurārcanam ||
yajñakarmasurāpānaṃ saubhāgyekārayedbudhaḥ || 1 || (-) ||

(dānam) (-) kuṃkumasya ca saubhāgye || 1 ||

(331) atha śobhananāmayogasya svarūpam (-)

prāṅmukhaṃpaṃcakoṇasthaṃ kauṃḍinyānvayasaṃbhavam ||
śobhanaṃśobhanakaraṃ namatāmāśraye sadā || 1 || 

pāṭalavarṇaḥ || (-) ||

(kṛtyam) (-) 

ayaṃyogassarvakarmasuśubhaḥ ||

bhūparigrahavaivāhadānabhūṣaṇakarma ca ||
nṛpābhiṣekamārogyakarmakuryāccaśobhane || 1 || (-) ||

(dānam) (-) yavadānaṃcaśobhane || 1 ||

(332) atha atigaṃḍayogasya svarūpam (-)

vādhūlānvayasaṃbhutaṃpaṃcakoṇoparisthitam ||
atigaṃḍābhidhaṃvaṃde japaṃtaṃ prāṅmukhaṃ sadā || 1 || 

pāṭalavarṇaḥ || (-) ||

(kṛtyam) (-) ayaṃyogassarvakarmasuvarjyaḥ ||

athavāṣaḍghaṭikānaṃtaraṃśubhakarmakuryāt ||
vigrahanigrahabhedanavadhabaṃdhacchedanarupūccāṭāḥ ||

<p. 219>

kṣudrakriyātigaṃḍekāryaṃ viṣaśastravahnikarmādyam || 2 || (-) ||

(dānam) (-) atigaṃḍecavastrāṇām || 1 ||

(333) atha sukarmayogasya svarūpam (-)

sukarmāṇaṃyogamahaṃ dakṣiṇāmukhamāśraye ||
kauṣikānvayasaṃbhūtaṃ japaṃtaṃ lokapūjitam || 1 || 

pāṭalavarṇaḥ || (-) ||

(kṛtyam) (-) 

ayaṃyogassarvakarmasuśubhaḥ ||

citrakarmagṛhasthāpyaṃ kalyāṇaṃbhūparigraham ||
rājābhiṣekakarmāṇisukarmaṇi ca kārayet || 1 || (-) ||

(dānam) (-) pāyasasyasukarmaṇi || 1 ||

(334) atha dhṛtiyogasya svarūpam

dhṛtiyogassadābhūyādātreyānvayasaṃbhavaḥ ||
dakṣiṇāmukhamāsīno vedāmreḍanatatparaḥ || 1 || 

pāṭalavarṇaḥ || (-) ||

(kṛtyam) (-) ayaṃyogassarvakarmasuśubhaḥ ||

prākāratoraṇādinidevālayagṛhāṇi ca ||
vratabaṃdhaṃgajārohaṃ dhṛtiyoge tu kārayet || 1 || (-) ||

(dānam) (-) dhṛtaurajatadānaṃca || 1 ||

(335) atha śūlayogasya svarūpam (-)

śūlanāmāmahānyogo bhavediṣṭārthadomama ||
dakṣiṇāmukha āsīnaḥkuṃḍinānvayasaṃbhavaḥ || 1 || 

pāṭalavarṇaḥ || (-) ||

(kṛtyam) (-) 

ayaṃyogassarvaśubhakarmasuvarjyaḥ ||

athavāpaṃcaghaṭikābhyaḥ paraṃśubhakarmakuryāt ||
vadhabaṃdhāvamānāniripūccāṭanamāraṇe ||
nivāraṇaṃkrūrakarmaśūlayogevidhīyate || 1 || (-) ||

(dānam) (-)  śūlemūlādidānakam || 1 ||

(336) atha gaṃḍayogasya svarūpam (-)

yogostugaṃḍanāmāmeśāṃḍilyānvayasaṃbhavaḥ ||
dakṣiṇāmukha āsīno brahmapāṭhaparāyaṇaḥ || 1 || 

pāṭalavarṇaḥ || (-) ||

(kṛtyam) (-) 

ayaṃyogassarvaśubhakarmasuvarjyaḥ ||

athavāṣaḍghaṭikābhyaḥparaṃśubhakarmakuryāt ||
vāpīkūpataṭākādikhātoccāṭanamāraṇam ||
bāhuyuddhaṃbhṛtyakarmakṣātraṃgaṃḍe praśasyate || 1 || (-) ||

(dānam) (-) gaṃḍemaṃḍanadānaṃca || 1 ||

<p. 220>

(337) atha vṛddhiyogasya svarūpam (-)

vṛddhirvṛddhipradomestukauśikodakṣiṇāmukhaḥ ||
yaściṃtayanparaṃbrahmabrasīmāśrityatiṣṭhati || 1 || 

pāṭalavarṇaḥ || (-) ||

(kṛtyam) (-) ayaṃyogassarvakarmasuśubhaḥ ||

bījāvāpaṃdhanaṃdhānyaṃ vivāhavratabaṃdhanam ||
taṭākasetubaṃdhaṃ ca vṛddhiyoge tu kārayet || 1 || (-) ||

(dānam) (-) vṛddhaugodānamiṣyate || 1 ||

(338) atha dhruvayogasyasvarūpam (-)

dhṛtyaidhruvostu me nityaṃ yogoyaṃ dakṣiṇā mukhaḥ ||
karebibhrannakṣamālāṃ gāyattrīmādarājjapan || 1 || 

pāṭalavarṇaḥ || (-) ||

(kṛtyam) (-) ayaṃyogassarvakarmasuśubhaḥ ||

taṭākavastrālaṃkāraratnabhūṣāgṛhakriyāḥ ||
setubaṃdhanakarmāṇi kuryādyoge dhruvā hvaye || 1 || (-) ||

(dānam) (-) dhruvecapaṃcaratnānām || 1 ||

(339) atha vyāghātayogasya svarūpam (-)

vyāghātaṃśirasānaumi vyāsānvayasamudbhavam ||
pratyaṅmukhopavisṭaṃtaṃ pratyagraravisannibham || 1 || 

pāṭalavarṇaḥ || (-) ||

(kṛtyam) (-) ayaṃyogassarvakarmasuvarjyaḥ ||

athavānavaghaṭikābhyaḥ paraṃśubhakarmakuryāt ||
kuryādvyāghātayoge tu vadhabaṃdhanirodhanam ||
sarvāṇikrūrakarmāṇibhedanoccāṭanāni ca || 1 || (-) ||

(dānam) (-) vyāghātephāṇitasya ca ||
(phāṇitamityasyaguḍamiśrāpūpamityarthaḥ || 1 ||

(340) atha harṣaṇayogasya svarūpam (-)

harṣaṇaṃharṣadaṃvaṃde pratyaṅmukhamudarciṣam ||
paṭhaṃtaṃvedamaniśaṃ kāśyapānvayasaṃbhavam || 1 || 

pāṭalavarṇaḥ || (-) ||

(kṛtyam) (-) ayaṃyogassarvakarmasuśubhaḥ ||

harṣaṇayogekuryādgajavājirathādhirohaṇaṃsatatam ||
vaivāhikāstrasaṃgrahanṛpābhiṣekādyamakhilaśubhakarma || 1 || (-) ||

(dānam) (-) harṣaṇegaṃdhadānaṃsyāt || 1 ||

(341) atha vajrayogasya svarūpam (-)

vajranāmābhavedyogobhāradvājānvayodbhavaḥ ||
pratyaṅmukha upāsīnaḥ paṭhanpraṇavamanvaham || 1 || 

pāṭalavarṇaḥ || (-) ||

(kṛtyam) (-) ayaṃyogassarvaśubhakarmasuvarjyaḥ ||

<p. 221>

athavāghaṭikātrayādūrddhvaṃśubhakarmakuryāt ||
vastrabhūṣaṇabhūkarṣasenādhīśatvamadbhutam ||
śastrasaṃgrahaṇādyaṃ ca vajrayoge praśasyate || 1 || (-) ||

(dānam) (-) vajredadyānmaṇīnapi || 1 ||

(342) atha siddhiyogasya svarūpam (-)

pratyaṅmukhobrahmavaṃśyaḥ siddhissiddhipradostume ||
viṣṭaroparisaṃviṣṭovedāṃtapaṭhanonmukhaḥ || 1 || 

pāṭalavarṇaḥ || (-) ||

(kṛtyam) (-) 

ayaṃyogassarvaśubhakarmasugrāhyaḥ ||

vidyāvivāhavratabaṃdhayajñanṛpābhiṣekakrayavikrayāśca ||
suvarṇamuktāphalabhūṣaṇādi karmāṇisidhyaṃti ca siddhiyoge || 1 || (-) ||

(dānam) (-) siddhausiddhārthakādeyāḥ || 1 ||

(343) atha vyatīpātayogasya svarūpam (-)

smarāmyahaṃvyatīpātaṃ vītihavyānvayoditam ||
pratyaṅmukhaṃ pāṭhayaṃtaṃ vedāñchiṣyānaharniśam || 1 || 

pāṭalavarṇaḥ || (-) ||

prakārāntaraṃdakṣaḥ (-) (parāśaramādhavīye dānaprakaraṇe) (-) 

śaṃkukarṇaḥ pralaṃboṣṭho laṃbabhrūrdīrghanāsikaḥ ||
aṣṭanetraścaturvaktro vistīrṇaḥ śatayojanam || 1 ||

vyatīpātanamastestu somasūryātmajaprabho || (-) ||

(kṛtyam) (-) ayaṃyogassarvakarmasuvarjyaḥ ||

athavātriṃśadghaṭikāparyaṃtaṃ śubhaṃ karmakuryāt ||
dāsyaṃsuvarṇadānaṃ ca dānaṃtīrthaniṣevaṇam ||
ripubhedoviṣātyugraṃ kāryaṃ ca vyatipātake || 1 || (-) ||

(dānam) (-) vyatīpāte ca kāṃcanam || 1 ||

(344)  atha varīyoyogasya svarūpam (-)

varīyānnāmayogoyaṃ varadostu sadā mama ||
pratyaṅmukhaḥ prāṃjalikassāvetasakulodbhavaḥ || 1 || 

pāṭalavarṇaḥ || (-) ||

(kṛtyam) (-) ayaṃyogassarvakarmasuśubhaḥ ||

muktāmaṇikanakāṃbarasarvālaṃkārakaṃkaṇādi ca yat ||
gajaturagādyadhirohaṇamakhilaṃ ca śubhaṃ varīyasi proktam || 1 || (-) ||

(dānam) (-) varīyasitilāndadyāt || 1 ||

<p. 222>

(345) atha parighayogasya svarūpam (-)

udaṅmukhobrahmagotroyogaḥparighanāmakaḥ ||
kailāsaśikharārūḍhosāmagāyanbhavenmayi || 1 || 

pāṭalavarṇaḥ || (-) ||

(kṛtyam) (-) 

ayaṃyogassarvaśubhakarmasuvarjyaḥ ||

athavātriṃśadghaṭikābhyaḥ paraṃśubhaṃ karmakuryāt ||
vivāhayuddhodyamaduṣṭakarmapradveṣaṇoccāṭaviṣaprayogam ||
krūraṃsamastaṃparighasyapūrvadalepikāryaṃ śubhamanyabhāge || 1 || (-) ||

(dānam) (-) śastrāṇiparighe tathā || 1 ||

(343) atha śivayogasyasvarūpam (-)

śivaśśivāyamebhūyācchivārādhanatatparaḥ ||
viṣṇuvaṃśasamudbhūtaḥ ṛgadhyāpanatatparaḥ || 1 || 

pāṭalavarṇaḥ || (-) ||

(kṛtyam) (-) 

asminyoge sarvaśubhakrmāṇi kāryāṇi ||
raśanākaṃṭhamālādibhūṣaṇāṃbaradhāraṇam ||
vivāhādyakhilaṃ yātrā śivayoge praśasyate || 1 || (-) ||

(dānam) (-) jalakuṃbhāśśivedeyāḥ || 1 ||

(347) atha siddhayogasya svarūpam (-)

siddhassiddhipradobhūyātkuṃḍinānvayasaṃbhavaḥ ||
udaṅmukhassvaśiṣyebhyo yajūṃṣisatataṃ paṭhan || 1 || 

pāṭalavarṇaḥ || (-) ||

(kṛtyam) (-)  ayaṃyogaḥsarvakarmasuśubhaḥ ||

grahapratiṣṭhāpanamauṃjībaṃdhavivāhadīkṣānṛpatipratiṣṭhāḥ ||
devapratiṣṭhādi śubhaṃ ca karmasiddhāhvaye sarvamuśaṃti yoge || 1 || (-) ||

(dānam) (-) siddhesidhānnamiṣyate || 1 ||

(348) atha sādhyayogasya svarūpam (-)

sādhyanāmābhavedyogaḥ śokānāmapanuttaye ||
udaṅmukhomahāmaṃtramātharvaṇamanusmaran || 1 || 

pāṭalavarṇaḥ || (-) ||

(kṛtyam) (-) 

ayaṃyogaḥsarvakarmasuśubhaḥ ||

gurudevatāpratiṣṭhāpūjākarmādi havyakarmāṇi ||
sthiracarayātrādyakhilaṃ kāryaṃ sādhyāhvaye yoge || 1 || (-) ||

(dānam) (-) 

sādhyelaṃkaraṇānāṃ ca || 1 ||

<p. 223>

(349) atha śubhayogasya svarūpam (-)

śubhaḥśubhāyamebhūyādvasiṣṭhānvayasaṃbhavaḥ ||
udaṅmukhojapanmaṃtraṃ śaivaṃpaṃcākṣaraṃ śubham || 1 || 

pāṭalavarṇaḥ || (-) ||

(kṛtyam) (-) 

ayaṃyogassarvakarmasuśubhaḥ ||

brahmavidyāmahotsāha bījāvāpanabhūṣaṇam ||
dhanadhānyagṛhodyogaṃ kāryaṃyoge śubhā hvaye || 1 || (-) ||

(dānam) (-) chatradānaṃśubheśubham || 1 ||

(350) atha śuklayogasya svarūpam (-)

śuklonāmamahāyogo yogīsvayamudaṅmukhaḥ ||
pratyagdṛṣṭissadābhūyātkauśikānvayasaṃbhavaḥ || 1 || 

pāṭalavarṇaḥ || (-) ||

(kṛtyam) (-) ayaṃyogassarvakarmasuśubhaḥ ||

lepanaṃbhūṣaṇaṃ caiva rājasaṃdarśanaṃ tathā ||
kanyādānaṃ mahotsāhaṃ śuklayoge ca kārayet || 1 || (-) ||

(dānam) (-) śuklecopānahordānam || 1 ||

(351) atha brahmayogasya svarūpam (-)

brahmābrahmakulodbhūto mahānūrdhvamukhasthitaḥ ||
brahmaṇyāhitadṛṣṭissantapannastu sukhāyame || 1 || 

pāṭalavarṇaḥ || (-) ||

(kṛtyam) (-) 

ayaṃyogaḥ sarva karmasuśubhaḥ ||

caulopanayanaṃ caiva śāṃtikaṃ pauṣṭikaṃ śubham ||
kṛṣividyāsetubaṃdhaṃ yoge brahmā hvaye hitam || 1 || (-) ||

(dānam) (-) śastaṃbrahmaṇisarpiṣaḥ || 1 ||

(352) atha aiṃdrayogasya svarūpam (-)

aiṃdrāyapraṇatirmesyādūrdhvapreritadṛṣṭaye ||
vādhūlānvaya jātāya varadāya sadānṛṇām || 1 || 

pāṭalavarṇaḥ || (-) ||

(kṛtyam) (-) 

ayaṃyogassarvakarmasupraśastaḥ ||

kanyādānaṃgajārohaḥ strīsevāvajrabhūṣaṇam ||
kāvyanāṭakasaṃgītamaiṃdrayoge tu sidhyati || 1 || (-) ||

(dānam) (-) aiṃdre ca dīpakāndadyāt || 1 ||

(353) atha vaidhṛtiyogasya svarūpam (-)

vaidhṛtirnāmayogo sāvūrdhvadṛṣṭiśśubhostume ||
kauṃḍinyagotrajobrahmasaṃsmaranmanasānvaham || 1 || 

pāṭalavarṇaḥ || (-) ||

prakārāntaram (-) (rudrayāmaleśāṃtiprakaraṇe) 

atiraudraṃ mahākāyaṃ śaṃkhavarṇaṃ caturbhujam ||
dadhataṃḍamaruṃ śūlaṃkhaḍgakheṭakadhāriṇam || 1 ||

<p. 224>

mamapūjāṃgṛhāṇemāṃcaṃdrasūryātmajaprabho || (-) ||

(kṛtyam) (-) ayaṃyogaḥ sarvakarmasutyājyaḥ ||
athavāpaṃcacatvāriṃśadghaṭikāparyaṃtaṃ śūbhakarma kuryāt ||
ripuprabhedaṃgaralaprayogabhedāgniśastrādikamugrakarma ||
uccāṭanaṃvaṃcanaśṛṃkhalādikāryaṃ hitaṃvaidhṛtināmayoge || 1 || (-) ||

(dānam) (-) vaidhṛtaukanakaṃhitam || 1 || 27 ||

atha viṣkaṃbhādisaptaviṃśatiyogeṣujātaguṇāḥ (-) (kālaprakāśikāyām) (-)

(viṣkaṃbhe) (-) 

dīrghavairojitāriśca kubjāṃgomadanāturaḥ ||
svataṃtraḥ paśumānmaṃtrī viṣkaṃbhe jāyate naraḥ || 1 ||

(prītau) (-) 

bhūtānāṃ priyavādī ca paradāraratotsukaḥ ||
gurudevādibhaktaśca prītiyogodbhavonaraḥ || 1 ||

(āyuṣmati) (-) 

dīrghajihvoviśālākṣo dhānyagomitraputravān ||
āyuṣmadyogasaṃjātaḥ kīrtimānpaṃḍitassukhī || 1 ||

(saubhāgye) (-) 

matsyaśaṃkhakalāṃkaśca mṛduḥkāmiphalātmakaḥ ||
saubhāgyayogasaṃjāto dhanīsyāt paradeśagaḥ || 1 ||

(śobhane) (-) 

sukhībhoktādhanīmānī mṛdukṛtyo mahodyamaḥ ||
sukopīśobhaneyoge jātobuddhipriyodṛḍhaḥ || 1 ||

(atigaṃḍe) (-) 

kāmīkalāvitsaumyāṃgo dīrghavairītanuḥkṣamī ||
pareṃgitajñomānīsyādatigaṃḍodbhavonaraḥ || 1 ||

(sukarmaṇi) (-) 

suśīloguṇavānbhoktā bahuputrakalatravān ||
puṇyakarmaratoyoge sukarmākhye tu jāyate || 1 ||

(dhṛtau) (-) 

kāmāṃgovākpatiśśrīmāntsaumyaḥ kāmī ca paṃḍitaḥ ||
dhṛtiyogodbhavodhīro bahuvittonnataśśaṭhaḥ || 1 ||

(śūle) (-) 

śūlayogodbhavaḥkopī tejasvīkalahapriyaḥ ||
badhirotitarāṃkāmī dhanīmānī dṛḍhaḥ prabhuḥ || 1 ||

<p. 225>

(gaṃḍe) (-) 

dīrghāśīdīrghadarśī ca tvagdoṣī śyāmalassukhī ||
kunakhīśrutagobhoktā dhanīgaṃḍodbhavaḥ pumān || 1 ||

(vṛdhau) (-) 

dhanadhānyasamṛddhaśca paṃḍitaḥ parivāravān ||
bahuputrakalatrāḍhyastridoṣīvṛddhiyogajaḥ || 1 ||

(dhruve) (-) 

samakāyomahodyogī sthiravāk chleṣmalaḥpaṭuḥ ||
kṣamīcanirdhanomānīdhruvayogodbhavonaraḥ || 1 ||

(vyāghāte) (-) 

kṣiprakopīkṛtaghnaśca janamānyaḥ prabhurdṛḍhaḥ ||
vyāghātayogasaṃjātaḥ putradārādhikoguṇī || 1 ||

(harṣaṇe) (-) 

paradārarataḥkāṃtaḥ kaphātmāpiśunaḥparaḥ ||
pareṃgitajñodhanavānharṣaṇe jāyate naraḥ || 1 ||

(vajre) (-) 

kaṭhinaḥkāminīsaktaḥ kāṃtaḥ kamalalocanaḥ ||
ajayyaḥ vittavāñchrīmānvajrayogodbhavo naraḥ || 1 ||

(siddhau) (-) 

saṃkalpasiddhaśśiṣṭāṃgo jayaśīlaḥ sthiraḥ prabhuḥ ||
śrīmāndhīmānprajāvāṃśca siddhiyogodbhavonaraḥ || 1 ||

(vyatīpāte) (-) 

jayaśīlojitāriśca strīsvabhāvo mahodyamaḥ ||
vyatīpāte narojātastejasvīśītalaḥ priyaḥ || 1 ||

(varīyasi) (-) 

vaṃśavidveṣakomānī naraḥparadhanecchukaḥ ||
pittātmāvittasaṃpanno varyānyogekalatravān || 1 ||

(parighe) (-) 

svataṃtraḥ paravidveṣīkāryavighnakaraśśaṭhaḥ ||
vācācalaśca bhīruśca śrīmānparighayogajaḥ || 1 ||

(śive) (-) 

śāṃtaḥśuddhamanāvidvāndevabrāhmaṇapūjakaḥ ||
dhanavānparivārāḍhyaḥ śivayogodbhavonaraḥ || 1 ||

(siddhe) (-) 

prasiddhaścaiva siddhātmā kīrtidharmaparāyaṇaḥ ||
tridoṣātmādhanībhoktā siddhayoge tu paṃḍitaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 226>

(sādhye) (-) 

pīnagaṃḍaścapiśuno maṃtraviddevatā priyaḥ ||
dhānyavānromaśākārassādhyayoge tu paṃḍitaḥ || 1 ||

(śubhe) (-) 

subhagodhārmikovidvānkāminīvallabhaḥ prabhuḥ ||
śubhayogebhaviṣyajjñaḥ śleṣmalodhanadhānyavān || 1 ||

(śukle) (-) 

kāmīvidvāñchaṭhomūrkhaścaṃcalodhārmikodhanī ||
śuklayoge tu saṃjāto vātaśleṣmātmako naraḥ || 1 ||

(brahmayoge) (-) 

strībhāvaḥ paṃḍitomānīguptakāryo vivekavān ||
brahmayogodbhavaśśreṣṭhaḥ kāṃtaśca dhanadhānyavān || 1 ||

(aiṃdrayoge) (-) 

paropakāraśīlaśca bhaviṣyajjñaśca buddhimān ||
vātātmākṣiprakopī ca śrīmānmāheṃdrayogajaḥ || 1 ||

(vaidhṛtau) (-) 

toyātmā ca naromūrkhaḥ kanakārhaḥkaphātmakaḥ ||
satyavāndhanavāntyāgī vaidhṛtau vikaṭekṣaṇaḥ || 1 || 27 ||

(354) atha yogābhimānidevatānāṃnāmāni (-) 

(jyotiṣaratnākarenāradīye)

yogeśāyamaviṣṇvindudhātṛjīvaniśācarāḥ ||
iṃdratoyāhivahnyarka bhūmarudbhagatoyapāḥ || 1 ||

gaṇeśarudradhanadatvaṣṭṛmitraṣaḍānanāḥ ||
sāvitrīkamalāgaurī nāsatyaupitaroditiḥ || 2 ||

viṣkaṃbhādikayogānāmadhi devavarā amī || 27 ||

atha yogābhimānidevatānāṃsvarūpāṇi (-) (jyotiṣaratnākare)

(355) tatrādau viṣkaṃbhābhimāniyamasya svarūpam (-)

viṣkaṃbhayoganāthaṃtaṃ yamaṃ mahiṣavāhanam ||
daṃḍapāśadharaṃvaṃde dakṣiṇāśāpatiṃ vibhum || 1 || 

nīlavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(356) atha prītiyogābhimāniviṣṇusvarūpam (-)

prītiyogapatiṃviṣṇuṃ garuḍoparisaṃsthitam ||
śaṃkhacakragadāpāṇiṃ vaṃde sarvārthasiddhaye || 1 || 

nīlavarṇaḥ || 

(caturviṃśatimṛrttisthaviṣṇuvat (2) ni(0) || 1 ||

<p. 227>

(357) atha āyuṣmadyogābhimānicaṃdrasvarūpam (-)

āyuṣmadyoganāthaṃtvāṃ somaṃsuragaṇārcitam ||
lakṣmīsahodaraṃvaṃde kṣīrasāgaranaṃdanam || 1 || 

śvetavarṇaḥ || navagrahacaṃdravat (5) nio || 1 ||

(358) atha saubhāgyayogābhimānidhātuḥsvarūpam (-)

saubhāgyayoganetāraṃ dhātāraṃ sarvatomukham ||
akṣasrakkuṃḍikāpāṇi dhyāye tvāṃpāhimāṃ prabho || 1 || 

pāṭalavarṇaḥ || bṛhaspatipratyadhidevatāvat (5)ni(0) || 1 ||

(359) atha śobhanayogābhimānigurusvarūpam (-)

tvaṃhiśobhanayogasya nāthosisurapūjitaḥ ||
jīvamāṃpāhi satatamanayā pūjayā prabho || 1 || 

kanakavarṇaḥ || navagrahasthaguruvat (5) ni(0) || 1 ||

(360) atha atigaṃḍayogābhimāniniśācarasvarūpam (-)

karālavadanaṃ kṛṣṇaṃ yā tu dhānaṃ nṛ vāhanam ||
ūrdhvakeśaṃ virūpākṣamatigaṃḍeśvaraṃ bhaje || 1 || 

nīlavarṇaḥ || dikpālanir(-)ṛtivat (4) ni(0) || 1 ||

(361) atha sukarmayogābhimānīṃdrasvarūpam (-)

sukarmayoganāthastvamiṃdradevagaṇārcitaḥ ||
śacīnāthanamastubhyaṃ pāhimāṃ svarṇanāyaka || 1 || 

kanakavarṇaḥ || lokapāleṃdravat (4) ni(0) || 1 ||

(362) atha dhṛtiyogābhimānyabdevatāsvarūpam (-)

dhṛtiyogādhipā āpaḥpāvanyaḥ pāpanāśikāḥ ||
prāṇadāḥ sarvalokasya pāṃtumāṃ viṣṇusaṃbhavāḥ || 1 || 

śvetavarṇāḥ || paṃcabhūtāsthābdevatāvat (4) ni(0) || 1 ||

(363) atha śūlayogābhimānisarpasvarūpam (-)

śūlayogasyanāthāṃstānahīṃstīkṣṇaviṣānvitān ||
namaskurmassadāśāṃtiṃ prayacchaṃ tu phaṇābhṛtaḥ || 1 || 

śvetavarṇaḥ || rāhvadhidevatāsarpavat (4) ni(0) || 1 ||

(364) atha gaṃḍayogābhimānivahnisvarūpam (-)

gaṃḍayogādhipaṃvahniṃ śaktisruksruvadhāriṇam ||
meghavāhanamārūḍhaṃ dhyāyet sarvārthasiddhaye || 1 ||

<p. 228>

lohitavarṇaḥ || paṃcabhūtasthavahnivat (4) ni(0) || 1 ||

(365) atha vṛddhiyogābhimānyarkkasvarūpam (-)

arkkamatyadbhutākāraṃ vṛddhiyogapatiṃ śubham ||
padmāsanasthaṃ deveśaṃ vaṃde jyotirgaṇeśvaram || 1 || 

siṃdūravarṇaḥ || navagrahasthārkkavat (5) ni(0) || 1 ||

(366) atha dhruvayogābhimānibhūmisvarūpam (-)

mātaraṃsarvalokasya dhruvayogādhidevatām ||
bhūmidevīmahaṃvaṃde mahiṣīṃ śārṅgadhanvanaḥ || 1 || 

śvetavarṇā || paṃcabhūtasthabhūmivat (4) nio || 1 ||

(367) atha vyāghātayogābhimānimarutsvarūpam (-)

dvibhujaṃdhūmravarṇaṃ ca pāśābhaya yutaṃ vibhum ||
vyāghātanāthaṃ marutaṃ mṛgārūḍhamahaṃbhaje || 1 || 

dhūmravarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(368) atha harṣaṇayogābhimānibhagasvarūpam (-)

harṣaṇādhipatiṃvaṃde bhagaṃbhāryādhi daivatam ||
saṃpujayiṣye saṃtuṣṭassamebhīṣṭaṃ prayacchatu || 1 || 

raktavarṇaḥ || uttarānakṣatradevatāvat (5) ni(0) || 1 ||

(369) atha vajrayogābhimāninivaruṇasvarūpam (-)

vajrayogādhipaṃvaṃde varuṇaṃ vāṃchitārthadam ||
nakravāhanamārūḍhaṃ pāśapātramapāṃpatim || 1 || 

kanakavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(370) atha siddhiyogābhimānigaṇeśasvarūpam (-)

siddhiyogeśvaraṃ vaṃde gaṇeśaṃ girijāsutam ||
ekadaṃtaṃ śūrpakarṇaṃ laṃbodaramaharniśam || 1 || 

siṃdūravarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(371) atha vyatīpātayogābhimānirudrasvarūapm (-)

vyatīpātābhidhaṃrudraṃ vṛṣabhoparisaṃsthitam ||
triṇetraṃtripurārātiṃ taṃ vaṃde pārvatīpatim || 1 || 

raktavarṇaḥ || ekādaśarudravat ni(0) (3) || 1 ||

(372) atha varīyoyogābhimānidhanadasvarūpam (-)

varīyasodhipaṃvaṃde dhanadaṃ lokapālakam ||
dhanadhānyābhivṛddhyarthaṃ devaṃ vai śravaṇaṃ vibhum || 1 || 

kanakavarṇaḥ || lokapālasthakuberavat ni(0) (4)

<p. 229>

(373) atha parighābhimānitvaṣṭṛsvarūpam (-)

parigheśamahaṃvaṃde tvaṣṭāraṃ śilpināṃvaram ||
vṛtrāsuraprabhṛtayoyatsutāstaṃ sadāmudā || 1 || 

pāṭalavarṇaḥ || viśvakarmabrahmavat (4) ni(0) || 1 ||

(374) atha śivayogābhimānimitrasvarūpam (-)

śivayogādhipaṃmitraṃ sadāśāṃtaṃ sunirmalam ||
vaṃde devagaṇaśreṣṭhaṃ samebhīṣṭaṃ prayacchatu || 1 || 

raktavarṇaḥ || anūrādhānakṣatradevatāvat (5) ni(0) || 1 ||

(375) atha siddhiyogābhimāniṣaḍānanasvarūpam (-)

ṣaḍānanamahaṃvaṃde siddhayogādhipaṃ vibhum ||
pārvatīnaṃdanaṃdevaṃ devasenādhipaṃ guham || 1 || 

pāṭalavarṇaḥ || aṃgārakapratyadhidevatāvat ni(0) (5) || 1 ||

(376) atha sādhyayogābhimānisāvitrīsvarūpam (-)

sādhyayogesvariṃ devīṃ sāvitrīṃ lokamātaram ||
saptakoṭimahāmaṃtra śreṣṭhāṃvaṃde surārcitām || 1 || 

śvetavarṇā || mādhyāhnikasāvitrīvat ni(0) (5)  || 1 ||

(377) atha śubhayogābhimānilakṣmīsvarūpam (-)

śubhayogeśvariṃ devī kamalāṃkamalālayām ||
vaṃderamāṃpadmamukhīṃ viṣṇuvakṣasthalālayām || 1 || 

kanakavarṇā || viṣṇupatnīlakṣmīvat ni(0) (2) || 1 ||

(378) atha śuklayogābhimānigaurīsvarūpam (-)

śuklayogeśvarīṃ vaṃde sarvalokaikamātaram ||
girirājasutāṃgaurīṃ padamābhayakarānvitām || 1 || 

marakatavarṇā || 1 ||

(379) atha brahmayogābhimānināsatyadevatāsvarūpam (-)

brahmayogasya netārau nāsatyāvaśvinīsutau ||
vaṃdetau devabhiṣajaupustu(sta)kauṣadhipāṇikau || 1 || 

śvetavarṇau || 1 ||

(380) atha aiṃdrayogābhimānipitṛsvarūpam (-)

aiṃdrābhimāninovaṃde sarvalokaikapūjitān ||
pitṝnpiṃḍābhayakarānputrāyuśśrīpradānnṛṇām || 1 || 

dhūmravarṇāḥ || 1 ||

<p. 230>

(381) atha vaidhṛtiyogābhimāniditisvarūpam (-)

vaidhṛtyadhīśvarīṃ devīṃditiṃdaityeṃdramātaram ||
ddibhujāṃpadmahastāṃtāmāyurārogyavṛddhaye || 1 || 

raktavarṇā || 1 || 27 ||

atha babādyekādaśakaraṇānāṃnāmāni (-) (saṃhitārṇave)

bavabālavakaulavataitulagarijavaṇikprabhadrakāḥśakuniḥ ||
atha ca catuṣpānnāgavakiṃstughnākhyānikaraṇāni || 1 ||

atha bavādyekādaśakaraṇānāṃsvarūpāṇi (-) (śaivāgame)

eṣukartavyānikṛtyāni (-) (daivajñavilāse) eṣukarttavyadānānica (-dānaciṃtāmaṇauviṣṇudharmottare)

(382) tatrādau bavakaraṇasyasvarūpam (-)

sadyojātaṃbavākhyānaṃ caṃdrārdhakṛtaśekharam ||
tapasvisaṃghasaṃsevyaṃ karaṇaṃpraṇamāmyaham || 1 || 

śvetavarṇaḥ ||

(kṛtyam) (-) 

carasthiradvijahitavastradhānyākarādiyat ||
dhātuvādavaṇigyānakarmasarvaṃbavehitam || 1 ||

(dānam) (-) bavepāyasadānaṃsyāt || 1 ||

(383) atha bālavakaraṇasyasvarūpam (-)

karaṇaṃbālavākhyaṃ tadvāmadevasamāhvayam ||
netratrayojjvalamukhaṃ namāmi balavṛddhidam || 1 || 

śvetavarṇaḥ ||

(kṛtyam) (-) 

maṃgalotsavayānādi vāstukarmākhilaṃ ca yat ||
nṛpābhiṣekasaṃgrāma kramasidhyati bālave || 1 ||

(dānam) (-) śayyādānaṃcabālave || 1 ||

(384) atha kualavakaraṇasyasvarūpam (-)

aghoraṃkaulavākhyānaṃ carmāṃbaradharaṃśucim ||
namāmimokṣadātāraṃ vedāṃtapratipāditam || 1 || 

śvetavarṇaḥ ||

(kṛtyam) (-) 

yānavāhanasaubhāgyaṃ mitratvaṃ maṃtrasādhanam ||
bālavoktākhilaṃkarma kaulave sidhyati dhruvam || 1 ||

(dānam) (-) kaulavegorasāndadyāt || 1 ||

<p. 231>

(385) atha taitulakaraṇasyasvarūpam (-)

taitulākhyaṃ tatpuruṣaṃ gaṃgodbhāsitamastakam ||
sarvagīrvāṇajaṃ vande putrapautrābhi vṛddhaye || 1 || 

śvetavarṇaḥ ||

(kṛtyam) (-) 

saṃdhivigrahayānādi krayavikrayakarmayat ||
taṭākakūpakhananaṃ kāryaṃtaitulasaṃjñake || 1 ||

(dānam) (-) tilāṃstaitulanāmani || 1 ||

(386) atha garajakaraṇasyasvarūpam (-)

namāmiśirasānityamīśānaṃgarajāhvayam ||
vāmāṃganityasaṃviṣṭahimādritanayojjvalam || 1 || 

śvetavarṇaḥ ||

(kṛtyam) (-) 

bījāvāpaṃ kṛṣiṃ caiva vivāhaṃ bhūparigraham ||
vāstukarmapraveśaṃ ca garaje tu vidhīyate || 1 ||

(dānam) (-) garābhidhānelavaṇam || 1 ||

(387) atha vaṇikkaraṇasyasvarūpam (-)

śivaṃvaṇiksvarūpaṃ taṃ śirasāpraṇamāmyaham ||
pramadāvrataparyaṃkaṃ śūlojjvalakarāṃbujam || 1 || 

śvetavarṇaḥ ||

(kṛtyam) (-) 

mūlakarmākhilaṃdhātu jīvakarmākhilaṃ ca yat ||
uktānuktākhilaṃkarma vaṇijesidhyati dhruvam || 1 ||

(dānam) (-) vaṇijedeyamaṃbaram || 1 ||

(388) atha bhadrakaraṇasya svarūpam (-)

bhadrāyamahatebhūyādbhadrākhyaḥ pārvatīpatiḥ ||
rudrākṣamālikodbhāsikaṃ dharaḥśubhavardhanaḥ || 1 || 

śvetavarṇaḥ ||

prakārāṃtareṇa svarūpamāha śrīpatiḥ (-) (nāradīye) (-) 

asitajaladavarṇādīrghanāsograraṃṣṭrāvipulahanukapolābiṃbikodbaṃdhajaṃghā ||
analaśatasahasraṃcodgiraṃtīsamaṃtātpatatibhuvanamadhyekāryanāśāyaviṣṭiḥ || 1 || 

nīlavarṇā ||

viṣṭerbhujaṃgamākāraṃ kecidicchaṃti dāruṇam ||
bhujaṃgamo mukhebhīmo na tu pucchedvidhocyate || 1 ||

(kṛtyam) (-) (daivajñavilāse) (-)

vadhabaṃdhavihārāstra cchedanoccāṭanāni yat ||
turaṃgamahiṣokṣādi karmaviṣṭyāṃ tu sidhyati || 1 || 

na kuryānmaṃgalaṃviṣṭyāṃ duritāddhi kadācana ||

<p. 232>

śubhakarmāṇisarvāṇi bhadrāyāṃ samudīrayet || 2 ||

asyaiva bhujaṃgākārasya kṛtyeghaṭikāḥ (-) (nāradīye) 

mukhe paṃcagaletvekā vakṣasyekādaśa smṛtāḥ ||
nābhau catasraḥ kaṭyāṃ ṣaṭpucchetisraśca nāḍikāḥ || 1 || (-) ||

(phalam) (-) 

kāryahānirmukhemṛtyurgale vakṣasinissvatā ||
kaṭyāṃbuddhipradānābhau cyutiḥpucche dhruvojayā || 1 ||

niśipurvārdhajāviṣṭirdivācā'parataḥ śubhā ||
kramāgatā tu yā viṣṭiḥ saivahālāhalopamā || 2 || (-) ||

(dānam) (-) viṣṭaucaṣaṣṭikānnāni || 1 ||

(389) atha śakunikaraṇasya svarūpam (-)

virūpākṣamahaṃvaṃde śakunīti kṛtā hvayam ||
ārogyadaṃpraṇamatāṃ jaṭāmaṃḍalamaṃḍitam || 1 || 

śvetavarṇaḥ ||

(kṛtyam) (-) 

śāṃtikaṃpauṣṭikaṃ caiva mūlamaṃtrauṣadhāni ca ||
devatāpūjanaṃ caiva śakunau tu praśasyate || 1 ||

(dānam) (-) śakunausarpirevaca || 1 ||

(390) atha catuṣpātkaraṇasya svarūpam

catuṣpāditisaṃjñāya nīlakaṃṭhāya śaṃbhave ||
amarastutyapādābjayugalāyanamonayaḥ || 1 || 

śvetavarṇaḥ ||

(kṛtyam) (-) 

gokāryaṃ tṛṇakāryaṃ ca brāhmaṇānāṃ ca bhojanam ||
tarpaṇaṃ devatānāṃ ca catuṣpadi vidhīyate || 1 ||

(dānam) (-) madhudānaṃcatuṣpadri || 1 ||

(391) atha nāgavakaraṇasya svarūpam (-)

nāgacarmāṃbaradharaṃnāga vākhyamumāpatim ||
dhyāyetsamastasiddhyarthamuttuṃgavṛṣavāhanam || 1 || 

śvetavarṇaḥ ||

(kṛtyam) (-) 

ugrakarmaripūccāṭaṃ māraṇaṃ mohanaṃ tathā ||
vedhastu vaṃcanaṃ krūraṃ nāgavecātraśasyate || 1 ||

(dānam) (-) dānaṃnāgecavāsasām || 1 ||

(392) atha kiṃstughnakaraṇasya svarūpam (-)

namasyāṃkara vai nityaṃ kiṃstughnākhyāya śūline ||
bhasmoddhūlita dehāya vedāṃta kṛtaśarmaṇe || 1 || 

śvetavarṇaḥ ||

<p. 233>

(kṛtyam) (-) 

evānnabhojanaṃ caiva bhūṣaṇaṃ bhūparigraham ||
śobhanaṃśubhakarmāṇi kiṃstughne tu praśasyate || 1 || (-) ||

(dānam) (-) dānaṃpriyaṃgoḥkiṃstughne || 1 || 11 ||

atha bavādyekādaśakaraṇeṣu jātānāṃ guṇāḥ (-) (kālaprakāśikāyām)

tatrādau (bave) (-) 

prakhyātavibhavācāro mṛduścaiva sukhīdṛḍhaḥ ||
vakrāṃgo nṛpapūjyaśca bavajātodhanādhipaḥ || 1 ||

(bālave) (-) 

bālavekaraṇejāto bālakṛtyaḥ pratāpavān ||
gobhūmivittabhṛtyāḍhyo nīcakṛtyo mahodyamaḥ || 1 ||

(kaulave) (-) 

gajāśvārohaṇedakṣaḥ sadācāraparaḥ prabhuḥ ||
mātāpitrorvidheyaśca daiṣṭikaḥ kaulavodbhavaḥ || 1 ||

(taitule) (-) 

snigdhāṃgaḥ prabhusevī ca dharmajño duṣṭa ceṣṭitaḥ ||
taitulekaraṇejāto mṛduvākpāṭhakaḥ sukhī || 1 ||

(garaje) (-) 

dūradarśīpratāpī ca nirbhayorājavallabhaḥ ||
garajekaraṇejāto jitaśatrurjanapriyaḥ || 1 ||

(vaṇije) (-) 

caturaḥśrutavānvīta krodhovikrayapaṃḍitaḥ ||
guptakṛtyoti muṃḍaśca vaṇije karaṇe nṛpaḥ || 1 ||

(viṣṭyām) (-) 

pāpiṣṭho nirbhayaścaiva tvasahiṣṇuḥ parājitaḥ ||
svataṃtraḥ karaṇe viṣṭyāṃ jātolubdhastu caṃcalaḥ || 1 ||

(śakunau) (-) 

unnasaśca bhaviṣyajñaḥ kuladveṣīkhalaḥ kṛśaḥ ||
śakunau paritoṣī ca gobhūmiparivārakaḥ || 1 ||

(catuṣpadi) (-)

asthiraḥkaluṣodhūrtaḥ krūravākcaiva durmatiḥ ||
nānāciṃtā kulorogī kāṃtaḥsyāccacatuṣpadi || 1 ||

(nāgavati) (-) 

vidvāṃśca dīrghavairī ca kṣiprakopo dhanānvitaḥ ||
vikaṭāṃgo guṇīmānī nāge jātolpabhugbhavet || 1 ||

<p. 234>

(kiṃstughne) (-) 

hāsyakṛtyaḥ kalābhijño dyūtajñaḥ śauryakṛtyavit ||
kiṃstughne karaṇe jāto bhogītyāgī naraḥ sukhī || 1 || 11 ||

atha bavādikaraṇābhimānidevatānāmāni (-) (jyotiṣaratnākarenāradīye)

kramaśaḥkaraṇādhīśāḥ sahasrākṣaḥ prajāpatiḥ ||
mitrākhyaḥ pitarobhūmiḥ śrīrviṣṇuśca yamastathā || 1 ||

māṇibhadrodaṃdaśūkovāyurekādaśasmṛtāḥ || 1 ||

atha bavādikaraṇābhimānināṃ svarūpāṇi (-) (jyotiṣaratnākare)

(393) tatrādau bavābhimānīṃdradhyānam (-)

iṃdraṃbavasyanetāraṃgajavāhanasaṃsthitam ||
vajrāṃkuśābhītikaraṃ naumīṃdrāṇī manoharam || 1 || 

kanakavarṇaḥ || lokapāleṃdravat ni(0) (4)  || 1 ||

(394) atha bālavābhimāniprajāpatidhyānam (-)

bālavasya ca netāraṃ prajānāṃpatimavyayam ||
akṣasruksruvakuṃḍāḍhyaṃ vaṃdemāṃpātusonvaham || 1 || 

pāṭalavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(395) atha kaulavābhimānimitradhyānam (-)

caṃdraṃśītalayaṃ taṃ taṃ kaulavādhīśvaraṃ ravim ||
gadāvaradahastaṃ ca vaṃdehaṃ divaseśvaram || 1 || 

raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(396) atha taitulābhimānipitṛdevatādhyānam (-)

taitulādhīśvarānvaṃde pitṝṁllokaikapūjitān ||
saṃtuṣṭāḥ pitaromahyaṃ bhaveyurvāñchitārthadāḥ || 1 || 

nīlavarṇaḥ || maghānakṣatradevatāvat ni(0) (5) || 1 ||

(397) atha garijābhimānibhūmidhyānam (-)

gari(ra)jādhīśvarīṃbhūmiṃ devīṃvāñchitadāyikām ||
namasyāmi sadāsāmāṃ rakṣatācchūbhakārikā || 1 || 

śvetavarṇā || paṃcabhūtasthabhūmivat ni(0) (4) || 1 ||

(398) atha vaṇijābhimāniramādhyānam (-)

vaṇijeśīmahaṃvaṃderamāṃgaruḍavāhanām ||
śaṃkhacakravarābhīti pāṇiṃseṣṭaṃprayacchatu || 1 || 

kanakavarṇā || 1 ||

<p. 235>

(399) bhadrābhimāniyamadhyānam (-)

yamaṃbhadreśvaraṃbhīmaṃ mahāmahiṣasaṃsthitam ||
daṃḍapāśadharaṃvaṃde dakṣiṇāśāpatiṃ vibhum || 1 || 

nīlavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(400) atha śakunyabhimāniviṣṇudhyānam (-)

viṣṇuṃdevamahaṃvaṃde khageśaṃkhagavāhanam ||
śaṃkhacakragadāśārṅga dhāriṇaṃ naumisarvadā || 1 || 

nīlameghavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(401) atha catuṣpādabhimānimāṇibhadradhyānam (-)

māṇibhadramahaṃvaṃde catuṣpāttithināyakam ||
yakṣeśvarasya sainyeśaṃsamebhīṣṭaṃ prayacchatu || 1 || 

nīlavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(402) atha nāgavābhimānisarpadhyānam (-)

nāgavasyeśvarānnāgānnānābhīṣṭapradānnṛṇām ||
vaṃdetānāyurārogyaputrapautrābhi vṛddhaye || 1 || 

śubhravarṇaḥ || aṣṭanāgasthaśeṣavat ni(0) (4) || 1 ||

(403) atha kiṃstughnābhimānivāyudhyānam (-)

kiṃstughnasyādhipānvāyūntsaptasaptamahābalān ||
khaḍgacarmadharānvaṃde vāñchitārthāndiśaṃ tu me || 1 ||  

dhūmravarṇaḥ || 1 ||  11 ||

(404) atha tyājyasvarūpam (-) (rudrayāmalekuhūkalpe)

kharānanaṃsiṃhagalaṃ tripādaṃśuṣkodaraṃ kruddhabhujaṃga netram ||
kapālapāśāṃkuśalāṃgalāḍhyahastaṃ sadālokabhayaṃkaraṃ ca || 1 ||

ṛkṣeṣurāśyādiṣu nartayaṃ taṃ namāmi varjyaṃ śavavāhanaṃ tam || 

nīlavarṇaḥ ||

prakārāṃtaram (-) (śaunakīyeśāṃtiprakaraṇe) 

jvalatpāvakakeśāṃtāṃ nīlameghasamaprabhām ||
bhūṣaṇairāyasaireva bhūṣitāṃbhīmarūpiṇīm || 1 ||

daṃṣṭrākarālavadanāṃ mahiṣoparisaṃsthitām ||
saṃyuktāmaṣṭabhirhastaiḥ khaḍgaśūlagadāmiṣām || 2 ||

pāśadaṃḍāṃkuśadharāṃ nārācādyā yudhāni ca ||
dhārayaṃtīṃ mahākāyāṃ mūrtiṃ kṛttvā vibhīṣaṇām || 3 ||

daṃṣṭrādaṣṭādharoṣṭhāṃ tāṃ varāhārāsthibhūṣaṇām ||
evaṃvidhasvarūpaṃ vai kṛtvā pātre nyaset tataḥ || 4 || 

(tatraprathamaghaṭikādevatārudraḥ ||

<p. 236>

(dvitīyaghaṭikādevatāyamaḥ || tṛtīyaghaṭikādevatā agniḥ || turīyaghaṭikādevatāmṛtyuḥ || 1 ||

(405) athaitanmṛtyusvarūpam (-)

daṃṣṭrākarālavadano nīlāṃjanasamākṛtiḥ ||
pāśakhaḍgāṃkuśagadāpāṇirmṛtyuḥsadāvatu || 1 || 

nīlavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(406) atha amṛtalakṣaṇam (-) (āyurvedataṃtre)

madhurarasasametaṃkṣuttṛḍāśānivāraṃ jananamaraṇavārdhakyādi doṣāpanodam ||
divijajanasusevyaṃ śuklavarṇaṃ mahaujastadamṛtaśubhadaivaṃ sarvadābhāvayāmi || 1 || 

śuklavarṇam || 1 ||

(407) atha gulikasvarūpam (-) (jyotiṣaratnākare)

nīlāṃjanaprakāśo raktākṣo vimalalocanodīrghaḥ ||
paṃcāsyaḥpṛthudaṃṣṭrobhallakaraḥkharavahogulikaḥ || 1 || 

nīlavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(408) atha mahāpātasvarūpam (-) (jyotiṣaratnākare)

sakṛṣṇodāruṇavapurlohitākṣo mahodaraḥ ||
sarvāriṣṭakaroraudro bhūyobhūyostu me hṛdi || 1 || 

kṛṣṇavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(409) atha vyatīpātasvarūpam (-) (jyotiṣārṇave)

kaṃṭhaṃte lohitasthānaśśvetagrīvaśśubhānanaḥ ||
śubhamāṃjiṣṭhavasano nīlavarṇavibhūṣitaḥ || 1 ||

aṣṭādaśabhujopeto bhrukuṭīkuṭilānanaḥ ||
pātraṃprathamahaste tu dvitīye loṣṭha bhedanam || 2 ||

akṣasūtraṃ tṛtīye tu turīyeṇa gadādharam ||
paṃcame śṛṃkhalāṃhaste ṣaṣṭhe kavacameva ca || 3 ||

saptamemudgaraṃhaste paṃkajaṃ cāṣṭame kare ||
navame caiva kuddālaṃ śrṛṃgikāmādimottare || 4 ||

pātraṃ dvitīyake caiva śṛṃgaṃ haste tṛtīyake ||
caturthekārmukaṃ pāṇau paṃcamekartrikāmapi || 5 ||

musalāṃ tu kareṣaṣṭhe saptame śarameva ca ||
aṣṭame ca dhvajaṃ haste navamakukkuṭaṃśaye || 6 ||

dadhānovairividhvaṃsī dhvastaye caiva mṛtyave || 

nīlavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 237>

(410) atha vyaprapātasvarūpam (-) (jyotiṣārṇve)

caṃdrārkayornayanavīkṣaṇajātamūrtiḥ kālānaladyutinibhaḥpuruṣotiraudraḥ ||
śastrānvitobhuvipatanvinirīkṣyamāṇaḥ kāryāṃtakānvitanutevyatipātayogaḥ || 1 || 

raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(411) atha vaiprapātasvarūpam (-) (jyotiṣaratnākare)

dīrghabāhurmahāraudrastīkṣṇadaṃṣtro mahotkaṭaḥ ||
vaiprapātamidaṃrūpaṃ sadyomaraṇakāraṇam || 1 || 

nīlavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(412) atha janmanakṣatrasvarūpam (-) (jyotiṣaratnākare)

janmarkṣaṃkrūrarūpaṃ karadhṛtakalaśaṃ prasphurallolajihvaṃ dīptākṣaṃtāmravarṇaṃ jvaladurudaśanodagradaṃṣṭrākarālam || 1 ||

yuktaṃbhaumārkabhedairasakṛdapivarābhītimālāvahaṃtaṃ pūjāmaṃtraistu dānairdvijavaravacanaiḥ prītidaṃ bhāvayāmi || 2 || 

raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(413) atha paṃcasaṃvatsarātmakayugābhimānidevatānāṃnāmāni (-) (muhūrtagaṇapatau)

ādausaṃvatsarojñeyo yugaścānaladaivataḥ ||
bhānumaddaivataḥ prokto dvitīyaḥ parivatsaraḥ || 1 ||

idāvatsarasaṃjñaśca tṛtīyaḥ somadaivataḥ ||
anuvatsarakaścaiva prājāpatyaḥ samīritaḥ || 2 ||

tathaivedvatsarogaurī daivataḥ sa tu paṃcamaḥ ||
yugaṃ taiḥ paṃcabhirvaṛṣaiḥ ṣaṣṭi dvādaśabhiryugaiḥ || 3 || 5 ||

atha dvādaśayugābhimānidevatānāṃnāmāni (-) (muhūrtagaṇapatau)

tadīśāvahnijīveṃdrapāśabhṛttvaṣṭṛsaṃjñakāḥ ||
ahirbudhnyaśca pitaro viśvedevā niśākaraḥ || 1 ||

puruhūtānalaudasraubhagaścaite kramātsmṛtāḥ || 12 ||

atha saṃvatsaraparivatsarādipaṃcanāmāni (-) (mahograrathaśāṃtaukālamādhavīye ca)

prabhavādivatsarāṇāṃ pañcānāṃ caivamevasaṃjñāssyuḥ ||
saṃvatsaraparivatsaramiticedāvatsaraścaiva || 1 || 

anuvatsaraśca tasmātparataścedvatsaroṃnteyaḥ || 5 ||

<p. 238>

atha brāhmādimānabhedānāha (-) (sūryasiddhāṃtemānādhyāye)

brāhmaṃdaivaṃ tathāpitryaṃ prājāpatyaṃ ca gauravam ||
sauraṃ ca sāyanaṃ cāṃdramārkṣaṃ mānāni vai nava || 1 || 9 ||

atha brāhmādimānānāṃ svarūpāṇi (-)

(414) tatrādau brāhmamānasvarūpam (-)

nakṣatradyuniśocchedo brāhmaḥkalpa udāhṛtaḥ ||
tatomakarasaṃkrāṃte ravessyāduttarāyaṇam || 1 || 1 ||

(415) atha daivamānasya svarūpam (-)

karkyādestu tathaivasyāt ṣa(-)emāsādakṣiṇāyanam ||
surāsurāṇāmanyonya mahorātraṃ viparyayāt || 1 || 1 ||

(416) atha pitryamānasya svarūpam (-)

paśyaṃtipitarassūryaṃ pārśvayostrigra(gṛ)hasthitam ||
triṃśatātithibhirmāsaścāṃdraḥpitryamahaḥ smṛtam || 1 || 1 ||

(417) atha prājāpatyamānasya svarūpam (-)

manvaṃtaravyavasthācaprājāpatyamudāhṛtam || 1 ||

(418) atha bārhaspatyamānasya svarūpam (-)

bārhaspatyenaṣaṣṭyabdo jñeyonānyaistu nityaśaḥ ||
prakārāṃtareṇa kārtikādīnivarṣāṇiguruyuktodayāstataḥ || 1 || 1 ||

(etānipaṃcamānāni dharmaśāstrānupayuktāni ||
anyāni tu catvāryupayuktāni)

cturbhirvyavahārotrasauracāṃdrarkṣasāvanairityukteḥ ||

(419) atha sauramānasya svarūpam (-)

saurastusaṃkrāṃtivaśāddinasya || 1 ||

(420) atha nākṣatramānasya svarūpam (-)

nākṣatramiṃdorbhagaṇabhramācca || 1 ||

<p. 239>

(421) atha sāvanamānasya svarūpam (-)

triṃśaddinaṃsāvanamāsaḥ || 1 ||

(422) atha cāndramānasya svarūpam (-)

ādyadinādamāṃtaṃkhalucāṃdramāhuḥ || 1 || 9 ||

atha prabhavādyabdeṣumānaniyamāḥ (-)

gṛhyategurumānenaprabhavādyabdalakṣaṇam ||
tattanmāsairdvādaśabhistattadabdo bhaveddhruvam || 1 ||

atha saurādicaturmānopayogamāha (-) (vṛddhavasiṣṭhaḥ)

saureṇadyuniśormānaṃ ṣaḍaśīti mukhāni ca ||
ayane viṣuve caiva saṃkrāṃteḥ puṇyakālatā || 1 ||

tithiḥkaraṇamudvāhakṣauraparvakriyāstathā ||
vratopavāsayātrādi kriyācāṃdreṇa gṛhyate || 2 ||

nakṣatranāmnāmāsāstu jñeyāḥparvāttya yogataḥ ||
sāvanānisyuretāni yajñakālavidhistutaiḥ || 3 ||

sūtakādiparicchedo dinamāsābdapāstathā || 4 ||

(viṃdhyasyottaradeśebārhaspatyamānābdogrāhyaḥ taddakṣiṇadeśe cāṃdramānābdo grāhyaḥ draviḍadeśe tu sauramānābdo grāhyaḥ || 3 || )

atha meṣādidvādaśarāśisvarūpāṇi (-) (śaivāgame) varṇādayaḥ (bṛhajjātake)

(423) tatrādau meṣarāśisvarūpam (-)

tīkṣṇaśṛṃgadharaṃdīrghaṃ sadāghaṃṭā virājitat ||
raktākṣaṃ kuṃcitapadaṃ meṣaṃ hṛdivibhāvaye || 1 || 

raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(424) atha vṛṣabharāśisvarūpam (-)

maṃdarācalasaṃkāśaṃ tīkṣṇaśṛṃga dvayānvitam ||
kakudvirājamānāṃsaṃ vṛṣabhaṃ hṛdibhāvaya || 1 || 

śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(425) atha mithunarāśisvarūpam (-)

parasparānurāgāḍhyamanyonya sadṛśā kṛti ||
anyonyā śliṣṭahastābjaṃ mithunaṃ hṛdibhāvaye || 1 || 

haridvarṇam || 1 ||

<p. 240>

(426) atha karkaṭakarāśisvarūpam (-)

vāripūrāṃtaracaraṃṣaḍaṃghriṃ lohite kṣaṇam ||
kukṣivinyastavadanaṃ dhyāyāmihṛdikarkaṭam || 1 || 

pāṭalavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(427) atha siṃharāśisvarūpam (-)

caṃḍāṭṭahāsaṃbhayadaṃ daṃtimastakabhedinam ||
dīrghalāṃgūlasaṃyuktaṃ siṃhaṃ hṛdivibhāvaye || 1 || 

dhūmrapāṃḍaravarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(428) atha kanyārāśisvarūpam (-)

patimuddiśyasadṛśaṃ tapasyaṃtīṃbhitāśanām ||
pūrṇacaṃdramukhīṃkāṃtāṃ kanyāṃ hṛdivibhāvaye || 1 || 

citravarṇā || 1 ||

(429) atha tulārāśisvarūapm (-)

padārthamānasidhyarthaṃ brahmaṇākalpitāṃ purā ||
tuletināmnavikhyatāṃ saṃkhyārūpāmupāsmahe || 1 || 

kṛṣṇavarṇā || 1 ||

(430) atha vṛścikarāśisvarūpam (-)

hālāhalasamāyuktaṃ nīlatoyadasannibham ||
ātolyamānapucchāgraṃ vṛścikaṃ hṛdibhāvaye || 1 || 

kanakavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(431) atha dhanūrāśisvaūpam (-)

īṣannamitakoṭyagradṛḍhajyābhedanānvitam ||
āropitograbāṇāgraṃ dhanurhṛdivibhāvaye || 1 || 

piṃgalavarṇam || 1 ||

(432) atha makararāśisvarūpam (-)

aṃbhodhighorajaṭharakṛtabhūyiṣṭhakhelanam ||
jalajaṃ tu pratibhayaṃ makaraṃ hṛdibhāvaye || 1 || 

karburavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(433) atha kuṃbharāśisvarūpam (-)

sauvarṇaratnakhacitaṃ sudhāpūrābhipūritam ||
vainateyajavānītaṃ kuṃbhaṃ hṛdivibhāvaye || 1 || 

dhūmravarṇaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 241>

(434) atha mīnarāśisvarūapam (-)

nimeṣahīnanayanaṃ sphuritaṃ vāridherjale ||
mamābhīṣṭasyasiddhyarthaṃ mīnaṃhṛdivibhāvaye || 1 || 

śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 || 12 ||

atha meṣādidvādaśalagneṣukṛtyāni (-) (daivajñavilāse)

tatrādau (meṣalagne) (-) 

abhiṣekovirodhaścātodyakārānibaṃdhanam ||
dāruṇaṃsāhasorājñāṃ meṣalagne praśasyate || 1 ||

(vṛṣabhe) (-) 

sthiracarakāryaṃ hyakhilaṃvivāhavāstvādi kanyakāvaraṇam ||
kṣetrāraṃbhaṇamakhilaṃ bhūṣaṇaśilpādikaṃ vṛṣabhe || 1 ||

(mithune) (-) 

meṣavṛṣoktaṃkarma dviradahayoṣṭrādhirohaṇaṃ karma ||
adhikaṃ māhiṣameṣakṣitipatisevādikaṃ mithune || 1 ||

(karkaṭe) (-) 

vāpīkūpataṭākādi vāribaṃdhanamokṣaṇam ||
pauṣṭikaṃkarmayatkiṃcit sarvaṃsidhyatikarkiṇi || 1 ||

(sihme) (-) 

kṛṣivāṇijyapaṇyādi nṛpasevābhiṣecanam ||
dhātvākarādimeṣoktaṃ kuryāt siṃhodaye sadā || 1 ||

(kanyāyām) (-) 

bhūṣaṇamaṃgalakāryaṃ tvauṣadhavijñānapaṇyaśilpādi ||
udvāhaśāṃtipauṣṭikagajaturagoṣṭrādikanyāyām || 1 ||

(tulāyām) (-) 

kaṣikarmavaṇijyeha yātrākarmatulodaye ||
prasidhyaṃti ca sarvāṇi tulābhāṃḍāśritāni ca || 1 ||

(vṛścike) (-) 

dāruṇaṃsāhasaṃcograṃ rājasevābhiṣecanam ||
cauryakṛtyaṃ sthirāraṃbhaṃ kartavyaṃ vṛścikodaye || 1 ||

(dhanuṣi) (-) 

maṃgalā'sevasaṃgrāmaśilpacitrakalākriyāḥ ||
vastrāstrakṛṣivāṇijyaṃ kartavyaṃ kārmukodaye || 1 ||

(makare) (-) 

vāribaṃdhanamokṣaṃ ca tadyaṃtrākṣe tu karmayat ||
nārīcatuṣpādādīnāṃ grahaṇaṃ syān mṛgodaye || 1 ||

<p. 242>

(kuṃbhe) (-) 

vājībhakṛṣiśilpādyaṃ toyaratnādyakaṃ ca yat ||
sthirabhūṣaṇavāstvādyaṃ kartavyaṃ ca ghaṭodaye || 1 ||

(mīne) (-) 

jalabaṃdhanajalamokṣaṇayātrāratnādi bhūṣaṇaṃ karma ||
rathaturagoṣṭrapaśūnāṃkāryaṃ mīnodayeśreṣṭham || 1 || 12 ||

(435) atha rāśīnāṃsvarūpāṇi (-) (bṛhajjātake)

matsyaughaṭīnṛmithunaṃsagadaṃsavīṇaṃcāpīnarośvajaghanomakaromṛgāsyaḥ ||
taulīsasasya dahanāplavagā ca kanyāśeṣāssvanāmasadṛśāḥ khacarāśca sarve || 1 || 12 ||

atha meṣādidrekkāṇasvarūpam (-) (bṛhajjātake)

(436) tatrādau meṣaprathamadvitīyatṛtīyadrekkāṇānāṃsvarūpāṇi (-)

(ādyaḥ) (-) 

kaṭyāṃsitavastraveṣṭitaḥ kṛṣṇaḥ śakta ivābhirakṣaṇe ||
raudraḥparaśuṃsamudyataṃ dhatteraktavilocanaḥ pumān || 1 || 

puruṣaḥ | kṛṣṇavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(dvitīyaḥ) (-) 

raktāṃbarābhūṣaṇasaktacittākuṃbhodarāvājimukhītṛṣārtā ||
caraikapādena ca meṣamadhyadrekkāṇarūpaṃ yavanopadiṣṭam || 1 || 

strī | raktavarṇā || 2 ||

(tṛtīyaḥ) (-) 

krūraḥ kalājñaḥ kapilaḥ kriyārthībhagnavratohyudyatadaṃḍahastaḥ ||
raktānivastrāṇibibharti caṃḍomeṣetṛtīyaḥ kathitastribhāgaḥ || 1 || 

pumān | kapilavarṇaḥ || 3 || 1 ||

(437) atha vṛṣabhaprathamadvitīyatṛtīyadrekkāṇānāṃsvarūpāṇi (-)

(ādyaḥ) (-) kutsitalūnakacāghaṭadehādagdhapaṭā tṛṣitāśanacittā ||
ābharaṇānyabhivāṃchatigaurīrūpamidaṃ prathamaṃ vṛṣabhasya || 1 || 

strī | gauravavarṇā || 1 ||

(dvitīyaḥ) (-) 

kṣetradhānyagṛhadhenukalājñolāṃgalesaśakaṭekuśalaśca ||
skaṃdhamudvahati gopatitulyaṃkṣutparo'javadano malavāsāḥ || 1 || 

puruṣaḥ | śvetavarṇaḥ || 2 ||

(tṛtīyaḥ) (-) 

dvipasamakāyaḥpāṃḍaradaṃṣṭraśśarabhasamāṃghriḥpiṃgalamūrtiḥ ||
avimṛgalomāvyākulacitto vṛṣabhavarasya prāṃtagatoyaḥ || 1 || 

puruṣaḥ | kanakavarṇaḥ || 3 || 2 ||

<p. 243>

(438) atha mithunaprathamadvitīyatṛtīyadrekkāṇānāṃsvarūpāṇi (-)

(ādyaḥ) (-) 

sucyāśrayaṃsamabhivāṃchatikarmanārīrūpānvitā bharaṇakāryakṛtādarā ca ||
hīnātmajā ṛtumatīmṛdudīrghabāhurādyaṃ tṛtīyabhavanasya vadaṃtitajjñāḥ || 1 || 

strī || haridvarṇā || 1 ||

(dvitīyaḥ) (-) 

udyānasaṃsthaḥkavacī dhanuṣmāñcharāstradhārīgaruḍonnasaśca ||
krīḍātmajālaṃkaraṇāttacittaṃkaroti madhyemithunasyacāyam || 1 || 

puruṣaḥ | haridvarṇaḥ || 2 ||

(tṛtīyaḥ) (-) 

bhūṣitovaruṇavadbahuratnairbaddhatūṇakavacassadhanuṣkaḥ ||
nṛttavādanakalāsucavidvānkāvyakṛnmithunarāśyavasāne || 1 || 

puruṣaḥ | haridvarṇaḥ || 3 ||

(439) atha karkaṭakaprathamadvīiyatṛtīyadekkāṇānāṃsvarūpāṇi (-)

(ādyaḥ) (-) 

patramulaphalabhugdvipakāyaḥ kānane malaye śarabhāṃghriḥ ||
kroḍatulyavadanohayakarṇaḥkarkaṭeprathamarūpamuśaṃti || 1 || 

puruṣaḥ || pāṭalavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(dvitīyaḥ) (-) 

padmārcitāmūrdhanibhābhiyuktāstrīkarkaśāraṇyatalevirauti ||
śākhāṃpalāśasyasamāśritā ca madhyasthitā karkaṭakākhyarāśeḥ || 1 || 

strī || pāṭalavarṇā || 2 ||

(tṛtīyaḥ) (-) 

bhāryābharaṇārthamarṇavaṃnaustho gacchatisarpaveṣṭitaḥ ||
haimaiśca yutovibhūṣaṇaiścipiṭāsyoṃtya gataśca karkaṭe || 1 || 

puruṣaḥ | pātalavarṇaḥ || 3 || 4 ||

(440) atha siṃhaprathamadvitīyatṛtīyadrekakāṇānāṃsvarūpāṇi (-)

(ādyaḥ) (-) 

śālmaleruparigṛdhrajaṃbukauśvānaraśca malināṃbarā vṛtaḥ ||
rautimātṛpitṛviprayogatassiṃharūpamidamādyamucyate || 1 || 

puruṣaḥ | dhūmrapāṃḍuvarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(dvitīyaḥ) (-) 

hayākṛtiḥpāṃḍaramālyaśekharobibharti kṛṣṇājinakaṃ balaṃ naraḥ ||
durāsadassiṃha ivāttakārmukonatāgranāsomṛgarājamadhyaḥ || 1 || 

puruṣaḥ | dhūmrapāṃḍuvarṇaḥ || 2 ||

<p. 244>

(tṛtīyaḥ) (-) 

ajānanovānaratulyaceṣṭobibhartidaṃḍaṃpahalamāmiṣaṃ ca ||
kūrcimanuṣyaḥ kuṭilaiścakeśairmṛgeśvarasyāṃtyagatatribhāgaḥ || 1 || 

puruṣaḥ | dhūmrapāṃḍuvarṇaḥ || 3 || 5 ||

(441) atha kanyāprathamadvitīyatṛtīyadrekkāṇānāṃsvarūpāṇi (-)

(ādyaḥ) (-) 

puṣpaprakīrṇena ghaṭenakanyāmālāsu dīrghāṃbarasaṃvṛtāṃgī ||
vastrārthasaṃyogamabhīpsamānāguroḥ kulaṃgacchatikanyakādyā || 1 || 

strī | citravarṇā || 1 ||

(dvitīyaḥ) (-) 

puruṣaḥpragṛhītalekhanīśyāmo vastraśirāvyayāyakṛt ||
vipulaṃ ca bibhartikārmukaṃ romavyāptatanuśca madhyamaḥ || 1 || 

puruṣaḥ |  śyāmavarṇaḥ || 2 ||

(tṛtīyaḥ) (-) 

gaurīsudhautāgradukūlayuktāsamucchritākuṃbhagatāgrahastā ||
devālayaṃ strīprayatāpravṛttāvadaṃti kanyāṃtyagata tribhāgam || 1 || 

kanakavarṇaḥ || 3 || 6 ||

(442) atha tulāprathamadvitīyatṛtīyadrekkāṇānāṃsvarūpāṇi (-)

(ādyaḥ) (-) 

vīthyaṃtarāpaṇagatopuruṣastulāvānunmānamānakuśalaḥ pratimānahastaḥ ||
bhāṃḍaṃviciṃtayati tasya ca mūlyametadrūpaṃ vadaṃti yavanāḥ prathamaṃ tulāyāḥ || 1 || 

puruṣaḥ | kṛṣṇavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(dvitīyaḥ) (-) 

kalaśaṃvinigṛhyaviniṣpatitassamabhīpsati gṛdhramūkhaḥ puruṣaḥ ||
kṣudhitastuṣitaśca kalatrasutānmanasaiti tulādharamadhyagataḥ || 1 || 

puruṣaḥ | kṛṣṇavarṇaḥ || 2 ||

(tṛtīyaḥ) (-) 

vibhīṣayaṃstiṣṭhatiratnacitrite vanemṛgīkāṃcanatūṇacarmabhṛt ||
dhanurdharovānararūpabhṛnnarastulāvasāne yavanairudāhṛtah || 1 || 

puruṣaḥ | kṛṣṇavarṇaḥ || 3 || 7 ||

(443) atha vṛścikaprathamadvitīyatṛitīyadrekkāṇānāṃsvārūpāṇi (-)

vastrairupetābharaṇaiśca nārīmahāsamudrātsamupaitikūlam ||
sthānacyutāsarpanibaddhapādāmanoramā vṛścikarāśipūrvā || 1 || 

strī | svarṇavarṇā || 1 ||

(dvitīyaḥ) (-) 

sthānasukhānyābhivāṃcchatinārībhrtṛkṛtebhujagāvṛtadehā ||

<p. 245>

kacchapakuṃbhasamānaśarīrāvṛścikamadhyamarūpamuśaṃti || 1 || 

strī | svarṇavarṇā || 2 ||

(tṛtīyaḥ) (-) 

pṛthulacipiṭakūrmatulyavaktraḥ śvamṛgasṛgālavarāhabhītikārī ||
avati ca malayākarapradeśaṃ mṛgapatiraṃtyagataśca vṛścikasya || 1 || 

puruṣaḥ | svarṇavarṇaḥ || 3 ||

(444) atha dhanuḥprathamadvitīyatṛtīyadrekkāṇānāṃsvarūpāṇi (-)

(ādyaḥ) (-) 

manuṣyavaktrośvasamānakāyo dhanurgṛhītvāyatamāśramasthaḥ ||
kratūpayuktānitapasvinaścara rakṣapūrvodhanuṣastribhāgaḥ || 1 || 

puruṣaḥ | piṃgalavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(dvitīyaḥ) (-) 

manoramācaṃpakatulyavarṇābhadrāsane tiṣṭhatimadhyarūpā ||
samudraratnānivighaṭṭayaṃtīmadhyastribhāgodhanuṣaḥpradiṣṭaḥ || 1 || 

strī | kanakavarṇaḥ || 2 ||

(tṛtīyaḥ) (-) 

kūrcīnarohāṭakacaṃpakābhovarāsanedaṃḍadharoniṣaṇṇaḥ ||
kauśeyakānyudvahate'jinaṃ ca tṛtīyarūpaṃ dhanuṣaśca rāśeḥ || 1 || 

puruṣaḥ | kanakavarṇaḥ || 3 || 9 ||

(445) atha makaraprathamadvitīyatṛtīyadrekkāṇānāṃsvarūpāṇi

(ādyaḥ) (-) 

romacitomakaropamadaṃṣṭrassūkarakāyasamānaśarīraḥ ||
yotrakajālakabaṃdhanadhārīraudramukhomakaraprathamaśca || 1 || 

puruṣaḥ | karburavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(dvitīyaḥ) (-) 

kalāsvabhijñābjadalāyatākṣī śyāmā ca citrāṇi ca mārgamāṇā ||
vibhūṣaṇālaṃkṛtalohakarṇāyoṣāpradiṣṭāmakarasyamadhye || 1 || 

strī | śyāmavarṇā || 2 ||

(tṛtīyaḥ) (-) 

kinnaropamatanussakaṃbalastūṇacāpakavacaissamanvitaḥ ||
kuṃbhamudvahatiratnacitritaṃskaṃdhagaṃ makararāśipaścimaḥ || 1 || 

puruṣaḥ || karburavarṇaḥ || 3 || 10 ||

<p. 246>

(446) atha kuṃbhaprathamadvitīyatṛtīyadrekkāṇānāṃsvarūpāṇi (-)

(ādyaḥ) (-) 

snehamadyajalabhojanāmiṣavyākulīkṛtamanāssukaṃbalaḥ ||
kośakāravasano'jināvṛtogṛdhratulyavadanoghaṭādikaḥ || 1 || 

puruṣaḥ | babhruvarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(dvitīyaḥ) (-) 

dagdheśakaṭesaśādvalelohādyāhara teṃganāvane ||
malinenapaṭenasaṃvṛtābhāṃḍairmūrdhagataissamadhyamaḥ || 1 || 

strī | babhruvarṇā || 2 ||

(tṛtīyaḥ) (-) 

śyāmassarojaśravaṇaḥ kirīṭītvakpatraniryāsaphalaṃbibharti ||
bhāṃḍānilohavyatimiśritānisaṃcārayatyaṃtya gatoghaṭasya || 1 || 

puruṣaḥ | śyāmavarṇaḥ || 3 || 11 ||

(447) atha mīnaprathamadvitīyatṛtīyadrekkāṇānāṃsvarūpāṇi (-)

(ādyaḥ) (-) 

sragbhāṃḍamuktāmaṇiśaṃkhamiśrairvyākṣiptahastassubibhūṣaṇaśca ||
bhāryāvibhūṣārthamapāṃnidhānenāvaṃplavatyādigatojhaṣasya || 1 || 

puruṣaḥ | śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(dvitīyaḥ) (-) 

atyucchritadhvajapatākamupaitipotaṃ kūlaṃprayātijaladheḥ parivārayuktā ||
varṇenacaṃpakanibhā pramadātribhāgo mīnasya caiva kathito munibhirdvitīyaḥ || 1 || 

strī | kanakavarṇā || 2 ||

(tṛtīyaḥ) (-) 

śvabhrāṃtike sarpaviveṣṭitāṃgovastrairvihīnaḥ puruṣastvaṭavyām ||
corānalavyākulitāṃtarātmāvikrośate cāṃtyagatojhaṣasya || 1 || 

puruṣaḥ | śvetavarṇaḥ || 3 || 12 ||

(448) atha ahorātrasya svarūpam (-) (nṛsiṃhaprāsāde)

ahorātrābhidhaścātra kṛṣṇagrīvodvimūrdhakaḥ ||
ākaṃṭhapādāṃtakacodvibhujo dīrghagodhikaḥ || 1 ||

sāmicaṃdrajaṭāmauliḥ piṃgalastu sulocanaḥ ||
bhrūmaṃḍalālakopetaḥ kṛṣṇaśubhrāṃśukānvitaḥ || 2 ||

arkaṃdakṣe dadhānoyaṃ vāme caiva vidhuṃ tathā ||
iṣṭāpūrtasya sidhyarthaṃ pūjanīyo manīṣibhiḥ || 3 || 

kanakavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 247>

(449) atha divāsvarūpam (madanaratne)

varābhayakaraṃvaṃde dvibhujaṃpadmasaṃsthitam ||
śvetavastradharaṃ devaṃ jaṭāvalkaladhāriṇam || 1 ||

pārāvatārohiṇaṃ taṃ sarvābharaṇabhūṣitam ||
padmavaktraṃ śuklavarṇaṃ divārūpaṃ vibhāvayet || 2 ||

(divādhidevatāsūryaḥ prasidhaḥ navagrahasthasūryavat ni(0) (5)  || 1 ||

atha divākartavyakṛtyāni (-) (mādhavīye)

nāmapuṃsavanaṃkṣauraṃ bījoptiḥsthāpanādikam ||
rājābhiṣekamannādyaṃ vidyāraṃbhopanāyanam || 1 ||

gṛhapraveśasīmaṃta śrāddhādyāśca divoditāḥ ||

(450) atha rātrisvarūpam (-) (madanaratne)

caturbhujāṃtrinayanāṃ sarvābharaṇabhūṣitām ||
pāśāṃkuśadhanurbāṇa dharāṃcaṃdranibhānanām || 1 ||

bheruṃḍavāhanīṃ dhyāyedrātrimabjakalāyutām ||
(taddevatācaṃdraḥ prasiddhaḥ navagrahasthacaṃdravat ni(0) (5) || 1 ||

atha rātrikartavyakṛtyāni (-) (smṛtimuktāphaledharmaśāstre)

mitrasyasaṃdarśanamagni kāryaṃvadhupraveśaṃ ca vivāhakarma ||
garbhāntarādhānabaligrahārcāḥ kuṃbhapratiṣṭhā hyabhicārakarma || 1 ||

piśācabādhāvinivartanaṃ ca jāte tadājātakakarma kūryāt ||

(451) atha saṃdhyānāṃ svarūpāṇyāhabharadvājaḥ (-) (mādhavīye)

paiśācīpaścimāsaṃdhyā prāksaṃdhyā raudrikocyate ||
rākṣasī cārdharātre syādbrāhmīmadhyāhna ucyate || 1 || 4 ||

atha saṃdhyāsuvarjyakāryāṇyāhamanuḥ (-) (bhaṭṭabhāskarīye)

catvārīmānikarmāṇi saṃdhyāyāṃ parivarjayet ||
āhāraṃ maithunaṃ nidrāṃ svādhyāyaṃ caiva nityaśaḥ || 1 ||

āhārājjāyatevyādhirgarbhasrāvaśca maithunāt ||
nidrātojāyate'lakṣmīḥ svādhyāyādāyuṣaḥ kṣayaḥ || 2 ||

(452) atha prātassaṃdhyāyāḥ svarūpam (-) (śaivāgame śekhare)

prātassaṃdhyāmahaṃnaumi ravibiṃbakarāṃ śubhām ||
śvetāruṇābhāṃ yuvatiṃ nānābharaṇabhūṣitām || 1 || 

pāṭalavarṇā || 1 ||

<p. 248>

(453) atha sāyaṃsaṃdhyāyāḥ svarūpam (-) (śaivāgame śekhare)

sāyaṃsaṃdhyāmahaṃnaumi caṃdraviṃbakarāṃśubhām ||
kuṃkumāruṇavarṇābhāmunnasāṃcitrabhūṣaṇām || 1 || 

siṃdūravarṇā || 1 ||

(454) atha mahākālasvarūpam (-) (śaivāgame)

vikīrṇavadanaṃkālaṃ bhayānakamariṃdamam ||
pāśahastāliromāṇaṃ namāmiśirasāvibhum || 1 || 

kṛṣṇavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(455) atha ugradevatāyāḥ svarūpam (-) (śaivāgame)

karālāsyaṃ virūpākṣamugraṃvyāghravarasthitam ||
śūlaṃcaḍamṛgaṃpāṇau bibhrāṇaṃ hṛdibhāvaye || 1 || 

raktavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(456) atha mṛtyudevatāyāḥ svarūpam (-) (śaivāgame)

pāśakhaḍgāṃkuśagadābhāsamānakarāṃbujam ||
gīrvāṇagaṇavaṃdyāṃghriṃ mṛtyuṃ mahiṣavāhanam || 1 || 

nīlavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(457) atha kuhvāḥsvarūpam (-) (rudrayāmale)

dhyāyāmyahaṃkuhūṃdevīṃ bhīmamūrtiṃyamodbhavām ||
jvalatpāvakakeśāṃtāṃ nīlameghasamaprabhām || 1 ||

bhūṣaṇairāyasairevabhūṣitāṃ bhīmarūpiṇīm ||
daṃṣṭrākarālavadanāṃ mahiṣoparisaṃsthitām || 2 ||

triṇetrāmaṣṭabhirhastaiḥ khaḍgaśūlavarāṃkuśān ||
kheṭakā'gnyabhayāhīṃdrāndakṣavāmakrameṇa hi || 3 ||

dhārayaṃtīṃ mahākāyāmūrdhvabhrūkuṭile kṣaṇām ||
kuhūṃkuhūviṣodbhūtarūpiṇīṃ praṇamāmyaham || 4 || 

nīlavarṇā || 1 ||

(458) atha kṛtyāyāḥsvarūpam (-) (pāṃcarātre)

triśūlabhīṣaṇāṃhastaissaptabhistribhiraṃghribhiḥ ||
jihvayāraktayādīptaṃ lelihānānijaṃmukham || 1 ||

udgiraṃtīvanetrābhyāmājyasiktaṃhavirbhujam ||
narāsthimālāṃbibhrāṇāmekhalīkṛtapannagām || 2 ||

kapālakuṃḍalopetāṃ prahasaṃtīṃ bhayānakām ||
daṃḍaṃghaṃṭāṃ tathāśurpaṃ mārjanīṃ pāśakuṃḍike || 3 ||

bibhratīṃ laṃbamānābhyāṃ stanābhyāṃ muktamūrdhajām ||
adhirūḍhāṃ naraskaṃdhamaṃdhakārasamākṛtim || 4 ||

<p. 249>

sphuliṃgamaṃḍalasthāṃ ca vimuktāṭopabhīṣaṇām ||
evaṃ rūpadharāṃ kṛtyāṃ namāmi ripunāśinīm || 5 || 

kṛṣṇavarṇā || 1 ||

(459) atha mahākṛtyāyāḥ svarūpam (-) (śābarataṃtre)

kṛṣṇavarṇāṃ mahākāyāṃ kṛṣṇakuṃcitamūrdhajām ||
dakṣiṇādhaḥ karekhaḍgaṃ dakṣordhve paraśuṃ tathā || 1 ||

vāmordhvepyaṃkuśaṃ caiva vāmādhaśca gadāṃsadā ||
bibhrāṇāṃ ca mahākṛtyāmarcayecchatrunāśinīm || 2 || 

kṛṣṇavarṇā || 1 ||

(460) atha rākāyāḥ svarūpam (-) (rudrayāmale)

rākāsphaṭikasaṃkāśā śaśārūḍhā caturbhujā ||
varābhayāmṛtakalāmudrā amṛtakuṃḍikām || 1 ||

dadhānāsarvadāpātu muktāhāravibhūṣitā || 

śvetavarṇā || 1 ||

(461) atha sinīvālyāḥ svarūpam (-) (rudrayāmale)

kṛṣṇavarṇāṃ caturhastāmakṣasūtraṃ kamaṃḍalum ||
varadābhayapāṇiṃ ca sinīvālīmahaṃbhaje || 1 || 

kṛṣṇavarṇā || 1 ||

(462) atha kālarāhoḥ svarūpam (-) (śaivāgame)

kālarāhuṃsarpapadaṃ tarakṣvāsyaṃ mahātanum ||
lokābhīṣṭapradaṃdhyāye sarvāriṣṭanivṛttaye || 1 || 

kṛṣṇavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(463) atha apasmārasya svarūpam (-) (siddhāṃtaśekhare)

śyāmābhoraktakeśaśca bhūtarūpākṛtistathā ||
vāmahaste tu phaṇinaṃ dakṣiṇe phaṇimudrikam || 1 ||

vedāṃgulena ṣaṭtriṃśattryaṃgulaṃ tasya connatiḥ || 

śyāmavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

atha pañcadaśānāṃ divārātramuhūrtānāṃsvarūpāṇi (-) (nṛsiṃhaprāsāde)

(464) tatrādau divāraudramuhūrtasya svarūpam (-)

tatrādimasturaudrākhyaḥ śyāmaḥ śvetāruṇacchaviḥ ||
śvetavastro mahātuṃgo dakṣiṇe sarpamādadhat || 1 ||

vāmepātraṃ sudhāpūrṇaṃ kṣudrakarmaprasiddhaye || 

śyāmavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 250>

(465) atha divāśvetamuhūrtasya svarūpam (-)

śvetābhidhodvitīyastu śvetavarṇo mahodaraḥ ||
śvetaśoṇābhavastroyaṃ śvetamuktāvibhūṣaṇaḥ || 1 ||

dakṣiṇepaṃkajaṃśubhraṃ vāme caiva kamaṃḍalum ||
dadhānobhūtayepūjyo yogavṛddhyai sukhāya ca || 2 || 

śubhravarṇaḥ || 2 ||

(466) atha divājayamuhūrtasya svarūpam (-)

tṛtīyotrajayākhyastu kṛṣṇaśubhro mahātanuḥ ||
dakṣiṇepaṃkajaṃnīlaṃ vāme sarpaṃ mahāphaṇam || 1 ||

bibhradvijayabhogāyapūjanīyo janādhipa || 

nīlameghavarṇaḥ || 3 ||

(467) atha divā āryabhaṭṭamuhūrtasya svarūpam (-)

turīyaścārya bhaṭṭākhyo nīlaśubhro mahābalaḥ ||
dakṣiṇe pustakaṃ haste vāme caiva triśūlakam || 1 ||

dadhānaḥ śreyase bhūtyai vijayāya sukhāya ca || 

nīlameghavarṇaḥ || 4 ||

(468) atha divāsāvitramuhūrtasya svarūpam (-)

adhunaivaṃ ca sāvitraḥ paṃcamaḥ kathyate mayā ||
śvetavastromecakābho mahāsattvasamanvitaḥ || 1 ||

pustakaṃdakṣiṇehaste vāmekuṃbhaṃ tu nirvraṇam ||
dadhadrogavināśāya pūjanīyo hyaharniśam || 2 || 

kṛṣṇavarṇaḥ || 5 ||

(469) atha divāvirājamuhūrtasya svarūpam (-)

virājaścātra vai ṣaṣṭhaḥ śyāmavarṇo jaṭādharaḥ ||
dakṣiṇe tu karedaṃḍaṃ vāme caivā bhayaṃkare || 1 ||

bibhradvalāyasaukhyāya pūjanīyoti bhaktitaḥ || 

śyāmavarṇaḥ || 1 || 6 ||

(470) atha divāgaṃdharvamuhūrtasya svarūpam (-)

saptamaścātragaṃdharvastāmravarṇaḥ kṛśojaṭī ||
dakṣiṇe vallakīṃ pāṇau vāme śaktiṃ ca kārayet || 1 ||

saukhyavṛddhyaiyaśo vṛddhyai pūjanīyoti bhaktitaḥ || 

raktavarṇaḥ || 1 || 7 ||

(471) atha divā abhijinmuhūrtasya svarūpam (-)

adhunācābhijinnāma kathyate hyaṣṭamaḥ śubhaḥ ||
pītavarṇoti hrasvastu tāmravastro mahodaraḥ || 1 ||

<p. 251>

tulāhastadvayopetaḥ pūjanīyassukhāptaye ||

sa evakutupo (-) nāmavijñātavyomanīṣibhiḥ || 2 ||

pitṝṇāṃsupriyaścaiva piṃḍahastothavāpyayam || 

pītavarṇaḥ || 8 ||

(472) atha divārauhiṇeyamuhūrtasya svarūpam (-)

navamorauhiṇeyākhyo(ṇākhyastu) muhūrtaḥ kathyatedhunā ||
śubhravarṇoviśālākṣo nīlavaddhemakuṃḍalaḥ || 1 ||

dakṣiṇepaṃkajaṃpāṇau vāmemodakameva ca ||
dadhānaśśubhasaṃpattyai vijayārogyasiddhaye || 2 || 

śubhravarṇaḥ || 9 ||

(473) atha divāgadādharamuhūrtasya svarūpam (-)

adhunākathyate vatsa daśamastu gadādharaḥ ||
gauravarṇoruṇaśśveta vasanaśśveta kuṃḍalaḥ || 1 ||

dakṣiṇe tu kareśaṃkhaṃ vāme paṃkajamādadhat || 

gauravarṇaḥ || 10 ||

(474) atha divāvijayamuhūrtasya svarūpam (-)

ekādaśodhunājñeyo muhūrtto vijayābhidhaḥ ||
hemavarṇo bṛhatphālaḥ kṛṣṇaśvetāruṇāṃśukaḥ || 1 ||

akṣasūtraṃkaredakṣe vāme caiva kamaṃḍalum ||
dadhatprajñāsukhāptyarthaṃ pūjanīyovipaścitām || 2 || 

hemavarṇaḥ || 11 ||

(475) atha divānair(-)ṛtyamuhūrtasya svarūpam (-)

nair(-)ṛtyākhyodhunājñeyo dvādaśastu muhūrtakaḥ ||
nīlavarṇojaṭāmauliḥ pītavastro mahābalaḥ || 1 ||

dakṣiṇe tu kare cakraṃ vāme cābhayamādadhat || 

nīlavarṇaḥ || 12 ||

(476) atha divāśatamakhamuhūrtasya svarūpam (-)

trayodaśobhavedatraraktaḥśatamakhābhidhaḥ ||
raktavastro mahorasko ratnahemasukuṃḍalaḥ || 1 ||

śoṇapaṃkajadakṣastu vāmekuṃḍīsamanvitaḥ || 

raktavarṇaḥ || 13 ||

(477) atha divātaruṇamuhūrtasya svarūpam (-)

muhūrtaḥ kathyate cātrataruṇākhyaścaturdaśaḥ ||
muktāphalanibhaścaiva muktāhāravibhūṣitaḥ || 1 ||

dhanurbāṇadharaścaiva jānīyācca sukhāptaye || 

śvetavarṇaḥ || 14 ||

(478) atha divāsubhagamuhūrtasya svarūpam (-)

athapaṃcadaśojñeyaḥ subhagastu haripriyaḥ ||
nīlaśvetāruṇaprāṃtavasanonīlakuṃḍalaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 252>

dakṣiṇe tu dhvajojñeyo vāme pātraṃ sudhāyutam || 

nīlavarṇaḥ || 15 ||

(479) atha rātrimuhūrtānāṃsvarūpāṇi (-)

(nṛsiṃhaprāsādevākyaiḥ śaivāgame mayukhe pāñcarātre kāraṇāgame ca ślo0)

(480) tatrādaurātrau atiraudramuhūrtasya svarūpam (-)

atiraudraḥprathamaḥ (-) (rudravat ni(0) (3) ||

(śaivāgame) (-) 

caṃdrāvataṃso jaṭilastriṇetro bhasmapāṃḍuraḥ ||
hṛdayasthaḥ sadābhūyādbhargobhayavināśanaḥ || 1 || 

śyāmavarṇaḥ || ekādaśarudrasthabhargavat ni(0) (3) || 1 ||

(481) atha rātraumahāgaṃdharvarājamuhūrtasya svarūpam (-)

mahāgaṃdharvarājodvitīyaḥ (gaṃdharvavat ni0) (4) || (-) ||

(śaivāgame) (-) 

kalyāṇarūpogaṃdharvo gāṃdharvāgama tatparaḥ ||
vīṇāvādanatattvajño pakṣavānaruṇaḥ smṛtah || 1 || 

aruṇavarṇaḥ || 2 ||

(482) atha rātraudraviṇaparivṛḍhamuhūrtasya svarūpam (-)

draviṇaparivṛḍhaḥ tṛtīyaḥ (kuberavat ni(0) (4) ||

(mayukhe) (-) 

aśvārūḍhaḥ kuṃtapāṇiḥ kuberaścitriṇī priyaḥ ||
nidhīśvaraḥ svarṇavarṇodhanadorūpavānprabhuḥ || 1 || 

svarṇavarṇaḥ || dikpālakuberavat ni(0) (4) || 3 ||

(483) atha rātrauśrāvaṇamuhūrtasya svarūpam (-)

śrāvaṇaścaturthaḥ (viṣṇuvat ni(0) (2) || (-) ||

(mayūkhe) (-) 

viṣṇuḥkaumodakīpadma śaṃkhacakradharaḥ kramāt ||
pradakṣiṇaṃ dakṣiṇādhaḥ karādārabhya nityaśaḥ || 1 || 

dhautavarṇaḥ || caturviṃśatimūrtisthaviṣṇuvat ni(0) (2)  || 4 ||

(484) atha rātrauvāyumuhūrtasya svarūpam (-)

vāyuḥpaṃcamaḥ (vāyuvat ni(0) (4) || mayūkhe)

