sārakṣetre (sāranāthaṃ) śaraṇye (śaraṇābhidham || 28 ||

nibiḍe (nibiḍākāraṃ) (mallāriṃ) maṇimaṃṭape ||
(jagadīśaṃ) dhanuṣkoṭyāṃ madhurāyāṃ tu (suṃdaram || 29 ||

mohapuryāṃ (kālamehgaṃ) kurukāyāṃ (ramāsakham ||
goṣṭhī pure (goṣṭhapatiṃ) (balāḍhyaṃ) bhramarasthale || 30 ||

dhanvimaṃgalake (śauriṃ) (viṣṇuṃ) viṃdyādvaṭasthale ||
sthale tu darbhaśayane vasaṃtaṃ (darbhaśāyinam || 31 ||

kuraṃge tu (mahāpūrṇaṃ) kṛṣṇānadyāma (thācyutam ||
anaṃtaśayane devaṃ (padmanābhaṃ) manoharam || 32 ||

(bhargākhyaṃ) bhārgavasthānelatakādumahāsthale ||
(ādinārāyaṇaṃ) devamevamaṣṭotaraṃśatam ||
yassmaret satataṃbhaktayācetasānanyagāminā || 33 ||

savidhūyāśusaṃsārabaṃdhānyāti hareḥ padam ||
aṣṭottaraśataṃviṣṇossthānāni paṭhatāsvayam || 34 ||

adhītāḥsakalāvedāḥ kṛtāśca vividhāmakhāḥ ||
avagāḍhānitirthānijñātaḥ sabhagavānhariḥ || 35 ||

saṃpāditā tathāmuktiḥ paramānaṃda dāyinī || 108 || 116 ||

