<p. 272>

atha aṣṭasvayaṃvyaktamūrtayaḥ (-)

ādyesvayaṃ ca vyaktesminvimāneraṃgasaṃjñite ||
śrīmuṣṭeveṃkaṭādrau ca sāligrāme ca naimiśe (ṣe || 1 ||

totādraupuṣkare caiva naranārāyaṇā śrame ||
aṣṭaumemūrtayassaṃti svayaṃvyaktā mahītale || 2 ||

atha dvivyadeśacatuṣṭayaślokaḥ (-) (śrīrāmānujācāryoktaḥ)

śrīraṃgamaṃgalamaṇiṃ karuṇānivāsaṃ śrīveṃkaṭādriśikharālayakālamegham ||
śrīhastiśailaśikharojjvalapārijātaṃ śrīśaṃ namāmi śirasāyaduśailadīpam || 1 ||

atha prapattisopānam (-)

pāṃḍyakṣitaukuṃḍinanāmapuryāṃtulākhyamāsetulamūlatāre ||
śayyābhujaṃgātmatayāpratītaṃ (śrīsaumyajāmātṛmuniṃ) prapadye || 1 ||

kāsārabhūtamahadāhvayabhaktisārāntseveśaṭhārikulaśekharaviṣṇucittān ||
bhaktāṃghrireṇumunivāhacatuṣkavīṃdrānmādhuryakāvyatulasī(-) prabhavānyatīṃdrān || 2 ||

yodvāparāṃteśravaṇethakāṃcyāṃ hemāṃbujādāśvayujākhyamāse ||
śrīpāṃcajanyojani (divyayogī) sarobhidhānaṃ śaraṇaṃ prapadye || 3 ||

māsethatasminvasubhevatīrṇaṃ pāresamudraṃpurimallanāmnyām ||
(bhūtābhidhanaṃ) munimutpalāṃtācchrīmadgadāṃśaṃśaraṇaṃprapadye || 4 ||

tanmāsijātaṃśatatārakāyāṃ māyūrapūryāṃ maṇikairavāṃtāt ||
bhaktyāmahāṃśaṃ (mahadāhvayaṃ)taṃ śrīnaṃdakāṃśaṃ śaraṇaṃ prapadye || 5 ||

taiṣyemahīsārapuremagharkṣejajñesurastrībhuvibhārgaveṇa ||
sudarśanāṃśaṃyamudārakīrtiṃtaṃ (bhaktisāraṃ) śaraṇaṃ prapadye || 6 ||

madhyekalidvāparayossahasraṃ varṣāṇisaptaivavivartyabhūmau ||
saudarśanīṃmūrtimupāgataṃcataṃ (bhaktisāraṃ) śaraṇaṃ prapadye || 7 ||

ādaukalerhikurikāpuripāṃḍyadeśe vaiśākhamāsimaghavānalabheṃśajātam ||
senāpateḥpadajakārigṛhevatīrṇaṃ śrīśāspadaṃ (śaṭharipuṃ) śaraṇaṃ prapadye || 8 ||

punarvasaukolapurethamāghe kṛtāvatāraṃ ghanakeraleṣu ||
śrīkaustubhāṃśaṃ (kulaśekharākhyaṃ) sārakṣitīśaṃśaraṇaṃ prapadye || 9 ||

śrīdhanvinavyākhyapure nṛyugmamāsemarudbhegraśikhāpratītam ||
garutmadaṃśaṃśvaśuraṃmurāreḥ (śrīviṣṇucittaṃ) śaraṇaṃ prapadye || 10 ||

<p. 273>

colakṣitaudhanuṣimāsimaheṃdratāreyaḥ prādurāsavaradovanamālikāṃśāt ||
raṃgeśakelisukhamūrdhvaśikhaṃdvijeṃdraṃ (bhaktāṃghrireṇu) managhātmaguṇaṃ prapadye || 11 ||

kāverītaṭaniculapureṃtyavaṃśerohiṇyā vilasativṛścikevatīrṇam ||
śrīvatsāṃśakaphaṇiśāyibhaktibhājaṃpāṇākhyaṃ (varamunivāhanaṃ) prapadye || 12 ||

caturthavarṇe cyutaśārṅgaśaktyākṛtodayaṃ kārtikakṛttīkāyām ||
raṃgeśakaiṃkairyataraṃgitāṃśaṃ (catuṣkavīṃdraṃ) śaraṇaṃ prapadye || 13 ||

pāṃḍyakṣamāyāṃprathitāvatāraṃ caitrasthacitroḍujamūrdhvacūḍam ||
gaṇāṃśabhājaṃ (madhuraṃkavīṃdraṃ) śaṭhāriśiṣyaṃ śaraṇaṃ prapadye || 14 ||

śucimāsipuṇyabhuvipūrvaphalgunīghanabhenavīnatulasīvanāṃtarāt ||
udetāmudāraguṇaraṃganāyakaprivavallabhāṃ (vasumatī) mupāsmahe || 15 ||

toṃḍīrorvyāmāsurīnāmnivaṃśecaitrārdrāyāṃśeṣabhogīṃdraśaktyā ||
śrīśodaṃcaddarśanasthāpanārthaṃ prādurbhūtaṃ (bhāṣyakāraṃ) prapadye || 16 ||

svasminyasminyāmunenadvayākhyaṃ madhyemārgaṃ dṛṣṭarāmānujāya ||
guptaṃratnaṃ lokarakṣā nimittaṃyodātprītyāta(nmahāpūrṇe)mīḍe || 17 ||

siṃhānanāṃśabhavamīśvarayogasidhaumuktāmaṇiṃ mahitanāthamunīṃdrapautram ||
prajñāviśeṣanilayaṃprativāditūlajhaṃjhānilaṃ hṛdayaciṃtaya(yāmunārya)m || 18 ||

vādenajitvāthanṛpārdharājyaṃ cakre viraktaṃ bhuviyāmunaṃyaḥ ||
taṃ (rāmamiśraṃ) kumudākṣaśaktiṃ padmākṣaśiṣyaṃ śaraṇaṃ prapadye || 19 ||

śrīnāthayogīṃdramakhādavāpya śaṭhārisūktiṃ suragānabhaṃgyā ||
hṛṣṭaṃjayatsena vipaścidaṃśaṃ (śrīpuṃḍarīkākṣa)mahaṃprapadye || 20 ||

colakṣitauśoṭṭakulāvataṃsa dvijottamādīśvara pūrvabhaṭṭāt ||
dīptodayaṃ divyagajānanāṃśaṃ bhaktāgragaṃ (nāthamuniṃ) prapadye || 21 ||

natvāśaṭhārimakhilāgamasārasūktiṃ senāpatiṃmurajidaṃghrisakhaṃ niṣevya ||
padmāmaśeṣajagatāṃ jananīṃ praṇamya śrīkāṃta(mādipuruṣaṃ) śaraṇaṃ prapadye || 22 ||

prapattisopānamidaṃ paṭhaṃti śṛṇvaṃti ye nityamananya cittāḥ ||
teṣāṃ harernityavibhutisaudhasukhāvahārohaṇamūrjitaṃ syāt || 23 ||

<p. 274>

(1) atha ūrdhvapuṃḍradhāraṇavidhānam (-) (śrutismṛtipurāṇeṣu)

tatratāvanmahopaniṣadi (-)

dhṛtordhvapuṃḍraḥ parameśitāraṃ nārāyaṇaṃ sāṃkhyayogādhi gamyam ||
jñātvāvimucyetanarassamastaissaṃsārapāśairiti caiva viṣṇum || 1 ||

(kaṭhaśākhāyām) (-)

dhṛtordhvapuṃḍraḥ kṛtacakradhārī viṣṇuṃparaṃ dhyāyati yo mahātmā ||
svareṇamaṃtreṇa sadāhṛdisthaṃ parātparaṃ yanmahato mahāṃtam || 1 ||

(atharvaṇe) (-)

hareḥpādākṛtimātmanohitāya madhyecchidramūrdhvapuṃdraṃ yo dhārayati saparasya priyo bhavati || 

sapuṇyabhāgbhavati | samuktibhāgbhavati ||

(brahmāṃḍe) (-)

grahastho brahmacārī ca vānaprasthastathā yatiḥ ||
avaśyaṃdhārayennityamurdhvapuṃḍraṃ suśobhanam || 1 ||

(2) atha ūrdhvapuṇḍradhāraṇayogyapaṃcamṛttikāḥ (-) (brahmāṇḍādau)

parvatāgrenadītīre mama kṣetre viśeṣataḥ ||
siṃdhutīre ca valmīke tulasīmūlasaṃśrite || 1 ||

mṛda etāstu saṃgrāhyāḥ varjāhyanyatramṛttikāḥ || 5 ||

atha dhṛtordhvapuṇḍrasthadevatāḥ (-) (pādmottarakhaṃḍe ekatriṃśedhyāye)

lalāṭekeśavaṃkuryānnārāyaṇamathodare ||
vakṣasthalemādhavaṃ tu goviṃdaṃ kaṃṭhakūbare || 1 ||

viṣṇuṃ ca dakṣiṇe kukṣaubāhuke madhusūdanam ||
trivikramaṃ skaṃdhadeśe vāmanaṃvāmapārśvake || 2 ||

śrīdharaṃbāhumadhye tu hṛṣīkeśaṃ tu tadbhuje ||
pṛṣṭhe ca padmanābhaṃ tu trikedāmodaraṃ nyaset || 3 ||

tatprakṣālanatoyena vāsudevaṃ ca mūrdhani || 13 ||

(3) atha dhāryamāṇordhvapuṃḍrāṇāṃ parimitimāha (-)

lalāṭe bhujayugme ca pṛṣṭhayoḥ kaṃṭhakūbare ||
dhārayedūrdhvapuṃdrāṇi caturaṃgulamāyatam || 1 ||

kukṣautatpārśvayoḥ proktamāyataṃ tu daśāṃgulam ||
bāhvorvakṣasthale puṃḍraṃ dvādaśāṃgulamucyate || 2 || 12 ||

(4) atha varṇabhedenordhvapuṇḍrasaṃkhyābhedāḥ (-)

evaṃdvādaśapuṃḍrāṇi brāhmaṇassatataṃdharet ||
tattatpuṃḍreṣutanmūrtiṃ dhyātvāmaṃtreṇa dhārayet || 1 ||

<p. 275>

catvāribhūbhujāṃproktaṃ dvipuṃḍraṃ tu viśāṃ smṛtam ||
ekapuṃḍra tu nārīṇāṃ śūdrāṇāṃ ca vidhīyate || 2 || 5 ||

(5) atha dhāryordhvapuṇḍrasthānakramadevatāḥ (-)

lalāṭe hṛdaye bāhvoḥ catuḥpuṃḍrāṇi dhārayet ||
lalāṭe hṛdaye dve tu phāletvekaṃ vidhīyate || 1 ||

ūrdhvapuṃḍraṃ lalāṭe tu sarveṣāṃ prathamaṃ smṛtam ||
lalāṭādi krameṇaiva dhāraṇaṃ tu vidhīyate || 2 ||

mūrtayovāsudevādyāḥ catuḥpuṃḍreṣu dhārayet ||
dve ca goviṃdakṛṣṇākhye tvekaṃ nārāyaṇaṃ dharet || 3 ||

eṣapuṃḍravidhiḥ proktaḥ sarveṣāṃ girije mayā || 3 ||

(6) athordhvapuṇḍrākṛtyādayaḥ (-)

aśvatthapatrasaṃkāśaṃ veṇupatrākṛtiṃ tathā ||
padmakuṭmalasaṃkāśaṃ mohanaṃ tritayaṃ smṛtam || 1 ||

mahābhāgavataśśuddhaḥ nityaṃharipadākṛtim ||
daṃḍākāraṃ tu vaide vidhārayedūrdhvapuṃḍrakam || 2 || 4 ||

(saccaritrarakṣāyām) (-)

dvyaṃgulaṃtryaṃgulaṃ vāpi sāṃtarālaṃ prakalpayet ||
pārśvaudvyaṃgulamātrausyādūrdhvapuṃḍrasthalakṣaṇam || 1 ||

(bharadvājasaṃhitāyām) (-) 

ūrdhvapuṃḍrāṃtarāle tu cakrādīndhārayetsadā ||
bahiṣkṛtāhyabhikruddhā pāpātpracyā vayaṃtite || 1 ||

prātarmadhyaṃ dinesāyamūrdhvapuṃḍreṇa keśavaḥ ||
akṛtairvāpi sukṛtaiḥ taistaiḥ prīṇāti karmabhiḥ || 2 ||

prabhāte divyalokasthaṃ madhyāhne cārkamadhyagam ||
toṣayannūrdhvapuṃdreṇa sāyaṃsvātmagataṃharim || 3 ||

(7) athordhvapuṇḍreṣuharidrādhāryāḥ (-) (saccaritrarakṣāyām)

ūrdhvapuṃḍreṣu sarveṣu haridrāṃ dhāraye cchubhām ||
abhiṣiktaṃ tu yaccūrṇaṃ viṣṇubiṃbe sadānaraḥ || 1 ||

haridrāṃdhārayedyastu sośvamedhaphalaṃlabhet ||

(saṃgrahe) (-) 

ūrdhvapuṃḍrasyāṃtarāle haridrāṃ yo na dhārayet ||
savaiṣṇavo lalāṭe tu śriyaṃ māṃ ca vyapohati || 1 ||

atha ūrdhvapuṃṇḍrasthaharidrācūrṇābhimānidevatāḥ (-) (hārītaḥ)

śrīrlakṣmīḥ kamalāpadmāpadminīkamalālayā ||
ramāvṛṣākapidhanyāvṛddhirijyātatheṃdirā || 1 ||

<p. 276>

śaktayaḥ keśavādīnāṃ saṃproktā parame pade ||

(pāṃcarātre) (-) śrīdevīprathamaṃnāmadvitīyamamṛtodbhavā ||
tṛtīyaṃ kamalāproktaṃ caturthaṃśāṃtiśobhinī || 1 ||

paṃcamaṃviṣṇupatnīti ṣaṣṭhaṃ vai vaiṣṇavī tathā ||
saptamaṃ tu varārohā cāṣṭamaṃ harivallabhā || 2 ||

navamaṃśārṅgiṇī proktaṃ daśamaṃ devadevatā ||
ekādaśaṃ tu lakṣmīśca dvādaśaṃsurasuṃdarī || 3 ||

(āgame) (-) 

śrīdevīprathamājñeyā dvitīyātvamṛtodbhavā ||
tṛtīyākamalāproktā caturthī lokasuṃdarī || 1 ||

paṃcamīviṣṇupatnī ca ṣaṣṭhīśrīvaiṣṇavī tathā ||
saptamī tu varārohā hyaṣṭamī harivallabhā || 2 ||

navamīśārṅgiṇīproktādaśamīdevadevatā || 3 ||

ekādaśīmahālakṣmīrdvādaśī surasuṃdarī ||
śrīcūrṇasyābhi māninyo dvādaśaitāḥ parāśśubhāḥ || 4 || 12 ||

(8) atha ūrdhvapuṃṇḍrayogyaharidrācūrṇabhājanam (-)

phalādanyatrabilvasya yaccūrṇaṃ pūrayecchubham ||
avaiṣṇavassavijñeyo taṃ kupyati hari priyā || 1 ||

(9) atha ūrdhvapuṃḍramṛddharṣaṇaprāṇapratiṣṭhāpanadhāraṇeṣu ṛṣicchandodevatādayaḥ (-)

oṃ ūrdhvapuṃṇḍramṛddharṣanamaṃtrasya | varāha ṛṣiḥ | anuṣṭupchandaḥ | śrībhūmirdevatā | akārobījam | yakāraśśaktiḥ | ūrdhvapuṃḍramṛdgharṣaṇārthe | ūrdhvapuṃḍramiśraprāṇapratiṣthārthe ca jape viniyogaḥ | evamūrdhvapuṃdradhāraṇamaṃtrasya | rāṇāyanīyasātyamugridūrvāsobhāgurigaurguṃḍīgaurgulavyupamanyugārgyasopa(-)karṣakaṇvakuthiviniśālihotrā(-)ṛṣayaḥ | gāyatryuṣṇiganuṣṭubjagatīpaṅtivyāhṛtiśakvarībṛhadrathaṃtaravirāḍatijagatīviṣṭārapaṅtayaḥchaṃdāṃsi ||
keśavādivāsudevāṃtāḥtrayodaśamūrtayo devatāh | oṃṁ aṃ bījam | oṃṁ uṃkīlakam | oṃṁ maṃśaktiḥ | ūrdhvapuṃḍradhāraṇeviniyogaḥ | oṃṁ kruddholkāyasvāhā | lkāyasvāhā | matkāyasvāhā |

<p. 277>

pṛtkolkāyasvāhā | dhyānam || arkodbhāsaṃkirīṭānvitamakaralasatkuṃḍalaṃdīptirātkeyūraṃkaustubhābhāśabala(-)rucibharāṃvaijayaṃtīṃdharaṃtam ||
nānāratnāṃśubhinnābharaṇaśatayutaṃśrīdharāśliṣṭapārśvaṃvaṃdedossakta(-)cakrāṃburuhavilasitaṃ viśvavaṃdyaṃmukuṃdam || 1 ||

astramaṃtreṇavāmahastaṃ saṃśodhyapraṇavenajalaṃnidhāyoddhṛtāsītimṛdamādāyagaṃdhadvāretyastra(-)maṃtreṇadaśadikṣurakṣāṃkṛtvāpraṇavamūlābhyāmabhimaṃtryanārasiṃhabījaṃ(-)vilikhya oṃṁ bhagavanpavitramitijalaṃnikṣipyatarjanyā(-)mṛdaṃjalaṃcaikīkṛtyabhagavatpādadvayaṃ smaranviṣṇoḥ kramosītimatreṇa paṃcaupaniṣadairmūlena dvādaśākṣareṇasaptavaiṣṇavamaṃtraiścābhimaṃtryapraṇavena tarjanyā mṛdamādāya mūrdhni vinyaset || oṃ keśavāya nama ityādibhiḥ dvādaśordhvapuṃḍrāndhṛtvāśeṣaṃ dvādaśākṣareṇa mūrdhni vinyaset | oṃ keśavāya nama ityādibhiḥ ṣaḍaṃganyāsakaranyāsānkuryāt | tataḥ catuścakramityādyagrimaṃ dhyāyet ||

(10) atha dvādaśorddhvapuṃḍrābhimānidevatānāṃdhyānam (-)

(vaikuṃṭhadīkṣitīye dharmaśāstrācārakhaṃḍe)

catuścakraṃ namasyāmi keśavaṃ kanakaprabham ||
nārāyaṇaṃ ghanaśyāmaṃ catuśśaṃkhaṃ namāmyaham || 1 ||

mādhavaṃmaṇibhaṃgābhaṃ ciṃtayāmi caturgadam ||
caṃdravarṇaṃ catuśśārṅgaṃ goviṃdamabhisaṃśraye || 2 ||

viṣṇuṃ caturhalaṃ vaṃde padmakiṃjalkasannibham ||
caturmusalamabjābhaṃ saṃśraye madhusūdanam || 3 ||

āśrayāmi catuḥkhaḍgamagnivarṇaṃ trivikramam ||
vāmanaṃ bālasūryābhaṃ caturvajraṃ samāśraye || 4 ||

śrīdharaṃpuṃḍarīkābhaṃ catuḥpaṭṭaṃ samāśraye ||
caturmudgaramabhyemi hṛṣīkeśaṃ taṭitprabham || 5 ||

paṃcāyudhaṃ padmanābhaṃ praṇamāmyarkarociṣam ||
dāmodaraṃ catuḥpāśamiṃdragopanibhaṃbhaje || 6 ||

ūrdhvapuṃḍreṣviti śrīśaṃnityaṃ dhyāyītanāmabhiḥ || 12 ||

(11) atha tulasījanmādvivāhatadrakṣaṇabṛndāvanatanmāhātmyāni (-) (padmapurāṇe brahmavaivarte ca)

bhagavantvanmukhātsarvaṃ śrutamasmābhiruttamam ||
māhātmyaṃ śrītulasyāstu kathayasva sureśvara || 1 ||

<p. 278>

kutrotpannā ca kiṃ rūpā kiṃvarṇākenacārcitā ||
tadarcanavidhiḥkīdṛgudyāpana vidhiḥ katham || 2 ||

pūjitā kiṃ dadātyeṣā tatsarvaṃ vaktumarhasi || 

brahmovāca || 

śṛṇvaṃtumunayassarve tulasīvratamuttamam || 3 ||

dhanyaṃyaśasyamāyuṣyamārogyaṃduḥkhanāśanam ||
daṃpatyoḥprītijanakaṃ putrapautrābhivṛddhidam || 4 ||

piśācagraharakṣoghnaṃ pavitraṃpāpanāśanam ||
sadāvijayadaṃrājñāṃ vignaughadhvāṃtanāśanam || 5 ||

pūrvaṃsurairmathyamānekṣīrābdhau sā bhavadvijāḥ ||
utpannaiṣātadā devī tulasīkāmarūpiṇī || 6 ||

kumārīcārusarvāṃgī biṃboṣṭhi mṛgalocanā ||
pūrṇacaṃdrānanāśyāmā kṛśamadhyāsukeśinī || 7 ||

supakvadāḍimībījatulyadaṃtā caturbhujā ||
śaṃkhārī ca gadāpadme dadhānāgaruḍā sthitā || 8 ||

stūyamānābhaktajanaissurakinnarapannagaiḥ ||
evaṃrūpā ca sā devī bhaktepsitavarapradā || 9 ||

caturdvāre śvetakṛṣṇa divyarūpairvyavasthitā ||
ārādhitā mayā viṣṇu śaṃbhuśakrādibhissuraiḥ || 10 ||

prāpto manorathassarvaścāsmābhistadanugrahāt ||
evaṃ prabhāvāsā devīyayedaṃ dhāryate jagat || 11 || 

ṛṣaya ūcuḥ || 

devyāḥ svarūpamadhunā varṇitaṃ yattvayā vibho ||
iyaṃ hi guptarūpā tu dṛśyate bhuvisarvadā || 12 ||

saṃśayoyaṃ suraśreṣṭhacchitvābrūhi yathātatham ||
tvadanyaḥ saṃśayasyāsya cchedakona hi vidyate || 13 || 

brahmovāca ||

pūrvamāsīddānaveṃdro nāmnājalaṃdharo suraḥ ||
tasya bhāryā hi cārvaṃgī surūpācāru yauvanā || 14 ||

kāmarūpāpūrṇacaṃdravadanāti manoharā ||
śyāmāsumadhyātanvaṃgī nāmnā vṛṃdeti viśrutā || 15 ||

biṃboṣṭhī haṃsagamanā taruṇī kokilasvarā ||
sukeśīpadmavadanā pīnonnata payodharā || 16 ||

strīratnabhūtā sā bṛṃdārājñastasyasuveśmani ||
jalaṃdharā sureṃdrasya sarvaśīlaguṇānvitā || 17 ||

tāṃkenacitprasaṃgena dṛṣṭvāsau puruṣottamaḥ ||
anurakto bhavattasyāṃ bhāvamāyā vimohitaḥ || 18 ||

kālenamahatābṛṃdā paṃcatvaṃ samupāgatā ||
jalaṃdharanareṃdrasya rājyalakṣmīrvinirgatā || 19 ||

tacchutvā keśavassarvaṃ tadviyogena duḥkhitaḥ ||
taccitābhasmani tadātatparobhūtsuduḥkhitaḥ || 20 ||

<p. 279>

ubhe te tulasīlakṣmyā vekībhūtau tu śāṃbhavi ||
taccittaugulmarūpeṇa rūpaṃdadhaturuttamam || 21 ||

pavitrakesarairyuktaṃ patrairāmodasaṃvṛtaiḥ ||
tatobṛṃdāvanecāru tulasīvanamāśrītā || 22 ||

punaḥ śrītulasī yukto viṣṇurvaikuṃṭhamanvagāt ||
tataḥ prabhṛtilokesminnāmnāvṛṃdā vanaṃ smṛtam || 23 ||

ityeṣā kathitā bṛṃdā dvitīyoktā hyanuttamā ||
prāsaṃgikī mahāpuṇyā prasaṃgātpāpanāśanī || 24 ||

athodagayaneprāpte puṇyehni tithiyogataḥ ||
śubhāyāṃ hemagarbhāyāṃ siktāyāṃ tīrthavāriṇā || 25 ||

paṃcāmṛtaiḥ snāpayitvā siktāyāmabhimaṃtritam ||
tulasīropaṇaṃ kuryāt svastivācanapūrvakam || 26 ||

svacchodakena tāṃ siktāṃ yatnena parirakṣayet ||

(12) śrīrāmānujācāryaśiṣyapīṭhaikāntisaṃkhyātatkṛtagranthādayaḥ (-) (anyatra nāradīyeca)

kalyabde divyakuṃbhe budhajanavidite vatsare piṃgalākhye caitremāsegateṣu dviyutadaśadine ṣvedhamāne himāṃśau ||
paṃcamyārdrāsamete suraguru divase karkaṭākhye vilagne śrīmānrāmānujāryassamajaninigamāṃtārthasaṃrakṣaṇārtham || 1 ||

rāmānujassaptaśatairyatīnāṃ pīṭhaiścatussatpatibhissametaḥ ||
ekāṃtibhirdvādaśabhissahasraiḥ śrīraṃga āsteyatisārvabhaumaḥ || 2 ||

vedārthasya ca saṃgrahaṃ mṛdupadaṃ vedāṃtadīpaṃ tathāvedārthasya ca sāramarthagahanaṃ śrībhāṣyamatyadbhutam ||
gītābhāṣyamathaprapatti viṣaye gadyatrayaṃ cākarottasmai lakṣmaṇakṣaṇāyamunaye tubhyaṃ namaḥ kūrmahe || 3 ||

lakṣmīnāthākhyasiṃdhauśaṭharipujaladaḥ prāpyakāruṇyanīraṃnāthādrāvabhyaṣiṃcattadanuraghuvarāṃ bhojacakṣurjharābhayām ||
gatvātāṃ yāmunākhyāṃ saritamathayatīṃdrākhyapadmākareṃdraṃ saṃpūryaprāṇisasyepravahati bahudhādeśikeṃdra bhramaughaiḥ || 4 ||

anaṃtaḥ prathamaṃrūpaṃ lakṣmaṇaśca tataḥ param ||
balabhadrastṛtīyastu kalaukaścidbhaviṣyati || 5 ||

patyuḥpaṃkajavāsinyāḥ preraṇātpṛthivītale ||
ahīnāmīśvaraḥ sākṣādabhūdrāmānujo muniḥ || 6 ||

<p. 280>

atha śrīrāmānujācāryāṣṭottaraśatanāmāni (-)

rāmānujaḥpuṣkarākṣo yatīṃdraḥ karuṇākaraḥ ||
kāṃtimatyātmajaśśrīmāllīṁlāmānuṣavigrahaḥ || 1 ||

sarvaśāstārthatattvajñaḥ sarvajñassajjanapriyaḥ ||
nārāyaṇakṛpāpātraṃ śrībhūtapuranāyakaḥ || 2 ||

anaghobhaktamaṃdāraḥ keśavānaṃdabardhanaḥ ||
kāṃcīpūrṇapriyasakhaḥ praṇatārti vināśanaḥ || 3 ||

puṇyasaṃkīrtanaḥ puṇyo brahmarākṣasamocakaḥ ||
yādavāpāditāpārtha vṛkṣacchedakuṭhāraka || 4 ||

amogholakṣmaṇamuniḥ śāradāśokanāśanaḥ ||
niraṃtarajanājñānanirmocanavicakṣaṇaḥ || 5 ||

vedāṃtadvayasārajño varadāṃbupradāyakaḥ ||
parābhiprāyatattvajño yāmunāṃguli mocakaḥ || 6 ||

devarājaghṛṇālabdhaṣaḍvākyārthamahodadhiḥ ||
pūrṇāryalabdhasanmaṃtraḥ śauripādābja ṣaṭpadaḥ || 7 ||

tridaṃḍadhārīdharmajño brahmadhyānaparāyaṇaḥ ||
raṃgeśakaiṃkaryaratovibhūti dvayanāyakaḥ || 8 ||

goṣṭhīpūrṇakṛpālabdhamaṃtrarājaprakāśakaḥ ||
vararaṃgānukaṃpāttadrāviḍāmnāyasāgaraḥ || 9 ||

mālādharāryavijñātadrāviḍāmnāya tattvadhīḥ ||
catussaptati śiṣyāḍhyaḥ paṃcācārya padāśrayaḥ || 10 ||

prapītaviṣatīrthāṃbhaḥ prakaṭīkṛtavaibhavaḥ ||
praṇatārtiharācāryaḥ dattabhikṣaikabhojanaḥ || 11 ||

pavitrīkṛtakūreśobhāgineyastridaṃḍakeḥ ||
kūreśaṃdāśarathyādi caramārthaprakāśakaḥ || 12 ||

śrīraṃgaveṅkaṭeśādriprakaṭīkṛta vaibhavaḥ ||
devarājārcanaratomūkamukti pradāyakaḥ || 13 ||

yajñamūrtipratiṣṭhātāmannāthodharaṇīdharaḥ ||
varadācāryasadbhakto yajñeśārtivināśanaḥ || 14 ||

anaṃtābhīṣṭaphalado viṭhṭhaleṃdraprapūjitaḥ ||
śrīśailapūrṇakaruṇālabdharāmāyaṇārthakaḥ || 15 ||

prapattidharmaikarato goviṃdārya priyānujaḥ ||
vyāsasūtrārthatattvajño bodhāyanamatānugaḥ || 16 ||

śrībhāṣyādi mahāgraṃtha kārakaḥkalināśanaḥ ||
advaitamatavicchettā viśiṣṭā dvaitapālakaḥ || 17 ||

kuraṃganagarīpūrnamaṃtraratnapradarśakaḥ ||
vināśitākhilamatāśeṣī kṛtaramāpatiḥ || 18 ||

putrīkṛtaśaṭhārāti śaṭhajiccarṇamocakaḥ ||
bhāṣādattahayagrīvo bhāṣyakāro mahāyaśāḥ || 19 ||

<p. 281>

pavitrīkṛtabhūbhāgaḥ kūrmanāthaprakāśakaḥ ||
śrīveṃkaṭācalādhīśaśśaṃkhacakrapradarśakaḥ || 20 ||

śrīveṃkaṭeśaśvaśuraḥ śrīramāsakhadeśikaḥ ||
kṛpāmātraprasannāryo gopikāmokṣadāyakaḥ || 21 ||

samīcīnāryasacchiṣyassatkṛto vaiṣṇavapriyaḥ ||
kṛmikaṃṭhanṛpadhvaṃsī sarvamaṃtramahodadhiḥ || 22 ||

aṃgīkṛtāṃdhrapūrṇārya sāligrāmapratiṣṭhitā ||
śrībhaktagrāmapūrṇāḍhyo viṣṇuvardhanarakṣakaḥ || 23 ||

bauddhadhvāṃtasahasrāṃśuḥ śeṣarūpapradarśakaḥ ||
nagarīkṛtavedādriḥ ḍillīśvarasamarcitaḥ || 24 ||

nārāyaṇapratiṣṭhāttasaṃpatputravimocanaḥ ||
saṃpatkumārajanakaḥ sādhulokaśikhāmaṇiḥ || 25 ||

supratiṣṭhitagoviṃdarājaḥ pūrṇamanorathaḥ ||
godāgrajodigvijetāgodābhīṣṭaprapūrakaḥ || 26 ||

sarvasaṃśayavicchettā viṣṇulokapradāyakaḥ ||
avyāhatamahadvartmāyatirājojagadguruḥ || 27 ||

evaṃ rāmānujāryasya nāmnāmaṣṭottaraṃśatam ||
yaḥ paṭhechṛṇuyādvāpi sarvānkāmānsamaśnute || 28 ||

yadāṃdhrapūrṇenamahātmanedaṃ stotraṃkṛtaṃ sarvajanāvanāya ||
tajjivabhūtaṃbhuvi vaiṣṇavānāṃ babhūvarāmānujamānasānām || 29 || 108 ||

atha yatirājaśrīrāmānujācāryasaptatiḥ (-)

kamapyādyaṃ guruṃvaṃdekamalāgṛhamedhinam ||
pravaktācchaṃdasāṃvaktāpāṃcarātrasya yaḥ svayam || 1 ||

sahadharmacarīṃśaureḥ saṃmaṃtritajagaddhitām ||
anugrahamayīṃvaṃde nityamajñānanigrahām || 2 ||

vaṃdevaikuṃṭhasenānyaṃ devaṃsūtravatīsakham ||
yadvetraśikharaspaṃdeviśvametadvyavasthitam || 3 ||

yasyasārasvatasrotovakulāmodavāsitam ||
śrutīnāṃviśramāyālaṃśaṭhāriṃtamupāsmahe || 4 ||

nāthenamunināthenabhaveyaṃnāthavānaham ||
yasyanaigamikaṃ tattvaṃhastāmalakatāṃ gatam || 5 ||

namasyāmyaraviṃdākṣaṃ nāthabhāve vyavasthitam ||
śuddhasattvamayaṃśaureravatāramivāparam || 6 ||

anujjhitakṣamāyogamapuṇyajanabādhakam ||
aspṛṣṭamadarāgaṃtaṃ rāmaṃturyamupāsmahe || 7 ||

vigāheyāmunaṃtīrthaṃ sādhubṛṃdāvanesthitam ||
nirastajihmagasparśe yatrakṛṣṇaḥ kṛtādaraḥ || 8 ||

dayānighnaṃyatīṃdrasya deśikaṃpūrṇamāśraye ||
yena viśvasṛjoviṣṇorapūryatamanorathaḥ || 9 ||

<p. 282>

praṇāmaṃlakṣmaṇamuniḥ pratigṛṇhātumāmakam ||
prasādayatiyatsūktiḥ svādhīnapadikāṃ śrutim || 10 ||

upavītinamūrdhvapuṃḍravaṃtaṃtrijagatpuṇyaphalaṃtridaṃḍahastam ||
śaraṇāgatasārthavāhamīḍe śikhayāśekhariṇaṃ patiṃ yatīnām || 11 ||

prathayanvimateṣu tīkṣṇabhāvaṃ prabhurasmatparirakṣaṇe yatīṃdraḥ ||
apṛthakpratipannayanmayatvairvṛdhepaṃcabhirāyudhairmurāreḥ || 12 ||

śamitodayaśaṃkarādi garvaḥ svabalāduddhṛtayādavaprakāśaḥ ||
aparopitavāñchruterapārthānnanurāmāvarajaḥ sa eṣabhūyaḥ || 13 ||

abahuśrutisaṃbhavaṃ śrutīnāṃjaratīnāmayathāyathapracāram ||
vinivartayituṃ yatīśvaroktirvidadhethāsthiranītipaṃjarasthā || 14 ||

amunātapanātiśāyibhūmnāyatirājenanibaddhanāyakaśrīḥ ||
mahatīgurupaṅktihārayaṣṭirvibudhānāṃ hṛdayaṃ gamāvibhāti || 15 ||

alūnapakṣasyayatikṣamābhṛtovibhāti vaṃśeharitattvamakṣaram ||
yadudbhavāḥ śuddhasuvṛttaśītalāḥbhavaṃtimuktāvalibhuṣaṇaṃ bhuvaḥ || 16 ||

anapāyaviṣṇupadasaṃśrayaṃbhaje kalayākayāpi kalayāpyanujjhitam ||
akalaṃkayogamajaḍāśayodayaṃyatirājacaṃdramuparāgadūragam || 17 ||

adhigamyasamyaganaghāḥ sumedhasoyaticakravarti padapadmapattanam ||
haribhaktidāsyarasikāḥ parasparaṃ krayavikrayārha daśayāsamiṃdhate || 18 ||

paruṣātivādaparivādapaiśunaprabhṛti prabhūtapatanīyapaṃkilā ||
svadatemamādyasubhagāsarasvatī yatirājakīrtikatakairviśodhitā || 19 ||

anukalpabhūtamurajitpadaṃsatāmajahattrivargamapavargavaibhavam ||
calacittavṛttivinivartanauṣadhaṃ śaraṇaṃ yatīṃdracaraṇau vṛṇīmahe || 20 ||

śvasitāvadhūtaparavādi vaibhavānigamāṃtanītijaladhestala spṛśaḥ ||
pratipādayaṃti gatimāpavargakīṃyati sārvabhaumapadasātkṛtāśayāḥ || 21 ||

mūleniviśyamahatāṃ nigamadrumāṇāṃ muṣṇanpratārakabhayaṃdhṛtanaikadaṃḍaḥ ||
raṃgeśabhaktajanamānasarājahaṃsorāmānujaḥ śaraṇamastumuniḥ svayaṃ naḥ || 22 ||

sanmaṃtravitkṣipatisaṃyamināṃnareṃdraḥ saṃsārajihmagamukhaiḥ samupasthitaṃ naḥ ||
viṣvaktanaṃ viṣayalobhaviṣaṃ nijābhirgāḍhānu bhāvagaruḍadhvajabhāvanābhiḥ || 23 ||

<p. 283>

nāthassa eṣayamināṃnakharaśmijālairaṃtarnilīnamapanīyatamomadīyam ||
vijñānacitramanaghaṃlikhatīvacitte vyākhyānakelirasikenakarāṃbujena || 24 ||

udgṛhṇatīmupaniṣatsunigūḍhamarthaṃ citte niveśayitumalpadhiyāṃ svayaṃ naḥ ||
paśyemalakṣmaṇamuneḥ pratipannahastāmunnidrapadmasubhagāmupadeśamudrām || 25 ||

ākarṣaṇāninigamāṃtasarasvatī nāmuccāṭanāni bahiraṃtarupaplavānām ||
pathyānighorabhavasaṃjvarapīḍitānāṃ hṛdyānibhāṃtiyatirājamunervacāṃsi || 26 ||

śītasvabhāvasubhagānubhavaḥ śikhāvāndoṣāvamardaniyatonnatiroṣadhīśaḥ ||
tāpānubaṃdhaśamanaḥ tapanaḥprajānāṃ rāmānujo jayati saṃvalitatridhāmā || 27 ||

jayatisakalavidyāvāhinījanmaśailojanipathaparivṛtti śrāṃtaviśrāṃti śākhī ||
nikhilakumatimāyāśarvarī bālasūryo nigamajaladhi velāpūrṇacaṃdro yatīṃdraḥ || 28 ||

munibahumatasārāmuktaniśśreṇikeyaṃ sa hṛdayahṛdayānāṃ śāśvatīdiṣṭasiddhiḥ ||
śamitaduritakhedāsaṃyamīṃdrasya sūktiḥparicitagahanānaḥ prasnuvītaprasādam || 29 ||

bhavamaruparikhinnasphītapānīyasiddhiḥ duritarahitajihvādugdhakulyāsakulyā ||
śrutinayanasanābhiḥ śobhate lakṣmaṇoktirnarakamathanasevāsvādanāḍiṃ dhamānām || 30 ||

haripadamakaraṃdasyaṃ dinaḥ saṃśritānāmanugata bahuśākhāstāpamunmūlayaṃti ||
śamitaduritagaṃdhāḥsaṃyamīṃdraprabaṃdhāḥkutukijanamanīṣā kalpanākalpavṛkṣāḥ || 31 ||

nānābhūtairjagatisamayairnarmalīlāṃvidhitsoraṃtyaṃvarṇaṃ prathayati vibhorādimavyūha bhede ||
viśvaṃtrātuṃviṣayaniyataṃ vyaṃjitānugrahassanviṣvaksenoyatipatirasauvetrasārastridaṃḍaḥ || 32 ||

lakṣyaṃbuddherlalitarasanālāsyalilānidānaṃ śuddhāsvādaṃkimapi jagatiśrotradivyauṣadhaṃ naḥ ||
lakṣyālakṣyaiḥ sitajaladhi vadbhātitātparyaratnairlakṣmīkāṃta sphuṭitamukurolakṣṇāryo padeśaḥ || 33) |

sthitimavadhīrayaṃtyati manorathasiddhimatīṃyatipatisaṃpradāyanirapāyaghanopacitāḥ ||
madhukaramaulidaghnamadadaṃturadaṃtighaṭāḥ karaṭakaṭāhavāhighanaśīkaraśīpharitām || 34 ||

anuṣadhiraṃgavṛttirasikānabhitāṃḍavayannigamavimarśakeliniratairnibhṛtairvidhṛtaḥ ||
guṇapariṇaddhasūktidṛḍhakoṭivighaṭṭanayāraṭatidiśāṃmukheṣu yatirājayaśaḥ paṭahaḥ || 35 ||

<p. 284>

idaṃ prathamasaṃbhavatkumatijālakūlaṃkaṣāmṛṣāmataviṣānalajvalitajīvajīvātavaḥ ||
kṣaraṃtyamṛtamakṣaraṃyatipuraṃdarasyoktayaḥ ciraṃtanasarasvatīcikurabaṃdhasairaṃdhrikāḥ || 36 ||

sudhāśanasudurgrahaśrutisamaṣṭimuṣṭiṃdhayaḥkathāhavamasaugatānkapaṭasaugatān(-)khaṃḍayan ||
munirmanasilakṣmaṇomudamudaṃ ca yatyaṃjasā mukuṃdaguṇamauktikaprakarayuktibhiḥsūktibhiḥ || 37 ||

kapardimatakardamaṃkapilakalpanāvāgurāduratyayamatītyataddruhiṇa taṃtrayaṃtrodaram ||
kudṛṣṭikuhanāmukhenipatataḥ parabrahmaṇaḥkaragrahavicakṣaṇo jayatilakṣmaṇoyaṃ muniḥ || 38 ||

kaṇādaparipāṭibhiḥ kapilakalpanānāṭakaiḥ kumārilakubhāṣitaiḥ gurunibaṃdhanagraṃthibhiḥ ||
tathāgatakathāśataistadanusārijalpairapiprasāritamidaṃjagatpraguṇitaṃyatīṃdroktibhiḥ || 39 ||

kathāṃkalahakautukagrahagṛhītakautaskutaṃprathājaladhisaṃbhavagrasanakuṃbha(-)saṃbhūtayaḥ ||
jayaṃtisudhiyoyatikṣitibhṛdaṃtikopāsanaprabhāvaparipaktrimā'pramitabhāratī(-)saṃpadaḥ ||  (40 ||

yatīśvarasarasvatī surabhitāśayānāṃsatāṃvahāmi caraṇāṃbujaṃ praṇatiśālināmaulinā ||
tadanyamatadurmatajvalitacetasāṃ vādināṃśirassunihitaṃ mayāpadamadakṣiṇaṃdakṣiṇam || 41 ||

bhajasvayatibhūpateranidamādidurvāsanākadadhvaparivartanaśramanivartinīṃvartanīm ||
labhasvahṛdayasvayaṃrathapadāyudhānugrahadrutaprahatinistruṭaddurita(-)duṣkṛtiṃniṣkṛtim || 42 ||

yadyetaṃyatisārvabhaumakathitaṃvidyādavidyātamaḥpratyūṣapratitaṃtramaṃtimayugekaściddipaścittamaḥ ||
tatraikatrajhaḍityupaitivilayaṃtattanmatasthāpanāhevakaprathamānahaitukakathākallola(-)kolāhalaḥ || 43 ||

kumativihitagraṃthagraṃthiprabhūtamatāṃtaragrahilamanasaḥpaśyaṃtyalpāṃ(-)yatīśvarabhāratīm ||
vikaṭamurabhidvakṣaḥpīṭhīpariṣkaraṇocitaḥ kulagiritulārohebhāvīkiyānivakaustubhaḥ || 44 ||

sthaviranigamastomastheyāṃ  yatīśvarapaddhatiṃ kumatiphaṇitikṣobhakṣībāḥ kṣipatubhajaṃtu vā ||
rasaparimalaślāghāghoṣasphuṭatpuṭabhedanaṃ lavaṇavaṇijaḥkarpūrārghaṃkimityabhimanvate || 45 ||

vahatimahilāmādyovedhāstrayī mukharairmukhaiḥ varatatutayāvāmobhāgaḥ śivasyavivartate ||

<p. 285>

tadapiparamaṃtattvaṃ gopījanasya vaśaṃvadaṃmadanakadanairnakliśyaṃte yatīśvarasaṃśrayāḥ || 46 ||

nigamapathikacchāyāśākhīnirāśamahānidhiḥ mahitavividhacchātraśreṇīmanorathasārathiḥ ||
tribhuvanatamaḥpratyūṣoyaṃtrividyaśikhāmaṇiḥ yatiparivṛḍhorakṣāyaṃtraṃramāpatisaṃpadām || 47 ||

jaḍamatimudhādaṃtādaṃtivyathauṣaḍhasiddhayaḥ pramitinidhayaḥ prajñāśāliprapālanayaṣṭayaḥ ||
śrutisurabhayaḥsiddhānaṃdābhivarṣukavāridāyamagatikathāvicchedinyo yatīśvarasūktayaḥ || 48 ||

pratikalamihapratyaktattvāvalokakudīpikāḥ yatiparivṛḍhagraṃthāściṃtāṃniraṃtarayaṃtinaḥ |
akaluṣaparijñānautsukyakṣudhāturadurdaśāpariṇataphalapratyāsīdatphale(-)grahisugrahāḥ || 49 ||

mukuṃdāṃghriśraddhākumudavanacaṃdrātapanibhā mumukṣāmakṣobhyāṃdadhātimayibṛṃdārakagiraḥ ||
svasiddhāntadhvāṃtasthirakutukadurvāṃdipariṣaddivābhītaprekṣādinakarasamutthānapuruṣāḥ || 50 ||

nirābādhābodhāyanaphaṇitiniṣyaṃdasubhagāḥ viśuddhopanyāsavyatibhiduraśārīrakanayāḥ ||
akuṃṭhaiḥkalpaṃte yatipatinibaṃdhānijamukhairanidrāṇaprajñārasadhamanimedhāyasudhiyām || 51 ||

vikalpāṭopenaśrutipathamaśeṣaṃvighaṭayanyadṛcchānirdiṣṭe yatinṛpatiśabdeviramati ||
vitaṃḍāhaṃkurvatpratikathakavetaṃḍapṛtanāviyātavyāpāravyatimathana(-)saṃraṃbhakalahaḥ || 52 ||

pratiṣṭhātarkāṇāṃ pratipadamṛcāṃdhāmayajuṣāṃ pariṣkārassāmnāṃparipaṇamatharvāṃgirasayoḥ ||
pradipastattvānāṃ pratikṛtirasautāpasagirāṃ prasutiṃsaṃvitteḥ pradiśati yatīśānaphaṇitiḥ || 53 ||

hatāvadye hṛdye haricaraṇapaṃkeruhayuge nibadhnaṃtyaikātmyaṃkimapiyatibhubhṛtphaṇitayaḥ ||
śunāsīraskaṃdadruhiṇaharaheraṃbahutabhukprabheśādikṣudrapraṇatiparihāra(-)pratibhuvaḥ || 54 ||

yathābhūtasvārthāyatinṛpatisūktirvijayate sudhāsaṃdohātmāsucaritavipaktiśrutigirām ||
kathādṛpyatkautaskutakalahakolāhalahatatrivedīnirvedapraśamanavinodapraṇayinī || 55 ||

śrutiśreṇī cūḍāpadabahumate lakṣmaṇamate svapakṣasthāndoṣānvitathamatirāropayatiyaḥ ||
svahastenotkṣiptaiḥ sakhalunijagātreṣu bahulaṃgaladbhirjaṃbālairgaganatalamāliṃpatijaḍaḥ || 56 ||

<p. 286>

nirālikelokenirupavibhavasrehabharitoyatikṣmābhṛddīpoyavinakilajājvalyataiha ||
ahaṃkāradhyāṃtaṃvijahatukathaṃkāramanaghāḥkutarkavyālaughaṃkumatimatapātālakuharam || 57 ||

yatikṣmābhrddṛṣṭaṃmatamihanavīnaṃtadapikiṃtataḥprāgevānyadvadatadapikiṃvarṇanikape ||
niśāmyaṃtāṃyadvānijamatatiraskāraniyamānnirātaṃkāṣṭaṃkadramiḍaguhadevaprabhṛtayaḥ || 58 ||

sudhāsāraṃśrīmadyativarabhuvaḥśrotrakuhureniṣiṃcaṃtinyaṃcannigamagarimāṇaḥphaṇitayaḥ ||
yadāsvādābhyāsapracayamahimollāsitadhiyāṃtadāsvādyaṃkāletadamṛtamanaṃtaṃsumanasām || 59 ||

yatikṣoṇībharturyadidamanidaṃbhogajanatāśiraśśriṇījuṣṭaṃtadihadṛḍhabaṃdhaṃprabhavati ||
avidyāraṇyānīkuharaviharanbhāmakamanaḥpramādyanmātaṃgaprathamanigalaṃpādayugalam || 60 ||

savitrīmuktānāṃsakalajagadenaḥpramaśanī garīyobhistīrhairupacitarasāyāmunamukhaiḥ ||
nirucchedānimnetaramapisamāplāvayatiyāyadṛcchāvikṣepādyatipatidayādivyataṭinī || 61 ||

ciṃtāśeṣadurarthadaṃturavacaḥkaṃthāśatagraṃthilāḥ siddhāṃtānasamiṃdhate yatipatigraṃthānusaṃdhāyinī ||
muktāśuktiviśuddhasiddhataṭinīcūḍālacūḍāpadaḥ kiṃkulyāṃkalayetakhaṃḍaparaśurmaṃḍūkamaṃjūṣikām || 62 ||

vaṃdetaṃ yamināṃdhuraṃdharamahaṃmānāṃdhakāradruhāṃpaṃthānaṃ paripaṃthināṃ nijadṛśāruṃdhānamiṃdhānayā ||
dattaṃ yenadayāsudhāṃbunidhināpītvāviśuddhaṃpayaḥ kālenaḥkariśailakṛṣṇajaladaḥkāṃkṣādhikaṃ varṣati || 63 ||

kāṣāyeṇagṛhītapītavasanādaṃḍaistribhirmaṃḍitāsāmūrtirmuramardanasya jayatitrayyaṃtasaṃrakṣiṇī ||
yatprakhyāpitatīrthavarghitadhiyāmabhyasya tāṃ yadguṇānāsiṃdhoranidaṃpraveśaniyatākīrtiḥ prajāgartinaḥ || 64 ||

lipselakṣmaṇayoginaḥ padayugaṃrathyā parāgacchaṭhārakṣārohaṇadhanyasūripariṣatsīmaṃtasīmāṃtikam ||
bhikṣāparyaṭanakṣaṇeṣuvibharāṃcakregalatkilviṣāyadvinayāsamiṣeṇapatramakarī(-)mudrāṃsamudrāṃbarā || 65 ||

nānātaṃtravilobhitenamanasānirṇītadurnītibhiḥkaṣṭaṃ kutsitadṛṣṭibhiryatipaterādeśavaideśikaiḥ ||

<p. 278>

vyāsohāsapadīkṛtaḥ parihṛtaḥ prācetasaścetarāḥ kṣiptaḥ keliśukaḥśukaḥ sa ca mudābādhāyabodhāyanaḥ || 66 ||

adhyātiṣṭhatimāmikāmatirasāvājanmarājanvatīpatyāsaṃyamināmanenajagatāmatyāhitacchedinā ||
yatsārasvatadugdhasāgarasudhāsiddhauṣadhāsvādināṃprasvāpāyanabobhaviti(-)bhagavanmāyā mahāyāminī || 67 ||

śuddhādeśavaśaṃvadīkṛtayatikṣoṇīśavāṇīśatapratyādiṣṭabahirgataśrutiśiraḥ(-)prāsādamāsīdati ||
dugdhodanvadapatyasannidhisudhāsāmodadāmodaraślakṣṇālokanadaurlalitya(-)lalitonmeṣāmanīṣāmama || 68 ||

āstāṃnāmayatīṃdrapaddhatijuṣāmājānaśuddhāmatistaccāvyājavidagdhamugdha(-)madhuraṃsārasvataṃ śāśvatam ||
kovācakṣurudaṃcayedapiparaḥsāṭopatarkacchaṭāśastrāśastrivihāranirbhararaṇā(-)svādeṣuvādeṣunaḥ || 69 ||

gādhātāthāgatānāṃgalatigamanikākāpilīkvāpilīnākṣīṇākāṇādavāṇī(-)druhiṇaharagirassaurabhaṃnārabhaṃte ||
kṣāmākaumāriloktirjagatigurumataṃgauravāddūravāṃtaṃkāśaṃkāśaṃ(-)karāderbhajatiyatipataubhadravedīṃtrivedim || 70 ||

viṣvagvyāpinyagādheyatinṛpatiyaśassaṃpadekārṇavesmiñchraddhāśuddhā(-)vagāhaiḥśubhamatibhirasauveṃkaṭeśobhiṣiktaḥ ||
prajñādaurjanyagarjatpratikathakavacastūlavātūlavṛtyāsaptatyāsāravatyā(-)samatanūtasatāṃprītimetāṃsametām || 71 ||

āśāmataṃgajagaṇānaviṣa hyavegānpādeyatikṣitibhṛtaḥprasabhaṃnirundhan ||
kāryaḥkathāhavakutūhalibhiḥpareṣāṃkarṇesa eṣakavitārkikasiṃhanādaḥ || 72 ||

upaśamitakudṛṣṭiviplavānāmupaniṣadāmupacāradīpikeyam ||
kabalitabhagavadvibhūtiyugmāṃdiśatutiṃyatirājasaptatirnaḥ || 73 ||

karatalāmalakīkṛtasatkathāśrutivataṃsitasūnṛtasūktayaḥ ||
divasatārakayaṃtisamatsarānyatipuraṃdarasaptatisādaraḥ || 74 ||

atha ālvārdhyānam (-)

(13) atha pohiyālvārdhyānam (-)

sāṃjalibaṃdhaḥ | paścācchikhaḥ | saroyogī || 1 ||

<p. 288>

(14) atha pūdhattālvārdhyānam (-)

sāṃjalibaṃdhaḥ | paścācchikhaḥ | bhūtayogī || 1 ||

(15) atha peyālvārdhyānam (-)

sāṃjalibaṃdhaḥ | paścācchikhaḥ | mahadāhvayaḥ || 1 ||

(16) atha tirmaleyālvārdhyānam (-)

ardhanimīlitākṣaḥ | prārthanāmudrāṃjaliḥ | puraścūḍaḥ | tiṣṭhati | bhaktisāraḥ || 1 ||

(17) atha nammālvārdhyānam (-)

dakṣecinmudrā | vāmepustakam | padmāsanam | dakṣekabarī | śrīśaṭhakopaḥ |

(18) atha kulaśekharālvārdhyānam (-)

tiṣṭhati | sāṃjalibaṃdhaḥ | mastakekirīṭam | bhaṭṭanāthaḥ || 1 ||

(19) atha periyālvārdhyānam (-)

tiṣṭhati | puraścūḍaḥ | karayostālau | viṣṇucittaḥ || 1 ||

(20) atha toṇḍarappaḍiyālvārdhyānam (-)

tiṣṭhati | sāṃjalibaṃdhaḥ | puraścūḍaḥ | vāmakaremaṇibaṃdhoparivaiṇavapuṣpabhājanaḥ | bhaktāṃghrireṇavaḥ || 1 ||

(21) atha tirappaṇiyālvārdhyānam (-)

tiṣṭhati | vīṇāvādanalagnakaraḥ | jaṭākuṃjobrahmaraṃdhre | munivāhanaḥ || 1 ||

(22) atha tribhaṅgyālvārdhyānam (-)

tiṣṭhati | dakṣakarekhaḍgaḥ | vāmakarecarma | jaṭākuṃjobrahmaraṃdhre | (1 ||

(23) atha parakāladhyānam (-)

śrīdevī tiṣthati | dakṣakarekamalam | ṛjuvāmahastaḥ | mastakekirīṭam || 1 ||

(24) atha bhāṣyakārarāmānujācāryadhyānam (-)

padmāsanaḥ | sāṃjalimudraḥ | dakṣabhāgetridaṃḍadhārī || 1 ||

<p. 289>

(prakārāṃtaram) (-)

upavītinamūrdhvapuḍravaṃtaṃ triṃjagatpuṇyaphalaṃtridaṃḍahastam ||
śaraṇāgatasārthavāhamīḍeśikhayāśekhariṇaṃpatiṃyatīnām || 1 ||

śrīraṃgeśovṛṣādrīśovaradoyaduśailarāṭ ||
poṣyaḥśiṣyoguruḥputroyasyataṃgurumāśraye || 2 || 

pāṭalavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

atha rāmānujadhāṭipaṃcakam (-)

pāṣaṃḍadrumaṣaṃḍadāvadahanaścārvākaśailāśaniḥ bauddhadhvāṃtanirāsavāsarapatirjainebhakaṃṭhīravaḥ ||
māyāvādibhujaṃgabhaṃgagaruḍaistraividyacūḍāmaṇiḥ śrīraṃgeśajayadhvajovijayaterāmānujoyaṃ muniḥ || 1 ||

pāṣaṃḍasāgaramahābaḍabāmukhāgniḥ śrīraṃgarājacaraṇāṃbujamūladāsaḥ ||
śrīviṣṇulokamaṇimaṃḍapamārgadāyīrāmānujovijayate yatirājarājaḥ || 2 ||

cāritroddhāradaṃḍaṃcaturanayapathālaṃkriyāketudaṃḍaṃsadvidyādīpadaṃḍaṃ sakalakalikathāsaṃhṛteḥkāladaṃḍam ||
trayyaṃtālaṃbadaṃḍaṃtribhuvanavijayacchatrasauvarṇadaṃḍaṃ dhatterāmānujāryaḥkavikathakaśirovajradaṃḍaṃtridaṃḍam || 3 ||

trayyāmāṃgalyasūtraṃtriyugayugapathārohaṇālaṃbasūtraṃ sadvidyākośasūtraṃharisuguṇamaṇervādasaṃdarbhasūtram ||
prajñāsūtraṃbudhānāṃpraśamadhanamaṇiḥpadminīnālasūtraṃ rakṣāsūtraṃmunīnāṃjayatu yatipatervakṣasibrahmasūtram || 4 ||

pāṣaṃḍaṣaṃḍagirikhaṃḍanavajradaṃḍāḥ pracchannabauddhamakarālayamaṃthadaṃḍāḥ ||
vedārthasārasukhadarśanadīpadaṃḍārāmānujasyavilasaṃtimunestridaṃḍāḥ || 5 ||

(25) atha vedāṃtācāryadhyānam (-) (varadācāryakṛtavedāṃtācāryamaṃgalāśāsane)

saśaṃkhacakralāṃchanaḥsadūrdhvapuṃḍramaṃḍitaḥsakaṃṭhalagnasattulasyanargha(-)padmamālikaḥ ||
sitāṃtarīyasottarīyayajñasūtraśobhitomamāvirastumānase guruḥsarvekaṭeśvaraḥ || 1 ||

(prakārāntaram) (-)

śrīmānvedāṃtavidyāgururavatusataḥsarvataṃtrasvataṃtrovyākhyāmudrāmasavye(-)dadhaditarakarepustakaṃsottarīyaḥ ||
dīvyacchubhrordhvapuṃḍronalinamaṇisarīsacchikhaḥsopavitodorañcacchaṃkhacakraḥ(-)kavikatakahariḥśrīśaghaṃṭāvatāraḥ || 1 ||

<p. 290>

(26) atha nañjīryadhyānam (-)

daṃḍī | sāṃjalibaṃdhaḥ | upaviṣṭaḥ | prapannakirīṭī | śiroveṣṭanam || 1 ||

(27) atha ramyajāmātṛmunidhyānam (-)

padmāsanāsīnaḥ || 1 ||

(28) atha madhurakavidhyānam (-)

karetālau | mastakaśikhaḥ | tiṣṭhati || 1 ||

(29) atha tirkkaccinaṃbikāṃcīpūrṇadhyānam (-)

sāṃjalibaṃdhaḥ | kakṣevyajanam | tiṣṭhati || 1 ||

(30) atha nāthamunidhyānam (-)

upaviṣṭaḥ | dakṣiṇakare cinmudrā | vāmepustakam | kirīṭam || 1 ||

(31) atha āluvaṃdācāryayāmunācāryadhyānam (-)

dakṣiṇakare cinmudrā | vāmepustakam | kakṣetridaṃḍaḥ | padmāsanam || 1 ||

(32) atha kūrattālvārdhyānam (-)

śrīvatsacihnaḥ | vāmakare pustakam | dakṣiṇe cinmudrā | padmāsanenopaviṣṭaḥ | cibukekeśavān | śmaśrumān | jaṭālaḥ ||

(33) atha pullalokācāryalokāryadhyānam (-)

dakṣe cinmudrā | vāmakare pustakam || (-) || 

(prakārāṃtareṇa) (-) sāṃjalibaṃdhopi || 1 || 10 ||

(34) atha viṣṇupaṃcaberamūrtīnāṃnāmāni (-) (pāṃcarātrāgame)

utsavaṃśayanaṃ caiva balisnapanake tathā ||
tīrthārcāberamityete paṃcaberāḥ prakīrtitāḥ || 1 ||

(prakārāntaram) (-)

(bhṛgusaṃhitāyāṃvaikhānasāgame) 

dhruṃvaṃcagrāmarakṣārthamūrcanārthaṃ tu kautukam ||
snapanaṃsnapanārthaṃsyādutsavaṃtūtsavārthakam || 1 ||

balyarthaṃ baliberaṃ ca paṃcaberānsamarcayet || 5 ||

<p. 291>

atha sāligrāmamūrtīnāṃnāmalakṣaṇaśilābhedādiviṣayeṣupraśnaḥ (narasihmapurāṇe brahmanāradasaṃvāde)

devādidevasarvajña lokeśakamalāsana ||
tvatprasādānmayāsarvaṃ jñātaṃjñeyaṃ vidhedhunā || 1 ||

idānīṃ śrotumicchāmi sāligrāmasya lakṣaṇam ||
tasyotpattiṃ nidānaṃ ca varṇaṃkṣetraṃ phalāphalam || 2 ||

mūrtibhedaṃ ca sarvasyāḥ sāligrāmaśilātanoḥ ||
tathārcanāyāṃ yogyatvaṃ tvadvākyena caturmukha || 3 ||

brahmovāca || 

sādhusādhumahāprājña kṛtaḥpraśnassunirmalaḥ || 
mayocyate vidhānena sāligrāmasya lakṣaṇam || 4 ||

utpattiṃ ca nidānaṃ ca varṇaṃkṣetraṃ phalāphalam ||
mūrtibhedaṃ ca pūjāyāṃ yogyatvaṃ munipuṃgava || 5 ||

(35) atha sāligrāmotpattideśakramāḥ (-) (tatraiva)

āsīdavantī deśeṣu nāmnā tu hariparvataḥ ||
sāligrāma itikṣetre haricakraśilāmaye || 1 ||

asyasmaraṇamātreṇa sarvapāpakṣayo bhavet ||
tatraivagaṃḍakyā khyātā nadīpāpapraṇāśinī || 2 ||

yajjalaspṛṣṭimātreṇa viṣṇu sā yujyamaśnute ||
tasmin parvatamūle tu cakratīrthaṃ mahatsaraḥ || 3 ||

tasyā nadyā nidānaṃ ca pravadaṃti purāvidaḥ ||
tasmin parvatatīrthesti sākṣāccakradharohariḥ || 4 ||

lakṣmyādharitryāsahito sānnidhyaṃ kurute mune ||
tacchilāsu ca sarvāsu harikṣetra gatāsu ca || 5 ||

śītavātavinirmukte śailagarbhe munīśvara ||
sarvalakṣaṇasaṃyuktā sāligrāmaśilā bhavet || 6 ||

sākṣāllakṣmīpaterviṣṇoḥ prasādātparameṣṭhinaḥ ||
utpattistacchilānāṃ tu puṇyakāleṣu vidyate || 7 ||

(36) atha teṣucakroptattikramaḥ (-) (tatraita)

paścātsahasravarṣāṇāṃ sāligrāmasya cakrake ||
vajrakīṭa itikhyāto jaṃturbhutvāharissvayam || 1 ||

hiraṇmayo mahāvīryo vidyullekhāsamaprabhaḥ ||
sāligrāmaśilāgarbhamāsādyakalanissvanaḥ || 2 ||

tatrasthaścakracihnāni mukhena kurute mune ||
nānāvidhāni cakrāṇi nānārupāṇi līlayā || 3 ||

antardadhāti tatraiva bahukālādanaṃtaram ||
sānnidhyaṃ kurute tatra sākṣāllakṣmīpatissadā || 4 ||

<p. 292>

tadālokanamātreṇa sarvapāpakṣayo bhavet ||
utpattirnāradoktaivaṃ vijñeyā munipuṃgava || 5 ||

(37) atha sāligrāmaśilānāṃvarṇarūpairbahuvidhatvam (-) (tatraiva)

śvetāpītātathāraktā kṛṣṇāśāḍvalasannibhā ||
kapilā ca tathādhūmrā kalaṃkā bahuvarṇinī || 1 ||

ativarṇā vivarṇā ca tathāsaṃdigdhavarṇinī ||
evaṃ vidhaistathā varṇairūpairnānāvidhāśilā || 2 ||

(38) atha sāligrāmakṣetrāṇāṃvarṇāḥ (-) (tatraiva)

kṣetraṃ tu vāsudevasya śvetavarṇaṃ pracakṣate ||
pītāhairaṇyagarbhāsyādraktāpradyumnarūpiṇī || 1 ||

kṛṣṇā tu viṣṇusukṣetraṃ syācchilāmunipuṃgava ||
śrīmannārāyaṇakṣetraṃ haritāṃgaṃ vidurbudhāḥ || 2 ||

kapilānārasiṃhīsyādvāmanītvatasīnibhā ||

atha sāligrāmakṣetravarṇabhedānāṃphalāni (-) (tatraiva)

śreṣṭhāsyāttu viśeṣeṇa bhūmrā tu yati pūjane ||
kalaṃkākṣayakārīsyādanaṃtobahuvarṇabhāk || 1 ||

ativarṇāduḥkhadāsyādvivarṇākulanāśinī ||
saṃdigdhavarṇāhaṃtrīsyāditikṣetraphalaṃ mune || 2 ||

patnīghnīkapilā caiva nīlālakṣmī pradāyinī ||
puṣṭidā vṛddhidā śyāmā raktārājyakarītathā || 3 ||

atiraktāmṛtyudāsyādgaurādhanakarī tathā ||
bahuvarṇā śrīkarīsyādvivarṇā niṣpalā tathā || 4 ||

śvetavarṇāmokṣadāsyāt saṃdigdhā sarvanāśinī ||

(39) atha sāligrāmarandhrapramāṇamāha (-) (tatraiva)

sūtreṇaveṣṭayenmadhyaṃ sāligrāmasya baddhimān ||
tadaṣṭāṃśa pramāṇaṃ syāduttamaṃ yasya gahvaram || 1 ||

vakresūtrāṣṭamobhāga uttamāmadhyamā ubhau ||
bhāgatrayaṃ jaghanyasyāt sāligrāmasya lakṣaṇam || 1 ||

atha sāligrāmeṣuvaktraphalānyāha (-) (tatraiva)

adhovaktraṃbhīkaraṃcordhvāsyamuccāṭanakriyam ||
samavaktraṃ viśiṣṭaṃ syāt pārśvāsyaṃ bhāgya hṛdbhavet || 1 ||

vakrāsyaṃ vyādhijanakaṃ dīrghāsyaṃ sarvabhakṣakam ||
mūrtibhedaṃsamāśodhya paścāllakṣaṇamādiśet || 2 ||

<p. 293>

atha daśāvatāramūrtīnāṃnāmāni (-) (tatraiva)

mūrtaścātha kathyaṃte yathāvacchṛṇusattama ||
matsyaḥkūrmovarāhaśca nārasiṃhotha vāmanaḥ || 1 ||

rāmorāmaśca rāmaśca budhaḥkalkarimedaśa || 10 ||

(40) atha sāligrāmeṣu mūrtīnāṃlakṣaṇāni (-) (nṛsihmapurāṇe)

tatrādau (matsyamūrtiḥ) (-)

matsyākṛtimukhākārāṃ mukhasaṃdṛśya cakrakām ||
śrīvatsabiṃdumālāḍhyāṃ matsyamūrtiṃ śubhāṃviduḥ || 1 ||

(mahākūrmamūrtiḥ) (-)

vartulaḥkamalākāro vanamālābja cakravān ||
pālāśohemabiṃdu śrīrmahākūrmastu durlabhaḥ || 1 ||

(vārāhamūrtiḥ) (-) 

dīrghāsyaṃ śyāmalākāraṃ pṛthvīvalayaveṣṭitam ||
dvāradeśelasaccakraṃ vārāhaṃ tadvidurbudhāḥ || 1 ||

(buddhamūrtiḥ) (-) 

raṃdhradṛśyadvayopāṃta aṃtaścakra dvayānvitām ||
śirodṛṣṭordhvacakraṃ ca pārśvayorvāpi dṛśyate || 1 || 

nānāvarṇamayīṃ vāpi buddhamūrtiṃ pracakṣate ||

(nārasihmamūrtiḥ) (-) 

dīrghāsyaḥ kapilākāro dīrghacakro mahodaraḥ ||
nārasiṃha itikhyāto yogyomaskari pūjane || 1 ||

(lakṣmīnṛsīhmamūrtiḥ) (-) 

vāmabhāgastha cakrāḍhyaḥ kṛṣṇavarṇassabiṃdukaḥ ||
lakṣmīnṛsiṃha ākhyāto bhuktimuktiphalapradaḥ || 1 ||

(vāmanamūrtiḥ) (-) 

iṃdranīlanibhākāraṃ vanamālāṃbujojjvalam ||
hrasvaṃ suvartulaṃ caiva vāmanaṃ paricakṣate || 1 ||

(paraśurāmamūrtiḥ) (-) 

lasatparaśurekhāḍhyo dūrvāśyāmastathonnataḥ ||
nābhideśalasaccakro rāmassyājjamadagnijaḥ || 1 ||

(śrīrāmamūrtiḥ) (-) 

rekhākāradhanurbāṇaṃ sthūlaṃ dīrghaṃ sa biṃdukam ||
nābhicaktraṃ bahucchidraṃ śyāmaṃ dāśarathiṃ viduḥ || 1 ||

(balarāmamūrtiḥ) (-) 

halarekho musalavāñchuklābhovanadāmavān ||
madhubiṃdudharaḥ śrīmānrāmassaṃkarṣaṇaśśubhaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 294>

(śrīghanamūrtiḥ) (-) 

sahasrabiṃdusaṃyuktaṃ dharmacakrasamanvitam ||
śvetavarṇamatiślakṣaṇaṃ sarvajñaṃ śrīghanaṃ viduḥ || 1 ||

(kalkimūrtiḥ) (-) 

hayarekhāsamāyukto rekhākuṃtā yudhākṛtiḥ ||
śvetavarṇo dīrghamukhaḥ kalkirityabhidhīyate || 1 ||

(śrīkṛṣṇamūrtiḥ) (-) 

rekhāpaṃcāyudhadharaṃ vanamālāvibhūṣitam ||
abjacihnaṃ sūkṣmacakraṃ kṛṣṇamenaṃ pracakṣate || 1 ||

(śrīgopālamūrtiḥ) (-) 

etallakṣaṇasaṃyuktaṃ paṃcāyudhavilekhanam ||
nīraṃdhraṃ vartulaṃ vāpi dīrghaṃ vāmālikā yutam || 1 ||

ekaikaṃ vā pṛthagvāpi tattadvigrahavarṇakam ||
evaṃ lakṣaṇasaṃyuktaṃ dīrghākāraṃ mahodaram || 2 ||

śrīgopālamimaṃprāhussarekhāvaṃśagahvaram || 1 ||

(dadhivāmanamūrtiḥ) (-) 

adhaścakrāgravilasaddadhibiṃdusamanvitam ||
vāmanaṃnīlaraktāṃgaṃ vadaṃti dadhi vāmanam || 1 ||

(dadhigopālavāmanamūrtiḥ) (-) 

ūrdhvacakrāgravilasaddaghibubdudaśobhitām ||
mūrtidadhātigotrīsyād dadhi gopālavāmanaḥ || 1 ||

(santānagopālamūrtiḥ) (-) 

daṃḍaśṛṃgayutaḥpārśve veṇunā śobhito mukhe ||
sasmātsaṃtānagopālo putrapautrābhi vṛddhidaḥ || 1 ||

iṃdranīlanibhodīrgho vanamālāvibhūṣitaḥ ||
aṃkuśākāravadano dharmacakrasamanvitaḥ || 2 || 1 ||

(pradyumnamūrtiḥ) (-) 

japākusumasaṃkāśaṃ vanamālāvibhūṣitam ||
dhanurbāṇāṃbujadharaṃ pradyumnaṃ ceṣṭadaṃ viduḥ || 1 ||

(aniruddhamūrtiḥ) (-) 

pradyumnalakṣaṇairyuktaṃ sūkṣmacakralasanmukham ||
suvarṇarūpyarekhāḍhyamaniruddhaṃ vidurbudhāḥ || 1 ||

(hayagrīvamūrtiḥ) (-) 

aṃkuśākāravadanaṃ dīrghabiṃdusamajjvalam ||
pakvajaṃbūphalākāraṃ hayagrīvaṃ vadaṃtyamum || 1 ||

(śrīdharamūrtiḥ) (-) 

ghanaśāḍvalasaṃkāśaṃ vanamālāvibhūṣitam ||
kiṃcidviṣamacakrāḍhyaṃ śrīdharaṃ śrīkaraṃ viduḥ || 1 ||

<p. 295>

(lakṣmīnārāyaṇamūrtiḥ) (-) 

nimnākāraṃ śiraścakraṃ suvṛttaṃ śītalā kṛti ||
dvāradvaye catuścakraṃ vāme vā dakṣiṇepi vā || 1 ||

śrīvatsaśaṃkhacakrāḍhyaṃ lakṣmīnārāyaṇaṃ viduḥ || 1 ||

(padmanābhamūrtiḥ) (-) 

nābhicakrollasatpadmo jaṃbūphalasamaprabhaḥ ||
padmanābha itikhyātastaṃ bidurnākadaṃ budhāḥ || 1 ||

(govindamūrtiḥ) (-) 

navadūrvādalaśyāmo vanamālāvibhūṣitaḥ ||
daśaraṃdhrasamāyukto viṃśaccakrasamanvitaḥ || 1 ||

goviṃda itivikhyātaḥ sarvakāmaphalapradaḥ || 1 ||

(viśvarūpamūrtiḥ) (-) 

jñeyodvādaśaraṃdhrastu caturviṃśati cakrakaḥ ||
viśvarūpa itikhyāto bhuktimuktiphalapradaḥ || 1 ||

(anantamūrtiḥ) (-) 

śrīvatsaśaṃkhacakrāḍhyaṃ paṃcāyudhalasattanum ||
samaṃsūkṣmaṃ lasaccakraṃ paṃkajadvayaśobhitam || 1 ||
sadāsuśītalatanumanaṃtamanalojjvalam || 

(lakṣmīnārāyaṇamūrtiḥ) (-) 

dvāradeśelasadrekhaṃ pakṣirājasurekhakam ||
lakṣmīnārāyaṇaṃ prāhurdurlabhaṃ śīghrasiddhidam || 1 ||

(nārāyaṇamūrtiḥ) (-) 

uktalakṣaṇasaṃyuktaṃ śeṣabhogena veṣṭitam ||
nārāyaṇamimaṃprāhurnāradeṣṭaphalapradam || 1 ||

(dāmodaramūrtiḥ) (-) 

kiṃcidviṣamacakrāḍhyamiṃdranīlasamaprabham ||
vanamālālasaccakraṃ prāhurdāmodaraṃ mune || 1 ||

(anantamūrtiḥ) (-) 

nānāvarṇasamāyukto nāgaveṣṭanasannibhaḥ ||
anaṃtamūrtirvijñeyo harirlakṣmīpradāyakaḥ || 1 ||

(trivikramamūrtiḥ) (-) 

dīrghākāromahātejāśśaṃkhacakragadāṃkavān ||
vanamālādharaśśrīmāntrivikrama udāhṛtaḥ || 1 ||

(janārdanamūrtiḥ) (-) 

śaṃkhacakrābjamālāṃko nīlaśśūlākṛtiśśubhaḥ ||
nanārdana itikhyāto himāṃśupariśītalaḥ || 1 ||

(vāsudevamūrtiḥ) (-) 

rekhāpaṃcāyudhadharo himāṃśu sadṛśaprabhaḥ ||
nābhicakradharaśśāṃto vāsudeva itīritaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 296>

(śrīviṣṇumūrtiḥ) (-) 

viṣṇukrāṃtanibhākāro vanamālābja cihnakaḥ ||
paṃcāyudhadharaśśrīmān viṣṇurityucyate budhaiḥ || 1 ||

(acyutamūrtiḥ) (-) 

nīlasthūlasamākāro vanamālāvibhūṣitaḥ ||
sūkṣmacakrassamaśślakṣṇo hyacyutassamudīritaḥ || 1 ||

(upendramūrtiḥ) (-) 

śaṃkhacakragadācihnā nīlavarṇolasattanuḥ ||
upeṃdramūrtirvikhayātā harissaukhyaśubhapradā || 1 ||

(śivanābhamūrtiḥ) (-) 

gajavṛttāsthūlarekhā dṛśyate yasya madhyataḥ ||
śivanābhassavijñeyo durlabhassarvakāmadaḥ || 1 ||

(hiraṇyagarbhamūrtiḥ) (-) 

dvāraṃ na dṛśyate yasya nīlavarṇassuśītalaḥ ||
hiraṇyagarbhaḥ khyātosau hemagarbhaḥ śubhapradaḥ || 1 ||

(madanagopālamūrtiḥ) (-) 

ardhaśyāmordharaktaśca śaṃkhacakradhanuśśarī ||
dīrghassuṣiravānvāme gopālomadanā hvayaḥ || 1 ||

(janārdanamūrtiḥ) (-) 

aṃtarlakṣyacatuścakraṃ śītalaṃcotpalaprabham ||
janārdanaṃ vijānaṃti vanamālābhiveṣṭitam || 1 ||

(prakārāntaram) (-) 

dvāraṣaṭkasamāyuktaṃ cakradvādaśakojjvalam ||
vanamālāyutaṃ ślakṣṇamāhustaṃ ca janārdanam || 1 ||

(lakṣmīnārāyaṇamūrtiḥ) (-) 

dve dve cakre tvadhaścordhvaṃ lakṣmīnārāyaṇa smṛtaḥ || 1 ||

(śrīmannārāyaṇamūrtiḥ) (-) 

dve dve cakre ca pārśvasthe śrīmannārāyaṇaḥ smṛtaḥ ||

(sudarśanamūrtiḥ) (-) 

vṛttākāraṃ tu dīrghaṃ vā dvāradṛṣṭaika cakrakam || 1 ||

sudarśanaṃ vijānaṃti biṃduyuktaṃ vicakṣaṇāḥ ||

(prakārāntaram) (-)

cakradvayaṃ bilenastaḥ yasya mūrdhni sudarśanam ||
raktamūrdhvamitiprāhurmahograṃ yati pūjane || 1 ||

(vanamālimūrtiḥ) (-) 

bilapārśvastha daṃṣṭrāṃka maṃtaścakra dvayojjvalam ||
kapilaṃ vakravadanaṃ tatpārsve vanamālinam || 1 ||

(mahājvālānṛsihmamūrtiḥ) (-) 

sthūlaṃ ca vivṛtāsyaṃ ca nīlaṃ vā kapilaṃ pṛthum ||
mahājvālā nṛsiṃhaṃ taṃ yatipūjyaṃ mahāmune || 1 ||

<p. 297>

(śivanābhamūrtiḥ) (-) 

ūrdhvaraṃdhralasalliṃgaṃ suvṛttaṃ śītalā kṛtim ||
śrīkaraṃśivanābhākhyaṃ sarvasaubhāgyavardhanam || 1 ||

(buddhamūrtiḥ) (-) 

raṃdhreṣva dṛṣṭacakraṃ ca paṃkākāraṃ sa biṃdukam ||
buddhākāraṃ vijānīyāccakraṃ vā malināvaham || 1 ||

(lakṣmīnṛsihmamūrtiḥ) (-) 

mahaccakrāṃtikalasansūkṣmacakrabilāṃtaram ||
lakṣmīnṛsiṃhaṃkapilaṃ varṇataḥ kṣetrabhāvanā || 1 ||

(śvetavarāhamūrtiḥ) (-) 

dīrghaghoṇasamāyuktamekadaṃṣṭraṃ sunirmalam ||
vanamālāyutaṃ ramyaṃ śvetaṃ vārāhamucyate || 1 ||

(bhuvarāhamūrtiḥ) (-) 

adhaścakrāṃtikalasadekadaṃṣṭraṃsamucchritam ||
aṃkuśākāravadanaṃ bhūvarāhaṃ śubhapradam || 1 ||

(kūrmamūrtiḥ) (-) 

sthūlaṃ ca nibiḍākāraṃ śyāmavarṇaṃ sa cakrakam ||
karburaṃ vāthakapilaṃ śyāmaṃ kūrmaṃ vidurbudhāḥ || 1 ||

(hṛṣīkeśamūrtiḥ) (-) 

paṃcaraṃdhrasamāyuktaṃ daśacakrasamanvitam ||
śyāmalaṃ komalākāraṃ hṛṣīkeśaṃ pracakṣate || 1 ||

(keśavamūrtiḥ) (-) 

rājatairbiṃdubhirhaimairanvitaṃ sūkṣmacakrakam ||
vanamālānvitaṃ śyāmaṃ keśavākhyaṃ vidurbudhāḥ || 1 ||

(acyutamūrtiḥ) (-) 

bahiścakrasamāyuktamaṃtaścakra dvayānvitam ||
mūrtaṃtamacyutaṃ jñeyaṃ sūkṣmaraṃdhraṃ suśītalam || 1 ||

(vaikuṇṭhamūrtiḥ)  (-) 

rekhāṣṭakāyudhopetaṃ padmanīkāśagahvaram ||
vanamālānvitaṃ śyāmaṃ vaikuṃṭhaṃ komalaṃ viduḥ || 1 ||

(viṣṭaraśravomūrtiḥ) (-) pārśvaraṃdhra dvayopetaṃ vanamālābhiveṣṭitam ||
viṣṭaraśravasaṃprāhusthūlaṃ dīrghaṃ ca cakriṇam || 1 ||

(hiraṇyagarbhaḥ) (-) 

himāṃśusadṛśākāraṃ ślakṣṇaṃ sthūlaṃ tathocchritam ||
hiraṇyagarbhamāhustaṃ dvāradṛṣṭasudarśanam || 1 ||

(hariharabrahmamūrtiḥ) (-) 

śaṃkhacakrāhikamalakamaṃḍaluparaśvadhaiḥ ||
mālātrayeṇasaṃyuktaṃ mūrtitrayamidaṃ viduḥ || 1 ||

<p. 298>

(kūrmavarāhamūrtiḥ) (-) 

biṃdudvayasamāyukta cakraṃ vā śaṃkhalāṃchanam ||
viṣṇulakṣaṇamāsyaṃ cāpyāsya cakraṃ samīpagam || 1 ||

tattallakṣaṇasaṃyuktaṃ bhānorvimalapaṃcakam ||
kūrmamūrtirvarāhaśca durlabhaṃ sarvakāmadam || 2 ||

(matsyamūrtiḥ) (-) 

matsyākāraṃ mahāsnigdhaṃ biṃdunoparibhuṣitam ||
daṃṣṭre vā śaktiliṃgaṃ ca vaktre tu viṣamasthite || 1 ||

(varāhamūrtiḥ) (-) 

iṃdranīlanibhāsthūlā trirekhālāṃchitā śubhā ||
varāhamūrtirvijñeyā sarvakāmaphalapradā || 1 ||

(kapilānārasihmamūrtiḥ) (-) 

kapilānārasiṃhaṃ tu daṃṣṭre vā sthūla cakrakam ||
vanamālā suniṣpannaṃ pṛthucakraṃ sudarśanam || 1 ||

brahmacaryeṇasaṃpūjyā bhuktimuktipradāyinī || 1 ||

(vāmanamūrtiḥ) (-) 

atasīpuṣpasaṃkāśaṃ biṃdunoparibhūṣitam ||
kṣataṃ kuṃḍalasaṃyuktaṃ vaktre vā biṃdupūrvakam || 1 ||

hrasvaṃ ca vartulaṃ caiva vāmanaṃ parikīrtayet || 1 ||

(dadhivāmanamūrtiḥ) (-) 

hrasvaṃsuvartulaṃ caiva biṃduno paribhūṣitam ||
śyāmalaṃ kṛṣṇavarṇaṃ cāpyāsya cakraṃsamīpagam || 1 ||

dadhivāmanamāhustaṃ durlabhaṃ sarvakāmadam ||

(prakārāntaram) (-) 

biṃdudvayaṃ ca hrasvaṃ ca śrīkaraṃ vanamālayā ||
kṛṣṇavarṇaṃ mahāsnigdhaṃ biṃdunoparibhūṣitam || 1 ||

dadhivāmanamityāhurbhuktimuktiphalapradam || 1 ||

(lakṣmīnṛsihmamūrtiḥ) (-) 

vāmecakradvayayutaḥ kṛṣṇavarṇassabiṃdukaḥ ||
lakṣmīnṛsiṃho vijñeyo bhuktimuktiphalapradaḥ || 1 ||

(rāmākhyamūrtiḥ) (-) 

kadaṃbakusumākāraṃ biṃdunāparibhūṣitam ||
dhanurbāṇākhyarekhāḍhyaṃ padmarekhāsamanvitam || 1 ||

rāmaṃ rāmaṃ ca rāmaṃ ca durlabhaṃ sarvakāmadam || 1 ||

(śrīrāmamūrtiḥ) (-) 

kodaṃḍakukkuṭāṃḍābha śyāmalonnatapṛṣṭhakam ||
savyāpasavyatūṇīraṃ pṛṣṭe cāpavirājitam || 1 ||

kalpadrumasamāyuktaṃ pṛṣṭecchatrasamanvitam ||
rāmaṃdāśarathiṃviddhi durlabhaṃ bhuvanatraye || 2 ||

<p. 299>

(śrīsītārāmamūrtiḥ) (-) 

kukkuṭāṃḍasamopeta(mākāra)madhovaktraṃ sa kuṃḍalam ||
dvāradeśe same cakre kalpavṛkṣa su cihnakam || 1 ||

vāmapārśve śiraścakraṃ rekhālāṃchita cihnakam ||
sītārāmaṃ tu taṃ viddhi bhuktimukti phalapradam || 2 ||

(gopālakṣetram) (-) 

jaṃbūphalasamākāraṃ kṛṣṇavarṇaṃ sa biṃdukam ||
pṛḍṭhe suṣiramāramya vaktremakarakuṃḍalam || 1 ||

lalāṭevāmabāṇaṃ tu biṃdunā cāpasaṃyutam ||
gopālakṣetramutpattyā sa rāmaṃ tasya lakṣaṇam || 2 ||

śatrunāśakaraṃ proktaṃ sarvakāmaphalapradam ||
aputreputraphaladaṃ sarvamaṃgalakārakam || 3 ||

(brahmamūrtiḥ) (-) 

parameṣṭhī tu śuklābhaḥ cakramekaṃ tathāṃbujam ||
suvartulaṃ tathāpītaṃ pṛṣṭhatassuṣiraṃdhruvam || 1 ||

brahmamūrtistu vijñeyā bhogamokṣaphalapradā || 1 ||

(vāsudevamūrtiḥ) (-) 

pūgīphalasamākāro hrasvaśca parivartulaḥ ||
dvāradeśe samecakre dṛśyete nāṃtarīyake || 1 ||

vāsudevassatujñeyaḥ śuklābhaśca svatejasā ||
apamṛyuharaṃścaiva sarvakāmaphalapradaḥ || 2 || 1 ||

(mahāviṣṇumūrtiḥ) (-) 

sudarśanaṃ mahāviṣṇuṃ rekhācakraṃ mahādyutim ||
kṛṣṇavarṇaṃ suvikhyātaṃ sarvamṛtyuharaṃ śubham || 1 ||

(nārāyaṇamūrtiḥ) (-) 

śyāmaṃ nārāyaṇaṃ viddhi nābhicakramathonnatam ||
dīrgharekhāsamākrāntaṃ suvarṇavanamālikam || 1 ||

ayaṃ nārāyaṇo jñeya apamṛtyu haraśśubhaḥ || 1 ||

(lakṣmīnārāyaṇamūrtiḥ) (-) 

dhvajavajrāṃkitaṃ pītaṃ vāmapārśve tu varttulam ||
dīrgharekhāsamākrāntaṃ catuścakrasamanvitam || 1 ||

musalāsidhanurmālāśaṃkhacakragadānvitam ||
lakṣmīnārāyaṇākhyaṃ ca mukhenābhau ca nārada || 2 ||

sarvasiddhipradaṃ divyaṃ sarvakarmaśubhapradam ||
sarvasaubhāgyadaṃ nṝṇāṃ lakṣmīnārāyaṇaṃ viduḥ || 3 || 1 ||

(śrīdharamūrtiḥ) (-) 

śrīdharaṃ tu tato deva cihnitaṃ vanamālayā ||
kadaṃbakusumākāraṃ sarvasiddhipradaṃ śubham || 1 ||

<p. 300>

(saṃkarṣaṇamūrtiḥ) (-) 

dve cakre ekalagne tu pūrvabhāge tu puṣkalam ||
saṃkarṣaṇaṃvijānīyādraktābhañcātiśobhanam || 1 ||

(pradyumnamūrtiḥ) (-) 

pradyumnaḥ sūkṣmacakrastu pītodīptastathaivaca ||
suṣirairbahulaiścaiva dīrghākārastu tadbhavet || 1 ||

(viṣṇumūrtiḥ) (-) 

aniruddhaṃ tu nīlābhaṃ vartulaṃ cāti śobhitam ||
kṛṣṇavarṇaṃ tathāviṣṇuṃ sthūlacakraṃ suśobhanam || 1 ||

(kṛṣṇamūrtiḥ) (-) 

gadākṛtiḥ sadārekhā lakṣyate madhyadeśataḥ ||
kṛṣṇamūrtissuvijñeyā bhogamokṣaphalapradā || 1 ||

(kūrmamūrtiḥ) (-) 

kūrmaścaivonnataḥpṛṣṭe śvetabhogakhurānvitaḥ ||
sakṛṣṇavarṇabiṃdussyānnirmalaḥ parikīrtitaḥ || 1 ||

kūrmastvevaṃ sa vijñeyassarvakarmaśubhapradaḥ || 1 ||

(anantamūrtiḥ) (-) 

nānāvarṇamanaṃtaṃ ca nāgabhogasucihnitam ||
dhvajākārā tadārekhā lakṣyate madhyadeśataḥ || 1 ||

śeṣākāraṃ mahāsthūlaṃ saptacakrasamanvitam ||

(prakārāntaram) (-) 

athavā cāṣṭacakraṃ tu daśacakraṃśubhāvaham ||
cakratrayodaśaṃ puṇyaṃ caturdaśamahāphalam || 1 ||

pītavarṇaṃ tathākṛṣṇaṃ bahuvarṇaṃ ca nīlakam ||
cakraśaṃkhagadāpadma vanamālāvibhūṣitam || 2 ||

anaṃtaṃ taṃ vijānīyāt sarvasaubhāgyadāyinam || 1 ||

(trivikramamūrtiḥ) (-) 

kukkuṭāṃḍasamākāraḥ ūrdhvacakrasuśobhanaḥ ||
dve cakre caikabhāge tu pūrvabhāge tu puṣkalaḥ || 1 ||

dhvajākārasubiṃdvāḍhyaḥ śaṃkhalāṃgalasaṃyutaḥ ||
trivikramassavijñeyo hyapamṛtyuharaḥ śubhaḥ || 2 || 1 ||

(lakṣmīgopālamūrtiḥ) (-) 

kukkuṭāṃḍasamākāraṃ śrīdharaṃvanamālinam ||
veṇulāṃgalacihnaṃ ca kuṃḍalābhyāṃ suśobhitam || 1 ||

lakṣmīgopālamāhustaṃ durlabhaṃbhuvanatraye || 
putralābhaṃ tathāmokṣaṃ bhuktiṃmuktiṃ dadāti ca || 2 || 1 ||

(śrīharimūrtiḥ) (-) 

sthūlacakro bhaveddevo harirlohitavarṇakaḥ || 1 ||

(balabhadramūrtiḥ) (-) 

balabhadro bhaved devo kīrtigotavivardhanaḥ ||
śyāmavarṇo mahāsnigdhaśchatrākārastathaiva ca || 1 ||

<p. 301>

sūkṣmadvāreṇabiṃdūnāṃ raktarekhābhiranvitaḥ ||
śirṣe tu puṣkalaṃ bibhranmahāsnigdhaṃ ca komalam || 2 ||

(gopālamūrtiḥ) (-) 

gopālamūrtirvijñeyā durlabhā bhuvanatraye ||
putralābhaṃ tathāmokṣaṃ gavāṃ vṛddhiṃ dadāti sā || 1 ||

(lakṣmīgopālamūrtiḥ) (-) 

sarvaśatruvināśāya lakṣmīgopālakaṃ sadā ||
chatrākāraṃmahāsnigdhaṃ dvāraṃ nāsti sa biṃdukam || 1 ||

sthūlaṃ śreṣṭhaṃ guru tathā mahātejaḥ prakāśitam ||

(varāhakṣetram) (-) 

varāharūpo devānāṃ śyāmalonnatapṛṣṭhakaḥ ||
pṛṣṭhabhāge tathāhema biṃdunāparibhūṣitaḥ || 1 ||

same dve cakrake cādhaḥ sūkṣmacakraṃ sucihnitam || 

vārāhakṣetramuptattyā || 1 ||

(catuścakraṃjanārdanaḥ) (-) catuścakraṃjanārdanaḥ || 189 ||

(41) atha sudarśanādimūrtīnāṃlakṣaṇāni (-) (prakārāntareṇa)

ekaṃ sudarśane cakraṃ lakṣmīnārāyaṇe dvikam ||
tricakraṃ cācyute jñeyaṃ catuścakraṃ janārdane || 1 ||

paṃcacakraṃ vāsudeve ṣaṭkaṃsaṃkarṣaṇe tathā ||
saptacakraṃ tu vārāhe cāṣṭakaṃ ca puruṣottame || 2 ||

navakaṃnārasiṃhe ca daśakaṃvāmane tathā ||
ekādaśa tu pradyumne tvanaṃte dvādaśa smṛtām || 3 ||

anyeṣubahūcakreṣu paramātmāpratiṣṭhitaḥ || 12 ||

atha mūrtiviśeṣapūjāphalam (-)

hiraṇyagarbhovijñeyaḥ pūjākartuśca śobhanaḥ ||
śivanābhasahasraṃ ca sāligrāmasahasrakam || 1 ||

pūjāphalaiḥsamaṃproktaṃ bhuktimuktipradāyakam ||

(42) atha kāsāṃcinmūrtīnāṃ svarūpāṇidurnirūpāṇi (-) (tatraiva)

mūmaṃti yāvatyoviṣṇossākṣācchriyaḥ pateḥ ||
tāvatyomūrtayassaṃti sāligrāmeṣunārada || 1 ||

sāligrāmaśilānāṃ tu mūrtīnāṃ pṛthagātmatā ||
na śakyate mayāvaktuṃ kalpakoṭiśatairapi || 2 ||

(43) atha pūjāyāṃvarjyamūrtīnāṃ svarūpāṇi (-) (tatraiva)

ākoṇaṃ darduraṃ caiva dagdhamuṣṇaṃ kalaṃkitam ||
acakraṃ tu tathāghṛṣṭaṃ vakrāsyaṃ bhinnamevavā || 1 ||

<p. 302>

bahucakraṃ vakracakraṃ tiryakcakraṃ tathā tyajet ||
dīrghaśobhitamacchāṃgamasaumyākṛtimeva vā || 2 ||

bahubāṇasamāyuktaṃ sphuritālakṣyacakrakam || 3 ||

apakvapanasākāraṃ babhvrākāraṃ parityajet ||
baṃdhanaṃ baddhacakraṃ ca krūracakraṃ tathā tyajet || 4 ||

karālaṃ vikarāla ca vakratuṃḍaṃ tathaiva ca ||
dardduraṃ sphuṭitaṃ dagdhaṃ trikoṇaṃ parivarjayet || 1 ||

aṃtassphuṭitabhagnaṃ ca baddhacakraṃ tathaiva ca ||
bahurekhaṃ paricchidraṃ tiryakcakraṃ tathā tyajet || 2 ||

atha varjyasāligrāmapūjanephalānyāha (-)

dardduraṃdagdhamuṣṇaṃ syāddhuḥkhadāridryadāyi ca ||
baṃdhakaṃbaddhacakraṃ ca trikoṇaṃ baṃdhunāśanam || 1 ||

aṃtassphuṭitacakraṃ ca baṃdhuputravināśakam ||
arthadhnīvimalā ca syāt karkaśaṃ kṣetrameva ca || 2 ||

vikarālaṃ mahāduḥkhaṃ karālaṃkulanāśanam ||

(44) atha pūjāyāṃgrāhyamūrtiparīkṣā (-) (tatraiva)

kṣīre vā taṃḍule vāpi sāligrāmaṃ niveśayet ||
ghanatvaṃ vṛddhamālokya gṛhṇīyādbuddhimānnaraḥ || 1 ||

atha sāligrāmamūrtidānatanmantrakrayavikrayaniṣedhāḥ (-) (tatraiva)

sāligrāmeṣu tiṣṭhaṃti bhuvanāni caturdaśa ||
tasmādasyapradānena prītobhavatu mādhavaḥ || 1 ||

arcitaṃ pratigṛhṇīyād dadyādarcitameva vā ||
tāvubhaupuṇyakarmāṇau narakīkrayavikrayī || 2 ||

atha sāligrāmamātrasannihitodeśaśśuddhaḥ (-) (tatraiva)

khaṃḍitaṃ sphuṭitaṃ bhinnaṃ pārśvabhinnaṃ vibheditam ||
sāligrāmavapuryatra tatra doṣo na vidyate || 1 ||

(anyatrāpi) (-) 

sāligrāmaśilābhagnā pūjanīyā sa cakrakā ||
khaṇḍitā sphuṭitā vāpi sāligrāmaśilā śubhā || 1 ||

(45) atha śūdrastrīpatitādibhisspṛṣṭāḥpūjitāvāmurtayonapūjyāḥ (-) (skānde)

śūdrovānupatīto vā striyo vā patitopi vā ||
keśavaṃ vā śivaṃ vāpi spṛṣṭvā naraka maśnute || 1 ||

<p. 303>

prāyaścittavihīnāni pāpāni śṛṇubhūpate ||
yaśśūdreṇārcitaṃ liṅgaṃ viṣṇuṃ vā praṇamennaraḥ || 2 ||

na tasya niṣkṛtirdṛṣṭā prāyaścittādikalpanaiḥ ||
sa sarvayātanābhogī yāvadā candratārakam || 3 ||

kṛtvāsaṃprokṣaṇaṃ tatra yajeddevaṃ vicakṣaṇaḥ ||
(saṃprokṣaṇavidhikramastvāgamādigrantheṣudṛṣṭavyaḥ ||

(46) atha brahmacārigṛhasthayatipūjyamūrtīnāṃ vivekaḥ (-)

brahmacārī ca sannyāsī bahucakraṃ prapūjayet ||
paṃkābhaṃ barbaraṃ caiva mṛgendrasadṛśākṛtim || 1 ||

bhīṣaṇāsyaṃ vahninibhaṃ yatissaṃpūjayenmune ||
saumyaścedgṛhibhiḥ pūjyahyonyathā pūjanaṃ na hi || 2 ||

(47) atha gṛhepūjyaśivaliṅgasāligrāmādisaṃkhyānirṇayaḥ (-)

gṛheliṅgadvayaṃnārcyaṃ śāligrāmadvayaṃ tathā ||
