sāligrāmāḥ samāḥ pūjyāssameṣu dvitayaṃ na hi ||
viṣamānaiva pūjyāstu viṣameṣveka evahi || 4 ||

(48) atha sāligrāmatīrthaprāśanamahimā (-) (nṛsihmapu0)

sāligrāmaśilātoyaṃ yaḥ pibedviṣṇusannidhau ||
sarvapāpavinirmukto viṣṇusāyujyamāpnuyāt || 1 ||

atha sāligrāmalakṣaṇādhyāyaśravaṇaphalādivarṇam (-)

nāradā'dyamayāproktaṃ sāligrāmasya vaibhavam ||
dhāryaṃ ca muninābhaktyā lakṣmīpatimude sadā || 1 ||

śṛṇuyādi mamadhyāyaṃ sāligrāmaguṇānvitam ||
dharmārthakāmamokṣārthaṃ bhaktimānyassame priyaḥ || 2 ||

sāyaṃprātaḥpaṭhennityaṃ sāligrāmasya vaibhavam ||
śrāddhalāle viśeṣeṇa pitṝṇāṃ dattamakṣayam || 3 ||

