mahānṛṃttapravṛttaṃ ca navaberāḥ prakīrtitāḥ || 9 ||

(5) atha liṃgabhedatatpūjākramatatphālāni (-) (śivarahasye)

athavakṣye viśeṣeṇaliṃgāni vividhāni ca ||
tattatphalāni vakṣyāmi śṛṇudevi śubhāni ca || 1 ||

īśvara uvāca || saikataṃ tāṃḍulaṃ cānnaṃ nadīmṛdgomayaṃ tathā ||
navanītaṃ ca rudrākṣaṃ bhasmacaṃdanakūrcajam || 2 ||

puṣpamālāguḍaṃpiṣṭaṃ kṣaṇikāśca caturdaśa ||
kṣaṇike maṃḍale toye tvātmārthaṃ yajanaṃ smṛtam || 3 ||

taṃḍulānāṃ ca liṃgena putrabāhulyamānpuyāt ||
sarvarogavināśāya gomayaṃ tu prakīrtitam || 4 ||

keśāsthi saṃbhavaṃ liṃgaṃ sarvaśatruvināśanam ||
āsuraṃ lavaṇotthaṃ ca sarvalokavaśaṃkaram || 5 ||

stambhane rajanīpiṣṭa saṃbhavaṃ liṃgamuttamam ||
taṃḍulodbhavapiṣṭena liṃgaṃ vidyā pradaṃ smṛtam || 6 ||

dadhidugdhamayaṃ liṃgaṃ kīrtisāmrājyavardhanam ||
dūrvāguḍūcisaṃbhūtamapamṛtyunivāraṇam || 7 ||

ikṣudaṃḍamayaṃliṃgaṃ smṛtamuccāraṇe param ||
ikṣusāramayaṃliṃgaṃ bahudraviṇakāmakṛt || 8 ||

sphāṭikaṃ bahusaumyatvaṃ tatphalaṃ munibhiḥ śrutam ||
pitṝṇāṃ muktaye pūjyaṃ liṃgaṃrajatasaṃbhavam || 9 ||

hemajaṃsvargalokasya prāptayet pūjyet pumān ||
pūjyet tāmrajaṃ liṃgaṃ puṣṭikāmastu saṃtatam || 10 ||

tathaivapūjayen martyaḥ liṃgaṃpittalasaṃbhavam ||
kīrtikāmorcayell.imgaṃ sadākāṃsya samudbhavam || 11 ||

śatrumāraṇakāmastu liṃgaṃlohamayaṃ sadā ||
śoṇacaṃdanajaṃliṃgamāyuṣkāmorcayetpumān || 12 ||

jvaraśāṃtyaicaṃdanotthamarcayelliṃgamuttamam ||
kastūrīsaṃbhavaṃliṃgaṃ graṃthakāmaḥ samarcayet || 13 ||

liṃgaṃgorocanotthaṃ ca rūpakāmastu pūjayet ||
kāṃtikāmastu satataṃ liṃgaṃkauṃkumakesaram || 14 ||

śvetāgarusamudbhūtaṃ mahāśaktivivardhanam ||
sarveṣāṃ kāmadaṃ liṃgaṃ kṛṣṇāgarusamudbhavam || 15 ||

yakṣakardamasaṃbhūtaṃ liṃgaṃprītivivardhanam ||
godhūmapiṣṭajaṃliṃgaṃ gokāmo nityamarcayet || 16 ||

mudgapiṣṭamayaṃliṃgaṃ pūjayedannamāpnuyāt ||
māṣapiṣṭamayaṃliṃgaṃ nityaṃ puṣṭivivardhanam || 17 ||

<p. 309>

caṇakodbhavapiṣṭhenaliṃgaṃsiddhikaraṃparam ||
liṃgaṃbrīhimayaṃpūjyaṃyaśaskāmenanityaśaḥ || 18 ||

yāvaddhānyamayaṃliṃgaṃvasaṃtepūjayennaraḥ ||
kāmavatsupriyonityaṃbhavetstrīṇāṃhimānavaḥ || 19 ||

grīṣmecamallikāpuṣpasaṃbhavaṃliṃgamuttamam ||
pūjayitvānaroścattayāprāpnotimahtīṃkṛṣim || 20 ||

varṣāsupūjayedbhaktayāliṃgaṃkanakapuṣpajam ||
ihacāmuṣmikelokesukhībhavatimānavaḥ || 21 ||

nīlotpalamayaṃliṃgaṃ kṛtvāśaradi mānavaḥ ||
pūjayāparamāṃsiddhiṃ bhaktyāprāpnoti mānavaḥ || 22 ||

hemaṃ tejātikusubhaiḥ liṃgaṃ kṛtvā manoramam ||
bhaktyāsamarcyamatimāñchivena saha modate || 23 ||

śiśire sarvapuṣpottha liṃgamabhyarcyamānavaḥ ||
svarvapāpaṃ vidhūyāśu modate brahmaṇā saha || 24 ||

pāṣāṇasaṃbhavaṃliṅgaṃ saṃpūjyaparayāmudā ||
sarvānkāmānavāpyātha prāpnoti paramāṃ gatim || 25 ||

yenakena prākāreṇa yasyakasyāpi vastunaḥ ||
kṛtvāliṃgaṃ samabhyarcya gāṇāpatyamavānuyāt || 26 ||

(tathāvakṣyamāṇarītyāpadmarāgakāśmīra puṣyarāgendranīlagomedakagārutmatavidrumamauktikahīrakapāradabāṇaliṃgānyapi(-)pūjyāni || 63 ||

(6) atha śivaliṃgārcanasyāvaśyakatvam (-) (śivarahasye)

vināliṃgārcanaṃ yasya kālogacchati nityaśaḥ ||
sa mahāpātakī tasya durvṛttasya durātmanaḥ || 1 ||

ekenasarvadānāni vratāni vividhāni ca ||
tīrthāni vividhā yajñāḥ śivārcā caikataḥ samāḥ || 2 ||

kaloliṃgārcanaṃ śreṣṭhaṃ yathāloke praśasyate ||
tathānāstītināstītiśāstrāṇāmeṣaniścayaḥ || 3 ||

bhuktimuktipradaṃliṃgaṃ vividhāpannivāraṇam ||
pūjayitvā narobhaktyā śivasāyujyamāpnuyāt || 4 ||

atha pāṣāṇādyādiliṅgeṣūttarottaraśraiṣṭhyam (-) (śivarahasye)

pāṣāṇātsphāṭikaṃśreṣṭhaṃ sphāṭikātpadmarāgajam ||
padmarāgācca kāśmīraṃ kāśmīrātpuṣyarāgajam || 1 ||

iṃdranīlaṃpuṣparāgādiṃdranīlācca gomadam ||
tatogārutmataṃ śreṣṭhaṃ vidrumaṃ ca tataḥ param || 2 ||

mauktikaṃ rajataṃ tasmād rajatācca suvarṇajam ||


<p. 310>

suvarṇādadhikaṃśreṣṭhaṃ hīrakaṃ pāradaṃ param || 3 ||

pāradasya guṇaṃvaktuṃ na śaknomi hi śaṃkari ||
pārthivena tu liṃgena bahavaḥ siddhimāgatāḥ || 4 ||

devāsuramanuṣyāśca siddhagaṃdharvayakṣakāḥ || 10 ||

atha yugabhedenaliṃgabhedāḥ (-)

kṛtemaṇimayaṃliṃgaṃ tretāyāṃ hemasaṃbhavam ||
dvāpare pāradaṃśreṣṭhaṃ pārthivaṃ tu kalau yuge || 1 || 4 ||

atha pārthivaliṃgasyātyuttamatvam (-)

ukteṣveteṣuliṃgeṣu liṃgatrayamanuttamam ||
mṛdbāṇarasaliṃgākhyaṃ teṣāmādyamanuttamam || 1 ||

tadevapārthivaṃliṃgaṃ kṣiprasiddhipradaṃbhuvi ||
aṣṭamūrtiṣusarvāsu mūrtirmepārthivī varā || 2 ||

etasmātpārthivaṃliṅgaṃ liṃgeṣvanyeṣvanuttamam ||
yathāsarveṣu deveṣu jyeṣṭhaḥ śreṣṭho maheśvaraḥ || 3 ||

tathāsarveṣu liṃgeṣu pārthivaṃ liṃgamuttamam ||
yathāsarveṣu vedeṣu praṇavo hi mahāntsmṛtaḥ || 4 ||

tathaivapārthivaṃliṃgaṃ susaṃpūjyaṃ maheśvara ||
pārthivārādhanaṃ dharmyamāyurvardhanamuttamam || 5 ||

tuṣṭidaṃpuṣṭidaṃ bhuktimuktidaṃ siddhidaṃśubham ||

atha strīṇāṃśivaliṅgamūrtyādipūjāsparśau (-)

paṃcākṣareṇakartavyaṃ strībhiśśaṅkarapūjanam ||
ṣaḍakṣareṇakartavyaṃ puruṣaistu prayatnataḥ || 1 ||

vihitaścaraliṅgeṣu sparśastrīṇāṃ prayatnataḥ ||
sthāvareṣvapi divyeṣu samantraṃ parvaṇi spṛśet || 2 ||

(7) atha śivanirmālyāni (-)

devasvaṃ devatādravyaṃ naivedyaṃ ca niveditam ||
caṃḍa dravyaṃ bahiḥkṣiptaṃ nirmālyaṃ ṣaḍvidhaṃ smṛtam || 1 || 6 ||

atha śivanirmālyaṃ grāhyam (-) (bṛhajjābālopaniṣadādau)

rudrabhuktaṃ tu bhuñjīyāt | rudrapītaṃpibet | rudrāghrātaṃjighret ||
rudreṇapītaṃpibanti | tasmānnirmālyamevabhakṣayīta | nirmālyamevaniṣeveta ||

bāṇaliṅge ca lauhe ca siddhaliṅge svayaṃbhuvi ||
pratimāsu ca sarvāsu na doṣomālyadhāraṇe || 1 ||

<p. 311>

dravyamanyaṃphalaṃ toyaṃśivasvaṃ na kvacit spṛśet |
nirmalatvācca (nirmālyaṃ) nṛṇāṃnairmalyakāraṇāt || 2 ||

tilaṣoḍaśabhāgaṃ ca tṛṇāgnyambukaṇopamam ||
pādodakaprasādānnaṃ saṃgṛhṇanmokṣamāpnuyāt || 3 ||

liṅge svayaṃbhave bāṇe ratnaje rasanirmite ||
siddhapratiṣṭhite tāmraraupyakāñcanalohaje || 4 ||

pratimāsu ca sarvāsu na caṇḍādhi kṛtirbhavet ||
caṇḍādhikāronoyatrabhoktavyaṃ tatra bhaktitaḥ || 5 ||

(8) atha sāṣṭāṅgapraṇatilakṣaṇam (-)

jānubāhuśirovakṣo gaṇḍāntāṅgāṣṭakaṃ yadā ||
daṇḍavadbhuvi devārthaṃ tadaṣṭāṅganatirbhavet || 1 || 1 ||

(9) atha pārthivacarasthāvaraliṃgeṣupañcasūtryāvaśyakatvādi (-)

paṃcasūtrī vidhānaṃ tu pārthive na vicārayet ||
yathākathaṃcidrūpeṇaramaṇīyaṃ prakalpayet || 1 ||

akhaṃḍaṃ taddhikartavyaṃ na dvikhaṃḍaṃ tu kārayet ||
dvikhaṃḍaṃ hi prakurvāṇo naiva pūjāphalaṃ labhet || 2 ||

ratnajaṃ hīrajaṃ liṅgaṃ pāradaṃ sphāṭikaṃ tathā ||
pārthivaṃ piṣṭajaṃ pauṣpamakhaṃḍaṃ tu prakārayet || 3 ||

akhaṃḍaṃsthāvaraṃliṃgaṃ dvikhaṃḍaṃ carameva ca ||
ye kurvati narāmūḍhā na pūjāphalabhāginaḥ || 4 ||

(10) atha pārthivaliṃganirmāṇatatpūjākramaḥ (-)

atha śaṃkarabhaktānāṃ pārthivārcā nigadyate ||
vedoktavidhināsamyak saṃpūrṇaphalasiddhaye || 1 ||

yathoktavidhinā snātvā saṃdhyāṃ kṛtvā yathāvidhi ||
brahmayajñaṃ vidhāyādau tatastarpaṇamācaret || 2 ||

nityakarmayathāśāstraṃ vidhāyānaṃtaraṃ pumān ||
pūjayetparayābhaktayā pārthivaṃ liṃgamuttamam || 3 ||

nadītīre taṭāke ca parvate kānane gṛhe ||
śivālaye śucaudeśe pārthivārcā vidhīyate || 4 ||

śuddhapradeśasaṃbhūtāṃ mṛdamāhṛtyayatnataḥ ||
śvetāḥśoṇāḥ pītakṛṣṇāḥ mṛdovarṇacatuṣṭayāḥ || 5 ||

yathālabdhamṛdākāryā na labdhe mṛttikottame ||
ānīyamṛtikāṃ śuddha deśāt snigdhāṃ prayatnataḥ || 6 ||

śodhitāṃ sa jalairyuktāṃ piṃḍīkṛtyaśanaiśśanaiḥ ||
paścālliṃgaṃ vidhāyāśu krameṇānena bhaktimān || 7 ||

<p. 312>

haromaheśvaraśśaṃbhuḥ śūlapāṇirmaheśvaraḥ ||
śivaḥpaśupatiścaiva mahādeva itikramāt || 1 ||

mṛdāharaṇasaṃghaṭṭa pratiṣṭhā vahanaṃ tathā ||
snapanaṃ pūjanaṃ caiva kṣamāpaṇavisarjanam || 2 ||

oṃ harāyanama iti mṛdāharaṇamityādi prakāreṇa ṣoḍaśopacārapūjāṃ kṛtvā paṃcākṣaraṃjaptvā nama oṃkārarūpāya namokṣaravapurdhṛte ||
namonādātmane tubhyaṃ namobiṃdukalātmane || 1 ||

aliṃgaliṃgarūpāya rūpātītāya te namaḥ ||
tvaṃ mātā sarvalokānāṃ tvamevajagatāṃpitā || 2 ||

tvaṃbhrātātvaṃsuhṛnmitraṃ tvaṃpitāprapitāmahaḥ ||
pārthivasyāsya liṃgasya yanmayāpūjanaṃ kṛtam || 3 ||

tenaśrībhagavānrudro vāṃchitārthaṃ prayacchatu ||
śivodātāśivobhoktā śivassarvamidaṃ jagat || 4 ||

śivoyajatisarvatra yaśśivassohameva ca ||
etāniśaktyupahṛtāni mayātraśaṃbholiṃgānipūjanavidhau sakalāni kṛtvā ||
pūjāphalaṃ mamasamastamupaitvavighnaṃ pūrṇaṃ vidhehi parameśvara pāhimāṃ tvam || 5 ||

hṛtpadmakarṇikāmadhye cāṃbayā sahaśaṃkara ||
praviśatvaṃ mahādeva sarvairāvaraṇaissaha || 6 ||

āvāhanaṃ na jānāmi na jānāmi visarjanam ||
pūjāvidhiṃ na jānāmī kṣamasva parameśvara || 7 ||

yāṃ tu devagaṇāssarve pūjāmādāyamatkṛtām ||
iṣṭakāmyārthasiddhyarthaṃ punarāgamanāya ca || 8 ||

iti saṃprārthyanatvā ca jaleliṃgaṃ visarjayet ||

(11) atha bāṇaliṃgasyalakṣaṇam (-)

tripañcasaptadhā yattu tulātulitamāstikāḥ ||
nayāti nyūnatāṃ tattu bāṇaliṅgamitīritam || 1 || 1 ||

atha pūjāyāṃniṣiddhaliṃgāni (-)

akṣādalpaparīmāṇaṃ na liṅgaṃ kutracinnaraḥ ||
kurvītāṅguṣṭhato hrasvaṃ na kadācit samācaret || 1 ||

(akṣāḥ (80) guñjāḥ (-) guñjāḥ pañcādyamāṣakāḥ | te ṣoḍaśākṣaḥ' ityamarāt)

(12) atha navavidhacaraliṃgānāṃlakṣaṇāni (-)

navāṣṭasatpāṃgulikaṃ liṅgaṃ śreṣṭhamihocyate ||
ṣaṭpañcakacaturmānaṃ madhyamaṃ trividhaṃ smṛtam || 1 ||

<p. 313>

dvitryekāṅguliliṅgaṃ yattrividhaṃ tatkaniṣṭhakam ||
evaṃ navavidhaṃproktaṃ caraliṅgaṃ yathākramāt || 2 || 9 ||

(13) atha pañcasūtrīnirṇayaḥ (-) (siddhāntaśekhareśaivāgameca)

liṅgamastakavistāro liṅgocchrāyasamomataḥ ||
paridhistattriguṇitastadvatpīṭhaṃ vyavasthitam || 1 ||

praṇālikā tathaivasyāt pañcasūtrivinirṇayaḥ ||

asyārthaḥ || 

liṅgamastakavistāraṃ liṅgoccatāsamaṃkṛtvā tattriguṇasūtraveṣṭanārhaṃliṅgasthaulyaṃ kṛtvātatsamaṃ vṛttaṃ caturaśraṃ vā pīṭhavistāramadhaścorddhvaṃ ca kuryāt ||

pīṭhoccatāṃ tu liṅgocca tādviguṇām || 
pīṭhamadhye liṅgāddviguṇasthūlaṃ pīṭhoccatātṛtīyāṃśenakhaṇḍaṃkatvā tasyordhvamadhaśca vapradvayaṃ trayaṃ vā kṛtvā liṅgavistāraṣaṣṭhāṃśena pīṭhopari bāhyamekhalāṃ kṛtvā tadantassaṃlagnaṃ tatsamaṃ khātaṃ kṛtvā pīṭhādbahirliṅgasamadīrghāṃmūledairghyasamavistārāmagretadardhavistārāṃ(-)tṛtīyāṃśena madhyakhātāṃ pīṭhavatsamekhalāṃpranālikāṃ kuryāt ||

atha rasaliṃgasyāpisarvebhyaḥśraiṣṭhyam (-)

mṛdbāṇarasaliṅgāni śreṣṭhānye teṣu vastutaḥ ||
triṣvādyaṃbāṇamutkṛṣṭaṃ rasaliṅgaṃ tatodhikam || 1 ||

(14) atha rudrāṣṭakākhyadāneviśeṣaḥ (-) (hemādraudānakhaṃḍe)

śṛṇudevamuneguhyaṃ dānaṃsarvārthadaṃ nṛṇām ||
rudrāṣṭakamitikhyātaṃ tatpatnīputrasaṃyutam || 1 ||

madhyecaturmukhopetamiti me bhagavānhariḥ ||
yathāhapūrvaṃ tatsarvaṃ vadāmitavanārada || 2 ||

rudrobhavaśca śarvaścāpīśaḥ paśupatistathā ||
bhīma ugromahādeva eterudrāḥ prakīrtitāḥ || 3 ||

jaṭinaścarmavasanāssarve khaṭvāṃgaśūlinaḥ ||
teṣāṃbhāryāśca putrāśca nāmāni kathayāmite || 4 ||

sauvarcalā ca dāvā ca vikeśī ca śivātathā ||
svāhā viśā ca dīkṣā ca rohiṇī ca yathākramāt || 5 ||

tā vai suveṣadhāriṇyaḥ sarvābharaṇabhūṣitāḥ ||
rudrapatnya imāścāṣṭau putrāṃśca śṛṇunārada || 6 ||

śanaiścaraśca śukraśca lohitāṃgo manojavaḥ ||

<p. 314>

vasaṃtassvargasaṃtānau budhaścaiva yathākramāt || 7 ||

te bālaveṣāḥkartavyāḥ śikhinodaṃḍapāṇayaḥ ||
puṇyakāle tu saṃprāpte śanau vā bhūtimicchatā || 8 ||

janmarkṣeṣu viśeṣeṇa dātavyaṃ munisattama ||
caturaśrāṃ samāṃbhūmiṃ liptvāgomayavāruṇā || 9 ||

catasrastasyarekhāḥsyuḥ prāktiryakcaiva sarvataḥ ||
hastamātraṃ dvihastaṃ vā navakoṣṭhasamanvitam || 10 ||

sthaṃḍilaṃtatrapadmāni taṃḍulaiśca prakalpayet ||
brahmāṇaṃ madhyame koṣṭhe sauvarṇaṃ viniveśayet || 11 ||

chaṃdo devīṃ ca tatpārśve tadardhena prakalpayet ||
sauvarṇānaṣṭarudrāṃśca brahmārddhena vinirmitān || 12 ||

prāgādyuttarapūrvāṃśca paritaḥ parikalpayet ||
tasyāpyardhena sauvarṇān pratyekaṃ rudrapārśvataḥ || 13 ||

teṣāṃ devīśca putrāṃśca kalpayitvārcayetpumān ||
svasvamaṃtreṇa pūjāsyānnamaskāra yutena ca || 14 ||

brahmādīnpūjayedgaṃdha puṣpadhūpadīpakaiḥ ||
pradakṣiṇaṃ tataḥ kṛtvā praṇamya ca yathākramam || 15 ||

pratyekamekaṃ prāgādīn saṃpūjyaivaṃ pradāpayet ||
pūjayitvopadeṣṭāraṃ dadyān maṃtreṇa madhyamam || 16 ||

prīyatāṃ bhagavānbrahmā parameṣṭhī pitāmahaḥ ||
evaṃ rudrāṣṭakopetaṃ dānaṃ dadyādyathā vidhi || 17 ||

sarvapāpavinirmuktaḥ sarvasiddhimavāpya ca ||
āyurārogyasaṃyuktaḥ putrabāndhavavānsukhī || 18 ||

bhuktvābhogānyathecchaṃ ca svargaṃ mokṣaṃ ca viṃdati || 25 ||

(15) atha rudrāṣṭakāntargatabrahmadhyānam (-) (brahmāṃḍapurāṇe)

padmapatrāsanasthaśca brahmākāryaścaturmukhaḥ ||
akṣamālāṃsruvaṃbibhratpustakaṃ ca kamaṃḍalum || 1 ||

vāsaḥkṛṣṇājinaṃ tasya pārśve haṃsastathaiva ca || 

pāṭalavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

(16) atha mailāraliṃgadhyānastotram (-) (skāṃdapurāṇe)

mailāraṃmālacīnāthaṃ sarvajaṃtu hiteratam ||
bhajāmibhajatāṃkalpa pādapaṃparayāmudā || 1 ||

śubhrāṃgaṃ bhūṣaṇairyuktaṃ haridrācūrṇasaṃyutam ||
pītāṃbaramudārāṃgaṃ bhajatāṃkāmadaṃ sadā || 2 ||

triśūlaṃḍamṛgaṃkhaḍgaṃ varadaṃ ca karāṃbujaiḥ ||
vibhrāṇaṃprāṇirakṣārthaṃ sarvakālamatandritam || 3 ||

<p. 315>

devānāṃrakṣaṇārthāya dānavānāṃ vadhāya ca ||
mailāraṃrūpamāsthāya śaṅkaraśśaṃkarobhavat || 4 ||

gajasiṃhavarāharkṣa vyāghrarūpadharānkhalān ||
duṣṭāñchatrūnvinighnaṃ tuṃturageṇa cacāraha || 5 ||

śukaiḥprabhūtaninadaiḥ kaṃṭhabaddhakapardakaiḥ ||
dvāradeśe sthitaiḥ śaśvatsevyamānamataṃdritaiḥ || 6 ||

pūrvadevādibhirdevairāvṛtaṃbhaktavatsalam ||
sarvadāsarvarakṣārthamudyataṃ taṃ bhajāmyaham || 7 ||

bhānuvāre manuṣyāṇāmutsave sārvakālike ||
yasya toṣaṃ saṃjanayetpāyasena guḍena vā || 8 ||

yasya saṃsevanānnṝṇāṃ dhanadhānyādi saṃpadaḥ ||
akleśe naiva sidhyaṃti godhanaṃ vājināṃ ca yaḥ || 9 ||

taṃ vaṃde varadaṃ devaṃ vārijasthaṃ maheśvaram ||
saṃsāraduḥkhasaṃtāpa nāśanāya sukhāya ca || 10 ||

smaraṇādyasya devasya mailārasyāmi taujasaḥ ||
haridrayā kṛtaṃ ramyaṃ bhaṃḍāraṃ bhajatāṃ nṛṇām || 11 ||

sarvakāmaphalāvāptiḥ sadya eva bhaviṣyati ||
yasya cihnaṃ suvarṇāḍhyaṃ bhaṃḍāraṃ bhajatāṃ sadā || 12 ||

hemabhaṃḍāramatulaṃ bhavet tasya na saṃśayaḥ ||

(17) atha mailārastrīmālācīstotram (-) (skāṃdapurāṇe)

mallārapatnīmālocī mahāmāyā ca mālatī ||
māyālakṣmīrmahālakṣmīrmāyāvatyabhi māninī || 1 ||

mailāra yoginī caiva bhairavī cāṃbikātathā ||
dvādaśaitāni nāmāni rahasyāni tavāṃbike || 2 ||

gopanīyāni yatnena na vaktavyāni kasyacit ||
nāmāni yāni te devi pratyahaṃ bhaktibhāvataḥ || 3 ||

aṣṭavāraṃ trivāraṃ vā trisaṃdhyaṃ yo japennaraḥ ||
na tasya bhītiḥ śatrubhyaḥ na vyādhibhyaḥ kadācana || 4 ||

na cāgni śastracorebhyaḥ sanityaṃ vijayī bhavet ||
tasya ciṃtitakāryāṇi sidhyaṃtyeva na saṃśayaḥ || 5 ||

(18) atha vibhūtyādimāhātmyam (-) (śivarahasye)

vedasiddheṣu dharmeṣu tripuṃḍraṃ bhasmakuṃṭhanam ||
rudraliṃgārcanaṃ caiva mukhyamāhurdvijāstikāḥ || 1 ||

tripuṃḍreṇavināśrāddhaṃ tripuṃḍreṇavināhutam ||
tripuṃḍreṇavinādānaṃ rākṣasaṃ tatprakīrttitam || 2 ||

vedasyādhyayaneśūdro nādhikārī yathā bhavet ||
tripuṃḍreṇavināvipro nādhikārī śivārcane || 3 ||

<p. 316>

dhigbhasmarahitaṃphālaṃdhiggrāmaśivālayam ||
dhiganīśārcanaṃ janmadhigvidyāmaśivāśrayām || 4 ||

śivaliṃgārcanaṃ śrautaṃ na kāryaṃ bhasmanā vinā ||
yāvaṃti śrautakarmāṇi kriyaṃte pratyahaṃ dvijaiḥ || 5 ||

tāvaṃtyapi ca kāryāṇi bhasmadhāraṇapūrvakam ||
bhasmadhāraṇahīnāṃgo yadi vipro bhaviṣyati || 6 ||

savipraḥsarvathārājñā nirvāsyo nātrasaṃśayaḥ ||
tasmātsarvaprayatnena tripuṃḍraṃ dhāryamanvaham || 7 ||

maṃtrapūtaṃ sitaṃbhasma lalāṭe yatra vartate ||
sa eva brāhmaṇo rājan satyaṃsatyaṃ na saṃśayaḥ || 8 ||

brāhmaṇopi svayaṃ mohādūrdhvapuṃḍraṃ karoti yaḥ ||
sapatatyeva narake yāvadā caṃdratārakam || 9 ||

śrīkaraṃ ca pavitraṃ ca śokaroganivāraṇam ||
lokevaśīkaraṃproktaṃ bhasmatrailokyapāvanam || 10 ||

vibhūtiryasyanophālenāṃgerudrākṣamālikāḥ ||
nāsye śivamayīvāṇī taṃ tyajedaṃtyajaṃ yathā || 11 ||

(skāṃde) (-)

saṃdhyāvandanavannityaṃ bhasmarudrākṣadhāraṇam ||
śrutismṛtipurāṇādau saṃghuṣṭaṃ niścitaṃ hitam || 1 ||

kadāpi na niṣiddhaṃ tadūrdhvapuṃḍrādi vatkvacit ||
yemāmananyaśaraṇāssitabhasmaphālārudrākṣakaṃkaṇalasatkaradaṇḍayugmāḥ ||
ye pūjayantyaharahaśśruti tattvabhūtaṃ tānevaghoranarakādahamuddhariṣye || 1 ||

pañcākṣarajapaṃbhasma snānaṃliṅgārcanaṃ trayam ||
kadācidapi na tyājyaṃ yathāśakti samācaret || 2 ||

bhūtyaivoddhūlanaṃ tiryak tripuṇḍrasya ca dhāraṇam ||
naivapramaditavyaṃ vai bhramādapi kadācana || 3 ||

dvijaḥkuryāt tu mantreṇa tattyāgī patito bhavet ||
bahiṣṭhassarvadharmebhyastatastannityamācaret || 4 ||

(śivapurāṇe) (-) 

brahmakuṃḍasamudbhūtaṃ bhasmadadyādvijātaye ||
caturarṇavaparyaṃtā tena dattā vasuṃdharā || 1 ||

(pārāśare) (-) 

prāpte bhojanakāle tu makṣikā keśa dūṣite ||
spṛṣṭvā tu salilaṃ bhasmaprakṣeptavyaṃ viśuddhaye || 1 ||

rudrākṣadhāraṇādvāpi tathāpaṃcākṣarī japāt |
bhasmatripuṃḍrakaraṇādbhavaṃprāpto bhaviṣyati || 2 ||

āyurārogyamaiśvaryaṃ tattvajñānamanāmayam ||
bhavati śrīmahādevaṃ pūjayetyabravīcchrutiḥ || 3 ||

(śivarahasye) (-) 

tajjalaṃbhasmasaṃyuktaṃ kurubhasmavivarjitam ||
na gṛṇhāti jalaṃśaṃbhurgāṃgaṃ vā kimutetarat || 1 ||

<p. 317>

tasmātkumārāḥ sarvāṇi puṣpādīni viśeṣataḥ ||
bhūtiyuktāni deyāni mūlamaṃtreṇa śaṃbhave || 2 ||

apūtamapi pūtaṃsyād bhasmanāsaṃyutaṃ yadi ||
dhāraṇaṃ bhasmano hyuktaṃ mantrapūrvaṃ dvijanmanām || 3 ||

tasmādbhasmayutaiḥ svacchairbilvairliṃgādikaṃ yajet ||
yadi syād bhasmarahitaṃ pīyūṣamapi tatparam || 4 ||

viṣamityavagaṃtavyaṃ yatoneśārpaṇe hitam ||
pākāgārepi deyaṃ syād bhasmakiṃcijjalānvitam || 5 ||

śākejaletaṃḍuleṣu mudgādiṣvapi yatnataḥ ||
tenakīṭādi saṃbaṃdha doṣopi suvinaśyati || 6 ||

bhūtirnaivedyapātrepi pradeyā jalasaṃyutā ||
kiṃ tayāsudhayāputrāḥ kiṃcidbhasmānvitaṃ yadi || 7 ||

yā śivārcanasāmagrī sā sarvābhūti pāvanā ||
kartavyāmūlamaṃntreṇa tayā tuṣṭo bhavecchivaḥ || 8 ||

yadakāryasahasrāṇi kṛtvāyaḥ snātibhasmanā ||
tatsarvaṃ bhasmadahati yathāgnistejasāvanam || 9 ||

anekajanmasiddhānāṃ śrautasmārtānu vartinām ||
vedokte naivamārgeṇa tripuṃḍre jāyate ratiḥ || 10 ||

ataḥ sarvaṃ parityajya tripuṃḍrairdehakuṃṭhanam ||
nityaṃprayatnataḥ kuryān mumukṣurmucyate'cirāt || 11 ||

(anyatrāpi) (-)

yatrabhuṃjītabhasmāṃgī mūrkho vā paṃḍitopi vā ||
tatrabhuṃkte sa patnīko vṛṣadhvaja iti smṛtaḥ || 1 ||

bhasmasaṃchannasaṃrvāṃgamanugacchati yaḥ pumān ||
sarvapātaka yukto hi sa sadyaḥ pūyate naraḥ || 2 ||

(śaṃkarasaṃhitāyām) (-) 

bhasmasaṃlagnasarvāgaṃ yastautiśraddhayā yutaḥ ||
sarvapātakayuktopi pūyate mānavo hi saḥ || 1 ||

bhasmasaṃchanna dehāya praṇāmaṃ kurute tu yaḥ ||
sarvapātakayuktopi sa sadyaḥ pūyate naraḥ || 2 ||

(saurasaṃhitāyām) (-) 

yastāramācarennityamāgneyaṃ niyatendriyaḥ ||
kulaikaviṃśamuttārya sa gacchet paramāṃ gatim || 1 ||

(19) atha bibhūtyādipañcabhedotpattivarṇādayaḥ

naṃdābhadrā ca surabhiḥ suśīlāsumanāstathā ||
paṃcagāvaḥ samutpannāḥ tābhyobhasmotthitaṃ nṛṇām || 1 ||

vibhūtirbhasitaṃbhasma kṣārorakṣeti bhasmanaḥ ||
bhavaṃti paṃcanāmāni hetubhiḥ paṃcabhiḥ kramāt || 2 ||

aiśvaryakaraṇā (dbhūtiḥ) (bhasma) sarvāghabhakṣaṇāt ||
(bhasitaṃ) sarvapāpānāṃ bhartsanāt (kṣāra) māpadām  || 3 ||

<p. 318> kṣāraṇātsarvabhūtebhyo (rakṣā) rakṣaṇataḥ śubhā ||
dagdhagomayamutkṛṣṭaṃ tadapyagnimukheparam || 4 ||

śrotesmārtekratautaṃtre śrāvaṇyāṃ viraje vane ||

(vāyavīyasāṃhitāyām) (-)

naṃdābhadrā ca surabhiḥ suśīlā sumanāstathā ||
paṃcagāvovibhorjātāḥ sadyojātādi vaktrataḥ || 1 ||

kapilaḥ kṛṣṇadhavalau dhūmroraktastathaiva ca ||
naṃdādīnāṃgavāṃ varṇāḥ krameṇaparikīrtitāḥ || 2 ||

sadyojātādvibhūtiśca vāmādbhasitameva ca ||
aghorādbhasmasaṃjātaṃ kṣāraṃtatpuruṣāttathā || 3 ||

rakṣāceśānavaktrācca naṃdādi dvārato bhavat || 5 ||

atha varṇabhedenadhāryabhasmabhedāḥ (-) (jābālopaniṣadi)

traivarṇikānāmagni hotrajaṃ vivāhāgnijamaupāsanāgnijaṃ vā ||
brahmacāriṇāmagnikāryakṛtam ||
vanasthānāṃvanyam athavā śivāgnijaṃvā ||
śūdrāṇāṃśrotriyāgārapacanāgnijam ||
anyeṣāṃdāvānalasamudbhavam ||
yatīnāṃyathoṃcitam || trivarṇāśramiṇāṃcitāgnijam || sarveṣāṃ devālayasthitam || śivāgnihotrajāvibhūtiḥ śivālayamaṃtrasaṃskāradagdhāvā || 8 ||

(20) atha bhasmādisnānadhāraṇamantrāṃgulisthānādibhedāḥ (-)

snapanopakramepādaukarauprakṣālyavāgyataḥ ||
ācamyoktāsanesthitvāprāṅkhovāpyudaṅkhaḥ || 1 ||

pavitrahastadvitayaḥ prāṇāyāmaṃ samācaret ||
tato mūlenabhasitamaṣṭakṛtvobhimaṃtrya ca || 2 ||

īśānena śirodeśaṃ mukhaṃ tatpuruṣeṇa tu ||
urodeśamaghoreṇa nābhiṃvāmena gopate || 3 ||

savyena pādausarvāṃgaṃ praṇave naiva dhūlayet ||
evaṃ snānakramaḥproktastasmādevaṃ samācaret || 4 ||

bhasmavāmakarekṛtvā dakṣiṇenābhimaṃtrayet ||
sadyaḥ prabhṛtibhirmantraiḥ bhasmānyuddhūayecchanaiḥ || 5 ||

athavā śirasi agnirityādinābhasmagṛhītvāṃgāni saṃspṛśet ||
vratametatpāśupataṃ paśupāśavimokṣaṇam || 

(kālāgnirudropaniṣadi) (-)

sadyojātādi paṃcabrahmamaṃtraiḥ parigṛhyā'gnirityādi maṃtraiścābhimaṃtryamānastoke itisaṃkṣudyaśaṃnodevīritijalenasaṃsṛjyamānomahāṃtamityāloḍyatryaṃbakamiti(-)tryāyuṣamiti ca śirolalāṭavakṣasskaṃṣutiryak tisrorekhāḥ kurvīta ||
vratametacchāṃbhavaṃ sarvavedeṣu vedavādibhiruktaṃ bhavati ||

<p. 319>

tasmātsamācarenmumukṣurapunarbhavāya || 

(vāyavīyasaṃhitāyām) (-) 

bhasmāgnihomajaṃ cātha virajāgnisamudbhavam || 
ādareṇasamādāyaśuddhepātre nidhāya tat || 1 ||

prakṣālyapādau hastau ca dvirācamya samāhitaḥ ||
gṛhītvābhasmatatpaṃca brahmamaṃtraiḥ śaniḥkare || 2 ||

prāṇāyāmatrayaṃ kṛtvā hyagnirityādi maṃtritam ||
tairevasaptabhirmaṃtraistrivāramabhimaṃtrayet || 3 ||

bhasmadhāraṇasaṃyuktaḥ pavitroniyatāśayaḥ ||
śivābhidhānaṃ yatproktaṃ bhāsanādbhasitaṃ matam || 4 ||

mahābhasmeti saṃciṃtya mahādevaṃ prabhāmayam ||
vartaṃte ye mahābhāgā mukhyāste bhasmadhāriṇaḥ || 5 ||

(anyatrāṇi) (-) 

prakṣālyapādau hastau ca dvirācamya samāhitaḥ ||
gṛhītvābhasmatatpaṃca brahmamaṃtraiḥ śanaiḥ kare || 1 ||

prāṇāyāmatrayaṃ kṛtvā yāgnirityādi maṃtritam ||
tairevasaptabhirmaṃtraistrivāramabhimaṃtryatat || 2 ||

omāpojyotirityuktvā dhyātvā viṣṇuṃ nalādhipam ||
saṃyojyabhasmanātoyamagnirityādibhiḥ punaḥ || 3 ||

nimṛjyasāṃbaṃdhyātvā samuddhūlyāpādamastakam ||
īśānena tu maṃtreṇa svamūrddhani viniḥkṣipet || 4 ||

mukhetasuruṣeṇaivatvaghorākhyeṇa vai hṛdi ||
guhye vāmadvaye naiva sadyojātena pādayoḥ || 5 ||

navāṃgaṃ praṇave naiva maṃtreṇoddhūlayettataḥ ||
uddhūlanasya snānāṃ te prakṣālyakaramācamet || 6 ||

(tripuṃḍrāṃtepyevam || 

(tatra viśeṣāḥ) (-) 

athabhasmādāyābhimaṃtrayet (5) (-) īśānassarvavidhānam śivom || 1 ||

tatpuruṣāya pracodayāt || 2 ||

aghorebhyaḥ rudrarūpebhyaḥ || 3 ||

vāmadevāyanamaḥ manonmanāyanamaḥ || 4 ||

sadyojātaṃ bhavodbhavāyanamaḥ || 5 ||

punarevābhimṛśati || sadyojātaṃ paṃcabhiḥ (5-4-3-2-1) ||

mānastoketanaya itimadhyamānāmikāṃguṣṭhaiḥ samādāyatūṣṇīmadbhissamudādāyatriyāyuṣamiti tripuṇḍraṃ dhārayet ||


(juhuyātsvayameveti (-) manuvākyena śiṣyamukhato homakalpanākathaṃ yujyate iti na śaṃkyam ||
śiṣyasyagurvadhīnatvātsvayaṃ śabdotra yujyate ||
hastapādādivacchiṣyā itiśiṣṭābruvaṃti hi || 1 || 

sannyāsiviṣaye idam ||

<p. 320>

bhasmanā vai trisaṃdhyaṃ ca gṛhiṇāṃ jalasaṃyutam ||
dhāryaṃtripuṃḍraṃ strīṇāṃ ca yatīnāṃ jalavarjitam || 1 ||

vanasthavratikanyānāṃ dīkṣāhīnanṛṇāṃ tathā ||
madhyāhnātprāgjalairyuktaṃ paratojalavarjitam || 2 ||

madhyāṃgulitrayeṇaiva dakṣiṇasya karasya tu ||
ṣaḍagulāyatamapi cādhikaṃ mānatastathā || 3 ||

netrayugmapramāṇena bhāledīptaṃ tripuṃḍrakam ||
akāronāmikāprokto hyukāromadhyamāṃguliḥ || 4 ||

makārastarjanītasmātribhiḥ kuryāttripuṃḍrakam ||
madhyamānāṃmikāṃguṣṭhairanulomavilomataḥ || 5 ||

dhārayedyastrīpuṃḍrāṃkaṃ sa rudronātrasaṃśayaḥ ||
mūrddhā caiva lalāṭaṃ ca karṇaukaṃṭhastathaiva ca || 6 ||

hṛdayaṃ caiva bāhū ca nābhisthānaṃ navocyate ||
paṃcāṃgulairnyasemūddhri praṇavena tu maṃtrataḥ || 7 ||

tryaṃgulaiśca nyaset phāle śiromaṃtreṇa deśikaḥ ||
sadyenadakṣiṇe karṇe vāmadevena vāmataḥ || 8 ||

aghoreṇa tu kaṃṭhe ca maṃdhyāṃgulyā spṛśedbudhaḥ ||
hṛdayaṃ hṛdaye naiva tribhiraṃgulibhisspṛśet || 9 ||

vinyaseddakṣiṇebāhau śikhāmaṃttreṇa deśikaḥ ||
vāmabāhau nyaseddhīmān kavacena triyaṃgulaiḥ || 10 ||

madhyena spṛśennābhyāmīśānābhidhamaṃtrataḥ ||

atha kāryabhedairvibhūtyādibhedāḥ (-)

dhāryennityakārye tu vibhūtiṃ vai prayatnataḥ ||
naimittikeṣu bhasitaṃ rakṣākāryeṣu sarvadā || 1 ||

prāyaściteṣu bhasmāni dhāryāṇi tu yathāvidhi ||
kṣāraṃ ca mokṣakāryeṣu prayoktavyaṃ sadābudhaiḥ || 2 || 5 ||

(20) atha bhasmotpādanaprakārāḥ (-) (vāyavīyasaṃhitāyām)

bhasmotpādanamuddiṣṭaṃ caturdhātaṃtravedibhiḥ ||
kalpañcaivānukalpañcāpyupakalpamakalpakam || 1 ||

teṣāmādimamutkṛṣṭamanyebhyaśca prabhāvataḥ ||
yathāśāstrokta vidhinā gṛhītvā gomayaṃ navam || 2 ||

sadyojāvāmadevābhyāṃ kuryātpiṃḍamakalmaṣam ||
śoṣayetpuruṣeṇaiva dahedghorācchivāgninā || 3 ||

(kalpaṃ) tadbhasmavijñeyamanukalpamathocyate ||
vaneṣugomayaṃyacca śuṣkaṃcūrṇī kṛtaṃ tathā || 4 ||

dagdhaṃ caivā('nukalpā)khyamākhātādhi gataṃ tu yat  ||
vastreṇottaritaṃ bhasma gomūtrādbaddhapiṃḍitam || 5 ||

<p. 321>

dagdhaṃprāguktavidhinā bhavedbhasmo (-) (pakalpaka)m ||
deśakālocitaṃbhasma gṛhītvā'śucivarjitam || 6 ||

piṃḍīkṛtyadahedvidān gomūtrakṣīragomayaiḥ ||
sādhāraṇamidaṃ(bhasma)tvakalpamadhūnā śṛṇu || 7 ||

anyadutpāditaṃ bhasmā(pyakalpa)mitikīrtitam ||
śrautasmārtāgnidāvāgni virajāgniśivāgnijam || 8 ||

vaidikairevatadgrāhyaṃ bhasmapaṃcavidhaṃ ca tat || 4 || 1 || 5 ||

athordhvapuṃḍratiryakpuṃḍrādidhāraṇevyavasthā (-) (dharmapravṛtau)

naivatiryaṅmṛdākuryādūrdhvapuṃḍraṃ na bhasmanā ||
caṃdanenobhayaṃkuryādititanmanurabravīt || 1 ||

tripuṃḍraṃsuraviprāṇāṃ vartulaṃ nṛpavaiśyayoḥ ||
ardhacaṃdraṃ tu śūdrāṇāmanyeṣāmūrdhvapuṃḍrakam || 2 ||

brāhmaṇānāṃ nṛpāṇāṃ ca bhasmamiśraṃ ca caṃdanam ||
netrayugmapramāṇaṃ tu tripuṃḍraṃ dhārayed dvijaḥ || 3 ||

(21) atha tripuṇḍrasyasvarūpam (-) (ratnāvalyām)

madhyamānāmikāṃguṣṭhairlalāṭe yattripuṃḍrakam ||
tattripuṃḍraṃbhavecchastaṃ mahāpātakanāśanam || 1 ||

atha tripuṇḍradhāraṇaphalam (-) (smṛtisāre)

aśucirvāpyanācāro manasāpāpamācaret ||
śucirevabhavennityaṃ tripuṃḍrasya ca dhāraṇāt || 1 ||

(nāradaḥ) (-) 

tripuṃḍraṃ paramaṃ puṇyaṃ brahmaviṣṇuśivātmakam ||
betālarākṣasāḥpretāḥ ye cānye kṣudrajaṃtavaḥ || 1 ||

tripuṃḍradhāriṇaṃ dṛṣṭvā palāyaṃtena saṃśayaḥ ||

(viṣṇuḥ) (-) 

yasya paṅau dvijobhuṅte śivabhaktastripuṃḍradhṛk ||
satāṃpaṅtipunātyeva sakalāṃ caturānana || 1 ||

(22) atha bhasmadhāraṇasthānāni (-) (smatisāre)

tripuṃḍraṃdhārayennityaṃ bhasmanā sa jalena ca ||
sthāneṣu paṃcadaśasu śarīre sādhakottamaḥ || 1 ||

uttamāṃge lalāṭe ca śravarṇe dvitaye tathā ||
galebhujadvaye caiva hṛdinābhau ca pṛṣṭhake || 2 ||

bāhuyugme kakuddeśe maṇibaṃdha dvaye tathā ||
tripuṃḍraṃ bhasmanādhāryaṃ mūlamaṃtreṇa sādhakaiḥ || 3 || 15 ||

<p. 322>

(23) atha varṇāśramastīpuṃbhedenabhasmadhāraṇeniyamāḥ (-)

dhāraṇaṃ bhasmanohyuktaṃ maṃtrapūrvaṃ dvijanmanām ||
amaṃtrapūrvamanyeṣāṃ śudrāṇāṃ dharmavedinām || 1 ||

strīṇāmapi tathāproktaṃ dvijastrīṇāṃ tu maṃtrataḥ ||
yathā hi yajñakarmādau patnīsādhye hi karmaṇi || 2 ||

sarvamaṃtrādhikarosti tathābhasmādi dhāraṇe || 3 ||

(24) atha muktaumukhyasādhanāni (-)

śivaliṃgamaṇissākṣān maṃtraḥpaṃcākṣarastathā ||
vibhūtirauṣadhaṃpuṃsāṃ muktistrī vaśyakarmaṇi || 1 || 3 ||

(25) atha bhasmasnānasyaśraiṣṭhyam (-)

bhasmasnānaṃ jalasnānādasaṃkhyeyaguṇānvitam ||
tasmādvāruṇamutsṛjya snānamāgneyamācaret || 1 ||

bhasmasnānātparaṃsnānaṃ pavitraṃ naiva vidyate ||
evammuktvā ṛṣīndevāntsnāto devaḥ śivaḥ svayam || 2 ||

tadāprabhṛtiviṣṇvādyāmunayaśca śivārthinaḥ ||
sarvakarmasuyatnena bhasmasnānaṃ prakurvate || 3 ||

tasmādetacchivasnānamāgneyaṃ yassamācaret ||
anenaivaśarīreṇa sa rudronātrasaṃśayaḥ || 4 ||

ārdrasnānādvaraṃbhāsmaṃ tvādrairjaṃtuvadho bhavet ||
ādraṃ tu prakṛtiṃvidyāt prakṛtiṃ baṃdhanaṃ viduḥ || 5 ||

prakṛtestu prahāṇārthaṃ bhasmanāsnānamiṣyate ||

atha bhasmadhāraṇākaraṇepratyavāyapraśaṃse (-)

dhigbhasmarahitaṃ phālaṃdhiggrāmamaśivālayam ||
dhiganīśārcakajanāndhigvidyāmīvāśrayām || 1 ||

tadbhasmadhāraṇaṃśastaṃ sarvaṃtadvattriliṃgakam ||
brahmaviṣṇumaheśānāṃ trayyagnīnāṃ ca dhāraṇam || 2 ||

guṇalokatrayāṇāṃ ca dhāraṇaṃ tena vai kṛtam ||
(bodhāyanasūtrepi) bhūtyainapramaditavyamityuktam ||

atha bhasmatripuṃṇḍreṣuvedāḥ (-)

ūrdhvarekhātha ṛgvedomadhyarekhāyajurbhavet ||
sāmaveda adhastācca vedatrayadharobhavet || 1 ||

<p. 323>

(26) atha vibhūtipratinidherabhāvaḥ (-)

dhṛtopavītaissaṃdhyāyāḥ kāryepratinidhirbhavet ||
vibhūtidhāraṇetvanyonāsti pratinidhirdhruvam || 1 ||

(27) atha bhasmādipātanaṃbhūmaunakāryam (-)

yāvaṃtaḥpatitābhūmau bhasmanāṃ paramāṇavaḥ ||
tāvadvarṣasahasrāṇi rauravaṃnarakaṃ vrajet || 1 ||

(28) atha rudrākṣotpattitadbhedāḥ (-) (śivarahasye)

purātripurasaṃhāre triṇetro jagatāṃpatiḥ ||
udapaśyatpurāyogamunmīlitavilocanaḥ || 1 ||

nipetustasya netrebhyo bahavojalabiṃdavaḥ ||
tebhyojātā yatastasmād rudrākṣā itikīrtitāḥ || 2 ||

aṣṭatriṃśatprabhedena bhavaṃtyutpatti bhedataḥ ||
netrātsūryātmanaśśaṃbhoḥ kapilā dvādaśoditāḥ || 3 ||

śvetāḥ ṣoḍaśasaṃjātāḥ somarūpādvilocanāt ||
kṛṣṇādaśavidhājatāḥ vahnirūpādvilocanāt || 4 ||

evamutpattito bhedādrudrākṣā bahudhā smṛtāḥ || 38 ||

(29) atha rudrākṣāṇāmadhāraṇe doṣāḥ (-)

snānedānejapehome vaiśvadeve surārcane ||
rudrākṣarahito vipro narake patati dhruvam || 1 ||

(30) atha rudrākṣāṇāṃmukhasaṃkhyābhedenadhāraṇasthānāni (-) (siddhāṃtaśekhare)

yathāsthānaṃ yathāvaktraṃ yathāyogaṃ yathāvidhi ||
rudrākṣadhāraṇaṃ vakṣye rudrarūpasya siddhaye || 1 ||

śikhāyāmekamekāsyaṃ rudrākṣaṃ dhārayedbudhaḥ ||
dvitridvādaśavaktrāṇi śirasitrīṇidhārayet || 2 ||

ṣaṭtriṃśaddhārayenmūrdhni nityamekādaśānanān ||
daśasaptapaṃcavaktrān ṣaṭṣaṭkarṇadvaye tathā || 3 ||

ṣaḍaṣṭavadanān kaṇṭhe dvātriṃśaddhārayet sadā ||
paṃcāśaddhārayedvidvāṃścaturvaktrāṃstu vakṣasi || 4 ||

trayodaśamukhānbāhvostathāṣoḍaśaṣoḍaśaḥ ||
pratyekaṃ dvādaśatathānavāsyānmaṇibaṃdhayoḥ || 5 ||

<p. 324>

caturdaśamukaṃ yajñasūtramaṣṭottaraṃ śatam ||

(prakārāntaram) (-) 

śikhāyāmekamevasyāt karayordvādaśaiva tu ||
dvātriṃśatkaṃṭhadeśe tu catvāriṃśacca mastake || 1 ||

ekaikakarṇayoḥ ṣaṭṣaṭvakṣasyaṣṭottaraṃ śatam ||
ekamevopavīte tu dhārayedbhāvayañchivam || 2 ||

(31) atha muktāpravālasphaṭikādiyutarudrākṣamālāśraiṣṭhyam (-)

muktāpravālasphaṭikapuṣpavaidūryakāṃcanaiḥ ||
sametāndhārayedyastu rudrākṣānsa śivo bhavet || 1 ||

atha rudrākṣāditrayāṇāmatiśraiṣṭhyam (-)

śaivaṃ nāmatathāgaṃgā vibhūtiryamunā matā ||
rudrākṣāvidhijāḥ proktāssarvapāpavināśakāḥ || 2 ||

śārīre tu trayaṃ yasya tatphalaṃ caikatassmṛtam ||
ekatraveṇikāyāśca darśanena phalaṃ tu yat || 3 ||

tadeva tulitaṃ pūrvaṃ brahmaṇā hitakāriṇā ||
samatāmevatatprāptaṃ tasmāddhāryaṃ trayaṃ budhaiḥ || 4 ||

(32) atha rudrākṣāṇāṃmukhabhedenalakṣaṇabhedāḥ (-)

cihnairetaiśśubhājñeyāḥ prekṣāvadbhirmunīśvarāḥ ||
ekaṃmukhaṃ tu yasya syāt pratipūraṃ vrajediha || 1 ||

dvimukhī ca tadājñeyā dhārako naiva dahyate ||
trimukhī ca yadā syād vaiśastraghātādikaṃ na hi || 2 ||

caturmukhī tadājñeyā vegaiścādho bhavediha ||
jale tu mucyamānāsānatarenmajjati kṣaṇāt || 3 ||

saṃproktā sā paṃcamukhī sarvānarthavināśinī ||
jalemajjati sā jñātvā dhāryādharmavivṛddhaye || 4 || 5 ||

(prakārāntaram (-) nirṇayasiṃdhau) (-)

ekavaktraṃśivassākṣādbrahmahatyāṃ vyapohati ||
avadhyatvaṃ pratisroto vahnistaṃbhaṃ karoti ca || 1 ||

dvivaktroharagaurī syād govadhādyaghanāśakṛt ||
trivaktro hyagnijanmātha pāparāśiṃpraṇāśayet || 2 ||

caturvaktrassvayaṃbrahmā narahatyāṃ vyapohati ||
paṃcavaktrastu kālāgniragamyāgamapāpanut || 3 ||

ṣaḍvaktrastu guhojñeyo bhrūṇahatyādi nāśayet ||
saptavaktrastvanaṃtassyāt svarṇasteyādi pāpahṛt || 4 ||

<p. 325>

vināyakoṣṭavaktraḥ syātsarvā nṛtavināśakṛt ||
bhairavonavavaktrastu śivasāyujyakārakaḥ || 5 ||

daśavaktrassmṛtoviṣṇurbhūtapretabhayāpahaḥ ||
ekādaśamukhorudro nānāyajñaphalapradaḥ || 6 ||

dvādaśāsyastathādityaḥ sarvaroganibarhaṇaḥ ||
trayodaśamukhaḥ kāmaḥ sarvakāmaphalapradaḥ || 7 ||

caturdaśāsyaśśrīkaṃṭho vaṃśoddhārakarassmṛtaḥ || 14 ||

atha rudrākṣāṇāṃpraśaṃsā (-)

yatrarudrākṣataravoyatrarudrākṣabhūṣaṇāḥ ||
yatraliṃgāni śaivāni tatrasannihitaḥ śivaḥ || 1 ||

namoṃtena śivāyetistrīṇāṃ pūjāpraśasyate ||
viśveśvaro vā viṣṇurvā brahmā vā na bhaviṣyati || 2 ||

yatonayordvayorekaḥ prabhurviśveśvaraḥ pitā ||
namaste astubhagavannityādi śrutibhissadā || 3 ||

viśveśvaro mahānanya itiniścīyate mayā ||
somaḥpavate ityādi śrutyāsomaḥ sadāśivaḥ || 4 ||

janitāpavanādīnāṃ viṣṇūnāmiti hi śrutiḥ ||
īśānaḥ sarvavidyānāmityādi śrutibhirmuhuḥ || 5 ||

īśvarasyaiva karttṛtvaṃ niścitaṃ nātrasaṃśayaḥ ||
umayāsahito devassoma ityabhidhīyate || 6 ||

umājñānamayīśaktiḥ saivavidyeti gīyate ||
rudrākṣadhārakassoma itiśāstravidoviduḥ || 7 ||

atha rudrākṣadhāraṇamahimā (-) (padārthādarśeboppadevaḥ)

rudrākṣānkaṃṭhadeśedaśanaparimitānmastake viṃśatirdveṣaṭṣaṭkarṇapradeśe karayugalakṛte dvādaśadvādaśaiva ||
bāhvoriṃdoḥ kalābhiḥ nayanayugakṛtepyekamekaṃśikhāyāṃ vakṣasyaṣṭādhikaṃ yaḥ kalayatiśatakaṃ sa svayaṃ nīlakaṃṭhaḥ || 1 ||

(haridīkṣitīye) (-) 

nityānikāmyāninimittajāni karmāṇi sarvāṇi sadāpi kurvan ||
abhasmarudrākṣadharoyadi syād dvijonatasyāsti phalopapattiḥ || 1 ||

sarveṣuvarṇāśramasaṃgateṣu nityaṃsadācāraparāyaṇeṣu ||
śrutismṛtibhyāmiha codyamānā vibhūtirudrākṣa dhṛtissamānā || 2 ||

(siddhāntaśekhare) (-) acchidraṃkanakaprakhyamananyadhṛtamuttamam ||
rudrākṣaṃdhārayetprājñaśśivapūjāparāyaṇaḥ || 1 ||

rudrākṣadhāraṇādevamucyante sarvapātakaiḥ ||
duṣṭacittādurācārāduṣprajā apimānavāḥ || 2 ||

<p. 326>

(śivabhaktisudhārṇave) (-)

dhṛtarudrākṣakarṇāya yastvannaṃ saṃprayacchati ||
trissaptakulamuddhṛtyarudralokaṃ sa gacchati || 1 ||

śucirvāpyaśucirvāpi hyabhakṣyasya ca bhakṣakaḥ ||
mlecchovāpyatha caṃḍālo yukto vā sarvapātakaiḥ || 2 ||

rudrākṣadhāraṇādeva sa rudronātrasaṃśayaḥ ||
khādanmāṃsaṃpibanmadyaṃ saṃgacchaṃnnaṃ tyajāmapi || 3 ||

pātakebhyo vimucyeta rudrākṣe śirasādhṛte ||
sarvayajñatapodānairvedābhyāsaiśca yatphalam || 4 ||

tatphalaṃlabhate sadyorudrākṣasya tu dhāraṇāt ||
śirasādhāraṇe koṭiḥ karṇayordaśakoṭayaḥ || 5 ||

śatakoṭirgaladhṛtaumurdhnikoṭisahasrakam ||
ayutaṃcopavīte tu lakṣakoṭirbhuje dhṛte || 6 ||

ameyaṃ maṇibaṃdhe tu rudrākṣāmokṣasādhakāḥ ||
rudrākṣadhāraṇācchreṣṭhaṃ na kiṃcidiha vidyate || 7 ||

amaṃtradhāraṇasyaiva guṇā ete prakīrtitāḥ ||
yaḥ punarmaṃtrasaṃyuktaṃ dhārayedbhaktito naraḥ || 8 ||

guṇānāṃ tasya māhātmyaṃ kathituṃ naiva śakyate ||

(śrautasidhāṃte) (-) 

lakṣaṃtaddarśanātpuṇyaṃ koṭistatsparśanādbhavet ||
śatakoṭiguṇaṃpuṇyaṃ dhāraṇāllabhate naraḥ || 1 ||

lakṣakoṭisahasrāṇi lakṣakoṭi śatāni ca ||
japāccalabhate puṇyaṃ nātrakāryā vicāraṇā || 2 ||

śivabhaktāyaśāṃtāyadadyādrudrākṣamuttamam ||
tasya puṇyaphalasyāṃtaṃ na cāhaṃ vaktumutsahe || 3 ||

paśavopi hi rudrākṣadhāraṇādyāṃti rudratām ||
kimuyedhārayaṃtismanarārudrākṣamālikāḥ || 4 ||

ucchiṣṭo vā vikarmastho yukto vā sarvapātakaiḥ ||
mucyate sarvapāpebhyo rudrākṣasya ca dhāraṇāt || 5 ||

japadhyānavihīnopi rudrākṣānyadidhārayet ||
sarvapāpavinirmuktassayāti paramāṃ gatim || 6 ||

bhasmarudrākṣadhārīyaḥ sadehāṃte śivaṃ vrajet ||
abhijño vā na bhijño vā rudrākṣasya tu dhāraṇāt || 7 ||

śivalokaṃ prapadyeta kīṭakogardabhopi vā ||

(33) atha dhāraṇeyogyāyogyarudrākṣāḥ (-) (siddhāntaśekharādau)

acchidraṃkanakaprakhyamananyadhṛtamuttamam ||
rudrākṣaṃdhārayetprājñaśśivapūjāparāyaṇaḥ || 1 ||

(tatraiva siddhāṃtaśekhare) (-) 

krimidaṣṭaṃ vibhinnaṃ ca jīrṇaṃsūkṣmamakaṃṭakam ||

<p. 327>

avṛttaṃ yamalaṃ vakramaṣṭāvetānvivarjayet || 1 ||

abhinnaṃnikaṣehaimamananyadhṛtamāruṇam ||
navyaṃparaṃparāprāptaṃ dhāryaṃ rudrākṣamuttamam || 2 ||

kulīnamakulīnaṃ vā bhūtirudrākṣadhāriṇam ||
dṛṣṭvonnatāsane sthitvā rauravaṃ narakaṃ vrajet || 3 ||

(34) atha japādraurudrākṣamālā āvaśyakāḥ (-)

aṃgulyājapa ekaḥ syādrekhayāṣṭaguṇo bhavet ||
japastu śaṃkhamaṇināśatamaṣṭottara bhavet || 1 ||

japastu putrajīvena bhavedevaśatatrayam ||
padmākṣeṇa sahasraṃ syāt sphaṭikenā yutatrayam || 2 ||

koṭikoṭiḥ kuśagraṃthyārudrākṣeṇāṃtavarjitaḥ ||
atassarvaprayatnena rudrākṣaissarvadā japet || 3 ||

(35) atha purusapadārthaḥ (-)

puruṣaḥ paramorudro devadevottamottamaḥ ||
puruṣo vai rudra itiśrutireṣāyatomatā || 1 ||

sarvāntaraśirogrīvassarvabhūtaguhāśayaḥ ||
sarvavyāpī ca bhagavān tasmāt sarvagataḥ śivaḥ || 2 ||

mahānprabhurvai puruṣassattvasyaivapravartakaḥ ||
sunirmalamidaṃśāṃtamīśānajyotiravyayam || 3 ||

māheśādbodhanādanyannāsti sarvārthadāyakam ||
manasākarmaṇāvācā śivaṃ yo bhajate sadā || 4 ||

taṃtārayati gaurīśo ghorasaṃsārasāgarāt ||
muktimuktāvarṣakopaṃ śivamaṃtraḥ śrutiśrutaḥ || 5 ||

gopanīyopi mokṣārthaṃ vedāṃtaiḥ prakaṭī kṛtaḥ ||
mokṣārthī tu śivādanyaṃ yaḥ pūjayitumicchati || 6 ||

sa unmatta itijñeyo vedamārgādbahiṣkṛtaḥ || 1 ||

(36) atha śivasyaprāśastyam (-) (skānde)

tadevakulamutkṛṣṭaṃ dhanyamityapi manmahe ||
yasmin kule samutpannaḥ śivapūjāparo bhavet || 1 ||

śaṃkaro viṣṇutapasā saṃtuṣṭo viṣṇave mudā ||
dadau vaikuṃṭhamamalamatodevottamaḥ śivaḥ || 2 ||

vedāssarve mahādevaṃ stuvaṃti vividhaṃ mudā ||
tadanyaṃ nastuvaṃtyeva matodevottamaḥ śivaḥ || 3 ||

śivānnāstyadhiko devassatyaṃsatyaṃ na saṃśayaḥ ||

<p. 328>

satyaṃsatyaṃpunassatyamuddhṛtyabhujamucyate || 4 ||

pātheyaṃparalokasya mokṣopāyamanāmayam ||
puṇyasaṃghaikanilayaṃ śiva ityakṣaradvayam || 5 ||

vibhūtirāśayo yatra yatra bilvavanānyapi ||
yatraśaivāḥ śivaparāstatrasannihitaḥ śivaḥ || 6 ||

(37) atha bilvamāhātmyam (-) (śivarahasye)

durlabhaṃśaṃkaraṃliṃgaṃ durlabhābilvamaṃjarī ||
durlabhāśāṃbhavī vidyā śivebhaktiśca durlabhā || 1 ||

bilvapatrairmahādevaṃ yo bhyarcayati nityaśaḥ ||
kālamṛtyurna cāyāti kimutānye ca mṛtyavaḥ || 2 ||

(38) atha pūjāyogyabilvapatrāṇi (-) (śivarahasye)

nityamārdrairanārdrairvā bilvapatraiḥ sadāśivam ||
pūjayasva mahādevaṃ tasmānmā pramado'bhavam || 1 ||

bilvapatrāṇi śudhāni svataḥparyuṣitānyapi ||
śaṃkarārcana yogyāni bhavaṃtīti hinaḥ śrutam || 2 ||

sauvarṇaṃ bilvapatraṃ vā ratnajaṃ rājataṃ tathā ||

(39) atha śivapūjāyāṃ bilvapatrāṇyavaśyakāni (-) (śivarahasye)

na hi paryuṣitaṃ tasmācchuddhamevasvayaṃ yataḥ ||
arpitānyapi bilvāni prakṣālya ca punaḥ punaḥ || 1 ||

śaṃkarāyārpaṇīyāninanavāniyadi kvacit ||
śuṣkaṃ khaṃḍitamārdraṃ vā bilvapatraṃ śivapriyam || 2 ||

cūrṇīkṛtānyapi prājñā bilvapatrāṇi vaidikāḥ ||
saṃpādyapūjayaṃtīśaṃ navālābhe vicakṣaṇāḥ || 3 ||

anāghrātaṃ bilvapatraṃ yādṛśaṃ tādṛśaṃ śive ||
vinikṣipyamahāpāpairmucyate nātrasaṃśayaḥ || 4 ||

bilvapatrārcanātprīto yathābhavati śaṃkaraḥ ||
tathānānyenasuprīto bhaviṣyati na saṃśayaḥ || 5 ||

bilvapatrārcane naiva sāṃgaṃśaṃkarapūjanam ||
bilvapatraṃ vināpūjā na sāṃgāpārvatī pateḥ || 6 ||

dhūpadīpopacārāṇāmabhāvepi mahīśituḥ ||
vastrādidānatopyetadbhavatyeva hi puṇyadam || 7 ||

sarvārthaṃ bilvapatrāṇi bhaviṣyaṃti na saṃśayaḥ ||

<p. 329>

bilvapatrārthamanyattu na bhavatyeva sarvathā || 8 ||

sahasrārbudapuṣpāṇāṃ pūjayāyatphalaṃbhavet ||
tatopikoṭiguṇitaṃ bilvapatrārcane prabhoḥ || 9 ||

kṛtvāyatnena satataṃ brahmahatyārbudānyapi ||
sadyonaśyaṃti bilvena pūjite tu maheśvare || 10 ||

śivaliṃgaṃ samabhyarcya bilvapatraiḥ prayatnataḥ ||
bhoktavyamanyathāviprairanvahaṃ yāṃtiyātanāḥ || 11 ||

yatneṣu pūjanīyeṣu bilvapatraṃ viśiṣyate || 3 ||

(40) atha bilvapatraṃparyuṣitaṃcchinnaṃbhinnaṃvāpūjāyāṃyogyameva 

(śivarahasyādau)

āṣaṇmāsādbilvapatraṃ pujāyogyaṃ śivasya tu ||
ārdraṃ vā yadi vā śuṣkaṃ śīrṇaṃkhaṃḍitameva vā || 1 ||

yā dṛśaṃ tādṛśaṃ vāpi bilvapatraṃ śivapriyam ||
gaurīgaurāṃgakodbhūtasvedabiṃdusamudbhavaḥ || 2 ||

tataḥ priyatamaḥ śaṃbhorbilvavṛkṣo na cetaraḥ ||
sā yujyādiphalāvāpti sādhanaṃ tarurāḍyataḥ || 3 ||

sarvasvaṃ pārvatīśena bilvavṛkṣe pratiṣṭhitam ||
svodyānodbhavavṛkṣasya svahastopārjitairnaraḥ || 4 ||

pūjayetpārvatīnāthaṃ bilvapatraissukomalaiḥ ||

(41) atha deveṣupatrapuṣpaphalabilvānāṃpūjāyāmarpaṇakramaḥ (-)

(śivarahasyenaṃdyagastyeśvarasaṃvāde)

agastya uvāca ||
patraiḥpuṣpaiḥ phalairvāpi sammukhaiḥ pūjyate śivaḥ ||
adhomukhairbilvapatrairatramesaṃśayo mahān ||  (1 ||

dakṣabhāge sthito brahmā vāmabhāge janārdanaḥ ||
madhyapatre sthitassākṣāt sāṃbassarvārthasādhakaḥ || 2 ||

pūrvabhāge'mṛtaṃnyastaṃ devairbrahmādibhiḥ purā ||
pṛṣṭabhāgesthitāyakṣā abhaktānāṃ niṣedhakāḥ || 3 ||

iṃdrādayolokapālāvṛṃtāgre parikīrtitāḥ ||
tato vai pūrvabhāgena pūjayedgirijāpatim || 4 ||

yatravāyadi vā puṣpaṃ phalaṃ neṣṭamadhomukham ||
adhomukhaṃ bilvapatraṃ śivasya vacanaṃ yathā || 5 ||

tarjanyaṃguṣṭhayogena gṛhītvābilvapatrakam ||
pūjayetpārvatīnāthaṃ siktaṃ caṃdanavāriṇā || 6 ||

vilayaṃyāṃti pāpāni koṭijanmārjitānyapi ||
mahākailāsabhavane śivena sahamodate || 7 ||

<p. 330>

bhūtipūjottaraṃ bilvaiḥ pūjanīyo maheśvaraḥ ||
pratyahaṃniyame neti prāhurjābālavādinaḥ || 8 ||

darśanādbilvavṛkṣasya sparśanādvaṃdanādapi ||
ahorātrakṛtaṃpāpaṃ naśyatyeva hi nārada || 9 ||

bilvavṛkṣaṃsamāsādya dvādaśyāmahnibhojanam ||
yaḥkuryādbhrūṇahāpāpānmucyate nātrasaṃśayaḥ || 10 ||

bilvavṛkṣaṃ samāsādya trirātropoṣitonaraḥ ||
haranāmajapaṁllakṣaṃ brahmahatyāṃ vyayohati || 11 ||

śuṣkaiḥ paryuṣitaiḥ patraiḥ khaṃḍairbilvasya nārada ||
pūjayedgirijānāthaṃ mucyate sarvapātakaiḥ || 12 ||

bilvavṛkṣaṃsamāsādyayo maṃtrānvividhāñjapet ||
ye māmananyaśaraṇāssatataṃ vareṇyaṃ saṃpūjayaṃti navakomalabilvapatraiḥ ||
tenirguṇā apiguṇāṃbudhayobhavaṃti  viṃdaṃtimuktimupabhuktasamastabhogāḥ || 13 ||

(42) atha niṣiddhapuṣpāṇipūjāsu (-)

durgandānyugragandhānikusumānivivarjayet ||
gandhahīnamapigrāhyaṃ pavitraṃ yatkuśādikam || 1 ||

keśakīṭopabaddhāniśīrṇaparyuṣitāni ca |
svayaṃpatitapuṣpāṇi tyajedupahatāni ca || 2 ||

(43) atha savyapradakṣiṇaprakāracaṇṣavṛṣasthānasomasūtrasthānanirṇayāḥ (-) śivaliṅgeṣu (-)

pradakṣiṇaprakārastu dvividhovedasammataḥ ||
savyāpasavyassavyaśca tatrādyovidhirucyate || 1 ||

vṛṣacaṇḍaṃ vṛṣaṃ caiva somasūtraṃ punarvṛṣam ||
caṇḍaṃ ca somasūtraṃ ca punaścaṇaḍaṃ punarvṛṣam || 2 ||

(prāgdvāraṃdevadevasya vṛṣasthānaṃ prakīrtitam ||
devasyanair(-)ṛtebhāge caṇḍasthānaṃ prakīrtitam || 3 ||

paścimābhimukheliṅge sthānametadudīritam ||
liṅge tu prāṅmukhe sthānaṃ caṇḍasyeśānyameva hi || 4 ||

maheśasyottarasthānaṃ somasūtrasthalaṃ smṛtam ||
paścimābhimukhe liṅge somasūtraṃ tu pūrvataḥ || 5 ||)

trīṇyetānisthalānyeva navasthānānisattama ||
upaviśyavṛṣasthāne caṇḍasthānaṃ tato vrajet || 6 ||

punarvṛṣaṃ samāgatya somasūtraṃ vrajet tataḥ ||
punarvṛṣeśamāgatya caṇḍasthānaṃ tato vrajet || 7 ||

<p. 331>

tato vṛṣeśamaprāpyasomasūtraṃ vrajeddvijaḥ ||
somasūtramanullaṃghya caṇḍasthānādvṛṣaṃ vrajet || 8 ||

sthānānyevaṃ samāvṛtya vṛṣabheśaṃ punaryadā ||
prāpnuyānniyatobhūtvā tadekaṃ syāt pradakṣiṇam || 9 ||

somasūtraṃ samullaṃghya garbhekāryāḥ pradakṣiṇāḥ ||
vṛṣoyadibhavedgarbhe nocettatra na sarvathā || 10 ||

somasūtraṃsamullaṃghya garbhesa vṛṣabhe hi saḥ || 
vihitaṃ vāstvavihitaṃ somasūtraṃ na laṃghayet || 11 ||

bahiścāpi hi tatsūtramullaṃghyaṃ naiva sarvathā || 9 ||

(44) atha mahādevabhaktānāṃlakṣaṇanāmadheyavarṇādayaḥ (-)

(skāṃdapurāṇevīramāheśvarakāṃḍebhaktavilāse)

(suṃdaramūrtiḥ) (-) 

brāhmaṇaḥ | baddhāṃjaliḥ | pāśvayornāgavetre | pārśvadvayekamalinīnaṃdinyaupadmahaste || 1 ||

(appaḥ) (-) 

kulālaḥ | baddhāṃjaliḥ | vāmakarebhūdārḍhyakārakadaṃḍavatphalakavān || 1 ||

(māṇikyavācakaḥ) (-) 

brāhmaṇaḥ | kirīṭī | dakṣakarekṣamālā | vāmakare pustakam || 1 ||

(śivajñānasaṃbaṃdhaḥ) (-) 

brāhmaṇaḥ | kirīṭī | tālavādakanibhaḥ || 1 ||

(nīlakaṃṭhaḥ) (-) 

brāhmaṇaḥ | tapasvī | baddhaṃjaliḥ | upaviṣṭaḥ | vāmekamaṃḍaluḥ || 1 ||

(trisahasrabhūsuraḥ) (-) 

brāhmaṇaḥ | baddhāṃjaliḥ || 1 ||

(mahādhanaḥ) (-) 

vaiśyaḥ | baddhāṃjaliḥ || 1 ||

(satyārthaḥ) (-) 

kṣatriyaḥ | kirīṭī | baddhāṃjaliḥ | vāmakare khaḍgaḥ || 1 ||

(māraḥ) (-) 

śūdraḥ | vakraśikhaḥ | baddhaṃjaliḥ || 1 ||

(vīramaṃdiraḥ) (-) 

śūdraḥ | jaṭādhārī | dakṣakare paraśuḥ || 1 ||

(amaranītiḥ) (-) 

śūraḥ | baddhāṃjaliḥ || 1 ||

(dārukaḥ) (-) 

śūraḥ | dakṣakare paraśuḥ || 1 ||

<p. 332>

(yenadināthaḥ ) (-) kṣatriyaḥ | vakraśikhaḥ | baddhāṃjaliḥ | dakṣiṇakakṣe'dhomukhakhaḍgaḥ || 1 ||

(kanna (ṣṇa) ppaḥ) (-) vyādhaḥ | sāṃjalibandhaḥ | vāmedhanurbāṇau | vakraśikhaḥ | padoḥpādvau || 1 ||

(kalānāthaḥ) (-) brāhmaṇaḥ | sāṃjalibandhaḥ | vāmegadā || 1 ||

(mānakuṃjaḥ) (-) kṣatriyaḥ | sāṃjalibandhaḥ || 1 ||

(gonāthaḥ) (-) gopaḥ | viṇuvādakanibhaḥ || 1 ||

(śaṃkulādāyaḥ) (-) śūdraḥ | dskṣakare kṣurikā || 1 ||

(mūrtināthaḥ) (-) vaiśyaḥ | sāṃjalibandhaḥ || 1 ||

(rudrapaśupatiḥ) (-) brāhmaṇaḥ | sāṃjalibandhaḥ || 1 ||

(skaṃdanāthaḥ) (-) brāhmaṇaḥ | dvayoḥkarayoḥ puṣpamālā || 1 ||

(naṃdanaḥ) (-) paṃcamaḥ | sāṃjalibandhaḥ || 1 ||

(vicāravān) (-) kṣatriyaḥ | sāṃjalibandhaḥ | dvayoḥ kakṣayoḥ dhautavastrāsanajapamālādigranthiḥ || 1 ||

(caṃḍeśvaraḥ) (-) brāhmaṇaḥ | sāṃjalibandhaḥ | kirīṭī | dakṣiṇakakṣe paraśuḥ || 1 ||

(kulapakṣakaḥ) (-) śūdraḥ | sāṃjalibaṃdhaḥ | vāme vastragranthiḥ || 1 ||

(pūtavatī) (-) vaiśyakanyā | sāṃjalibaṃdhā || 1 ||

(vidyāśūraḥ) (-) brāhmaṇaḥ | sāṃjalibaṃdhaḥ || 1 ||

(abhūticaraḥ) | brāhmaṇaḥ | sāṃjalibaṃdhaḥ || 1 ||

(nīlanagnaḥ) (-) śūdraḥ | sāṃjalibaṃdhaḥ || 

(navanaṃdaḥ) (-) brāhmaṇaḥ | sāṃjalibaṃdhaḥ || 1 ||

(kalikāmaḥ) (-) paṃcamaḥ | kirīṭī | sāṃjalibaṃdhaḥ | vāmekhaḍgaḥ || 1 ||

(dabrabhaktaḥ) (-) buruḍaḥ | vastrakambalādinirmitavastuviśeṣeṇāvṛtakarṇāntamastakaḥ | vāmakakṣe vāśikā | sāṃjalibaṃdhaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 333>

(śrīmūlaḥ) (-) brāhmaṇaḥ | sāṃjalibaṃdhaḥ | jaṭāmakuṭadhārī || 1 ||

