(45) atha jagadguruśrīśaṅkarācāryāvatāraḥ (-) 
(śaṅkaradigvijayevaidikavijayadhvajesaṅkaramandārasaurabhādauca)

kalaurudromahādevo lokānāmīśvaraḥ pitā ||
kariṣyatyavatāraṃsvaṃ śaṃkaro nīlalohitaḥ || 1 ||

śrautasmārtapratiṣṭhārthaṃ śiṣyāṇāṃhitakāmyayā ||
upadekṣyatitajjñānaṃśiṣyāṇāṃ brahmasammitam || 2 ||

sarvavedāntasāraṃ ca dharmānvedanidarśanān || 1 ||

(46) atha pūjāyāṃpacāyanānyāvaśyakāni (-) (sadācārasaṃgrahe)

ādityamaṃvikāṃviṣṇuṃ gaṇanāthaṃmaheśvaram ||
brāhmaṇaḥ pūjayet paṃca paṃcayajñaparāyaṇaḥ || 1 || 5 ||

<p. 335>

atha pūjāyāṃpañcāyatanasanniveśeniyamāḥ (-)

(47) tatrādau pūjāyāṃvaidikapaṃcāyatanasanniveśakramaḥ (-) (sadācārasaṃgrahe)

sathyāṃbikādevahavirdinādhipopiturmanuṣyasya ca viṣṇurīritaḥ ||
brahmeśvaraubhūtabalirgaṇādhipoyajñeśvarāssyuryajanīyadevatāḥ  || 1 ||

viṣṇustapastīvrakaraḥsukarmaṇāṃsākṣīravirmaṃtramayīmanonmanī ||
dhyānasyavighnāpanudaṃbikāsutojñānapradaḥsthāṇuritīryate budhaiḥ || 2 ||

(śivapaṃcāyatanam) (-) śaṃbhaumadhyagate harīnaharabhūdevyaḥ

(viṣṇupaṃcāyatanam) (-) harau śaṃkarebhāsyenā'gasutā

(ādityapaṃcāyatanam) (-) ravau haraganeśājāṃbikā sthāpayet ||

(devipaṃcāyatanam) (-) devyāṃ(-)viṣṇuharebhavaktraravayaḥ

(gaṇeśapaṃcāyatanam) (-) laṃbodare'jeśvarenāryāḥ (-) śaṃkaradiṅmukhāstuśubhadāḥ vyatyastato hānidāḥ || 1 ||

madhyasthitasya devasya devā īśānyataḥ śubhāḥ || 5 ||

atha devānāṃdiṅnirṇayaḥ

devasyamukhamārabhyadiśaṃprācīṃprakṛlpayet || 1 ||

madhyasthitasyadevasyetyarthaḥ ||

