(kevalaśivapaṃcāyatanam) (-) pārvatīparameśānaugaṇeśasskaṃdanaṃdinaḥ ||

(kevalaviṣṇupaṃcāyatanam) (-) śrībhūdevyaumahāviṣṇurviṣvaksenaḥkhageśvaraḥ ||

(kevaladevīpaṃcāyatanam) (-) kālīdurgābhavānī ca viṣṇuścaiva manonmanī ||

idameva (kevalagaurīpañcāyatana) (-) mityapyucyate ||

(kevalasūryapaṃcāyatanam) (-) bhānuśchāyātathādaṃḍastathāmāṭharapiṃgalau ||

(kevalagaṇeśapaṃcāyatanam)  (-) gaṇeśovallabhāyakṣaḥkuṃḍodaramahodarau ||

