atha aṣṭādaśapurāṇānāṃ pravaktṛbhūlokāgamanayornirṇayaḥ (-) (purāṇasāre)

parāśarasutovyāsaḥ kṛṣṇadvaipāyano bhavat ||
sa evasarvadevānāṃ purāṇānāṃ pradaśakaḥ || 1 ||

purāṇamakhilārthānāṃ bodhakaṃ śrutisaṃmitam ||
adyāpi devaloketacchatakoṭipravistaram || 2 ||

tadarthotracaturlakṣaiḥ saṃkṣepeṇanigadyate ||
tadaṣṭādaśadhākṛtvā bhūlokesminprakīrtitam || 3 || 18 ||

atha mahāpurāṇānāṃlakṣaṇāni (-) (purāṇasāre)

(1) tatrādau brāhmapurāṇasyalakṣaṇam (-)

brahmaṇābhihitaṃpūrvaṃ yāvanmātraṃ marīcaye ||
brāhmaṃtaddaśasāhasraṃ (10000) ślo(0) purāṇaṃparikīrtitam || 1 || 1 ||

(2) atha pādmapurāṇasyalakṣaṇam (-)

brahmaṇābhitaṃpūrvaṃ yāvanmātraṃ marīcaye ||
paṃcaparvātmakaṃbrahmā pādmaṃloke jagāda vai || 1 ||

pādmaṃ tatpaṃcapaṃcāśat sahasrāṇi (55000) ślo(0) nigadyate || 1 ||

(3) atha varāhapurāṇasyalakṣaṇam (-)

vārāhakalpavṛttāṃtamadhikṛtyaparāśaraḥ ||
yānprāhadharmāṃstvakhilāntadyuktaṃ vaiṣṇavaṃ viduḥ || 1 ||

viṣṇvākhyamaṣṭasāhasram (8000) ślo(0) tatpurāṇaṃ vidurbudhāḥ || 1 ||

<p. 342>

(4) atha vāyupurāṇasyalakṣaṇam (-)

śvetakalpaprasaṃgenadharmānvāyurihā bravīt ||
etattadvāyavīyaṃ syādudramāhātmyamucyate || 1 ||

caturviṃśatisahasrāṇi (24000) ślo(0) purāṇaṃ tadihocyate || 1 ||

(5) atha bhāgavatapurāṇasyalakṣaṇam (-)

yatrādhikṛtyagāyatrīṃ varṇyatedharmavistaraḥ ||
vṛtrāsuravadhopetaṃ tadbhāgavatamucyate || 1 ||

(prakārāntaram) (-) 

sārasvatasyakalpasya madhye ye syurnarāmarāḥ ||
tadvṛttāṃtodbhavoyatratadbhāgavatamucyate || 1 ||

aṣṭādaśasahasrāṇi (18000) ślo(0) purāṇaṃparikīrtitam || 1 ||

(6) atha bhaviṣyapurāṇasyalakṣaṇam (-)

śatānīkenapṛṣṭenavyāsaśiṣyeṇadhīmatā ||
sauradharmastu yatraiva vyākhyātastu sumaṃtunā || 1 ||

dvādaśaivasahasrāṇi (12000) ślo(0) bhaviṣyākhyaṃtaducyate || 1 ||

(7) atha nāradīyapurāṇasyalakṣaṇam (-)

yatrāhanāradodharmānbṛhatkalpāśrayāṃstviha ||
caturviṃśatisahasrāṇi (24000) ślo(0) nāradīyaṃtaducyate || 1 || 1 ||

(8) atha mārkaṇḍeyapurāṇasyalakṣaṇam (-)

yatrādhikṛtyaśakunīndharmādharmavicāraṇā ||
saptatriṃśatsahasrāṇi (37000) ślo(0) mārkaṃḍeyamihocyate || 1 || 1 ||

(9) atha āgneyapurāṇasyalakṣaṇam (-)

yattadagnyudbhavaṃcedaṃjagatsthāvarajaṃgamam ||
cayanānāṃsamutpattimiṣṭikāgamanaṃtathā || 1 ||

adhikṛtyapravṛttaṃ yatkratusaṃkhyādikaṃ tathā ||
vasiṣṭhasyāgninā proktamāgneyaṃ tatpracakṣate || 2 ||

āgneyaṃ cāṣṭasāhasraṃ (8000) ślo(0) sarvakratuphalapradam || 1 ||

<p. 343>

(10) atha brahmakaivartapurāṇasyalakṣaṇam (-)

yatra vai vaiṣṇavādharmā vasiṣṭhenamahātmanā ||
aṃbarīṣasya vai proktaḥ sargobrāhmastathaiva ca || 1 ||

procyate brahmakaivartaṃ taddvādaśasahasrakam (12000) ślo(0) || 1 ||

(11) atha laiṅgyapurāṇasyalakṣaṇam (-)

yatraceśānakalpasya vṛttāṃtamadhikṛtya ca ||
kalpitaṃlaiṃgyamityuktaṃ purāṇaṃ brahmaṇā svayam || 1 ||

tadekādaśasāhasra (11000) ślo(0) mākhyātaṃ munipuṃgavāḥ || 1 ||

(12) atha varāhaprāṇasyalakṣaṇam (-)

vāmanasyaprasaṃgena kalpasya munipuṃgavāḥ ||
mahāvarāhasyapunarmāhātmyamadhikṛtya ca || 1 ||

viṣṇanābhihitaṃkṣoṇyai tadbārāhamihocyate ||
caturviṃśatisahasrāṇi (24000) ślo(0) tatpurāṇamihocyate || 2 || 1 ||

(13) atha skandapurāṇasyalakṣaṇam (-)

yatramāheśvarāndharmānadhikṛtya ca ṣaṇmukhaḥ ||
kalpe tatpuruṣe vṛttaiścaritrairupabṛṃhitam || 1 ||

skāṃdaṃnāmapurāṇaṃ tannirmametattrayodaśam ||
sahasrāṇāṃśataṃcaika (100000) ślo(0) mitimartyeṣuprakīrtitam || 2 || 1 ||

(14) atha vāmanapurāṇasyalakṣaṇam (-)

trivikramasyamāhātmyamadhikṛtyacaturmukhaḥ ||
trivargaṃ ca tridaivatyaṃ vāmanaṃ tatprakīrtitam || 1 ||

caturdaśasahasrāṇi (14000) ślo(0) khyātaṃkalpānugaṃ śivam || 1 ||

(15) atha kūrmapurāṇasyalakṣaṇam (-)

yatradharmārthakāmānāṃ mokṣasya ca rasātale ||
māhātmyaṃ kathayāmāsa kūrmarūpījanārdanaḥ || 1 ||

iṃdradyumnaprasaṃgena ṛṣibhyaścakrasannidhau ||
tatkaurmaṃṣaṭsahasrāṇi (6000) ślo(0) lakṣmīkalpānuṣaṃgikam || 2 || 1 ||

(16) atha mātsyapurāṇasyalakṣaṇam (-)

śrutīnāṃ yatra kalpādau pravṛttyarthaṃ janārdanaḥ ||
mātsyarūpeṇamanavenārasiṃhopavarṇitam || 1 ||

<p. 344>

adhikṛtyābravīt saptakalpavṛttaṃ ca suvratāḥ ||
tanmātsyamitijānīdhvaṃsahasrāṇi caturdaśa (14000) ślo(0) || 2 || 1 ||

(17) atha garuḍapurāṇasyalakṣaṇam (-)

yadā tu gāruḍe kalpeviśvāṃḍaṃ garuḍodbhavam ||
adhikṛtyābravīdviṣṇuḥ gāruḍaṃ tadihocyate || 1 ||

tattuṣoḍaśasāhasraṃ (16000) ślo(0) purāṇaṃ paripaṭhyate || 1 ||

(18) atha brahmāṇḍapurāṇasyalakṣaṇam (-)

brahmābrahmāṃḍamāhātmyamadhikṛtyābravītpunaḥ ||
taccadvādaśasāhasraṃ (12200) ślo(0) brahmāṃḍaṃdviśatādhikam || 1 || 1 ||

(19) atha mahāpurāṇānāṃsaṃhatyaślokasaṃkhyāḥ (-)

bhaviṣyāṇāṃ ca kalpānāṃ śrayate yatravistaraḥ ||
caturlakṣamidaṃ (400000) ślo(0) proktaṃ vyāsenādbhutakarmaṇā || 1 ||

idaṃlokahitārthāyasaṃkṣiptaṃparamarṣiṇā || 1 ||

(20) atha śrīmahābhāratasyaparvādhyāyaślokasaṃkhyāḥ (-)

(mahābhāratoktānukramaṇikādhyāye)

adhyāyaślokasaṃkhyā agaṇiṣatamahābhārate tvādiparvaṇyadridvyakṣīṇyathābdhībhagajagajamitāḥsabhyakenāgaśailāḥ ||
rudreṣvakṣīṇivanyenavarasanayanānyabdhisaṭṣaṇmahīkṣmāḥ vairāṭesaptaṣaṭkāḥgaganaśaranabhobāhavassaṃpradiṣṭāḥ || 1 ||

audyogerībhacaṃdrāgajanavarasaṣaṭbhīṣmaparvaṇyageśāḥ abdhībhāṣṭeṣavothābhranagaśaśadharāḥ drauṇakekābhragoṣṭau ||
kārṇekāṃgānivedārinavakṛtamitāḥ śalyaparvaṇyathogobāṇāḥ ravākṣidvirāmā athagajaśaśinaḥ sauptikebhrādrināgāḥ || 2 || 
strīparvaṇyadripakṣāśśaranagamunayaḥ śāṃtiparvaṇyajāgnitrīṇyaśvābdhyadrivedeṃdava upagaditāścānuśāstauṣaḍiṃdrāḥ ||
ravābhrābhrāṣṭāśvamedhesurabhunakhasurā āśramāvāsaparvaṇyakṣyabdhyākhyāḥ ṣaḍabhrākṣaśaśadharamitāmausaleṣṭaukhavedāḥ || 3 ||

<p. 345>

māhāprasthāniketutraya ihagaganākṣitrayassaṃpradiṣṭāḥ svargārohe tu bāṇānavagaganakarāḥ parvasūktāḥ svasaṃkhyāḥ ||
ahyāyānāṃ sahasraṃsadaladhṛtisahasraṃharervaṃśa itthaṃślokāḥ śrīkṛṣṇabhūmībhṛdidamagaṇayadbhāratādhyāyapadmam || 4 ||

(21) atha śrīmadbhāgavatasthaskaṃdhādhyāyaślokasaṃkhyāḥ (-)

śrīmadbhāgavateśukenakathitedhyāyāstathāślokakā ādyenaṃdakusaṃjñitāvasumatīdyvaṣṭau dvitīye daśa ||
ṣaṇṇaṃdajvalanāstṛtīya analāgnīpaṃcaviṃśanmanustūryekujvalanāḥkhaṣaṭkajaladhikṣmāpaṃcame(-)ṣaḍvayam || 1 ||

dvidvikṣoṇidharāśca ṣaṣṭhagaditānaṃdeṃdavaścābdhiṣaṇnāgāḥsaptamasaṃkhyakethatithayaḥ ślokāstriṣaṭkādrayaḥ ||
saṃkhyātāśca tathāṣṭame jaladhinetre naṃdavahniprajeśāskaṃdhenavamejināvidhimunisraṣṭṛprasaṃkhyāḥ kramāt || 2 ||

skaṃdhe vaidaśamekhanaṃdagaṇitānaṃdādrinaṃdāgnayaścaikatriṃśadathośarādriguṇa(-)bhūsaṃkhyāstathaikādaśe ||
skaṃdhe cāṃtyamaketrayodaśamitāścādhyāyasaṃkhyāstathā ślokāścaṃdramunīśabāṇagaṇitāḥ skaṃdhāḥ paraṃdvāhaśa || 3 ||

(22) atha rāmāyaṇasthakāṃḍa sarga ślokasaṃkhyāḥ (-)

bālakāṇḍe tu saṃkhyātāḥ sargā vai munimārutāḥ ||
ślokāstvaṃbarabāṇāsi bāhavaśca prakīrtitāḥ || 1 ||

ayodhyākāṃḍake sargāḥ naṃdarudra prasaṃkhyakāḥ ||
ślokāstuvasunāgākṣa vedasaṃkhyāḥ prakīrtitāḥ || 2 ||

araṇyakāṃḍake sargāḥ bāṇaparvatasaṃkhyakāḥ |
ślokāstu tatra gaditāḥ kheṣujvalananetrakāḥ || 3 ||

kiṣkiṃdhākāṃḍasargāstu marudrasasamīsitāḥ ||
padmānikhākṣitejokṣi saṃkhyātānivicakṣaṇaiḥ || 4 ||

tathā suṃdarakāṃḍe tu sargānāgārisaṃkhyakāḥ ||
tatraślokāstu śūnyābhrarasajvalanasaṃkhyakāḥ || 5 ||

yuddhakāṃḍe tu saṃkhyātāssargāvyomādicandirāḥ ||
ślokāstu tatra gaditāḥ arināgākṣamānasāḥ || 6 ||

tathācottarakāṃḍe tu sargā rudreṃdu saṃjñakāḥ ||
ślokāstu tatragaditāḥ śūnyābhravyomasāgarāḥ || 7 ||

<p. 346>

(23) atha skāṃdapurāṇasthakhaṃḍādhyāya śokasaṃkhyāḥ (-)

purāṇeṣu muniśreṣṭhā skāṃdaṃ sukhadamuttamam ||
sarvavedāṃtasarvasvaṃ paṃcāśatkhaṃḍamaṃḍitam (5) || 1 ||

saṃhitābhistathāṣaḍabhiḥ (6) yuktaṃ paramapāvanam ||
ādyāsanatkumārīyā dvitīyā sūtasaṃhitā || 2 ||

tṛtīyā saṃhitā brāhmī turīyā vaiṣṇavī matā ||
paṃcamī śāṃkarījñeyā ṣaṣṭhīsyātsaurasaṃhitā || 3 ||

ādyātu paṃcapaṃcāśa sāhasraiḥ ślokakai (55000) ślo(0) ryutā ||
dvitīyā saṃhitā viprāḥ ṣaṭsahasrai (6000) ślo(0) ralaṃkṛtā || 4 ||

trisahasraiḥ (3000) ślo(0) yutābrāhmī paṃcabhiḥ (5000) ślo(0) vaiṣṇavī matā ||
triṃśadbhiḥ (30000) ślo(0) śāṃkarī yuktākhaṃḍairdvādaśabhi(12)ryutā || 5 ||

ṣaṣṭhitusārasaṃyuktā sahasreṇaikakenasā (1000) ślo(0) graṃthalakṣaiḥ ||
(100000) ślo(0) yutaṃskāṃdaṃpaṃcāśatkhaṃḍamaṃḍitam || 6 ||

atha vedopavedaṣaḍaṃgataṃtrāgamopaniṣadādīnāṃtattadāgamataṃtrādikartṝṇāṃ ca nāmāni (-) (lakṣmīnārāyaṇasaṃvāde)

(24) atha vedāḥ (-)

ṛgvedadaścayajurvedaḥ sāmātharvāścaturvidhāḥ || 4 ||

(25) athopavedāḥ (-)

āyurvedastu ṛgvededhanurvedoyajuṣyapi ||
sāmnigāṃdharvavedaḥ syādarthavedohyatharvaṇe || 1 ||

aṃgavedāstuvijñeyāḥ kramādete mahāphalāḥ || 4 ||

(26) atha vedādutpannāniśāstrāṇi (-)

āyuḥśāstraṃ śilpaśāstraṃ jyotiṣaṃ dhātuvādakam ||
āyurādyupavedebhyaḥ catvārojajñiresutāḥ || 1 || 4 ||

(27) atha vedānāṃṣaḍaṃgāni (-)

śikṣākalpo vyākaraṇaṃ niruktaṃ jyotiṣaṃ tathā ||
chaṃdaśceti ṣaḍaṃgāni ṛgādīnāṃ mahīyasām || 1 || 6 ||

<p. 347>

(28) atha vedānāmupāṅgāni (-)

padaṃ pratipadaṃ chaṃdo jñānaṃ svarasamudbhavaḥ ||
nyāyastadbrahmamīmāṃsetyupāṃgānyuditāniṣaṭ || 1 || 6 ||

(29) atha vedānāṃpatnyaḥ (-)

ṛgādīnāmimāḥ patnyassāmidhenī srugāhvayā ||
juhūḥ samitsamākhyātāścaturṇāṃ vidhinirmitāḥ || 1 || 4 ||

(30) atha dvātriṃśadupaniṣannāmāni (-)

tatha caivopaniṣadodvātriṃśatparikīrtitāḥ ||

īśāvāsyaṃcakenākhyaṃ kaṭhavallyabhidhaṃ tathā || 1 ||

muṃḍakaṃ caiva māṇḍūkyaṃ chāṃdogyaṃ taitirīyakam ||
praśnākhyaṃ bṛhadāraṇyamaitareyaṃ tathaiva ca || 2 ||

garbhākhyaṃ caiva kaivalyaṃ śvetāśvatarameva ca ||
kālāgnirudraṃhaṃsaṃ ca nārāyaṇamataḥ param || 3 ||

sārīraṃnādabiṃdvākhyaṃ maṃtraṃ cāmṛta biṃdukam ||
brahmākhyaṃ caiva jābālamatharvaśira āhvayam || 4 ||

bṛhajjābālakaṃ caiva subālakamataḥ param ||
maitreyaṃ parahaṃsaṃ ca kṣurikānāmakaṃnathā || 5 ||

kauṣītakaṃtāpanīya maruṇī nāmakaṃ tathā ||
maitrāyaṇīyaṃ cātharva śikhāsaṃjñamanukramāt || 6 ||

etānyupaniṣacchabdavācyānisumahāṃti ca ||
tiṣṭhanti brahmanikaṭe tasmādupaniṣatsmṛtā || 7 ||

mokṣaikahetubhūtāni nṛṇāṃ śravaṇamātrataḥ || 32 ||

(31) atha vedagatābheda viśeṣāḥ (-)

vidhimantrārthavādāśca vedeṣu gaditāstrayaḥ || 3 ||

(32) atha śāstrāṇi (-)

ādyaṃ śāstreṣutarkākhyaṃ vaiśeṣikamataḥ param ||
mīmāṃsā śāstramaparaṃturyaṃ vedāṃtanāmakam || 1 ||

paṃcamaṃ yogaśāstraṃ tu ṣaṣṭhaṃ sāṃkhyāhvayaṃ tathā ||
ṣaḍetāni hi śāstrāṇi jagadetairniyamyate || 2 || 6 ||

(33) athopaśāstrāṇi (-)

etebhya upaśāstrāṇi jajñireṣaḍanukramāt ||
tarkaśāstrānnītiśāstraṃ nānāthaparibṛṃhitam || 1 ||

<p. 348>

vaiśeṣikātpramāṇākhyaśāstraṃyukti viguṃphitam ||
mīmāṃsāśāstrato dharma śāstraṃ karma kriyāhvayam || 2 ||

adhyātmaśāstraṃ vedāṃtaśāstrācchokaikabheṣajam ||
yogaśāstrāttatvaśāstramātmajñānapradarśanam || 3 ||

sāṃkhyaśāstrānmokṣaśāstraṃ sarvaduḥkhaharaṃ nṛṇām ||
saṃgṛhītānimunibhirupaśāstrāṇi yāni ca || 4 || 6 ||

(34) athāṃgaśāstropaśāstreṣūttamaśāstram (-)

eṣāṃśāstropaśāstrāṇāmaṃgaśāstramanuttamam ||
śabdaśāstraṃ mahābhāṣyaṃ sūtravyākaraṇānvitam || 1 || 1 ||

(35) atha śāstragatābhāgaviśeṣāḥ (-)

sūtraṃ bhāṣyaṃ vārtikaṃ ca trayaṃśāstreṣu varṇyate || 3 ||

(36) atha vyākhyānalakṣanam (-)

padacchedaḥ padārthoktirvigraho vākyayojanā ||
ākṣeposyasamādhānaṃ vyākhyānaṃ ṣaḍvidhaṃ matam || 1 || 6 ||

(37) atha mahāpurāṇānāmāni (-)

brāhmaṃ pādmaṃ vaiṣṇavaṃ ca śaivaṃ bhāgavataṃ tathā ||
nāradīyāhvayaṃ ṣaṣṭhaṃ mārkaḍeyaṃ tu saptamam || 1 ||

āgneyaṃ ca bhaviṣyaṃ ca brahmakaivartakaṃ tathā ||
laiṃgyaṃ vārāhakaṃskāṃdaṃ vāmanaṃ kaurmameva ca || 2 ||

mātsyaṃ ca gāruḍaṃ caiva brahmāṃḍaṃ ca tataḥ param ||
aṣṭādaśaprabhedāni vyāsenoktānibhāmini || 3 || 18 ||

(38) athopapurāṇanāmāni (-)

tathaivopapurāṇānitāvaṃtyevamahāṃti ca ||
cāturlakṣa (400000) pramāṇena cakrepārāśaromuniḥ || 1 ||

ādyaṃsanatkumāroktaṃ nārasiṃhaṃdvitīyakam ||
skāṃdaṃ ca śivadharmākhyaṃ daurvākhyaṃ nāradīyakam || 2 ||

kāpilaṃ mānavaṃ caiva śauklaṃ brahmāṃḍameva ca ||
vāruṇaṃ kālikākhyaṃ ca māheśvarasamīritam || 3 ||

sāṃbaṃsauraṃ ca mārīcaṃ pārāśaryaṃ ca bhārgavam ||
etānyupapurāṇāni vedavyāsoditānihi || 4 || 18 ||

<p. 349>

(39) atha purāṇadeśyagranthāḥ (-)

kāvyetihāsakathanakalpavṛttādināmabhiḥ ||
śaivavaiṣṇavasārākhyairaticitrakathānvitaiḥ || 1 ||

purāṇābhinnānyanyānikānicitsaṃtibhāmini || 4 ||

(40) tatrakāvyetihāsagranthāḥ (-)

kāvyaṃ rāmāyaṇaṃ proktamitihāsaṃ tu bhāratam ||
itihāsottamaṃ tadvaditihāsasamuccayam || 1 ||

harivaṃśastu kathitaḥ sarvārtha paribṛṃhitaḥ ||
śeṣadhārmahvayaścānyaḥ kathitolokapāvanaḥ || 2 || 5 ||

(41) atha purāṇavṛttāḥ (-)

daśacaiva purāvṛttāḥ saṃtijñānopapādakāḥ ||
teṣvādimohariścandramāhātmyakathanakramaḥ || 1 ||

sāvitryupākhyānamapipṛthubhūpacaritrakam ||
caturthastunalodaṃtassaudāsodaṃta eva ca || 2 ||

ṣaṣṭhaḥ kauśalavodaṃtaḥ māṃdhātuścaritrakam ||
tatorukmāṃgadodaṃtodauṣyaṃtodaṃta eva ca || 3 ||

dhuṃdhumārasya māhātmyaṃ purāvṛttāvabodhitāḥ ||
śivadharmāhvayaṃ śāstraṃ viṣṇudharmāhvayaṃ tathā || 4 ||

tathā caturlakṣa (400000) ślo(0) mānameṣāṃgrathapramāṇakam ||
purāṇabhinnānyetānikīrtitānimanīṣibhiḥ || 5 || 12 ||

(42) atha kalpagranthāḥ (-)

kalpāstusaptuvijñeyāḥ pṛthaksaptasahasrakāḥ ||
vaidyādharastu prathamonānācitrakathāśrayaḥ || 1 ||

dvitīyojñānavāsiṣṭhastṛtīyopsarasāhvayaḥ ||
yāyātastucaturthassyātpaṃcamomohanāhvayaḥ || 2 ||

dharmādharmāhvayaṣṣaṣṭho yonikalpastusaptamaḥ ||
ete sarvārthadātaṇāṃ śravaṇātpāpahāriṇaḥ || 3 || 7 ||

prakārāntaram (-) (anyatra) (-)

prathamaścaṇḍikākalpaṣṣoḍhākalpastataḥ param ||
tṛtīyaṣṣoḍaśīkalpaḥ kalpaḥ pañcākṣarābhidhaḥ || 1 ||

śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīkalpaḥ dūrgākalpastathaiva ca ||
rāmatārakakalpaśca śūlinī kalpa eva ca || 2 ||

tataḥ pratyaṃgirākalpaḥ indrākṣī kalpa eva ca ||
tatodhūmāvatīkalpaśśītalākalpa eva ca || 3 ||

svapnavārāhikākalpastṛcakalpastathaiva ca ||
lakṣmīnṛsiṃhakalpaśca kuhūkalpastataḥ param || 4 ||

<p. 350>

anantakalpastripurasundarīkalpa eva ca ||
aśvatthakalpaḥ tulajābhavānīkalpa eva ca || 5 ||

śuddhavārāhikākalpa āsurī kalpa eva ca ||
tathaivabagalākalpaḥ kalpovaṭukabhairavaḥ || 6 ||

daśapāpaharākalpassvarṇākarṣaṇabhairavaḥ ||
rājamātaṅgikākalpaḥ kalpobrahmāstranāmakaḥ || 7 ||

kalpolaghuśśyāmalāyāḥ kalpaścaivāśvalāyanaḥ ||
dattātreyābhidhaḥ kalpaḥ kārtavīryābhidhaḥ param || 8 ||

candirāparameśvaryāḥ kalpohanumataḥ paraḥ ||
etekalpāvedamūrti saṃkhyākāḥ parikīrtitāḥ || 9 || 34 ||

(43) atha smṛtayaḥ (-)

viṣṇuḥ parāśarodakṣaḥ saṃvartovyāsahāritau ||
śātatapovasiṣṭhaśca yamāpastaṃbagautamāḥ || 1 ||

devalaścaiva śaṃkhaśca bharadvājo śanāstrayaḥ ||
śaunakoyājñavalkyaścetyaṣṭādaśamunīśvarāḥ || 2 ||

etaiḥ pravartitāloke smṛtayoṣṭādaśottamāḥ || 18 ||

(44) athopasmṛtayaḥ (-)

upasmṛtipravaktāro ṛṣayoṣṭādaśasmṛtāḥ ||
jābālirnāciketaśca skaṃdalokākṣikaśyapāḥ || 1 ||

sanatkumārolikhitaḥ śaṃtanurjanakastathā ||
vyāghraḥ kātyāyanobabhruḥ jātūkarṇaḥ kapirnalaḥ || 2 ||

bodhāyanaḥ kaṇādaśca viśvatmitro mahātapāḥ ||
sumaṃturetemunayastathopasmṛtikāriṇaḥ || 3 || 18 ||

(45) atha smṛtisthaviṣayavibhāgaḥ (-)

ācārovyavahāraśca tathākālavinirṇayaḥ ||
prāyaścitta kramaḥśrāddhaṃ paṃcasmṛtiṣuyojitāḥ || 1 || 5 ||

(46) atha purāṇasthaviṣayavibhāgaḥ (-)

sargaśca pratisargaśca vaṃśomanvaṃtarāṇi ca ||
vaṃśānucaritaṃ caiva purāṇeṣu prakīrtyate || 1 || 5 ||

<p. 351>

(47) atha kāvyasthaviṣayavibhāgaḥ (-)

nagarārṇavaśailartu caṃdrārkodayavarṇanam ||
udyānasalilakrīḍāmadhupānaratotsavāḥ || 1 ||

vipralaṃbhovivāhaśca kumārodayavarṇanam ||
maṃtraṃdyūtapramāṇāni nāyakābhyudayastathā || 2 ||

kāvyetvaṣṭādaśavidhāvaṇyartakāvyavedibhiḥ || 18 ||

(48) atha vaidikatāntrikagranthāḥ (-)

āgamānāṃprabhedāśca kathyaṃtetramamapriye ||
ādauvaidikataṃtrāṇāmanukramaṇikocyate || 1 ||

sarvajñānottaraṃcaṃdrajñānaṃjñānārṇavāhvayam ||
āruṇeśvarataṃtraṃ ca viśuddheśvaranāmakam || 2 ||

traipuraṃ tu mahādevaṃ tatraṃ nyāyottaraṃ tataḥ ||
kālāsāraṃ kālavādataṃtraṃ yogīśvarī śatam || 3 ||

pūrvāmnāyāhvayaṃ dakṣiṇāmnāyākhyamanuttamam ||
paścimāmnāyakābhikhyamuttarāmnāyanāmakam || 4 ||

anuttarāmnāyataṃtramūrdhvāyāhvayaṃ tathā ||
kuṃḍīśvaramataṃ vīṇātaṃtraṃ guhyāhvayaṃ ca tat || 5 ||

kulacūḍāmaṇītaṃtraṃ kulāsārāhvayaṃ tataḥ ||
hṛdbhedaṃ mātṛbhedaṃ ca vātulaṃ vātulottaram || 6 ||

sarvavīramatañcaivatrotālaṃtrotalottaram ||
bahurūpāṣṭakaṃ caiva yāmalāṣṭakameva ca || 7 ||

kiraṇākhyamahātaṃtramekatriṃśadimānihi ||
anusṛtyatuvedoktakarmāṇyanucaraṃtihi || 8 || 31 ||

(49) athāvaidikatantrāni (-) (pu(0) anyatrāpi)

avaidikācāravatāṃtantrāṇāṃkrama ucyate ||
mahāmāyāśaṃbaraṃ ca yoginījālaśaṃbaram || 1 ||

tattvaśaṃbarakaṃ caiva kulārṇavamataḥ param ||
mahāsaṃmohanaṃ caiva rūpikāmatameva ca || 2 ||

virūpikāmataṃ caiva nityāṣoḍaśikā hvayam ||
pariśiṣṭānaṃdataṃtramamareśvarameva ca || 3 ||

vāmajuṣṭaṃ kuloddiṣṭaṃ rūpabhedaṃ tu kāmikam ||
paṃcāmṛtaṃ ca kalyāṇaṃ bhūtākhyaṃ vaibhavāṣṭakam || 4 ||

rājitaṃgāruḍaṃbālā taṃtraṃ vāsukināmakam ||
mahākālīmataṃ caiva mahāvīrāvatīmatam || 5 ||

<p. 352>

lalitājñāna taṃtraṃ ca lalitā taṃtrameva ca ||
mahākuleśvarīcūḍāmaṇitaṃtramanuttamam || 6 ||

trayastriṃśatprabhedāni hyavaidikavatāṃ nṛṇām || 33 || (-) ||

prakārāntaram (-)

catuṣṣaṣṭiśca tantrāṇi mātṝṇāmuttamānihi ||
mahāmāyāśambaraṃ ca yoginījālaśambaram || 1 ||

tattvaśambarakaṃ caiva bhairavāṣṭakameva ca ||
bahurūpāṣṭhakaṃ caiva pātalāṣṭakameva ca || 2 ||

candrajñānaṃ mālinī ca mahāsammohanaṃ tathā ||
vāmajaṣṭaṃ mahādevaṃ vātūlaṃ vātulottaram || 3 ||

hṛdbhedaṃ tantrabhedaṃ ca guhya tantraṃ ca kāmikam ||
kalāvādaṃ kalāsāraṃ tathānyatkuṇḍikā matam || 4 ||

matottaraṃ ca vīṇākhyaṃ trotalaṃ trotalottaram ||
pañcāmṛtaṃ rūpabhedaṃ bhūtoḍḍāmarameva ca || 5 ||

kulasāraṃ kuloddeśaṃ kulacūḍāmaṇistathā ||
sarvajñānottamaṃ caiva mahākālīmataṃ tathā || 6 ||

āruṇeśaṃ mohinīśaṃ trikuṭīśvarameva ca ||
pūrvapaścimadakṣaṃ cāpyattaraṃ ca niruttaram || 7 ||

vimalaṃ vimalorjaṃ ca devīmatamataḥ param || 64 ||

(50) tatrabhairavāṣṭakatantrāṇi (-)

siddhabhairava taṃtraṃ ca māyikaṃ bhairavaṃ tathā ||
kaṃkālabhairavaṃ taṃtraṃ kālāgnyākhyaṃ ca bhairavam || 1 ||

śaktibhairavataṃtraṃ ca yoginībhairavaṃ tathā ||
mahābhairavataṃtraṃ ca tathā bhairavanāthakam || 2 || 8 ||

(51) bahurūpāṣṭakatantrāṇi (-)

brāhmīmāheśvarī caiva vārāhī caiva vaiṣṇavī ||
indrāṇī caiva cāmuṇḍā śivadūtī kumārikā || 1 ||

etannāmānitantrāṇi bahurūpāṣṭakānihi || 8 ||

(52) athopatantrāṇi (-)

evamevopataṃtrāṇi ṣoḍaśātra ca saṃtihi ||
maṃtrārṇavaṃ maṃtrasāraṃ mahākālaṃ tu śāṃbhavam || 1 ||

ṣaṭkālāgamataṃtraṃ ca mūlaśākteya nāmakam ||
uḍḍāmareśvaraṃ rājataṃtraṃ lākulīkeśvaram || 2 ||

tathāmṛgamukhītaṃtraṃ caṃḍarudreśvaraṃ tataḥ ||
saubhāgyavallarītaṃtraṃ tālaṃ caṃḍeśvaraṃ tathā || 3 ||

halamekhalakaṃśaivaṃ kautukaṃ ceti vai kramāt ||
paṃcavakrasya vakrebhyaḥ paṃcabhyaḥ parijajñire || 4 || 16 ||

<p. 353>

(53) athā'gamagranthāḥ (-)

aṣṭāviṃśatisaṃkhyākāḥ kāmikādyāmahāgamāḥ ||
teṣāmādyaḥ kāmikākhyo dvitīyaḥ kāraṇāgamaḥ || 1 ||

ajitāgamanāmātu turyaścitrāgamāhvayaḥ ||
yogajaścaiva vedasya sadyojātamukhāccayutāḥ || 2 ||

(granthapātaḥ) 

jayāgamovīrasaṃjñāgamoviśvāsakāgamaḥ ||
svāyaṃbhuvanalānāmatvaghoramukhasaṃbhavāḥ || 3 ||

kāravomakuṭaścaiva caṃdrajñānā hvayastathā ||
biṃbākhyovimalākhyaśca mukhāttatpuruṣāccyutāḥ || 4 ||

prodgītaścaivasidhyaśca lalitāgama eva ca ||
sarvottaraśca saṃtāna kiraṇau pārameśvaraḥ || 5 ||

vātulaścāpi ceśānanāmakādvadanāccyutāḥ ||
eteṣṭāviṃśatiścaivāgamāḥ prādhānyataḥ smṛtāḥ || 6 || 28 || (-) || pra(0)

lalitāgama evādau tataśśaivāgamaśśubhaḥ ||
pāñcarātrāgamaḥ proktaḥ kāraṇāgama eva ca || 1 ||

vaikhānasāgamaḥ paścāt tatomantrāgamomataḥ ||
ṛtusaṃkhyāstu vijñeyā āgamāḥ parikīrtitāḥ || 2 || 6 ||

(54) atha vaiṣṇavāgamāḥ (-)

vaikhānasaṃpāṃcarātraṃ pratiṣṭhāsārameva ca ||
vijñānalalitaṃ ceti catvāro vaiṣṇavāgamāḥ || 1 || 4 ||

(55) athopāgamānāṃsaṅkhyāmātram (-)

etebhyaśca samutpannā pṛthakyathagupāgamāḥ ||
ṣaṇnavatyuttaraśatasaṃkhyākāḥ parijajñire || 1 || 196 ||

(56) atha saṃhitākarttṝṇāṃnāmāni (-)

saṃhitāśāstrakartāraḥ śataṃ vai ṛṣayaḥ smṛtāḥ ||
hayagrīvaśca garbhaśca śaunako manureva ca || 1 ||

bodhāyanassumaṃtuśca yājñavalkyaśca vātulaḥ ||
vyāsobṛhaspatiścaiva yamogautama eva ca || 2 ||

prājāpatyatrimauṅgalyāvāsiṣṭhobhārgavastathā ||
śātātapovāmadevo vṛddhaśātātapastathā || 3 ||

jamadagnirjaiminiśca jātūkarṇaśca jājaliḥ ||
jābālirjailanityaśca jānaṃntirjahnureva ca || 4 ||

<p. 354>

jyotiṣmānjīvalaścaiva vītihotrastataḥ param ||
śālihotraḥ suhotraśca vasuhotrastadanaṃtaraḥ || 5 ||

daśahotroyajñahotraḥ śatahotrastathaiva ca ||
nityahotraḥ prāṇahotraḥ sahastotrastathaiva ca || 6 ||

atryagastyāsurīviśvāmitrāṣṭā vakra piṃgalāḥ ||
pṛgādhacūlībhṛgavaḥ suyajñaśca tataḥ param || 7 ||

mataṃgaśca yamaścaiva rājalaḥ syāt tathaiva ca ||
vṛṃdāvanaścolūkaśca vātsyāyanamṛkaṃḍukau || 8 ||

rucakaḥ pippalādaśca cyavanaḥsūta eva ca ||
kapilonaidhruvaḥ kāśyapa evaṃ ṛṣyaśṛṃgakaḥ || 9 ||

śunaḥ śepodīrghatamāḥ kauṃḍinyastadanaṃtaraḥ ||
medhātithiścalaugākṣiḥ śuddhakālapradīpakau || 10 ||

viṣṇuvṛddhaśca vatsaśca vārdhraśvaḥ saṃkṛtistathā ||
bṛhadukthyaḥ kapiścaivahārītaḥ kutsa eva ca || 11 ||

nijaḍuścaivva bahrūśca kakṣyavānanidhistathā ||
bāṣkalaśca phaṇīpūtimāṣonakula eva ca || 12 ||

nārāyaṇo devarātaḥ kālīmaṃtrapradīpakau ||
yoganārāyaṇīyāṃśuratnamālyābhidhāstathā || 13 ||

jātakaumudikābhūmiḥ sudhāsārastathaiva ca ||
sanatsujātoyavanovālakhilya iti kramāt || 14 ||

saṃhitāsaṃpraṇetāraḥ ṛṣayaḥ kīrtitā amī ||
vedopavedavedāṃgā gamataṃtrakramādikam || 15 ||

tattatkartṛprabhedaśca kīrtitaścaivamatrahi || 100 ||

(57) atha śaivāgamadevatāsvarūpam (-)

(skāṃdelakṣmīnārāyaṇasaṃhitāyām)

śaivāgamaścaiva dīkṣāvahaḥ paṃcākṣaro ṛṣiḥ ||
śuddhasphaṭikasaṃkāśastripuṃḍrāṃkitamastakaḥ || 1 ||

stryakṣaścarmaparīdhānaḥ vaiyāghrājinasaṃsthitaḥ ||
baddhapadmāsanodvyaṣṭabhujaiḥ khaṭvāṃgaśūlake || 2 ||

śaktidaṃḍaucāpabāṇau varābhītigadāṃkuśān ||
cinmudrikāṃcākṣamālāṃ pustakaṃ ca kamaṃḍalum || 3 ||

khaṅgakheṭaudadhānoyaṃ pāyācchaivāgamonvaham ||

śvetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 355>

(58) atha vaikhānasāgamadevatā svarūpam (-) 

(skāṃdalakṣmīnārāyaṇasaṃhitāyām)

vaikhānasāgamodevastveṇakṛttivarāsanaḥ ||
baddhapadmāsanaḥ proktaḥ śvetavarṇaścaturmukhaḥ || 1 ||

aṣṭabhistubhujairdhatte darārī ca varābhayau ||
cinmudrāṃpustukaṃkuṃḍīmakṣaṃdakṣāditaḥ kramāt || 2 ||

pītaṃvasānovasanaṃ tripuḍrāṃkitamastakaḥ ||
jaṭībaddhakirīṭī ca sadādadyācchubhāninaḥ || 3 ||

śetavarṇaḥ || 1 ||

atha strīśūdrādīnāmupadeśakramaḥ (-)

(tantrasāre upadeśapaṭale)

(59) atha pañcadhāguravaḥ (-)

uttamaḥ paṃcadhāproktogururbrahmātmadarśibhiḥ ||
brahmacārīgṛhasthaśca vānaprasthaśca bhikṣukaḥ || 1 ||

ṭīku (-) taṃtrasāroktavāda upadeśapaṭaladalli brahmavettarugaliṃda helalpaṭṭiruvadenaṃdarebrahmacāriyu gṛhasthanu vānaprasthanu yatiyu || 1 ||

ativarṇāśramīteṣu kramācchreṣṭhāvicakṣaṇāḥ ||
aśreṣṭhānāṃ hareśre'ṣṭhā guravaḥ parikīrtitāḥ || 2 || 5 ||

ṭīku (-) varṇāśramātītanāda avadhūtayogiyu yī aidujanaru yogyarāgiddare vabbarigiṃtavabbaru śreṣṭharādaguruvenisuvaru | yalai viṣṇuve tamage yogyatekaḍameyāgiddare tamagiṃta śreṣṭharu kramavāgi gurugalenisikkolluvaru | adu hyāgeṃdare || 2 ||

brahmcārīgṛhasthaśca vanasthastu yaterapi ||
vidyotkarṣabalenaiva gururbhavatinānyathā || 3 ||

ṭīku (-) gṛhasthāśramavaṃtanige brahmacāriyu yatige vānaprasthanu vidyotkarṣabaladiṃda mātrave guruvenisuvanu | mattoṃduprakāradiṃdalu āgubadillā || 3 ||

gṛhasthopivanasthasya yaterapyaṃ bujekṣaṇa ||
vidyotkarṣabalenaiva gururbhavatinānyathā || 4 ||

<p. 356>

ṭīku (-) hāge hṛhasthanu vānprasthanige guruvāguvanu | vanasthanu yatigū guruvāguvanu | yalai kamalākṣane āśramadallikaḍameyādāgyu vidyotkarṣadiṃda śreṣṭhanāgiruvanendu anisikkolluvanu yī arthadallisaṃśayavilla || 4 ||

vānaprasthāśramasthopi tathāsaṃnyāsino hare ||
vidyotkarṣabalenaivagururbhavatinānyathā || 5 ||

ṭīku (-) hāge vānaprasthanu saṃnyāsigu guruvāguvanu | yalai puruṣottamane varṇāśramagalannu atikramiśiruva avadhūtayogiyādāgyu vidyābalavilladiddare guruvāguvadilla || 5 ||

ativarṇāśramīproktogurussarvādhiko bhavet ||
nakasyāpibhavecchiṣyo yathāhaṃ puruṣottama || 6 ||

ṭīku (-) kalai viṣṇuve varṇāśramagalannatikramiśida yogiyu sarvarigiṃtalu  śreṣṭhanāguvanu | ātanu tannaṃte yārigū śiṣyanāguvadilla || 6 ||

(60) atha strīśūdraviṣayeviśeṣaḥ (-) (tatraivasthalāṃtare)

śūdrāṇāṃ ca tathā strīṇāṃ gurutvaṃ naiva vidyate ||
patirevagurustrīṇāṃ janakastu tatodhikaḥ ||
athavā brahmavitprājño yogyābhāvetayorvaraḥ || 1 ||

ṭīku (-) matteneṃdare stīyarigu śūdrarigu upadeṃśavannu māḍuva gurutvādhikāravu illave ila | ādaru strīyarige patiyemukhyaguruvu | ātanigiṃtalu taṃdeyu guruvenisuvanu | avaribbarigu maṃtropadeśamāḍaluyogyateyu sāladiddalli brahmajñāniye uttama guruvenisuvanu || 1 ||

śūdrāṇāmuttamovarṇaḥ kramādatyuttamottamaḥ ||
purāṇapaṭhanemaṃtre jñānamārgapradarśane || 2 ||

ṭīku (-) śūdrarige purāṇapāṭhavannu maṃtropadeśavannu jñānopadeśavannu māḍuvadakku tamagiṃtalu vaiśya kṣatriya brāhmaṇa yī kramadiṃda vabbarigiṃtavabbaru uttamottamaguruvenisuvaru || 2 ||

patyurājñāvaśādeva strīṇāṃmantredhikāritā ||
vratamaṃtropavāsesyādanyathāniṣphalaṃ bhavet || 3 ||

ṭīku (-) strīyarunalige maṃtropavāsamodalāda taṃtramārgādhikāramātrave patiyājñeyiṃda uṃṭāguvadu | patiya ājñeyillade prabartisalusakalavu niṣphalavāguvadu || 3 ||

<p. 357>

bharturājñāṃpuraskṛtya gurumanyaṃ samāśrayet ||
abhāvejanakasyājñānaṃ svātaṃtryaṃ bhavet striyaḥ || 4 ||

ṭīku (-) strīyarige patiye mukhyaguruvāddariṃda avanige maṃtropadeśadayogyateyilladiddare avana ājñeyiṃdale mattobbaguruvannu āsrayisabeku | avanataruvāya taṃdeya ājñeyanāśrayisabeku | strīyarige svātaṃtryavilla || 4 ||

(61) atha sau(0) strīṇāṃ śiraḥsnānaniṣedhaḥ (-)

(śaivaratnākare sūtasaṃhi0)

puṇyakṣetrepuṇyatīrthe grahaṇepuṇyavāsare ||
jātāśauce mṛtāśauce rajodoṣaprasūtiṣu || 1 ||

putrīputravivāhāṃge dīkṣāṃgebharturevahi ||
suvāsinyāśśirasnānaṃ natvabhyaṃgaṃ vinā kvacit || 2 ||

ṭīku (-) śaivaratnākaradalli sūtasaṃhiteyalliruvadenaṃdare (-) suvāsinīyaru puṇyakṣetra puṇyatīrthagalalliyu grahaṇādipuṇyakāladalliyujātāśaucādigalalliyu rajasvale pādāgaluprasavavādāgalu putrīputravivāhadalliyu patiyu ācarisuva yāgādidīkṣegalalliyu śiraḥ snānavannu māḍabahudu | yī prakṛtagalallade abhyaṃgahoratāgi śiraḥsnānasarvathā yogyavalla || 2 ||

(62) sau(0) atha strīṇāṃ niyamāḥ (-) (śaivaratnākare)

strīṇāṃhibhartṛśuśrūṣādharmonānyassanātanaḥ ||
madarcanaṃ hi kalyāṇyāni yogobhartturasti cet || 1 ||

yānārībhartṛśuśrūṣāṃ vihāya vratatatparā ||
sānārīnirayaṃ yātinātrakāryā vicāraṇāṃ || 2 ||

aśmārohaṇamārabhyastrīṇāgauryarcanaṃ param |
purāṇapaṭhanaṃ śreyā na vedādhyāyanādikam || 3 ||

ṭīku (-) śaivaratnākaradalli heliruvadenaṃdare (-) yalaiviṣṇuve strīyarige patiśuśrūṣeparamadharmavu śāsvatavādaṃthāddu | adakkiṃtalu adhikavādaddumattoṃdu illavāddariṃda patiya anujñeyādarene pārvatiyādanannannu pūjemāḍabahudu | yāvastrīyu patiya ājñeyaṃ horatu vratādigalannu ācarisuvalo avalu narakavaṃ ddoṃduvalu saṃśayavilla |

<p. 358>

strīyarige vratopavāsādiniyama yāvadaṃdare | vivāhakāladalli saptapadītaruvāya aśmārohaṇavannu modalugoṃḍu gaurīpūjeyuvidhyuktavāddariṃda śreṣṭhavu | tadārabhya vedādhyayanahoratāgi purāṇādipaṭhanavu śravaṇavu śreyaskaraveṃduheliruvadu | āddaridaṃ stīyu patiya ājñeyiṃdale vratādigalannācarisabeku ||

(63) atha sau(0) strīṇāṃgrauryarcanamaṃtro (-)

(brahmottarakhaṇḍe anyatra ca)

nityamāryārcanaṃ kāryaṃ gauryāḥ paṃcākṣareṇatu ||
namontaṃ vaiṣṇavaṃśāktaṃ śaivaṃvācānyadaivatam || 1 ||

maṃtraḥ praśasyatestrīṇāṃ na ca strīnapumānayam ||
mahāpātakadāvāgnissoyaṃ maṃtraḥ ṣaḍakṣaraḥ || 2 ||

praṇavenavināmaṃtrassoyaṃpaṃcākṣarassmṛtaḥ ||

ṭīku (-) nityavu gaurīpaṃcākṣarīmaṃtradiṃdale gaurīpūjeyaṃmāḍabeku | strīyarige praṇavavarjitavāgiyemaṃtropadeśavaṃmāḍatakkaddu | āddariṃdavaiṣṇavaśaktiśaivamaṃtragalu namoṃtavāgiye upadeśamāḍatakkaddu | yīmaṃtravu namoṃtavādakāraṇaklībamaṃtraveniśikolluvadu | āddariṃdayidekramaddiṃdale strīyarige upadeśavaṃ māḍabeku | brahmottarakhaṃḍadalli heliruvadeneṃdare praṇavayuktavāda yī maṃtrave mahāpātakagalige dāvāgnisvarūpavāda ṣaḍakṣarīyanisuduyidemaṃtraveṃ praṇavarahitavādare paṃcākṣarīyanisikkolluvadu || 17 ||

(64) atha mokṣāpekṣiṇāṃstrīśūdrasaṃkīrṇānāṃ mantraḥ (-)

strībhiśśūdraiśca saṃkīrṇairdhyāyatemuktikāṃkṣibhiḥ ||
nālaṃkriyānahomaśca na saṃskāro na tarpaṇam || 1 ||

na kāleṣūpadeśaśca sadāśucirayaṃmanuḥ ||
prāṇāyāma manenaiva tenaivācamanaṃ varam || 2 ||

ṭīku (-) yīpaṃcākṣarīmaṃtrave mokṣārthigalādastrīśūdrasaṃkīrṇarugaliṃdadhyānisalpaḍuvadu | yīpaṃcākṣarīmaṃtrakke stīyarumuṃtādavariṃdabhūśuddhyādi āhnikavistāravu homatarpaṇādigalukelasavillāmattu sarvakāladallupariśuddhavādamaṃtravāddariṃdayīmaṃtropadeśakke grahaṇaparvakālādi niyāsayantu() kelasavillāstrīyarugaliṃda prāṇāyāmavu ācamanavu yidemaṃtradiṃdale māḍatakkaddu ||

<p. 359>

(65) athaitanmantraiḥ strīkartavyapūjāpratimādiviśeṣāḥ (-)

tenaiva pūjayed devaṃ devīṃ vā lokamātaram ||
pratimāsvarcayed viṣṇuṃ devīṃ vāgarikanyakām || 1 ||

liṅgeṣvarcātatheśasya maṃḍale cānyadevatāḥ ||
devatāyāḥ kalāhvānaṃ na pratiṣṭhāvidhistriyāḥ || 2 ||

ṭīku (-) strīyarugalu śivapūjeyannu gaurrīpūjeyannu yidemaṃtradiṃdale māḍatakkaddu | yāva ākṛti yannu yiriśipūjisebeṃkadare viṣṇuvannu gauriyanniriśikoṃḍepūjisatakkaddu | īśvaranaṃpūjisabekādare śivaliṃgavanniriśikkoṃḍepūjisatakkaddu | migilādadevategalannumaṃḍaladalliyepūjisatakkaddu | yiṣṭehoratu strīyarugalige devatā kāla āvāhaneyu prāṇapratiṣṭhāvidhānavukaḍadu | āddariṃdapuruṣariṃda prāṇapratiṣṭhitavāda liṃgavigrahagalannu pūrvoktarītiyiṃdalepūjisabeku || maṇḍalavaṃdare raṃgavalyādicitra || 2 ||

(66) atha saṃvatsarādigrahāṃtanāmnāṃvarṇasaṃkhyāḥ (-)

manurdvaye tṛtīyebhaṃturīyeṣoḍaśaiva tu ||
paṃcame tu dvayaṃ proktamabdānāṃ varṇakaṃ budhaiḥ || 1 ||

pakṣadvayaṃdvisaṃkhyākamayanepāṃḍavāssmṛtāḥ ||
ṛtūnāṃ tu trayaṃmutau netrasaṃkhyā trayaṃ tathā || 2 ||

māsaṣaṭkaṃ vahnisaṃkhyā dvisaṃkhyāne catuṣṭayam ||
yugasaṃkhyā dvayaṃproktaṃ māsānāṃ varṇato mayā || 3 ||

trisaṃkhyānavakaṃ proktaṃ yugasaṃkhyā catuṣṭayam ||
dvisaṃkhyāyāṃ trayaṃproktaṃ tithīnāṃ varṇitā budhaiḥ || 4 ||

dvisaṃkhyā tu yugāḥ proktāḥ trayasaṃkhyā dvayaṃ tathā ||
ekaṃ vai yugasaṃkhyāyāṃ vārāṇāṃ kathito janaiḥ || 5 ||

bāṇasaṃkhyā dvayaṃ proktaṃ yugasaṃkhyā ṛṣistathā ||
aṣṭakaṃ ca dvisaṃkhyāyāṃ traye caikādaśa smṛtāḥ || 6 ||

nakṣatrāṇāṃ varṇasaṃkhyā kathitā ṛṣibhiḥ kalau ||
dvisaṃkhyāyāṃ paṃcadaśatraye caiva daśa smṛtāḥ || 7 ||

vedasaṃkhyā dvayaṃproktaṃ yogānāṃ varṇato janaiḥ ||
aṣṭake tu trivarṇāḥ syurakṣisaṃkhyā dvayaṃ tathā || 8 ||

ekaṃ ca vedasaṃkhyāyāṃ karaṇānāmiti smṛtāḥ ||
dvisaṃkhyāyāṃ rasāḥ proktāstrisaṃkhyāpaṃcakaṃ tathā || 9 ||

ekaṃ ca yugasaṃkhyāyāṃ rāśīnāṃ kathitāstathā ||
vedasaṃkhyā dvayaṃproktaṃ dvisaṃkhyā ṛṣayastathā || 10 ||

<p. 360>

grahāṇāṃ kathitā varṇā navānāṃ jñaptaye budhaiḥ ||
śakeśālīvāhanasya catuṣpañcamunīnduke || 11 ||

kharajyeṣṭhasitepakṣe saptamyāṃ guruvāsare ||
śrīmaccaṇḍī kṛpādṛṣṭyā kathitākṛṣṇabhūbhujā || 12 ||

abdādigrahaparyaṃtā varṇasaṃkhyā satāṃ mude || 13 ||

[iti śrīmatsamastabhūmaṃḍalamaṃḍanāyamānānikhiladeśāvataṃsakarnāṭakajana(-)padādhiṣṭhānabhūta(-) śrīmanmahīśūramahāsaṃsthānamadhyadedīpyamānāvikalakalānidhikulakramāgata(-)rājakṣitipālapramukhanikhilanijarājādhirājamahārājacakravartimaṃḍalānubhūta(-)divyaratnasiṃhāsanārūḍhaśrīmadrājādhirājarājaparameśvaraprauḍhapratāpāprati(-)mavīranarapatibirudeṃteṃbaragaṃḍalokaikavīrayadukūlapayaḥ pārāvārakalānidhiśaṃkhacakrāṃkuśakuṭhāramakaramatsyaśarabhasālvagaṃḍa(-)bheruṃḍadharaṇīvarāhahanumadgaruḍakaṃṭhīravādyanekabirudāṃkitaśrīmanmahī(-)śūrapuravarādhīśaśrīkṛṣṇarājamahārājaviracite śrītattvanidhyākhyagraṃthe āgamādinirūpaṇaṃnāma aṣṭamonidhissaṃpūrṇaḥ] || 8 ||

[iti śrītattvanidhyākhyagranthe (-) aṣṭama āgamanidhissaṃpūrṇaḥ] || 8 ||




<p. 361>

śrīḥ |

atha

[śrītattvanidhau (-)

navamaḥ kautukanidhiḥ] |

athacchadākṣādinānākautukāvahakrīḍādayaḥ (-)

(1) tatrādau (-) cāmuṇḍeśvarīchadakrīḍāvivaraṇam (-) (cāmuṇḍeśvarīgaṃjīph)

cāmuṇḍāviṣṇurīśaśca brahmāgaṇapatistathā ||
senānīrvīrabhadraśca rāmakṛṣṇaumahāphaṇī || 1 ||

puraṃdarodinakaraḥ śailanāthaśca vāridhiḥ ||
manmathomohinī caiva kramāt ṣoḍaśadevatāḥ || 2 ||

ekasyādevatāyāstu pṛthagaṣṭā daśacchadāḥ ||
rājārājñīrathovājī padātirdhvaja eva ca || 3 ||

meṣādimīnaparyaṃtāstattaddevāṃkaśobhitāḥ ||
ataḥ paraṃ tu vijñeyāścakravartipadaṃgatāḥ || 4 ||

paṃcaviṃśatisaṃkhyākāḥ svataṃtrāḥ pṛṭhagīritāḥ ||
rājarājeśvarī cādau kālīlakṣmīḥ sarasvatī || 5 ||

brāhmīmāheśvarī caiva kaumārīvaiṣṇavī tathā ||
vārāhī ca tatheṃdrāṇī daṃḍinī maṃtriṇī tathā || 6 ||

yoganidrā ca bālā ca tathaiva bhuvaneśvarī ||
iṃdrākṣī cānnapūrṇā ca tathāṣaṭcakradevatāḥ || 7 ||

tatovāgīśvarī devī manmathasya priyāratiḥ ||
ādau cāmuṃḍikārpyāṇihaṃsapatrāṇi sapta vai || 8 ||

sarvaṃ militvā patrāṇi viṃśatiśca śatatrayam ||
tattadaṃkānusāreṇakhelanīyyāvicakṣaṇaiḥ || 9 ||

khaḍgaṃcakraṃ vṛṣohaṃ somūṣakothamayūrakaḥ ||
dakṣavakraṃ hanūmāṃśca vaṭacchadaśayastathā || 10 ||

nāgogajoraverbiṃbaṃsavṛkṣogirireva ca ||

<p. 362>

makarassyātpañcabāṇā hastasthaśśuka eva ca || 11 ||

cihnāni caṇḍikādīnāṃ lekhyāni svacchadeṣu vai ||
sauvarṇaiścātiraktaiśca pāṭalaiḥśśvaitavarṇakaiḥ || 12 ||

yuktoharidrājataśca gairikaścāmpakastathā ||
saindūrasthālathalyenayutoharita eva ca || 13 ||

kṛṣṇayuktaḥ hariccaivamindranīlastathaiva ca ||
vartirūpastathāgauroraktotyasitavarṇayuk || 14 ||

pītaḥkṛṣṇaścetivarṇāścāmuṇḍādeḥkramātsmṛtāḥ ||
ṣoḍaśānāṃ ca jātīnāṃ rājarājeśvarī kramāt || 15 ||

pañcaviṃśativarṇāgāṃ varṇassyāddhaiṅgulīyakaḥ ||
śukacchadānāṃvarṇastu raktojñeyovicakṣaṇaiḥ || 16 ||

atrasarvakrīḍanakecchadānāṃ pṛṣṭhato bhavet ||
sarveṣāmekarūpeṇa raktovarṇastu nānyathā || 17 ||

divārātrau ca rājñīsyāccāmuṇḍāsamprakīrtitā ||
cāmuṇḍāyāḥ krīḍanakepradhānācaṇḍikā smṛtā || 18 ||

krīḍācaturbhirbhavatinanyūnairnādhikairapi ||
ekaikapatrarītyā tu caturṇāṃ patrikā tadā || 19 ||

ekībhavati yā rāśissa eko bhāga ucyate ||
pṛthakcaturbhirgrāhyāḥ syurviṃśatiḥ kuśalaiḥ smṛtāḥ || 20 ||

parasparaṃ naiva kuryuḥ patrikāsampradarśanam ||
rājādimīnaparyantaṃ dūrbalaṃ hyuttarottaram || 21 ||

nayasya haste haṃsassyāddhaṃsogrāhyastu te navaiḥ ||
svīyapatreṣu yacchreṣṭhaṃ tatpradāyamanīṣiṇā || 22 ||

cāmuṇḍārthaṃ samarpyāṇi haṃsapatrāṇi cāditaḥ ||
dvitīye haṃsaparyāye caṇḍikābhāgapūrikā || 23 ||

sarvādau caṇḍikā deyā yasya haste sthitā bhavet ||
cāmuṇḍāyai samarpyāṇi haṃsapatrāṇi nānyathā || 24 ||

yenasaṃgṛhyatebhāgastamārabhyapravartate ||
krīḍātvādausvapatreṣu prabalaṃ tulyajātikam || 25 ||

deyaṃpatraṃkrameṇaiva tada bhāve tvatulyakam ||
yenapradīyate tatra prabalaṃ hyādadītasaḥ || 26 ||

bhāgaṃtāmatthaṃkramaśo mohinyāmīnapatrakam ||
yenānte krīḍane dattaṃ jayinaṃtaṃ vinirdiśet || 27 ||

anyeparājitāstenetyevaṃjñeyaṃ vicakṣaṇaiḥ ||
parityajyaviśeṣoktīragrimakrīḍaneṣuvai || 28 ||

sāmānyāṃśā evamevetyavadhāryaṃ na cānyathā ||
śrīcāmuṇḍākṛpālabdhalakṣmīvāṇīsamṛddhinā || 29 ||

<p. 363>

śakeśālīvāhanasya ḍaghaṭhendu miteśubhe ||
āṣāḍhe citrabhānostu śuklaikādaśake ravau || 30 ||

kṛṣṇarājamaheṃdreṇa cāmuṇḍāpeṭikākṛtā ||

(ṭīku) (-) yī cāmuṃḍeśvarīgaṃjīphige bājugalu (16) kke vaṭṭu yalegalu (320) kke (1) (-) cāmuṃḍeśvarībāju (1) kke (18) yalegalu citradabaṇṇa (2) (-) viṣṇubāju (1) kke(18) yalegalu yiṃgalīkadabaṇṇa (3) (-) īśvarabāju (1) kke (18) yalenalu jaṃgālubaṇṇa (4) (-) brahmabāju (1) kke (18) yalegalu pistābaṇṇa (5) (-) viśveśvarabāju (1) kke (18) yalegalu bellībaṇṇa (6) (-) ṣaṇmukhabāju (1) kke (18) yalegalu kāvībaṇṇaṃ (7) (-) vīrabhadrabāju (1) kke (18) yalegalu saṃpigebaṇṇa (8) (-) rāmabāju (1) kke (18) yalegalu candrabaṇṇa (9) (-) kṛṣṇabāju (1) kke (18) yalegala gulaḍābaṇṇa (10) (-) mahāśeṣabāju (1) kke (18) yalegalu kappupaccebaṇṇa (11) (-) iṃdrabāju (1) kke (18) yalegalu nilibaṇṇa (12) (-) sūryabāju (1) kke (18) yalegalu vartibaṇṇa (13) (-) parvatarājabāju (1) kke (18) yalegalu bilībaṇṇa (14) (-) samudrarājabāju (1) kke (18) yalegalu vūdābaṇṇa (15) (-) manmathabāju (1) kke (18) yalegalu haladībaṇṇa (16) (-) mohinībāju (1) kke (18) yalegalu kappubaṇṇa || īmere bājugala (16) kke yalegalu (288 ||

