<p. 367>

śerasi (29) cakravartigalannu māḍikkoṃḍu giṇiyaleyalli mohinīyu kūtukkoṃḍu ikṣucāpapuṣpaśaragaliṃda garuḍanannu bhedisuvaṃtebaradiruva yaleyaṃnu ākhairu hukumāgi yāru yiliyuttārayo avara āṭa geddaddu | mikkādavara āṭa khilāleṃbadāgi buddhivaṃtaru niṣakarṣeyannu māḍikkoṃḍāḍuvadu ||

(3) atha navīnadaśāvatāracchadakrīḍanam (-)

(navīnadaśāvatāragaṃjīph)

cāmuṇḍāmatsyakūrmo ca varāho nṛharirvaṭuḥ ||
rāmārāmaścarāmaśca kṛṣṇaḥ kalkī ca mohinī || 1 ||

ekasyādevatāyāstu pṛthagaṣṭādaśacchadāḥ ||
rājārājñīrathovājī padātirdhvaja eva ca || 2 ||

meṣādimīnaparyaṃtaṃ tattaddevāṃkaśobhitāḥ ||
ataḥparaṃ tu vijñeyāścakravartipadāṃkitāḥ || 3 ||

rājarājeśvarīcādau brahamāviṣṇumaheśvarāḥ ||
gajānanaśca senānīḥ sūryaścandrodigīśvarāḥ || 4 ||

kāmaḥ saptadaśaśreṣṭhāḥ svataṃtrāḥ pṛthagīritāḥ ||
devyāśchatrādidhāriṇyassaptapatreṣu ceṭikāḥ || 5 ||

sarvaṃmilitvā patrāṇi vyomavedāścisaṃkhyayā ||
tattadaṃkānusāreṇa khelanīyā vicakṣaṇaiḥ || 6 ||

catvāro vā trayovāsyuḥ krīḍakāstvatrakhelane ||
trayāṇāṃkrīḍane caivaṃ viśeṣojñāyatāmiyān || 7 ||

chadadvayaṃceṭikayorjñeyaṃ syāccakravartinoḥ ||
cakravarticchadāstena smṛtā ekoviṃśatiḥ || 8 ||

caṇḍikārthaṃ samarpyāssyuśceṭikāpatrikā imāḥ ||
ahardivaṃsyāccāmuṇḍārājñītasmādvicakṣaṇaiḥ || 9 ||

yaddhaste caṇḍikāpatraṃ krīḍārabhyā tu tena vai ||
mohinījātibhāgeṣvanti maṃmīnāṃkitaṃ chadama || 10 ||

krīḍānte krīḍate yastu sajayyanyeparājitāḥ ||
varṇāstveṣāṃ yathāpūrvaṃ kalpyāssyuratiyuktitaḥ || 11 ||

śiṣṭamanyadyathāpūrvaṃ cintanīyaṃ vicakṣaṇaiḥ ||
śrīcamuṇḍākṛpātrakṛṣṇarājamahībhujā || 12 ||

krīḍādaśāvatārākhyā racitāvardhatāṃciram ||

(ṭīku) (-) ī navīnadaśāvatāra gaṃjīphige bājugalu (12) kke dara (18) yalegala mere (216) yalegalu || cakravartiyalegalu (17 || upacārastrīyara yalegalalli yaraḍuyalegalaṃnu cakravartigalige śerisikkollabeku || (-) || janagalu (4) kke dara (60) llu (240) yalegalu |

<p. 368>

hagalurātrigaligu cāmuṇḍeśvariye dhoreyāddariṃda cāmuṇḍeśvaribhīrābaṃdavare modalāḍatakkaddu | ākhairu mohinībājuvinalli ākhairu mīnuyaleyaṃnu ākhairu yāruhukaṃ iliyuttāro avaru kaḍameyavaraṃnu khilālu māḍidahāge niṣkarṣeyannu māḍi āyā bājugalige raṃgumuṃtāgi bhunāsabu noḍi cāmuṇḍeśvarī gaṃjīph jaganmohanagaṃjīphinamere nātavāni nītavāni muṃtāgi buddhivaṃtaru noḍikkoṃḍāḍuvadu ||

(4) atha navagrahacchadakrīḍanam (-)

(navagrahagaṃjīph)

cāmuṇḍāviṣṇurīśaśca sūryādi navakaṃ tathā ||
ekaikasya tu devasya pṛthagaṣṭā daśacchadāḥ || 1 ||

rājārājñīrathovājī padātirdhvaja eva ca ||
meṣādimīnaparyaṃtaṃ pūrvasmāddurbalaṃ param || 2 ||

caṃdrahāsaścakraśūle grahāṇāṃ maṃḍalāni ca ||
etaccihnānusāreṇa khelanīyā vicakṣaṇaiḥ || 3 ||

svarṇavarṇotiraktaśca pāṭalaśca kusumbhakaḥ ||
rājatoraktavarṇaśca haritpītaśca rājataḥ || 4 ||

kṛṣṇonīlaḥ kṛṣṇavarṇo varṇā eṣāṃ kramāt smṛtāḥ ||
jātayaśca dvādaśaikajāteraṣṭādaśacchadāḥ || 5 ||

catvāro vā trayovāsyuḥ krīḍakāstvatranānyathā ||
jñeyaḥ krīḍākramaścaiva yathāpūrvamudīritaḥ || 6 ||

caṇḍikātvatrarājñīsyādrātrindivamitīritam ||
ketujātaumīnapatramante yena pradīyate || 7 ||

sajayī syāt pare tena jitā iti vinirṇayaḥ ||
śrīcāmuṇḍākṛpāpūrṇakṛṣṇarājamahībhujā || 8 ||

sarasānāṃvinodāyagṛhāṇāṃ peṭikākṛtā ||

(ṭīku) (-) navagraha gaṃjīphige bājugalu (12) kke dara (18) yalegalamere (216) yalegalannu janagalu (3) kke dara (72) yalegalamere janagalu (4) kke dara (54) yalegalamere haṃcikkoṃḍāḍuvadu || hagalu rātri saha cāmuṇḍeśvariye ghore || ākhairu ketubājuvinalli ākhairu bhīnuyaleyaṃnu ākhairu yāru āḍuttāro avaru kaḍame āṭagārarannu khilālu māḍidaṃte niścayisi kaḍame yāvattu cāmuṇḍeśvarī gaṃjīph āḍuvamere buddhivaṃtaru noḍikkoṃḍāḍuvadu ||

<p. 369>

(5) atha pañcapāṇḍavacchadakrīḍāvivaraṇam (-)

(pañcapāṇḍavagañjīph)

kṛṣṇa īśastathādharmaḥ vṛkodarakirīṭinau ||
nakulassahadevaśca kauravo bhīṣma eva ca || 1 ||

droṇaḥ karṇastathā śalya ete dvādaśanāyakāḥ ||
ekaikasya tu nāthasya parvasaṃkhyāyutacchadāḥ || 2 ||

nāyakastatsatī caiva śatāṃgasturago bhaṭaḥ ||
patākācaikamārabhya sūryasaṃkhyā vadhikramāt || 3 ||

cakraṃtriśūlaṃ ca sṛṇirgadācāpakaṭhārikāḥ ||
churikāmuṣṭibāṇau ca pāśasarpakaśāḥ kramāt || 4 ||

pāṇḍavānāṃ prabhuḥ kuṣṇa itareṣāṃ maheśvaraḥ ||
divākṛṣṇaṃ puraskṛtya rātrau tu parameśvaram || 5 ||

etaccihnānusāreṇa khelanīyā budhaissadā ||
atiraktaḥ pāṭalaśca śvetoraktastathaiva ca || 6 ||

pītohariccāruṇaśca kṛṣṇaḥ śvetaśca pītakaḥ ||
nīlaścitraṃ cetivarṇāśchadānāṃ saṃprakīrtitāḥ || 7 ||

caturbhirvātribhirvāpi krīḍeyaṃ saṃpravartate ||
viṣṇujātyantimaṃ patraṃ mohinyai yena dīyate || 8 ||

tena vai nirjitāstasmātsvayaṃ sa vijayī bhavet ||
śiṣṭaṃ sarvaṃ krīḍanādi caṇḍikāvatsmṛtaṃ budhaiḥ || 9 ||

śrīcāmuṇḍā kṛpāpūrṇa kṛṣṇarājamahībhujā ||
racitāvardhatāṃ nityaṃ mahābhārata peṭikā || 10 ||

(ṭīku) (-) yīpaṃcapāṃḍava gaṃjīphina āṭakke bājugalu (12) kke dara (18) yalegalamerige (216) yalegalaṃnu (3) janakke dara (72) yalegalamerige janagalu (4) kke dara (54) yalegalamerige haṃcikkoṃḍāḍuvalli hagalu āṭakke viṣṇuvaṃnu ghoreyannāgi rātri āṭakke īśvaranannu ghoreyannāgi māḍikkoṃḍu viṣṇubājuvinalli ākhairu cakramohinīyaleyannu ākhairu yāru āḍuttārayo avarukaḍame āṭagāra rannu khilālu māḍidaṃte niṣkarṣeyannu māḍikkoṃḍu kaḍame yāvattannu cāmuṇḍeśvarīgaṃjāph āḍuvamerige buddhivaṃtaru noḍikkoṃḍāduvadu ||

(6) atha devīdaśāvatāracchadakrīḍāvivaraṇam (-)

(devīdaśāvatāragañjīph)

cāmuṇḍā prathamājñeyā mahākālī daśānanā ||
mahālakṣmīstṛtīyā ca kamalāsanasaṃsthitā || 1 ||

mahāsarasvatīturyāvīṇāvādanatatparā ||
brāhmīmāheśvarī caiva kaumārī vaiṣṇavī tathā || 2 ||

<p. 370>

vārāhī ca tatheṃdrāṇī daśaitādevatāḥ smṛtāḥ ||
ekasyā devatā yāstu purāṇagaṇitacchadāḥ || 3 ||

mahārājñīyuvarājñīmaṃtriṇīdaṃḍinī tathā ||
pattidhvajaucakraśaṃkhau mṛgedraśca mataṃgajaḥ || 4 ||

vyāghrāśvau hariṇohaṃ somayūraśca bhujaṃgamaḥ ||
bakamatsyāvitiproktāḥ durbalāḥ parataḥ kramāt || 5 ||

svarṇoraktastathāpītoharitaḥ kṛṣṇa eva ca ||
siṃdūraśvetavarṇau ca caṃpakaḥ pāṭalastathā || 6 ||

dūrvādalaśyāmavarṇaśśilpibhiścitrakarmabhiḥ ||
tattadvarṇānusāreṇakhelanīyāvicakṣaṇaiḥ || 7 ||

sarvaṃ militvāpatrāṇi vyomadiksomasaṃkhyakāḥ ||
etaddevacchadāṃtaṃtu vakṣyantelakṣaṇāni vai || 8 ||

khaḍgodaśānanaṃ cābjaṃ vīṇāhaṃso vṛṣastathā ||
mayūrogaruḍaścaiva mahiṣogaja eva ca || 9 ||

jātayassyuḥ kīḍanakechadānāṃ daśa īritāḥ ||
krīḍakāśca bhavantyatra trayaścatvāra eva vā || 10 ||

ahardivañca cāmuṇḍārājñīsyādyasya hastagā ||
krīḍārambhastena kāryastvindrāṇyāścāntimacchadaḥ || 11 ||

mīnalakṣmādīyatente sajayyanye parājitāḥ ||
śeṣaṃ sarvaṃ caṇḍikāyāḥ krīḍāvaditi tadvidaḥ || 12 ||

śrīcāmuṇḍākṛpāpātra cāmarājābdhijanmanā ||
śrīkṛṣṇanṛpacandreṇaśaktikautukapeṭikā || 13 ||

jīyādviracitābhūmauyāvaccandrārkatārakam ||

(ṭīku) (-) yīdevīdaśāvatāra gajīphige bājugalu (10) kke dara yalegalu (18) galallu (180) yalegalu | janagalu (3) kke dara yalegalu (60) rallu janagalu (4) kke (45) ragalallu haṃcikkoṃḍu āḍuvadaralli hagalurātri āṭakku cāmuṇḍeśvariye ghore | ākhairu iṃdrāṇī bājubinalli ākhairu mīnuyaleyannu ākhairu yāru hukuṃ māḍuttāreyo avaru kaḍame āṭagārarannu khilālu māḍidaṃte niṣakarṣeyannumāḍikkoṃḍu kaḍame āṭagalannu cāmuṇḍeśvarī gaṃjīphinaṃte buddhivaṃtaru noḍikkoṃḍāḍuvadu ||

(7) atha dikpālacchadakrīḍāvivaraṇam (-)

(dikpālagañjīph)

cāmuṇḍendrāgniśamanā nir(-)ṛttiśca jaleśvaraḥ ||
pavanodhanadaśceśo mohinitidaśa kramāt || 1 ||

<p. 371>

ekasyā devatāyāstu kalāsaṃkhyā yutacchadāḥ ||
rājārājñī rathovājī padātirdhvaja eva ca || 2 ||

ekādyavasthāsaṃkhyāṃtaḥ pūrvasmāddurbalaḥ paraḥ ||
etāsāṃ devatānāṃ tu tattacihnaṃ pravakṣyate || 3 ||

siṃhomataṅgajomeṣomahiṣo mānuṣomṛgaḥ ||
sāraṃgāśvauvṛṣaśukaukramājjñeyābudhaiḥ sadā || 4 ||

sarvaṃ militvā patrāṇi ṣaṣṭyuttaraśataṃ matam ||
uktacihnānusāreṇa khelanīyā vicakṣaṇaiḥ || 5 ||

svarṇoraktastathāpītaḥ śvetapītaharittathā ||
atiraktaḥ pāṭalaśca pītovaivartikā tathā || 6 ||

rājataścetisaṃproktā varṇā eṣāṃ vicakṣaṇaiḥ ||
jāticihnānivakṣyante siṃhaśca kamalāsanaḥ || 7 ||

vīṇākamaṇḍuluścakraṃ triśūlaṃ dvimukhaṃ dvayoḥ ||
pārśvayoreka śiraso maṇḍaleravicandrayoḥ || 8 ||

bhavanti cātra krīḍāyā catvāraḥ pañcavājanāḥ ||
rātrindivaṃ caṇḍikaivarājñīsyāttasya khelanam || 9 ||

yaddhastagābhavedādaurājñītyevaṃvidurbudhāḥ ||
evaṃ vai mohinījāterantimaṃ śukapatrakam || 10 ||

ante vai krīḍyate yena sajayyanyeparājitāḥ ||
cāmuṇḍikākrīḍanavacchiṣṭaṃ jñeyaṃ vicakṣaṇaiḥ || 11 ||

śrīcāmuṇḍākṛpāpūrṇaḥ kṛṣṇarājadharādhipaḥ ||
caturāṇāṃ vinodāyacakredikpālapeṭikām || 12 ||

(ṭīku) (-) yīdikpāla gaṃjīphige bājugalu (10) kkebāju (1) kke yalegalu (16) llu (160) yalegalu | janagalu (4) kkedara (40) yalegalallu janagalu (5) kke dara (32) yalegala merigehaṃcikkoṃḍu hagalu rātrigu ḍāmuṇḍeśvariye ghoreyāddariṃda ḍāmuṇḍeśvarībaṃdavare modalu āḍuvaru ākhairu mohinī bājuvinalli ākhairu śukamohinī yaleyannu yāru ākhairu hukuṃ māḍuttārayo avaru kaḍame āṭadavarannu khilālu māḍidaṃte niṣkarṣeyannumāḍikkoṃḍu āḍuttā kaḍame āṭa yāvattannu cāmuṇḍeśvarīgaṃjiphinamerige buddhivaṃtaru noḍikkoṃḍāḍuvadu ||

(8) atha manoharacchadakrīḍāvivaraṇam (-)

(manoharagañjīph)

śrīcāmuṇḍāmaheśca rāmakṛṣṇaucaturmukhaḥ ||
hayagrīvaśca senānī mahendraśca rati priyaḥ || 1 ||

devatāratnasaṃkhyākāḥ kramaśaḥ parikītritāḥ ||
pṛthagekasyadevasya kalāsaṃkhyāmitacchadāḥ || 2 ||

rājārājñī tathā mātyaḥ senānīḥ sevakodhvajaḥ ||

<p. 372>

ekādidaśasaṃkhyāṃtaḥ pūrvasmāddurbalaḥ paraḥ || 3 ||

etāsāṃ devatānāṃ tu tattacihnaṃ pravakṣyate ||
siṃhovṛṣovānaraśca khagendrohaṃsaghoṭakau || 4 ||

mayūrakuñjaraśukāḥ jñātavyāḥ kramaśo budhaiḥ ||
rājarājeśvarīcādau śrīkaṃṭhaśśarabhastathā || 5 ||

dakṣiṇāmūrtirākhyāto vaṭapatraśayo hariḥ ||
vighneśastāṃḍavaścaiva divākaraniśākarau || 6 ||

navasaṃkhyāsamāyuktāḥ svatantrāścakravartinaḥ ||
ādaucāmuṇḍikārpyāṇi padmapatrāṇisapta vai || 7 ||

sarvaṃ militvāpatrāṇi ṣaṣṭyuttaraśatāni ca ||
uktakramānusāreṇa khelanīyā vicakṣaṇaiḥ || 8 ||

svarṇavarṇaḥ pāṭalaśca pītavarṇoti raktakaḥ ||
śvetayukto haridvarṇaḥ śvetogairikavarṇakaḥ || 9 ||

pāṭalaḥ pītavarṇaścetyevaṃ varṇāḥ prakīrtitāḥ ||
cakravarticchadānāṃ ca padmānāṃ svarṇavarṇakaḥ || 10 ||

padmapatraṃ yasya hastenāstigrāhyaṃ tu tena tat ||
svīyottamacchadaṃ dattvā caturbhiḥkhelanaṃ bhavet || 11 ||

cakravarticchadā ādau khelanīyāvicakṣaṇaiḥ ||
mārajāterantyapatraṃ śuka mohinikābhidham || 12 ||

antyesaṃkrīḍyate yena sajayyanye parājitāḥ ||
cāmuṇḍikā krīḍanavacchiṣṭaṃ jñeyaṃ vicakṣaṇaiḥ || 13 ||

śrīcāmuṇḍākṛpāpūrṇa kṛṣṇarājamahībhujā ||
kalpitā ca vinodāya śrīmanohara peṭikā || 14 ||

(ṭīkku) (-) yīmanohara gaṃjīphige bājugalu (9) dara bāju (1) kke yalegalu (16) llu (144) yalegalu | cakravartiyalegalu (9) | padmadayalegalu (7) | aṃtu (160) yalegalu | hagalu rātre āṭakku cāmuṇḍeśvariye ghoreyāddariṃda cāmuṇḍeśvarīhukumige koḍatakka padmadayaleyuyārige varade yirutteyo avaru baṃdiddavarige vūjannu koṭṭu tegadukkoṃḍu cāmuṇḍeśvarīge koḍatakkaddu | janagalu (4) kke dara (40) llu (160) yalegalu | cakravartigalu mohukttyāri hukumāddariṃda modalu iladukkolluvadu || yīgaṃjīphinalli ākhairu manmathabājuvinalli ākhairu śukamohinīyaleyaṃnu ākhairu yāru hukuṃ iliyuttāreyo avaru kaḍame āṭadavaraṃnukhilālu māḍidahāge tiliyatakkaddu || kaḍame āṭa yāvattannu cāmuṇḍeśvarī gaṃjīphinamerige buddhivaṃtaru niṣkarṣeyannu māḍikkoṃḍāḍuvadu ||

<p. 373>

(9) atha sarvamaṅgalāchadakrīḍāvivaraṇam (-)

(sarvamaṅgalāgañīph)

śrīcāmuṇḍāmaheśaśca śrīpatiścaturānanaḥ ||
puraṃdarodinakaroniśākararatipriyau || 1 ||

devatāścāṣṭasaṃkhyākāḥ kramaśaḥ parikīrtitāḥ ||
pṛthagekasyadevasya purāṇa gaṇitacchadāḥ || 2 ||

rājārājñītathāmātyaḥ senānīḥ sevakodhvajaḥ ||
meṣādimīnaparyaṃtaṃ tattadevāṃkaśobhitāḥ || 3 ||

itaḥ paraṃtu vijñeyāḥ pratyekaṃ devatā imāḥ ||
śrīkaṇṭhovighnarājaśca ṣaṇmukhovaṭapatragaḥ || 4 ||

tāṃḍavodakṣiṇāmūrtirmatsyādyādaśamūrtayaḥ ||
kalāsaṃkhyāsamāyuktāḥ svatantrāścakravartinaḥ || 5 ||

sarvaṃ militvā patrāṇi vyomāṃgaśaśisaṃkhyayā ||
siṃhastriśūlaṃ cakraṃ ca haṃsovajrāyudhaṃ tathā || 6 ||

aruṇohariṇaścaiti jātyaṅkānvaividurbudhāḥ ||
svarṇavarṇotiraktaśca pītaḥśveto harittathā || 7 ||

kṛṣṇaśca vartikāpāṭalaśca sindūra eva ca ||
cakravarticchadānāṃ vai svarṇavarṇaḥ prakīrtitaḥ || 8 ||

syātkrīḍeyaṃ caturbhirmārajāterantimacchadaḥ ||
mīnākhyokrīḍyate yena sajayyanye parājitāḥ || 9 ||

cāmuṇḍikākrīḍanavacchiṣṭaṃ jñeyaṃ vicakṣaṇaiḥ ||
śrīcāmuṇḍākṛpāpūrṇa kṛṣṇarājakṣamābhujā || 10 ||

racitāvardhatāṃ nityaṃ sarvamaṃgala peṭikā ||

(ṭīku) (-) yīsarvamaṃgalā gaṃjīphige bājugalu (18) kke dara (1) kke yalegalu (18) llu yalegalu (144) | cakravartigala yalegalu (16) | vaṭṭu yalegalu (160) kke (1) (-) cāmuṇḍeśvarī bāju (1) kke (18) yalegalu cinnadabaṇṇa (2) (-) īśvarabāju (1) kke (18) yalegalu īṃgalīkadabaṇṇa (3) (-) viṣṇubāju (1) kke (18) yalegalu haladībaṇṇa (4) (-) brahmabāju (1) kke (18) yalegala pistāpaccebaṇṇa (5) (-) iṃdrabāju (1) kke (18) yalegalu kappubaṇṇa (6) (-) sūryabāju (1) kke (18) yalegalu vartībaṇṇa (7) (-) candrabāju (1) kke (18) yalegalu jaṅgālubaṇṇa (8) (-) manmathabāju (1) kke (18) yalegalu candrabaṇṇa | yīmerige bājugalu (8) kke yalegalu (144 || cakravartigala yalegalu (16) bellibaṇṇa | yīmerige iruva yīgaṃjīphinalli janagalu (4) kke dara (1) kke yalegalu (40) llu haṃcikkoṃḍu ākhairu (8) ne manmathabājuvinalli ākhairu mīnuyaleyaṃnu ākhairu hukuṃ yāru yiliyuttārayo avaru yallara āṭavannu khilālu māḍidahāge niṣkarṣeyannu māḍikkoṃḍu kaḍame āṭa yāvattannu cāmuṇḍaiśvarī gaṃjīphinamerige buddhivaṃtaru noḍikkoṃḍāḍuvadu ||

<p. 374>

(10) atha navaratnacchadakrīḍāvivaraṇam (-)

(navaratnagañjīph)

mahācāmuṇḍikārājñī mahālakṣmīrdvitīyakā ||
mahāsarasvatī caiva vīṇāvādanatatparā || 1 ||

brahmāviṣṇumaheśāgni divākarāniśākarāḥ ||
trayaṃ trayaṃ trayaṃ ceti navaitā devatāssmṛtāḥ || 2 ||

ekasyādevatāyāstu kalāsaṃkhyāyutacchadāḥ ||
ādaurājā tatorājñī maṃtrīsenāpatistathā || 3 ||

pattirdhvajovatāṃrāṃkāḥ pūrvasmāddurbalaḥ paraḥ ||
pūrvaṃ proktāḥ chadāramyāḥ tattaddevāṃkaśobhitāḥ || 4 ||

ataḥparaṃ tu vijñeyāścakravarti padaṃ gatāḥ ||
rājarājeśvarīcādau daṃḍinīmaṃtriṇī tathā || 5 ||

brāhmīmāheśvarī caiva kaumārī vaiṣṇavī tathā ||
vārāhī ca tatheṃdrāṇī svataṃtrā navaśaktayaḥ || 6 ||

ādau cāmuṇḍikārpyāṇi siṃhapatrāṇi sapta vaiḥ ||
sarvaṃ militvā patrāṇāṃ ṣaṣṭyuttaraśataṃmatam || 7 ||

tattadaṃkānusāreṇa khelanīyāvicakṣaṇaiḥ ||
svarṇavarṇonīlapītaḥ vartivarṇaśca pītakaḥ || 8 ||

pāṭalaḥkṛṣṇavarṇaśca haridvarṇaśca campakaḥ ||
candravarṇa itiproktā navaratnasya vai nava || 9 ||

cakravarticchadānāṃ ca mṛgendrasyāpi rājataḥ ||
mahācāmuṇḍikārājñī deyāsyai siṃhapatrikā || 10 ||

yasya haste nāsti tena grāhyānyasmāttu pūrvavat ||
krīḍārabhyā yasya haste cāmuṇḍāpatrikā bhavet || 11 ||

iyaṃ krīḍā caturbhissyāccandrajātyantimacchadaḥ ||
yastusaṃkrīḍatente vaisajayyanye parājitāḥ || 12 ||

cāmuṇḍikākrīḍanavaccheṣṭaṃ jñeyaṃ vicakṣaṇaiḥ ||
śrīcāmuṇḍākṛpāpūrṇaḥ kṛṣṇarājamahīpatiḥ || 13 ||

caturāṇāṃ mude cakre navaratnākhyapeṭikām ||

(ṭīku) (-) śaktitraya mūrtitraya tejastrayātmakavāda yī navaratnagaṃjīphige bājugalu (9) kke dara yalegala (16) llu (144) yalegalu | cakravartiyalegalu (9) | siṃhadayalegalu (7) | vaṭṭu (160) yalegalu || idaralli (1) (-) cāmuṇḍeśvarī bāju (1) kke (16) yalegalu cinnadabaṇṇa (2) (-) mahālakṣmībāju (1) kke (16) yalegalu jaṃgālubaṇṇa (3) (-) mahāsarasvatī bāju (1) kke (16) yalegalu vartibaṇṇa (4) (-) brahmabāju (1) kke (16) yalegalu haladībaṇṇa (5) (-) viṣṇubāju (1) kke (16) yalaigalu iṃgalīkabaṇṇa (6) (-) īśvarabāju (1) kke (16) yalegalu kappubaṇṇa 

<p. 375>

(7) agnibāju (1) kke (16) yalegalu pistāpaccebaṇṇa (8) (-) sūryabāju (1) kke (16) yalegalu saṃpigebaṇṇa (9) (-) candrabāju (1) kke (16) yalegalu candrabaṇṇa || yīmerige bājugalu (9) | chūṭacakravartigala yalegalu (9) siṃhadayalegalu (7) saha belībaṇṇa | cāmuṇḍeśvarī mīrā baṃdavara āṭave modalāguvaddariṃda cāmuṇḍeśvarī hukamige koḍatakka siṃhada yaleyuyāra baliyalli irutteyo avarige būjannu koṭṭu siṃhada yaleyannu tegadukkoṃḍu cāmuṇḍeśvarī mīrākke koḍabeku || janagalu (4) kke (40) yalegalamerige haṃcikkoṃḍu ākhairu caṃdrabājuvinalli ākhairu kalkimohinīyaleyaṃnu ākhairu yāru hakuṃ iliyuttārayo abaru kaḍame āṭadabarannu khilālu māḍidahāge niśceyisi kaḍame āṭa yāvattannu cāmuṇḍeśvarīgaṃjīphinamerige buddhivaṃtarunoḍikkoṃḍāḍuvadu ||

(11) atha kṛṣṇarājacchadakrīḍāvivaraṇam (-)

(kṛṣṇarājapeṭ)

śrīkṛṣṇaḥ śaṃkarobrahmāmaheṃdraśca yathākramam ||
raktapītaharitkṛṣṇavarṇayuktā imematāḥ || 1 ||

ekaikasya tu varṇasya pṛthagaṣṭādaśacchadāḥ ||
rājārājñītathāmātyaḥ padātirdhvaja eva ca || 2 ||

sudarśanaṃ pāṃca janyogarutmānmārutātmajaḥ ||
bheruṇḍasālvaśarabhasiṃhamatte bhavājinaḥ || 3 ||

varāhomakaromatsyaḥ pūrvasmāddurbalaḥ paraḥ ||
jātayassyuścatasrotrakṛṣṇeśa brahmavajriṇām || 4 ||

catvāro vā trayo vā syuḥ krīḍakāścaturāmatāḥ ||
bhavedrātrindivaṃrājā kṛṣṇa eva yatastataḥ || 5 ||

kṛṣṇamūrtimatākrīḍārabdhavyādausuniścitam ||
kṛṣṇajātyantimaṃ patraṃ mīnadvayasulakṣitam || 6 ||

yenānte krīḍyate soyaṃ jayyanye vai parājitāḥ || (-) ||

athaibhirevakrīḍāsyācchadairanyāmanoharā || 1 ||

krīḍakairniyatānāṃ hi saṃkhyānāṃ paripūrikā ||
patrikāṇāṃ samākhyātāḥ saṃkhyāḥ krīḍanako vidaiḥ || 2 ||

rājñodvādaśaśarājñyāḥ syurdaśāmātyasyapañca vai ||
catasraśca padātessyurdhvajasyaikamitikramāt || 3 ||

rājārājñīcetyubhayaṃ vartaye yasya sannidhau ||
ekajātīyakaṃtasmai viṃśatirmukhyayostayoḥ || 4 ||

saṃkhyātāstānnimittāssyuḥ pañcāśatkhelanentime ||
saṃkhyā aṣṭādaśātrasyurjñeyāssaṅkhyā viśeṣataḥ || 5 ||

<p. 376>

saṅkhyālabhyāḥ krīḍaneṣṭāviṃśatiśca tathā śatam ||
evaṃ saṅkhyāyena labdhāsajayyanye parājitāḥ || 6 ||

kṛṣṇajātiḥ pradhānāsyāditijñeyaṃ vicakṣaṇaiḥ ||
rājādayodhvajāntāssyurekajāticchadā yadā || 7 ||

vaśeyasyajayīsasyādanye jñeyāḥ parājitāḥ ||
śrīmaccāmuṇḍikāpūrṇakaṭākṣaśubhalakṣitā || 8 ||

bhūyādbhūmaṇḍalekhyātā kṛṣṇarājākhya paṭṭikā ||

(ṭīku) (-) yī kṛṣṇarājapeṭige bājugalu (4) galige yalegalu (8) ragalallu (72) yalegalanu janagalu (3) kke (24) yalegalumerige janagalu (4) kke (18) yalegalamerige haṃcikkoṃḍāḍuvadaralli hagalu rātrigu kṛṣṇananne ghoreyaṃnu māḍikkoṃḍu kṛṣṇabāju vina ākhairuyugma mīnuyaleyannu yāru ākhairu huku māḍuttārayo avarukaḍame āṭadavaraṃnu khilālu māḍidahāge buddhivataru niṣkarṣeyannu māḍikkāḍādduvadu || (-) || varahāda āṭavannu āḍabekādare nūru ipatteṃṭu varahāgalannu gotta māḍikkoṃdu adaralli ghoregalu (4) ge (12) varahāgalallu (48) | rāṇigalu (10) llu (4) galige (40) | vajīragalu (4) ge (5) llu (20) | padātigalu (4) galige (4) llu (16) | patākegalu (4) galige (1) llu (4) | vaṭṭu nūrippatteṃṭu varahāgalu | turupujaṃṭī badare (50) | sādā jaṃṭī baṃdare jaṃṭī (1) kke (20) | kaipaṭṭu (18) varahāgalu | aṃtu (128) varahāgala | ghore ādiyāgi patākāṃtada vaṃde dinasu (4) yalegalu yārabalīli kūḍutto avaru geddavaru itararu sotavareṃdu niṣkarṣeyannu māḍikkoṃḍu sotavaru khilālu ādareṃdu tiladukkollabeku ||

(12) atha sadyojātādicchadakrīḍāvivaraṇam (-)

(sadyojātapeṭ)

cāmuṇḍā prathamājñeyā sadyojātādi paṃcakam ||
ekaikasya tu devasya māsasaṃkhyāyutacchadāḥ || 1 ||

rājārājñī tathā mudrāmaṃtrī patagaketane ||
vāhanaṃ cāyudhaṃchatraṃ rathohastī hayaḥ kramāt || 2 ||

svarṇahāritalākṣābhāḥ pītoraktastu kṛṣṇabhāḥ ||
etadvarṇānusāreṇakhelanīyā vicakṣaṇaiḥ || 3 ||

caturbhirvātribhirvāpi krīḍeyaṃ saṃpravarttate ||
sarveṣumukhyā cāmuṇḍā rātrindivamitismṛtā || 4 ||

kṛṣṇarājacchadakrīḍā vacchiṣṭā samprakīrtitā ||
śrīcāmuṇḍā dayāsāṃdra kṛṣṇarājendrakalpitā || 5 ||

ācaṃdratārakaṃ jīyāt sadyojātādi paṭṭikā ||

<p. 377>

(ṭīku) (-) yī sadyojātapeṭige bājugalu (6) galige yalegalu (12) llu yalegalu (72) | janagalu (3) kke yalegalu (24) llu janagalu (4) yalegalu (18) llu haṃcikkoṃḍāḍuvadu | hagalurātriya āṭakku cāmuṇḍeśvarīye ghoreyannāgi māḍikkoṃḍu kaḍame āṭa yāvattannu kṛṣṇarājapeṭannu āḍuvaṃte buddhivaṃtaru noḍikkoṃḍāḍuvadu ||

(13) atha navīnarāmacchadakrīḍāvivaraṇam (-)

(navyarāmapeṭ) (-)

rāmorāmānujaścaiva bharatolakṣmaṇānujaḥ ||
ekaikasya tu devasya ratnasaṃkhyā yutacchadāḥ || 1 ||

bāṇabāṇāsanacchatradivya cāmara cihnitāḥ ||
mudrārājārājapatnī bhṛtyaśceti catuṣṭayam || 2 ||

diṅnandavasuśailāṃgasaṃkhyācihnapariṣkṛtān ||
paṃcacchadānmelayitvā navakaṃ navakaṃ pṛthak || 3 ||

etaccihnānusāreṇa khelanīyā sadājanaiḥ ||
āṅglacchadānāṃ krīḍevakrīḍeyaṃ parikīrtitā || 4 ||

śrīcāmuṇḍākṛpāpūrṇakṛṣṇarājeṃdradhīmatā ||
kṛtālokopakārāyanavyā śrīrāma peṭikā || 5 ||

(ṭīku)  (-) ī hosarāmapeṭannu ispīṭ āḍuva merige yallā āṭagalaṃnu āḍabahudu | idaralli hagalu rātrige saha rāmadevare ghoreyannāgi niṣkarṣeyannu mādikkoṃḍāḍuvadu ||

(14) atha ṣoḍaśamukhāsanekṣakrīḍāprakāraḥ (-)

(16) mukhadapagaḍe āṭa)

kamalaṃ ṣoḍaśadalaṃ lekhyamādau sa karṇikam ||
ekaikasmindale lekhyā adha ūrdhvābhigāminaḥ || 1 ||

rekhāścatasrastiryak ca rekhā ṛjvyastathā nava ||
ekaikasmin koṣṭhakāni daletryaṣṭa krameṇa vai || 2 ||

yugadikpālāgni koṣṭhāni ṣoḍaśadaleṣu vai || 3 ||

madhya śreṇyāṃ dalasyādi koṣṭhaṃ varttulamālikhet ||
sarveṣvapiprakalpyaivaṃ tatraśārānvi nikṣipet || 4 ||

catuṣkrameṇa bhinnāṅkānkrīḍakāścātraṣoḍaśa ||
athavātrasyuraṣṭeti jñeyaṃ krīḍāvicakṣaṇaiḥ || 5 ||

khelanasya prakārastu prasiddhākṣavadīritaḥ ||
catuḥśārakrameṇakṣāvakṣyante kramaśodhunā || 6 ||

raktāḥ pītāśca haritāḥ kṛṣṇā vai raktapaṭṭikāḥ ||
pītapaṭṭāḥ kṛṣṇapaṭṭāstathāharitapaṭṭakāḥ || 7 ||

<p. 378>

madhyeraktāstathā pītā madhye haritapaṭṭakāḥ ||
ūrdhvādhaḥ śvetapaṭṭāssyureta evaṃ prakīrtitāḥ || 8 ||

ūrdhvādhoraktapaṭṭāssyurūrdhvādhaḥ pītapaṭṭakāḥ ||
ūrdhvādhaśca haritpaṭṭā ūrdhvādhaḥ kṛṣṇapaṭṭakāḥ || 9 ||

caturṣveṣu matāvarṇāḥ śvetāmadhya iti smṛtam ||
evaṃśārāścatuṣṣaṣṭiḥ krīḍakāṣṣoḍaśāṣṭavāḥ || 10 ||

akṣāvaṣṭāśrakaukāryau caturaṃgulamāyatau ||
ekaikasminpārśvabhāge saṅkhyā sūcaka lakṣaṇam || 11 ||

dalakrameṇatvekaikaṃ cakrākāraṃ sukoṣṭhakam ||
caturastatraśārānvaisaṃsthāpya krīḍanaṃ bhavet || 12 ||

koṣṭhadvayāntareṇasyuḥ koṣṭhānisumavanti ca ||
saṅkhyāvabodhanārthāni pārśveṣu syustuśārayoḥ || 13 ||

ekaṃtrīṇi ca catvāri ṣaḍaṣṭau daśavai tathā ||
dvādaśaivaṃ ṣoḍaśetisumasaṅkhyā dvayostathā || 14 ||

ṣoḍaśānāṃ khelane syācchāra ekaḥ prakīrtitaḥ || 15 ||

aṣṭānāṃ krīḍane tu dvauśārausyātāmitīritam ||
śālīvāhaśakasyābde gha ṅachendumite śubhe || 16 ||

kharavarṣe kṛṣṇapakṣe trayodaśyāṃ ravau śubhe ||
śrīcāmuṇḍākṛpāpūrṇa kṛṣṇarājamahībhujā || 17 ||

nirmitāṣoḍaśamukhākṣa krīḍāti manoharā ||

(ṭīku) (-) (16) mukhadapagaḍe āṭakke cārīkāyiḍālagala vivara (-) cārī (1) kke bīdigalu (3) | bīdigalu (1) kke manegalu (8) llu bīdugalu (3) kke manegalu (24) | cārīgalu (16) galige vaṭṭu manegalu (384 || īcārīge madhyadalli kamalavu idara suttalu (16) dalagalu | īvagalalli vaṃduvaṃdu guṃḍu mane | īmanegalalli nālkunālku kāyigalannu maḍagikkoṃḍāḍuvadu | īcārīge yaraḍuyaraḍumanegalanna viṭṭu vaṃduvaṃdu hubu iratakkaddu || īcārīge kāyigala lekha vaṭṭu (64) galige vivara (-) keṃpukāyigalu (4) haladī kāyigalu (4) | hasarukāyigalu (4) | kappukāyigalu (4) | keṃpupaṭṭhāpaṭṭikāyigala (4) | haladīdaṭṭāpaṭṭikāyigalu (4) | hasarupaṭṭāpaṭṭī kāyigalu (4) | kappupapaṭṭāpaṭṭikāyigalu (4) | madhye keṃpu mele kelage bilapu iruva kāyigalu (4) | madhye haladī mele kelage bilapu iruva kāyigala (4) | madhye hasaru mele kelage bilapu iruva kāyigalu (4) | madhye kappu mele kelage bilapu iruva kāyigalu (4) | mele kelage keṃpu madhye bilapu iruva kāyigalu (4) | mele kelage haladī madhye bilapu iruva kāyigalu (4) | mele kelage hasaru madhye bilapu iruva kāyigalu (4) | mele kelage kappu madhye vilapu iruva kāyigalu (4) |

<p. 379>

aṃtu kāyigalu (64) | īcārīge (8) paṭṭina ḍālagalalekha (-) ḍāla (2) kke ḍāla (1) kke paṭṭugala mele lekha paṭṭu (1) kke (1) | paṭṭu (1) kke (3) | paṭṭu (1) kke (4) | paṭṭu (1) kke (6) | paṭṭu (1) kke (8) | paṭṭu (1) kke (10) | paṭṭu (1) kke (12) | paṭṭu (1) kke (16) | ide bherige innoṃdu ḍāla | ī (2) ḍālagaliṃda joḍu dāya balitakka (-) duga ittiga yaṃṭu haṃneraḍu hadināru ippattu ippattanālku mūvatteraḍu | īmarige biluvaṃte gurutannu hāki koṃḍu (16) janagalu āḍabekādare vaṃṭi pagaḍe āṭavaṃnu āḍabahudu || yaṃṭu janagalu āḍabekādalli huyala dāya āḍabahudu | kaḍame āṭagalamaryāde kāyigalannu naḍasuvadu muṃtāgi viśiṣṭavu pūrvada akṣakrīḍeyaṃte buddhibaṃtaru niṣkarṣeyannu māḍikkoṃḍāḍuvadu ||

(15) athāṣṭamukhāsanekṣa krīḍāprakāraḥ (-)

(8) mukhadapagaḍe āṭa)

dalāṣṭakaṃ tu kamalaṃ likhedādau pṛthagdale ||
tisrovidhyastu ṛjavovīdhyāṃ koṣṭhāṣṭakaṃ caret || 1 ||

caturviṃśati koṣṭhāni tvekaikasmindale kramāt ||
syussaṃhatyadaleṣveṣu dvinavatyuttaraṃ śatam || 2 ||

madhye tu karṇikāproktā madhyavīdhyādikoṣṭhakam ||
vartulaṃ parikalpyātra catuśśārīṃ vinikṣipet || 3 ||

vibhinna lakṣaṇāñchārānsusaṃpādyasamārabhet ||
krīḍāṃraktāstathāpītāḥ kṛṣṇāharitavarṇakāḥ || 4 ||

ūrdhvādhaḥ pītavarṇāḥ syurūrdhvādhoraktavarṇakāḥ ||
ūrdhvādhoharitāścordhvamadhaścaivāsitāstathā || 5 ||

madhye catvāra etesyuśśvetāśśārā iti smṛtāḥ ||
akṣau dvau pūrvavatkalpyau viśeṣastatra kathyate || 6 ||

 sumaiṣṣoḍaśabhiryastu bhāgonissuma īritaḥ ||
etadbhāgasyacottānekrīḍānātrapravartate || 7 ||

krīḍitārassyuraṣṭau vā catvāro vāpi tadvidaḥ ||
krīḍā tu suprasiddhākṣakrīḍāvaditi niścayaḥ || 8 ||

śālīvāhaśakasyābde ghaṅachendumite śubhe ||
kharaphālgunaśuklasya hyekādaśyāṃbudhetviyam || 9 ||

śrīcāmuṇḍākṛpāpūrṇakṛṣṇarājamahībhujā ||
racitācāṣṭavaktrākṣakrīḍeyaṃ sumanoharā || 10 ||

(ṭīku) (-) (8) mukhada pagaḍe āṭakke cārīkāyiḍālagala vivara | cārī (1) kke bīdigalu (3) | bīdi (1) kke manegalu (8) llu bīdigalu (3) kke manegalu (24) | cārīgalu (8) kke vaṭṭu manegalu (192) |

<p. 380>

īcārīge madhyadalli kamalavu | idara suttalu (8) dalagalu | īvagalalli vaṃduvaṃdu gaṃḍumane | īmanegalalli nālkunālku kāyigalaṃnu maḍagikkoṃḍu āḍuvadu | īcārīge yaraḍuyeraḍu manegalaṃnu biṭṭu vaṃduvaṃdu huvu iratakkaddu | īcārīge kāyigalalakhkha (-) vaṭṭukāyigalu (32) galige vivara (-) haladī kāyigalu (4) | hasaru kāyibalu (4) | keṃpukāyigalu (4) | kappu kāyigalu (4) | mele kelage haladī madhye vilapu iruva kāyigalu (4) | mele kelage hasaru madhye bilapu iruva kāyigalu (4) | mele kelage keṃpu madhye bilapu iruva kāyigalu (4) | mele kelage kappu madhye bilapu iruva kāyigalu (4) | aṃtu kāyigalu (32) | īcārīge (8) paṭṭina ḍālagala lekha | ḍālagalu (2) galige ḍāla (1) kke paṭṭugala mele lekha (-) paṭṭu (1) kke (1) | paṭṭu (1) kke (3) | paṭṭu (1) kke (4) | paṭṭu (1) kke (6) | paṭṭu (1) kke (8) | paṭṭu (1) kke (10) | paṭṭu (1) kke (12) | khālī paṭṭu (1) || idemerige innoṃdu | īyaraḍu ḍālagaliṃda joḍu dāya vīlatakkaddu  duga (-) ittiga (-) yaṃṭu (-) hanneraḍu (-) hadināru (-) ippattu (-) ippattanālku | īmerige bīluvaṃte gurutannu hākikkoṃḍu (8) janagalu āḍabekādalli vaṃṭi pagaḍe āḍabahudu | (4) janagalu āḍabekādalli hu iludāya āḍabahudu | kaḍame āṭagala maryāde kāyigalannu naḍasuvadu muṃtāgi viśiṣṭavu pūrvada akṣakrīḍeyaṃte buddhivaṃtaru noḍikkoṃḍāḍuvadu ||

(16) atha ṣaṇmukhāsāsanekṣakrīḍāvivaraṇam (-)

(6) mukhadapaḍe āṭa

ṣaḍdalaṃkamalaṃkuryād dalekoṣṭhānipūrvavat ||
dalamūle tu catvāri koṣṭhāniparikalpayet || 1 ||

madhyavīdhyāścakrakoṣṭhe ṣaṭṣaṭśārāntsajātikān ||
saṃsthāpyārambhaṇaṃ kuryāt krīḍāyā iti nirṇayaḥ || 2 ||

śārāṣṣaṭtriṃśadākhyātāḥ pṛthagvarṇā anukramāt ||
ṣaṭṣaṭśārā ekavarṇājñeyāḥ krīḍanakovidaiḥ || 3 ||

pītāśca haritāraktāḥ kṛṣṇāśśvetāśca pāṭalāḥ ||
ṣaṭkoṇākṣau tu vijñeyau daśāntaṃ sumakalpanam || 4 ||

ekāditotravijñeyaṃ krīḍakāṣṣaṭtrayopi vā ||
khelanaṃ syāt prasiddhākṣa krīḍāvaditi niścayaḥ || 5 ||

śālivāhaśakasyābde ghaṅachendumitekhare ||
phālgunasya siteśukre paurṇamāsyāmidaṃ kṛtam || 6 ||

śrīcāmuṇḍākṛpāpūṇa kṛṣṇarājamahībhujā ||
caturāṇāṃ hitārthāya ṣaṇmukhākṣasukhelanam || 7 ||

<p. 381>

(ṭīku) (-) ī ṣaṇmukhada pagaḍe āṭada cārī kāyi ḍālagala vivara (-) cārī (1) kke bīdigalu (1) kke manegalu (8) llu vīdigalu (3) kke manegalu (24) llu cārī (6) kke vaṭṭu manegalu (144) | īcārīge madhyadalli kamala | idara suttalu ārudalagalu | ivagalalli vaṃduvaṃdu guṃḍu mane  īmanegalalli āru āru kāyigalannu maḍigikkoṃḍu āḍuvadu | īcārīge yaraḍuyaraḍu manegalannu biṭṭu vaṃduvaṃdu havu iratakkaddu | īcārīge kāyigala lekha (-) vaṭṭu (-) kāyigalu (36) kke vivara (-) haladīkāyigalu (6) | hasarukāyigalu (6) | keṃpukāyigalu (6) | karīkāyigalu (6) | bilī kāyigalu (6) | gulābīraṃgina kāyigalu (6) | aṃtu kāyigalu (36) | īcārīge (6) paṭṭina ḍālagala lekha ḍālagalu (2) kke ḍāla (1) kke paṭṭu (1) kke (1) | paṭṭu (1) kke (3) | paṭṭu (1) kke (4) | paṭṭu (1) kke (6) | paṭṭu (1) kke (8) | paṭṭu (1) kke (10) | yidemerige yinnoṃdu ḍāla | īyaraḍuḍālagāliṃda joḍu dāya balitakkadu (-) duga (-) yittiga (-) yaṃṭu (-) hanneraḍu (-) hadināru (-) īppattu | yīmerige bīluvaṃte gurutugalannu hākikkoṃḍu (6) janagalu ādabekādalli vaṃṭi pagaḍeya āṭavannu āḍabahudu | (3) janagalu āḍabekādalli huyilu dāya āḍabahudu | kaḍame āṭagala maryāde yāvattannu pūrvada akṣakrīḍeyaṃte buddhivaṃtaru nauḍikkoṃḍāḍuvadu ||

(17) atha burajākhyakoṣṭhaviśeṣavadakṣakrīḍāvivaraṇam (-)

(burajupagaḍe āṭa)

caurdalaṃlikhetpadmamaṣṭāviṃśatikoṣṭhakam ||
pṛthagdale likhet tatra vīdhyastisrobhavanti hi || 1 ||

madhyavīdhyā tu koṣṭhāni daśapārśve nava kramāt ||
caturdalānāṃ koṣṭhāni dvādaśottarakaṃśatam || 2 ||

dalamūle tu catvāri vṛttakoṣṭhāni kalpayet ||
caturbhiḥ krīḍakaiḥ pañca sthāpyāśśārāssvakāstviha || 3 ||

dalāntare pṛthakkāryaṃ sundaraṃ koṣṭhapañcakam ||
burajākhyaṃ dalaṃ hyevaṃ catuṣkaṃ syād dalāntare || 4 ||

caturṇāṃburajākhyānāṃ koṣṭhānyāsaṃśca viṃśatiḥ ||
saṃhṛtyasarvakoṣṭhāni dvātriṃśadadhikaṃ śatam || 5 ||

burajākhyaṃ vṛttakoṣṭhaṃ gaṇanāyāṃ na vidyate ||
ramyāñchukānvṛttakoṣṭhe caturovilikhet kramāt || 6 ||

ārabhyaburajusthānādyugmaṃ bhavati nānyathā ||
anyatrayugmaṃ na bhaved burajorityadīritam || 7 ||

gatvābhavet tu burujāntaraṃ yugmaṃtadeva vā ||
trikoṣṭhīmantarekṛtvā koṣṭhe kuryāt sumaṃśubham || 8 ||

śāraviṃśatikaṃ rakta kṛṣṇapītapalāśi ca ||
kramājjñeyamathākṣau dvauṣaḍaśrau parikalpayet || 9 ||

tatrādimekṣe kramaśaḥ ṣaḍaśreṣusumānihi ||
dvecatvāriṣaḍaṣṭau ca tato daśa tato'sumam || 10 ||

antyekṣe dvādaśatathā ṣoḍaśāṣṭā daśasphuṭam ||
viṃśatiśca caturviṃśatiśca niṣkusumaṃ bhavet || 11 ||

nissumenadyvaṅkacihnastvakṣa uttānago yadā ||
tasya vakṣyephalaṃtvagrenāmānyevaṃ vicintayet || 12 ||

catussumonissumenayugamityabhidhīyate ||
ṣaṭsumonissumenasyādrasa ityabhidhiyate || 13 ||

aṣṭasaṅkhyonissumena hyuttānovarga ucyate||
daśasaṅkhyonissumenadikchabdenābhidhīyate || 14 ||

dvādaśāṃkonissumenabhānurityabhidhīyate ||
ṣoḍaśāṅkonissmumenakalāśabdenagīyate || 15 ||

nissumenāṣṭādaśāṅko smṛtirityabhidhīyate ||
viṃśatyaṅkonissumena hyuttānaḥkṛtirucyate || 16 ||

caturviṃśatisaṅkhyākonissumenaghano bhavet ||
nissumonissumenottānaścetyūjya itīryate || 17 ||

pūjyāvakṣau yadā syātāṃ śāronaiva calediha ||
sasaṅkhyākṣauyadottānau bhavetāṃnissumaṃvinā || 18 ||

tadānuyugmaṃ calatinaikaśśāraścalediha ||
śiṣṭākrīḍāprasiddhākṣakrīḍevakathitā budhaiḥ || 19 ||

śālīvāhanaśakasyābde mamathendumite śubhe ||
nandanāṣāḍhaśuklasya tvekādaśyāṃ raverdine || 20 ||

śrīcāmuṇḍākṛpāpūrṇa kṛṣṇarājamahīpatiḥ ||
burajvakṣakrīḍanasya prakāraṃ vyavṛṇotsvayam || 21 ||

(ṭīku) (-) burajina pagaḍe āṭake cārī kāyi ḍālagala vivaracārī (1) kke bīdigalu (3) | bīdi (1) kke madhyada bīdi manegalu (10) | bāju bīdigalu (2) kka manegalu (9) rallu (18) | vaṭṭu bīdigalu (3) kke cārī (1) kke manegalu (28) llu cārīgalu (4) kke vaṭṭu manegalu (112) | cārīge madhyadalli kamalavu | sūttalū nālku guṃḍumane | nālku cārīge saṃdīvalagaḍe nālku buruju | buruju (1) kke manegalu (5) rallu buruju (4) kke manegalu (20) | aṃtu manegalu (132) | burujinavalage guṃḍu mane (1) lekhakke yilladdu |

<p. 383>

idaralli vṃduvaṃdu giṇī varayabeku | īcārīge kamalada suttalu īruva guṃdumaneyalli ayidu kāyigalannu maḍigikkoṃḍu āḍuvadu || ī āṭakke burujugalalliye joḍiyannukaṭṭatakkaḍdu | madhye joḍī kaṭṭuvadakke āgadu | madhye joḍīyannu viccidalli tirigī burujinalliye joḍīyannu kaṭṭabeku | īcārīge mūrumūru manegalannu biṭṭu vaṃduvaṃdu hūvu yiratakkaddu | īcārīge kāyigala lekha | vaṭṭu kāyigalu (20) galige vivara (-) cārī (1) kke kāyigalu (5) rallu haladīkāyigalu (5) | hasarukāyigalu (5) | keṃpukāyigalu (5) | kappukāyigalu (5) | dinasu (1) kke (5) kāyigalamerege bhedaviruvaṃte kāyigalannu māḍisatakkaddu | īcārīge (2) ḍālagalu (-) āru paṭṭina bājugalannullaḍālagala paṭṭagala mele lekha (-) paṭṭu (1) kke (2) | paṭṭu (1) kke (4) | paṭṭu (1) kke (6) | paṭṭu (1) kke (8) | paṭṭu (1) kke (10) |  khālī paṭṭu (1)  | ḍāla (1) kke paṭṭu (1) kke (12) | paṭṭu (1) kkeṃ (16) | paṭṭu (1) kke (18) | paṭṭu (1) kke (20) | paṭṭu (1) kke (24) | khālīpaṭṭu (1) | īyaraḍu ḍālagaliṃda joḍu dāya bīlatakkaddu | khālī paṭṭu (1) | yaraḍu lekha iruba paṭṭu saha biddare phalayeṃba heṃsaru | khālī paṭṭu (1) nālku lekha viruva paṭṭu (1) saha biddare yugaveṃbahesaru | khālī paṭṭu (1) ārū lekhabiruva paṭṭu saha biddare rasaviṃbahesaru | khālīpaṭṭu (1) yaṃṭu lekhaviruva paṭṭu saha biddare vargaveṃbahesaru | khālī paṭṭu (1) hattulekhaviruva paṭṭu saha biddare dikkuyeṃbahesaru | khālīpaṭṭu (1) hanneraḍulekhaviruva paṭṭu saha biddare bhānuveṃbahesaru | khālī paṭṭu (1) hadinārulekhaviruva paṭṭu saha biddare kaleyaṃbahesaru | khālī paṭṭu (1) hadineṃṭulekhaviruva paṭṭu saha biddare smṛtiyeṃbahesaru | khālī paṭṭu (1) ippattulekhaviruvapaṭṭu saha biddare kṛtiyeṃbahesaru | khālī paṭṭu (1) ippattulekhaviruva paṭṭu (1) saha biddare ghanaveṃbahesaru | yaraḍu ḍālagalalliyu khālī paṭṭu biddare pūjyaveṃbahesaru | kāyinaḍeyuvadakke(-)illa | yaraḍulekhadapaṭṭu biddalli jauḍudāyavalla | vaṃṭikāyi naḍaśikkollasakkaddu | kaḍame āṭada kramayāvattannupūrvada akṣakrīḍeyaṃte buddhivaṃtaru noḍikkoṃḍāḍuvadu ||

(18) atha navagrahākṣakrīḍāvivaraṇam (-)

(navagrahadapagaḍe(-)āṭa)

kamalaṃdvādaśadalaṃ karṇikāpariśobhitam ||
likhetpratidalaṃramyaṃ koṣṭhadvādaśakaṃ kramāt || 1 ||

meṣādimīnaparyantaṃ daladvādaśakaṃ smṛtam ||
dvādaśāṃśaṃ rāśicakramidamityanumanyatām || 2 ||

yadā bhaved dalekoṣṭhanavakaṃ triṃśadevavā ||
koṣṭhānitānijānīyānnavāṃśaistriṃśadaṃśakaiḥ || 3 ||

saṃyuktaṃ rāśicakraṃ tat kalpyaṃ ramyaṃ yathoktavat ||
navagrahāssvākṛtayaśśārāssyussumanoharāḥ || 4 ||

raktaḥkiñcidraktayutaḥ śvetaḥ śvetasthalābjavat ||
śvetaraktaśca haritaḥpītaḥśveto'sitastathā || 5 ||

dhūmracitrau ca varṇāssyūravyādīnāṃ kramādiha ||
ravyādīnāṃ ca saptānāṃ gatissavyena vai smṛtā || 6 ||

apasavyārāhuketvorgatirityavadhāryatām ||
aticāragatirvakrāstambhaścaivamṛjurmatā || 7 ||

krīḍāyāṃgatirevaṃsyāditikrīḍāvidoviduḥ ||
akṣaudvaucaturaśrau syātāṃ vā pārśvacatuṣṭaye || 8 ||

sumānyekaṃtrīṇicatvāriśūnyaṃ ca yathākramāt ||
ekasminnevamanyasmindve ca trīṇi ca pañca ca || 9 ||

sumānissyustathāpārśvamekaṃvikusumaṃ smṛtam ||
yadaikasaṅkhyaścottānastadāsiṃhādimāṃśake || 10 ||

raviṃsaṃsthāpayedevaṃ dvisaṃṅkhyaḥ kaṭakādime ||
vidhuṃtrisaṅkhyaścottānaḥkujaṃmeṣādimenyaset || 11 ||

tathottānaścatussaṅkhyobudhaṃkanyādimenyaset ||
tathottānaḥpañcasaṅkhyoguruṃminādimenyaset || 12 ||

akṣoyadāṣaḍuttāno nyasecchukraṃ tulādime ||
saptasaṅkhyoyadottānomakarādauśaniṃnyaset || 13 ||

aṣṭasaṅkhyoyadottānonyasedrāhuṃvṛṣādime ||
navasaṅkhyoyadottānaḥ syāt keturvṛścikādime || 14 ||

ekaikasmindalevakrā ṛjvīcāpigatirbhavet ||
ekādidvādaśāntāsyādṛjvīvakrāparā smṛtā || 15 ||

ekāntādvādaśādissyādgatiḥkhelanakovidaiḥ ||
sthāpanaṃhananaṃ caiva lokasiddhākṣavat smṛtam || 16 ||

śūnyapārśvau yadottānāvakṣausyātāṃ tadāgatiḥ ||
śārāṇāṃnobhavetkintu stambhaḥsyāditi tadvidaḥ || 17 ||

śālivāhaśakasyābde mamathendumite śubhe ||
nandanenabhasaḥ kṛṣṇe tvaṣṭamyāṃ ravivāsare || 18 ||

śrīcāmuṇḍākṛpāpūrṇa kṛṣṇarājamahībhṛtā ||
navagrahākṣakrīḍāyāḥ prakāroyaṃ prakāśitaḥ || 19 ||

<p. 385>

(ṭīku) (-) navagrahada pagaḍe āṭakke kāyidālagala vivara (-) cārī (1) kke madhye guṃḍu adara suttalu (12) guṃḍugalu | āguṃḍugalalli hanneraḍu rāśigalu | adara suttalu (12) dalagalu | dala (1) kke (12) manegala merige voṭṭu manegalu (144) | idu dvādaśāṃśagalakramavu | dala (1) kke (9) manegalamerige cārīyannu māḍikkoṃḍalī navāṃśa kramavu | dala (1) kke mūvatta manegalamerige nirmiśidalli triṃśāṃśakramavu | idakke kāyigalu navagrahagala ākāravāgi (9) iruvavu | varṇagalavivara (-) sūrya keṃpu | candra biligulāvi | aṃgārakabilīkeṃpu | budha hasaru | bṛhaspati haladī | śukra bilapu | śani kappu | rāhu dhūmra | ketu citravarṇa | īmerige raṃgannu hākikkoṃḍāḍuvadu | hyāgeṇdare (-) ravyādi saptagrahagalu savyagatiyiṃda neḍayuvaru | rāhuketugalu apasavyavāgi naḍeyuvaru | aticāra (-) vakra staṃbha ṛjugatigalu modalāgi jyotiśśāstrarītyā yalā(-)āṭagalannu āḍabahudu || (-) || īkāyigalannu neḍuvadara krama (-) ḍāladalli (1) saṃkhyeya dāyavi biddalli sūyanannu siṃha rāśiyalli neḍuvadu || 2) biddalli candranannu karkaṭakarāśiyalli neḍuvadu || 3) biddalli aṃgārakanannu meṣarāśiyalli neḍuvadu || 4) biddalli budhanannu kanyārāśiyalli neḍuvadu || 5) biddalli vṛhaspatiyannu mīnarāśiyalli neḍuvadu || 6) biddalli śukranannu tulārāśiyalli nevaḍudu || 7) biddalli śaniyannu makararāśiyalli neḍuvadu || 8) biddalī rāhuvinarāśiyāda vṛbhaṣarāśiyalli avanannu nevaḍudu || 9) saṃkhyebiddalli ketuvannu avanige tuṃgarāśiyāda vṛścikarāśiyalli neḍuvadu || yīmerige yāvayāva grahagalannu yāruyāru tegadukkoṃḍu āḍuttāro āyāyagrahakkesariyāgi āyāya saṃkhyegalu viddāga neṭṭukkolluvadu ṛjugatiyiṃdalādaru vakragatiyiṃdalādaru kāyigalannu hoḍadalli punaśca neḍabekādare modalusaṃketada prakāra ḍāladalli dāya biddāga neṭṭukkolluvadu || (-) || ī(-)āṭakke (4) paṭṭina ḍāla (2) kke vivara (-) ḍāla (1) kke (2) (-) (3-) (5) (-) khālī paṭṭu (1) | mattoṃdu ḍāla (1) kke (1) (-) (3) (-) (4) (-) khālī paṭṭu (1) | yīmerige ḍālagalannu māḍikkoṃdu dāyagalu biddabherige kāyigalannu neṭṭabaliyiṃda muṃdakke naḍasuvadu | ḍālagala khālī paṭṭu yaraḍu vaṃde sāri biddare (staṃbha) gatiyilla | yīmerige ī(-)āṭavannu niṣkarṣemāḍikkoṃdu buddhivaṃtaru noḍikkoṃḍāḍuvadu ||

(19) atha bhūcakrāsanekṣakrīḍāvivaraṇam (-)

(bhūcakradapagaḍe-āṭa)

cakrākārālikhedrekhāṣṣaṭprākāraṃ yathātathā ||
tatrādimassyātprākāraścatuṣṣaṣṭi gṛhānvitaḥ || 1 ||

dvitīyastvaṣṭacatvāriṃśatkoṣṭhaissaṃyutobhavet ||
catvāriṃśatkoṣṭhakaistu tṛtīyassaṃyutobhavet || 2 ||

<p. 386>

ṣaṭtriṃśatkoṣṭhakayutaḥ prākārassyāccaturthakaḥ ||
dvātriṃśatkoṣṭhasaṃyuktaḥ prakārassyāt tu pañcamaḥ || 3 ||

tadantare syāt prākārastvaṣṭāviṃśatikoṣṭhakaḥ ||
tadantare syāt prākāraścaturviṃśatikoṣṭhakaḥ || 4 ||

tadantare syāt prākārarūpeṇasarasāṃtatiḥ ||
aṣṭāviṃśatisaṅkhyānāṃ madhye tasyāstyanuttamam || 5 ||

sāyujyasthānamatrāsti madhyeliṅgaṃ pinākinaḥ ||
prākārātprathamādvāhye prākpratyagdakṣiṇottare || 6 ||

ṣaṭṣaṭkoṣṭhānikurvīrañchārāṇāṃsthāpanāyavai ||
yataḥkrīḍāpravarteta catvāraḥkrīḍakāssmṛtāḥ || 7 ||

caturviṃśatiśārāṇāmasitaḥpītalohitau ||
haritassyāttathākṣāśca catvāraścaturaśrakāḥ || 8 ||

trīṇyekamaṣṭaṣaṭcetisumānikramaśolikhet ||
tathānyecaturakṣāssyuścaturaśrāḥprakīrtitāḥ || 9 ||

trīṇyekaṃ saptaṣaṭcaiva sumānikramaśo likhet ||
svasthānācchārakānramyānakṣapuṣpakrameṇa vai || 10 ||

cārayitvā ca sāyujye suptāṁlliṅge hi kurvate ||
phalatomuktimāpannā itikrīḍāsukovidāḥ || 11 ||

cakrākāreṇagamanaṃ śārāṇāmititadvidaḥ ||
śakeśālīvāhanasya ṣaṣṭyuttaramunīnduke || 12 ||

vilaṃbyāṣāḍhaśuklasya tvekādaśyāṃ kujeśubhe ||
śrīcāmuṇḍākṛpāpūṇa cāmarājatanubhavā || 13 ||

kṛṣṇabhūpenabhūcakrākṣakrīḍākalitāparā ||

(ṭīku) (-) bhūcakradapagaḍe āṭakke cārī kāyigalu ḍālagala vivara (-) ībhūcakradapagaḍe āṭakke cakrākrāravāgi cārīyannu māḍikkoṃḍu adaralli horaginiṃda (5) sāluguṃḍagalalli caukada manegalu modalane sālige (64) | (2) nesālige (48) manegalu | (3) ne sālige (40) manegalu | (4) ne sālige (36) manegalu | (5) ne sālige (32) manegalu || (-) || īmerige manegalannu māḍi alliṃda valage (1) sālu guṃḍumanegalannu (29) māḍi alliṃda volage koṭeyannu baradu ākoṭeya sālinalli (24) manegalannu māḍi alliṃda volage koladaṃte (1) sālu baradu adaralli (28) manegalannu baradu adakkiṃta volage doḍḍadāgiruva sāyujyada sthānavāda (1) maneyalli śivaliṃgavaṃ barayuvadu | īcārīge (4) dikkugalalliyu vaṃduvaṃdu manegala sālu horasūttugalu (5) rallu cārīyaṃte guṃḍumanegalannu māḍikkoṃḍu hora suttina horage (6) manegalannu baradukkoṃḍu āru kāyigalannu neṭṭukkolluvaṃte māḍuvadu || (-) ||

<p. 387>

īmerige kāyigalannu neḍuva manegalu liṃgavannu varadiruva sāyujya sthānada (1) mane saha (325) manegalu āguvaddariṃda hasaru kāyannu neḍuva manecarige (6) ne suttinalliruva guṃḍumaneyalli brāhmaṇajanma || haladīkāyannu neḍuva manecārīge (6) ne suttina guṃḍumaneyalli kṣatriyajanma || keṃpu kāyannu neḍuva manecārīge (6) ne suttina guṃḍumaneyalli vaiśyajanma || kappukāyannu neḍuva manecārīge (6) ne suttina guṃḍu maneyalli śūdrajanma || īmerige gurutannu māḍikkoṃḍu idara valagina koṭeya ākāravāgiruva sālinalli madhyemadhye vaṃdavaṃdu maneyalli āyāya dikkugalannanusariśi dikpālakaru yaṃṭumaṃdiyannu baradukkoṃḍu āḍuvadu ||

