(20) śrīcakrākṣadalāsanekṣakrīḍāvivaraṇam (-)

(kalaśākṛtivṛndāvanavannumele ullaśrīcakradapagaḍe(-)āṭa)

śrīcakrākṣakrīḍanārthaṃ brūvetaccakralekhanam ||
tatropariṣṭādvīdhyastunavakalpyāmanoharāḥ || 1 ||

vṛndāvanākāratosmādadhodaśadalaṃ likhet ||
kamalaṃ śrīcakramiti paṇḍitairatrakīrtitam || 2 ||

saṃtikoṣṭhāniṣaḍaśītyuttaradviśataṃ yathā ||
bṛndāvanantu kalaśā kṛtyāyatnena saṃlikhet || 3 ||

vīdhyodaśasyuruparitadadhaḥ kamalaṃ bhavet ||
ūrdhvaṃ daśamavīdhyāṃsyānmahatkoṣṭha tu madhyame || 4 ||

<p. 388>

śrīcāmuṇḍātatralekhyā yatrasāyujyamiṣyate ||
tadadhovilikhetṣaṭ ca vīdhyaḥ koṣṭhaiḥ susaṃyutāḥ || 5 ||

vīdhyāṃvīdhyāṃ hi koṣṭhāni trayodaśalikhet kramāt ||
tadadhastanavīdhyoḥ koṣṭhānipañcadaśa kramāt || 6 ||

pṛthakpṛthagitiprāhurekaikasyāṃ tatopyadhaḥ ||
koṣṭhānisaptadaśavaivilikhetkhelane paṭuḥ || 7 ||

vilikhyādhastanābjasya dalānāṃ madhyame dale ||
ekaviṃśatikoṣṭhāni likhitvāpārśvayoḥ pṛthak || 8 ||

dalayoḥkurukoṣṭhāni dvādaśadvādaśātratu ||
śārādvādaśasaṃsthāpyāḥ ṣaṭṣaṭvarṇa krameṇa tu || 9 ||

ṣaṭkṛṣṇāṣṣaṭcaraktāssyuḥ pītāṣṣaḍḍharitāstathā ||
caturviṃśatiśārāṃstāndalayoḥ pārśvayoḥ kṣipet || 10 ||

madhyenasahaśiṣṭeṣudaleṣvaṣṭasusaṃlikhet ||
saṃhṛtyaṣaḍaśītyuttaraśatadvayakoṣṭhakam || 11 ||

bhavatyeṣāṃ tu koṣṭhānāṃ jāti dvayamudīritam ||
kāryakāraṇabhedenabhinnacihnaṃ manoharam || 12 ||

kāryakoṣṭhāni caikottara śataṃkāraṇasya ca ||
koṣṭhānyekottaraśataṃ śārasthāpana hetave || 13 ||

caturviṃśati koṣṭhāni viśrāntyaikoṣṭhakāni ca ||
ekonapaṃcāśaccasyuḥ sāyujyāyaikamuttamam || 14 ||

sthāpitasthānamārabhyadalānyevaṃtadantare ||
sarvakoṣṭheṣu saṃcāryabṛndāvanasamākṛtau || 15 ||

sarpagatyātatraśārānkoṣṭhe tu kramaśassudhīḥ ||
sāyujyaṃ prāpaye danta itikrīḍāvidoviduḥ || 16 ||

catvārokṣābhavantyatracaturaśrasuśobhitāḥ ||
sumānisyuḥpārśvabhāge pṛthakpṛthaganukramāt || 17 ||

trīṇyekaṃ paṃca ṣaṭcasyussumānihyakṣayoścaret ||
catvāridveṣaḍaṣṭau syuritipakṣāntarasmṛtam || 18 ||

sśrāpitasthānataścaṇḍyāḥ sthānemuktimavāpya ca ||
sukhaṃ śayītatatreti krīḍākrīḍanakovidāḥ || 19 ||

kāryakāraṇaviśrāṃti sthānānidvyekaśūnyakaiḥ ||
cihnitānyanulomenavilomenāpicālanam || 20 ||

daleṣusyādbuddhibalācchārāṇāmitinirṇayaḥ ||
śiṣṭaṃprasiddhākṣatulyamitidvidbhirīritam || 21 ||

śālīvāhaśakasyābdekhaṣaṇmunidharāmite ||
vilambyāśvinaśuklasya paurṇamāsyāṃ budhe śubhe || 22 ||

<p. 389>

śrīcāmuṇḍākṛpāpūrṇakṛṣṇarājamahībhūtā ||
śrīcakradaśapatrākṣakrīḍeyaṃ nirmitā śubhā || 23 ||

