(21) atha hastibandhanakrīḍāvivaraṇam (-)

aṣṭakoṇaṃsyāt tu paṃcāśītikauṣṭhairyutaṃ tataḥ ||
vyādhāssyuraṣṭā catvāriṃśaccatvārobhavantihi || 1 ||

gajāsteṣāṃ grahaḥ kāryo hastagrāhaṃ vilāsataḥ ||
vyādhaissandhāvevasadāvyāghragrahavadīritam || 2 ||

