(22) athoddiṣṭākṣaraprakāśanam (-) 

caṇḍīṃvīrakathāgārāṃmaṇikoṭīrabaṃdhurām ||
cāmuṇḍikāṃcāmarājabāhuvikramapoṣiṇīm || 1 ||

siṃhapīṭhesukhāsīnāṃ khagapiṃchālivījitām ||
bhūnāthasaṃtatinutāṃ somakhaṃḍāvataṃsinīm || 2 ||

śāṃtāhitecchamahiṣāṃ tūṇajaṃghāṃ śuci smitām ||
samūḍhasumamaṃ ca sthāṃ vāhābhūṣāphaṇāmaṇim || 3 ||

tāṃḍavālīḍhavalayajhaṇajjhaṇavarāravām ||
śāṭīluṭhattārahārāṃsiṃhaveṣarathasthitām || 4 ||

mahīśūrapurībhāsiyaduvaṃśaphalapradām ||
bālāveṣadharāṃ devīṃ vaṃdehaṃ viṃdhyavāsinīm || 5 ||

ekaviṃśatināmāni devyāssaṃdhyāgamepaṭhan ||
kīrtiṃbhāgyaṃsusaṃtānaṃ vijñānaṃ labhate varaḥ || 6 ||

śakeśālīvāhanasya tricatussaptabhūmite ||
vikramāśvinaśuklasya prathamāyāṃravauśubhe || 7 ||

<p. 391>

śrīcāmuṇḍākṛpāpūrṇa kṛṣṇarājamahībhūtā ||
uddiṣṭākṣaravacchlokāracitābudhatuṣṭaye || 8 || (-) ||

asyasūtraṃ vanaḍhamikhā iti ||

(23) atha saṃkhyābhirlipyavagamakramaḥ (-)

prathamaṃ varṇasaṃkhyāne dvitīyaṃ vargasūcane ||
ekādikamacāṃsthānedaśakaṃdīrghabodhane || 1 ||

biṃdusthāne ca navakaṃ visargenavatiṃ tathā ||
saṃkhyāyāḥkādinavakaṃ pādabhedasyaṭādikam || 2 ||

dhānyamānepakārādi rasamāne tu yādikam ||
niṣkāditulaneśādi biṃdornoviśramasyañaḥ || 3 ||

ardhākṣarasyārdhavṛttamevaṃsaṃkhyālipikramaḥ ||
yaṃprastuvaṃti vidvāṃso bṛhaspati samā api || 4 ||

kṛṣṇarājamahārājaracitovardhatāmayam ||
śakeśālīvāhanasya tricatussaptabhūmite || 5 ||

vikramāśvinaśuklasya tvekādaśyāṃ budhe śubhe ||
saṅkhyālipīnālipibhissaṃkhyānāṃ bodhako mahān || 6 ||

