(24) atha muṣṭipraśneṣu hastagrāhyapadārthataduttaravidhayaḥ (-)

svarṇaṃ jalaṃ tathā śūlaṃ pravālastvak śilāguḍaḥ ||
carmabhasmamṛdasthīni rajataṃ nakhagomaye || 1 ||

nīrasāśca tathājñeyā tāmraprabhṛtayo budhaiḥ || (-) ||
annaṃkāryāsakaṃ puṣpaṃ carma caiva pravālakaḥ || 2 ||

<p. 393>

tṛṇaṃ ca tvak ca karpūraṃ supatraṃ raupyamūlake ||
dhānyaṃ ca gomayaṃ caiva lohobhasmādayassmṛtāḥ || 3 || (-) ||

karpūra mūle ca jalaṃ pūgīphalamathophalam ||
keśomaṇiśca rajataṃ kārpāsomṛccapatrakam || 4 ||

sopāhvasya tathātvak ca tāmraṃ carma tathaiva ca ||
lavaṇaṃ ceti vai proktāḥ padārthāṣṣoḍaśātrahi || 5 || (-) ||

ghṛtaṃguḍoghāsapūgīphale karpūrameva ca ||
lohastāmraṃ bhasmacāsthi sañjīvaḥ keśa eva ca || 6 ||

lavaṇaṃ tvag gomayaṃ ca śuṣkaṃ carmeti vai smṛtāḥ || (-) ||
rajataṃ caiva karpūraṃ pravālo ratnameva ca || 7 ||

kāryāsastvagghṛtaṃ caiva guḍaḥ kaṇamṛdau tathā ||
asthyaśmākeśalavaṇaupuṣpabhūtī iti smṛtāḥ || 8 || (-) ||

prakārāntaram (-) 

patraṃkārpāsakaṃ caiva dhānyaṃ lohastathaiva ca ||
sajīvomūlaśuṣke ca rasa ityādayo gatāḥ || 1 ||

phalaṃkārpāsakadṛṣadraseṣusyācchadosthi ca ||
śuṣkaṃ mṛdeṣuvijñeyamiti vai tadvidoviduḥ || 2 ||

phalaṃcarma ca dhānyaṃ ca sajīvaśca chadastathā ||
śilārasaśca lavaṇamityādīṃstadvidoviduḥ || 3 ||

asthiśuṣakaṃ gomayaṃ ca lavaṇāni śilā tathā ||
mūlaṃrasassajīvaścetyevaṃ jñeyaṃ vicakṣaṇaiḥ || 4 ||

śālīvāhaśakasyābde tricatussaptabhūmite ||
vikramāśvinaśuklasya trayodaśyāṃ bhṛgordine || 5 ||

