patigeviṣavanniṭṭasatigevotiyajanmasatatavītanavuṃḍusāguvabage || 10 ||

bhramarajanmavunoḍalamitadhanagalaghalimamateyiṃsadvayavamāḍadiralu ||
jenuhuluvāguvanujīvigaligannaketānukaṇṭakanāgalavanunoṇavu || 11 ||

tānuvalleyavanāgidayayilladirenārimānavagesacchileyabhāvavahudu ||
mūvattavaṃdariṃmodalāginālvattaraidaneyamanegalenuyaidirppakāryakāraṇagalanu(-)kāṇvantepeluvenu || 12 ||

keluvudunīvidanukiviyakoṭṭu ||
dānakaṇṭakatoṭadabeliyāguvanuviṣahṛdayasarpanāgiruvanoḍu || 13 ||

avivekadallimulugekappeyāguvacāḍihelijīvisematsyanivane ||
yahanumaduvekaṇṭakavekkucadurevañcaneyiṃdavadukenariyāguvanumatiyanīgibadukebahudinagūbe ||(14 || 

pāpadiṃjñānigalakaṇḍukāṇade iralukapaṭadiṃdapādapaveyāguvanu ||
parara(-)annavanuṇḍubāleyāyasavaṃnacauryadalibāletolanavanalidu || 15 ||

pararanubaiyyenāyiyāguvanavanunarananoḍu ||
nīrinallijanarugalaniṃtuhiṃseyagaiyemosaleyāguvatannamosadiṃda || 16 ||

tīrthayātregejanarutirugeniṃdisekūrma sārthakadakarmadalimattanāge ||
ajagaranuvaṃśagalanavanapekṣiselateyudvijavaranenoḍidanuviśadavāgi || 17 ||

nālvattarāranenaḍevamanemodalāgiyaravattumanegalalibaradu(-)iruvakāryakāraṇagalanu ||
kāṇvaṃtepeluvenusarvadākeluvudusakalajanarumudadinaliyutavega || 18 ||

mohaheccutabaralu kudivakāmiyusatatagubbacciyahanu ||
avivekadaliśāstragalanoderāsabhanu ḍāṃbhikadhyānavanumāḍebakanu || 19 ||

bariviraktatukaraḍiyaridapaddhadakālajñānavusuralukoliyāguvanu ||
uttamadakuladallipuṭṭimāṃsavatinnalitalavatāmyāke || 20 ||

īpariyanoḍustrīyaranubaladiṃdakeḍisekoṃḍamusukavanu ||
strīyarigegaṅgavaṃtirugipagalumāḍalavanukapota || 21 ||

māḍehīnācāravanuvānaranubuṇḍamanegeraḍavageyeṭagarāguvanu ||
bahaluttamadajātiyalipuṭṭināṭyādiṃyāvanaranubadukuvanonavilavanumatujatanhoṭṭe(-)yanutānehoredaresūkaradajanmavu || 22 ||

dūrbalarabaradiṃdaduḥkhagaisalugiḍaga ||
hiriyaranutoḍiśaṭhaṇe iṃdanaḍayevanṭeyāguvakaṇḍavaramaneyamuridutanamanekaṭṭegījaganumarulutanadim || 23 ||

aruvattavandariṃdamundāgiyappattaraidaneyamanegalanuyaidirppakāryakāraṇagalanu || kamalamukhipe luvenumudadiṃdanīkelumodalāgi || 24 ||

<p. 402>

kālāḍikudureśṛṃgāraceṣṭegalalisarvadāniratakogileyutāneyahanu ||
sujanaralidoṣavagaiyuvanetāneśivaṃgi || 25 ||

doḍḍavaragarvadiṃdūṣisuvanukoṇanāguva ||
jīvakoṭidaṇḍaneyalliniratanādarekaṭukanijaveyavanu || 26 ||

śambhumantrabhraṣṭhaśarabhanavanuparārthavāgināmasmaraṇemāḍegaruḍa ||
viṣṇumantrabhraṣṭabheruṇḍanuparārthavāgitīrthayātreyamāḍalaṃcevyāṭe || 27 ||

yatnyāsaktavyāliyāguvamārgatappinaḍadareholeyasatya ||
karmācaraṇeyallicapalamṛgajāṇekrūranehuliyu ||
matiyilladetanagepararabuddhi(-)iṃdajīviseśukanu ||
tirugidaremadaheccigajavusālaidāyitugaṇenamāḍe(-)ārasāle || 28 ||

pattararāraneyamaneyallipatiyajariyuvanārimāliyahalu ||
īsālaleppattarelaneyamaneyalliyācārahīnanādavaneśūdra || 29 ||

illiyambhattoṃdarallipatiyaṃviṭṭuparapuruṣaranutānupaḍeyevidhave ||
illiyambhatmūraralideviyamantrabhraṣṭanādaresiṃhabhāvavahudu || 30 ||

yambhattaraidaraliyanyaputraranoḍipaḍalasūyeyanavalubañjeyahalu ||
yambhattu(-)idaramelevambhattanemaneyolbiṭṭunācikeyannubīdiyolsogasiṃtiruge ||
veśyājanmavillitoṃbhattaralivāve(-)illaderamisalavanapuṃsakanu || 31 ||

yelanesālinalliruvatoṃbhattelaralilobhiyāgenararalivaiśyanu ||
illitoṃbhatteṃṭarallisādhuveyāgijñānavillade(-)iralutānugovu || 32 ||

toṃbhattuvaṃbhattutoruvamaneyallitānumāḍidapuṇyakṣīṇavāgemanuja ||
yanṭanesālamanenūravaṃbhattarallisātvikanahaṃkāriyāgevimanava || 33 ||

nūrahadinelaneyamaneyallitāsakāmaneyāgitapasaṃmāḍerājanu ||
oṃbhatteneyasālinallinūra(-)ippattaidarallitopuhākisidaḍavāyulokavu ||
illivanitenūrippattayaṇṭaralikerekolavanelasiracisevaruṇalokavumunde || 34 ||

iruvanūrmuvattavandaralinīcadevateyaṃbhajisenir(-)ṛtiyalokabahudu ||
innuhattanesālunūramūvattārutoruvallitānuratnābharaṇadānavanumāḍidarenā(-)galokavubadudu ||
nārikele (-) illinūraivattarallisāṃgādhyayanavanumāḍesadvipravaranukelu || 35 ||

sāluhannoṃdarallisalluvanūraivattaraidaralibahudhanavamodadittapuruṣagahudukuberaloka ||
nūraivattelaralipatibhaktiyaṇisimāḍesatigepatisālokyasalubanūraivattaroṃbhattanedaralivappuvadidu || 36 ||

aṣṭakānvaṣṭakagalanumāḍepitṛloka ||
nūra(-)aravattoṃdatoruvallidharmasūkṣmavatilidutāneḍayeyamaloka ||
hanneraḍanesālupaḍadu(-)iruvanūra(-)aravattelatorutihamnaneyallikadanadallihiṃmeṭṭadavanumaḍiyalavagevīrasvargabahudu || 37 ||

nūreppattoṃbhattaralisaṃsāravittabiḍalu(-)avanahanusuvirakta ||
hadimūraneyasālinallinūreṃbhattaralliyaiduśivanadevālayavujīrṇavāgirutiraladuddhāravanumāḍalubahudavage(-)īśānalokavu ||
manenūreṃbhatteṃṭarali (-) bahalayajñayāgādigalanumāḍaliṃdranalokabaruvudavanige ||
nūratombhattavandarallitoṣadiṃda(-)atithipūjeyamāḍalagnilokabuvahudu || 38 ||

sāluhadinālkaralisandhisiruva(-)innūramūramaneyallibahukapilagodānadiṃgālokatānevahudu ||
innūravoṃbhattanedaralisatkarmagalamāḍalīśvarārpaṇabuddhi(-)indavatattvabhāvavanupaḍeva ||
hadinaidaneyamanaidanesālinallinūrahadinedaneyalliṣaṇatrayavanillivarjisalavagesatya(-)lokavebahudusatyāvagi || 39 ||

<p. 403>

innūrahadineṃṭanedaralivīraśaivaneyāgevimalakailāsaloka ||
innūrahattumattinnuvoṃbhattaralivīravaiṣṇavanāgevipulavaikuṇṭhalokavāmanujanige || 40 ||

dorebudidinnūrahattaneyasadburukaṭākṣanemukhyavāgi ||
