jñānayogavumundetānenāmasmaraṇenādāsandhānanalidunoḍal ||
arcaneyudāsatvarājayogaśravaṇamanananididhyāsanamattesākṣātkārasaṃsāravimokānandadanubhavavusvāṃkitavu ||
