ūrdhvalokadamanegaloṭṭumāḍe || 45 ||

padinelumanujanemodalāgiyepiśācapadadaparyatadalimanujabhāvabhedagalasadanagalu(-)baradihavu ||
hadinelugoviniṃmodalāgikuritunoḍalśileyapariyaṃtaravutiriyakjantugalamanegalihavara(-)vattuyaṇisinoḍal || 46 ||

śūlanaṃrakavemodalugoṇḍuvaitaraṇiyanukaḍeyoleṇisiluhanneraḍumanegal ||
noṭakarekeli(-)īyāṭakkeḍālagalunālkupaṭṭinamūranaṃṭinīvu || 47 ||

vandarindippattaravarigetappadenoḍi(-)illilekhavannuhākikkoṃḍādi ||
śālivāhanaśakavusāviradayelnūranalvatta(-)aidakkesalbacitrabhānusaṃvatsaravapaḍadacaitradaśuddhapañcamiyubudhavāraraṃjisi(-)ruvaśubhavādadivasadalisabheyavaru ||
meccuvāpariyiṃdadhareyalli(-)iruvanararunāriyarusanmārgavarivaṃteśrīkṛṣṇadharaṇīndraracisiruvasarasavāda(-)śrīdeviyasāyujyaveṃbuvāṭavācandratārakamāgaritunoḍi ||
