<p. 408>

ī devīsāyujyamuktiya pagaḍe āṭakke kāryadamanegalu (106) kāraṇagalamanegalu (106) sadgurukaṭākṣādi aṃkitadamane (1) sahamanegalu (24) | vaṭṭu manegalu (236) | ī(-)āṭakke nālkupaṭṭinaḍālagalu mūru | īḍālagalalli nakhasaṃkhyeyante vaṃdariṃda hiḍidu ippattusaṃkhyegalava rigebīluvaṃte gurutumāḍikkoṃḍāḍuvadu ||

(28) atha liṅgākṛtidevīsāyujyamuktyakṣakrīḍāvivaraṇam (-)

pṛṭhagvīdhitrayedhastātkoṣṭhānyekonaviṃśatiḥ ||
vīdhidvayesaptadaśatataḥ pañcadaśopari || 1 ||

vīdhyāmuparikoṣṭhānisyūramyāṇitrayodaśa ||
ekādaśasyuḥ koṣṭhānividhyāmuparitatpare || 2 ||

ūrdhvabhāge dvayorvīdhyoḥ koṣṭhāni syuḥ trayodaśa ||
pṛthak tadūrdhvaṃvīdhyoḥ syurdvayorekādaśa kramāt || 3 ||

pṛthak tadūrdhvavīdhyāṃ tu koṣṭhāni syustrayodaśa ||
tadūrdhvaṃsyussaptadaśavīdhyāṃ koṣṭhāni saṃlikhet || 4 ||

ūrdhvordhvavīdhikramaśaḥ ṣoḍaśadvādaśa kramāt ||
koṣṭhānikalpyānyatreti krīḍāsu kuśalaissmṛtam || 5 ||

pūrvoktākṣakrīḍanavatkrīḍeyaṃ kathitā budhaiḥ ||
akṣāścātra trayojñeyānissumā ekapārśvataḥ || 6 ||

pārśvatraye tu kramaśaḥ dvitryekakusumaḥ pṛthak ||
ekokṣonyastathājñeyo daśasaptacatussumaḥ || 7 ||

trayodaśa tathāpaṃcadaśa caivaṃ caturdaśa ||
sumānyatrasuvijñeyā nīticākṣavicakṣaṇāḥ || 8 ||

śālīvāhaśakeṣu bāṇamunibhūsaṃkhyeṣu varṣeṣvatho yāteṣvadyajayāvahevijayanāmnyabde(-)ṛtaugraiṣmake ||
āṣāḍhesitapakṣakebhṛgudine caikādaśī saṃyute śrīliṃgākṛtimātanodimamihaśrīkṛṣṇabhūvallabhaḥ || 9 ||

caturaśrākṛtiyāda devīsāyujyamukti(-)āṭada paṭhavannu śivaliṃgākṛtiyāgi raciśiyiruvadakke paṭhavannuracisuvakrama (-) ḍālagalalekhasaha (-) (sīsapadya) (-)
 śrīcaṇḍikāprājyasevāsamālabdhasāmrājyasauśīlyasadguṇaighaśritajanāmarabhūjakṛṣṇanṛpabhojarājeṃdraracisiruvaramyavāda ||
śivaliṃgadākṛtiyacitrapaṭadalidevisāyujyamuktiyaṃbāṭadolage || 1 ||

sadgurukaṭākṣādisāyujyamuktyantavāginoḍal ||
kailāsamodalāgikeltattvamārgāṃta(-)ūrdhvalokadamanegaloṭṭumāḍe || 2 ||

padinelumanujanemodalāgiyepiśācapadadaparyaṃtadalimanujabhāva ||
bhedagalasadanagaluberadihavuhādinelugoviniṃmodalāgikuritunoḍal || 3 ||

<p. 409>

śileyaparyaṃtaravutiryakkujaṃtugala manegalihabaravatūyaṇisinoḍal ||
śūlanarakavumodalugoṃḍuvaitaraṇiyanukaḍeyoleṇisaluhanneraḍumanegal || 4 ||

modaliṃdagṛhagalanumudadiṃdayāṇisidare nūramuvattahadumuṃdepelve ||
sadgurukaṭākṣādisarasasadanaṃ galigekāraṇagaleyillakaleyayidanu || 5 ||

vulidanūrārakkevucitavāgiyepesarukāryaveṃdivākinnukāraṇagalu ||
manegalavenūrāruyaṇisalaṃkitagūḍhayinnūramūvattumeleyāru || 6 ||

śālivāhanaśakavusāviradayelanūru aivattāraneyaidutiruva ||
vijayasaṃvatsaradavimalavādāṣāḍhaśuddhayekādaśiśukravāra || 7 ||

śubhadivasadallīśadayayiṃsādhusaṃtoṣakkesarasamāgi ||
māḍiruvadevisāyujyadāṭavācandratārakavidāḍisukhadim || 8 ||

(ṭīku) (-) īpaṭhavannu racisuvakrama (-) śivaliṃgākṛti paṭhakke vaṭṭu manegalu (236) | kelagaṇa śūla narakada vaṃdane sālu modalāgi devīsayujyamuktiya aṃkitadamaneyu iruva melaṇa sālugalavarige sālugalu (16) kke vivara (-) kelagaṇa (1) ne sālige (19) manegalu | yaraḍane sālige (19) manegalu | mūrane sālige (19) manegalu | nālkane sālige (17) manegalu | aidane sālige (17) manegalu | ārane sālige (15) manegalu | yelane sālige (13) manegalu | yaṇṭane sālige (11) manegalu (!) vambhattane sālige (13) manegalu | hattane sālige (13) manegalu | hannoṃdane sālige (11) manegalu | hanneraḍane sālige (11) manegalu | hadimūrane sālige (13) manegalu | hadinālkane sālige (17) manegalu | hadinaidane sālige (16) manegalu | hadināranemelina sālinalli aṃkitada manegūḍi devīsāyujya muktivarige (12) manegalu vaṭṭu sālugalu (16) kke vaṭṭu manegalu (236 || yīśivaliṃgākṛti paṭavannu racisuballi liṃgada vubhayapārśvadalli doḍḍa yaraḍu maṇḍalavannu raciśi balagaḍeya maṇḍaladalli śīcāmuṇḍeśvarī ammanavaru yaḍagaḍeya maṇḍaladalli yīmele baradiruva padyagalannubareyabeku ||

ī(-)āṭakke ḍālagalu adaralliruva hūvugala lekhasaha abhijitsahitavāda (28) nakṣatragalaṃte ḍāla (1) kke paṭṭu (4) kke lekkhavillada paṭṭu (1) | lekkhada paṭṭugalu (3) kke paṭṭu (1) kke (1) | paṭṭu (1) kke (2) | paṭṭu (1) kke (3) | ḍāla (1) kke lekhavillada paṭṭu (1) | lekkhada paṭṭu (3) kke paṭṭu (1) kke (4) | paṭṭu (1) kke (7) | paṭṭu (1) kke (10) | ḍāla (1) kke lekkhavillada paṭṭu (1) | lekkhada (3) kke paṭṭu (1) kke (13) | paṭṭu (1) kke (14) | paṭṭu (1) kke (15) | īmerige iruva ḍālagalu (3) riṃda (1) barada hiḍidu (28) galavarigu lekkhagalu bīlutte | īrītinoḍikroṃḍu kaḍame āṭa yāvattannu caturaśrākṛtiyāda devīsāyujyada paṭhadāṭavannu āḍuvante buddhivantaru noḍikkoṃḍāḍubadu ||

