(30) atha viśvarūpākṛtaudevīsāyujyamuktyakṣakrīḍāvivaraṇam (-)

vīdhyaṣṣoḍaśatatrasyuḥ koṣṭhasaṃkhyāgrimakramāt ||
adhovīdhyāṃsaptakoṣṭhamekādaśatathopari || 1 ||

trayodaśatadūrdhvaṃ pañcadaśasyuḥ tataḥ param ||
ūrdhvaṃsaptadaśaivaṃ tadūrdhvaṃ vīdhīṣupañcasu || 2 ||

pṛṭhakkoṣṭhānividvadbhiḥ jñeyānyekonaviṃśatiḥ ||
tadūrdhvaṃsyussaptadaśatadūrdhvāṃsyuḥ pṛthakpṛthak || 3 ||

<p. 411>

vīdhidvayepañcadaśatadūrdhvaṃ syustrayodaśa ||
