tadūrdhvamevaṃlekhyaṃsyādakṣakrīḍāvicakṣaṇaiḥ ||
devīsāyujyavatsarvamakṣāstraya udīritāḥ || 5 ||

ekapārśvenissumāssyuranyeṣutriṣu vai kramāt ||
ekaṃdvetrīṇicatvāridvādaśāṣṭasumānihi || 6 ||

sumānisaptadaśa ca trayodaśadaśeti ca ||
caturaśrākṣakeṣvevaṃ vyavasthāsaṃprakīrtitā || 7 ||

ṣaṭpaṃcasaptendumiteśālivāhaśakābdake ||
vijayaśrāvaṇekṛṣṇenavamyāṃśukravāsare || 8 ||

śrīcāmuṇḍākṛpāpūrṇa kṛṣṇarājamahībhṛtā ||
devīsāyujyamuktyartha viśvarūpākṛtiḥkṛtā || 9 ||

krīḍanātkrīḍakānāṃ ca paritoṣāyadhīmatā ||

caturaśrākṛtiyāda devīsāyujyamuktiyāṭada paṭhabannu viśvarūpākṛtiyāgi raci śiruvadakke padyaślokada paṭhavannu racisiruvakrama ḍālagala lekkhasaha (sīsa) 'srīmahābalaśailaśṛṃgavāsiniyādalokamāteyaviśvarūpadolage || ṣaṭtriṃśadadhikadviśatamaṃdiragalolcetanācetanasṛṣṭibaradu || 1 ||

brahmāṃḍavekāṇabaruvaṃtesāyujyamuktiyaṃbāṭaphaṇigatiyali ||
rucisidaśrīkṛṣṇarājamahārājanakhilarusanmārgavariyuvante || 2 ||

rasaśararṣikuraṃgadharāṃkavijayavatsaraśrāvaṇottarapakṣanavamī ||
kaviyavāsaradolsakalakavigaloppedhareyaliruvaṃteyācandratāravāgi || 3 ||

