caturaṅgairbalairvyūhamabhedyaṃ gāruḍaṃ bhavet || 2 ||

<p. 414>

rājāmātyaścoṣṭrarathaupatākāvājikuñjarāḥ ||
padātayo dvādaśasyurekapakṣe tathānyataḥ || 3 ||

kalpayityā krīḍanaṃ syāt prasiddhacaturaṅgavat ||
uṣṭrapārśverathastasya pārśvesthāpyāpatākikā || 4 ||

tatośva ityādisarvaṃ prasiddhacaturaṅgavat ||
rājñaḥsthitissyātsvasthānemantrīṣaṣṭhe hi rājataḥ || 5 ||

samakṣaṃsyāccaturthesya sthāne uṣṭrastathārathaḥ ||
caturthe syāt paṃcame tu patākāsyānmanoharā || 6 ||

nāthamantripathesyasyāccaturthevājinaḥ sthitiḥ ||
hastīsamorathabalasya kramāt ṣaṭbalāni ca || 7 ||

adhaḥkramāt ṣaṭpadātaya ekāsammukhā bhavet ||
padātiḥ kariṇaḥ dve tu samestastu yadātadā || 8 ||

tārārkaśaśisaṃkhyāsu krīḍāsubrahmaṇāpi ca ||
abhedyogāruḍavyūho bhavediti budhaissmṛtam || 9 ||

śrīcāmuṇḍākṛpāpūrṇakṛṣṇarājamahībhṛtā ||
abhedyagāruḍavyūhoracitaścaturaṃgake || 10 ||

śrīkṛṣṇarājamahārājakaṇṭhīravaruviracisiruva (12) mane caturaṃgadabhedyavāda gāruḍavyūhavaṃracisiruva padya kāyigalalekkhasaha (-) 

(padya) (-)

sarasacaturaṃgadoli arasuniṃteḍeyalli rasigāranekaḍe(-)iruvamantrī ||
tanagedurāginālkanemaneyolvaṃṭerathanālkarali(-)aidaralipatāke || 1 ||

nāthamaṃtrīpathakenālkanekaḍevāji rathabalasamavāgiracipudāne ||
ārumoharusāligārukelagaḍepyāde karimukhadoloṃduyaraḍusamadi || 2 ||

aṃtutārārkaśaśisakhyeyāṭagalali ucitabhavadīyagāruḍavyūhadolage ||
kamalasaṃbhavahokkarukaṭṭalahude caturaguṇasāṃdrakṛṣṇarājakṣitīṃdra || 3 ||

(ṭīku) (-) ī(-)āṭadaliraṃguyaraḍariṃdakāyigalu (48) kke arasugalu (2) pradhānigalu (2) vaṃṭegalu (4) rathagalu (4) patākegalu (4) kuṭuregalu (4) ānegalu (4) ālugalu (24) aṃtu (48) kāyigalu || ī(-)āṭhakke sālu (1) kke manegalu (12) rallu sālu (12) kke (144) manegalu | īkāyigalannu naḍasuvakrama (-) arasu pradhāni vaṃṭe kudare āne ālugalusaha mogalāyi caturaṃgadaṃte naḍasuvadu | rathavannu āneyaṃte nālkubīdiyallu tānu(-)iruvamaneyallade (1) mane āce manege naḍasuvadu | patākeyannu mūlemele tāniruvamaneyallade madhye biṭṭu ācemanege naḍasuvadu ||

<p. 415>

(33) etaccaturaṃgagatibhedakramaḥ (-)

rūpālolaprabhūrekhīlābhapāloguru priyaḥ ||
rāgālāpakarārāvagītakāmarasolbaṇaḥ || 1 ||

kṛṣṇarājoṃganāraṃgapīnobaddhārirāyudhaiḥ ||
geharatnapadollāsīnānārāmakathonmanāḥ || 2 ||

rādhākarālaṃ bakhaniḥ kaṃbulekhīti varṇitaḥ ||
kṛṣṇarājaturaṃgasya cāturaṃgasyariṃgaṇe || 3 ||

(34) atha śrīcakroddhārakramaḥ (-)

(vāmakeśvaratantre)

bindutrikoṇavasukoṇadaśārayugmamanvaśranāgadalasaṃyutaṣoḍaśāram ||
vṛttatrayaṃ ca dharaṇī sadanatrayaṃ ca śrīcakrametadūditaṃ paradevatāyāḥ || 1 ||

prakārāṃtareṇa śrīcakralakṣaṇam (-)

(śrīśaṃkarācāryakṛtasauṃdaryalaharyām) 

caturbhiḥ śrīkaṇṭhaiḥ śivayuvatibhiḥ paṃcabhirapi prabhinnābhiḥ śaṃbhornavabhirapi mūlaprakṛtibhiḥ ||
catuścatvāriṃśadvasudalakalāśratrivalayatrirekhābhiḥ sārdhaṃ tava caraṇakoṇāḥ pariṇatāḥ || 1 ||

(35) atha śrīcakragrahadevatānāmāni (-)

(lalitārcanamañjaryāṃ trayodaśastabakāntarvartyaṣṭamastabake jñānārṇave)

bhūgṛhaṃ svarapatrābjaṃ vasvaraṃ bhuvanāśrakam || 1 ||

daśārayugmamaṣṭāraṃ tryaśramadhyaṃ ca bhedataḥ ||
trailokyamohanaṃ cakraṃ sarvāśāparipūrakam || 2 ||

sarvasaṃkṣobhaṇaṃ cakraṃ sarvasaubhāgyadāyakam ||
sarvārthasādhakaṃ cakraṃ sarvarakṣākaraṃ param || 3 ||

sarvarogaharaṃ cakraṃ sarvasiddhi pradāyakam ||
sarvānandamayaṃ madhyaṃ navamaṃ cakranāyakam || 4 ||

navadhācakrasaṃketaṃ yojānātisapūjakaḥ ||
prakaṭāśca tathāguptāstathāguptatarāḥ parāḥ || 5 ||

saṃpradāyāḥ kulāḥ kaulāḥ nigarbhāśca rahasyakāḥ ||
parāpararahasyāstā atipūrvarahasyakāḥ || 6 ||

navadhānāmasaṃketo yoginīnāṃ vidhīyate ||
tripurātripureśī ca sundarīpuravāsinī || 7 ||

śrīrmālinī ca siddhāṃbāmahātripurasundarī ||
atyāpaddharamevedaṃ vijñāsaṃketasaṃjñitam || 8 ||

tatsaṃpradāyasaṃśodhyaṃ navakaṃ bhuktimuktidam ||
atrātipūrvarahasyakā(-)itivacanātparāpararahasyākhyāyoginītvatipūrvaketi dakṣiṇāmūrtivacanātparāparātirahasyayoginītinavacakrayoginīnāmānīti śivam || 9 ||

<p. 416>

[iti śrīmatsamastabhamaṃḍalamaṃḍanāyamānānikhiladeśāvataṃ sakarnāṭakajanapadādhiṣṭhānabhūta śrīmanmahīśūramahāsaṃsthānamadhyadedīpyamānāvikalakalānidhikulakramāgata(-)rājakṣitipālapramukhanikhilanijarājādhirājamahārājacakravartimaṃḍalānubhūta(-)divyaratnasiṃhāsanārūḍha śrīmadrājādhirājarājaparameśvaraprauḍhapratāpāpratimavīranarapatibirudeṃteṃbaragaṃḍalokaikavīrayadukulapayaḥpārāvārakalānidhiśaṃkhacakrāṃkuśakuṭhāra(-)makaramatsyaśarabhasālvagaṃḍabheruṃḍadharaṇīvarāhahanumadgaruḍakaṃṭhīra(-)vādyanekabirudāṃkitaśrīmanmahīśūrapuravarādhīśa śrīkṛṣṇarājamahārājaviracite śrītattvanidhyākhyagraṃthepatrikākṣakrīḍādimahākautukanirūpaṇaṃnāmanavamo(-)nidhissaṃpūrṇaḥ] || 9 ||

[iti śrītattvanidhyākhyagranthe (-) navamaḥ kautukanidhissaṃpūrṇaḥ] || 9 ||

[śrītattvanidhyākhyoyaṃgranthassamāptaḥ] ||

